values
  ('838887921779111488', 'The Outwaters', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robbie Banfitch, Robbie Banfitch', 'Robbie Banfitch', 'Robbie Banfitch, Angela Basolis, Scott Schamell, Michelle May, Leslie Ann Banfitch, Christine Brown, Melissa Andrea, Nancy Bujnowski', 'NR', 'Deep in the Mojave desert, under a scorching blood-red sun, four travelers have set up camp to make art. One fateful night, the group is thrust into a feverish tornado of flayed flesh and mind-boggling monstrosities, the likes of which mere humans simply cannot fathom.', 'Deep in the Mojave desert, under a scorching blood-red sun, four travelers have set up camp to make art. One fateful night, the group is thrust into a feverish tornado of flayed flesh and mind-boggling monstrosities, the likes of which mere humans simply cannot fathom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81SNcKfobpYtPzbPEKIqutRMU6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752867'),
  ('215168919407318427', 'The Oval Portrait', 1973, 'Horror', 'Rogelio A. González, Scott Maitland', 'Enrique Torres Tudela', 'Wanda Hendrix, Barry Coe, Gisele MacKenzie, Maray Ayres, Barney O''Sullivan, Doris Buckinham, Pia Shandel, D. Goldrick', null, 'A woman finds herself possessed by the soul of another woman trapped inside a painting. Based on a work by Edgar Allan Poe, aka The Oval Portrait.', 'A woman finds herself possessed by the soul of another woman trapped inside a painting. Based on a work by Edgar Allan Poe, aka The Oval Portrait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ugp1PHxRaeYDUctCaxFrA9mWW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376258'),
  ('268674093046885988', 'The Over the Hill Gang', 1969, 'Western, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jean Yarbrough, Wesley Barry, Henry Cronjager Jr.', 'Jameson Brewer', 'Walter Brennan, Edgar Buchanan, Andy Devine, Jack Elam, Gypsy Rose Lee, Kristin Harmon, Ricky Nelson, Pat O''Brien', 'PG-13', 'A retired Texas Ranger and three aged pals help to clean up a town run by a crooked mayor, a drunken judge and a trigger-happy sheriff.', 'A retired Texas Ranger and three aged pals help to clean up a town run by a crooked mayor, a drunken judge and a trigger-happy sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUmG6ukmEVeMBv5Y31ZRhmYdv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54050'),
  ('278307752778601691', 'The Overcoat', 1926, 'Drama', 'Andrey Moskvin, Yevgeniy Mikhaylov, Grigori Kozintsev', 'Yury Tynyanov', 'Andrei Kostrichkin, Antonina Yeremeyeva, Aleksei Kapler, Sergei Gerasimov, Emil Gal, Yanina Zheymo, Vladimir Lepko, Oleg Zhakov', null, 'Soviet film based on Nikolai Gogol stories "Nevsky Prospekt" and "The Overcoat".', 'Soviet film based on Nikolai Gogol stories "Nevsky Prospekt" and "The Overcoat".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgUtDG9cV8C4CEYlfWhANRkqkKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105170'),
  ('752323425975480042', 'The Overcoat', 1952, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Alberto Lattuada, Guidarino Guidi, Luigi Malerba', 'Enzo Curreli, Luigi Malerba, Cesare Zavattini', 'Renato Rascel, Yvonne Sanson, Giulio Stival, Giulio Calì, Ettore Mattia, Olinto Cristina, Anna Carena, Sandro Somarè', null, 'Based on the Nikolai Gogol story but set in 1950s Italy, "The Overcoat" is the story of a poor city hall clerk whose only desire is to buy a new overcoat.', 'Based on the Nikolai Gogol story but set in 1950s Italy, "The Overcoat" is the story of a poor city hall clerk whose only desire is to buy a new overcoat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZnMg0Lv1PvNqxuI0chX6IJPjYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93834'),
  ('800212321645736104', 'The Overcoat', 1959, 'Drama', 'Aleksey Batalov, Genrikh Marandzhyan, Ekaterina Serdechkova', 'Leonid Solovyov', 'Rolan Bykov, Yuriy Tolubeev, Nina Urgant, Elena Ponsova, Georgiy Teykh, Glikeriya Bogdanova-Chesnokova, Lev Stepanov', null, 'A story about a government clerk who has his precious new overcoat stolen. No-one seems willing to help him retrieve his prized possession, a fact that continues to concern him even when he is beyond the grave.', 'A story about a government clerk who has his precious new overcoat stolen. No-one seems willing to help him retrieve his prized possession, a fact that continues to concern him even when he is beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veh5ilnznoGp2JHwCDyeLubbROq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117863'),
  ('777872155197927657', 'The Overeater', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Thierry Binisti, Dominique Bouilleret', 'Thierry Binisti, Xavier Maurel', 'Éric Cantona, Rachida Brakni, Caroline Silhol, Richard Bohringer, Jocelyn Quivrin, Jean-Michel Noirey, Hubert Saint-Macary, Valérie Messas', null, 'Séléna is chief of the Marseille police. Respected and feared by his men, his sole enemy seems to be himself, along with his 300 pounds. Strangled by the bursting straight-jacket of his body, tortured by his past, he leads a solitary life in a large isolated house. Séléna is the only person who knows that Elsa was guilty of the murder of her uncle, a wealthy shipowner. Fascinated by the young woman’s beauty, he offers her a strange deal: in exchange for his silence, he demands that she dines with him every night for a year.', 'Séléna is chief of the Marseille police. Respected and feared by his men, his sole enemy seems to be himself, along with his 300 pounds. Strangled by the bursting straight-jacket of his body, tortured by his past, he leads a solitary life in a large isolated house. Séléna is the only person who knows that Elsa was guilty of the murder of her uncle, a wealthy shipowner. Fascinated by the young woman’s beauty, he offers her a strange deal: in exchange for his silence, he demands that she dines with him every night for a year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNO1HfOJpTshXlQ03khFOnwpsEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61361'),
  ('320374899146219534', 'The Overlanders', 1946, 'Western, Adventure', 'Harry Watt, Osmond Borradaile', 'Harry Watt', 'Chips Rafferty, John Nugent Hayward, Daphne Campbell, Jean Blue, Helen Grieve, John Fernside, Peter Pagan, Frank Ransome', null, 'It''s the start of WWII in Northern Australia. The Japanese are getting close. People are evacuating and burning everything in a "scorched earth" policy. Rather than kill all their cattle, a disparate group decides to drive them overland half way across the continent, from Wyndham in Western Australia through the Northern Territory outback of Australia to pastures north of Brisbane, Queensland.', 'It''s the start of WWII in Northern Australia. The Japanese are getting close. People are evacuating and burning everything in a "scorched earth" policy. Rather than kill all their cattle, a disparate group decides to drive them overland half way across the continent, from Wyndham in Western Australia through the Northern Territory outback of Australia to pastures north of Brisbane, Queensland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOA1OMqaVlyxVgkpYkIHlTDFY6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68295'),
  ('356095502745340160', 'The Overnight', 2015, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Patrick Brice, John Guleserian', 'Patrick Brice', 'Adam Scott, Taylor Schilling, Jason Schwartzman, Judith Godrèche, RJ Hermes, Kyle Field, Sarah DeVincentis, Max Moritt', 'R', 'Alex, Emily, and their son, RJ, are new to Los Angeles. A chance meeting at the park introduces them to the mysterious Kurt, Charlotte, and Max. A family “playdate” becomes increasingly interesting as the night goes on.', 'Alex, Emily, and their son, RJ, are new to Los Angeles. A chance meeting at the park introduces them to the mysterious Kurt, Charlotte, and Max. A family “playdate” becomes increasingly interesting as the night goes on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DDEGc6vifxxYdkym3G99AMlITG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308024'),
  ('406393239059890012', 'The Overnighters', 2014, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jesse Moss, Jesse Moss', 'Jesse Moss', 'Keegan Edwards, Jay Reinke', 'PG-13', 'Desperate, broken men chase their dreams and run from their demons in the North Dakota oil fields. A local Pastor''s decision to help them has extraordinary and unexpected consequences.', 'Desperate, broken men chase their dreams and run from their demons in the North Dakota oil fields. A local Pastor''s decision to help them has extraordinary and unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkDorP7Rj1wgxcYZx2aNeozRJP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250666'),
  ('218263051906295646', 'The Overtaxed', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Marco Scarpelli, Mariano Laurenti, Steno', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Vittorio Metz, Steno', 'Totò, Aldo Fabrizi, Louis de Funès, Cathia Caro, Nando Bruno, Luciano Marin, Anna Campori, Miranda Campa', null, 'Mr. Pezzella owns and operates a well-established luxury-clothing store. He does not like and does not consider it right to pay taxes and therefore uses a tax consultant to be able to evade more taxes.', 'Mr. Pezzella owns and operates a well-established luxury-clothing store. He does not like and does not consider it right to pay taxes and therefore uses a tax consultant to be able to evade more taxes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFq0XCLiv02qTjZPm4I5w8zcZ8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51912'),
  ('625057891944376050', 'The Overture', 2004, 'Drama, Music', 'Sawanee Utoomma, Itthisoontorn Vichailak, Peerasak Saksiri', 'Peerasak Saksiri, Itthisoontorn Vichailak, Dolkamol Sattatip', 'Anuchit Sapanpong, Adul Dulyarat, Pongpat Wachirabunjong, Narongrit Tosa-nga, Phoovarit Phumpuang, Sompob Benjathikul, Kiat Punpiputt, Arratee Tanmahapran', null, 'Based on the life of Luang Pradit Pairoh the most revered traditional Thai music master who lived during the reigns of Kings Rama V to VIII, the movie traces the life of Sorn, who picked up the Thai xylophone mallets as a small child and played all his life.', 'Based on the life of Luang Pradit Pairoh the most revered traditional Thai music master who lived during the reigns of Kings Rama V to VIII, the movie traces the life of Sorn, who picked up the Thai xylophone mallets as a small child and played all his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Mrmy2tOxIt92BPpE1hcEU3CMVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178929'),
  ('31098506632465770', 'The Owl and the Pussycat', 1970, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, Harry Stradling Sr., Andrew Laszlo', 'Buck Henry', 'Barbra Streisand, George Segal, Robert Klein, Allen Garfield, Roz Kelly, Jacques Sandulescu, Jack Manning, Grace Carney', 'PG', 'Meek, owlish Felix and strident, catty Doris live in the same apartment building. His incessant typing bothers her; her gentlemen callers bother him. Felix informs the landlord of her activities, so Doris moves in on Felix. When they both get thrown out, they move in with Barney... until they drive him out! That''s when Felix and Doris finally decide to put theory into practice. But do opposites attract?', 'Meek, owlish Felix and strident, catty Doris live in the same apartment building. His incessant typing bothers her; her gentlemen callers bother him. Felix informs the landlord of her activities, so Doris moves in on Felix. When they both get thrown out, they move in with Barney... until they drive him out! That''s when Felix and Doris finally decide to put theory into practice. But do opposites attract?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGzDvJ99qHM1rpQef8wlm2Cxchl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42597'),
  ('274432301723476909', 'The Owl Who Married a Goose: An Eskimo Legend', 1974, 'Animation', 'Caroline Leaf', null, null, null, 'In this short animation based on an Inuit legend, a goose captures the fancy of an owl, a weakness for which he will pay dearly. The sound effects and voices are Inuktitut, but the animation leaves no doubt as to the unfolding action. A story with the wry humor characteristic of many Inuit tales.', 'In this short animation based on an Inuit legend, a goose captures the fancy of an owl, a weakness for which he will pay dearly. The sound effects and voices are Inuktitut, but the animation leaves no doubt as to the unfolding action. A story with the wry humor characteristic of many Inuit tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imslEcdND6nPCUlT4rAH2jbofIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285671'),
  ('340765280275177628', 'The Owners', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gustavo Biazzi, Ezequiel Radusky, Agustín Toscano', 'Agustín Toscano, Ezequiel Radusky', 'Rosario Bléfari, Germán de Silva, Sergio Prina, Cynthia Avellaneda, Liliana Juárez, Nicolás Aráoz, Daniel Elías, Fernando Flores Blasco', null, 'Sergio and his family work in an estate in Argentina’s northern region. When their employers aren''t home, they occupy the main house and emulate the life of the owners. Then Pia, the eldest daughter of the owner, arrives at the estate with the intention of staying a few days until her father’s marriage...', 'Sergio and his family work in an estate in Argentina’s northern region. When their employers aren''t home, they occupy the main house and emulate the life of the owners. Then Pia, the eldest daughter of the owner, arrives at the estate with the intention of staying a few days until her father’s marriage...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83IOxSBMLP7QpYa59SbzyMrdNqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190907'),
  ('527638014811416548', 'The Owners', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Abi Jarvis, Julius Berg, Dan Hubbard', 'Mathieu Gompel, Julius Berg', 'Maisie Williams, Sylvester McCoy, Rita Tushingham, Jake Curran, Andrew Ellis, Ian Kenny, Stacha Hicks', null, 'A group of friends think they found the perfect easy score - an empty house with a safe full of cash. But when the elderly couple that lives there comes home early, the tables are suddenly turned. As a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues, the would-be thieves must fight to save themselves from a nightmare they could never have imagined.', 'A group of friends think they found the perfect easy score - an empty house with a safe full of cash. But when the elderly couple that lives there comes home early, the tables are suddenly turned. As a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues, the would-be thieves must fight to save themselves from a nightmare they could never have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMUpzTRF4f4MkScDkUZM030H2t0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659986'),
  ('572306800235530970', 'The Ox', 1991, 'Drama', 'Sven Nykvist, Sven Nykvist, Bengt Widell', 'Sven Nykvist, Lasse Summanen', 'Max von Sydow, Stellan Skarsgård, Ewa Fröling, Erland Josephson, Liv Ullmann, Björn Granath, Björn Gustafson, Lennart Hjulström', null, 'In desperation brought on by near-starvation, Helge Roos kills his master''s ox to feed his wife and baby daughter, setting off a devastating and unexpected chain of events.', 'In desperation brought on by near-starvation, Helge Roos kills his master''s ox to feed his wife and baby daughter, setting off a devastating and unexpected chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlStNLvwgcy0ZKEfYTbz6KTPOYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125882'),
  ('353520936491367153', 'The Oxford Murders', 2008, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kiko de la Rica, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Elijah Wood, John Hurt, Leonor Watling, Julie Cox, Jim Carter, Alex Cox, Burn Gorman, Dominique Pinon', null, 'At Oxford University, a professor and a grad student work together to try and stop a potential series of murders seemingly linked by mathematical symbols.', 'At Oxford University, a professor and a grad student work together to try and stop a potential series of murders seemingly linked by mathematical symbols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPGyZg44eCxccfoaNNbJwTJj66J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12245'),
  ('329137117297198266', 'The Oyster and the Wind', 1997, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Walter Lima Jr., Pedro Farkas', 'Flávio R. Tambellini', 'Lima Duarte, Fernando Torres, Leandra Leal, Floriano Peixoto, Castrinho, Débora Bloch, Arduíno Colassanti, Ricardo Marecos', null, 'A young girl named Marcela lives with her dad, Jose, a lighthouse keeper, and old Daniel on an island. The only contact the girl has with the world outside her home is by a boat with four sailors that pays a visit to the island in order to take them supplies. Daniel, who not only protects her from her dad''s strictness but also teaches her how to be literate, is her source of tenderness. Her dad thinks she should be away from the world - though she wishes she could spend a few days in town. Then one day, as she has her first period and becomes a woman, she starts feeling sexuality through the blowing wind, which she talks to.', 'A young girl named Marcela lives with her dad, Jose, a lighthouse keeper, and old Daniel on an island. The only contact the girl has with the world outside her home is by a boat with four sailors that pays a visit to the island in order to take them supplies. Daniel, who not only protects her from her dad''s strictness but also teaches her how to be literate, is her source of tenderness. Her dad thinks she should be away from the world - though she wishes she could spend a few days in town. Then one day, as she has her first period and becomes a woman, she starts feeling sexuality through the blowing wind, which she talks to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDGrQXN3MwgWNiHTtWQ8PH0HSY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194858'),
  ('52115879303240142', 'The Oyster Princess', 1919, 'Comedy', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Hanns Kräly, Ernst Lubitsch', 'Victor Janson, Ossi Oswalda, Harry Liedtke, Julius Falkenstein, Max Kronert, Curt Bois, Hans Junkermann, Albert Paulig', null, 'A pampered American oyster tycoon decides to buy a husband for his daughter, but things don’t go quite as planned. Along the way there are mishaps, misunderstandings and a foxtrot sequence that must be seen to be believed.', 'A pampered American oyster tycoon decides to buy a husband for his daughter, but things don’t go quite as planned. Along the way there are mishaps, misunderstandings and a foxtrot sequence that must be seen to be believed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4ifmOMaw415Lt4YAYfBb7Cdjh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48591'),
  ('271954902253666600', 'The Pace That Kills', 1935, 'Drama', 'William A. O''Connor, Jack Greenhalgh', null, 'Lois January, Noel Madison, Sheila Bromley, Dean Benton, Lois Lindsay, Charles Delaney, Eddie Phillips, Frank Shannon', 'NR', 'A drug dealer on the run from the law meets an innocent young girl and her brother, and turns them into “cocaine fiends”.', 'A drug dealer on the run from the law meets an innocent young girl and her brother, and turns them into “cocaine fiends”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMUjgG1ypDumMzE2kLXLAgVnLvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34875'),
  ('758160108090934578', 'The Pacifier', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, Action', 'Adam Shankman, Peter James, Daniel Silverberg', 'Robert Ben Garant, Thomas Lennon', 'Vin Diesel, Lauren Graham, Faith Ford, Brittany Snow, Max Thieriot, Morgan York, Chris Potter, Carol Kane', 'PG', 'Navy SEAL Shane Wolfe is handed a new assignment: Protect the five Plummer kids from enemies of their recently deceased father -- a government scientist whose top-secret experiment remains hidden in the kids'' house.', 'Navy SEAL Shane Wolfe is handed a new assignment: Protect the five Plummer kids from enemies of their recently deceased father -- a government scientist whose top-secret experiment remains hidden in the kids'' house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayVLPibrtazh7U5FliWRLDMmG3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10022'),
  ('66231942066104608', 'The Pacifist', 1970, 'Drama', 'Miklós Jancsó, Carlo Di Palma, József Pilissy', 'Giovanna Gagliardo', 'Monica Vitti, Pierre Clémenti, Peter Pasetti, Piero Faggioni, Gino Lavagetto, Sergio Tramonti, Ottavio Fanfani, Cristiano Minellono', null, 'A journalist preparing a story on extremist youth falls in love with a young radical who fears being killed by his companions when he is unable to commit a political assassination.', 'A journalist preparing a story on extremist youth falls in love with a young radical who fears being killed by his companions when he is unable to commit a political assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijtNYEZap4xO8SSIzP20vXaqgK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144428'),
  ('1085502258937060391', 'The Pack', 1977, 'Horror, Adventure, Thriller', 'Robert Clouse, Ralph Woolsey, Tommy Lofaro', 'Robert Clouse', 'Joe Don Baker, Hope Alexander-Willis, Richard B. Shull, R.G. Armstrong, Ned Wertimer, Bibi Besch, Delos V. Smith Jr., Richard O''Brien', 'PG', 'The residents of vacation spot Seal Island find themselves terrorized by a pack of dogs -- the remnants of discarded pets by visiting vacationers.', 'The residents of vacation spot Seal Island find themselves terrorized by a pack of dogs -- the remnants of discarded pets by visiting vacationers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmH6ol9J8drRyIIhcLWLrE1mfIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86239'),
  ('486148475195842235', 'The Pack', 1994, 'Drama', 'Marco Risi, Ferzan Özpetek, Massimo Pau', 'Andrea Carraro, Marco Risi', 'Giampiero Lisarelli, Ricky Memphis, Giorgio Tirabassi, Luca Zingaretti, Angelika Krautzberger, Tamara Simunovic, Roberto Caprari, Salvatore Spada', null, 'In the Roman province a group of boys accepted Sola''s proposal: to rape two German tourists on holiday in Italy held captive in a shack by a junkyard. The only one who pulls back from the group is Raniero, the others willingly accept to follow him. Slowly the news of the two imprisoned tourists spread like wildfire and attracts all the men of the area.', 'In the Roman province a group of boys accepted Sola''s proposal: to rape two German tourists on holiday in Italy held captive in a shack by a junkyard. The only one who pulls back from the group is Raniero, the others willingly accept to follow him. Slowly the news of the two imprisoned tourists spread like wildfire and attracts all the men of the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reY8jnPGvCan1nfhTydGM2zgntP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173782'),
  ('557627874979077922', 'The Pack', 2010, 'Horror', 'Franck Richard', 'Franck Richard', 'Yolande Moreau, Émilie Dequenne, Benjamin Biolay, Philippe Nahon, Matthias Schoenaerts, Éric Godon, Ian Fonteyn, Georges Lini', null, 'In the middle of a snowy no man''s land, Charlotte picks up Max, a hitchhiker; they stop in a truck-stop restaurant, and when Max doesn''t come back from the bathroom, Charlotte starts looking for him in vain. She decides to return during the night but gets kidnapped by the bartender, La Spack, who turns out to be Max''s mother and needs to feed her kids, ''The pack'', a bunch of blood lusting ghouls. Charlotte now faces a terrifying reality: these ghouls are already dead... and hungry. Alone and in the middle of nowhere, she quickly realizes... she''s next on the menu!', 'In the middle of a snowy no man''s land, Charlotte picks up Max, a hitchhiker; they stop in a truck-stop restaurant, and when Max doesn''t come back from the bathroom, Charlotte starts looking for him in vain. She decides to return during the night but gets kidnapped by the bartender, La Spack, who turns out to be Max''s mother and needs to feed her kids, ''The pack'', a bunch of blood lusting ghouls. Charlotte now faces a terrifying reality: these ghouls are already dead... and hungry. Alone and in the middle of nowhere, she quickly realizes... she''s next on the menu!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vC2tiHgSKGWFDDBkvGu883JwBdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52369'),
  ('672323006571808606', 'The Pack', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Nick Robertson, Benjamin Shirley', 'Evan Randall Green', 'Anna Lise Phillips, Jack Campbell, Katie Moore, Kieran Thomas McNamara, Hamish Phillips', null, 'Man’s best friend becomes his worst nightmare when a horde of bloodthirsty wild dogs descends upon a family’s farmhouse in a fang-bearing fight for survival.', 'Man’s best friend becomes his worst nightmare when a horde of bloodthirsty wild dogs descends upon a family’s farmhouse in a fang-bearing fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qe8Xue6kXAj4Cf42Phz7R165LAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344854'),
  ('211550623293493570', 'The Package', 1989, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Andrew Davis, Frank Tidy, Terry Leonard', 'John Bishop', 'Gene Hackman, Joanna Cassidy, Tommy Lee Jones, John Heard, Dennis Franz, Pam Grier, Ron Dean, Nathan Davis', 'R', 'Experienced Green Beret sergeant Johnny Gallagher is escorting a prisoner, Airborne Ranger Thomas Boyette, back to the US, but Boyette escapes and Gallagher must risk life and limb to catch him.', 'Experienced Green Beret sergeant Johnny Gallagher is escorting a prisoner, Airborne Ranger Thomas Boyette, back to the US, but Boyette escapes and Gallagher must risk life and limb to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pInBodZ7xrX8JL7KPL4G9kM5gRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31606'),
  ('972381544170964869', 'The Package', 2013, 'Action', 'Jesse V. Johnson, C. Kim Miles', 'Derek Kolstad', 'Steve Austin, Dolph Lundgren, Darren Shahlavi, Monique Ganderton, Jerry Trimble, Michael Daingerfield, Mike Dopud, Eric Keenleyside', 'R', 'A courier for a local crime lord must deliver a mysterious package while being chased by a horde of unusual gangsters.', 'A courier for a local crime lord must deliver a mysterious package while being chased by a horde of unusual gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBJ0IbG0zUdvbemRsHBAYvOtxH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146578'),
  ('957665176232307769', 'The Package', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jake Szymanski, Hillary Spera, Chris Debenedetto', 'Kevin Burrows, Matt Mider', 'Daniel Doheny, Geraldine Viswanathan, Luke Spencer Roberts, Sadie Calvano, Eduardo Franco, Alexander Calvert, Sugar Lyn Beard, Christian Convery', 'R', 'When a group of teenagers goes on a spring break camping trip, an unfortunate accident sets off a race to save their friend’s most prized possession.', 'When a group of teenagers goes on a spring break camping trip, an unfortunate accident sets off a race to save their friend’s most prized possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70mP0nwUmtaL44Y8aoUn6uBjJON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503619'),
  ('28956688722278786', 'The Pact', 1976, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Sergio Véjar, Javier Durán, Fernando Colín', 'Sergio Véjar, Raúl de Anda', 'Fernando Allende, Ana Martín, Roberto Cañedo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Hortensia Santoveña, José L. Murillo', null, 'When they were children, siblings Sergio and Teresa made a promise to never leave each other. An unhealthy co-dependence developes into adulthood.', 'When they were children, siblings Sergio and Teresa made a promise to never leave each other. An unhealthy co-dependence developes into adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vH4Mq9sIqn7BAS0yyw5xAKp9eSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334363'),
  ('937497026365794958', 'The Pact', 2012, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nicholas McCarthy, Bridger Nielson', 'Nicholas McCarthy', 'Caity Lotz, Casper Van Dien, Agnes Bruckner, Haley Hudson, Dakota Bright, Sam Ball, Mark Steger, Kathleen Rose Perkins', 'R', 'After their mother passes away, sisters Nicole and Annie reluctantly return to their childhood home to pay their last respects. While staying overnight in the house, the sisters sense a mysterious presence in their midst: noises startling them in the night, objects moving about, a fallen picture of an unknown woman posed next to their mother. Annie begins experiencing a series of intense and disturbing dreams - visions that lead her to uncover something terrible about her mother''s past that is finally revealing itself.', 'After their mother passes away, sisters Nicole and Annie reluctantly return to their childhood home to pay their last respects. While staying overnight in the house, the sisters sense a mysterious presence in their midst: noises startling them in the night, objects moving about, a fallen picture of an unknown woman posed next to their mother. Annie begins experiencing a series of intense and disturbing dreams - visions that lead her to uncover something terrible about her mother''s past that is finally revealing itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0a4iSc5yKEiV15NCTI5GwrZudc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111440'),
  ('210769182098046822', 'The Pact', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'David Victori, Elías M. Félix, Anna González', 'David Victori, Jordi Vallejo', 'Belén Rueda, Darío Grandinetti, Mireia Oriol, Antonio Durán ''Morris'', Carlus Fàbrega, Jordi Recasens, Vanessa Buchaca, Frederic Llobregat', 'PG-13', 'Suddenly, Clara, Mónica''s daughter, falls into a deep coma. With Clara left to die, a mysterious man proposes Monica to make a pact: Clara will be saved if Mónica does something for him.', 'Suddenly, Clara, Mónica''s daughter, falls into a deep coma. With Clara left to die, a mysterious man proposes Monica to make a pact: Clara will be saved if Mónica does something for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ibI5KJmdEYQnCcuDMk0clCrz1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517320'),
  ('607277365112766604', 'The Pact II', 2014, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Dallas Richard Hallam, Patrick Horvath, Ezequiel Mirol', 'Patrick Horvath, Dallas Richard Hallam', 'Caity Lotz, Camilla Luddington, Haley Hudson, Amy Pietz, Scott Michael Foster, Patrick Fischler, Mark Steger, Nicki Micheaux', 'NR', 'The sequel is set just weeks after Annie Barlow''s deadly confrontation with the Judas Killer. In this elevated sequel, we meet June, a woman whose carefully constructed life is beginning to unravel due to lucid nightmares so awful they disturb her waking life', 'The sequel is set just weeks after Annie Barlow''s deadly confrontation with the Judas Killer. In this elevated sequel, we meet June, a woman whose carefully constructed life is beginning to unravel due to lucid nightmares so awful they disturb her waking life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqXXhzXRr0DYsZXbunJ9W6B7nqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228358'),
  ('313957580525744829', 'The Pact of Silence', 2003, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Graham Guit, Patrick Blossier', 'Roselyne Bosch', 'Gérard Depardieu, Élodie Bouchez, Carmen Maura, Isaac Sharry, Patrícia Bull, Teresa Madruga, Augusto Portela, Orlando Costa', null, 'Everyone has a secret. Twins Sarah and Gaëlle near 25; for ten years, Sarah has been a fundamentalist Carmelite in a Brazilian convent, and Gaëlle has been in prison for a heinous crime. Sarah comes to the attention of Fr. Joachim, a priest and physician; he can find no cause for her debilitating abdominal pain. When Sarah and he are transferred to Paris, Joachim looks for Gaëlle, now on probation and finding no respite from society''s approbation. An enterprising reporter is digging into Gaëlle''s life, the mother superior of Sarah''s convent hovers over her, and Joachim investigates the phenomenon of twin''s symmetry. Is there any release from the past?', 'Everyone has a secret. Twins Sarah and Gaëlle near 25; for ten years, Sarah has been a fundamentalist Carmelite in a Brazilian convent, and Gaëlle has been in prison for a heinous crime. Sarah comes to the attention of Fr. Joachim, a priest and physician; he can find no cause for her debilitating abdominal pain. When Sarah and he are transferred to Paris, Joachim looks for Gaëlle, now on probation and finding no respite from society''s approbation. An enterprising reporter is digging into Gaëlle''s life, the mother superior of Sarah''s convent hovers over her, and Joachim investigates the phenomenon of twin''s symmetry. Is there any release from the past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ci3jDgZ2dlfMnyadw9l9KhUXmBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62089'),
  ('731265490891779143', 'The Pagan King', 2018, 'History, Adventure, Action', 'Aigars Grauba, Ben Baird, Valdis Celmiņš', 'Aigars Grauba, Max Kinnings', 'Edvin Endre, Aistė Diržiūtė, James Bloor, Artūrs Skrastiņš, Dainis Grūbe, Elīna Vāne, Ivo Martinsons, Egons Dombrovskis', 'R', 'On his deathbed, the reigning king bestows power to an unexpected heir who must find strength within himself to unite his people against the violent crusades which threaten their freedom.', 'On his deathbed, the reigning king bestows power to an unexpected heir who must find strength within himself to unite his people against the violent crusades which threaten their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1dH8MmGfeTqbLh8ZoIZaq64bkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432165'),
  ('783165178275439530', 'The Pagan Madonna', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gyula Mészáros, István Bujtor, István Hildebrand', 'István Bujtor, Gyula Mészáros', 'István Bujtor, András Kern, László Bánhidy, Mária Gór Nagy, Ferenc Kállai, Gabi Pálok, Péter Benkő, Kovács István', null, 'The unique statue of the ancient fertility goddess Demeter, known as the "Pagan Madonna" is stolen from the museum, located in a small town on Lake Balaton. At the same time seriously wounded a servant of the museum. The abduction of the museum''s priceless statues of pure gold is investigated by the then young and inexperienced investigator Kardos and lieutenant "Droplet".', 'The unique statue of the ancient fertility goddess Demeter, known as the "Pagan Madonna" is stolen from the museum, located in a small town on Lake Balaton. At the same time seriously wounded a servant of the museum. The abduction of the museum''s priceless statues of pure gold is investigated by the then young and inexperienced investigator Kardos and lieutenant "Droplet".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAmaILotHQHaU64YYSVGlrsutac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79244'),
  ('330083823496593624', 'The Pagan Queen', 2009, 'Fantasy, History, Romance', 'Constantin Werner, Bobby Bukowski', 'Lance Daly, Constantin Werner', 'Winter Ave Zoli, Csaba Lucas, Lea Mornar, Vera Filatova, Veronika Bellová, Adéla Dodoková, Ivo Novák, Adéla Slámová', 'NR', 'A visionary Slavic queen and her faithful allies draw on everything in their power to overthrow the queen''s despotic husband.', 'A visionary Slavic queen and her faithful allies draw on everything in their power to overthrow the queen''s despotic husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYJeGbyp2QMAgrIDEgozsuODly1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46694'),
  ('317490322754788469', 'The Page Turner', 2006, 'Drama, Music, Thriller', 'Denis Dercourt, Jérôme Peyrebrune', 'Jacques Sotty', 'Catherine Frot, Déborah François, Pascal Greggory, Christine Citti, Clotilde Mollet, Jacques Bonnaffé, Xavier de Guillebon, Antoine Martynciow', null, 'Mélanie Prouvost, a ten-year-old butcher''s daughter, is a gifted pianist. That is why she and her parents decide that she sit for the Conservatory entrance exam. Although Mélanie is very likely to be admitted, she unfortunately gets distracted by the president of the jury''s offhand attitude and she fails. Ten years later, Mélanie becomes her page turner, waiting patiently for her revenge.', 'Mélanie Prouvost, a ten-year-old butcher''s daughter, is a gifted pianist. That is why she and her parents decide that she sit for the Conservatory entrance exam. Although Mélanie is very likely to be admitted, she unfortunately gets distracted by the president of the jury''s offhand attitude and she fails. Ten years later, Mélanie becomes her page turner, waiting patiently for her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBomGoLZKklJWb5hMvcy44WbUsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8436'),
  ('200862111886624488', 'The Pagemaster', 1994, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Pixote Hunt, Joe Johnston, Gordon Hunt', 'Ernie Contreras, David Casci, David Kirschner', 'Macaulay Culkin, Christopher Lloyd, Whoopi Goldberg, Patrick Stewart, Frank Welker, Leonard Nimoy, Ed Begley Jr., Mel Harris', 'G', 'Rich knows a lot about accidents. So much so, he is scared to do anything that might endanger him, like riding his bike, or climbing into his treehouse. While in an old library, he is mystically transported into the unknown world of books, and he has to try and get home again.', 'Rich knows a lot about accidents. So much so, he is scared to do anything that might endanger him, like riding his bike, or climbing into his treehouse. While in an old library, he is mystically transported into the unknown world of books, and he has to try and get home again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIWUuCjN8VND7BDugvf45LveA6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15139'),
  ('324906638579520362', 'The Painted', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sasha Sibley, Peter Bui', 'Sasha Sibley', 'Aleksa Palladino, Sean Bridgers, Jadon Cal, Jessica Ruth Bell, Zara King, Amadeus Serafini, Patrice Johnson, Gary Poux', null, 'When Evelyn Elster inherits her estranged cousin''s fortune she thinks her family has finally gotten the break they''ve needed. Little do they know they''ve not only inherited her cousin''s riches, but also a family curse, and must do whatever they can to avoid becoming its latest victims.', 'When Evelyn Elster inherits her estranged cousin''s fortune she thinks her family has finally gotten the break they''ve needed. Little do they know they''ve not only inherited her cousin''s riches, but also a family curse, and must do whatever they can to avoid becoming its latest victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybQ7ZTkn83lZCy4wD9naOPIWVU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250846'),
  ('1151242001504941586', 'The Painted Bird', 2019, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Václav Marhoul, Vladimír Smutný, Vít Karas', 'Václav Marhoul', 'Petr Kotlár, Nina Šunevič, Alla Sokolova, Udo Kier, Michaela Doležalová, Stellan Skarsgård, Harvey Keitel, Julian Sands', null, 'After losing his parents, a young Jewish boy wanders Eastern Europe, seeking refuge during World War II.', 'After losing his parents, a young Jewish boy wanders Eastern Europe, seeking refuge during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfuh6vTYLGspvkYoBy8GCaJx9Ur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477428'),
  ('281847364459368735', 'The Painted Desert', 1931, 'Western', 'Howard Higgin, Edward Snyder', null, 'William Boyd, Helen Twelvetrees, William Farnum, J. Farrell MacDonald, Clark Gable, Charles Sellon, Wade Boteler, Will Walling', 'NR', 'Western pardners Jeff and Cash find a baby boy in an otherwise deserted emigrants'' camp, and clash over which is to be "father." They are still bitterly feuding years later when they own adjacent ranches. Bill, the foundling whom Cash has raised to young manhood, wants to end the feud and extends an olive branch toward Jeff, who now has a lovely daughter. But during a mining venture, the bitterness escalates. Is Bill to be set against his own adoptive father?', 'Western pardners Jeff and Cash find a baby boy in an otherwise deserted emigrants'' camp, and clash over which is to be "father." They are still bitterly feuding years later when they own adjacent ranches. Bill, the foundling whom Cash has raised to young manhood, wants to end the feud and extends an olive branch toward Jeff, who now has a lovely daughter. But during a mining venture, the bitterness escalates. Is Bill to be set against his own adoptive father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8F8MOwJ2PrexrHX20SgUIGK6HF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42813'),
  ('729807145454251077', 'The Painted Hills', 1951, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Harold F. Kress, Alfred Gilks, Harold Lipstein', 'True Eames Boardman', 'Gary Gray, Paul Kelly, Bruce Cowling, Art Smith, Ann Doran, Chief Yowlachie, Andrea Virginia Lester, Brown Jug Reynolds', 'G', 'After years of prospecting, Jonathan finally strikes gold. He returns to town only to discover that his partner has since died and left Tommy fatherless. He decides to leave Shep with Tommy to cheer him up. Meanwhile, Jonathan''s new partner isn''t interested in sharing the gold, and lures Jonathan to his death.', 'After years of prospecting, Jonathan finally strikes gold. He returns to town only to discover that his partner has since died and left Tommy fatherless. He decides to leave Shep with Tommy to cheer him up. Meanwhile, Jonathan''s new partner isn''t interested in sharing the gold, and lures Jonathan to his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Xvm83XJiACBeVj3quKLhu1VSIH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61855'),
