  ('43115425364257616', 'The Painted Veil', 2006, 'Romance, Drama', 'John Curran, Stuart Dryburgh, John Mahaffie', 'Ron Nyswaner', 'Edward Norton, Naomi Watts, Liev Schreiber, Toby Jones, Diana Rigg, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Xia Yu, Juliet Howland', 'PG-13', 'A British medical doctor fights a cholera outbreak in a small Chinese village, while also being trapped at home in a loveless marriage to an unfaithful wife.', 'A British medical doctor fights a cholera outbreak in a small Chinese village, while also being trapped at home in a loveless marriage to an unfaithful wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k41IvHDLgZO2ae7RuU77wQjScIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14202'),
  ('866557345307920318', 'The Painter', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kimani Ray Smith, Ryan Petey', 'Brian Buccellato', 'Charlie Weber, Jon Voight, Madison Bailey, Max Montesi, Marie Avgeropoulos, Rryla McIntosh, Luisa d''Oliveira, Leah Gibson', 'R', 'An ex-CIA operative is thrown back into a dangerous world when a mysterious woman from his past resurfaces. Now exposed and targeted by a relentless killer and a rogue black ops program, he must rely on skills he thought he left behind in a high-stakes game of survival.', 'An ex-CIA operative is thrown back into a dangerous world when a mysterious woman from his past resurfaces. Now exposed and targeted by a relentless killer and a rogue black ops program, he must rely on skills he thought he left behind in a high-stakes game of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UZ0ydgbXtnrq8xZCI5lHVXVcH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211957'),
  ('829488495551342783', 'The Painter and the Thief', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Benjamin Ree, Kristoffer Kumar, Benjamin Ree', 'Benjamin Ree', 'Barbora Kysilkova, Karl-Bertil Nordland, Øystein Stene, Linda Ville Marie Ruud, Bjørn Inge Nordland', null, 'When two of artist Barbora Kysilkova’s most valuable paintings are stolen from a gallery at Frogner in Oslo, the police are able to find the thief after a few days, but the paintings are nowhere to be found. Barbora goes to the trial in hopes of finding clues, but instead she ends up asking the thief if she can paint a portrait of him. This will be the start of a very unusual friendship. Over three years, the cinematic documentary follows the incredible story of the artist looking for her stolen paintings, while at the same time turning the thief into art.', 'When two of artist Barbora Kysilkova’s most valuable paintings are stolen from a gallery at Frogner in Oslo, the police are able to find the thief after a few days, but the paintings are nowhere to be found. Barbora goes to the trial in hopes of finding clues, but instead she ends up asking the thief if she can paint a portrait of him. This will be the start of a very unusual friendship. Over three years, the cinematic documentary follows the incredible story of the artist looking for her stolen paintings, while at the same time turning the thief into art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldcenmrQen5x8ZJ4NerYhXESc8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654170'),
  ('182653787446074987', 'The Painting', 2011, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Rémi Chayé', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Anik Leray', 'Chloé Berthier, Thierry Jahn, Jessica Monceau, Céline Ronté, Adrien Larmande, Magali Ronsenzweig, Jean-François Laguionie, Julien Bouanich', 'NR', 'Three characters living in an unfinished painting venture out into the real world in search of their creator to convince him to finish his work.', 'Three characters living in an unfinished painting venture out into the real world in search of their creator to convince him to finish his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol4cgUIyw3FXFmJOILBowuGTZgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98162'),
  ('924856923472533792', 'The Pajama Game', 1957, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'George Abbott, Stanley Donen, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'George Abbott, Richard Bissell', 'Doris Day, John Raitt, Carol Haney, Eddie Foy Jr., Reta Shaw, Barbara Nichols, Thelma Pelish, Jack Straw', null, 'An Iowa pajama factory worker falls in love with an affable superintendent who had been hired by the factory''s boss to help oppose the workers'' demand for a pay raise.', 'An Iowa pajama factory worker falls in love with an affable superintendent who had been hired by the factory''s boss to help oppose the workers'' demand for a pay raise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71Q9f7byPqH8trF4BvZOlXnhO2D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40867'),
  ('866044232126514227', 'The Palace', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pan Anzi', null, 'Zhou Dongyu, Chen Xiao, Zhao Liying, Lu Yi, Zhu Zixiao, Winston Chao, Vivian Wu, Bao Bei''er', null, 'In Qing Dynasty, Chen Xiang and Liuli became maids and friends in the imperial palace. Liuli wanted to be famous whereas Chen Xiang just wanted to live a normal life. Liuli attempted to change her life by knowing the prince, even at the cost of betraying Chen Xiang.', 'In Qing Dynasty, Chen Xiang and Liuli became maids and friends in the imperial palace. Liuli wanted to be famous whereas Chen Xiang just wanted to live a normal life. Liuli attempted to change her life by knowing the prince, even at the cost of betraying Chen Xiang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Bp9xkgIM97nhqAvhc8UEF1IuiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244188'),
