  ('870020428441072111', 'The Palace of the Arabian Nights', 1905, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A poor but honest man wins great wealth, and the hand of a beautiful princess, after facing a series of exciting trials in the tunnels and catacombs of ancient Araby. Guided by the mysterious Khalafar, the troupe (alongside him go some cowardly scholars) encounter skeletons, fire-breathing lizards, and mirages on their journey through the lower world.', 'A poor but honest man wins great wealth, and the hand of a beautiful princess, after facing a series of exciting trials in the tunnels and catacombs of ancient Araby. Guided by the mysterious Khalafar, the troupe (alongside him go some cowardly scholars) encounter skeletons, fire-breathing lizards, and mirages on their journey through the lower world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9tRZvUKnTIz8ZEkU1618jduZpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182344'),
  ('459836510205031767', 'The Pale Blue Eye', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Masanobu Takayanagi, Troy Sizemore, Christopher Surgent', 'Scott Cooper', 'Christian Bale, Harry Melling, Lucy Boynton, Toby Jones, Simon McBurney, Timothy Spall, Robert Duvall, Harry Lawtey', 'R', 'West Point, New York, 1830. When a cadet at the burgeoning military academy is found hanged with his heart cut out, the top brass summons former New York City constable Augustus Landor to investigate. While attempting to solve this grisly mystery, the reluctant detective engages the help of one of the cadets: a strange but brilliant young fellow by the name of Edgar Allan Poe.', 'West Point, New York, 1830. When a cadet at the burgeoning military academy is found hanged with his heart cut out, the top brass summons former New York City constable Augustus Landor to investigate. While attempting to solve this grisly mystery, the reluctant detective engages the help of one of the cadets: a strange but brilliant young fellow by the name of Edgar Allan Poe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xkGlFRqrN8btTLU0KQvOfn2PHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800815'),
  ('535774323431647373', 'The Pale Door', 2020, 'Horror, Western', 'Aaron B. Koontz, Courtney Hope Thérond, Dave Halls', 'Keith Lansdale, Cameron Burns, Aaron B. Koontz', 'Noah Segan, Melora Walters, Zachary Knighton, Stan Shaw, Bill Sage, James Landry Hébert, Devin Druid, Natasha Bassett', 'R', 'The Dalton gang escape to a nearby town after a train robbery goes south, but they are met by a coven of witches with sinister plans for the unsuspecting outlaws.', 'The Dalton gang escape to a nearby town after a train robbery goes south, but they are met by a coven of witches with sinister plans for the unsuspecting outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkAZb9jteax1XRnEFlCU9Oer1YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610201'),
  ('295369759833367968', 'The Paleface', 1922, 'Western, Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Virginia Fox, Joe Roberts', null, 'A butterfly collector unwittingly wanders into an Indian encampment while chasing a butterfly, but the tribe has resolved to kill the first white man who enters their encampment because white oil tycoons are trying to force them from their land.', 'A butterfly collector unwittingly wanders into an Indian encampment while chasing a butterfly, but the tribe has resolved to kill the first white man who enters their encampment because white oil tycoons are trying to force them from their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BwcYlQxOCZR4koDhXvj1GYA8kD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25770'),
  ('620569794026656393', 'The Paleface', 1948, 'Comedy, Western', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Alvin Ganzer, Ray Rennahan', 'Frank Tashlin, Edmund L. Hartmann', 'Bob Hope, Jane Russell, Robert Armstrong, Iris Adrian, Bobby Watson, Jackie Searl, Joseph Vitale, Charles Trowbridge', null, 'Bob Hope stars in this laugh-packed wild west spoof co-starring Jane Russell as a sexy Calamity Jane, Hope is a meek frontier dentist, "Painless" Peter Potter, who finds himself gunslinging alongside the fearless Calamity as she fights off outlaws and Indians.', 'Bob Hope stars in this laugh-packed wild west spoof co-starring Jane Russell as a sexy Calamity Jane, Hope is a meek frontier dentist, "Painless" Peter Potter, who finds himself gunslinging alongside the fearless Calamity as she fights off outlaws and Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfcl0iTwtTq2uSGmAFiLQPx7JTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17804'),
  ('898613949092677551', 'The Palermo Connection', 1990, 'Thriller', 'Pasqualino De Santis, Francesco Rosi, Roberto Andò', 'Tonino Guerra, Francesco Rosi, Gore Vidal', 'Jim Belushi, Mimi Rogers, Joss Ackland, Philippe Noiret, Vittorio Gassman, Carolina Rosi, Marco Leonardi, Ronald Yamamoto', 'R', 'Carmine Bonavia wins election as the mayor of New York on a promise to legalize drugs. After the election, he marries Carrie and goes to his ancestral home of Sicily for their honeymoon. In his hotel, he meets Il Principe, a Sicilian prince who has spent years confined to the hotel because he crossed the Mafia. Amid the beauties of Sicily Carmine discovers that men of power will stop at nothing to prevent the legalization of drugs, which threatens their business.', 'Carmine Bonavia wins election as the mayor of New York on a promise to legalize drugs. After the election, he marries Carrie and goes to his ancestral home of Sicily for their honeymoon. In his hotel, he meets Il Principe, a Sicilian prince who has spent years confined to the hotel because he crossed the Mafia. Amid the beauties of Sicily Carmine discovers that men of power will stop at nothing to prevent the legalization of drugs, which threatens their business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWedmsGRrQODgd6KDEbvuDlKAB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73954'),
  ('766925393268129239', 'The Pallbearer', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Matt Reeves, Robert Elswit', 'Jason Katims, Matt Reeves', 'David Schwimmer, Gwyneth Paltrow, Michael Rapaport, Toni Collette, Carol Kane, Michael Vartan, Bitty Schram, Jean De Baer', 'PG-13', 'Aspiring architect Tom Thompson is told by mysterious Ruth Abernathy that his best friend, "Bill," has taken his own life. Except that Tom has never met Bill and neither have his incredulous friends. So when Tom foolishly agrees to give the eulogy at Bill''s funeral, it sets him on a collision course with Ruth -- who is revealed to be Bill''s oversexed mother -- and Julie DeMarco, the longtime crush Tom hasn''t seen since they were teens.', 'Aspiring architect Tom Thompson is told by mysterious Ruth Abernathy that his best friend, "Bill," has taken his own life. Except that Tom has never met Bill and neither have his incredulous friends. So when Tom foolishly agrees to give the eulogy at Bill''s funeral, it sets him on a collision course with Ruth -- who is revealed to be Bill''s oversexed mother -- and Julie DeMarco, the longtime crush Tom hasn''t seen since they were teens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwHI9B3kcj3WqZoE2LaLDi6ZeAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23570'),
  ('154902579478366951', 'The Palm Beach Story', 1942, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Preston Sturges, Victor Milner', 'Preston Sturges', 'Claudette Colbert, Joel McCrea, Mary Astor, Rudy Vallee, Sig Arno, Robert Warwick, Arthur Stuart Hull, Torben Meyer', 'NR', 'A New York inventor, Tom Jeffers, needs cash to develop his big idea, so his adoring wife, Gerry, decides to raise it by divorcing him and marrying an eccentric Florida millionaire, J. D. Hackensacker III.', 'A New York inventor, Tom Jeffers, needs cash to develop his big idea, so his adoring wife, Gerry, decides to raise it by divorcing him and marrying an eccentric Florida millionaire, J. D. Hackensacker III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl3MVnrUsCa0wRsFTVU0ohbtWy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32255'),
  ('566031859491051711', 'The Paloni Show! Halloween Special!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'David Firth, Simon Hanselmann, Jaime Rodríguez', 'Simon Hanselmann, Joel Haver, Myke Chilian', 'Justin Roiland, Zach Hadel, Pamela Adlon, Vatche Panos, Kari Wahlgren, Steve Agee, Ryder Bird, Lombardo Boyar', 'R', 'Leroy, Reggie and Cheruce Paloni host a Halloween special full of spooky shorts from a group of up-and-coming animators.', 'Leroy, Reggie and Cheruce Paloni host a Halloween special full of spooky shorts from a group of up-and-coming animators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9LjwvEZDFWojjyKXdHb20A6526.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019105'),
  ('345769650559268397', 'The Pamela Principle', 1992, 'Romance, Drama', 'Paul Thomas', 'Robyn Sullivent, Alan Gries, Paul Thomas', 'J.K. Dumont, Kim Burnette, Tamara Landry, Troy Donahue, Frank Pesce, Eugene Stevenson, Bobby Johnston, K.C. Williams', 'R', 'Pamela is a young actress who has moved into New York City from the midwest. She meets up with Carl who is middle-aged tailor of women''s clothings and is going through a "mid-life crisis". He sees his son''s amourous escapades and longs for better relationship with his wife Anne who is distant at times. He has an affair with Pamela. But Pamela''s lifestyle does not go well with him.', 'Pamela is a young actress who has moved into New York City from the midwest. She meets up with Carl who is middle-aged tailor of women''s clothings and is going through a "mid-life crisis". He sees his son''s amourous escapades and longs for better relationship with his wife Anne who is distant at times. He has an affair with Pamela. But Pamela''s lifestyle does not go well with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6hbSRCXicAIS4JmFV7kyCdgXSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214584'),
  ('38035679526140230', 'The Panama Deception', 1992, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Manuel Becker, Michael Dobo, Barbara Trent', 'David Kasper', 'Elizabeth Montgomery, Michael Parenti, Carlos Cantú, Alma Martinez, Lou Diamond Phillips, Tony Plana', null, 'This winner of the 1993 Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature details the case that the 1989 invasion of Panama by the US was motivated not by the need to protect American soldiers, restore democracy or even capture Noriega. It was to force Panama to submit the will of the United States after Noriega had exhausted his usefulness.', 'This winner of the 1993 Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature details the case that the 1989 invasion of Panama by the US was motivated not by the need to protect American soldiers, restore democracy or even capture Noriega. It was to force Panama to submit the will of the United States after Noriega had exhausted his usefulness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZN3WG2X2Flv4iyx0y9Jva7m7O3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41773'),
  ('438368682000878090', 'The Panama Papers', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime', 'E.J. Enríquez, Alex Winter', 'Alex Winter', 'Elijah Wood, Bastian Obermayer, Katrin Langhans, Frederik Obermaier, Marina Walker Guevara, Gerard Ryle, Emilia Díaz-Struck, Matthew Caruana Galizia', null, 'A documentary feature film about the biggest global corruption scandal in history, and the hundreds of journalists who risked their lives to break the story.', 'A documentary feature film about the biggest global corruption scandal in history, and the hundreds of journalists who risked their lives to break the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Yw1ZB8oFB4fZTII9GL17yLyEqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551653'),
  ('309290281411353558', 'The Paneless Window Washer', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Willard Bowsky', null, 'Jack Mercer, Gus Wicke, Mae Questel', null, 'Bluto dirties all of an office building''s windows himself, to drum up business for his window cleaning service. When he gets to Olive''s stenographer office, about ten floors up, she says no: Popeye''s going to wash her windows. And the battle with Popeye is on.', 'Bluto dirties all of an office building''s windows himself, to drum up business for his window cleaning service. When he gets to Olive''s stenographer office, about ten floors up, she says no: Popeye''s going to wash her windows. And the battle with Popeye is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqJamjNYdKrEhaEzrj6nsk7ZWkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209509'),
  ('787884195506501556', 'The Panic in Needle Park', 1971, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Adam Holender, Robert Greenhut', 'Joan Didion, John Gregory Dunne', 'Al Pacino, Kitty Winn, Alan Vint, Richard Bright, Kiel Martin, Michael McClanathan, Warren Finnerty, Marcia Jean Kurtz', 'R', 'A stark portrayal of life among a group of heroin addicts who hang out in Needle Park in New York City. Played against this setting is a low-key love story between Bobby, a young addict and small-time hustler, and Helen, a homeless girl who finds in her relationship with Bobby the stability she craves.', 'A stark portrayal of life among a group of heroin addicts who hang out in Needle Park in New York City. Played against this setting is a low-key love story between Bobby, a young addict and small-time hustler, and Helen, a homeless girl who finds in her relationship with Bobby the stability she craves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhJ8Dnl6Z9KR9R2zskBKIfrFeFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27554'),
  ('60881326290583589', 'The Panther Women', 1967, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'René Cardona', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Ariadna Welter, Elizabeth Campbell, Yolanda Montes ''Tongolele'', Eric del Castillo, Manuel Valdés, Jorge Mondragón, Nathanael León, Genaro Moreno', null, 'The Panther women are worshipers of Satan and perform rituals in their honor and sacrifice. The fighters will face them up and down the ring.', 'The Panther women are worshipers of Satan and perform rituals in their honor and sacrifice. The fighters will face them up and down the ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJ2yShK9FYkqi40VyoCjiaB6ruA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341785'),
  ('744926767922516063', 'The Paper', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ron Howard, John Seale, Jane Jenkins', 'Stephen Koepp, David Koepp', 'Michael Keaton, Robert Duvall, Glenn Close, Marisa Tomei, Randy Quaid, Jason Alexander, Catherine O''Hara, Jason Robards', 'R', 'Henry Hackett is the workaholic editor of a New York City tabloid. He loves his job, but the long hours and low pay are leading to discontent. Also, publisher Bernie White faces financial straits, and has hatchet-man Alicia Clark—Henry''s nemesis—impose unpopular cutbacks.', 'Henry Hackett is the workaholic editor of a New York City tabloid. He loves his job, but the long hours and low pay are leading to discontent. Also, publisher Bernie White faces financial straits, and has hatchet-man Alicia Clark—Henry''s nemesis—impose unpopular cutbacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGPrFbucRLwVtCKCeinwAklAl0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12280'),
  ('1125476320575407409', 'The Paper Brigade', 1996, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Blair Treu, Brian Sullivan', 'Denice K. Rice', 'Kyle Howard, Robert Englund, Travis Wester, Chauncey Leopardi, Ethan Glazer, Matthew Ness, Bibi Osterwald, Kylee Cochran', 'PG', 'A 14 year old boy named Gunther moves to a small town with his parents and little brother. He meets up with a group of overly charitable paper boys who want him to sub for their friend while he''s out of town. Gunther agrees so he can get enough money for concert tickets to take his blonde and beautiful crush too, all the while dealing with Chad, her wannabe boyfriend and his bully friends. All in all, Gunther learns to respect himself and other people and to have fun during it all.', 'A 14 year old boy named Gunther moves to a small town with his parents and little brother. He meets up with a group of overly charitable paper boys who want him to sub for their friend while he''s out of town. Gunther agrees so he can get enough money for concert tickets to take his blonde and beautiful crush too, all the while dealing with Chad, her wannabe boyfriend and his bully friends. All in all, Gunther learns to respect himself and other people and to have fun during it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qV8wZhGUAm6WJ0V5XeIJgScAIYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64265'),
  ('467455205822105017', 'The Paper Chase', 1973, 'Drama', 'James Bridges, Gordon Willis, Tony Lucibello', 'James Bridges', 'Timothy Bottoms, Lindsay Wagner, John Houseman, Graham Beckel, James Naughton, Edward Herrmann, Craig Richard Nelson, Robert Lydiard', 'PG', 'A first-year law student struggles with balancing his coursework and his relationship with the daughter of a stern professor.', 'A first-year law student struggles with balancing his coursework and his relationship with the daughter of a stern professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LU6tK5S9RIZq8mN7xXZY7HtGAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14328'),
  ('106820141795127360', 'The Paper Man', 1963, 'Drama', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Gabriel Figueroa, Mario Llorca', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Ricardo Garibay', 'Ignacio López Tarso, Alida Valli, Luis Aguilar, Guillermo Orea, Columba Domínguez, Noé Murayama, José Ángel Espinosa ''Ferrusquilla'', Julio Alemán', null, 'A deaf and mute vagabond finds a large denomination bill in a Mexico City dump, and while he tries to buy something with it, others try to con him into giving it away.', 'A deaf and mute vagabond finds a large denomination bill in a Mexico City dump, and while he tries to buy something with it, others try to con him into giving it away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lLeAzUXqvZicCbhTpBeo6uKY87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113029'),
  ('227122999454943769', 'The Paper Man Returns', 2023, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Cheng Siyi', 'He Sanqi', 'Han Dong, Chen Zihan, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Zhong Lei, Zhang Haoran, Wei Lu, Zhao Gang, Li Ruixue', null, 'Folklore journalist Lu Xiaosheng visits the Liansheng Paper Effigy Shop to investigate a strange tale. Twenty years ago, Qiao Yuanyuan died unjustly, and a paper figure made for her burial was said to bring her spirit back to kill her father. Only the craftsman’s apprentice knows the truth.', 'Folklore journalist Lu Xiaosheng visits the Liansheng Paper Effigy Shop to investigate a strange tale. Twenty years ago, Qiao Yuanyuan died unjustly, and a paper figure made for her burial was said to bring her spirit back to kill her father. Only the craftsman’s apprentice knows the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9iZdYryvIXdRJMX8ZkYMBY2ORs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070442'),
  ('789191895208244016', 'The Paper Tigers', 2020, 'Action, Comedy', 'Quoc Bao Tran, Shaun Mayor, Ken Quitugua', 'Quoc Bao Tran', 'Alain Uy, Ron Yuan, Mykel Shannon Jenkins, Jae Suh Park, Matthew Page, Joziah Lagonoy, Ken Quitugua, Yoshi Sudarso', 'PG-13', 'Three middle aged men polish their martial arts skills to avenge their fallen master.', 'Three middle aged men polish their martial arts skills to avenge their fallen master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x54tAgLfS51fO5EcipNJJ9tfSRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731738'),
  ('1073645855567478117', 'The Paper Will Be Blue', 2006, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, War', 'Radu Muntean', 'Alexandru Baciu, Radu Muntean, Răzvan Rădulescu', 'Paul Ipate, Adi Cărăuleanu, Dragoș Bucur, Tudor Aaron Istodor, Alexandru Potocean, Andi Vasluianu, Dana Dogaru, Ion Sapdaru', null, 'Out of enthusiasm, a Militia soldier abandons his platoon and decides to fight for the cause of the Revolution. His Lieutenant and the rest of the crew look for him during the confused night of 22-23 December 1989.', 'Out of enthusiasm, a Militia soldier abandons his platoon and decides to fight for the cause of the Revolution. His Lieutenant and the rest of the crew look for him during the confused night of 22-23 December 1989.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MlOWyZpZEDK7kYzW3mAR3P4vsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73682'),
  ('544857842027338046', 'The Paperboy', 1994, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Douglas Jackson, Rodney Gibbons', 'David E. Peckinpah', 'Alexandra Paul, Marc Marut, Brigid Tierney, Frances Bay, William Katt, Krista Errickson, Barry Flatman, Karyn Dwyer', null, 'A homicidal twelve-year-old paperboy becomes obsessed with a woman and her daughter next-door, and he''ll do anything to make his fantasy of the "perfect family" come alive.', 'A homicidal twelve-year-old paperboy becomes obsessed with a woman and her daughter next-door, and he''ll do anything to make his fantasy of the "perfect family" come alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xklwDWqhvcBTNy1gg6g1kN6WFOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63725'),
