  ('37881289097560984', 'The Parade', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Srđan Dragojević, Dušan Joksimović', 'Srđan Dragojević', 'Nikola Kojo, Hristina Popović, Miloš Samolov, Goran Jevtić, Goran Navojec, Dejan Aćimović, Toni Mihajlovski, Nataša Marković', null, 'The Parade, in a tragicomic way, tells the story about ongoing battle between two worlds in contemporary post-war Serbian society - the traditional, oppressive, homophobic majority and a liberal, modern and open-minded minority... The film, which deals with gay rights issues in Serbia, features footage of the 2010 Belgrade gay pride parade. The film introduces a group of gay activists, trying to organize a pride parade in Belgrade.', 'The Parade, in a tragicomic way, tells the story about ongoing battle between two worlds in contemporary post-war Serbian society - the traditional, oppressive, homophobic majority and a liberal, modern and open-minded minority... The film, which deals with gay rights issues in Serbia, features footage of the 2010 Belgrade gay pride parade. The film introduces a group of gay activists, trying to organize a pride parade in Belgrade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdqyKH35zociRb17kJ2YVCQW64y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81534'),
  ('592397341794420818', 'The Parades', 2024, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Michihito Fujii, Keisuke Imamura', 'Michihito Fujii', 'Masami Nagasawa, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Ryusei Yokohama, Nana Mori, Tetsushi Tanaka, Shinobu Terajima, Lily Franky, Akari Takaishi', 'PG-13', 'A mother searches for her missing son after a devastating calamity, only to realize that she has died and is now confined to a realm of restless spirits.', 'A mother searches for her missing son after a devastating calamity, only to realize that she has died and is now confined to a realm of restless spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGkoz4G6q8z7xHCCeGo0oKSUKBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1238127'),
  ('502797768603881072', 'The Paradine Case', 1947, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Lee Garmes, Alfred Hitchcock, James G. Stewart', 'David O. Selznick', 'Gregory Peck, Ann Todd, Alida Valli, Charles Laughton, Charles Coburn, Ethel Barrymore, Louis Jourdan, Leo G. Carroll', null, 'In London, barrister Anthony Keane takes the case of Maddalena Paradine, a beautiful woman accused of poisoning her blind husband. Though happily married, Keane becomes infatuated with his enigmatic client and convinced of her innocence. His obsession clouds his judgment as he builds a defense implicating her servant, André Latour—an act that leads to devastating consequences both in court and at home.', 'In London, barrister Anthony Keane takes the case of Maddalena Paradine, a beautiful woman accused of poisoning her blind husband. Though happily married, Keane becomes infatuated with his enigmatic client and convinced of her innocence. His obsession clouds his judgment as he builds a defense implicating her servant, André Latour—an act that leads to devastating consequences both in court and at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faUkygLOpVA8roEYNYyQTX3llnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31667'),
  ('394278774288545566', 'The Paradise of Thorns', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Naruebet Kuno, Tawanwad Wanavit, Rattiya Nuthiang', 'Naron Cherdsoongnern, Karakade Norasethaporn, Naruebet Kuno', 'Jeff Satur, Engfa Waraha, Seeda Puapimon, Harit Buayoi, Pongsakorn Mettarikanon, Nikorn Saetang, Paphon Jirahitaphat, Ampon Phonram', 'PG-13', 'When his partner Sek dies, Thongkam loses his property to his late love''s eager family and must fight to reclaim the home they built together.', 'When his partner Sek dies, Thongkam loses his property to his late love''s eager family and must fight to reclaim the home they built together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR63Z8mFuhxLDFf9XCyKVFEIUsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290206'),
  ('73156987891087497', 'The Parallax View', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Alan J. Pakula, Hawk Koch, John M. Poer', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr., David Giler', 'Warren Beatty, Paula Prentiss, William Daniels, Walter McGinn, Hume Cronyn, Kelly Thordsen, Chuck Waters, Earl Hindman', 'R', 'An ambitious reporter gets in trouble while investigating a senator''s assassination which leads to a vast conspiracy involving a multinational corporation behind every event in the world''s headlines.', 'An ambitious reporter gets in trouble while investigating a senator''s assassination which leads to a vast conspiracy involving a multinational corporation behind every event in the world''s headlines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ClPRox438lwK2Eze7X5xySDaYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17365'),
  ('293852414959538068', 'The Parallel Street', 1962, 'Drama', 'Ferdinand Khittl, Ronald Martini', 'Bodo Blüthner', 'Friedrich Joloff, Ernst Marbeck, Wilfried Schröpfer, Herbert Tiede, Henry van Lyck, Werner Uschkurat', null, 'Feature-documentary "pointing up a thousand facets of this world and probing to determine what may lie beneath the surface".', 'Feature-documentary "pointing up a thousand facets of this world and probing to determine what may lie beneath the surface".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2emv1wcU5m1wIFZJojiDJvPaS2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193595'),
  ('405309425233157496', 'The Paramedic', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Nasca, Raimondo Castelli, Giuseppe Aquari', 'Enrico Montesano, Sergio Nasca', 'Enrico Montesano, Edwige Fenech, Daniela Poggi, Rossano Brazzi, Enzo Cannavale, Marco Messeri, Enzo Robutti, Leo Gullotta', null, 'At work, Mario Millio is the only male nurse not on strike. At home, his wife is more interested in calling the hot-line of a local TV-doctor. When Mario wins 15 million Lire in the lottery, he buys himself a new car and starts to live out his dreams in secret. All goes well until a criminal steals the car and Mario is blamed for the car thief''s crimes', 'At work, Mario Millio is the only male nurse not on strike. At home, his wife is more interested in calling the hot-line of a local TV-doctor. When Mario wins 15 million Lire in the lottery, he buys himself a new car and starts to live out his dreams in secret. All goes well until a criminal steals the car and Mario is blamed for the car thief''s crimes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4Z1KvQ7UC4CiktHp6icTgm20hD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73835'),
  ('310388412522614279', 'The Paramedic', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Carles Torras, Juan Sebastián Vásquez', 'David Desola, Hèctor Hernández Vicens', 'Mario Casas, Déborah François, Guillermo Pfening, Celso Bugallo, Raúl Jiménez, Maria Rodríguez Soto, Pol Monen, Gerard Oms', null, 'Unable to face his new reality in a wheelchair, Ángel develops a deadly obsession with the woman who left him and unleashes a sinister revenge plot.', 'Unable to face his new reality in a wheelchair, Ángel develops a deadly obsession with the woman who left him and unleashes a sinister revenge plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9ruFmHoUws4A45s8FBZuMNC6Mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701175'),
  ('306309035638791847', 'The Paranoids', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriel Medina, Adriana Vior, Lucio Bonelli', 'Gabriel Medina, Nicolás Gueilburt', 'Daniel Hendler, Martín Feldman, Walter Jakob, Jazmín Stuart, Veronica Perdomo, Cecilia Gispert, Wu-chao Ting, Daniel Jeng', null, 'Luciano works in birthday parties and writes his first feature when friend Manuel returns from Spain to repeat his TV show, "The Paranoids", together with his girl Sofia. Manuel is everything he is not and him trying to be helpful in his career and with women, only worsens the conflict.', 'Luciano works in birthday parties and writes his first feature when friend Manuel returns from Spain to repeat his TV show, "The Paranoids", together with his girl Sofia. Manuel is everything he is not and him trying to be helpful in his career and with women, only worsens the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrPadmqYnWai8FJE3hP52LjVpkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44989'),
  ('391785530008548417', 'The Parasite Doctor Suzune: Genesis', 2011, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ryu Kaneda', 'Yoshinobu Fujioka, Yuji Kobayashi', 'Rei Yoshii, Megumi Kagurazaka, Motoki Fukami, Akari Hoshino, Hassei Takano, Yukijiro Hotaru, Houka Kinoshita, Yurika Kubo', null, 'The city is infested with mysterious parasites that bore into their human hosts to increase their host''s power and sexual desires. A beautiful girl, Suzune Arizono is a vet with a specialty in parasites, and who fights daily to end the plague. Before long, she learns that an evil organization, the Kito Zaibatsu, is behind the explosive growth of this ferocious parasite. She also learns that her long-missing father, Dr. Arizono, is also involved. In order to crush the Kito Zaibatsu''s ambition and to see her father again, Suzune takes on the fight without regard to the danger involved.', 'The city is infested with mysterious parasites that bore into their human hosts to increase their host''s power and sexual desires. A beautiful girl, Suzune Arizono is a vet with a specialty in parasites, and who fights daily to end the plague. Before long, she learns that an evil organization, the Kito Zaibatsu, is behind the explosive growth of this ferocious parasite. She also learns that her long-missing father, Dr. Arizono, is also involved. In order to crush the Kito Zaibatsu''s ambition and to see her father again, Suzune takes on the fight without regard to the danger involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr2ekJrJu18ncoJJdfFzyd0rNC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260015'),
  ('160206739351817169', 'The Parent Trap', 1961, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'David Swift, Lucien Ballard, Ivan Volkman', 'David Swift', 'Hayley Mills, Maureen O''Hara, Brian Keith, Charles Ruggles, Cathleen Nesbitt, Una Merkel, Joanna Barnes, Linda Watkins', 'G', 'Two identical twin sisters, separated at birth by their parents'' divorce, are reunited years later at a summer camp, where they scheme to bring their parents back together. The girls, one of whom has been living with their mother and the other with their father, switch places after camp and go to work on their plan, the first objective being to scare off a gold-digger pursuing their father.', 'Two identical twin sisters, separated at birth by their parents'' divorce, are reunited years later at a summer camp, where they scheme to bring their parents back together. The girls, one of whom has been living with their mother and the other with their father, switch places after camp and go to work on their plan, the first objective being to scare off a gold-digger pursuing their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaZFWy6ZAvQoMW2mo9xP5gx4URo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19186'),
  ('657992297372669972', 'The Parent Trap', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Nancy Meyers, Ilene Starger, Charles Shyer', 'Nancy Meyers, David Swift, Charles Shyer', 'Lindsay Lohan, Dennis Quaid, Natasha Richardson, Elaine Hendrix, Lisa Ann Walter, Simon Kunz, Polly Holliday, Maggie Wheeler', 'PG', 'Hallie Parker and Annie James are identical twins who were separated at a young age due to their parents'' divorce. Unbeknownst to their parents, the girls are sent to the same summer camp, where they meet, discover the truth about their relationship, and come up with a plan to switch places in an effort to reunite their mother and father.', 'Hallie Parker and Annie James are identical twins who were separated at a young age due to their parents'' divorce. Unbeknownst to their parents, the girls are sent to the same summer camp, where they meet, discover the truth about their relationship, and come up with a plan to switch places in an effort to reunite their mother and father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4dGmi8u9W0HHyVXcgWPoiFfKTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9820'),
