  ('390581227742672290', 'The Parole Officer', 2001, 'Crime, Comedy', 'John Duigan, John Daly, Sean Guest', 'Henry Normal, Steve Coogan', 'Steve Coogan, Lena Headey, Ben Miller, Om Puri, Steven Waddington, Stephen Dillane, Emma Williams, John Henshaw', null, 'A hapless parole officer is framed for murder by a crooked police chief. To prove his innocence he must entice his former clients away from the law abiding lives they are now living to recover the evidence that will save him.', 'A hapless parole officer is framed for murder by a crooked police chief. To prove his innocence he must entice his former clients away from the law abiding lives they are now living to recover the evidence that will save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTiBD7kCwIpjOXZ0L2JDMNo4su5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32577'),
