  ('150861573164203379', 'The Party and the Guests', 1966, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Věra Vláčilová, Jan Němec, Pavel Horák', 'Jan Němec, Ester Krumbachová', 'Ivan Vyskočil, Jan Klusák, Jiří Němec, Pavel Bošek, Karel Mareš, Evald Schorm, Zdena Škvorecká, Helena Pejšková', null, 'A group of the bourgeois head for a prominent figure''s birthday party. As they venture through the woods and have a picnic, they''re suddenly surrounded by some suspicious strangers.', 'A group of the bourgeois head for a prominent figure''s birthday party. As they venture through the woods and have a picnic, they''re suddenly surrounded by some suspicious strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Nl4QFdesxZcgPBs0qLn4koE2Ee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105348'),
  ('787105498255665329', 'The Party Animal', 1984, 'Comedy', 'David Beaird, Marty Schiff, Bryan England', 'David Beaird', 'Matthew Causey, Timothy Carhart, Jerry Jones, Robin Harlan, Frank Galati, Lucy Roucis, Joan Dykman, Barbara Baylis', 'R', 'The Party Animal is a documentary-style comedy about a sex-starved man, Pondo Sinatra, a 26-year-old college student whom everyone agrees is doomed to die a virgin. Desperate to break what seems to be a cosmic curse, he tries ever more bizarre schemes to seduce one the sexy, scantily-clad women who seem to be everywhere, taunting him and enjoying his misery. Despite his best efforts, however, he is rejected everywhere, even at the local cathouse. When Pondo threatens to kill himself, Studley, his ladykilling best friend, tries to help him in his quest to "get him a little", as does Studley''s mentor, a wise old janitor named Elbow.', 'The Party Animal is a documentary-style comedy about a sex-starved man, Pondo Sinatra, a 26-year-old college student whom everyone agrees is doomed to die a virgin. Desperate to break what seems to be a cosmic curse, he tries ever more bizarre schemes to seduce one the sexy, scantily-clad women who seem to be everywhere, taunting him and enjoying his misery. Despite his best efforts, however, he is rejected everywhere, even at the local cathouse. When Pondo threatens to kill himself, Studley, his ladykilling best friend, tries to help him in his quest to "get him a little", as does Studley''s mentor, a wise old janitor named Elbow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIU8O47fWjnKqli9dCcRwI0FAKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38986'),
  ('1008684974750397108', 'The Party Is Over', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marie Garel-Weiss, Samuel Lahu', 'Salvatore Lista, Marie Garel-Weiss', 'Zita Hanrot, Clémence Boisnard, Coralie Russier, Marie Denarnaud, Michel Muller, Pascal Rénéric, Inès Fehner, Martine Schambacher', null, 'Despite their differences, Celeste and Sihem quickly become inseparable. The common will to get out of drugs seals their fusional friendship. This will be as much a force as an obstacle when, transferred from the center that welcomes them, they find themselves left to themselves, to the test of the real world and its temptations. They will have to fight to finally live.', 'Despite their differences, Celeste and Sihem quickly become inseparable. The common will to get out of drugs seals their fusional friendship. This will be as much a force as an obstacle when, transferred from the center that welcomes them, they find themselves left to themselves, to the test of the real world and its temptations. They will have to fight to finally live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8vMPg40miZ8iTLxETKviRlEnjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474298'),
  ('790137635756959546', 'The Party''s Just Beginning', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Karen Gillan, Edd Lukas', 'Karen Gillan', 'Karen Gillan, Lee Pace, Matthew Beard, Paul Higgins, Siobhan Redmond, Jamie Quinn, Rachel Jackson, Niall Greig Fulton', null, 'In a bleak Inverness midwinter, Luisaidh is careening off the rails after the suicide of her best friend. She medicates her misery with joyless sex, chips and a belief in the power of positive drinking. Surrounded by bittersweet memories, she struggles to find someone to talk to or some reason to make life worthwhile at the most stressful time of the year.', 'In a bleak Inverness midwinter, Luisaidh is careening off the rails after the suicide of her best friend. She medicates her misery with joyless sex, chips and a belief in the power of positive drinking. Surrounded by bittersweet memories, she struggles to find someone to talk to or some reason to make life worthwhile at the most stressful time of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkQGIm3g4gQIm6sme3P1cHHexnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435557'),
  ('249590851781122758', 'The Party''s Over', 1965, 'Drama', 'Guy Hamilton, Larry Pizer', 'Marc Behm', 'Oliver Reed, Clifford David, Katherine Woodville, Ann Lynn, Louise Sorel, Eddie Albert, Mike Pratt, Maurice Browning', null, 'A group of close friends spend their time drinking and partying. When the American fiancé one of them shows up, the clique protects her by hiding her from him. He slowly becomes deeper involved with the wild bunch while the party rages on. This once controversial British movie was filmed in 1962 but not released until three years later.', 'A group of close friends spend their time drinking and partying. When the American fiancé one of them shows up, the clique protects her by hiding her from him. He slowly becomes deeper involved with the wild bunch while the party rages on. This once controversial British movie was filmed in 1962 but not released until three years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpAlr22qHyXKcNNFDLasXBlGFuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41830'),
  ('810732537082802898', 'The Party''s Over!', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Antony Cordier, Nicolas Gaurin, Clément Comet', 'Jean-Alain Laban, Steven Mitz', 'Laurent Lafitte, Élodie Bouchez, Ramzy Bedia, Laure Calamy, Sami Outalbali, Noée Abita, Mahia Zrouki, Candide Sanchez', null, 'Mehdi had planned to spend a quiet summer in his in-laws'' sumptuous home. But as soon as he arrives, a conflict breaks out between his girfriend''s family and the villa''s janitor couple. As Mehdi comes from a modest background, he thinks he can lead the negotiations between the two parties and bring everyone back to their senses. But things start to escalate...', 'Mehdi had planned to spend a quiet summer in his in-laws'' sumptuous home. But as soon as he arrives, a conflict breaks out between his girfriend''s family and the villa''s janitor couple. As Mehdi comes from a modest background, he thinks he can lead the negotiations between the two parties and bring everyone back to their senses. But things start to escalate...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtR5sUSugZlbcN0mXVVMX0mlWzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313211'),
  ('1065207894104879049', 'The Pass', 1988, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Vladimir Tarasov, Kabul Rasulov', 'Kir Bulychyov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Aleksandr Pashutin, Alina Pokrovskaya', null, 'A starship crashed on an uninhabited planet and its crew had to abandon it. Years later the survivors and their children try to return to the ship and send a distress signal. But for that they must go through a very dangerous mountain passage.', 'A starship crashed on an uninhabited planet and its crew had to abandon it. Years later the survivors and their children try to return to the ship and send a distress signal. But for that they must go through a very dangerous mountain passage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pePmkhUX4VsyKA6hRJaBCniA9Wr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95814'),
  ('49055351331211847', 'The Pass', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ben A. Williams', 'John Donnelly', 'Russell Tovey, Arinzé Kene, Lisa McGrillis, Nico Mirallegro, Rory J. Saper', null, 'The night before their debut game, two professional soccer players share a kiss. In a sporting world where image is everything, this surprising ‘pass’ sets the men up for a contrasting decade of fame and failure, full of secrets and denial.', 'The night before their debut game, two professional soccer players share a kiss. In a sporting world where image is everything, this surprising ‘pass’ sets the men up for a contrasting decade of fame and failure, full of secrets and denial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDoCBDEhOlOcNhIK3RwBUC557Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382475'),
  ('503437223832756729', 'The Passage', 1979, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Kip Gowans, J. Lee Thompson, Michael Reed', 'Bruce Nicolaysen', 'Anthony Quinn, James Mason, Malcolm McDowell, Patricia Neal, Kay Lenz, Paul Clemens, Christopher Lee, Michael Lonsdale', 'R', 'During WW 2, a Basque shepherd is approached by the underground, who wants him to lead a scientist and his family across the Pyrenees. While being pursued by a sadistic German.', 'During WW 2, a Basque shepherd is approached by the underground, who wants him to lead a scientist and his family across the Pyrenees. While being pursued by a sadistic German.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kXQJWwWntjzAJv14IcYqPhgd46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51543'),
  ('825366189119352579', 'The Passage', 1986, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'René Manzor, André Diot', 'Alain Delon, René Manzor', 'Alain Delon, Christine Boisson, Jean-Luc Moreau, Alain Lalanne, Alberto Lomeo, Salvatore Nicosia, Jean Levasseur, Sylvie Monier', null, 'Film-maker Jean Diaz lives with his son David after separated from his wife. On their way to the new house near the sea, Jean and David have a car accident provoked by The Death (portrayed here like a grim-reaper). The doctor actually can save Jean, but The Death sabotages the equipment with his computer. The Death offers Jean to wake David from his coma, but Jean must make an animation movie against the violence for him.', 'Film-maker Jean Diaz lives with his son David after separated from his wife. On their way to the new house near the sea, Jean and David have a car accident provoked by The Death (portrayed here like a grim-reaper). The doctor actually can save Jean, but The Death sabotages the equipment with his computer. The Death offers Jean to wake David from his coma, but Jean must make an animation movie against the violence for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWXybdhAOMm60LHBgKz5j1JARxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59059'),
  ('1007541308826367022', 'The Passenger', 1975, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Luciano Tovoli, Federico Canudas', 'Mark Peploe, Michelangelo Antonioni, Miguel De Echarri', 'Jack Nicholson, Maria Schneider, Jenny Runacre, Ian Hendry, Steven Berkoff, Ambroise Mbia, José María Caffarel, James Campbell', 'PG-13', 'David Locke is a world-weary American journalist who has been sent to cover a conflict in northern Africa, but he makes little progress with the story. When he discovers the body of a stranger who looks similar to him, Locke assumes the dead man''s identity. However, he soon finds out that the man was an arms dealer, leading Locke into dangerous situations. Aided by a beautiful woman, Locke attempts to avoid both the police and criminals out to get him.', 'David Locke is a world-weary American journalist who has been sent to cover a conflict in northern Africa, but he makes little progress with the story. When he discovers the body of a stranger who looks similar to him, Locke assumes the dead man''s identity. However, he soon finds out that the man was an arms dealer, leading Locke into dangerous situations. Aided by a beautiful woman, Locke attempts to avoid both the police and criminals out to get him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8jYH43plz70dNmHy82zAHGTqxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9652'),
  ('9997800747508335', 'The Passenger', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tor Iben', 'Tor Iben', 'Niklas Peters, Lynn Femme, Urs Stämpfli, Maxim Albert, Annina Nusko, Bastian Scheibe', null, 'While searching for a condo in Berlin for his father, Nick meets Philipp, a young talented photographer and a gorgeous actress named Lilli. There is instant chemistry and both are easily seduced by Nick''s charms. Lilli and Philipp begin to explore their relationship with the sexy visitor, succumbing to their passionate affections for him which intensifies their volatile emotional and physical bonds. But what Philipp and Lilli don''t realize is that they are being lured into Nick''s manipulative..and deadly, love game.', 'While searching for a condo in Berlin for his father, Nick meets Philipp, a young talented photographer and a gorgeous actress named Lilli. There is instant chemistry and both are easily seduced by Nick''s charms. Lilli and Philipp begin to explore their relationship with the sexy visitor, succumbing to their passionate affections for him which intensifies their volatile emotional and physical bonds. But what Philipp and Lilli don''t realize is that they are being lured into Nick''s manipulative..and deadly, love game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lG1ggqaV8e9WbWSRVv69ub8Og0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286880'),
  ('845564983840738230', 'The Passenger', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Raúl Cerezo, Fernando González Gómez, Ignacio Aguilar', 'Luis Sánchez-Polack, Asier Guerricaechevarría, Javier Echániz', 'Ramiro Blas, Cecilia Suárez, Paula Gallego, Cristina Alcázar, Vasileios Papatheocharis, Carmen Ibeas, Yao Yao, Niko Verona', null, 'Four people traveling in a van run over a lone woman while she is walking in the dark down a country road. After loading her into the vehicle to take her to the nearest hospital, they notice that she is behaving rather strangely. The occupants of the van soon realise that the time has come to fight for their lives, and together they agree on one very simple rule: "do not sit next to her."', 'Four people traveling in a van run over a lone woman while she is walking in the dark down a country road. After loading her into the vehicle to take her to the nearest hospital, they notice that she is behaving rather strangely. The occupants of the van soon realise that the time has come to fight for their lives, and together they agree on one very simple rule: "do not sit next to her."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bYCDIYqT3GpE6ICnMP6HvUlJMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869399'),
  ('170614811573897312', 'The Passenger', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Carter Smith, Lyn Moncrief, Gerson Paz', 'Jack Stanley', 'Kyle Gallner, Johnny Berchtold, Liza Weil, Billy Slaughter, Matthew Laureano, Jordan Sherley, Kanesha Washington, Lupe Leon', 'NR', 'Randolph Bradley is perfectly content fading into the background, but when his coworker Benson snaps and goes on a violent killing spree, he’s forced to face his fears and confront his troubled past in order to find a way to survive.', 'Randolph Bradley is perfectly content fading into the background, but when his coworker Benson snaps and goes on a violent killing spree, he’s forced to face his fears and confront his troubled past in order to find a way to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4elVCxpRBcqVLPEI2sDC4fIa0Mt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957314'),
  ('903788876523645996', 'The Passengers', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Claude Guiguet, Philippe Bottiglione', 'Jean-Claude Guiguet, Haydée Caillot', 'Fabienne Babe, Philippe Garziano, Bruno Putzulu, Stéphane Rideau, Gwenaëlle Simon, Véronique Silver, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Marie Rousseau', null, 'The new Saint Denis-Bobigny streetcar picks up and drops off commuters in an all-too-brief transit of their lives. Among the regular riders is a woman who is both spectator and guide – she introduces, comments on, ponders and catalyzes the sometimes vain, sometimes serious preoccupations of her fellow travelers, who, for the moment, are rushing headlong toward their destiny. The commuters and their observer have double lives. Once they step off this streetcar, the real-life dramas begin. Each has his or her style of living or dying…', 'The new Saint Denis-Bobigny streetcar picks up and drops off commuters in an all-too-brief transit of their lives. Among the regular riders is a woman who is both spectator and guide – she introduces, comments on, ponders and catalyzes the sometimes vain, sometimes serious preoccupations of her fellow travelers, who, for the moment, are rushing headlong toward their destiny. The commuters and their observer have double lives. Once they step off this streetcar, the real-life dramas begin. Each has his or her style of living or dying…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1RW81EAjQ5PdqD0oPoVeaqIbs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171172'),
  ('682645198533952121', 'The Passengers of the Night', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mikhaël Hers, Sébastien Buchmann, Vincent Lefeuvre', 'Mariette Désert, Mikhaël Hers, Maud Ameline', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Quito Rayon Richter, Noée Abita, Megan Northam, Thibault Vinçon, Emmanuelle Béart, Laurent Poitrenaux, Didier Sandre', null, 'On election night in 1981, celebrations spill out onto the street and there is an air of hope and change throughout Paris. But for Elisabeth, her marriage is coming to an end and she will now have to support herself and her two teenage children. She finds work at a late-night radio show and encounters a troubled teenager named Talulah whom she invites into her home.', 'On election night in 1981, celebrations spill out onto the street and there is an air of hope and change throughout Paris. But for Elisabeth, her marriage is coming to an end and she will now have to support herself and her two teenage children. She finds work at a late-night radio show and encounters a troubled teenager named Talulah whom she invites into her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5UGtAsH24q3t9GQpj0A7t9HXY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895659'),
  ('242864159612279304', 'The Passengers of Ursa Major', 1943, 'Animation', 'Paul Grimault', 'Maurice Blondeau', null, null, 'A futuristic cruise ship with a crew of robots is ready to take its first flight. A boy follows his curious dog on board of the ship, but then the ship takes off. The robots sees the boy as a blind passenger and try to get him off the flying ship.', 'A futuristic cruise ship with a crew of robots is ready to take its first flight. A boy follows his curious dog on board of the ship, but then the ship takes off. The robots sees the boy as a blind passenger and try to get him off the flying ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgIMCfMAQAWqK0jhKD35rwEtcnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247012'),
  ('278195798994676223', 'The Passerby', 1982, 'Drama', 'Jacques Rouffio, Jean Penzer, Claire Denis', 'Jacques Rouffio, Jacques Kirsner', 'Romy Schneider, Michel Piccoli, Helmut Griem, Dominique Labourier, Gérard Klein, Mathieu Carrière, Jacques Martin, Wendelin Werner', null, 'Max Baumstein is a reputable businessman who founded an international organization fighting against violations of human rights. Why would he commit an act that apparently negates the principles he has striven for so long to uphold? As he is tried for first-degree murder for killing a Paraguayan ambassador in cold blood, he reveals a secret about himself that he kept hidden from his wife Lina. His act is the conclusion of a struggle that started many decades earlier in his childhood...', 'Max Baumstein is a reputable businessman who founded an international organization fighting against violations of human rights. Why would he commit an act that apparently negates the principles he has striven for so long to uphold? As he is tried for first-degree murder for killing a Paraguayan ambassador in cold blood, he reveals a secret about himself that he kept hidden from his wife Lina. His act is the conclusion of a struggle that started many decades earlier in his childhood...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k67NPm1Id6Hl09oCdcCRqON2Axq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5063'),
  ('328519262031600931', 'The Passing', 1985, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Richard Chisolm, José "Jochi" Melero, John Huckert', 'John Huckert, Mary Maruca', 'James Carroll Plaster, Welton Benjamin Johnson, John Huckert, Lynn Odell, Mark McPherson, Richard Chisolm, Steve Ingrassia, Charles Murphy', null, 'The lives of two men, an elderly WWII vet and a young death row prisoner, intersect when the vet enrolls in a program to have his consciousness transplanted into a younger body...and the prisoner is forced to provide the body.', 'The lives of two men, an elderly WWII vet and a young death row prisoner, intersect when the vet enrolls in a program to have his consciousness transplanted into a younger body...and the prisoner is forced to provide the body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frRoxRFVf5Ld8Ty89vqY9SeSenf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190068'),
  ('1034094071492446588', 'The Passing', 1992, null, 'Bill Viola', null, null, null, 'Internationally acclaimed and award-winning video installation artist Bill Viola juxtaposes personal pictures of his mother''s death with images of his own son''s birth to explore foundational and potent themes of beginnings and endings, the cycle of life and the movement of generations. An evocative exploration of personal and communal spirituality, this deeply felt film is a poetic masterpiece to contemplate time and again.', 'Internationally acclaimed and award-winning video installation artist Bill Viola juxtaposes personal pictures of his mother''s death with images of his own son''s birth to explore foundational and potent themes of beginnings and endings, the cycle of life and the movement of generations. An evocative exploration of personal and communal spirituality, this deeply felt film is a poetic masterpiece to contemplate time and again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVGEBVVkeJMcGyhKGOihKiWWGFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49829'),
  ('579956597798279715', 'The Passing of the Third Floor Back', 1935, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Berthold Viertel, Curt Courant, Louis Levy', 'Alma Reville, Michael Hogan', 'Conrad Veidt, Rène Ray, Frank Cellier, Anna Lee, John Turnbull, Cathleen Nesbitt, Ronald Ward, Beatrix Lehmann', 'NR', 'The tenants of an old London boarding house spend their time in petty bickering and sniping until a mysterious stranger arrives at their door.', 'The tenants of an old London boarding house spend their time in petty bickering and sniping until a mysterious stranger arrives at their door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8epP0fJhvfXGPxODHOFVLXv1kPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125125'),
  ('64627588741864124', 'The Passion of Anna', 1969, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Max von Sydow, Liv Ullmann, Bibi Andersson, Erland Josephson, Erik Hell, Sigge Fürst, Svea Holst, Annicka Kronberg', 'R', 'A recently divorced man and an emotionally devastated widow begin a love affair.', 'A recently divorced man and an emotionally devastated widow begin a love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr01316AyxUZyZrdLwzz3AXrgJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42602'),
  ('292595423355685145', 'The Passion of Augustine', 2015, 'Drama', 'Léa Pool, Daniel Jobin', 'Léa Pool, Marie Vien', 'Céline Bonnier, Lysandre Ménard, Diane Lavallée, Valérie Blais, Pierrette Robitaille, Marie Tifo, Marie-France Lambert, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé', null, 'The nuns of a musical convent work hard in order to prevent the religious school from closing.', 'The nuns of a musical convent work hard in order to prevent the religious school from closing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i9kN5VV23cLWfCh0E6FetCgIeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331797'),
  ('372786119197983777', 'The Passion of Ayn Rand', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, History, TV Movie', 'Christopher Menaul, Rocco Gismondi, Tim Singh', 'Howard Korder, Mary Gallagher', 'Helen Mirren, Eric Stoltz, Julie Delpy, Peter Fonda, Sybil Darrow, Tom McCamus, Don McKellar, David Ferry', null, 'Author Ayn Rand becomes involved with a much younger and married man, to the dismay of those close to her.', 'Author Ayn Rand becomes involved with a much younger and married man, to the dismay of those close to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSudsCHq4z5jVl08nEq1OhMAzeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49622'),
