  ('970313977633895842', 'The Passionate Friends', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Lean, George Pollock, Guy Green', 'Eric Ambler', 'Ann Todd, Claude Rains, Trevor Howard, Betty Ann Davies, Isabel Dean, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Arthur Howard, Guido Lorraine', 'NR', 'A woman is torn between the love of her life, who''s married to someone else, and her older husband.', 'A woman is torn between the love of her life, who''s married to someone else, and her older husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awmC8rVQR2WcN7kTKP7bXHFInnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51618'),
  ('118149052288596239', 'The Passionate Plumber', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Edward Sedgwick, Norbert Brodine', null, 'Buster Keaton, Jimmy Durante, Polly Moran, Irene Purcell, Gilbert Roland, Mona Maris, Maude Eburne, Henry Armetta', 'NR', 'Paris plumber Elmer Tuttle is enlisted by socialite Patricia Alden to help make her lover Tony Lagorce jealous. With the help of his friend Julius J. McCracken and through the high society contacts he has made through Patricia, Elmer hopes to find financing for his latest invention, a pistol with a range-finding light. Comic complications ensue when Elmer''s effort to interest a military leader is misconstrued as an assassination attempt.', 'Paris plumber Elmer Tuttle is enlisted by socialite Patricia Alden to help make her lover Tony Lagorce jealous. With the help of his friend Julius J. McCracken and through the high society contacts he has made through Patricia, Elmer hopes to find financing for his latest invention, a pistol with a range-finding light. Comic complications ensue when Elmer''s effort to interest a military leader is misconstrued as an assassination attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fbqCflNnl8OoxYyujQ3UIGFvpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53575'),
  ('748256293677551881', 'The Passionate Stranger', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Muriel Box, Otto Heller', 'Sydney Box, Muriel Box', 'Ralph Richardson, Margaret Leighton, Patricia Dainton, Carlo Giustini, Frederick Piper, Thorley Walters, George Woodbridge, Allan Cuthbertson', null, 'Judith Wynter is a happily married novelist whose romantic works are eagerly devoured by scores of female readers. When Carlo, a handsome young Italian chauffeur, arrives to work for Judith and her husband, a professor currently recovering from an attack of paralysis, he causes quite a flutter; when he then reads the manuscript of Judith''s latest novel, he jumps to a rather unfortunate conclusion... and life in the Wynter household becomes very complicated indeed!', 'Judith Wynter is a happily married novelist whose romantic works are eagerly devoured by scores of female readers. When Carlo, a handsome young Italian chauffeur, arrives to work for Judith and her husband, a professor currently recovering from an attack of paralysis, he causes quite a flutter; when he then reads the manuscript of Judith''s latest novel, he jumps to a rather unfortunate conclusion... and life in the Wynter household becomes very complicated indeed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAtFFzK3ZzdIUZAw16KB5HyEQTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348100'),
  ('538328456880783178', 'The Passionate Thief', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Leonida Barboni, Silvana Mangini Colizzi', 'Mario Monicelli, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Furio Scarpelli', 'Anna Magnani, Totò, Ben Gazzara, Fred Clark, Edy Vessel, Gina Rovere, Toni Ucci, Kurt Polter', 'NR', 'On New Year''s Eve, a young woman and an out-of-work actor complicate a pickpocket''s plans to ply his trade.', 'On New Year''s Eve, a young woman and an out-of-work actor complicate a pickpocket''s plans to ply his trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqi0sYlea3k2wzZu6oTOFlWwyLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71995'),
  ('674027268880725490', 'The Passport', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Vadim Yusov', 'Revaz Gabriadze, Georgiy Daneliya, Arkadiy Khayt', 'Gérard Darmon, Natalya Gundareva, Oleg Yankovskiy, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Evgeni Leonov, Mamuka Kikaleishvili, Leonid Yarmolnik, Levan Pilpani', null, 'Merab, a Georgian taxi driver who mistakenly crosses into Israel while seeing off his Jewish brother, Yasha, gets stuck without documents. He gets entangled in bureaucratic nightmares, mistaken identity, and KGB plots while trying to return home.', 'Merab, a Georgian taxi driver who mistakenly crosses into Israel while seeing off his Jewish brother, Yasha, gets stuck without documents. He gets entangled in bureaucratic nightmares, mistaken identity, and KGB plots while trying to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZZujbMnKCptjt9Eq9bvPc7Tm2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27926'),
  ('370771454648717161', 'The Password Is Courage', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Andrew L. Stone, Davis Boulton', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Dirk Bogarde, Maria Perschy, Alfred Lynch, Nigel Stock, Reginald Beckwith, Richard Marner, Ed Devereaux, Lewis Fiander', 'NR', 'Sergeant-Major Charles Coward, a brave British soldier is captured by German forces during World War II. When he''s thrown into a prisoner of war camp, he immediately plans his escape. Masquerading as a wounded German soldier, he makes it as far as the medical tent, where the deceived enemy forces award him the Iron Cross. Though he is ultimately discovered, he goes on to courageously pursue his freedom with a whimsical and undying audacity.', 'Sergeant-Major Charles Coward, a brave British soldier is captured by German forces during World War II. When he''s thrown into a prisoner of war camp, he immediately plans his escape. Masquerading as a wounded German soldier, he makes it as far as the medical tent, where the deceived enemy forces award him the Iron Cross. Though he is ultimately discovered, he goes on to courageously pursue his freedom with a whimsical and undying audacity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXfygm4kwDmWAWtQpInnbgFj0U2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67749'),
  ('251429778793992867', 'The Past', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Héctor Babenco', 'Alan Pauls, Héctor Babenco', 'Gael García Bernal, Analía Couceyro, Mariana Anghileri, Paulo Autran, Mimí Ardú, Mabi Abele, Robson Nunes, Héctor Babenco', null, 'After 12 years, Sofía and Rímini decided to separate. While Rímini finds it easy to move on and start a new life, Sofía stays stuck in the past and constantly harasses him. She reappears again and again on Rímini''s horizon to reconquer him, torture him or redeem him.', 'After 12 years, Sofía and Rímini decided to separate. While Rímini finds it easy to move on and start a new life, Sofía stays stuck in the past and constantly harasses him. She reappears again and again on Rímini''s horizon to reconquer him, torture him or redeem him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BxoNZ6kxoKsr2RUlU17IagvtQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66461'),
