  ('203860522999625161', 'The Patent Leather Kid', 1927, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Santell, Arthur Edeson, Ralph Hammeras', null, 'Richard Barthelmess, Molly O''Day, Lawford Davidson, Matthew Betz, Arthur Stone, Ray Turner, Hank Mann, Walter James', null, 'The Patent Leather Kid is a 1927 silent film which tells the story of a boxer who scoffs at fighting outside the ring... particularly for the United States once it enters World War I. Eventually, he is drafted, is shipped overseas, and performs a heroic act, which results in his being severely wounded.', 'The Patent Leather Kid is a 1927 silent film which tells the story of a boxer who scoffs at fighting outside the ring... particularly for the United States once it enters World War I. Eventually, he is drafted, is shipped overseas, and performs a heroic act, which results in his being severely wounded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPdTFhQkGmOa5GrbVeAgsOTsFM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102541'),
