  ('486552170228155973', 'The Path of Excellence', 2023, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Mermoud, Tristan Tortuyaux', 'Salvatore Lista, Anton Likiernik, Frédéric Mermoud', 'Suzanne Jouannet, Marie Colomb, Cyril Metzger, Marilyne Canto, Maud Wyler, Lorenzo Lefèbvre, Antoine Chappey, Alexandre Desrousseaux', null, 'Sophie is a brilliant student. Encouraged by her maths teacher, she leaves the family farm to attend a science preparatory class. Between new encounters, successes and failures, and faced with fierce competition, Sophie realizes that her dream of joining the Polytechnique represents more than an entrance examination but a true challenge of social climbing.', 'Sophie is a brilliant student. Encouraged by her maths teacher, she leaves the family farm to attend a science preparatory class. Between new encounters, successes and failures, and faced with fierce competition, Sophie realizes that her dream of joining the Polytechnique represents more than an entrance examination but a true challenge of social climbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk7dawmAo4AhnuUDlWSA0x4i1xV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989593'),
