  ('24389149188152484', 'The Patience Stone', 2013, 'Drama, War', 'Atiq Rahimi, Thierry Arbogast', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Atiq Rahimi', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Hamid Djavadan, Hassina Burgan, Massi Mrowat, Mohamed Al Maghraoui, Malak Djaham Khazal, Faiz Fazil, Hatim Seddiki', 'R', 'In a war-ridden country, a woman watches over her husband, comatose from a bullet in the neck and abandoned by Jihad companions and brothers. One day, the woman decides to say things to him she could never have done before.', 'In a war-ridden country, a woman watches over her husband, comatose from a bullet in the neck and abandoned by Jihad companions and brothers. One day, the woman decides to say things to him she could never have done before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ed2STYKoR8zLQGBdPZsmf65xsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128158'),
