  ('969108765797406434', 'The Patriot', 2000, 'Drama, History, War, Action', 'Caleb Deschanel, Roland Emmerich, Richard F. Mays', 'Robert Rodat', 'Mel Gibson, Heath Ledger, Joely Richardson, Jason Isaacs, Chris Cooper, Tchéky Karyo, René Auberjonois, Lisa Brenner', 'R', 'After proving himself on the field of battle in the French and Indian War, Benjamin Martin wants nothing more to do with such things, preferring the simple life of a farmer. But when his son Gabriel enlists in the army to defend their new nation, America, against the British, Benjamin reluctantly returns to his old life to protect his son.', 'After proving himself on the field of battle in the French and Indian War, Benjamin Martin wants nothing more to do with such things, preferring the simple life of a farmer. But when his son Gabriel enlists in the army to defend their new nation, America, against the British, Benjamin reluctantly returns to his old life to protect his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWZd815QxUCUcrWQZwUkAp9ljG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2024'),
  ('877970212852126485', 'The Patriot Game', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Arthur MacCaig, Théo Robichet, Arthur MacCaig', null, 'Winnie Marshall', null, 'Recounts Ireland''s history from British colonization to the territory''s division in 1922, then from 1968 details a decade of events through images and eyewitness accounts of killings and such massacres as the infamous "Bloody Sunday" as the IRA argues their cause.', 'Recounts Ireland''s history from British colonization to the territory''s division in 1922, then from 1968 details a decade of events through images and eyewitness accounts of killings and such massacres as the infamous "Bloody Sunday" as the IRA argues their cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KX4eLoxYpo9OTktWZgDlXmVb9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218994'),
