  ('274663304520521935', 'The Peace Killers', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Douglas Schwartz', null, 'Clint Ritchie, Jess Walton, Paul Prokop, Michael Ontkean, Lavelle Roby, Nino Candido, Jon Hill, Gary Morgan', 'R', 'Siblings Kristy and Jeffrey are buying supplies at a remote desert gas station when some members of a biker gang come cruising in. The bikers recognize Kristy, who used to be the main squeeze of the gang''s leader before she ran away. The pair get away, but the bikers find out that they''re living in a nearby commune, and start making their battle plans to bring Kristy back.', 'Siblings Kristy and Jeffrey are buying supplies at a remote desert gas station when some members of a biker gang come cruising in. The bikers recognize Kristy, who used to be the main squeeze of the gang''s leader before she ran away. The pair get away, but the bikers find out that they''re living in a nearby commune, and start making their battle plans to bring Kristy back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQoWwAJGbCQ0FT6DAgqsHhqbeZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94055'),
  ('402860749780336894', 'The Peacekeeper', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Frédéric Forestier', 'Robert Geoffrion, Stewart Harding', 'Dolph Lundgren, Roy Scheider, Michael Sarrazin, Montel Williams, Christopher Heyerdahl, Allen Altman, Martin Neufeld, Monika Schnarre', null, 'When a terrorist group steals the US President''s personal communications computer for launching the US arsenal in case of war, only a heroic Major has the key to prevent a Presidential assassination or a nuclear holocaust.', 'When a terrorist group steals the US President''s personal communications computer for launching the US arsenal in case of war, only a heroic Major has the key to prevent a Presidential assassination or a nuclear holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QBjzPscdNshlskkzw2fDXfLC1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27719'),
  ('973054068268812783', 'The Peacemaker', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mimi Leder, Dietrich Lohmann, Ivan Bartling', 'Kevin Bernhardt', 'George Clooney, Nicole Kidman, Marcel Iureș, Aleksandr Baluev, Rene Medvešek, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Goran Višnjić, Tamara Tunie', 'R', 'When a train carrying atomic warheads mysteriously crashes in the former Soviet Union, a nuclear specialist discovers the accident is really part of a plot to cover up the theft of the weapons. Assigned to help her recover the missing bombs is a crack Special Forces Colonel.', 'When a train carrying atomic warheads mysteriously crashes in the former Soviet Union, a nuclear specialist discovers the accident is really part of a plot to cover up the theft of the weapons. Assigned to help her recover the missing bombs is a crack Special Forces Colonel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hc3p6pvIrfO4AmrVLb6qTviOwW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6623'),
  ('974331285099916912', 'The Peach Thief', 1964, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Vulo Radev, Todor Stoyanov', 'Vulo Radev', 'Nevena Kokanova, Rade Marković, Mikhail Mikhaylov, Vasil Vachev, Naum Shopov, Ivan Bratanov, Georgi Georgiev, Ivan Manov', null, 'The wife of a Bulgarian POW camp''s warden falls in love with a Serbian prisoner at the end of World War I.', 'The wife of a Bulgarian POW camp''s warden falls in love with a Serbian prisoner at the end of World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maySiiLihlnl622Bu4mBlZ42oa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109379'),
  ('722412532456188769', 'The Peachy Cobbler', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'A poor cobbler feeds his last crust of bread to some birds that are really elves, who show their gratitude by finishing all his work while he sleeps.', 'A poor cobbler feeds his last crust of bread to some birds that are really elves, who show their gratitude by finishing all his work while he sleeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9OAWlq4GYLI3LoxxwDjOZhtptd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87212'),
  ('879684071221480586', 'The Peacock', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matthias Schellenberg, Philipp Pfeiffer, Lutz Heineking', 'Sönke Andresen, Lutz Heineking, Christoph Mathieu', 'Lavinia Wilson, Svenja Jung, Serkan Kaya, Jürgen Vogel, David Kross, Tom Schilling, Annette Frier, Philip Jackson', null, 'When investment banker Linda Bachmann and her team arrive at Lord and Lady Macintosh''s country estate, the signs are not good for a relaxing weekend in Scotland: the annual balance sheet is lousy, colleagues are suspicious of themselves and their boss, and it works the rumor that soon a compliance employee will restructure the team. To top it all off, the property is not very comfortable, cook Helen''s skills cannot hide that, and the methods of the young seminar leader Rebecca also seem rather questionable. When first the Lord''s favorite peacock and then the Lady''s favorite goose disappear, further arguments and chaos are inevitable. And finally it starts to snow...', 'When investment banker Linda Bachmann and her team arrive at Lord and Lady Macintosh''s country estate, the signs are not good for a relaxing weekend in Scotland: the annual balance sheet is lousy, colleagues are suspicious of themselves and their boss, and it works the rumor that soon a compliance employee will restructure the team. To top it all off, the property is not very comfortable, cook Helen''s skills cannot hide that, and the methods of the young seminar leader Rebecca also seem rather questionable. When first the Lord''s favorite peacock and then the Lady''s favorite goose disappear, further arguments and chaos are inevitable. And finally it starts to snow...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19mX51SCXlLSctngtty4GXFI8zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073045'),
  ('370641102786154352', 'The Peacock King', 1988, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Lam Nai-Choi, Takashi Miike, Kwan Chi-Kan', 'Frank Kong Heung-Sang, Shirley Woo Suet-Lai, Edward Tang', 'Yuen Biao, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee, Pauline Wong, Hiroshi Mikami, Eddy Ko Hung, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Narumi Yasuda, Ken Ogata', null, 'Coerced by the evil Witch Raga, Ashura, the Hell Virgin, attempts to unlock the four Earth holes that lead to the Gates of Hell. Together, Raga aims to control the Earth. However, two monks skilful in magical powers set off on a journey to the cities to obstruct Ashura from unlocking the gates and stop Raga. Otherwise, not only will control of the Earth be at stake, but the King of Hell will resurrect and darkness will overcome the world.', 'Coerced by the evil Witch Raga, Ashura, the Hell Virgin, attempts to unlock the four Earth holes that lead to the Gates of Hell. Together, Raga aims to control the Earth. However, two monks skilful in magical powers set off on a journey to the cities to obstruct Ashura from unlocking the gates and stop Raga. Otherwise, not only will control of the Earth be at stake, but the King of Hell will resurrect and darkness will overcome the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwA3VBmandmI4c0Z2BdVCalvo5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80640'),
  ('721165970813020887', 'The Peanut Butter Falcon', 2019, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Nilson, Nigel Bluck, Michael Schwartz', 'Tyler Nilson, Michael Schwartz', 'Shia LaBeouf, Zack Gottsagen, Dakota Johnson, Thomas Haden Church, John Hawkes, Bruce Dern, Jon Bernthal, Yelawolf', 'PG-13', 'A down-on-his-luck crab fisherman embarks on a journey to get a young man with Down syndrome to a professional wrestling school in rural North Carolina and away from the retirement home where he’s lived for the past two and a half years.', 'A down-on-his-luck crab fisherman embarks on a journey to get a young man with Down syndrome to a professional wrestling school in rural North Carolina and away from the retirement home where he’s lived for the past two and a half years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyQcRGvdW3VtxHR4fSDgPOePEip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463257'),
  ('1032936043861165463', 'The Peanut Butter Solution', 1985, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Michael Rubbo, Thomas Vámos', 'Andrée Pelletier, Vojtěch Jasný, Louise Pelletier', 'Mathew Mackay, Helen Hughes, Michel Maillot, Edgar Fruitier, Michael Hogan, Harry Hill, Alison Darcy, Siluck Saysanasy', 'PG', 'Peanut butter is the secret ingredient for magic potions made by two friendly ghosts. Eleven-year-old Michael loses all of his hair when he gets a fright and uses the potion to get his hair back, but too much peanut butter causes things to get a bit hairy.', 'Peanut butter is the secret ingredient for magic potions made by two friendly ghosts. Eleven-year-old Michael loses all of his hair when he gets a fright and uses the potion to get his hair back, but too much peanut butter causes things to get a bit hairy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2DgMuccpBd5VFQA87JSMeaXw7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19425'),
  ('509773588824537244', 'The Peanuts Movie', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Steve Martino, Renato Falcão, Christian Haniszewski', 'Craig Schulz, Cornelius Uliano, Bryan Schulz', 'Noah Schnapp, Bill Melendez, Marleik ''Mar Mar'' Walker, Alex Garfin, Hadley Belle Miller, Rebecca Bloom, Anastasia Bredikhina, Venus Schultheis', 'G', 'Snoopy embarks upon his greatest mission as he and his team take to the skies to pursue their arch-nemesis, while his best pal Charlie Brown begins his own epic quest.', 'Snoopy embarks upon his greatest mission as he and his team take to the skies to pursue their arch-nemesis, while his best pal Charlie Brown begins his own epic quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiwdwnl7RFs1vcBanOKr13ye3wE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227973'),
  ('1037398336920366881', 'The Pear Tree', 1998, 'Romance, Drama', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Mahmoud Kalari, Ebrahim Sheibani', 'Dariush Mehrjui', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Homayoun Ershadi, Mohammad Reza Shaban-Noori, Nematollah Gorji, Sasan Bagherpour, Jafar Bozorgi, Shaghayegh Farahani, Aram Ghasemy', 'PG-13', 'Mahmoud is suffering from writer''s block and he is unable to continue the book he is currently working upon. He decides to take a break from his routine life and plans to visit his family''s rural estate that is situated at north of Tehran. He also intends to complete his book in this visit. While at the estate, Mahmoud''s attention is brought to the old Pear Tree that is situated behind the estate by the old gardener of the estate. Seeing the Pear Tree, Mahmoud thinks about his past - his infatuation towards his 14-year-old female cousin known only as M, his adolescent dreams, how that changed over the years. The rest of the film chronicles thoughts of Mahmoud and his past.', 'Mahmoud is suffering from writer''s block and he is unable to continue the book he is currently working upon. He decides to take a break from his routine life and plans to visit his family''s rural estate that is situated at north of Tehran. He also intends to complete his book in this visit. While at the estate, Mahmoud''s attention is brought to the old Pear Tree that is situated behind the estate by the old gardener of the estate. Seeing the Pear Tree, Mahmoud thinks about his past - his infatuation towards his 14-year-old female cousin known only as M, his adolescent dreams, how that changed over the years. The rest of the film chronicles thoughts of Mahmoud and his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiSxasAeSsrk1j8XblohOFl5u6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165911'),
  ('509751250169269707', 'The Pearl', 1929, 'Fantasy', 'Henri d''Ursel, Marc Bujard', 'Georges Hugnet', 'Georges Hugnet, Kissa Kouprine, Renee Savoye, Mary Stutz', null, 'A silent, surreal short involving a man buying a pearl necklace. He meets a woman who also desires the necklace.', 'A silent, surreal short involving a man buying a pearl necklace. He meets a woman who also desires the necklace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87NL9KPhGiekvoqXU7ddzO2bLNM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149952'),
  ('1113224468925117956', 'The Pearl', 1947, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Emilio Fernández, Ignacio Villareal, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Emilio Fernández, Jack Wagner, John Steinbeck', 'Pedro Armendáriz, María Elena Marqués, Fernando Wagner, Gilberto González, Charles Rooner, Juan García, Alfonso Bedoya, Raúl Lechuga', null, 'Fisherman Quino and his wife Juana are very poor and desperate because the town''s foreign doctor refuses to treat their son Coyotito, who has been bitten by a scorpion. When Quino unexpectedly finds a magnificent pearl in the sea, Juana senses that the discovery will only bring them misfortune and tries to convince her husband to return it to the sea.', 'Fisherman Quino and his wife Juana are very poor and desperate because the town''s foreign doctor refuses to treat their son Coyotito, who has been bitten by a scorpion. When Quino unexpectedly finds a magnificent pearl in the sea, Juana senses that the discovery will only bring them misfortune and tries to convince her husband to return it to the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWnAJPPrsyxZY7mQY0SVyAb90na.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43459'),
  ('924740898150606315', 'The Pearl Button', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Nicolás Lasnibat, Patricio Guzmán, Katell Djian', 'Patricio Guzmán', 'Patricio Guzmán, Martín G. Calderón, Gabriela Paterito, Gabriel Salazar, Claudio Mercado, Raúl Zurita, Cristina Calderón, Adil Brkovic', 'NR', 'The ocean contains the history of all humanity. The sea holds all the voices of the earth and those that come from outer space. Water receives impetus from the stars and transmits it to living creatures. Water, the longest border in Chile, also holds the secret of two mysterious buttons which were found on its ocean floor. Chile, with its 2,670 miles of coastline and the largest archipelago in the world, presents a supernatural landscape. In it are volcanoes, mountains and glaciers. In it are the voices of the Patagonian Indigenous people, the first English sailors and also those of its political prisoners. Some say that water has memory. This film shows that it also has a voice.', 'The ocean contains the history of all humanity. The sea holds all the voices of the earth and those that come from outer space. Water receives impetus from the stars and transmits it to living creatures. Water, the longest border in Chile, also holds the secret of two mysterious buttons which were found on its ocean floor. Chile, with its 2,670 miles of coastline and the largest archipelago in the world, presents a supernatural landscape. In it are volcanoes, mountains and glaciers. In it are the voices of the Patagonian Indigenous people, the first English sailors and also those of its political prisoners. Some say that water has memory. This film shows that it also has a voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0Vwz4s8Uhm2M9QhA95oh307Mke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319994'),
  ('881845893120801710', 'The Pearl of Death', 1944, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Virgil Miller, Roy William Neill, Bernard B. Brown', 'Bertram Millhauser', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Dennis Hoey, Evelyn Ankers, Miles Mander, Ian Wolfe, Charles Francis, Holmes Herbert', null, 'The famous Borgia Pearl, a valuable gem with a history of bringing murder and misfortune to its owner since the days of the Borgias, is brought to London, thanks in part to Sherlock Holmes. But before long the jewel is stolen, due to an error on Holmes'' part, and shortly thereafter, a series of horrible murders begin, the murderer leaving his victims with their spines snapped and surrounded by a mass of smashed china.', 'The famous Borgia Pearl, a valuable gem with a history of bringing murder and misfortune to its owner since the days of the Borgias, is brought to London, thanks in part to Sherlock Holmes. But before long the jewel is stolen, due to an error on Holmes'' part, and shortly thereafter, a series of horrible murders begin, the murderer leaving his victims with their spines snapped and surrounded by a mass of smashed china.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36crcUCyyKZritifPJNlXMfsp9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33421'),
  ('527457573490673508', 'The Pearls of the Crown', 1937, 'Comedy, History', 'Sacha Guitry, Jules Kruger', 'Christian-Jaque, Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Jacqueline Delubac, Lyn Harding, Renée Saint-Cyr, Enrico Glori, Ernete Zacconi, Barbara Shaw, Marguerite Moreno', null, 'The story of the seven pearls of the English Crown, from Henry VIII to 1937 – three of them missing.', 'The story of the seven pearls of the English Crown, from Henry VIII to 1937 – three of them missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNVbuQcFHX1Kf77fVwiYsQ6phap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70090'),
  ('464352772211851722', 'The Peasant Women of Ryazan', 1927, 'Drama', 'Ivan Pravov, Olga Preobrazhenskaya, Konstantin Kuznetsov', 'Olga Vishnevskaya, Boris Altshuler', 'Kuzma Yastrebetsky, Olga Narbekova, Elena Maksimova, Georgy Bobynin, Emma Tsesarskaya, Raisa Puzhnaya, Ivan Savelyev, Gulya Korolyova', null, 'The picture compares the fate of two heroines Anna and her lively and energetic sister-in-law Vasilisa, who openly defies the old way of life.', 'The picture compares the fate of two heroines Anna and her lively and energetic sister-in-law Vasilisa, who openly defies the old way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5oi5eYXSB86nAEW4z3WcKe3Hfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189921'),
  ('174201534257374429', 'The Peasants', 2023, 'Animation, History, Drama', 'Kacper Kowalski, Julian Tałandziewicz, Ewa Brodzka', 'DK Welchman, Hugh Welchman', 'Kamila Urzędowska, Robert Gulaczyk, Mirosław Baka, Sonia Mietielica, Ewa Kasprzyk, Cezary Łukaszewicz, Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Sonia Bohosiewicz', 'R', 'Peasant girl Jagna is forced to marry the much older, wealthy farmer Boryna, despite her love for his son Antek. With time, Jagna becomes the object of envy and disdain with the villagers and she must fight to preserve her independence.', 'Peasant girl Jagna is forced to marry the much older, wealthy farmer Boryna, despite her love for his son Antek. With time, Jagna becomes the object of envy and disdain with the villagers and she must fight to preserve her independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ATsQJx6SnG1EQgmbm3NNeUzwmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734002'),
  ('191528969688620714', 'The Pebble and the Penguin', 1995, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Don Bluth, Gary Goldman', 'Rachel Koretsky, Steven Whitestone', 'Martin Short, Annie Golden, Jim Belushi, Tim Curry, Alissa King, Stevie Vallance, Will Ryan, Neil Ross', 'G', 'A bashful bachelor penguin named Hubie, who''s partial to a pretty female named Marina. Ancient penguin ritual dictates that males present a pebble to their intended, then mate for life. Hubie finds a spiffy stone, but before he can bestow it on Marina, dastardly rival Drake tosses him into the churning sea, and Hubie gets swept away.', 'A bashful bachelor penguin named Hubie, who''s partial to a pretty female named Marina. Ancient penguin ritual dictates that males present a pebble to their intended, then mate for life. Hubie finds a spiffy stone, but before he can bestow it on Marina, dastardly rival Drake tosses him into the churning sea, and Hubie gets swept away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWi36nNbyMw51yGN0tTSOrOLu6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54648'),
  ('817678047946788459', 'The Peddler', 1987, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf, Ali Reza Zarrindast, Homayoun Payvar', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Zohreh Sarmadi, Esmaeel Soltaniyan, Mohammad Talaie, Somayyeh Ebrahimi, Morteza Zarrabi, Mahmoud Basiri, Davoud Ghanbari, Behzad Behzadpour', null, 'The movie consists of three episodes that explore the lives of poor and desperate in Iran. In episode one, a very poor couple with many crippled children abandon their newly born baby in hopes that it will have a better future. In the second episode, a mentally impaired and isolated young man tries to take care of his senile mother who is almost dead. In the third episode, a cowardly and desperate peddler tries to escape from his boss.', 'The movie consists of three episodes that explore the lives of poor and desperate in Iran. In episode one, a very poor couple with many crippled children abandon their newly born baby in hopes that it will have a better future. In the second episode, a mentally impaired and isolated young man tries to take care of his senile mother who is almost dead. In the third episode, a cowardly and desperate peddler tries to escape from his boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iomSPAfq7LxPELCLeeBKlBYsmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200021'),
  ('565922858561896236', 'The Peddler and the Lady', 1943, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mario Bonnard, Gastone Bartolucci, Giuseppe Aldo Rossi', 'Mario Bonnard', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Anna Magnani, Peppino De Filippo, Caterina Boratto, Olga Solbelli, Rina Franchetti, Saro Urzì, Cristiano Cristiani', null, 'Peppino, a fishmonger on Campo de'' Fiori, a famous Roman marketplace, works alongside Elide, a greengrocer, who has a soft spot for him, despite the fact they argue all day long... But neither Peppino, nor his friend Aurelio, the barber, are interested in getting married. Until he meets the beautiful Elsa...', 'Peppino, a fishmonger on Campo de'' Fiori, a famous Roman marketplace, works alongside Elide, a greengrocer, who has a soft spot for him, despite the fact they argue all day long... But neither Peppino, nor his friend Aurelio, the barber, are interested in getting married. Until he meets the beautiful Elsa...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozZYNKyS3gfwnXfUwofR64VbnL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143085'),
  ('204717857022398241', 'The Pee Wee 3D: The Winter That Changed My Life', 2012, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Éric Tessier, Bernard Couture', 'Martin Bouchard, Emmanuelle Joly, Jean Sébastien Poirier', 'Antoine Olivier Pilon, Alice Morel-Michaud, Claude Legault, Édith Cochrane, Normand Daneau, Guy Nadon, Sophie Prégent, Julie Le Breton', null, 'When his wife dies, Carl offers his only son, Janeau, 12, a fresh start. They move to Mont Saint-Hilaire, where Janeau makes friends with Julie, a talented Pee-Wee hockey goalie determined to compete in the annual World Tournament held in Quebec. She convinces Janeau to join the team, but he has a hard time being accepted by the rest of the players, including Joey, the star player who has to endure constant pressure from his father.', 'When his wife dies, Carl offers his only son, Janeau, 12, a fresh start. They move to Mont Saint-Hilaire, where Janeau makes friends with Julie, a talented Pee-Wee hockey goalie determined to compete in the annual World Tournament held in Quebec. She convinces Janeau to join the team, but he has a hard time being accepted by the rest of the players, including Joey, the star player who has to endure constant pressure from his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVYR2C6HvpN1VhBqihXolKPKCCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185935'),
  ('824365360704591021', 'The Pee-wee Herman Show', 1981, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Marty Callner, Paul Reubens, Terry Donohue', 'Phil Hartman, Edie McClurg, Paul Reubens', 'Paul Reubens, Phil Hartman, Lynne Marie Stewart, John Paragon, Edie McClurg, John Moody, Tito Larriva, Nicole Panter', null, 'The original adult-oriented version of what would eventually become an award-winning children''s classic. This version of the show features Pee-wee''s playhouse and many of the characters of the later series, but with irreverent overtones and jokes including ''mirror shoes'' and others.', 'The original adult-oriented version of what would eventually become an award-winning children''s classic. This version of the show features Pee-wee''s playhouse and many of the characters of the later series, but with irreverent overtones and jokes including ''mirror shoes'' and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwFd0JGrDTjEjD9U6ddKYVkBy5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20363'),
  ('569088200778485191', 'The Peeping', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Romance', 'Marco Mak Chi-Sin, Jimmy Kwok Chun-Ming', 'Wong Jing', 'Daniel Wu, Grace Lam Nga-Si, Teresa Mak Ka-Kei, Jenny Yam Kong-Sau, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Samuel Leung Cheuk-Moon, Gobby Wong Ga-Ying, Luk Yu-Cheung', null, 'Private detective Calvin is hired to tape the sex life of a female politician Kwai Fung Ming, but falls for her instead. He decides to help her counter-attack Law Sau Nam, who is the mastermind to discredit Kwai. Unexpectedly, Law is only one of the tools in this war.', 'Private detective Calvin is hired to tape the sex life of a female politician Kwai Fung Ming, but falls for her instead. He decides to help her counter-attack Law Sau Nam, who is the mastermind to discredit Kwai. Unexpectedly, Law is only one of the tools in this war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hie0r3htiwNnb1QQS0dMqFrRRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380784'),
  ('31708034563871559', 'The Peeping Tom', 1997, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ivan Lai Kai-Ming, Lee Bing-Gwong, Cheung Man-Po', 'Sam Leong Tak-Sam', 'Jade Leung Tsang, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Miho Nomoto, Gary Mak Wing-Lun, Lo Hung, Lee Kin-Yan, Rachel Tucker', null, 'Roy Chen Chih Lai is a serial rapist and murderer with a leg fetish, and cuts off his victims'' legs as trophies after he''s through with them. One day at a bank robbery shootout, he catches police woman Cheng Hsuen on camera, and chooses her to be his next victim. He begins to stalk her and enter her personal life, even waiting for her inside her home. He notices her sister, Kelly, as well (who is also a cop), and her boyfriend, Ken. After he kidnaps and rapes Kelly, Cheng decides to lure the madman by using herself as bait, and bring justice to the situation.', 'Roy Chen Chih Lai is a serial rapist and murderer with a leg fetish, and cuts off his victims'' legs as trophies after he''s through with them. One day at a bank robbery shootout, he catches police woman Cheng Hsuen on camera, and chooses her to be his next victim. He begins to stalk her and enter her personal life, even waiting for her inside her home. He notices her sister, Kelly, as well (who is also a cop), and her boyfriend, Ken. After he kidnaps and rapes Kelly, Cheng decides to lure the madman by using herself as bait, and bring justice to the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTlcWwmUt4iNsu7PKz8Y3jWnLtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105819'),
  ('937523297634659622', 'The Pelican and the Snipe', 1944, 'Animation', 'Hamilton Luske', null, 'Sterling Holloway', 'NR', 'A snipe that lives with a pelican in a lighthouse must continually keep his pelican friend from harm when he flies in his sleep.', 'A snipe that lives with a pelican in a lighthouse must continually keep his pelican friend from harm when he flies in his sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCp4647kgNVj7OPi64afNeOPCq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54080'),
  ('136893145616856536', 'The Pelican Brief', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Alan J. Pakula, Stephen Goldblatt, Trey Batchelor', 'Alan J. Pakula', 'Julia Roberts, Denzel Washington, Sam Shepard, John Heard, Tony Goldwyn, James B. Sikking, William Atherton, Robert Culp', 'PG-13', 'A law student''s theory about the recent deaths of two Supreme Court justices embroils her in a far-reaching web of murder, corruption, and greed.', 'A law student''s theory about the recent deaths of two Supreme Court justices embroils her in a far-reaching web of murder, corruption, and greed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7B1HS0SqfJR1jbeHS6V0ZWdzLXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9944'),
  ('78093383186347197', 'The Penalty', 1920, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Wallace Worsley, Don Short, James Dugan', 'Charles Kenyon, Philip Lonergan', 'Lon Chaney, Charles Clary, Doris Pawn, James Pier Mason, Milton Ross, Ethel Grey Terry, Kenneth Harlan, Claire Adams', 'NR', 'Blizzard, deranged from a childhood operation in which both his legs were needlessly amputated after an accident, becomes a vicious criminal, and eventually mob leader of the San Francisco underworld.', 'Blizzard, deranged from a childhood operation in which both his legs were needlessly amputated after an accident, becomes a vicious criminal, and eventually mob leader of the San Francisco underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ct5XMbwZWv3SzZ01lYM4rQihRmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27509'),
  ('507474714371531154', 'The Penguin Lessons', 2025, 'Drama', 'Peter Cattaneo, Xavi Giménez, Laia Vidal', 'Jeff Pope', 'Steve Coogan, Jonathan Pryce, Vivian El Jaber, Björn Gustafsson, Alfonsina Carrocio, David Herrero, Micaela Breque, Tomás Pozzi', 'PG-13', 'In 1976, as Argentina descends into violence and chaos, a world-weary English teacher regains his compassion for others thanks to an unlikely friendship with a penguin.', 'In 1976, as Argentina descends into violence and chaos, a world-weary English teacher regains his compassion for others thanks to an unlikely friendship with a penguin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uz7eucj2EgBLC0KVjkiCbVrvuX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086497'),
  ('743586126806590923', 'The Penguin Pool Murder', 1932, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'George Archainbaud, Henry W. Gerrard, Ray Lissner', 'Willis Goldbeck', 'Edna May Oliver, James Gleason, Robert Armstrong, Mae Clarke, Donald Cook, Edgar Kennedy, Clarence Wilson, James Donlan', 'NR', 'New York schoolmarm Hildegarde Withers assists a detective when a body of unscrupulous stockbroker Gerald Parker suddenly appears in the penguin tank at the aquarium.', 'New York schoolmarm Hildegarde Withers assists a detective when a body of unscrupulous stockbroker Gerald Parker suddenly appears in the penguin tank at the aquarium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JsNPCnbNjxYDLh9t1eXgZGnHB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84971'),
  ('770038703097396350', 'The Penitent Thief', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Adam Gregory, Lucas Miles', 'Don E. Willis', 'Kevin Sorbo, James Russo, Major Dodge, Stelio Savante, Krista Bradley, Xiomara Bermudez, Jay Giannone, Charles "Skeeta" Jenkins', null, 'The story of the two unnamed men who were crucified alongside Jesus and how they came to be beside him on the cross that fateful day. Dismas and his brother Jotham, along with Gestas, another young man who will share their fate, suffer tragedy and injustice at the hands of a band of thieves and a ruthless Roman centurion. Theirs is a story of survival against the odds, but they cannot outrun their destiny.', 'The story of the two unnamed men who were crucified alongside Jesus and how they came to be beside him on the cross that fateful day. Dismas and his brother Jotham, along with Gestas, another young man who will share their fate, suffer tragedy and injustice at the hands of a band of thieves and a ruthless Roman centurion. Theirs is a story of survival against the odds, but they cannot outrun their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkUxZ9sFE7tn0NPRILqZVEPZRF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778552'),
  ('1134473063865039648', 'The Penknife', 1992, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Ben Sombogaart, Reinier van Brummelen', 'Sjoerd Kuyper', 'Olivier Tuinier, Adelheid Roosen, Genio de Groot, Verno Romney, Maxim Hartman, Heleen Hummelen, Beppie Melissen, Kees Hulst', null, 'Accidentally still in possession of his best friend''s pocket knife after they move all the way to a different city, a young boy sets out to return it.', 'Accidentally still in possession of his best friend''s pocket knife after they move all the way to a different city, a young boy sets out to return it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RaFJ3DdIv3uJKMvOTq8PjnkusO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48449'),
  ('314824874325189726', 'The Pentagon Papers', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Rod Holcomb, Michael Mayers', 'Jason Horwitch', 'James Spader, Claire Forlani, Paul Giamatti, Alan Arkin, Kenneth Welsh, Maria del Mar, Aaron Ashmore, Jonas Chernick', 'R', 'This compelling political drama is based on the true story of high-ranking Pentagon official Daniel Ellsberg, who, during the Nixon era, strove to preserve American democracy by leaking top-secret documents to the New York Times and Washington Post. The documents in question would eventually become famous as the Pentagon Papers, which revealed the true reasons for U.S. involvement in Vietnam.', 'This compelling political drama is based on the true story of high-ranking Pentagon official Daniel Ellsberg, who, during the Nixon era, strove to preserve American democracy by leaking top-secret documents to the New York Times and Washington Post. The documents in question would eventually become famous as the Pentagon Papers, which revealed the true reasons for U.S. involvement in Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2npPf6898vk78b20DPpcglyNcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40113'),
  ('534906277796559277', 'The Pentagon UFO Tapes', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Justin Jordan', null, 'Luis Elizondo, Tim Burchett, Nancy Mace', null, 'The truth takes flight. For decades, the U.S. military denied the truth. Now, declassified footage reveals an unidentified, craft-defying explanation. This film uncovers America’s UFO secrets from Roswell to the latest Pentagon leaks. Declassified military footage. Unexplained aerial encounters. From Roswell to the Pentagon’s shocking leaks, this gripping doc exposes decades of UFO secrets the government tried to hide.', 'The truth takes flight. For decades, the U.S. military denied the truth. Now, declassified footage reveals an unidentified, craft-defying explanation. This film uncovers America’s UFO secrets from Roswell to the latest Pentagon leaks. Declassified military footage. Unexplained aerial encounters. From Roswell to the Pentagon’s shocking leaks, this gripping doc exposes decades of UFO secrets the government tried to hide.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvtfsoLABhtaZiPXmAYNQ3ZqFciJ.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-pentagon-ufo-tapes'),
  ('1125547629619755587', 'The Pentagon Wars', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Richard Benjamin, Robert D. Yeoman, Gary Marcus', null, 'Kelsey Grammer, Cary Elwes, Viola Davis, John C. McGinley, Tom Wright, Clifton Powell, Dewey Weber, Richard Schiff', 'R', 'From the director of “Made In America” and “The Money Pit” comes a hilarious look at one of the most expensive blunders in military history. Over 17 years and almost as many billion dollars have gone into devising the BFV (Bradley Fighting Vehicle). There''s only one problem. . . it doesn''t work. (Spoiler alert: 25 years later ... it does work.)', 'From the director of “Made In America” and “The Money Pit” comes a hilarious look at one of the most expensive blunders in military history. Over 17 years and almost as many billion dollars have gone into devising the BFV (Bradley Fighting Vehicle). There''s only one problem. . . it doesn''t work. (Spoiler alert: 25 years later ... it does work.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPe6EtkyONh6JuekhPZ56jRWyVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14439'),
  ('589091597226758072', 'The Penultimate', 1981, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Luc Besson, Carlo Varini', 'Pierre Jolivet, Luc Besson', 'Pierre Jolivet, Jean Reno, Fabrice Roche', null, 'A man wanders through a wrecked, dystopian city, finding violence everywhere he turns.', 'A man wanders through a wrecked, dystopian city, finding violence everywhere he turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaAOxn7wMaNVid4GWanxTKRkjAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144692'),
  ('897216143636333042', 'The People', 1972, 'Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'John Korty, Edward Rosson', 'James M. Miller', 'Kim Darby, William Shatner, Diane Varsi, Dan O''Herlihy, Laurie Walters, Johanna Baer, Chris Valentine, Chris Valentine', null, 'A young woman is assigned to teach school in a secluded valley whose inhabitants appear stern, secretive and anti-pleasure. Following two children who disappear to play in the woods, she finds that this is actually a community of extraterrestrials with mild paranormal powers who are attempting to repress and deny their heritage for fear of arousing prejudice and hatred in their human neighbors. Based on a series of novels by the late Zenna Henderson.', 'A young woman is assigned to teach school in a secluded valley whose inhabitants appear stern, secretive and anti-pleasure. Following two children who disappear to play in the woods, she finds that this is actually a community of extraterrestrials with mild paranormal powers who are attempting to repress and deny their heritage for fear of arousing prejudice and hatred in their human neighbors. Based on a series of novels by the late Zenna Henderson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oF9i5KHSoNL8PAutzcUlOoLGNvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252965'),
  ('1102928958054098832', 'The People Across the Lake', 1988, 'Horror, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Richard Leiterman, Arthur Allan Seidelman, Peter Dashkewytch', null, 'Valerie Harper, Gerald McRaney, Barry Corbin, Tammy Lauren, Daryl Anderson, Jeff Kizer, Gary Bisig, Gregory Togel', null, 'In an effort to get away from the city and all its crime, Chuck Yoman and his family move to a big old house in a peaceful lakeside town. The discovery of a mutilated corpse in the lake and another body in the woods, however, suggests that the Yomans would have been safer if they had stayed put...', 'In an effort to get away from the city and all its crime, Chuck Yoman and his family move to a big old house in a peaceful lakeside town. The discovery of a mutilated corpse in the lake and another body in the woods, however, suggests that the Yomans would have been safer if they had stayed put...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5WMQC9pZbou2aeF2z6fzFnUuCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223269'),
