  ('1136616819081325104', 'The People at Universal', 1991, 'Comedy, Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Felipe Aljure, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Guillermo Calle, Felipe Aljure, Manuel Arias', 'Álvaro Rodríguez, Robinson Díaz, Jennifer Steffens, Ana Marí­a Aristizabal, Ramon Agirre, Aizpea Goenaga, Juana Mendiola, César Badillo', null, 'Former Sergeant Diogenes Hernandez owns the Universal, a precarious detective agency private in the Centre of Bogotá, which is based in the same apartment where he and his wife Fabiola inhabit. His nephew, Clemente Fernández, who works at the Agency, maintains a romance with Fabiola, without trying to hurt the feelings of his uncle, but driven by the need to alleviate their empty urban and anonymous man.', 'Former Sergeant Diogenes Hernandez owns the Universal, a precarious detective agency private in the Centre of Bogotá, which is based in the same apartment where he and his wife Fabiola inhabit. His nephew, Clemente Fernández, who works at the Agency, maintains a romance with Fabiola, without trying to hurt the feelings of his uncle, but driven by the need to alleviate their empty urban and anonymous man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wzPlydLfU3PV9Jnbw82X9PfIs5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116225'),
  ('1111569025989331280', 'The People in the Walls', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Michael Crum', 'Gerald Crum', 'Natalia Santacoloma, Donny Boaz, Cole Crum, McKenna Smith, Aleena Heritage, Cassi Colvin, Shanon Snedden, Mark Anthony Baca', null, 'A viral ritual allows three kids to conjure people from the walls as they must now try to put them back before it is too late.', 'A viral ritual allows three kids to conjure people from the walls as they must now try to put them back before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NyL99rcDr5S4qQ8FXDwWiLujEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1328402'),
  ('116840906844972538', 'The People Next Door', 1970, 'Drama', 'Gordon Willis, David Greene, Terence A. Donnelly', 'J.P. Miller', 'Eli Wallach, Julie Harris, Deborah Winters, Cloris Leachman, Hal Holbrook, Nehemiah Persoff, Mike Kellin, Stephen McHattie', 'R', 'A married couple struggle with the realities of their imperfect marriage as they fight to save and rehabilitate their teenage daughter from a life of drug addiction and ultimate committal to a mental ward.', 'A married couple struggle with the realities of their imperfect marriage as they fight to save and rehabilitate their teenage daughter from a life of drug addiction and ultimate committal to a mental ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJEi5XnNH5n3EW2hyQMrk1SbxR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141623'),
  ('209386731658599387', 'The People That Time Forgot', 1977, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Connor, Bryan Coates, Peter Allwork', 'Patrick Tilley', 'Patrick Wayne, Doug McClure, Sarah Douglas, Dana Gillespie, Thorley Walters, Shane Rimmer, Tony Britton, John Hallam', 'PG', 'Major Ben McBride organizes a mission to the Antarctic wastes to search for his friend who has been missing in the region for several years. McBride''s party find themselves in a world populated by primitive warriors and terrifying prehistoric creatures, all of whom they must evade in order to get back safely', 'Major Ben McBride organizes a mission to the Antarctic wastes to search for his friend who has been missing in the region for several years. McBride''s party find themselves in a world populated by primitive warriors and terrifying prehistoric creatures, all of whom they must evade in order to get back safely', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IIrlm2CjGCY5UV94lMCNb9HC94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27591'),
  ('351436332496192666', 'The People Under the Stairs', 1991, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Wes Craven, Sandi Sissel', 'Wes Craven', 'Brandon Quintin Adams, Everett McGill, Wendy Robie, A. J. Langer, Ving Rhames, Sean Whalen, Bill Cobbs, Kelly Jo Minter', 'R', 'Trapped inside a fortified home owned by a mysterious couple, a young boy quickly learns the true nature of the homicidal inhabitants, and secret creatures hidden deep within the walls.', 'Trapped inside a fortified home owned by a mysterious couple, a young boy quickly learns the true nature of the homicidal inhabitants, and secret creatures hidden deep within the walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OWDBVmGdM7HwaDtbDsdn6Rlzqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13122'),
  ('120748068708618968', 'The People Upstairs', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cesc Gay, Andreu Rebés, Mireia Juárez', 'Cesc Gay', 'Javier Cámara, Belén Cuesta, Alberto San Juan, Griselda Siciliani', null, 'Julio and Ana have been together for more than fifteen years. They have become a couple who no longer look at nor touch one another, and who have made daily fighting the essence of their relationship. This evening, Ana has invited their upstairs neighbors to come round, Salva and Laura, a couple younger than them, pleasant and friendly, but whose noises are now an annoyance for Julio and Ana... or perhaps a stimulus? The upstairs neighbors will make them an unusual and surprising proposal which will turn the evening into an exaggerated and cathartic experience for all four.', 'Julio and Ana have been together for more than fifteen years. They have become a couple who no longer look at nor touch one another, and who have made daily fighting the essence of their relationship. This evening, Ana has invited their upstairs neighbors to come round, Salva and Laura, a couple younger than them, pleasant and friendly, but whose noises are now an annoyance for Julio and Ana... or perhaps a stimulus? The upstairs neighbors will make them an unusual and surprising proposal which will turn the evening into an exaggerated and cathartic experience for all four.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukhbDB4hvCbx3HBsEVL65w9NP2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717675'),
  ('595604794973393106', 'The People vs. Fritz Bauer', 2015, 'History, Drama, Mystery', 'Lars Kraume, Jens Harant', 'Lars Kraume, Olivier Guez', 'Burghart Klaußner, Ronald Zehrfeld, Sebastian Blomberg, Jörg Schüttauf, Lilith Stangenberg, Laura Tonke, Götz Schubert, Cornelia Gröschel', null, 'It is the late 1950s. Flourishing under the economic miracle, Germany grows increasingly apathetic about confronting the horrors of its recent past. Nevertheless, Fritz Bauer doggedly devotes his energies to bringing the Third Reich to justice. One day Bauer receives a letter from Argentina, written by a man who is certain that his daughter is dating the son of Adolph Eichmann. Excited by the promising lead, and mistrustful of a corrupt judiciary system where Nazis still lurk, Bauer journeys to Jerusalem to seek alliance with Mossad, the Israeli secret service. To do so is treason — yet committing treason is the only way Bauer can serve his country.', 'It is the late 1950s. Flourishing under the economic miracle, Germany grows increasingly apathetic about confronting the horrors of its recent past. Nevertheless, Fritz Bauer doggedly devotes his energies to bringing the Third Reich to justice. One day Bauer receives a letter from Argentina, written by a man who is certain that his daughter is dating the son of Adolph Eichmann. Excited by the promising lead, and mistrustful of a corrupt judiciary system where Nazis still lurk, Bauer journeys to Jerusalem to seek alliance with Mossad, the Israeli secret service. To do so is treason — yet committing treason is the only way Bauer can serve his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jufmPUcwJYCRJe2q3pgAP0IavhC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355065'),
  ('766422934642116124', 'The People vs. George Lucas', 2010, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Alexandre O. Philippe', 'Alexandre O. Philippe', 'George Lucas, Mark A. Altman, John Barger, Ahmed Best, David Brin, Matt Cohen, Brian Comerford, Michael Cornacchia', null, 'The passion the original Star Wars trilogy inspires in its fans is unparalleled; but when it comes to George Lucas himself, many have found their ardor has cooled into a complicated love-hate relationship. This hilarious, heartfelt documentary delves deep into Lucas’s cultural legacy, asking all the tough questions. Has Lucas betrayed his masterwork? Should he just have left the original trilogy alone? Is The Phantom Menace so bad it should carry a health warning? Utilizing interviews taken from over 600 hours of footage, and peppered with extraordinary Star Wars and Indiana Jones recreations lovingly immortalized in song, needlepoint, Lego, claymation, puppets and paper-mâché, above all this film asks the question: who truly owns that galaxy far, far away—the man who created it, or the fans who worship it?', 'The passion the original Star Wars trilogy inspires in its fans is unparalleled; but when it comes to George Lucas himself, many have found their ardor has cooled into a complicated love-hate relationship. This hilarious, heartfelt documentary delves deep into Lucas’s cultural legacy, asking all the tough questions. Has Lucas betrayed his masterwork? Should he just have left the original trilogy alone? Is The Phantom Menace so bad it should carry a health warning? Utilizing interviews taken from over 600 hours of footage, and peppered with extraordinary Star Wars and Indiana Jones recreations lovingly immortalized in song, needlepoint, Lego, claymation, puppets and paper-mâché, above all this film asks the question: who truly owns that galaxy far, far away—the man who created it, or the fans who worship it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vv7roShhYsFSp8xoCtzJYk8zD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75311'),
  ('103773087409393120', 'The People vs. Larry Flynt', 1996, 'Drama', 'Miloš Forman, Philippe Rousselot', 'Scott Alexander, Larry Karaszewski', 'Woody Harrelson, Courtney Love, Edward Norton, Brett Harrelson, Donna Hanover, James Cromwell, Crispin Glover, Vincent Schiavelli', 'R', 'Larry Flynt is the hedonistically obnoxious, but indomitable, publisher of Hustler magazine. The film recounts his struggle to make an honest living publishing his girlie magazine and how it changes into a battle to protect the freedom of speech for all people.', 'Larry Flynt is the hedonistically obnoxious, but indomitable, publisher of Hustler magazine. The film recounts his struggle to make an honest living publishing his girlie magazine and how it changes into a battle to protect the freedom of speech for all people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAgHn7ys6TiVXBDTZ0UBEjinIUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1630'),
  ('35828213810553038', 'The People We Hate at the Wedding', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Adam Morris, Oliver Stapleton, Charlie Vaughan', 'Wendy Molyneux', 'Kristen Bell, Ben Platt, Allison Janney, Cynthia Addai-Robinson, Dustin Milligan, John Macmillan, Isaach de Bankolé, Karan Soni', 'R', 'A dysfunctional family that can''t seem to get along and get it together reluctantly reunites for a family wedding. As their many skeletons are wrenched from the closet, it turns out to be just what this singular family needs to reconnect.', 'A dysfunctional family that can''t seem to get along and get it together reluctantly reunites for a family wedding. As their many skeletons are wrenched from the closet, it turns out to be just what this singular family needs to reconnect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQZKw9jetOInPPdSZgbKFxJALHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802372'),
  ('771535199565131066', 'The People Who Own the Dark', 1976, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'León Klimovsky, Miguel Fernández Mila, Manuel Torres', 'Vicente Aranda, Joaquín Jordá, Gabriel Moreno Burgos', 'Nadiuska, Alberto de Mendoza, Teresa Gimpera, Emiliano Redondo, Julia Saly, Tomás Picó, Diana Polakov, Antonio Mayans', 'R', 'A group of rich businessmen and military officers who are partying in an old castle are spared when a nuclear war ravages the earth. When they venture out into the nearest town to search for food and supplies, they find most of the residents blinded, and soon they discover the existence of a sinister group called The People Who Own The Dark.', 'A group of rich businessmen and military officers who are partying in an old castle are spared when a nuclear war ravages the earth. When they venture out into the nearest town to search for food and supplies, they find most of the residents blinded, and soon they discover the existence of a sinister group called The People Who Own The Dark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozplw0BJabrcnIuTb2G6srNOU6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29876'),
  ('1090746010513046408', 'The People''s Joker', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Nate Cornett, Vera Drew, Joey Lyons', 'Bri LeRose, Vera Drew', 'Vera Drew, Lynn Downey, Kane Distler, Nathan Faustyn, David Liebe Hart, Phil Braun, Griffin Kramer, Christian Calloway', 'NR', 'An aspiring clown grappling with her gender identity combats a fascistic caped crusader.', 'An aspiring clown grappling with her gender identity combats a fascistic caped crusader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80yak1h7YcNpMOsfSbThfwKYKK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808482'),
  ('995219641068372262', 'The Peppercorns and the Curse of the Black King', 2017, 'Family, Adventure, Crime', 'Christian Theede, The Chau Ngo', 'Dirk Ahner', 'Leo Gapp, Lilly Barshy, Marleen Quentin, Ruben Storck, Nino Böhlau, Zoran Pingel, Emilia Flint, Luke Matt Röntgen', null, 'Mia and her partner Benny, along with Mia''s sister, Alicia, will be in charge of solving some puzzling cases that are happening in their city Hamburg. Surrounded by ghosts and mysterious characters this group of friends, accompanied by other young people, follow their clues.', 'Mia and her partner Benny, along with Mia''s sister, Alicia, will be in charge of solving some puzzling cases that are happening in their city Hamburg. Surrounded by ghosts and mysterious characters this group of friends, accompanied by other young people, follow their clues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2fY3FrNgxyVrAziFTRQXuMMqSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434368'),
  ('490597874116008480', 'The Perez Family', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mira Nair, Stuart Dryburgh', 'Robin Swicord', 'Marisa Tomei, Alfred Molina, Anjelica Huston, Chazz Palminteri, Trini Alvarado, Ruben Rabasa, Luis Raúl, Vincent Gallo', 'R', 'In the midst of the Mariel boat lift -- a hurried exodus of refugees from Cuba going to America -- an immigration clerk accidentally presumes that dissident Juan Raul Perez and Dorita Evita Perez are married. United by their last name and a mutual resolve to emigrate, Dorita and Juan agree to play along. But it gets complicated when the two begin falling for each other just as Juan reunites with his wife, Carmela, whom he hasn''t seen in decades.', 'In the midst of the Mariel boat lift -- a hurried exodus of refugees from Cuba going to America -- an immigration clerk accidentally presumes that dissident Juan Raul Perez and Dorita Evita Perez are married. United by their last name and a mutual resolve to emigrate, Dorita and Juan agree to play along. But it gets complicated when the two begin falling for each other just as Juan reunites with his wife, Carmela, whom he hasn''t seen in decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxi3UDHf86kDk5hqJxnpEMzVch2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63020'),
  ('123442840611289325', 'The Perfect Blue', 1998, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Kieron J. Walsh, Zoran Đorđević', 'Nick Collins', 'Philip Glenister, Inday Ba, Michele Austin, Lennie James, Michael Liebman, Katie Carr, Ruth Gemmell, Rupert Vansittart', null, 'When Sunny and Tom are reunited shortly before their respective weddings, the former lovers realize how much they still love each other. The pair must decide whether to turn their backs on the safe and sensible futures they had planned for themselves.', 'When Sunny and Tom are reunited shortly before their respective weddings, the former lovers realize how much they still love each other. The pair must decide whether to turn their backs on the safe and sensible futures they had planned for themselves.', null, 'tmdb:movie:425767'),
  ('1038463648394233030', 'The Perfect Candidate', 2020, 'Drama', 'Haifaa al-Mansour, Patrick Orth', 'Haifaa al-Mansour', 'Mila Alzahrani, Nora Al Awadh, Dae Al Hilali, Khalid Abdulrhim, Shafi Al Harthy, Mohamed Othman, Nojoud Ahmed, Khadeeja Mua''th', null, 'A young Saudi doctor campaigns for a seat on the municipal council, finding confidence as she combats prejudice.', 'A young Saudi doctor campaigns for a seat on the municipal council, finding confidence as she combats prejudice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxHGzOY7SiEnVt5kp5Hjj5ImpK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618214'),
  ('550303580583594391', 'The Perfect Catch', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Tyler Walzak, Jorge Orellana', null, 'Nikki DeLoach, Andrew W. Walker, Lisa Durupt, Chance Hurstfield, Vincent Dangerfield, P. Lynn Johnson, Eric Keenleyside, Brent Fidler', null, 'When Jessica Parker’s former high school boyfriend, superstar baseball player Chase Taynor, returns to town, she finds the inspiration to reinvent her struggling diner… and revisits the past to find something even better for the future.', 'When Jessica Parker’s former high school boyfriend, superstar baseball player Chase Taynor, returns to town, she finds the inspiration to reinvent her struggling diner… and revisits the past to find something even better for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLO64np21v6uKlHSMUGsRDG16II.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450679'),
  ('129467530078430351', 'The Perfect Christmas Present', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Adrian Peng Correia, Blair Hayes', 'Blaine Chiappetta', 'Tara Holt, Sam Page, Ta''Rhonda Jones, Emily Peterson, Phillip Edward Van Lear, Stacia Crawford, Sam Guinan-Nyhart, Dan Brown', 'G', 'Tom Jacobs is Mr Christmas! He''s built an entire business around helping clients find the perfect gift. But what happens when he falls for one lucky recipient?', 'Tom Jacobs is Mr Christmas! He''s built an entire business around helping clients find the perfect gift. But what happens when he falls for one lucky recipient?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bn7xVSndMAO2TMZrSeY61dT7Bb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480638'),
  ('908782333174915890', 'The Perfect Circle', 1997, 'Drama, War', 'Ademir Kenović, Milenko Uherka', 'Pjer Žalica, Ademir Kenović, Abdulah Sidran', 'Mustafa Nadarević, Almedin Leleta, Almir Podgorica, Josip Pejaković, Jasna Diklić, Mirela Lambić, Ljubica Lohajner Žnidarić, Amina Begović', null, 'An alcoholic Bosnian poet sends his wife and daughter away from Sarajevo so they can avoid the troubles there. However, he is soon descended upon by a pair of orphaned brothers. The brothers have escaped a massacre in their own village and have come to the Bosnian capital in search of a long lost Aunt. The poet befriends the boys and together they try to survive the horror of the siege of Sarajevo.', 'An alcoholic Bosnian poet sends his wife and daughter away from Sarajevo so they can avoid the troubles there. However, he is soon descended upon by a pair of orphaned brothers. The brothers have escaped a massacre in their own village and have come to the Bosnian capital in search of a long lost Aunt. The poet befriends the boys and together they try to survive the horror of the siege of Sarajevo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz817P2e8wS7JPIiY5QyKv5myCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49807'),
  ('29538395914277495', 'The Perfect Couple', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kim Jung-woo', 'Hong Yoon-jeong, Dong Hee-sun, Lee Jeong-sub', 'Lee Dong-wook, Hyun Young, Jeon Soo-kyeong, Kim Min-gyu, Kim Jae-man, Jang Hyun-sung, Ju Sang-uk, Ju Seok-tae', null, 'While eating skewered tempura at a street vendor, young reporter Choi Soo-jin accidentally sticks the skewer into the side of a detective, Kang Jae-hyuk, who was chasing a suspected criminal. After this encounter, Soo-jin is told to work on a story about a detective, and the detective turns out to be Jae-hyuk. Soo-jin joins his crackdown on drug dealers, and the two start to fall in love.', 'While eating skewered tempura at a street vendor, young reporter Choi Soo-jin accidentally sticks the skewer into the side of a detective, Kang Jae-hyuk, who was chasing a suspected criminal. After this encounter, Soo-jin is told to work on a story about a detective, and the detective turns out to be Jae-hyuk. Soo-jin joins his crackdown on drug dealers, and the two start to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ax8eVw1et7QyNwmO7Wn4bfgMJwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135641'),
  ('421579529054775407', 'The Perfect Date', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dominique Farrugia, Arnaud Lemort, Éric Guichard', 'Arnaud Lemort, Franck Dubosc', 'Clovis Cornillac, Virginie Efira, Manu Payet, Laurence Arné, Shirley Bousquet, Jonathan Lambert, Annelise Hesme, Laurent Lafitte', null, 'Michel dreams of a perfect meeting with the woman of his dreams, entirely due to chance, as his parents and grandparents experienced. Vincent, Michel''s contrast, is completely different. He is more the man of the direct approach and he follows his...! The two childhood friends Michel and Vincent, with completely opposite views when it comes to women, soon discover the limits of their respective techniques when they meet Angèle and Nathalie.', 'Michel dreams of a perfect meeting with the woman of his dreams, entirely due to chance, as his parents and grandparents experienced. Vincent, Michel''s contrast, is completely different. He is more the man of the direct approach and he follows his...! The two childhood friends Michel and Vincent, with completely opposite views when it comes to women, soon discover the limits of their respective techniques when they meet Angèle and Nathalie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lj6QtDX96LI1DmjKsMeJrp575hr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136294'),
  ('320742464273535368', 'The Perfect Date', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Chris Nelson, Bartosz Nalazek', 'Randall Green, Steve Bloom', 'Noah Centineo, Laura Marano, Odiseas Georgiadis, Camila Mendes, Matt Walsh, Joe Chrest, Carrie Lazar, Alexander Biglane', 'PG-13', 'No beau? No problem! To earn money for college, a high schooler creates a dating app that lets him act as a stand-in boyfriend.', 'No beau? No problem! To earn money for college, a high schooler creates a dating app that lets him act as a stand-in boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrAYdezO3h1mjdYTaQyTXoj8IZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543540'),
  ('385324580357831090', 'The Perfect David', 2021, 'Drama', 'Felipe Gómez Aparicio, Adolpho Veloso', 'Felipe Gómez Aparicio, Leandro Custo', 'Mauricio Di Yorio, Umbra Colombo, Diego Starosta, Pablo Staffolarini, José Luis Sain, Agustina Cabo, Antonella Ferrari, Francisco Bereny', null, 'David is a young bodybuilder who obsessively trains to become his artist mother''s muse. As he dedicates himself to further developing his physique, he goes through an identity crisis that will mark his destiny.', 'David is a young bodybuilder who obsessively trains to become his artist mother''s muse. As he dedicates himself to further developing his physique, he goes through an identity crisis that will mark his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8l2l2naMMRglN3IzZJ7wNx2hcnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737012'),
  ('152896172687536089', 'The Perfect Day', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Pierre Devillers', 'Valérie Amarou', 'Omar Sy, Johnny Hallyday, Zinédine Zidane, Jacques Chirac, Ronaldo, Zagallo, Yves Saint Laurent, Laura Georges', null, 'French soccer fans, celebrities and athletes retrace the exhilarating events of July 12, 1998, as France earned a historic win in the World Cup final.', 'French soccer fans, celebrities and athletes retrace the exhilarating events of July 12, 1998, as France earned a historic win in the World Cup final.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fl5CwdEcWCTAHCtaEeuyX11mdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528779'),
  ('102922398785189471', 'The Perfect Dictatorship', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Luis Estrada, Telma Silva, Martín Torres', 'Jaime Sampietro', 'Damián Alcázar, Alfonso Herrera, Joaquín Cosío, Osvaldo Benavides, Silvia Navarro, Flavio Medina, Saúl Lisazo, Tony Dalton', null, 'TV MX, the most powerful Mexican Television Corporation, discloses a scandalous story involving Governor Carmelo Vargas in serious crimes and illicit business. Governor Vargas worried about his political future, decides to clean his image and negotiates a billionaire secret agreement with the owners of the TV Corporation. Carlos Rojo, an ambitious young news producer, and Ricardo Diaz, TV network star reporter, are responsible for making a dirty campaign to change the image the public has of the corrupt Governor and make him, at any cost, a political star and a great presidential candidate. Mexican Television believes that democracy is a farce and has already placed one President... Will they do it again?', 'TV MX, the most powerful Mexican Television Corporation, discloses a scandalous story involving Governor Carmelo Vargas in serious crimes and illicit business. Governor Vargas worried about his political future, decides to clean his image and negotiates a billionaire secret agreement with the owners of the TV Corporation. Carlos Rojo, an ambitious young news producer, and Ricardo Diaz, TV network star reporter, are responsible for making a dirty campaign to change the image the public has of the corrupt Governor and make him, at any cost, a political star and a great presidential candidate. Mexican Television believes that democracy is a farce and has already placed one President... Will they do it again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgg9WVENbrSmNsX8BlBfrhTY0IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264525'),
  ('190060446081504643', 'The Perfect Dinner', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Davide Minnella', 'Salvatore Esposito, Gianluca Bernardini, Giordana Mari', 'Salvatore Esposito, Greta Scarano, Gianluca Colucci, Gianfranco Gallo, Antonella Attili, Antonio Grosso, Marlon Joubert, Teresa Ferrari', null, 'Carmine is a Neapolitan mafioso who isn’t cut out for the criminal life. Under the protection of his boss Pasquale, Carmine is sent north to run a money laundering operation through a restaurant. He simply needs to defrost frozen meals, issue receipts and dinner is served. But everything changes when he meets Consuelo, a chef who always pursues perfection and dreams of winning a Michelin star. Carmine hires her and decides to transform the establishment into a high-end restaurant. Could the love for food and dream of winning a Michelin star give them both a second chance?', 'Carmine is a Neapolitan mafioso who isn’t cut out for the criminal life. Under the protection of his boss Pasquale, Carmine is sent north to run a money laundering operation through a restaurant. He simply needs to defrost frozen meals, issue receipts and dinner is served. But everything changes when he meets Consuelo, a chef who always pursues perfection and dreams of winning a Michelin star. Carmine hires her and decides to transform the establishment into a high-end restaurant. Could the love for food and dream of winning a Michelin star give them both a second chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neTgFAKHUWnbWu5cEjnrNNzFBZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838876'),
  ('228403666569968003', 'The Perfect Education', 1999, 'Drama', 'Ben Wada, Yasushi Sasakibara', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Naoto Takenaka, Hijiri Kojima, Kazuki Kitamura, Asami Sawaki, Shinya Tsukamoto, Katsuski Mizushima, Mitsuko Ishii, Shigeru Izumiya', null, 'Schoolgirl Kuniko is kidnapped by a middle-aged man Iwazono when she is jogging. He tells her that he had a failed marriage which leaves him a deep and everlasting scar in his mind. He kidnaps her in search of a perfect marriage and intends to lock her in the room and ''educate'' her to perform perfect sex where body and soul are united.', 'Schoolgirl Kuniko is kidnapped by a middle-aged man Iwazono when she is jogging. He tells her that he had a failed marriage which leaves him a deep and everlasting scar in his mind. He kidnaps her in search of a perfect marriage and intends to lock her in the room and ''educate'' her to perform perfect sex where body and soul are united.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2ZmhLHzU9WOuWkoc0BTxA9Zcyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68833'),
  ('977346260104939275', 'The Perfect Family', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Arantxa Echevarría', 'Olatz Arroyo', 'Belén Rueda, Jose Coronado, Gonzalo de Castro, Pepa Aniorte, Carolina Yuste, Gonzalo Ramos, Lalo Tenorio, Jesús Vidal', null, 'Lucía is a woman for whom leading a model life and taking control of her life is the most important thing. Since she got married, she has focused all of her efforts on caring for her family, until achieving what for her is a perfect family. However, her entire world begins to collapse with the arrival of Sara, the girlfriend of her son; a young girl with great freedom and without mincing words who has a very different family from what Lucia always dreamed of as a political family. Now, Lucia must accept that the perfect family was not exactly what she thought.', 'Lucía is a woman for whom leading a model life and taking control of her life is the most important thing. Since she got married, she has focused all of her efforts on caring for her family, until achieving what for her is a perfect family. However, her entire world begins to collapse with the arrival of Sara, the girlfriend of her son; a young girl with great freedom and without mincing words who has a very different family from what Lucia always dreamed of as a political family. Now, Lucia must accept that the perfect family was not exactly what she thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejRrpBuWj8MNkFP7DUHZoqhuGmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826241'),
  ('535134243448502992', 'The Perfect Find', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Numa Perrier, Eric Lin, Abigail Hansen', 'Leigh Davenport', 'Gabrielle Union, Keith Powers, Gina Torres, Aisha Hinds, La La Anthony, D. B. Woodside, Janet Hubert, Shayna McHayle', 'R', 'After a high-profile firing, everything is at stake for 40-year-old Jenna: her career, her ticking biological clock, and her bank account. Her fashion career comeback hits a snag when she falls for a charming, much younger coworker — who happens to be her boss’s son. As sparks fly, Jenna must decide if she’ll risk it all on a secret romance with the one person who could destroy her comeback.', 'After a high-profile firing, everything is at stake for 40-year-old Jenna: her career, her ticking biological clock, and her bank account. Her fashion career comeback hits a snag when she falls for a charming, much younger coworker — who happens to be her boss’s son. As sparks fly, Jenna must decide if she’ll risk it all on a secret romance with the one person who could destroy her comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZXturIugHYCl7T6oLeMj1AWm7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561717'),
  ('656583689067844159', 'The Perfect Furlough', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Blake Edwards, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Stanley Shapiro', 'Tony Curtis, Janet Leigh, Keenan Wynn, Linda Cristal, Elaine Stritch, Marcel Dalio, Jay Novello, Les Tremayne', null, 'A love-starved soldier stationed at an Arctic base wins a furlough in Paris, but a pretty, no-nonsense military psychologist is ordered to accompany him as chaperone to keep him out of trouble.', 'A love-starved soldier stationed at an Arctic base wins a furlough in Paris, but a pretty, no-nonsense military psychologist is ordered to accompany him as chaperone to keep him out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrbtmgxifaVcM8C63UhaiubpzJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225943'),
  ('1149029298151579946', 'The Perfect Game', 2009, 'Drama, Family', 'William Dear, Bryan Greenberg', 'W. William Winokur', 'Jake T. Austin, Jansen Panettiere, Moisés Arias, Ryan Ochoa, Gabriel Morales, Carlos Padilla, Tony Revolori, Mario Revolori', 'PG', 'Based on a true story, a group of boys from Monterrey, Mexico who become the first non-U.S. team to win the Little League World Series.', 'Based on a true story, a group of boys from Monterrey, Mexico who become the first non-U.S. team to win the Little League World Series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwn02B0AyQYXzftAo9StX8JD2JY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56601'),
  ('311415949355634188', 'The Perfect Guy', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David M. Rosenthal, Steve Danton, Janell Sammelman', 'Tyger Williams', 'Sanaa Lathan, Michael Ealy, Morris Chestnut, Kathryn Morris, Holt McCallany, Rutina Wesley, Charles S. Dutton, L. Scott Caldwell', 'PG-13', 'With a fulfilling career and a loving relationship, lobbyist Leah Vaughn seems to have it all. Things come crashing down when Dave, her long-term boyfriend, disagrees with her future plans for marriage and a family. The resulting painful breakup leaves Leah heartbroken, until she meets the charming and handsome Carter Duncan. Soon, the budding romance turns dangerous as Carter reveals his volatile nature, forcing Leah to break up with the man she thought was Mr. Right. She soon realizes that Carter doesn''t want to let her go.', 'With a fulfilling career and a loving relationship, lobbyist Leah Vaughn seems to have it all. Things come crashing down when Dave, her long-term boyfriend, disagrees with her future plans for marriage and a family. The resulting painful breakup leaves Leah heartbroken, until she meets the charming and handsome Carter Duncan. Soon, the budding romance turns dangerous as Carter reveals his volatile nature, forcing Leah to break up with the man she thought was Mr. Right. She soon realizes that Carter doesn''t want to let her go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1U3ROFFCVbu9H63lKYMbXEHeJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304372'),
  ('102839807905933623', 'The Perfect Holiday', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Lance Rivera, Teodoro Maniaci', 'Lance Rivera, Marc Calixte, Nat Mauldin', 'Morris Chestnut, Gabrielle Union, Faizon Love, Terrence Howard, Queen Latifah, Charlie Murphy, Katt Williams, Jill Marie Jones', 'PG', 'Nancy Taylor, a divorced mother of three, feels especially lonely during the holidays. All she wants for Christmas is to meet a nice man - even just a nice compliment would make her day. Sensing her sadness, Nancy''s little girl, Emily, has a plan to make her mom happy again. She shares her Mommy''s wish with shopping mall Santa, Benjamin Armstrong. And Benjamin, who is also a struggling songwriter, knows exactly the right words to say.', 'Nancy Taylor, a divorced mother of three, feels especially lonely during the holidays. All she wants for Christmas is to meet a nice man - even just a nice compliment would make her day. Sensing her sadness, Nancy''s little girl, Emily, has a plan to make her mom happy again. She shares her Mommy''s wish with shopping mall Santa, Benjamin Armstrong. And Benjamin, who is also a struggling songwriter, knows exactly the right words to say.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoGUYjqPWTyF1DSlM9sJhG8QPGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26990'),
  ('339680123573930951', 'The Perfect Host', 2010, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Nicholas Tomnay, Julie Johnsen, Dave Casper', 'Nicholas Tomnay', 'David Hyde Pierce, Clayne Crawford, Nathaniel Parker, Megahn Perry, Helen Reddy, Cooper Barnes, Indira G. Wilson, Tyrees Allen', 'R', 'Warwick Wilson is the consummate host. He carefully prepares for a dinner party, the table impeccably set and the duck perfectly timed for 8:30 p.m. John Taylor is a career criminal. He’s just robbed a bank and needs to get off the streets. He finds himself on Warwick’s doorstep posing as a friend of a friend, new to Los Angeles, who’s been mugged and lost his luggage.', 'Warwick Wilson is the consummate host. He carefully prepares for a dinner party, the table impeccably set and the duck perfectly timed for 8:30 p.m. John Taylor is a career criminal. He’s just robbed a bank and needs to get off the streets. He finds himself on Warwick’s doorstep posing as a friend of a friend, new to Los Angeles, who’s been mugged and lost his luggage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYqk1u5d3eARg5gV8cF4RZFZKKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66195'),
  ('577401729041198385', 'The Perfect Human', 1968, 'Drama', 'Jørgen Leth, Ole John, Henning Camre', 'Ole John, Jørgen Leth', 'Majken Algren Nielsen, Claus Nissen, Jørgen Leth', null, 'An elegant and humorous film—in the guise of a serious anthropological treatise—spotlights "The Perfect Human," a model of the modern Dane created by our wishful thinking.', 'An elegant and humorous film—in the guise of a serious anthropological treatise—spotlights "The Perfect Human," a model of the modern Dane created by our wishful thinking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlDCJ4jhVRP9RsWwVVM75wP3dOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43681'),
  ('641734635320112320', 'The Perfect Man', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Mark Rosman, John R. Leonetti', 'Gina Wendkos', 'Hilary Duff, Heather Locklear, Chris Noth, Mike O''Malley, Ben Feldman, Vanessa Lengies, Caroline Rhea, Kym Whitley', 'PG', 'Holly is tired of moving every time her mom Jean breaks up with yet another second-rate guy. To distract her mother from her latest bad choice, Holly conceives the perfect plan for the perfect man, an imaginary secret admirer who will romance Jean and boost her self-esteem.', 'Holly is tired of moving every time her mom Jean breaks up with yet another second-rate guy. To distract her mother from her latest bad choice, Holly conceives the perfect plan for the perfect man, an imaginary secret admirer who will romance Jean and boost her self-esteem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1zaWMtjzw1hm5tPXm2GLFJaCfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15648'),
  ('356576622122343671', 'The Perfect Match', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bille Woodruff, Tommy Maddox-Upshaw', 'Brandon Broussard, Gary Hardwick, Dana Verde', 'Terrence J, Paula Patton, Kali Hawk, Lauren London, Brandy Norwood, Cassie Ventura, Draya Michele, Bria L. Murphy', null, 'Charlie is a charming playboy who doesn''t believe in serious relationships. His best friends bet him that if he sticks to one woman for one month, he''s bound to get attached. Charlie denies this yet accepts the seemingly easy challenge, until he cross paths with the beautiful and mysterious Eva. They may agree to a casual affair, but eventually Charlie is questioning whether he may actually want more.', 'Charlie is a charming playboy who doesn''t believe in serious relationships. His best friends bet him that if he sticks to one woman for one month, he''s bound to get attached. Charlie denies this yet accepts the seemingly easy challenge, until he cross paths with the beautiful and mysterious Eva. They may agree to a casual affair, but eventually Charlie is questioning whether he may actually want more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAiF9gKhb3gPbnp9g5nNhrfTqpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378200'),
  ('1099291550942773828', 'The Perfect Neighbor', 2025, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Geeta Gandbhir', null, 'Susan Lorincz, Ajike Owens, Pamela Dias', 'R', 'Police bodycam footage reveals how a long-running neighborhood dispute turned fatal in this documentary about fear, prejudice and Stand Your Ground laws.', 'Police bodycam footage reveals how a long-running neighborhood dispute turned fatal in this documentary about fear, prejudice and Stand Your Ground laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NE7yN45zo19o4LJr6JFxDWmh2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400782'),
  ('724200769935498242', 'The Perfect Pairing', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Justin Yaroski, Don McBrearty, Manny Kargov', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe, Rickie Castaneda, Megan Hocking', 'Nazneen Contractor, Brennan Elliott, Art Hindle, Steve Byers, Foad H.P., Beth Hornby, Zarina Rocha, Genelle Williams', 'G', 'A food and wine critic who hits her head and loses memory while accidentally visiting a winery she panned in the past, owned and operated by single dad Michael.', 'A food and wine critic who hits her head and loses memory while accidentally visiting a winery she panned in the past, owned and operated by single dad Michael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEEJzb0Vtb9xI6Q17ob7uHrDiZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874136'),
  ('1141300199565404431', 'The Perfect Patient', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Mikael Håfström, Ragna Jorming, Tora Greiff Bergström', 'Erlend Loe', 'Jonas Karlsson, David Dencik, Alba August, Magnus Roosmann, Suzanne Reuter, Linda Ulvaeus, Christopher Wagelin, Björn Bengtsson', null, 'A true and captivating story about the biggest legal scandal in Swedish history, the story about the reporter who questioned an entire legal system. Hannes Råstam was dedicated to proving the innocence of Thomas Quick and unmask the legal chaos which sentenced Quick to a life in psychiatric prison.', 'A true and captivating story about the biggest legal scandal in Swedish history, the story about the reporter who questioned an entire legal system. Hannes Råstam was dedicated to proving the innocence of Thomas Quick and unmask the legal chaos which sentenced Quick to a life in psychiatric prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLMTdvygnav436Y9TQ3aFcYCcCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606146'),
  ('1063304486817543313', 'The Perfect Score', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Clark Mathis, Brian Robbins', 'Marc Hyman, Jon Zack', 'Chris Evans, Bryan Greenberg, Scarlett Johansson, Erika Christensen, Darius Miles, Leonardo Nam, Matthew Lillard, Tyra Ferrell', 'PG-13', 'Six high school seniors decide to break into the Princeton Testing Center so they can steal the answers to their upcoming SAT tests and all get perfect scores.', 'Six high school seniors decide to break into the Princeton Testing Center so they can steal the answers to their upcoming SAT tests and all get perfect scores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xflTliVBvCztaLzTJx9luHnSqwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13505'),
  ('842049043538581804', 'The Perfect Secret', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bora Dağtekin, Manuel Kreuzpaintner, Julia Eiber', 'Filippo Bologna, Paolo Genovese, Rolando Ravello', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Jessica Schwarz, Jella Haase, Elyas M''Barek, Karoline Herfurth, Frederick Lau, Florian David Fitz, Emily Kusche', null, 'Seven friends - three women and four men - meet for dinner. Everyone should put their cell phone on the table. No matter what message comes in - anyone can read it and listen to the phone calls. However, this leads to a lot of chaos.', 'Seven friends - three women and four men - meet for dinner. Everyone should put their cell phone on the table. No matter what message comes in - anyone can read it and listen to the phone calls. However, this leads to a lot of chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ej8QuSK03YmF3VojH6h2pI7aJIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620881'),
  ('925369268117099516', 'The Perfect Storm', 2000, 'Drama, Adventure, Action', 'John Seale, Wolfgang Petersen, Jane Jenkins', 'William D. Wittliff', 'George Clooney, Mark Wahlberg, Diane Lane, John C. Reilly, William Fichtner, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, John Hawkes, Dash Mihok', 'PG-13', 'In October 1991, a confluence of weather conditions combined to form a killer storm in the North Atlantic. Caught in the storm was the sword-fishing boat Andrea Gail.', 'In October 1991, a confluence of weather conditions combined to form a killer storm in the North Atlantic. Caught in the storm was the sword-fishing boat Andrea Gail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJPoxqgpfFNbGi0HyoNsjFeLCio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2133'),
  ('405410037140020405', 'The Perfect Stranger', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Toni Bestard, Nicolás Pinzón', 'Arturo Ruiz Serrano', 'Colm Meaney, Ana Wagener, Natalia Rodríguez, Carlos Santos, Guiem Juaneda, Pascal Ulli, Kate Burdette, Biel Duran', null, 'The mysterious arrival of a foreigner to a small village in a Mediterranean island, awake the sudden interest from a diverse group of residents, who will appear unexpectedly in the stranger''s life, believing that he''s going to reopen an old shop. In contrast, the real intentions of the stranger are hidden behind an old Polaroid photo, which has led him to that place in search of answers.', 'The mysterious arrival of a foreigner to a small village in a Mediterranean island, awake the sudden interest from a diverse group of residents, who will appear unexpectedly in the stranger''s life, believing that he''s going to reopen an old shop. In contrast, the real intentions of the stranger are hidden behind an old Polaroid photo, which has led him to that place in search of answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ay2aO5UA6C9zcPzY9YNN4JxHga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89261'),
  ('367862549530959126', 'The Perfect Teacher', 2010, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Reid A. Dunlop, Matt Delaney, Alexandre Champagne', 'Christine Conradt', 'Megan Park, David Charvet, Boti Bliss, Keeva Lynk, Amanda Tilson, Kimberly-Sue Murray, Christina Broccolini, James McGowan', 'PG-13', 'A spoiled, selfish teenager becomes infatuated with her teacher. She befriends his daughter as a way of worming her way into the family, and sets about manipulating every aspect of his life.', 'A spoiled, selfish teenager becomes infatuated with her teacher. She befriends his daughter as a way of worming her way into the family, and sets about manipulating every aspect of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beSsbJ77KIc8j9X0gf3O8FlL4OW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68193'),
  ('443054609239148574', 'The Perfect Trap', 2019, 'Family, Comedy', 'Stefan Biebl, Marcus H. Rosenmüller', 'Simone Höft, Nora Lämmermann', 'Butz Ulrich Buse, Marie Leuenberger, Luis Vorbach, Pepe Trebs, Justus Kaßmann, Maja Beckmann, Jona Gaensslen, Xari Wimbauer', null, 'The discovery of a magic mirror allows Fred to realize his dream: his twin tidies up his room, eats without complaining and becomes first in class. But Fred did not keep his promise to keep this secret by revealing it to his friend, Émile.', 'The discovery of a magic mirror allows Fred to realize his dream: his twin tidies up his room, eats without complaining and becomes first in class. But Fred did not keep his promise to keep this secret by revealing it to his friend, Émile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41Rh4Es6Mv448ugczwMFjTon43d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570168'),
  ('1033340592187852212', 'The Perfect Wave', 2014, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Bruce Macdonald', 'Roger Hawkins, William A. Wood III', 'Scott Eastwood, Cheryl Ladd, Patrick Lyster, Rachel Hendrix, Scott Mortensen, Nikolai Mynhardt, Carolyn Forword', null, 'The true story of Ian McCormack who grew up surfing the waters of New Zealand. Wanting to dive deeper, Ian sets out on a journey with his best friend that will change his life as they chase the perfect wave.', 'The true story of Ian McCormack who grew up surfing the waters of New Zealand. Wanting to dive deeper, Ian sets out on a journey with his best friend that will change his life as they chase the perfect wave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRbFTl2OkANyTm26IbwUZ3Vr3ay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251979'),
  ('360225332778169954', 'The Perfect Weapon', 1991, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Mark DiSalle, Leslie Grobar, Thomas A. Irvine', 'David C. Wilson', 'Jeff Speakman, John Dye, Mako, James Hong, Mariska Hargitay, Dante Basco, Beau Starr, Seth Sakai', 'R', 'Jeff, a young delinquent, is enrolled by his father in a kenpo school, in the hopes of teaching the boy some self-discipline. Years later, Jeff''s mentor, Kim, is being threatened by one of the Korean mafia families. Jeff tries to help his old friend, but is too late to prevent Kim''s death at the hands of an unknown hitman. Vowing revenge, Jeff takes on all of the families, using his martial arts skills to find the man who killed his friend.', 'Jeff, a young delinquent, is enrolled by his father in a kenpo school, in the hopes of teaching the boy some self-discipline. Years later, Jeff''s mentor, Kim, is being threatened by one of the Korean mafia families. Jeff tries to help his old friend, but is too late to prevent Kim''s death at the hands of an unknown hitman. Vowing revenge, Jeff takes on all of the families, using his martial arts skills to find the man who killed his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCXDdDDgNxvtQVzBw9TfTz1QYjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34421'),
  ('578443256374663578', 'The Perfect Weapon', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Titus Paar, Mark Rutledge, James R.W. Hiatt', 'Ulysses Oliver, Jesse Cilio, Alex Brenner', 'Steven Seagal, Sasha Jackson, Johnny Messner, Richard Tyson, Sandra Yap, Philip Fornah, Emilien De Falco, Vernon Wells', 'R', 'In a not too distant future, a totalitarian state run by ‘The Director” controls all aspects of life. All enemies of the state are dealt in the harshest way. Most of them are executed by the secret government’s assassins. The best operative is code-named “Condor” – an elite agent and hit man for the government. However, in his latest assignment, “Condor” fails to kill an opposition leader, and finds himself on the run from the very same government agency that he works for. This sets in motion a chain of events with unforseen consequences for all involved.', 'In a not too distant future, a totalitarian state run by ‘The Director” controls all aspects of life. All enemies of the state are dealt in the harshest way. Most of them are executed by the secret government’s assassins. The best operative is code-named “Condor” – an elite agent and hit man for the government. However, in his latest assignment, “Condor” fails to kill an opposition leader, and finds himself on the run from the very same government agency that he works for. This sets in motion a chain of events with unforseen consequences for all involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bFIPM8PatqvwtNO9ObjQ6PBDky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416149'),
  ('818679049915346587', 'The Perfect Weapon', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'John Maggio, Brian Oakes', null, 'John Stimac, Seth Rogen, Hillary Clinton, Will Hurd', null, 'Explore the rise of cyber conflict as the primary way nations now compete with and sabotage one another. As fear mounts about how potential cyberattacks will affect 2020 elections in the U.S., the film features interviews with top military, intelligence and political officials and includes on-the-ground reporting from the frontlines of the cyber wars.', 'Explore the rise of cyber conflict as the primary way nations now compete with and sabotage one another. As fear mounts about how potential cyberattacks will affect 2020 elections in the U.S., the film features interviews with top military, intelligence and political officials and includes on-the-ground reporting from the frontlines of the cyber wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXphpQgetq4FZJN1cNnX1FpGcS5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728209'),
  ('155078050144184128', 'The Perfect Wife', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Don E. FauntLeRoy, Don E. FauntLeRoy, Jack Skeets Gleeson', 'George Saunders, Richard Dana Smith', 'Perry King, Shannon Sturges, Lesley-Anne Down, William R. Moses, Michele Greene, Max Gail, Michael Fairman, Luisa Leschin', null, 'When Leah''s brother dies in a car accident, she vows revenge on the doc who failed to save him.', 'When Leah''s brother dies in a car accident, she vows revenge on the doc who failed to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVeihvklKJyeen5M1Pbxh2dmuHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239513'),
  ('531183658072774311', 'The Perfection', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Emily Silver, Kit Marlatt, Mark D. Currie', 'Nicole Snyder, Richard Shepard, Eric C. Charmelo', 'Allison Williams, Logan Browning, Steven Weber, Alaina Huffman, Molly Grace, Milah Thompson, Eileen Tian, Mark Kandborg', null, 'When troubled musical prodigy Charlotte seeks out Elizabeth, the new star pupil of her former school, the encounter sends both musicians down a sinister path with shocking consequences.', 'When troubled musical prodigy Charlotte seeks out Elizabeth, the new star pupil of her former school, the encounter sends both musicians down a sinister path with shocking consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPDe68PDsgIGMs6wdJLtcwVVxA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529962'),
  ('574174447934908262', 'The Performance', 2026, 'Drama', 'Shira Piven, Lael Utnik', 'Shira Piven, Josh Salzberg', 'Jeremy Piven, Robert Carlyle, Maimie McCoy, Adam Garcia, Steven Berkoff', 'R', 'A gifted Jewish tap dancer is recruited to perform a one-night engagement in 1930''s Berlin. With his life on the line, he and his troupe must give their best performance. Based on a story by Arthur Miller first published in The New Yorker.', 'A gifted Jewish tap dancer is recruited to perform a one-night engagement in 1930''s Berlin. With his life on the line, he and his troupe must give their best performance. Based on a story by Arthur Miller first published in The New Yorker.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcqJoCweblgjHDhJNq31cYo5gpUk.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-performance-2026'),
  ('283540759154044412', 'The Perfume of the Lady in Black', 1974, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Francesco Barilli, Giorgio Scotton, Nello Giorgetti', 'Francesco Barilli, Massimo D''Avak', 'Mimsy Farmer, Maurizio Bonuglia, Mario Scaccia, Jho Jhenkins, Niké Arrighi, Lara Wendel, Aleka Paizi, Renata Zamengo', null, 'Sylvia, an industrial scientist, is troubled by strange hallucinations related to the tragic suicide of her mother.', 'Sylvia, an industrial scientist, is troubled by strange hallucinations related to the tragic suicide of her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obkFF8JiCyuBCXFHWFNRLo1Gl5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65317'),
  ('677494907666230168', 'The Perfume of the Lady in Black', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Podalydès, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Denis Podalydès, Jean-Noël Brouté, Sabine Azéma, Olivier Gourmet, Zabou Breitman, Michael Lonsdale, Pierre Arditi, Bruno Podalydès', null, 'Newly married, Mathilde and Robert are honeymooning at a resort owned by their friends Edith and Arthur, the Chateau d''Hercule. But an unpleasant shock is in store for them.', 'Newly married, Mathilde and Robert are honeymooning at a resort owned by their friends Edith and Arthur, the Chateau d''Hercule. But an unpleasant shock is in store for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqwZnN6CQclKaCMmZHJDgBcvC5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60104'),
  ('548586150645974490', 'The Perfume of Yvonne', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Patrice Leconte, Eduardo Serra', 'Patrice Leconte', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Hippolyte Girardot, Sandra Majani, Richard Bohringer, Paul Guers, Corinne Marchand, Philippe Magnan, Claude Aufaure', null, 'It is the summer of 1958 in wealthy Lake Geneva, where an enigmatic young Frenchman begins an affair with a beautiful starlet under the watchful eye of her flamboyant elderly mentor. But in a season full of secrets, is truth the most elusive passion of all?', 'It is the summer of 1958 in wealthy Lake Geneva, where an enigmatic young Frenchman begins an affair with a beautiful starlet under the watchful eye of her flamboyant elderly mentor. But in a season full of secrets, is truth the most elusive passion of all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfqsYEAi0W84DwevkGBDgK5gBgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64724'),
  ('727219296002639319', 'The Perfumier', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nils Willbrandt', null, 'Emilia Schüle, Ludwig Simon, Sólveig Arnarsdóttir, Anne Müller, Robert Finster, August Diehl', 'R', 'To regain her sense of smell and get back her lover, a detective joins forces with a perfume maker who uses deadly methods to create the perfect scent.', 'To regain her sense of smell and get back her lover, a detective joins forces with a perfume maker who uses deadly methods to create the perfect scent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieivbB7SDenOGfqae0vZdJQfJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016446'),
  ('838021209559069949', 'The Perilous Internet Ring', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Norio Tsuruta', 'Ma Boyong', 'Sun Yihan, Fu Meng-po, Zhang Jing, Han Qiuchi, Zhou Haodong, Musi Ni', null, 'A college student investigates a series of mysterious deaths.', 'A college student investigates a series of mysterious deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cqOZ19H79uskbEwXt9oBydDMTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767585'),
  ('467487463857700808', 'The Periwig-Maker', 1999, 'Animation, Drama', 'Steffen Schäffler', 'Steffen Schäffler, Annette Schäffler', 'Kenneth Branagh, Daren C. Evans, Alice Fairhall, Roger Law', null, 'In this Oscar-nominated short, a man seals himself off in 17th century plague-infested London to escape the danger of infection. When a little girl seeks his help, he has an opportunity.', 'In this Oscar-nominated short, a man seals himself off in 17th century plague-infested London to escape the danger of infection. When a little girl seeks his help, he has an opportunity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn2YcZTISnBms6j8UvhDX8UGA9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48522'),
  ('59102478517850008', 'The Perks of Being a Wallflower', 2012, 'Drama', 'Stephen Chbosky, Andrew Dunn, Susan Ransom-Coyle', 'Stephen Chbosky', 'Logan Lerman, Emma Watson, Ezra Miller, Mae Whitman, Kate Walsh, Dylan McDermott, Melanie Lynskey, Nina Dobrev', 'PG-13', 'Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, 1991. High school freshman Charlie is a wallflower, always watching life from the sidelines, until two senior students, Sam and her stepbrother Patrick, become his mentors, helping him discover the joys of friendship, music and love.', 'Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, 1991. High school freshman Charlie is a wallflower, always watching life from the sidelines, until two senior students, Sam and her stepbrother Patrick, become his mentors, helping him discover the joys of friendship, music and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKCvdFFF5n80P2VdS7d8YBwbCjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84892'),
  ('370500116049885398', 'The Persian Version', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'André Jäger, Ogulcan Koyler, Tugçe Sari', 'Maryam Keshavarz', 'Layla Mohammadi, Niousha Noor, Kamand Shafieisabet, Bijan Daneshmand, Bella Warda, Chiara Stella, Tom Byrne, Shervin Alenabi', 'R', 'When a large Iranian-American family gathers in New York City for the patriarch’s heart transplant, a family secret is uncovered and catapults the estranged mother and daughter into an exploration of the past.', 'When a large Iranian-American family gathers in New York City for the patriarch’s heart transplant, a family secret is uncovered and catapults the estranged mother and daughter into an exploration of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nzBlZtebWJXY8ap0ibkgb3eMUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058620'),
  ('322773731878078450', 'The Personal History of David Copperfield', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Nick Dent, Nige Watson, Nikki Molloy', 'Simon Blackwell, Armando Iannucci', 'Dev Patel, Peter Capaldi, Ben Whishaw, Tilda Swinton, Gwendoline Christie, Hugh Laurie, Anthony Welsh, Aneurin Barnard', 'PG', 'A fresh and distinctive take on Charles Dickens’ semi-autobiographical masterpiece, The Personal History of David Copperfield, set in the 1840s, chronicles the life of its iconic title character as he navigates a chaotic world to find his elusive place within it. From his unhappy childhood to the discovery of his gift as a storyteller and writer, David’s journey is by turns hilarious and tragic, but always full of life, colour and humanity.', 'A fresh and distinctive take on Charles Dickens’ semi-autobiographical masterpiece, The Personal History of David Copperfield, set in the 1840s, chronicles the life of its iconic title character as he navigates a chaotic world to find his elusive place within it. From his unhappy childhood to the discovery of his gift as a storyteller and writer, David’s journey is by turns hilarious and tragic, but always full of life, colour and humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2epgo9k2Jrs7qrTL1Rork1mDSKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520900'),
  ('407080250988020461', 'The Personals', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Chen Kuofu, Chih-Hsiang Lin', 'Chen Kuofu, Chen Shih-Chieh', 'René Liu, Wu Bai, Chen Chao-jung, Ku Pao-Ming, King Shih-chieh, Eli Shih, Lo Pei-an, Doze Niu Cheng-Tse', null, 'An attractive and successful doctor places a personal ad in a newspaper to try to meet (and eventually marry) Mr. Right. A succession of blind dates ensues, featuring men who are lonely, desperate, dangerous and perverted.', 'An attractive and successful doctor places a personal ad in a newspaper to try to meet (and eventually marry) Mr. Right. A succession of blind dates ensues, featuring men who are lonely, desperate, dangerous and perverted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Yly1AkVOL8js3vxCWPCw7NjXKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77825'),
  ('446183671083378225', 'The Pervert''s Guide to Cinema', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Natascha Teunissen, Sophie Fiennes, Remko Schnorr', 'Slavoj Žižek', 'Slavoj Žižek, Alfred Hitchcock', null, 'A hilarious introduction, using as examples some of the best films ever made, to some of Slovenian philosopher and psychoanalyst Slavoj Žižek''s most exciting ideas on personal subjectivity, fantasy and reality, desire and sexuality.', 'A hilarious introduction, using as examples some of the best films ever made, to some of Slovenian philosopher and psychoanalyst Slavoj Žižek''s most exciting ideas on personal subjectivity, fantasy and reality, desire and sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AAxgfwAnpBmQCspuwlMITekcsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34283'),
  ('808294754902158123', 'The Pervert''s Guide to Ideology', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Sophie Fiennes, Luke Johnston, Remko Schnorr', 'Slavoj Žižek', 'Slavoj Žižek', 'R', 'A journey into the labyrinthine heart of ideology, which shapes and justifies both collective and personal beliefs and practices: with an infectious zeal and voracious appetite for popular culture, Slovenian philosopher and psychoanalyst Slavoj Žižek analyzes several of the most important films in the history of cinema to explain how cinematic narrative helps to reinforce prevailing ethics and political ideas.', 'A journey into the labyrinthine heart of ideology, which shapes and justifies both collective and personal beliefs and practices: with an infectious zeal and voracious appetite for popular culture, Slovenian philosopher and psychoanalyst Slavoj Žižek analyzes several of the most important films in the history of cinema to explain how cinematic narrative helps to reinforce prevailing ethics and political ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGmLQzLuok7qB0xVLv7s6rvUdl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128190'),
  ('254936843431084204', 'The Pest', 1997, 'Action, Comedy', 'Paul Miller, Roy H. Wagner', 'David Bar Katz', 'John Leguizamo, Jeffrey Jones, Edoardo Ballerini, Freddy Rodríguez, Tammy Townsend, Aries Spears, Joe Morton, Charles Hallahan', 'PG-13', 'Fast-talking Latino con artist Pestario "Pest" Vargas is the target of Scottish mobsters to whom he owes a considerable debt. Willing to do anything to raise money and avoid severe injury or death, Vargas agrees to a very unusual job -- he will be transported to a remote island and hunted by Gustav Shank, a racist German executive. If he can survive a full day and night, Vargas gets $50,000 and will be set free. Is he wily enough to elude Shank?', 'Fast-talking Latino con artist Pestario "Pest" Vargas is the target of Scottish mobsters to whom he owes a considerable debt. Willing to do anything to raise money and avoid severe injury or death, Vargas agrees to a very unusual job -- he will be transported to a remote island and hunted by Gustav Shank, a racist German executive. If he can survive a full day and night, Vargas gets $50,000 and will be set free. Is he wily enough to elude Shank?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmxgXwRgWJ3Ds9VQX7SDRIGJYvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17949'),
  ('112017106072792812', 'The Pet', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'D. Stevens', 'D. Stevens', 'Pierre Dulat, Andrea Edmondson, Summer Nguyen, Lydia McLane, Steven Wollenberg, Magi Avila', null, 'A young woman in dire financial straights accepts an offer to be a wealthy aristocrat''s human "pet" for six months. Then ruthless modern "pet-nappers" kidnap the woman to sell her on the GSM (Global Slave Market).', 'A young woman in dire financial straights accepts an offer to be a wealthy aristocrat''s human "pet" for six months. Then ruthless modern "pet-nappers" kidnap the woman to sell her on the GSM (Global Slave Market).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6UZzTszSpIysEt3mk47U93iS0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52462'),
  ('711179582598891434', 'The Pet Store', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse''s new job at Tony''s Pet Store is jeopardized when Beppo the Gorilla escapes and kidnaps Minnie. Mickey fights back with the help of the other animals in the store.', 'Mickey Mouse''s new job at Tony''s Pet Store is jeopardized when Beppo the Gorilla escapes and kidnaps Minnie. Mickey fights back with the help of the other animals in the store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8365lh6rtXb77Bai20K6GQsEKG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161840'),
  ('1134427306896483230', 'The Petrified Dog', 1949, null, 'Sidney Peterson', null, 'Marie Hirsh', null, 'Chases within chases. A mother runs after a child. A man seems to be pursuing himself. A woman who has been nibbling her lipstick through half of the film is pursued by a man. Scrambled Alice in Wonderland with brutiste soundtrack. The pursuit of art is represented by a painter daubing at a landscape in an empty frame.', 'Chases within chases. A mother runs after a child. A man seems to be pursuing himself. A woman who has been nibbling her lipstick through half of the film is pursued by a man. Scrambled Alice in Wonderland with brutiste soundtrack. The pursuit of art is represented by a painter daubing at a landscape in an empty frame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paVzMTdJJcqiYhD7NFjzK3ARjpk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209731'),
  ('168617091463308088', 'The Petrified Forest', 1936, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sol Polito, Archie Mayo, Frank Shaw', 'Charles Kenyon, Delmer Daves', 'Leslie Howard, Bette Davis, Humphrey Bogart, Genevieve Tobin, Dick Foran, Porter Hall, Charley Grapewin, Paul Harvey', 'NR', 'Gabby, the waitress in an isolated Arizona diner, dreams of a bigger and better life. One day penniless intellectual Alan drifts into the joint and the two strike up a rapport. Soon enough, notorious killer Duke Mantee takes the diner''s inhabitants hostage. Surrounded by miles of desert, the patrons and staff are forced to sit tight with Mantee and his gang overnight.', 'Gabby, the waitress in an isolated Arizona diner, dreams of a bigger and better life. One day penniless intellectual Alan drifts into the joint and the two strike up a rapport. Soon enough, notorious killer Duke Mantee takes the diner''s inhabitants hostage. Surrounded by miles of desert, the patrons and staff are forced to sit tight with Mantee and his gang overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjE4pw6mqoA1OJHNLq1aol4y4C1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17030'),
  ('947751889536096590', 'The Petrified Forest', 1973, 'Crime, Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Masahiko Okumura, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Kenichi Hagiwara, Shima Iwashita, Takeshi Kusaka, Sayoko Ninomiya, Haruko Sugimura, Akio Tanaka, Masako Yagi, Ippei Kawashima', null, 'Follows a young med student''s relationships with two women: a dangerous affair with a childhood friend and his mother''s struggle to rebuild their estranged relationship.', 'Follows a young med student''s relationships with two women: a dangerous affair with a childhood friend and his mother''s struggle to rebuild their estranged relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9BkC4vTzCE8jyGqoxQ9ROILSoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204975'),
  ('964106867639706210', 'The Pez Outlaw', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Bryan Storkel, Amy Bandlien Storkel', null, 'Steve Glew, Kathy Glew, Nate Larson', null, 'Steve Glew, a small-town Michigan farmer, boards a plane for Eastern Europe soon after the fall of the Berlin Wall. His mission is to locate a secret factory that holds the key to the most desired and valuable pez dispensers. If he succeeds, he will pull his family out of poverty and finally find a purpose in his mundane life.', 'Steve Glew, a small-town Michigan farmer, boards a plane for Eastern Europe soon after the fall of the Berlin Wall. His mission is to locate a secret factory that holds the key to the most desired and valuable pez dispensers. If he succeeds, he will pull his family out of poverty and finally find a purpose in his mundane life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCZlHJe8gbfecigjGFHO8FJQwdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934222'),
  ('637004221539697064', 'The Phantom', 1931, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alan James', null, 'Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Allene Ray, Niles Welch, Tom O''Brien, Sheldon Lewis, Wilfred Lucas, Violet Knights, William Gould', 'NR', 'An eclectic group of people are stalked by a masked killer in an old mansion.', 'An eclectic group of people are stalked by a masked killer in an old mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y4BV1xdUunmlEb8TnSmvhB6o8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156365'),
  ('866728472976703894', 'The Phantom', 1984, 'Drama', 'Marek Nowicki, Witold Sobociński', 'Marek Nowicki', 'Roman Wilhelmi, Dorota Kwiatkowska, Marzena Trybała, Mariusz Benoit, Mariusz Dmochowski, Hanna Mikuć, Anna Chodakowska, Olgierd Łukaszewicz', null, 'Set in the early years of the century. A story of a country gentleman haunted by the memory of his first wife. His current wife, had enough of his obsession and has taken a lover, who is mysteriously paralyzed. Meanwhile, main character''s son gets his first taste of sensual experience with a mute peasant girl.', 'Set in the early years of the century. A story of a country gentleman haunted by the memory of his first wife. His current wife, had enough of his obsession and has taken a lover, who is mysteriously paralyzed. Meanwhile, main character''s son gets his first taste of sensual experience with a mute peasant girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UssWseIIeOPAl1s6AAfXif7MZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141757'),
  ('159320629221575231', 'The Phantom', 1996, 'Adventure, Action', 'Simon Wincer, Conrad W. Hall, Lisette Thomas', 'Jeffrey Boam', 'Billy Zane, Kristy Swanson, Treat Williams, Catherine Zeta-Jones, James Remar, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Bill Smitrovich, Casey Siemaszko', 'PG', 'The 21st successor to the role of Bengalla''s resident superhero must travel to New York to prevent a rich madman from obtaining three magic skulls that would give him the secret to ultimate power.', 'The 21st successor to the role of Bengalla''s resident superhero must travel to New York to prevent a rich madman from obtaining three magic skulls that would give him the secret to ultimate power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8k8RSMkmGR9Lp6FbKtithM3KIQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9826'),
  ('777250038696014743', 'The Phantom Baron', 1943, 'Drama', 'Serge de Poligny, Roger Hubert', 'Jean Cocteau', 'André Lefaur, Odette Joyeux, Jany Holt, Alain Cuny, Jean Cocteau, Gabrielle Dorziat, André Alerme, Aimé Clariond', null, 'Elfy, Countess of Saint-Hélié''s daughter, was brought up with her foster sister Anne, in an old dilapidated castle whose landlord, Baron Julius Carol, disappeared mysteriously some day. The two girls had a playmate, Hervé, the son of the gamekeeper. Now that they are adult, Anne is in love with Hervé while Elfy thinks she loves the young man. One day, the baron''s mummified body is found in an oubliette and the secret of the estate is revealed...', 'Elfy, Countess of Saint-Hélié''s daughter, was brought up with her foster sister Anne, in an old dilapidated castle whose landlord, Baron Julius Carol, disappeared mysteriously some day. The two girls had a playmate, Hervé, the son of the gamekeeper. Now that they are adult, Anne is in love with Hervé while Elfy thinks she loves the young man. One day, the baron''s mummified body is found in an oubliette and the secret of the estate is revealed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4egQq1BrkUIhVCQRgv1kIuM8Mwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66451'),
  ('758405251264044662', 'The Phantom Creeps', 1939, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ford Beebe, Saul A. Goodkind', 'George H. Plympton, Basil Dickey, Mildred Barish', 'Bela Lugosi, Robert Kent, Dorothy Arnold, Edwin Stanley, Regis Toomey, Jack C. Smith, Edward Van Sloan, Dora Clement', null, 'A mad scientist attempts to rule the world by creating various elaborate inventions.', 'A mad scientist attempts to rule the world by creating various elaborate inventions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsjPEN30Z7WJFMQIgAYUzbxCjvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45607'),
  ('967592236648006047', 'The Phantom Empire', 1935, 'Action, Music, Science Fiction, Western', 'B. Reeves Eason, Otto Brower', null, 'Gene Autry, Frankie Darro, Betsy King Ross, Dorothy Christy, Wheeler Oakman, Charles K. French, Warner Richmond, J. Frank Glendon', 'NR', 'When the ancient continent of Mu sank beneath the ocean, some of its inhabitant survived in caverns beneath the sea. Cowboy singer Gene Autry stumbles upon the civilization, now buried beneath his own Radio Ranch. The Muranians have developed technology and weaponry such as television and ray guns. Their rich supply of radium draws unscrupulous speculators from the surface. The peaceful civilization of the Muranians is corrupted by the greed from above, and it becomes Autry''s task to prevent all-out war, ideally without disrupting his regular radio show.', 'When the ancient continent of Mu sank beneath the ocean, some of its inhabitant survived in caverns beneath the sea. Cowboy singer Gene Autry stumbles upon the civilization, now buried beneath his own Radio Ranch. The Muranians have developed technology and weaponry such as television and ray guns. Their rich supply of radium draws unscrupulous speculators from the surface. The peaceful civilization of the Muranians is corrupted by the greed from above, and it becomes Autry''s task to prevent all-out war, ideally without disrupting his regular radio show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSngO3JT8ICqvOvgBg4zXbucDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184892'),
  ('769873212259231312', 'The Phantom Empire', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver', 'Fred Olen Ray, T.L. Lankford', 'Ross Hagen, Jeffrey Combs, Dawn Wildsmith, Robert Quarry, Susan Stokey, Sybil Danning, Michelle Bauer, Russ Tamblyn', 'R', 'Lost city explorers find mutants, cavegirls, dinosaurs and a leather clad space queen.', 'Lost city explorers find mutants, cavegirls, dinosaurs and a leather clad space queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1C81XbB9YzGhOYI8kstFtc7i1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27664'),
  ('657688663872046921', 'The Phantom from 10,000 Leagues', 1955, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Dan Milner, Brydon Baker, Ronald Stein', 'Lou Rusoff', 'Kent Taylor, Cathy Downs, Michael Whalen, Rodney Bell, Phillip Pine, Vivi Janiss, Helene Stanton, Pierce Lyden', 'NR', 'A marine biologist and a government agent investigate mysterious deaths and rumors of a sea monster in a secluded ocean cove, and find themselves involved with a marine biology professor conducting secretive experiments, international spies trying to steal his secrets, a radioactive light on the sea bottom, and the malevolent thing which guards it.', 'A marine biologist and a government agent investigate mysterious deaths and rumors of a sea monster in a secluded ocean cove, and find themselves involved with a marine biology professor conducting secretive experiments, international spies trying to steal his secrets, a radioactive light on the sea bottom, and the malevolent thing which guards it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eADSHxjhYZ0Pynj2NKHNKwASS8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29412'),
  ('456045860258343116', 'The Phantom Inventory', 2004, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Franck Dion, Ivan Rouvreure', 'Franck Dion', 'Robert Roanne, Jean-Paul Landresse', null, 'The film is about a very stern looking man who has come to a very unusual flat to repossess the belongings of an old man in a wheelchair. However, again and again, the home seems to play tricks on the guy--driving him half-mad in the process.', 'The film is about a very stern looking man who has come to a very unusual flat to repossess the belongings of an old man in a wheelchair. However, again and again, the home seems to play tricks on the guy--driving him half-mad in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8zXwMis725KVcWPfwb2izGUyhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48342'),
  ('430314783607377512', 'The Phantom Light', 1935, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Powell, Roy Kellino', 'Ralph Smart', 'Binnie Hale, Gordon Harker, Donald Calthrop, Milton Rosmer, Ian Hunter, Herbert Lomas, Reginald Tate, Barry O''Neill', null, 'A series of mysterious deaths in a Welsh lighthouse lead locals to believe it is haunted. But the new keeper is sceptical.', 'A series of mysterious deaths in a Welsh lighthouse lead locals to believe it is haunted. But the new keeper is sceptical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMjBGcNoDqDLUGe9z6pvlLZUs1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130882'),
  ('235258230768271116', 'The Phantom Lover', 1995, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Ronny Yu, Leslie Cheung', 'Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Ronny Yu', 'Leslie Cheung, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Liu Lin, Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk, Bao Fang, Phillip Kwok Chui, Yu Yankai, Huang Lei', null, 'In 1936 China, a nearly bankrupt drama troupe starts performing in a burned-out theater where the great actor Song Danping was killed. One of the actors, Wei Qing, starts seeing strange apparitions that could revive his troupe and deliver him to the same fate as Song Danping.', 'In 1936 China, a nearly bankrupt drama troupe starts performing in a burned-out theater where the great actor Song Danping was killed. One of the actors, Wei Qing, starts seeing strange apparitions that could revive his troupe and deliver him to the same fate as Song Danping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u63yzFmZsPd7jK5T61W8Gf2jugZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187401'),
  ('549080378704379439', 'The Phantom of 42nd Street', 1945, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Albert Herman, William A. Calihan Jr.', 'Milton Raison', 'Dave O''Brien, Jack Mulhall, Kay Aldridge, Alan Mowbray, Frank Jenks, Edythe Elliott, Vera Marshe, Cyril Delevanti', 'NR', 'A theatre critic teams up with a cop to investigate the murder of a Broadway actor.', 'A theatre critic teams up with a cop to investigate the murder of a Broadway actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfc7agRLndVXQh2DeSq4eBpyVpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117836'),
  ('386868341320586681', 'The Phantom of Crestwood', 1932, 'Crime, Mystery', 'J. Walter Ruben, Henry W. Gerrard, James Hartnett', 'Bartlett Cormack', 'Ricardo Cortez, Karen Morley, Anita Louise, Pauline Frederick, H.B. Warner, Mary Duncan, Sam Hardy, Tom Douglas', 'NR', 'Five men have to prove their innocence when a blackmailer is murdered.', 'Five men have to prove their innocence when a blackmailer is murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11nozB68nCjRCaxRuOIuqCSXLpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27114'),
  ('352662345048429609', 'The Phantom of Liberty', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Luis Buñuel, Edmond Richard', 'Luis Buñuel, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Adriana Asti, Milena Vukotić, Jean-Claude Brialy, Monica Vitti, Jean Rochefort, Michel Piccoli, Adolfo Celi, Claude Piéplu', null, 'This Surrealist film, with a title referencing the Communist Manifesto, strings together short incidents based on the life of director Luis Buñuel. Presented as chance encounters, these loosely related, intersecting situations, all without a consistent protagonist, reach from the 19th century to the 1970s. Touching briefly on subjects such as execution, pedophilia, incest, and sex, the film features an array of characters, including a sick father and incompetent police officers.', 'This Surrealist film, with a title referencing the Communist Manifesto, strings together short incidents based on the life of director Luis Buñuel. Presented as chance encounters, these loosely related, intersecting situations, all without a consistent protagonist, reach from the 19th century to the 1970s. Touching briefly on subjects such as execution, pedophilia, incest, and sex, the film features an array of characters, including a sick father and incompetent police officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6cON5ebistPm6AS1XcZZMmKpIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5558'),
  ('116250872582173105', 'The Phantom of Morrisville', 1966, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Bořivoj Zeman, Mojmír Ticháček, Jaroslav Toms', 'František Vlček', 'Oldřich Nový, Květa Fialová, Jana Nováková, Vít Olmer, Waldemar Matuška, Jaroslav Marvan, František Filipovský, Jan Skopeček', null, 'Inspector Brumpby (Jaroslav Marvan) and the young crime reporter Allan Pinkerton (Vít Olmer) attend wedding of Sir Hannibal Morris (Oldrich Nový) with beautiful Clarence (Kveta Fialová). After the ceremony, Clarence''s ex-husband, criminal Manuel Diaz (Waldemar Matuska), who was believed dead, shows up in her room. He wants to get his hands on Clarence and, most importantly, on the money she would inherit in the eventuality of her new husband''s death. Diaz makes attempts on Hannibal''s life. He knows his way about an underground labyrinth in the château and the traps he sets up for Hannibal seem to work, since Hannibal is apparently found dead after an explosion in the labyrinth, after which his body vanishes. The inspector tries to solve the countless mysteries. In this, he is joined by Allan, always ahead of the man of the law in his estimation and judgment of the situation.', 'Inspector Brumpby (Jaroslav Marvan) and the young crime reporter Allan Pinkerton (Vít Olmer) attend wedding of Sir Hannibal Morris (Oldrich Nový) with beautiful Clarence (Kveta Fialová). After the ceremony, Clarence''s ex-husband, criminal Manuel Diaz (Waldemar Matuska), who was believed dead, shows up in her room. He wants to get his hands on Clarence and, most importantly, on the money she would inherit in the eventuality of her new husband''s death. Diaz makes attempts on Hannibal''s life. He knows his way about an underground labyrinth in the château and the traps he sets up for Hannibal seem to work, since Hannibal is apparently found dead after an explosion in the labyrinth, after which his body vanishes. The inspector tries to solve the countless mysteries. In this, he is joined by Allan, always ahead of the man of the law in his estimation and judgment of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVhg406OSoYavpp7HTBNLJdjVef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41981'),
  ('564998749423531024', 'The Phantom of Regular Size', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Tomorowo Taguchi, Kei Fujiwara, Nobu Kanaoka, Shinya Tsukamoto', null, 'A short film where Shinya Tsukamoto experimented with effects and ideas, which eventually resulted in the feature film Tetsuo: The Iron Man.', 'A short film where Shinya Tsukamoto experimented with effects and ideas, which eventually resulted in the feature film Tetsuo: The Iron Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pwRwUj1bKNA6B5Yo1HmkOqZddi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105896'),
  ('795049924544034158', 'The Phantom of Soho', 1964, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Richard Angst, Gisela Anton', 'Ladislas Fodor', 'Dieter Borsche, Barbara Rütting, Hans Söhnker, Peter Vogel, Elisabeth Flickenschildt, Helga Sommerfeld, Werner Peters, Hans Nielsen', 'NR', 'A masked killer is stalking and killing Londoners outside a nightclub.', 'A masked killer is stalking and killing Londoners outside a nightclub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXcuTV0n35JQaEt1QUW7FMdbpnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49062'),
  ('202465641587158777', 'The Phantom of the Monastery', 1934, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Fernando de Fuentes, Ross Fisher, Paul Castelain', 'Fernando de Fuentes, Juan Bustillo Oro, Jorge Pezet', 'Enrique del Campo, Marta Roel, Carlos Villatoro, Paco Martínez, Victorio Blanco, Francisco Lugo, Beltrán de Heredia, Agustín González', null, 'Alfonso, Eduardo and Cristina get lost when visiting a forest. A strange monk finds them and takes them to an ancient convent. There, the three amigos suffer personality changes, specially Cristina who tries to seduce Alfonso in a strange coincidence to a story told by an old monk. After some efforts to escape, Alfonso is trapped inside a jail and more strange and macabre situations happen.', 'Alfonso, Eduardo and Cristina get lost when visiting a forest. A strange monk finds them and takes them to an ancient convent. There, the three amigos suffer personality changes, specially Cristina who tries to seduce Alfonso in a strange coincidence to a story told by an old monk. After some efforts to escape, Alfonso is trapped inside a jail and more strange and macabre situations happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZldhnyaRelI6Y7yuhuq8O9Opsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184940'),
  ('750761698138804246', 'The Phantom of the Open', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kit Fraser, Craig Roberts', 'Scott Murray, Simon Farnaby', 'Mark Rylance, Sally Hawkins, Jonah Lees, Christian Lees, Jake Davies, Mark Lewis Jones, Johann Myers, Rhys Ifans', 'PG-13', 'Maurice Flitcroft, a dreamer and unrelenting optimist, managed to gain entry to The British Open Golf Championship qualifying in 1976 and subsequently shot the worst round in Open history, becoming a folk hero in the process.', 'Maurice Flitcroft, a dreamer and unrelenting optimist, managed to gain entry to The British Open Golf Championship qualifying in 1976 and subsequently shot the worst round in Open history, becoming a folk hero in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bcrhJQLoLNsYX4UGTOMQkCiACA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717151'),
  ('454855825911596204', 'The Phantom of the Opera', 1925, 'Horror, Music', 'Charles Van Enger, Milton Bridenbecker, Rupert Julian', null, 'Lon Chaney, Norman Kerry, Mary Philbin, Arthur Edmund Carewe, Gibson Gowland, Snitz Edwards, John St. Polis, Virginia Pearson', 'NR', 'The deformed Phantom who haunts the Paris Opera House causes murder and mayhem in an attempt to make the woman he loves a star.', 'The deformed Phantom who haunts the Paris Opera House causes murder and mayhem in an attempt to make the woman he loves a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvaYpAYj957C2tlq3vVJPSzGJXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964'),
  ('648034388070202795', 'The Phantom of the Opera', 1962, 'Horror', 'Terence Fisher, Arthur Grant', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Herbert Lom, Heather Sears, Edward de Souza, Thorley Walters, Michael Gough, Harold Goodwin, Martin Miller, Liane Aukin', null, 'A London opera house is haunted by tragic events on its opening night, but when its star is kidnapped, a producer tracks down the Phantom who is intent on seeking his revenge.', 'A London opera house is haunted by tragic events on its opening night, but when its star is kidnapped, a producer tracks down the Phantom who is intent on seeking his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLNKIDXC9dFt9EnjNFxYMctZH1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46330'),
  ('413344743500524483', 'The Phantom of the Opera', 1989, 'Horror, Romance', 'Dwight H. Little, Peter Lyons Collister, Elemér Ragályi', 'Duke Sandefur', 'Robert Englund, Jill Schoelen, Alex Hyde-White, Bill Nighy, Stephanie Lawrence, Terence Harvey, Nathan Lewis, Peter Clapham', 'R', 'An aspiring opera singer finds herself transported back to Victorian-era London -- and into the arms of a reclusive, disfigured maestro determined to make her a star.', 'An aspiring opera singer finds herself transported back to Victorian-era London -- and into the arms of a reclusive, disfigured maestro determined to make her a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie03D5WcIKW5AHXM59KTU6TRvmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86962'),
  ('674489806066737092', 'The Phantom of the Opera', 1998, 'Horror, Romance, Mystery', 'Dario Argento, Ronnie Taylor', 'Gérard Brach, Dario Argento', 'Julian Sands, Asia Argento, Andrea Di Stefano, Nadia Rinaldi, Coralina Cataldi-Tassoni, István Bubik, Lucia Guzzardi, Aldo Massasso', 'R', 'A series of terrifying accidents and brutal murders leave a bloody trail into the subterranean caverns of an Opera house. Below the theatre stalks a man raised by creatures of the underworld.', 'A series of terrifying accidents and brutal murders leave a bloody trail into the subterranean caverns of an Opera house. Below the theatre stalks a man raised by creatures of the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHKKGS3jrPo6wTMhIuBDpWMi7VT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10593'),
  ('302755381737199245', 'The Phantom of the Opera', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Joel Schumacher, Anthony Caron-Delion, John Mathieson', 'Charles Hart, Richard Stilgoe', 'Gerard Butler, Emmy Rossum, Patrick Wilson, Miranda Richardson, Minnie Driver, Ciarán Hinds, Simon Callow, Victor McGuire', 'PG-13', 'A young soprano becomes the obsession of a disfigured and murderous musical genius who lives beneath the Paris Opera House.', 'A young soprano becomes the obsession of a disfigured and murderous musical genius who lives beneath the Paris Opera House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTsp2VTaCBiGs8w05OTXfD97FRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9833'),
  ('488989006801258274', 'The Phantom of the Opera at the Royal Albert Hall', 2011, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Laurence Connor, Nick Morris', 'Richard Stilgoe, Andrew Lloyd Webber, Charles Hart', 'Ramin Karimloo, Sierra Boggess, Hadley Fraser, Liz Robertson, Nick Holder, Wendy Ferguson, Daisy Maywood, Barry James', 'NR', 'A disfigured musical genius, hidden away in the Paris Opera House, terrorises the opera company for the unwitting benefit of a young protégée whom he trains and loves. The 25th anniversary of the first public performance of Phantom of the Opera was celebrated with a grand performance at the Royal Albert Hall in London.', 'A disfigured musical genius, hidden away in the Paris Opera House, terrorises the opera company for the unwitting benefit of a young protégée whom he trains and loves. The 25th anniversary of the first public performance of Phantom of the Opera was celebrated with a grand performance at the Royal Albert Hall in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vf1ryVPBSV2J8dOfCmyv3u0Vu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76115'),
  ('293592741254858484', 'The Phantom of the Operetta', 1960, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Music, Mystery', 'Fernando Cortés, Manuel Muñoz ''Torito'', Jack Draper', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Juan García', 'Germán Valdés, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Luis Aldás, Marcelo Chávez, Famie Kaufman, Antonio Brillas, Julián de Meriche, Armando Sáenz', null, 'Aldo and his girlfriend Lucy reopen an abandoned opera house, but find out that the place is inhabited by a group of Phantoms wearing the Claude Rains 1943 Phantom of the Opera costume.', 'Aldo and his girlfriend Lucy reopen an abandoned opera house, but find out that the place is inhabited by a group of Phantoms wearing the Claude Rains 1943 Phantom of the Opera costume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhMbj2e9jyW2r83hpssvQWTyJuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146296'),
  ('900198970325145731', 'The Phantom Planet', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'William Marshall, Elwood J. Nicholson, Maurice Vaccarino', 'William Telaak, Fred De Gorter, Fred Gebhardt', 'Dean Fredericks, Coleen Gray, Anthony Dexter, Dolores Faith, Francis X. Bushman, Richard Weber, Al Jarvis, Dick Haynes', 'NR', 'After an asteroid draws an astronaut and his ship to its surface, he is miniaturized by the phantom planet''s exotic atmosphere.', 'After an asteroid draws an astronaut and his ship to its surface, he is miniaturized by the phantom planet''s exotic atmosphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqXs9OlNv09D3AIkl14Rlw9pTJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27717'),
  ('852749679684485594', 'The Phantom Stockman', 1953, 'Western', 'Lee Robinson', 'Lee Robinson', 'Chips Rafferty, Henry Murdoch, Victoria Shaw, Max Osbiston, Guy Doleman, Bob Darken, Albert Namatjira', 'NR', 'Kim Marsden inherits a cattle station near Alice Springs after the death of her father. Kim becomes convinced her father was murdered. She sends for a legendary local bushman called the Sundowner, who was one of her father''s best friends.', 'Kim Marsden inherits a cattle station near Alice Springs after the death of her father. Kim becomes convinced her father was murdered. She sends for a legendary local bushman called the Sundowner, who was one of her father''s best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foQLJfWA3PoVaDEMXWPmMQwlWZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353126'),
  ('188393422385159067', 'The Phantom Tollbooth', 1970, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Dave Monahan, Abe Levitow, Lester Shorr', 'Chuck Jones, Sam Rosen', 'Butch Patrick, Mel Blanc, Daws Butler, Candy Candido, Hans Conried, June Foray, Patti Gilbert, Shepard Menken', 'G', 'The Phantom Tollbooth, based upon the children''s adventure novel by Norton Juster, tells the story of a bored young boy named Milo. Unexpectedly receiving a magic tollbooth and, having nothing better to do, Milo drives through it and enters a kingdom in turmoil following the loss of its princesses, Rhyme and Reason.', 'The Phantom Tollbooth, based upon the children''s adventure novel by Norton Juster, tells the story of a bored young boy named Milo. Unexpectedly receiving a magic tollbooth and, having nothing better to do, Milo drives through it and enters a kingdom in turmoil following the loss of its princesses, Rhyme and Reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/totkDxL4QApB4xFr7gc1EdGkz7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28476'),
  ('177605346115902178', 'The Pharmacist', 1933, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Ripley, George Unholz, Frank B. Good', 'W.C. Fields', 'W.C. Fields, Marjorie Kane, Elise Cavanna, Grady Sutton, Lorena Carr', null, 'A henpecked but stoic pharmacist tries to maintain his precarious balance while dealing with demanding customers and his dysfunctional family.', 'A henpecked but stoic pharmacist tries to maintain his precarious balance while dealing with demanding customers and his dysfunctional family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOPt8wyjhgSEbGbNRTMJSidDAQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52282'),
  ('445175039201605752', 'The Pharmacist', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rainer Kaufmann, Klaus Eichhammer', 'Ralf Hertwig, Kathrin Richter', 'Katja Riemann, Jürgen Vogel, Richy Müller, Isabella Parkinson, August Zirner, Dagmar Manzel, Andrea Sawatzki, Friedrich von Thun', null, 'Hella is around 30 and works in a pharmacy. She is waiting for the right man to step into her life, but as she has a certain affinity for losers, she is kind of disillusionized. When she gets to know Levin, a dentist student who likes cars most, her dreams seem to come true. Levin has a very rich grandfather who likes her at first glance. The old man thinks of changing his last will to the condition that Levin has to marry Hella in order to inherit his fortunes. Like in a fairy-tale the door to a new life opens for Hella, but can she take it?', 'Hella is around 30 and works in a pharmacy. She is waiting for the right man to step into her life, but as she has a certain affinity for losers, she is kind of disillusionized. When she gets to know Levin, a dentist student who likes cars most, her dreams seem to come true. Levin has a very rich grandfather who likes her at first glance. The old man thinks of changing his last will to the condition that Levin has to marry Hella in order to inherit his fortunes. Like in a fairy-tale the door to a new life opens for Hella, but can she take it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1xH1gwJ9fQzRaKnhAAY3LKgWNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9881'),
  ('578511632204397656', 'The Pharmacist', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Jean Veber, Laurent Fleutot', 'Jean Veber', 'Guillaume Depardieu, Vincent Perez, Kad Merad, Clara Bellar, Alice Taglioni, Elea Oberon, Irina Ninova, Rochelle Redfield', null, 'An ecological pharmacist uses ancient Celtic techniques to murder industrial magnates whose practices harm the planet.', 'An ecological pharmacist uses ancient Celtic techniques to murder industrial magnates whose practices harm the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD3STnCzrX4YzhSCG4zcQMFi0Zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65292'),
  ('504711572083664971', 'The Phenix City Story', 1955, 'Crime', 'Phil Karlson, Harry Neumann, Maurice Vaccarino', 'Daniel Mainwaring, Crane Wilbur', 'John McIntire, Richard Kiley, Kathryn Grant, Edward Andrews, Lenka Peterson, Biff McGuire, Truman Smith, Jean Carson', null, 'A crime-busting lawyer and his initially reluctant attorney father take on the forces that run gambling and prostitution in their small Southern town.', 'A crime-busting lawyer and his initially reluctant attorney father take on the forces that run gambling and prostitution in their small Southern town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VB4tGVtym2qXodfxQsCAJBKkSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35956'),
  ('947410379185276143', 'The Phenom', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ryan Samul, Noah Buschel', 'Noah Buschel', 'Johnny Simmons, Ethan Hawke, Paul Giamatti, Sophie Kennedy Clark, Alison Elliott, Yul Vazquez, Paul Adelstein, Marin Ireland', null, 'A rookie pitcher undergoes psychotherapy to overcome the yips.', 'A rookie pitcher undergoes psychotherapy to overcome the yips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghzeEBAFhWtZFl0awCrC2xyRZKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390512'),
  ('604748213646125096', 'The Phenomenon', 2020, 'Documentary', 'James Fox', 'Marc Barasch', 'Peter Coyote, Chris Mellon, Don Berliner, Jacques Vallée, James Fox, Gaylan King, George Knapp, John Podesta', null, 'This documentary examines unidentified aerial phenomenon. With testimony from high-ranking government officials and NASA Astronauts, Senator Harry Reid says it "makes the incredible credible."', 'This documentary examines unidentified aerial phenomenon. With testimony from high-ranking government officials and NASA Astronauts, Senator Harry Reid says it "makes the incredible credible."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2WWRtyYKrmLjtXhm53GMsGQQ2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745272'),
  ('451405301220242416', 'The Phenomenon', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Duncan McMath', null, 'Ronaldo, Zinédine Zidane, Christian Vieri, Roberto Carlos, Diego Simeone, Bebeto, Romário, Paolo Maldini', null, 'Featuring contributions from legendary team-mates and opponents, friends and family, this is the definitive story of Ronaldo, encompassing his meteoric rise, his spectacular fall (including one of football’s biggest mysteries) and the World Cup’s greatest ever redemption story.', 'Featuring contributions from legendary team-mates and opponents, friends and family, this is the definitive story of Ronaldo, encompassing his meteoric rise, his spectacular fall (including one of football’s biggest mysteries) and the World Cup’s greatest ever redemption story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkrKnExjZwGTKdRIOZZ2lEykFxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1038205'),
  ('295043599837358840', 'The Philadelphia Experiment', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Stewart Raffill, Dick Bush, Gail Joyce Fortmuller', 'Michael Janover, William Gray', 'Michael Paré, Nancy Allen, Eric Christmas, Bobby Di Cicco, Louise Latham, Kene Holliday, Joe Dorsey, Michael Currie', 'PG', 'Based on an "actual event" that took place in 1943. About a US Navy Destroyer Escort that disappeared from the Philadelphia Naval Shipyard, and sent two men 40 years into the future to 1984.', 'Based on an "actual event" that took place in 1943. About a US Navy Destroyer Escort that disappeared from the Philadelphia Naval Shipyard, and sent two men 40 years into the future to 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loKzciPI19uLZ6GeSYjInzdGg60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10606'),
  ('260116111035496116', 'The Philadelphia Experiment', 2012, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Paul Ziller, Michael C. Blundell, Jody Ryan', 'Andy Briggs', 'Ryan Robbins, Nicholas Lea, Malcolm McDowell, Emilie Ullerup, Michael Paré, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle, Gina Holden, John Reardon', 'PG-13', 'A secret government research project tries reviving the World War II "Philadelphia Experiment," which was an attempt to create a cloaking device to render warships invisible. When the experiment succeeds, it brings back the original ship (the Eldridge) that disappeared during the first test in 1943 - which brings death and destruction to the 21st century. It''s up to the sole survivor of the first experiment and his granddaughter to stop it.', 'A secret government research project tries reviving the World War II "Philadelphia Experiment," which was an attempt to create a cloaking device to render warships invisible. When the experiment succeeds, it brings back the original ship (the Eldridge) that disappeared during the first test in 1943 - which brings death and destruction to the 21st century. It''s up to the sole survivor of the first experiment and his granddaughter to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7mGfgQqhv7i3s5yPNXFpBKTwge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122293'),
  ('756941110179619963', 'The Philadelphia Story', 1940, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, Joseph Ruttenberg, Edward Woehler', 'Donald Ogden Stewart, Waldo Salt', 'Cary Grant, Katharine Hepburn, James Stewart, Ruth Hussey, John Howard, Roland Young, John Halliday, Mary Nash', 'NR', 'When a rich woman''s ex-husband and a tabloid-type reporter turn up just before her planned remarriage, she begins to learn the truth about herself.', 'When a rich woman''s ex-husband and a tabloid-type reporter turn up just before her planned remarriage, she begins to learn the truth about herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKUubjvxO78XDts6VP1Ggcp4R9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981'),
  ('24173860449822662', 'The Philly Kid', 2012, 'Drama, Action', 'Jason Connery, Marco Fargnoli', 'Adam Mervis', 'Wes Chatham, Devon Sawa, Sarah Butler, Neal McDonough, Lucky Johnson, Chris Browning, Adam Mervis, Bernard Hocke', null, 'A former NCAA champion wrestler is paroled after 10 years in prison. Now, to save a friend''s life, in a series of cage fights he must agree to do the impossible - lose.', 'A former NCAA champion wrestler is paroled after 10 years in prison. Now, to save a friend''s life, in a series of cage fights he must agree to do the impossible - lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pN0UFnqzkIFjmhH8ICKVAqxNBdo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102222'),
  ('309102132873046706', 'The Philosopher', 1989, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rudolf Thome, Reinhold Vorschneider, Irmela Baumert', 'Rudolf Thome', 'Johannes Herrschmann, Adriana Altaras, Friederike Tiefenbacher, Claudia Matschulla, Jürgen Wink, Werner Gerber, Marquard Bohm', null, 'The obscure philosopher Georg Hermes almost withdrew from the world to concentrate on his studies, especially Heraclitus, having no relationship since his mother''s death. When he wants a new suit for a lecture (actually very minor) about his new book, he meets the sisters Franziska, Breate and Marthe, who run a boutique, share a house and have a lover each. Those invite Georg to dinner, Franziska even on dates. Falling off a boat he gets naked with her, and they become lovers. The girls all take to Hermes and get him to move in, spoiled by all and offered polygamy.', 'The obscure philosopher Georg Hermes almost withdrew from the world to concentrate on his studies, especially Heraclitus, having no relationship since his mother''s death. When he wants a new suit for a lecture (actually very minor) about his new book, he meets the sisters Franziska, Breate and Marthe, who run a boutique, share a house and have a lover each. Those invite Georg to dinner, Franziska even on dates. Falling off a boat he gets naked with her, and they become lovers. The girls all take to Hermes and get him to move in, spoiled by all and offered polygamy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doCGjgUA5yZO2izxnAZL0gbUQ62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162820'),
  ('899855532354693999', 'The Philosopher''s Stone', 1958, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Satyajit Ray, Nityananda Datta, Tapeshwar Prasad', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Tulsi Chakraborty, Kali Bannerjee, Ranibala, Gangapada Basu, Haridhan Mukhopadhyay, Jahar Roy, Bireswar Sen, Mani Srimani', null, 'An underpaid middle-aged clerk finds a stone that changes iron to gold on touch. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2007.', 'An underpaid middle-aged clerk finds a stone that changes iron to gold on touch. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWWQiaXmlIAzKj21bBNSLqMRPk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169781'),
  ('852335298803644768', 'The Phoenician Scheme', 2025, 'Comedy, Adventure, Crime', 'Bruno Delbonnel, Wes Anderson, Tom Rye', 'Wes Anderson', 'Benicio del Toro, Mia Threapleton, Michael Cera, Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston, Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade', 'PG-13', 'Wealthy businessman Zsa-zsa Korda appoints his only daughter, a nun, as sole heir to his estate. As Korda embarks on a new enterprise, they soon become the target of scheming tycoons, foreign terrorists, and determined assassins.', 'Wealthy businessman Zsa-zsa Korda appoints his only daughter, a nun, as sole heir to his estate. As Korda embarks on a new enterprise, they soon become the target of scheming tycoons, foreign terrorists, and determined assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2jxeYLXTYfu0bqJmnLGIgZswib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137350'),
  ('473879148760958205', 'The Phoenix Incident', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Keith Arem, Brandon Cox, Christian Butcher', 'Keith Arem', 'Yuri Lowenthal, Travis Willingham, Troy Baker, Liam O''Brien, Michael Adamthwaite, Brian Bloom, Jamie Tisdale, James Patrick Stewart', 'NR', 'A number of ''missing person'' cases are reported in Phoenix, Arizona when an unexplained light appears in the sky one night in 1997.', 'A number of ''missing person'' cases are reported in Phoenix, Arizona when an unexplained light appears in the sky one night in 1997.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EWUeUO4IyiKwlX14XLUiCRMUNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321039'),
  ('348648789738989525', 'The Phone', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Park Sang-min, Kim Bong-joo, Park Se-moon', 'Kim Bong-joo', 'Son Hyun-joo, Uhm Ji-won, Bae Sung-woo, Roh Jeong-eui, Jang In-sub, Jo Dal-hwan, Lee Cheol-min, Hwang Seok-jeong', null, 'When his wife is murdered, Dong-ho loses the light in his life, breaks down and falls into depression. But he knows that as long as the killer is still around, he can not get out of his loss. Then, one day, he receives a call and can not believe who he is listening to.', 'When his wife is murdered, Dong-ho loses the light in his life, breaks down and falls into depression. But he knows that as long as the killer is still around, he can not get out of his loss. Then, one day, he receives a call and can not believe who he is listening to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXslVikPfGoO0ip0Z32Ap23gxea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367882'),
  ('101903943266786169', 'The Phone Call', 2013, 'Drama', 'Mat Kirkby, Ole Bratt Birkeland', 'Mat Kirkby, James Lucas', 'Sally Hawkins, Jim Broadbent, Edward Hogg, Prunella Scales', null, 'Heather is a shy lady who works in a helpline call centre. When she receives a phone call from a mystery man, she has no idea that the encounter will change her life forever.', 'Heather is a shy lady who works in a helpline call centre. When she receives a phone call from a mystery man, she has no idea that the encounter will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxgAsqknOMYe8DPiqeOcFJVna3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220809'),
  ('18424761116280087', 'The Photograph', 1987, 'Drama', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Aris Stavrou, Nikos Papatakis', 'Nikos Papatakis', 'Christos Tsagas, Aris Retsos, Zozo Zarpa, Despina Tomazani, Hristos Valavanidis, Marina Delivoria, Yannis Totsikas, Stratos Pahis', null, 'A young Greek man goes to Paris seeking help from a solitary and almost misanthropic distant relative who works as a furrier. With him, he takes nothing from his homeland but a photograph of a woman that he finds on the pavement. A misunderstanding regarding the photograph sets off a series of dramatic misunderstandings which trap him in a vicious circle of lies and fantasies.', 'A young Greek man goes to Paris seeking help from a solitary and almost misanthropic distant relative who works as a furrier. With him, he takes nothing from his homeland but a photograph of a woman that he finds on the pavement. A misunderstanding regarding the photograph sets off a series of dramatic misunderstandings which trap him in a vicious circle of lies and fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geuJk6paiy1bcdM678nrgQSw936.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270286'),
  ('930188723614383249', 'The Photograph', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jakub Porembski, Mark Anthony Little, Geoffrey A. Ehrlich', 'Stella Meghie', 'Issa Rae, LaKeith Stanfield, Chanté Adams, Y''lan Noel, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Lil Rel Howery, Teyonah Parris, Jasmine Cephas Jones', 'PG-13', 'When famed photographer Christina Eames dies unexpectedly, she leaves her estranged daughter, Mae, hurt, angry and full of questions. When Mae finds a photograph tucked away in a safe-deposit box, she soon finds herself delving into her mother''s early life -- an investigation that leads to an unexpected romance with a rising journalist.', 'When famed photographer Christina Eames dies unexpectedly, she leaves her estranged daughter, Mae, hurt, angry and full of questions. When Mae finds a photograph tucked away in a safe-deposit box, she soon finds herself delving into her mother''s early life -- an investigation that leads to an unexpected romance with a rising journalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdqZqIcWt0Ne2Io2OA9iWqqMuCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589049'),
  ('392498504820515130', 'The Photographer', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ji Hyun-sook', null, 'Jo Yong-bok, Lee Soo-jung, Oh Joo-ha, Lee Soo, Chae Won', null, 'As the photographer Minho starts shooting in the studio with a new concept, the female model is killed in the accident. The process takes place accidentally on the camera and the picture is sold at a high price. Minho, who suddenly touched a great deal of money, is unable to win the remorse of conscience and becomes a prodigal life, devouring all the money he had. Minhoo, who became a shaggy person, started to take pictures again after killing the model, and curator Seung Hee, who sold the photographs, finally found Minho''s truth and set up a new plan.', 'As the photographer Minho starts shooting in the studio with a new concept, the female model is killed in the accident. The process takes place accidentally on the camera and the picture is sold at a high price. Minho, who suddenly touched a great deal of money, is unable to win the remorse of conscience and becomes a prodigal life, devouring all the money he had. Minhoo, who became a shaggy person, started to take pictures again after killing the model, and curator Seung Hee, who sold the photographs, finally found Minho''s truth and set up a new plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlwRMHq36xITPNmzmyPYHaaaPvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445585'),
  ('125233294626713552', 'The Photographer of Mauthausen', 2018, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Mar Targarona, Aitor Mantxola, Francesc Prat', 'Alfred Pérez-Fargas, Roger Danès', 'Mario Casas, Richard van Weyden, Alain Hernández, Adrià Salazar, Eduard Buch, Stefan Weinert, Rubén Yuste, Nikola Stojanovic', 'R', 'Spanish photographer Francesc Boix, imprisoned in the Mauthausen-Gusen concentration camp, works in the SS Photographic Service. Between 1943 and 1945, he hides, with the help of other prisoners, thousands of negatives, with the purpose of showing the freed world the atrocities committed by the Nazis, exhaustively documented. He will be a key witness during the Nuremberg Trials.', 'Spanish photographer Francesc Boix, imprisoned in the Mauthausen-Gusen concentration camp, works in the SS Photographic Service. Between 1943 and 1945, he hides, with the help of other prisoners, thousands of negatives, with the purpose of showing the freed world the atrocities committed by the Nazis, exhaustively documented. He will be a key witness during the Nuremberg Trials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6b4L0uLVgFsDfqPx0sFZbCRwIKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528949'),
  ('376509518990203310', 'The Photographer: Murder in Pinamar', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Alejandra Martín, Alejandro Hartmann', 'Tatiana Merenuk, Alejandro Hartmann, Gabriel Bobillo', null, null, 'The murder of photographer José Luis Cabezas in the summer of 1997 deeply shakes Argentina, and ends up revealing a mafia scheme in which the political and economic powers appear to be involved.', 'The murder of photographer José Luis Cabezas in the summer of 1997 deeply shakes Argentina, and ends up revealing a mafia scheme in which the political and economic powers appear to be involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOm7VAlsuJ5ixXg3pgKY8a7uhqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962920'),
  ('347156557805841101', 'The Photographical Congress Arrives in Lyon', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Auguste Lumière, P.J.C. Janssen', null, 'Down the gangway, photographers leave the deck of a riverboat in large numbers.', 'Down the gangway, photographers leave the deck of a riverboat in large numbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcJ0wz0eylRLYKy6w3LkF4xjFVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208234'),
  ('950909488933424741', 'The Physician', 2013, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Philipp Stölzl, Hagen Bogdanski', 'Christoph Müller, Philipp Stölzl, Simon Block', 'Tom Payne, Ben Kingsley, Stellan Skarsgård, Olivier Martinez, Emma Rigby, Elyas M''Barek, Fahri Yardım, Makram J. Khoury', 'R', 'England, 1021: Born in a miserable mining town, Robert Cole swears to become a physician and vanquish disease and death. His harsh path of many years, a quest for knowledge besieged by countless challenges and sacrifices, leads him to the remote Isfahan, in Persia, where he meets Ibn Sina, the greatest healer of his time.', 'England, 1021: Born in a miserable mining town, Robert Cole swears to become a physician and vanquish disease and death. His harsh path of many years, a quest for knowledge besieged by countless challenges and sacrifices, leads him to the remote Isfahan, in Persia, where he meets Ibn Sina, the greatest healer of his time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18eJr4Fc4HKymLgKLgGQbD37SPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169881'),
  ('930408073108231635', 'The Physician II', 2025, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Philipp Stölzl, Frank Griebe', 'Stewart Harcourt', 'Tom Payne, Emily Cox, Aidan Gillen, Áine Rose Daly, Owen Teale, Liam Cunningham, Emma Rigby, Sara Kestelman', null, '1050 AD: Robert Cole returns to England to bring the medical light of the Orient to his countrymen. But he fails because of the intrigues of the established London doctors, who feel threatened by the new knowledge. And it is not only the human body that is full of seemingly impenetrable secrets, the soul also holds its own mysteries.', '1050 AD: Robert Cole returns to England to bring the medical light of the Orient to his countrymen. But he fails because of the intrigues of the established London doctors, who feel threatened by the new knowledge. And it is not only the human body that is full of seemingly impenetrable secrets, the soul also holds its own mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QUEFxTno1ztSOHyKJDfGuG5Rsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219548'),
  ('597750280742772439', 'The Physician of the Castle', 1908, 'Drama, Thriller', null, null, null, null, 'Two criminals lure a doctor away from his home with a phony note about a child''s illness. After the doctor rushes off, the criminals break into his house and menace his wife and child. By the time the doctor realizes what has happened, his family faces a desperate situation.', 'Two criminals lure a doctor away from his home with a phony note about a child''s illness. After the doctor rushes off, the criminals break into his house and menace his wife and child. By the time the doctor realizes what has happened, his family faces a desperate situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsjH6YgNPFDHXhYSoK9y5HVfKrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185442'),
  ('916884078883109690', 'The Pianist', 2002, 'Drama, War', 'Roman Polanski, Paweł Edelman, Weronika Migoń', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Adrien Brody, Thomas Kretschmann, Frank Finlay, Maureen Lipman, Emilia Fox, Ed Stoppard, Julia Rayner, Jessica Kate Meyer', 'R', 'The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman''s experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.', 'The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman''s experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hFvxCCWrTmCYwfy7yum0GKRi3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423'),
  ('715210305673546123', 'The Piano', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stuart Dryburgh, Jane Campion, Colin Englert', 'Jane Campion', 'Holly Hunter, Harvey Keitel, Sam Neill, Anna Paquin, Cliff Curtis, Kerry Walker, Ian Mune, Geneviève Lemon', 'R', 'When an arranged marriage brings Ada and her spirited daughter to the wilderness of nineteenth-century New Zealand, she finds herself locked in a battle of wills with both her controlling husband and a rugged frontiersman to whom she develops a forbidden attraction.', 'When an arranged marriage brings Ada and her spirited daughter to the wilderness of nineteenth-century New Zealand, she finds herself locked in a battle of wills with both her controlling husband and a rugged frontiersman to whom she develops a forbidden attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUxjG6baSzGIgP7R8BQI5rpMuET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713'),
  ('897231034646994539', 'The Piano Accident', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux, Christian Alzieu', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Adèle Exarchopoulos, Jérôme Commandeur, Sandrine Kiberlain, Karim Leklou, Gabin Visona, Morena Gosset, Marie Lanchas, Luc Schwarz', null, 'Social media sensation Magalie, known for posting shocking content, suffers a serious accident while filming one of her videos. She retreats to the mountains, accompanied by her assistant. Her peace is disrupted when a journalist begins blackmailing her.', 'Social media sensation Magalie, known for posting shocking content, suffers a serious accident while filming one of her videos. She retreats to the mountains, accompanied by her assistant. Her peace is disrupted when a journalist begins blackmailing her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdfAz6tvp67G9zxONtGF2Vjrnmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313144'),
  ('39748419251470944', 'The Piano Forest', 2007, 'Music, Animation, Drama', 'Masayuki Kojima, Tomohiko Ito, Toru Takahashi', 'Ryuta Hourai', 'Aya Ueto, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Mayuko Fukuda, Chizuru Ikewaki, Rica Matsumoto, Hiroyuki Amano, Kazuko Kurosawa, Hiroyuki Miyasako', null, 'Shuhei Amamiya transfers to Moriwaki Elementary filled with hope and ambition. But it doesn''t take long before he gets picked on by the class bullies, and gets involved in a dare to play the mysterious piano in the forest. Igniting his meeting with an equally enigmatic child, Kai Ichinose, who seems to be the only one capable getting sound out of the thought to be broken piano.', 'Shuhei Amamiya transfers to Moriwaki Elementary filled with hope and ambition. But it doesn''t take long before he gets picked on by the class bullies, and gets involved in a dare to play the mysterious piano in the forest. Igniting his meeting with an equally enigmatic child, Kai Ichinose, who seems to be the only one capable getting sound out of the thought to be broken piano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BVofIiyDjv41Sn6WaKjXHft6RG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59298'),
  ('71202522373271706', 'The Piano in a Factory', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jeremy Zhou, Zhang Meng', 'Zhang Meng', 'Wang Qianyuan, Qin Hailu, Jang Shin-young, Guo Yongzhen, Tian Yu', null, 'To fight for custody of his daughter who loves playing the piano, a steel factory worker decides to forge a piano from scratch.', 'To fight for custody of his daughter who loves playing the piano, a steel factory worker decides to forge a piano from scratch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vI4ggulcfZxko9S2dLdmKMOiB4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72245'),
  ('293870475278308632', 'The Piano Lesson', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Mike Gioulakis, Malcolm Washington', 'Virgil Williams, Malcolm Washington', 'John David Washington, Danielle Deadwyler, Samuel L. Jackson, Ray Fisher, Michael Potts, Corey Hawkins, Gail Bean, Jerrika Hinton', 'PG-13', 'A brother and sister''s battle over a prized heirloom piano unleashes haunting truths about how the past is perceived — and who defines a family legacy.', 'A brother and sister''s battle over a prized heirloom piano unleashes haunting truths about how the past is perceived — and who defines a family legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgampq63AqCrza6bnvmWqCcvCzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804406'),
  ('980891473976042842', 'The Piano Teacher', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Haneke, Christian Berger, Katharina Biró', 'Michael Haneke', 'Isabelle Huppert, Annie Girardot, Benoît Magimel, Susanne Lothar, Udo Samel, Anna Sigalevitch, Cornelia Köndgen, Thomas Weinhappel', 'R', 'Erika Kohut, a sexually repressed piano teacher living with her domineering mother, meets a young man who starts romantically pursuing her.', 'Erika Kohut, a sexually repressed piano teacher living with her domineering mother, meets a young man who starts romantically pursuing her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNHKYQnP1RnqEhkivHJzBPb4MOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1791'),
  ('76577085744853818', 'The Piano Tuner', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Olivier Treiner', 'Olivier Treiner', 'Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Danièle Lebrun, Grégory Gadebois, Emeline Gue, Nicole David, Micheline Levchin', null, 'Adrien is a young pianist prodigy. He collapsed psychologically having failed in a renowned competition and henceforth works as a piano tuner. As remedy to this life, he invents a blind person''s mask to penetrate into the intimacy of his customers. This subtlety allows Adrien to get back the taste for music. But since he sees things he should not see, Adrien ends up witnessing a murder.', 'Adrien is a young pianist prodigy. He collapsed psychologically having failed in a renowned competition and henceforth works as a piano tuner. As remedy to this life, he invents a blind person''s mask to penetrate into the intimacy of his customers. This subtlety allows Adrien to get back the taste for music. But since he sees things he should not see, Adrien ends up witnessing a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/918z2ggVSvUYLBJYyFdKPL3RE4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190681'),
  ('1107334229884700047', 'The Piano Tuner of Earthquakes', 2005, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama, Music', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay, Nicholas D. Knowland', 'Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay, Alan Passes', 'Amira Casar, Gottfried John, Assumpta Serna, César Saratxu, Ljubisa Gruicic, Marc Bischoff, Henning Peker, Gilles Gavois', null, 'Dark fairytale about a demonic doctor who abducts a beautiful opera singer with designs on transforming her into a mechanical nightingale.', 'Dark fairytale about a demonic doctor who abducts a beautiful opera singer with designs on transforming her into a mechanical nightingale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3vfQ4tsbw6qcw7RJC16RFLwlaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44502'),
  ('387829987138113628', 'The Pick-up Artist', 1987, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'James Toback, Thomas A. Reilly, Ken Ornstein', 'James Toback', 'Molly Ringwald, Robert Downey Jr., Dennis Hopper, Danny Aiello, Harvey Keitel, Vanessa Williams, Mildred Dunnock, Brian Hamill', 'PG-13', 'A womanizer meets his match when he falls for the daughter of a gambling addict who is in debt to the mob.', 'A womanizer meets his match when he falls for the daughter of a gambling addict who is in debt to the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMhtuRY6iF5akKeKd0t6BeM0mJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17258'),
  ('517132971269242186', 'The Pickle', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Paul Mazursky, Fred Murphy, Henry J. Bronchtein', 'Paul Mazursky', 'Danny Aiello, Dyan Cannon, Clotilde Courau, Shelley Winters, Barry Miller, Jerry Stiller, Chris Penn, Little Richard', 'R', 'Harry Stone always dreamed of making "The Great American Movie." Instead, he made "The Pickle" - a teenage sci-fi flick about a flying cucumber. Harry just wanted to get out of debt; now everyone he''s ever known, loved and neglected is standing in line for tickets.', 'Harry Stone always dreamed of making "The Great American Movie." Instead, he made "The Pickle" - a teenage sci-fi flick about a flying cucumber. Harry just wanted to get out of debt; now everyone he''s ever known, loved and neglected is standing in line for tickets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCzdS1R27F675iSUIfOHQKxFpiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40881'),
  ('970397393025947278', 'The Pickup', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Tim Story, Larry Blanford', 'Kevin Burrows, Matt Mider', 'Eddie Murphy, Pete Davidson, Keke Palmer, Eva Longoria, Jack Kesy, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Andrew Dice Clay, Marshawn Lynch', 'R', 'A routine cash pickup takes a wild turn when mismatched armored truck drivers Russell and Travis are ambushed by ruthless criminals led by savvy mastermind Zoe.', 'A routine cash pickup takes a wild turn when mismatched armored truck drivers Russell and Travis are ambushed by ruthless criminals led by savvy mastermind Zoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFWvWhfAvij8UIngg2Vf6JV95Cr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106289'),
  ('575474123920227339', 'The Pickwick Papers', 1952, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Noel Langley, Wilkie Cooper', 'Noel Langley', 'James Hayter, James Donald, Nigel Patrick, Joyce Grenfell, Hermione Gingold, Hermione Baddeley, Donald Wolfit, Harry Fowler', 'NR', 'The Pickwick Club sends Mr. Pickwick and a group of friends to travel across England and to report back on the interesting things they find...', 'The Pickwick Club sends Mr. Pickwick and a group of friends to travel across England and to report back on the interesting things they find...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyp0FiB8JUH26OZpCSH0dUBQjDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139204'),
  ('599334584155874423', 'The Picnic', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'Summertime, and Mickey takes Minnie on a picnic. While Pluto is chasing a rabbit, and Mickey and Minnie are doing a courtship dance, every animal in the woods is busy making off with their picnic food. And then the rain comes.', 'Summertime, and Mickey takes Minnie on a picnic. While Pluto is chasing a rabbit, and Mickey and Minnie are doing a courtship dance, every animal in the woods is busy making off with their picnic food. And then the rain comes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWFwFB0MTWDvs72ZAqUyNIKT2Gi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162965'),
  ('988593368831343445', 'The Picture of Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'David I. Strasser, Justin Sebastian', 'Jessica L. Randall', 'Chelsea Hobbs, Giles Panton, Mila Jones, Lauren K. Robek, Erin Boyes, Brenda Crichlow, Karen Kruper, Matt Hamilton', 'PG', 'Ember Morley, a graphic designer and aspiring storybook illustrator in Manhattan is surprised when she learns she has inherited her Grandmother’s Christmas tree farm. She heads back to her hometown of Willow Hill in order to sell it before Christmas, but the charming townspeople convince her to stay a little longer and help plan their annual Christmas Tree Festival. When forced to work with Brandon Hart, the farm’s handsome caretaker, Ember is reminded of the things she once wanted in life.', 'Ember Morley, a graphic designer and aspiring storybook illustrator in Manhattan is surprised when she learns she has inherited her Grandmother’s Christmas tree farm. She heads back to her hometown of Willow Hill in order to sell it before Christmas, but the charming townspeople convince her to stay a little longer and help plan their annual Christmas Tree Festival. When forced to work with Brandon Hart, the farm’s handsome caretaker, Ember is reminded of the things she once wanted in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkOJSwzTaFaLa1MszAqqyweoxHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854146'),
  ('758359719263623644', 'The Picture of Dorian Gray', 1945, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Albert Lewin, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Albert Lewin', 'Hurd Hatfield, George Sanders, Donna Reed, Angela Lansbury, Peter Lawford, Lowell Gilmore, Richard Fraser, Douglas Walton', 'NR', 'A corrupt young man somehow keeps his youthful beauty, but a special painting gradually reveals his inner ugliness to all.', 'A corrupt young man somehow keeps his youthful beauty, but a special painting gradually reveals his inner ugliness to all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfvcsmAzdie8YuWI0JpO2u1uzfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16559'),
  ('448534530065835030', 'The Picture of Dorian Gray', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Fantasy, Horror', 'Richard John Taylor', 'Richard John Taylor', 'Leone Kessel, Lizzy Willis, Allison Blair, Triana Terry, Rula Lenska', null, 'A modern day retelling of Oscar Wilde’s cautionary tale, it follows actress Dorian as she travels to Matera to be tutored by reclusive screen icon Lady Amelia Wotton for her upcoming Broadway debut as Lady Macbeth. When Wotton asks her granddaughter Evie to photograph Dorian, the girls grow close but is their relationship as innocent as it appears to be, or is there a more sinister curse at work?', 'A modern day retelling of Oscar Wilde’s cautionary tale, it follows actress Dorian as she travels to Matera to be tutored by reclusive screen icon Lady Amelia Wotton for her upcoming Broadway debut as Lady Macbeth. When Wotton asks her granddaughter Evie to photograph Dorian, the girls grow close but is their relationship as innocent as it appears to be, or is there a more sinister curse at work?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WGQpArN7lrBIUeIguGnVMuBUGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1179188'),
  ('842356928208359125', 'The Picture Show Man', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Power, Geoff Burton, Mark Egerton', 'Joan Long', 'John Meillon, Rod Taylor, John Ewart, Judy Morris, Garry McDonald, Harold Hopkins, Jeanie Drynan, Sally Conabere', 'PG', 'A man, his son and a piano player travel around Australia showing the first silent movies', 'A man, his son and a piano player travel around Australia showing the first silent movies', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hZtYhbScpcTjAcYr6UFxuZOgsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41100'),
  ('657629907301568422', 'The Pied Piper', 1933, 'Animation, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'George Gramlich, Allan Watson, Marion Darlington, Harriette Haddon', 'NR', 'The people of Hamelin, overrun with rats, offer a bag of gold to anyone who can get rid of the rats. A piper offers to do the job, and successfully lures the rats into a mirage of cheese, which disappears. The citizens, disappointed that all he did was play a tune, offer only pocket change. The piper, angered, plays a new tune that has all the children of the city follow him, even the new twins the stork is preparing to deliver.', 'The people of Hamelin, overrun with rats, offer a bag of gold to anyone who can get rid of the rats. A piper offers to do the job, and successfully lures the rats into a mirage of cheese, which disappears. The citizens, disappointed that all he did was play a tune, offer only pocket change. The piper, angered, plays a new tune that has all the children of the city follow him, even the new twins the stork is preparing to deliver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jLbWLcLn1akSDZePKm7Wta80Jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67596'),
  ('1038555920965947921', 'The Pied Piper', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'Irving Pichel, Edward Cronjager, Tom Dudley', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Monty Woolley, Roddy McDowall, Anne Baxter, Otto Preminger, J. Carrol Naish, Lester Matthews, Jill Esmond, Ferike Boros', null, 'Englishman Mr. Howard is on a fishing holiday in eastern France when the Germans invade in 1940. Setting off to try and get back home he is persuaded to take along the two Cavanaugh children, and as his journey progresses his family keeps growing in size. Once in German-occupied northern France a new problem arises — the risk of being heard speaking English.', 'Englishman Mr. Howard is on a fishing holiday in eastern France when the Germans invade in 1940. Setting off to try and get back home he is persuaded to take along the two Cavanaugh children, and as his journey progresses his family keeps growing in size. Once in German-occupied northern France a new problem arises — the risk of being heard speaking English.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEX58msBJx0Pcb4rYPHZaV8La0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84085'),
  ('446532557308594831', 'The Pied Piper', 1972, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Jacques Demy, Peter Suschitzky', 'Jacques Demy, Mark Peploe, Andrew Birkin', 'Donovan, Diana Dors, Donald Pleasence, Roy Kinnear, John Hurt, Michael Hordern, Jack Wild, Peter Vaughan', null, 'Greed, corruption, ignorance, and disease. Midsummer, 1349: the Black Death reaches northern Germany. Minstrels go to Hamelin for the Mayor''s daughter''s wedding to the Baron''s son. He wants her dowry to pay his army while his father taxes the people to build a cathedral he thinks will save his soul. A local apothecary who''s a Jew seeks a treatment for the plague; the priests charge him with witchcraft. One of the minstrels, who has soothed the Mayor''s daughter with his music, promises to rid the town of rats for the fee. The Mayor agrees, then renigs. In the morning, the plague, the Jew''s trial, and the Piper''s revenge come at once.', 'Greed, corruption, ignorance, and disease. Midsummer, 1349: the Black Death reaches northern Germany. Minstrels go to Hamelin for the Mayor''s daughter''s wedding to the Baron''s son. He wants her dowry to pay his army while his father taxes the people to build a cathedral he thinks will save his soul. A local apothecary who''s a Jew seeks a treatment for the plague; the priests charge him with witchcraft. One of the minstrels, who has soothed the Mayor''s daughter with his music, promises to rid the town of rats for the fee. The Mayor agrees, then renigs. In the morning, the plague, the Jew''s trial, and the Piper''s revenge come at once.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qUGAMLlGzPJFI2iV9W9KogsQdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185949'),
  ('60526388798175345', 'The Pied Piper', 1986, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Jiří Barta, Miroslav Jirounek, Vladimír Malík', 'Kamil Pixa', 'Oldřich Kaiser, Jiří Lábus, Michal Pavlíček, Vilém Čok', 'NR', 'A darkly brilliant stop-motion adaptation of The Pied Piper of Hamelin about a plague of rats that punish townsfolk corrupt with greed. One of Czechoslovakia''s most ambitious animation projects of the 1980s, notable for its unusual dark art direction, innovative animation techniques and use of a fictitious language.', 'A darkly brilliant stop-motion adaptation of The Pied Piper of Hamelin about a plague of rats that punish townsfolk corrupt with greed. One of Czechoslovakia''s most ambitious animation projects of the 1980s, notable for its unusual dark art direction, innovative animation techniques and use of a fictitious language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw4ZXFrj1fuwbbtLwg9C7JAfEy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82094'),
  ('207941295629140438', 'The Pied Piper of Guadalupe', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester the cat imitates the Pied Piper of Hamelin to lure a group of mice into a jug that he seals with a cork. But Speedy Gonzales won''t be hypnotized by Sylvester''s flute and gradually rescues his friends from Sylvester''s clutches.', 'Sylvester the cat imitates the Pied Piper of Hamelin to lure a group of mice into a jug that he seals with a cork. But Speedy Gonzales won''t be hypnotized by Sylvester''s flute and gradually rescues his friends from Sylvester''s clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DrVL8YRhAoDB7iIdVDhU8Fjmir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234707'),
  ('1142881769500706717', 'The Pied Piper of Hamelin', 1957, 'Music, Fantasy, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bretaigne Windust, William E. Snyder', 'Irving Taylor, Hal Stanley, Robert Browning', 'Van Johnson, Claude Rains, Lori Nelson, Jim Backus, Kay Starr, Joseph Sargent, Doodles Weaver, Stanley Adams', null, 'The singing, rhyming citizens of Hamelin hope to win a competition with rival towns for royal recognition. To this end, the mayor outlaws play (which is a bit hard on the children) and refuses to help a rival town when it''s flooded. But rats (seen only as shadows), fleeing the flood, invade Hamelin in droves; a magical piper, whose music only children (and rats) can hear, strikes a bargain...which, once the rats are gone, the Mayor and council renege on, to their subsequent regret.', 'The singing, rhyming citizens of Hamelin hope to win a competition with rival towns for royal recognition. To this end, the mayor outlaws play (which is a bit hard on the children) and refuses to help a rival town when it''s flooded. But rats (seen only as shadows), fleeing the flood, invade Hamelin in droves; a magical piper, whose music only children (and rats) can hear, strikes a bargain...which, once the rats are gone, the Mayor and council renege on, to their subsequent regret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IDkEN8l5vzS575RJw6KwgrAzTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117772'),
  ('18584021036589937', 'The Pig Keeper''s Daughter', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Bethel Buckalew, Robert Wilson, Richmond L. Aguilar', null, 'Terry Gibson, Peggy Church, Gina Paluzzi, John Keith, Peter James, Bruce Kimball, Paul Stanley, Nick Armmans', null, 'Since Moonbeam Swiner is The Pigkeeper''s Daughter, it''s no surprise that her best friend in the whole wide world is a little piggy named Lord Hamilton. And that has her Ma worried. After all, Moonbeam has reached the ripe old age of 19 and she still ain''t hitched yet. So when a traveling salesman from the big city arrives on the scene, Ma quickly out-cons the con-artist and Pa arranges a shotgun wedding.', 'Since Moonbeam Swiner is The Pigkeeper''s Daughter, it''s no surprise that her best friend in the whole wide world is a little piggy named Lord Hamilton. And that has her Ma worried. After all, Moonbeam has reached the ripe old age of 19 and she still ain''t hitched yet. So when a traveling salesman from the big city arrives on the scene, Ma quickly out-cons the con-artist and Pa arranges a shotgun wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNWM1kooke8xeszQiS09n4dX6zL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96289'),
  ('501505987803780341', 'The Pig Who Cried Werewolf', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Gary Trousdale', 'Ken Bielenberg, Sean Bishop, Gary Trousdale', 'Sean Bishop, Cody Cameron, Aron Warner', 'PG', 'Of the famous Three Little Pigs, Heimlich is the one porker who finds a conspiracy around every corner. When The Big Bad Wolf moves in next door, Heimlich tries to warn his piggy pals Horst and Dieter that this may not bring a fairy-tale ending. Tired of hearing him ''cry wolf,'' they ignore Heimlich''s warnings until it''s almost too late for them to live happily ever after. The chase is on!', 'Of the famous Three Little Pigs, Heimlich is the one porker who finds a conspiracy around every corner. When The Big Bad Wolf moves in next door, Heimlich tries to warn his piggy pals Horst and Dieter that this may not bring a fairy-tale ending. Tired of hearing him ''cry wolf,'' they ignore Heimlich''s warnings until it''s almost too late for them to live happily ever after. The chase is on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNJbWSWDRWsXjz1gi1J2lxsWZFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82530'),
  ('842016908406921443', 'The Pig, the Snake and the Pigeon', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Hsu, Hong Shi-hao, Wong Ching-Po', 'Wong Ching-Po', 'Ethan Juan, Gingle Wang, Lee Lee-zen, Cherry Hsieh, Ben Yuen Foo-Wah, Chen Yi-wen, Troy Liu, Peggy Tseng', null, 'The arrogant, third most-wanted criminal in Taiwan, decides to get rid of the top two competitors and crowns himself the most-wanted criminal before dying.', 'The arrogant, third most-wanted criminal in Taiwan, decides to get rid of the top two competitors and crowns himself the most-wanted criminal before dying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FhZ9VC999qeOWH2ytbangUMMt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046090'),
  ('1018444073545930812', 'The Pigeon', 2018, 'Drama', 'Banu Sıvacı, Arda Yıldıran', 'Banu Sıvacı', 'Kemal Burak Alper, Ruhi Sarı, Michal Elia Kamal, Demet Genç, Mazlum Taşkıran, Evren Erler, Melik Aksan', null, 'Yusuf is a youngster living with his sister and brother in one of Adana’s suburbs. On the roof of the house where they live, he passionately feeds and raises the pigeons bequeathed by his father. He has got a special bond with a female pigeon named Maverdi. His brother forces him to work and to earn money. Yusuf who doesn’t know any other world than the one with his pigeons on the roof will face the labor life and the realities of his neighborhood.', 'Yusuf is a youngster living with his sister and brother in one of Adana’s suburbs. On the roof of the house where they live, he passionately feeds and raises the pigeons bequeathed by his father. He has got a special bond with a female pigeon named Maverdi. His brother forces him to work and to earn money. Yusuf who doesn’t know any other world than the one with his pigeons on the roof will face the labor life and the realities of his neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a819HS4VyWQT6U9qp4gMInvcqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493902'),
  ('260434381556816079', 'The Pigeon Tunnel', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Errol Morris, Astrid Sieben', 'Errol Morris', 'John le Carré, Jake Dove, Charlotte Hamblin, Garry Cooper, Simon Harrison, Douglas Rankine, Dominik Dervaics, Mike Noble', 'PG-13', 'Academy Award winner Errol Morris pulls back the curtain on the storied life and career of David Cornwell, the former spy known to the literary world as John le Carré.', 'Academy Award winner Errol Morris pulls back the curtain on the storied life and career of David Cornwell, the former spy known to the literary world as John le Carré.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsDb7JlPS6QnI26bTP3sREz9n0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155770'),
  ('928711829658698529', 'The Pilgrim', 1923, 'Comedy, Western', 'Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh, Tom Harrington', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Syd Chaplin, Mai Wells, Dean Riesner, Charles Reisner, Tom Murray, Kitty Bradbury', 'NR', 'The Tramp is an escaped convict who is mistaken as a pastor in a small town church.', 'The Tramp is an escaped convict who is mistaken as a pastor in a small town church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jddF7tvwd0sgMVsxkAZfiYESQRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53430'),
  ('847019270989326387', 'The Pilgrim''s Progress', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Robert Fernandez, Chris Jung', 'Robert Fernandez', 'David Thorpe, John Rhys-Davies, Kristyn Getty, Tristan Beint, Justin Butcher, Stephen Daltry, Andy Harrison, Jasmine Jones', 'PG', 'An epic journey, faithfully adapted to modern-day. Christian faces distractions, challenges, and perils at every turn of the way. But ends victorious, with helpful guides, as he stays on the narrow path to the distant Celestial City.', 'An epic journey, faithfully adapted to modern-day. Christian faces distractions, challenges, and perils at every turn of the way. But ends victorious, with helpful guides, as he stays on the narrow path to the distant Celestial City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtfsNxAsDHElFvYHUc9Khwqg17Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595172'),
  ('438222258487236465', 'The Pill', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'J.C. Khoury, Andreas von Scheele', 'J.C. Khoury', 'Noah Bean, Rachel Boston, Anna Chlumsky, Jean Brassard, S. Lue McWilliams, Steve Routman, Julia Royter, Jack Tartaglia', null, 'Worried that he has gotten the free-spirited Mindy pregnant after an unprotected one-night stand, Fred feigns romantic interest and sticks by her side for twelve hours to make sure she takes both doses of the morning-after pill.', 'Worried that he has gotten the free-spirited Mindy pregnant after an unprotected one-night stand, Fred feigns romantic interest and sticks by her side for twelve hours to make sure she takes both doses of the morning-after pill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGQOL6qS8EvouYcsIGJYbPe3WGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87587'),
  ('1017090045758642716', 'The Pillar of Fire', 1899, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Jehanne d''Alcy, Georges Méliès', null, 'A devil wearing bat-like wings and brandishing a trident dances around a giant pot, conjuring forth flame from his trident to lit a fire beneath the pot. After the devil works the fire with bellows, an angelic woman emerges from the pot. The devil and the pot vanish as the woman performs a dance, waving about her diaphanous sleeves until she conjures forth another fire, then she rises amongst the smoke into the air.', 'A devil wearing bat-like wings and brandishing a trident dances around a giant pot, conjuring forth flame from his trident to lit a fire beneath the pot. After the devil works the fire with bellows, an angelic woman emerges from the pot. The devil and the pot vanish as the woman performs a dance, waving about her diaphanous sleeves until she conjures forth another fire, then she rises amongst the smoke into the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79Mewu1YmnUdB0SPswikYyyPuHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104706'),
  ('529603780584280999', 'The Pilot', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Doucet', 'Paul Doucet', 'Hugo Becker, Grégory Fitoussi, Eye Haïdara, Kahina Carina, Lalie Lanners, Jean-Baptiste Anoumon, Elisabeth Mbaki, Sayyid El Alami', null, 'A drone pilot in Mali whose wife and daughter are kidnapped by terrorists. They will be executed if he doesn''t derail the capture by his team of the head of a jihadist network.', 'A drone pilot in Mali whose wife and daughter are kidnapped by terrorists. They will be executed if he doesn''t derail the capture by his team of the head of a jihadist network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA01FQLdNPXFSVBSdqqY35tHBuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948271'),
  ('730048824980203676', 'The Pilot: A Battle for Survival', 2021, 'War, History, Drama', 'Renat Davletyarov, Semen Yakovlev', 'Renat Davletyarov, Aleksei Timoshkin, Sergej Ashkenazy', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Anna Peskova, Pavel Osadchy, Maksim Emelyanov, Aleksey Barabash, Anatoly Grishko, Elena Drobysheva, Evgeniy Mikheev', null, 'December of 1941, Northwestern Front. A German tank column is moving towards Moscow. During a mission to stop the enemy advance, Nikolai Komlev''s IL-2 is shot down. Komlev manages to crash-land his plane in a remote forest clearing. He''s alive, but far from friendly territory. Ahead of him is a relentless trial of severe physical and mental endurance. After battling hunger and extreme cold, evading packs of wolves and detachments of Nazi soldiers, the wounded Komlev finally makes it back to safety. But there he faces another challenge, the most life-changing of them all.', 'December of 1941, Northwestern Front. A German tank column is moving towards Moscow. During a mission to stop the enemy advance, Nikolai Komlev''s IL-2 is shot down. Komlev manages to crash-land his plane in a remote forest clearing. He''s alive, but far from friendly territory. Ahead of him is a relentless trial of severe physical and mental endurance. After battling hunger and extreme cold, evading packs of wolves and detachments of Nazi soldiers, the wounded Komlev finally makes it back to safety. But there he faces another challenge, the most life-changing of them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msKnqw1OMiJnQQ7rOFh8Syglxfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597859'),
  ('866306941302031330', 'The Pimp', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Bourdiaux', 'Vincent Lambert', 'José Garcia, Gilbert Melki, Carmen Maura, Arsène Mosca, Jo Prestia, Catalina Denis, Alain Fromager, Laurent Bateau', null, 'A mild-mannered banker is forced to masquerade as a notorious gangster and pimp.', 'A mild-mannered banker is forced to masquerade as a notorious gangster and pimp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsai3CTU0VENHY2LuKJ7Xe06LGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35025'),
  ('869519729851412707', 'The Pinchcliffe Grand Prix', 1975, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ivo Caprino', 'Remo Caprino, Kjell Syversen, Kjell Aukrust', 'Frank Robert, Kari Simonsen, Toralv Maurstad, Leif Juster, Rolf Just Nilsen, Harald Heide-Steen Jr., Helge Reiss, Wenche Foss', null, '100 miles north, a bit east and up, is Pinchcliffe, the home of bicycle repairman Reodor Felgen and his two assistants, Solan Gundersen and Ludvig. Sponsored by oil sheik Ben Redic Fy Fazan, they build the car "Il Tempo Gigante" to race against Reodor''s former assistant Rudolf Blodstrupmoen, who has stolen one of Reodor''s inventions to become a world racing champion.', '100 miles north, a bit east and up, is Pinchcliffe, the home of bicycle repairman Reodor Felgen and his two assistants, Solan Gundersen and Ludvig. Sponsored by oil sheik Ben Redic Fy Fazan, they build the car "Il Tempo Gigante" to race against Reodor''s former assistant Rudolf Blodstrupmoen, who has stolen one of Reodor''s inventions to become a world racing champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWnG4MrdUcrJ3dhB2pvwQZjKXIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492015'),
  ('311132604568202013', 'The Pink Blueprint', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hawley Pratt', 'John W. Dunn', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'At a building site, the Pink Panther finds a blueprint for the construction of a generic home and replaces it with a pink-colored plan for an ultra-modern house. When the little man on the building site rejects the Pink Panther''s pink blueprint and continues his original project, the panther decides to construct his preferred house on the same site, using the man''s materials.', 'At a building site, the Pink Panther finds a blueprint for the construction of a generic home and replaces it with a pink-colored plan for an ultra-modern house. When the little man on the building site rejects the Pink Panther''s pink blueprint and continues his original project, the panther decides to construct his preferred house on the same site, using the man''s materials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHEY9WHEq5iZ5boSOHlVP2mxugi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243294'),
  ('299357619893193369', 'The Pink Cat', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Yiannis Hartomatzidis, Theodoros Konstadopoulos', 'Nasos Grimanis', 'Sotiris Moustakas, Panos Mihalopoulos, Vana Barba, Efi Pikoula, Michalis Moustakas, Kostas Makedos, Teta Konstanta, Thomas Konstadinidis', null, 'Panos and Archimidis are colleagues and co-tenants. Panos is a modern young man, whereas Archimidis is more conservative. Panos tries to make Archimidis live his life more passionately. Archimidis then develops a dual personality. In the morning, he is a restrained teacher, and at night he is a reveller and a skirt-chaser. When his sister is kidnapped, Archimidis enters a hospital to overcome his problem.', 'Panos and Archimidis are colleagues and co-tenants. Panos is a modern young man, whereas Archimidis is more conservative. Panos tries to make Archimidis live his life more passionately. Archimidis then develops a dual personality. In the morning, he is a restrained teacher, and at night he is a reveller and a skirt-chaser. When his sister is kidnapped, Archimidis enters a hospital to overcome his problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ0vPsDIqDP62zK80sdCi8cdx6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389541'),
  ('1120127473922911390', 'The Pink Chiquitas', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tony Currie, Nicolas Stiliadis', 'Tony Currie', 'Frank Stallone Jr., Bruce Pirrie, Elizabeth Edwards, Claudia Udy, John Hemphill, Don Lake, Laura Robinson, Cindy Valentine Leone', 'PG-13', 'A pink meteor controlled by aliens lands near a small town and turns the local women into nymphos. A deputy sheriff and a local private eye investigate.', 'A pink meteor controlled by aliens lands near a small town and turns the local women into nymphos. A deputy sheriff and a local private eye investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoMBHQLUny9jyyHM7fQBubSABs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88296'),
  ('167662664132547402', 'The Pink Cloud', 2021, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Iuli Gerbase', 'Iuli Gerbase', 'Renata de Lélis, Eduardo Mendonça, Kaya Rodrigues, Helena Becker, Girley Paes, Lívia Perrone, Arthur da Costa Florenzano, Gabriel Eringer', 'R', 'After a toxic and mysterious pink cloud suddenly appears around the globe, people are forced to shelter in place. A woman finds herself stuck in an apartment with a stranger after a one-night stand, and the two come to terms with staying together.', 'After a toxic and mysterious pink cloud suddenly appears around the globe, people are forced to shelter in place. A woman finds herself stuck in an apartment with a stranger after a one-night stand, and the two come to terms with staying together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bLB5RnwXNxrXji49jcoxWopFnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776490'),
  ('118417775896755123', 'The Pink Mirror', 2003, null, 'Sridhar Rangayan', null, 'Ramesh Menon, Edwin Fernandes, Rishi Raj, Edwin Fernandes, Rufy Baqal', null, 'Award-winning Indian film drama. Said to be the first Indian film to comprehensively focus on Indian trans people, with the entire story revolving around two trans women and a gay teenager''s attempts to seduce a man - Samir. The film explores the taboo subject of trans people in India, which is still much misunderstood and ridiculed.', 'Award-winning Indian film drama. Said to be the first Indian film to comprehensively focus on Indian trans people, with the entire story revolving around two trans women and a gay teenager''s attempts to seduce a man - Samir. The film explores the taboo subject of trans people in India, which is still much misunderstood and ridiculed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie09bqjv4Ksopb21lw7cb9UmnfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431804'),
  ('1149970231003120759', 'The Pink Panther', 1963, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Philip H. Lathrop, Blake Edwards, Ottavio Oppo', 'Maurice Richlin, Blake Edwards', 'David Niven, Peter Sellers, Claudia Cardinale, Capucine, Robert Wagner, Brenda De Banzie, Colin Gordon, John Le Mesurier', 'PG', 'The trademark of The Phantom, a renowned jewel thief, is a glove left at the scene of the crime. Inspector Clouseau, an expert on The Phantom''s exploits, feels sure that he knows where The Phantom will strike next and leaves Paris for the Tyrolean Alps, where the famous Lugashi jewel ''The Pink Panther'' is going to be. However, he does not know who The Phantom really is, or for that matter who anyone else really is...', 'The trademark of The Phantom, a renowned jewel thief, is a glove left at the scene of the crime. Inspector Clouseau, an expert on The Phantom''s exploits, feels sure that he knows where The Phantom will strike next and leaves Paris for the Tyrolean Alps, where the famous Lugashi jewel ''The Pink Panther'' is going to be. However, he does not know who The Phantom really is, or for that matter who anyone else really is...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCjJ0sKayks2uL7MJBzdp2i67NI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936'),
  ('907570421018258492', 'The Pink Panther', 2006, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime, Adventure, Family', 'Shawn Levy, Jonathan Brown, Elizabeth Flaherty', 'Len Blum, Steve Martin', 'Steve Martin, Jean Reno, Kevin Kline, Beyoncé, Emily Mortimer, Henry Czerny, Kristin Chenoweth, Roger Rees', 'PG', 'When the coach of the France football team is killed by a poisoned dart in the stadium at the end of a game, and his huge, expensive ring with the Pink Panther diamond disappears, the ambitious Chief Inspector Dreyfus assigns the worst police inspector – Jacques Clouseau – to the case.', 'When the coach of the France football team is killed by a poisoned dart in the stadium at the end of a game, and his huge, expensive ring with the Pink Panther diamond disappears, the ambitious Chief Inspector Dreyfus assigns the worst police inspector – Jacques Clouseau – to the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/th6i4TqJa5tEQaSKul2XgqSqTV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12096'),
  ('1011666589404495270', 'The Pink Panther 2', 2009, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Harald Zwart, Marty Eli Schwartz, Louis Guerra', 'Michael H. Weber, Steve Martin, Scott Neustadter', 'Steve Martin, Jean Reno, Emily Mortimer, Andy Garcia, Alfred Molina, Yuki Matsuzaki, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, John Cleese', 'PG', 'When legendary treasures from around the world are stolen, including the priceless Pink Panther Diamond, Chief Inspector Dreyfus is forced to assign Inspector Clouseau to a team of international detectives and experts charged with catching the thief and retrieving the stolen artifacts.', 'When legendary treasures from around the world are stolen, including the priceless Pink Panther Diamond, Chief Inspector Dreyfus is forced to assign Inspector Clouseau to a team of international detectives and experts charged with catching the thief and retrieving the stolen artifacts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWhI9kn5OtxWB208Z88xAyhOJ68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15159'),
  ('640797687867921530', 'The Pink Panther Strikes Again', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Harry Waxman, Blake Edwards, Terry Marcel', 'Frank Waldman, Blake Edwards', 'Peter Sellers, Herbert Lom, Leonard Rossiter, Colin Blakely, Graham Stark, Byron Kane, Dick Crockett, Richard Vernon', 'PG', 'Charles Dreyfus, who has finally cracked over inspector Clouseau''s antics, escapes from a mental institution and launches an elaborate plan to get rid of Clouseau once and for all.', 'Charles Dreyfus, who has finally cracked over inspector Clouseau''s antics, escapes from a mental institution and launches an elaborate plan to get rid of Clouseau once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GGCch9LNAKwp4ZADAcNz1hd1dn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12268'),
  ('443016937594782792', 'The Pink Phink', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', null, null, null, 'A house painter can''t understand why everything he paints blue turns pink.', 'A house painter can''t understand why everything he paints blue turns pink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTMsWavJaSGlF7aN0aboyc2JNxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149193'),
  ('598590862681445054', 'The Pink Soldier', 2006, 'Music, Family, TV Movie', 'Jean-Louis Cap', 'Pierre-Dominique Burgaud', 'Matthieu Chedid, Raoul Lepenec, Catherine Jacob, Jeanne Cherhal, Albin de la Simone, Vanessa Paradis, Francis Cabrel, Bénabar', null, 'A little boy hides in the toy section of a department store at night, where the toys come to life.', 'A little boy hides in the toy section of a department store at night, where the toys come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3bFQdCdc2uwT4E0xq1U6CKhgV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200214'),
