  ('520391451796778221', 'The Pink Telephone', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Édouard Molinaro, Bernard Bats, Philippe Monnier', 'Francis Veber', 'Pierre Mondy, Mireille Darc, Françoise Prévost, Gérard Hérold, Michael Lonsdale, Daniel Ceccaldi, Raoul Curet, Robert Dalban', null, 'A small industrialist from Toulouse, goes to Paris to negotiate the buyout of his company from an American financial group. During his stay, the representative of the large firm calls on a luxury call girl to facilitate their "business".', 'A small industrialist from Toulouse, goes to Paris to negotiate the buyout of his company from an American financial group. During his stay, the representative of the large firm calls on a luxury call girl to facilitate their "business".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwSQKy9SlwJxdsRufIMM5VwRTnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79709'),
  ('375872236767397118', 'The Pintins to the Rescue', 2000, 'Animation, Family', 'Franco Bíttolo, Ricardo Rodríguez', 'Martín Taskar, Pablo Lago, Marcos Carnevale', 'Arturo Maly, Alfredo Casero, Diego Peretti, Rosario Sánchez Almada, Adolfo Stambulsky, Guillermo Gravino, Queco Yerve, Luis Albornoz', null, 'The family Pintín: Ada, Bepo and grandfather Fierro must rescue Luna, the youngest daughter of the family, who was kidnapped by humans and taken to an island that functions as a private zoo.', 'The family Pintín: Ada, Bepo and grandfather Fierro must rescue Luna, the youngest daughter of the family, who was kidnapped by humans and taken to an island that functions as a private zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMNcpu6Df8REaDeRDYvNl7FnxmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83870'),
  ('1135144626806532807', 'The Piper', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kim Kwang-tae, Kim Jae-keun, Hong Jae-sik', 'Kim Kwang-tae', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Lee Sung-min, Chun Woo-hee, Lee Joon, Goo Seung-hyun, Lee Min-ji, Kyul Hwi, Jung Kyung-ho', null, 'Shortly after the Korean war, a father and a son are wandering through the country and make a stop in a remote village, where strange and dangerous happenings occur.', 'Shortly after the Korean war, a father and a son are wandering through the country and make a stop in a remote village, where strange and dangerous happenings occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkX9UdSXNpfDU5Hn7dACaYs7LYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345888'),
  ('131702388176954284', 'The Piper', 2023, 'Horror', 'Erlingur Thoroddsen, Daniel Katz', 'Erlingur Thoroddsen', 'Charlotte Hope, Julian Sands, Kate Nichols, Salomé Chandler, Oliver Savell, Philipp Christopher, Alexis Rodney, Pippa Winslow', null, 'When a composer must finish her late mentor''s concerto, she discovers that playing its music summons deadly consequences.', 'When a composer must finish her late mentor''s concerto, she discovers that playing its music summons deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A92IidYEd25UHJGh4baSsTcJ650.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845643'),
  ('357586332386552143', 'The Pirate', 1948, 'Music, Romance, Comedy, Adventure', 'Vincente Minnelli, Harry Stradling Sr., Wallace Worsley Jr.', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Judy Garland, Gene Kelly, Walter Slezak, Gladys Cooper, Reginald Owen, George Zucco, Fayard Nicholas, Harold Nicholas', 'NR', 'A girl is engaged to the local richman, but meanwhile she has dreams about the legendary pirate Macoco. A traveling singer falls in love with her and to impress her he poses as the pirate.', 'A girl is engaged to the local richman, but meanwhile she has dreams about the legendary pirate Macoco. A traveling singer falls in love with her and to impress her he poses as the pirate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltoy9asHYuLcEq78jjvZPjH6LCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35032'),
  ('337418768488616679', 'The Pirate - Marco Pantani', 2007, 'Drama', 'Claudio Bonivento', 'Nicola Carraro, Nicola Lusuardi, Claudio Bonivento', 'Rolando Ravello, Nicoletta Romanoff, Ivano Marescotti, Omero Antonutti, Franco Mescolini, Gianfelice Facchetti, Solvejg D''Assunta, Maurizio Tafani', null, 'The determination of cyclist Marco Pantani leads him to win the Giro d''Italia and (as the only Italian) the Tour de France, as well as to overcome serious accidents. In 1999, his hematocrit level is found to be above the permitted threshold: this marks the beginning of a downward spiral that leads to depression and death from drugs.', 'The determination of cyclist Marco Pantani leads him to win the Giro d''Italia and (as the only Italian) the Tour de France, as well as to overcome serious accidents. In 1999, his hematocrit level is found to be above the permitted threshold: this marks the beginning of a downward spiral that leads to depression and death from drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUUgm76DsUvHFcjvF5jzkgnp8XZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430656'),
  ('483830657745111279', 'The Pirate Movie', 1982, 'Romance, Adventure, Comedy', 'Ken Annakin', 'Trevor Farrant', 'Kristy McNichol, Christopher Atkins, Ted Hamilton, Bill Kerr, Maggie Kirkpatrick, Kate Ferguson, Rhonda Burchmore, Linda Nagle', 'PG', 'Left behind by her friends on a boat trip, contemporary teen Mabel takes pursuit but is knocked unconscious on an island, where she has a dream involving pirates, sisters, a modern major-general, romance, and adventure.', 'Left behind by her friends on a boat trip, contemporary teen Mabel takes pursuit but is knocked unconscious on an island, where she has a dream involving pirates, sisters, a modern major-general, romance, and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tIR7zyExuzhJ9c9ZWHqCkJsSPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25872'),
  ('1143220612672603427', 'The Pirates', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Kim Jae-hoon, Lee Suk-hoon', 'Lee Suk-hoon, Chun Sung-il, Choi Lee-Young', 'Son Ye-jin, Kim Nam-gil, Oh Dal-su, Park Cheol-min, Yoo Hai-jin, Lee Kyung-young, Sulli, Kim Tae-woo', null, 'At the cusp of the founding of Joseon Dynasty, an envoy from China is delivering Emperor’s Ming’s Royal Seal. But nature in the form of a giant whale intervenes and swallows the royal seal. When a generous reward is offered to whomever can retrieve the royal seal from the belly of the whale, the race is on. A group of mountain bandits led by Jang Sa Jung and a group of pirates led by Yeo Wol go after the lost treasure, but who will get to to it first?', 'At the cusp of the founding of Joseon Dynasty, an envoy from China is delivering Emperor’s Ming’s Royal Seal. But nature in the form of a giant whale intervenes and swallows the royal seal. When a generous reward is offered to whomever can retrieve the royal seal from the belly of the whale, the race is on. A group of mountain bandits led by Jang Sa Jung and a group of pirates led by Yeo Wol go after the lost treasure, but who will get to to it first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qU1SW1b2Txf3Ge9rGlddDthSgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285213'),
  ('809588627485421682', 'The Pirates of Blood River', 1962, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'John Gilling, Arthur Grant', 'John Hunter, John Gilling', 'Kerwin Mathews, Christopher Lee, Andrew Keir, Glenn Corbett, Michael Ripper, Peter Arne, Marla Landi, Oliver Reed', 'NR', 'A group of ruthless pirates attack a 17th Century Huguenot settlement on the Isle of Devon in search of treasure and will stop at nothing to obtain it.', 'A group of ruthless pirates attack a 17th Century Huguenot settlement on the Isle of Devon in search of treasure and will stop at nothing to obtain it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye0ioSmMo2zvDVpwnlm6rzkcKiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58733'),
  ('22086764303712380', 'The Pirates of Malaysia', 1964, 'Action', 'Umberto Lenzi, Tersicore Kolosoff, Juan Gabriel Tharrats', 'Ugo Liberatore, Nino Stresa, Gérard Cohen', 'Steve Reeves, Jacqueline Sassard, Mimmo Palmara, Andrea Bosic, Nando Gazzolo, Leo Anchóriz, Franco Balducci, Pierre Cressoy', null, 'Filmed in Singapore it tells the story of Sandokan who is a Malaysian rebel who, with a group of renegades, goes up against a British General who is trying to force the King to resign.', 'Filmed in Singapore it tells the story of Sandokan who is a Malaysian rebel who, with a group of renegades, goes up against a British General who is trying to force the King to resign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22fIERshbW1b2MQvva0WPpDcgqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74605'),
  ('90347064012191135', 'The Pirates of Penzance', 1980, 'Music, Comedy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Joshua White, Nick Hutak, William Elliott', 'William S. Gilbert', 'Kevin Kline, Linda Ronstadt, Rex Smith, Patricia Routledge, Tony Azito, George Rose, G. Eugene Moose, Alice Playten', null, 'As a young child, Frederic had been apprenticed to a pirate by mistake when he should have been apprenticed to a pilot. Now, having reached his 21st year, Frederic''s indentures are at last over and he happily leaves the service of the pirates. When Frederic meets the beautiful Mabel, one of the many daughters (or wards in Chancery) of Major-General Stanley, they fall in love and decide to marry. However, complications arise when the pirates decide to marry the rest of the Major-General''s daughters, themselves - and Frederic''s birthdate turns out to be not all it seems. Filmed live from Central Park prior to the production''s transition to Broadway.', 'As a young child, Frederic had been apprenticed to a pirate by mistake when he should have been apprenticed to a pilot. Now, having reached his 21st year, Frederic''s indentures are at last over and he happily leaves the service of the pirates. When Frederic meets the beautiful Mabel, one of the many daughters (or wards in Chancery) of Major-General Stanley, they fall in love and decide to marry. However, complications arise when the pirates decide to marry the rest of the Major-General''s daughters, themselves - and Frederic''s birthdate turns out to be not all it seems. Filmed live from Central Park prior to the production''s transition to Broadway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieqoXDBIfXzFig1uqCZu9q4Y48F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181850'),
  ('56793127805341854', 'The Pirates of Penzance', 1983, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Adventure', 'Wilford Leach, Douglas Slocombe', 'Wilford Leach', 'Kevin Kline, Angela Lansbury, Linda Ronstadt, George Rose, Rex Smith, Tony Azito, David Hatton, Tim Bentinck', 'G', 'As a young child, Frederic had been apprenticed to a pirate by mistake when he should have been apprenticed to a pilot. Now, having reached his 21st year, Frederic''s indentures are at last over and he happily leaves the service of the pirates. When Frederic meets the beautiful Mabel, one of the many daughters (or wards in Chancery) of Major-General Stanley, they fall in love and decide to marry. However, complications arise when the pirates decide to marry the rest of the Major-General''s daughters, themselves - and Frederic''s birthdate turns out to be not all it seems.', 'As a young child, Frederic had been apprenticed to a pirate by mistake when he should have been apprenticed to a pilot. Now, having reached his 21st year, Frederic''s indentures are at last over and he happily leaves the service of the pirates. When Frederic meets the beautiful Mabel, one of the many daughters (or wards in Chancery) of Major-General Stanley, they fall in love and decide to marry. However, complications arise when the pirates decide to marry the rest of the Major-General''s daughters, themselves - and Frederic''s birthdate turns out to be not all it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2bvgBjzvTXU3qA1EWFhcNRb6Xv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15716'),
  ('634691519921828517', 'The Pirates of Somalia', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bryan Buckley, Scott Henriksen, Warren Gray', 'Bryan Buckley', 'Evan Peters, Barkhad Abdi, Melanie Griffith, Al Pacino, Philip Ettinger, Russell Posner, Kiana Madani, Maria Vos', 'R', 'After an inspiring chance encounter with his idol, rookie journalist Jay Bahadur uproots his life and moves to Somalia looking for the story of a lifetime. Hooking up with a local fixer, he attempts to get embedded with the local Somali pirates, only to quickly find himself in over his head.', 'After an inspiring chance encounter with his idol, rookie journalist Jay Bahadur uproots his life and moves to Somalia looking for the story of a lifetime. Hooking up with a local fixer, he attempts to get embedded with the local Somali pirates, only to quickly find himself in over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8dlDPwo9mnorurL6ukIpyHZZd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394537'),
  ('708137330096219085', 'The Pirates Who Don''t Do Anything: A VeggieTales Movie', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Mike Nawrocki, Paul Kohut, Alan Kennedy', 'Phil Vischer', 'Phil Vischer, Mike Nawrocki, Cam Clarke, Laura Gerow, Yuri Lowenthal, Alan Lee, Cydney Trent, Keri Pisapia', 'G', 'A boatload of beloved VeggieTales pals embark on a fun and fresh pirate adventure with their trademark humor and silly songs in The Pirates Who Don''t Do Anything - A VeggieTales Movie! Larry the Cucumber, Mr. Lunt and Pa Grape find themselves on the ride of their lives when they are mysteriously whisked back to the time when pirates ruled the high seas.', 'A boatload of beloved VeggieTales pals embark on a fun and fresh pirate adventure with their trademark humor and silly songs in The Pirates Who Don''t Do Anything - A VeggieTales Movie! Larry the Cucumber, Mr. Lunt and Pa Grape find themselves on the ride of their lives when they are mysteriously whisked back to the time when pirates ruled the high seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwawxSwOkjeld4eQLSkIyyYNnqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15511'),
  ('112940286610774409', 'The Pirates: The Last Royal Treasure', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Kim Yeong-ho, Jin Jong-hyun', 'Chun Sung-il', 'Kang Ha-neul, Han Hyo-joo, Lee Kwang-soo, Kwon Sang-woo, Chae Soo-bin, Sehun, Kim Seung-o, Park Ji-hwan', null, 'A gutsy crew of Joseon pirates and bandits battle stormy waters, puzzling clues and militant rivals in search of royal gold lost at sea.', 'A gutsy crew of Joseon pirates and bandits battle stormy waters, puzzling clues and militant rivals in search of royal gold lost at sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50UQeTrUM7ErXzkvqCsV6EXcM3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591120'),
  ('909362388738652448', 'The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists!', 2012, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Peter Lord, Jeff Newitt', 'Gideon Defoe', 'Hugh Grant, Martin Freeman, Imelda Staunton, David Tennant, Jeremy Piven, Salma Hayek Pinault, Lenny Henry, Brian Blessed', 'PG', 'The enthusiastic Pirate Captain, along with his rag-tag crew, sets out to beat his bitter rivals. The chaotic adventure takes them from exotic shores to Victorian London, and from a haplessly smitten scientist to a diabolical queen.', 'The enthusiastic Pirate Captain, along with his rag-tag crew, sets out to beat his bitter rivals. The chaotic adventure takes them from exotic shores to Victorian London, and from a haplessly smitten scientist to a diabolical queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkLeXPDP6sramrTiF5W7TzUl4t0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72197'),
  ('434105477296979907', 'The Pirogue', 2012, 'Drama', 'Moussa Touré', 'Abasse Ndione', 'Souleymane Seye Ndiaye, Laïty Fall, Malamine Drame, Balla Diarra, Salif Jean Diallo, Babacar Oualy, Mame Astou Diallo, Saikou Lô', null, 'Baye Laye is the captain of a fishing pirogue. Like many of his Senegalese compatriots, he sometimes dreams of new horizons, where he can earn a better living for his family. When he is offered to lead one of the many pirogues that head towards Europe via the Canary Island, he reluctantly accepts the job, knowing full-well the dangers that lie ahead. Leading a group of 30 men who don''t all speak the same language, some of whom have never seen the sea, Baye Laye will confront many perils in order to reach the distant coasts of Europe.', 'Baye Laye is the captain of a fishing pirogue. Like many of his Senegalese compatriots, he sometimes dreams of new horizons, where he can earn a better living for his family. When he is offered to lead one of the many pirogues that head towards Europe via the Canary Island, he reluctantly accepts the job, knowing full-well the dangers that lie ahead. Leading a group of 30 men who don''t all speak the same language, some of whom have never seen the sea, Baye Laye will confront many perils in order to reach the distant coasts of Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WoMpChqMDuGjWgmKdNrLkKQgS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126328'),
  ('504647659828782662', 'The Pit', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Comedy', 'Lew Lehman, Manfred Guthe', 'Ian A. Stuart', 'Sammy Snyders, Jeannie Elias, Sonja Smits, Laura Press, Laura Hollingsworth, Richard Alden, Andrea Swartz, John Auten', 'R', 'Twelve year-old Jamie Benjamin is a solitary misunderstood boy in his preteens. His classmates pick on him, his neighbors think he''s weird and his parents ignore him. But now Jamie has a secret weapon: deep in the woods he has discovered a deep pit full of man-eating creatures he calls Trogs... and it isn''t long before he gets an idea for getting revenge and feeding the Trogs in the process!', 'Twelve year-old Jamie Benjamin is a solitary misunderstood boy in his preteens. His classmates pick on him, his neighbors think he''s weird and his parents ignore him. But now Jamie has a secret weapon: deep in the woods he has discovered a deep pit full of man-eating creatures he calls Trogs... and it isn''t long before he gets an idea for getting revenge and feeding the Trogs in the process!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qD95tGVbWUVoaQQRnZTL17h41G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47038'),
  ('266747887013696728', 'The Pit and the Pendulum', 1961, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Floyd Crosby, Roger Corman, Paul Rapp', 'Richard Matheson', 'Vincent Price, John Kerr, Barbara Steele, Luana Anders, Antony Carbone, Patrick Westwood, Lynette Bernay, Mary Menzies', null, 'In the sixteenth century, Francis Barnard travels to Spain to clarify the strange circumstances of his sister''s death after she had married the son of a cruel Spanish Inquisitor.', 'In the sixteenth century, Francis Barnard travels to Spain to clarify the strange circumstances of his sister''s death after she had married the son of a cruel Spanish Inquisitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hOTmFaePluI5eicY4XTv6hg0T0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28501'),
  ('943705759331468483', 'The Pit and the Pendulum', 1991, 'Horror, Romance', 'Stuart Gordon, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Dennis Paoli', 'Lance Henriksen, Stephen Lee, William Norris, Mark Margolis, Carolyn Purdy-Gordon, Barbara Bocci, Benito Stefanelli, Jeffrey Combs', 'R', 'Set during the height of Spanish Inquisition. The beautiful and kind-hearted Maria is arrested as a witch when she inadvertently cries out in horror at the public whipping of a child. As Maria’s husband Antonio tries to save her, Torquemada, the Grand Inquisitor, determines to punish Maria with torture for the desire she inflames in him. Loosely based on Edgar Allen Poe''s classic short story.', 'Set during the height of Spanish Inquisition. The beautiful and kind-hearted Maria is arrested as a witch when she inadvertently cries out in horror at the public whipping of a child. As Maria’s husband Antonio tries to save her, Torquemada, the Grand Inquisitor, determines to punish Maria with torture for the desire she inflames in him. Loosely based on Edgar Allen Poe''s classic short story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq4pLMaMlVmDEzaxTrDqDa4ET25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47090'),
  ('668122349305824374', 'The Pit, the Pendulum and Hope', 1983, 'Animation, Horror, Mystery', 'Jan Švankmajer, Miloslav Špála', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Jan Žáček', null, 'Animated short film based on Edgar Allan Poe''s "The Pit and the Pendulum" and Auguste Villiers de l''Isle-Adam''s "A Torture by Hope".', 'Animated short film based on Edgar Allan Poe''s "The Pit and the Pendulum" and Auguste Villiers de l''Isle-Adam''s "A Torture by Hope".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f67m89oG4jdYAay4C5rWnIa00rW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104275'),
  ('516554603468093735', 'The Pitiless Three', 1964, 'Western', 'Joaquín Romero Marchent, Rafael Pacheco', 'Joaquín Romero Marchent, Jesús Navarro Carrión, Rafael Romero Marchent', 'Richard Harrison, Fernando Sancho, Gloria Milland, Claudio Undari, Miguel Palenzuela, Gloria Fernán Osuna, Luis Induni, Carlos Romero Marchent', null, 'Three unequal brothers seek revenge for the murder of their father. Each of them goes a different way.', 'Three unequal brothers seek revenge for the murder of their father. Each of them goes a different way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx8wQzMFj9Gar1n9xoOh76znloX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140529'),
  ('731530384301316529', 'The Pixar Shorts: A Short History', 2007, 'Animation, Family, Documentary', 'Erica Milsom, Tony Kaplan', null, 'Eben Ostby, Ralph Guggenheim, John Lasseter, Edwin Catmull, Alvy Ray Smith, Bill Reeves', null, 'The story of Pixar''s early short films illuminates not only the evolution of the company but also the early days of computer animation, when a small group of artists and scientists shared a single computer in a hallway, and struggled to create emotionally compelling short films.', 'The story of Pixar''s early short films illuminates not only the evolution of the company but also the early days of computer animation, when a small group of artists and scientists shared a single computer in a hallway, and struggled to create emotionally compelling short films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxB5oLKslLUafmiYLRvmIfgfEJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265447'),
  ('639611435283968464', 'The Pixar Story', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Leslie Iwerks, Suki Medencevic', 'Jeff Vincent, Leslie Iwerks', 'Stacy Keach, Edwin Catmull, Steve Jobs, John Lasseter, William Reeves, Joe Ranft, George Lucas, Pete Docter', null, 'A look at the first years of Pixar Animation Studios - from the success of "Toy Story" and Pixar''s promotion of talented people, to the building of its East Bay campus, the company''s relationship with Disney, and its remarkable initial string of eight hits. The contributions of John Lasseter, Ed Catmull and Steve Jobs are profiled. The decline of two-dimensional animation is chronicled as three-dimensional animation rises. Hard work and creativity seem to share the screen in equal proportions.', 'A look at the first years of Pixar Animation Studios - from the success of "Toy Story" and Pixar''s promotion of talented people, to the building of its East Bay campus, the company''s relationship with Disney, and its remarkable initial string of eight hits. The contributions of John Lasseter, Ed Catmull and Steve Jobs are profiled. The decline of two-dimensional animation is chronicled as three-dimensional animation rises. Hard work and creativity seem to share the screen in equal proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhK51wJybwZTRCPVUOkGpSI4auN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15302'),
  ('840784434287206511', 'The Place', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Francesca Farneti, Paolo Genovese, Fabrizio Lucci', 'Isabella Aguilar, Paolo Genovese', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Marco Giallini, Alba Rohrwacher, Vittoria Puccini, Rocco Papaleo, Silvio Muccino, Silvia D''Amico, Vinicio Marchioni', null, 'The fates of an apparently random group of strangers who each come into contact with a mysterious figure who they believe possesses the power to grant any wish, in return for which they must carry out a task he assigns them.', 'The fates of an apparently random group of strangers who each come into contact with a mysterious figure who they believe possesses the power to grant any wish, in return for which they must carry out a task he assigns them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBs5CiFImWQLVWm7alzUwbHUOkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468198'),
  ('731365646299292070', 'The Place Beyond the Pines', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Derek Cianfrance, Sean Bobbitt, Mariela Comitini', 'Derek Cianfrance, Ben Coccio, Darius Marder', 'Ryan Gosling, Bradley Cooper, Eva Mendes, Rose Byrne, Ray Liotta, Dane DeHaan, Emory Cohen, Mahershala Ali', 'R', 'A motorcycle stunt rider considers committing a crime in order to provide for his wife and child, an act that puts him on a collision course with a cop-turned-politician.', 'A motorcycle stunt rider considers committing a crime in order to provide for his wife and child, an act that puts him on a collision course with a cop-turned-politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY5j2xQzMGWmxBuhQo0HfA4Lxqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97367'),
  ('780047261470346197', 'The Place Promised in Our Early Days', 2004, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Makoto Shinkai, Makoto Shinkai, Makoto Shinkai', 'Makoto Shinkai', 'Hidetaka Yoshioka, Masato Hagiwara, Yuuka Nanri, Unsho Ishizuka, Kazuhiko Inoue, Risa Mizuno, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Masami Iwasaki', null, 'In a post-war alternative timeline, Japan is divided into the North, controlled by the Union, and the South, controlled by the United States. A mysterious high tower rises within the borders of the Union. Three high school students promise to cross the border with a self-built airplane and unravel the secret of the tower.', 'In a post-war alternative timeline, Japan is divided into the North, controlled by the Union, and the South, controlled by the United States. A mysterious high tower rises within the borders of the Union. Three high school students promise to cross the border with a self-built airplane and unravel the secret of the tower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlyJw6WmfLn378oz0ZmI0SYFoGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12924'),
  ('417304235789062624', 'The Place Without Limits', 1978, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Miguel Garzón, Francisco Guerrero', 'José Emilio Pacheco, Manuel Puig', 'Roberto Cobo, Gonzalo Vega, Ana Martín, Lucha Villa, Carmen Salinas, Julián Pastor, Emma Roldán, Fernando Soler', null, 'Family honor, greed, machismo, homophobia, and dreams collide in a small Mexican town.', 'Family honor, greed, machismo, homophobia, and dreams collide in a small Mexican town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzgFtZ2JXfjyffvwrJHRUMFiwsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77360'),
  ('877969032746518083', 'The Plague', 1992, 'Action, Drama', 'Luis Puenzo, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Robert Katz, Luis Puenzo', 'William Hurt, Robert Duvall, Raúl Juliá, Sandrine Bonnaire, Jean-Marc Barr, Victoria Tennant, Jorge Luz, Atilio Veronelli', null, 'In a city in South America an outbreak of bubonic plague occurs. While people try to flee and the military close the city, an idealistic doctor decides to stay and help the sick. In the ever-changing circumstances, he puts up a brave fight, being helped by others but also involving them without being able to control the situation.', 'In a city in South America an outbreak of bubonic plague occurs. While people try to flee and the military close the city, an idealistic doctor decides to stay and help the sick. In the ever-changing circumstances, he puts up a brave fight, being helped by others but also involving them without being able to control the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0h7BR9iXaPYZs30dWaX1Lr4atd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36907'),
  ('306048489210884349', 'The Plague', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Hal Masonberg, Bill Butler, Anthony DiBlasi', 'Teal Minton, Hal Masonberg', 'James Van Der Beek, Ivana Miličević, Brad Hunt, Dee Wallace, Brittany Scobie, Joshua Close, John P. Connolly, Bradley Sawatzky', 'R', 'Ten years have passed since the world''s children fell into a coma. Tonight they''re waking up and all hell is breaking loose. An unholy battle between the generations is being waged, and time is not on the side of adults.', 'Ten years have passed since the world''s children fell into a coma. Tonight they''re waking up and all hell is breaking loose. An unholy battle between the generations is being waged, and time is not on the side of adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC1IDjpUXbWwmJnWGb9FBldinoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15420'),
  ('105907669665616024', 'The Plague', 2025, 'Drama', 'Charlie Polinger, Stefania Ispas, Diana Molea', 'Charlie Polinger', 'Everett Blunck, Kayo Martin, Joel Edgerton, Kenny Rasmussen, Lucas Adler, Caden Burris, Elliott Heffernan, Lennox Espy', 'R', 'A socially awkward tween endures the ruthless hierarchy at a water polo camp, his anxiety spiraling into psychological turmoil over the summer.', 'A socially awkward tween endures the ruthless hierarchy at a water polo camp, his anxiety spiraling into psychological turmoil over the summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0RWuqzgvyfiIYU4QfgJHhmxZF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370814'),
  ('728958547460711403', 'The Plague Dogs', 1982, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama', 'Martin Rosen, Colin White, Tony Guy', 'Martin Rosen', 'John Hurt, Christopher Benjamin, James Bolam, Nigel Hawthorne, Warren Mitchell, Judy Geeson, Patrick Stewart, Brian Stirner', 'NR', 'Two dogs, Rowf and Snitter, struggle to survive in the countryside after escaping from an animal research laboratory. They are pursued by search parties and then the military after rumors spread that they could be carrying the bubonic plague.', 'Two dogs, Rowf and Snitter, struggle to survive in the countryside after escaping from an animal research laboratory. They are pursued by search parties and then the military after rumors spread that they could be carrying the bubonic plague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLKf3C4O1ZlkWrz0awUfgRneumL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30060'),
  ('34575650212146218', 'The Plague in Florence', 1919, 'Drama, Horror, History', 'Otto Rippert, Willy Hameister, Emil Schünemann', 'Fritz Lang', 'Marga von Kierska, Anders Wikman, Theodor Becker, Otto Mannstaedt, Karl Bernhard, Hans Walter, Auguste Prasch-Grevenberg, Julietta Brandt', null, 'Suddenly appearing in Florence, an evil seductress causes Cesare, the city''s ruler, and his son to both fall madly in love with her. The son, killing his father before an order to torture the woman can be carried out, then turns the city''s churches into dens of sexual debauchery. Acts of evil and corruption continue unabated until the arrival of Death, who brings with her a horrible plague which she is about to loose upon the city.', 'Suddenly appearing in Florence, an evil seductress causes Cesare, the city''s ruler, and his son to both fall madly in love with her. The son, killing his father before an order to torture the woman can be carried out, then turns the city''s churches into dens of sexual debauchery. Acts of evil and corruption continue unabated until the arrival of Death, who brings with her a horrible plague which she is about to loose upon the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GkxU3rJx7oLRas2lUQAAi0tJWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285797'),
  ('803789921898784799', 'The Plague of the Zombies', 1966, 'Horror', 'John Gilling, Arthur Grant', 'Peter Bryan', 'André Morell, Brook Williams, Diane Clare, John Carson, Jacqueline Pearce, Michael Ripper, Roy Royston, Alexander Davion', 'NR', 'Sir James Forbes arrives in a remote Cornish village to identify a mysterious plague afflicting the population. He discovers that one of the squires is a disciple of Haitian witchcraft and using dark magic to resurrect the dead. As the plan to create undead servants unravels, the squire unleashes his zombie army on the unsuspecting village.', 'Sir James Forbes arrives in a remote Cornish village to identify a mysterious plague afflicting the population. He discovers that one of the squires is a disciple of Haitian witchcraft and using dark magic to resurrect the dead. As the plan to create undead servants unravels, the squire unleashes his zombie army on the unsuspecting village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFme66bZIpOzBlTNZvCxlQzuML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29049'),
  ('466939107628491636', 'The Plagues of Breslau', 2018, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Mirosław Kuba Brożek, Mikołaj Syguła, Patryk Vega', 'Patryk Vega, Sylwia Koperska-Mrozińska', 'Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Daria Widawska, Tomasz Oświeciński, Andrzej Grabowski, Filip Chajzer, Ewa Kasprzyk, Iwona Bielska, Maria Dejmek', null, 'Every day at 6 pm a serial killer kills another person. Police officer Helena Rus thinks the killings are done by one man only and decides to reveal the killer''s identity by getting back in 18th century history of the city.', 'Every day at 6 pm a serial killer kills another person. Police officer Helena Rus thinks the killings are done by one man only and decides to reveal the killer''s identity by getting back in 18th century history of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcLCLWYuLJFHrN4y23YxHTlZVsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557336'),
