  ('58779404727707779', 'The Players', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Fred Cavayé, Alexandre Courtes', 'Nicolas Bedos, Philippe Caverivière, Jean Dujardin', 'Jean Dujardin, Gilles Lellouche, Géraldine Nakache, Alexandra Lamy, Priscilla de Laforcade, Florine Delobel, Guillaume Canet, Sandrine Kiberlain', 'R', 'Eight short films explore the subject of male infidelity. Serial cheaters, Fred and Greg, spend a night on the town doing what they do best, and with absolutely no regrets. The duo play various characters in assorted extracurricular situations, ranging from sexist to the darker sides of carnal desires.', 'Eight short films explore the subject of male infidelity. Serial cheaters, Fred and Greg, spend a night on the town doing what they do best, and with absolutely no regrets. The duo play various characters in assorted extracurricular situations, ranging from sexist to the darker sides of carnal desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boHSJQ4ECBNjuEKTgct2jBOLqQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89899'),
  ('1022010801562942571', 'The Players', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Gastone Salerno, Giulia Emiliani, Stefano Mordini', 'Stefano Mordini, Riccardo Scamarcio, Filippo Bologna', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Valerio Mastandrea, Laura Chiatti, Valentina Cervi, Marina Foïs, Massimiliano Gallo, Ascanio Balbo, Alessandro Fiorucci', 'R', 'From campy lies to sexy surprises, this collection of vignettes captures the follies of several men as they fumble with fidelity and relationships.', 'From campy lies to sexy surprises, this collection of vignettes captures the follies of several men as they fumble with fidelity and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCATbnGxYI271PyDPVjzbpm2sxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608649'),
  ('247870311620873333', 'The Players Club', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ice Cube, Malik Hassan Sayeed', 'Ice Cube', 'LisaRaye McCoy, Bernie Mac, Jamie Foxx, Ice Cube, Terrence Howard, Michael Clarke Duncan, Monica Calhoun, Faizon Love', 'R', 'Single mother Diana struggles to provide for her child and pay for her college education. When she meets two dancers from a nearby gentlemen''s club, Diana''s convinced there''s fast money to be made stripping.', 'Single mother Diana struggles to provide for her child and pay for her college education. When she meets two dancers from a nearby gentlemen''s club, Diana''s convinced there''s fast money to be made stripping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zq6D4HBRK6GMaJj4w5n5QsKXkLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19848'),
  ('127448531232835777', 'The Playgirls and the Vampire', 1960, 'Horror', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Walter Brandi, Lyla Rocco, Maria Giovannini, Alfredo Rizzo, Marisa Quattrini, Leonardo Botta, Antoine Nicos, Corinne Fontaine', null, 'Sexy nightclub dancers get trapped in a dark, creepy castle for the night.', 'Sexy nightclub dancers get trapped in a dark, creepy castle for the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZhkppfq0bATYF27HVJsnh6qdbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37678'),
  ('47010111314991858', 'The Playground', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jérémie Attard, Audrey Gini, Hafsia Herzi', 'Nacim Mehtar, Victor Jestin', 'Lucie Loste Berset, Clotilde Courau, Djanis Bouzyani, Ludovic Berthillot, Jérémie Laheurte, Lizzie Brocheré, Sylvère Jacot, Olivia Espinas', null, 'After years of traveling, Anyas parents have decided to return from Australia to their native France, and she has to attend a public school for the first time in her life. But normal everyday school life quickly causes problems for the girl. On the first day, she gets a shot with a soccer ball on the head. When no one wants to apologize for this, a violent argument immediately ensues. So she messed it up with the locals right from the start. Anya becomes an outsider, which doesn''t even really bother her. But Zoé, Nils and Jade, who are also a bit different, take care of her. A new clique is formed. But the pretty outsider would prefer to be friends with Nathan, the school director''s son. But he gives her the cold shoulder because it wouldn''t be cool to be interested in girls in front of his buddies. Meanwhile, the girls hatch a plan to win their place in the schoolyard. A real fight ensues between the students. Now it''s girls against boys. But how far can a dispute between children go?', 'After years of traveling, Anyas parents have decided to return from Australia to their native France, and she has to attend a public school for the first time in her life. But normal everyday school life quickly causes problems for the girl. On the first day, she gets a shot with a soccer ball on the head. When no one wants to apologize for this, a violent argument immediately ensues. So she messed it up with the locals right from the start. Anya becomes an outsider, which doesn''t even really bother her. But Zoé, Nils and Jade, who are also a bit different, take care of her. A new clique is formed. But the pretty outsider would prefer to be friends with Nathan, the school director''s son. But he gives her the cold shoulder because it wouldn''t be cool to be interested in girls in front of his buddies. Meanwhile, the girls hatch a plan to win their place in the schoolyard. A real fight ensues between the students. Now it''s girls against boys. But how far can a dispute between children go?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oP4wMGuAIoYQCVXLdC6hxM4vwga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920302'),
  ('581292488337467634', 'The Plea', 1967, 'Drama', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Oleksandr Antypenko', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Anzor Salukvadze, Rezo Kveselava', 'Spartak Bagashvili, Rusudan Kiknadze, Ramaz Chkhikvadze, Otar Megvinetukhutsesi, Zurab Kapianidze, Nana Qavtaradze, Irakli Uchaneishvili, Tengiz Archvadze', null, 'Brave sons of Khevsureti and Kisteti fight against each to protect their homelands. But, they confront faulty domestic traditions to respect enemy’s true prowess and find themselves in conflict with own compatriots.', 'Brave sons of Khevsureti and Kisteti fight against each to protect their homelands. But, they confront faulty domestic traditions to respect enemy’s true prowess and find themselves in conflict with own compatriots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inW0AJ8Cllmru8dPA9ao7cWfxMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149727'),
  ('838923659027103423', 'The Pleasure', 1985, 'Drama', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Catherine Corbaz', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Gabriele Tinti, Andrea Guzon, Lilli Carati, Marco Mattioli, Laura Gemser, Dagmar Lassander, Maurice Poli', null, 'Italy in the early 1930s. To the elderly aristocrat Gerard, all that is left of Leonora, the love of his life, are a number of erotic tape recordings. She led a double life as respectable wife and mother of two, and as a whore at the local brothel. Now, after her death, her children Ursula and Edmund pass under the tutelage of Gerard. Having not seen them for many years, he is utterly bewildered by Ursula''s uncanny likeness to her mother. While Gerard''s mistress Fiorella takes care of Edmund''s sexual needs, Ursula follows the last instructions of her mother. In the process, she uses the legacy of her mother''s recordings to get into the mindset of her relationship with Gerard. Is Gerard ready to find his lost love Leonora again... in the likeness of her very daughter?', 'Italy in the early 1930s. To the elderly aristocrat Gerard, all that is left of Leonora, the love of his life, are a number of erotic tape recordings. She led a double life as respectable wife and mother of two, and as a whore at the local brothel. Now, after her death, her children Ursula and Edmund pass under the tutelage of Gerard. Having not seen them for many years, he is utterly bewildered by Ursula''s uncanny likeness to her mother. While Gerard''s mistress Fiorella takes care of Edmund''s sexual needs, Ursula follows the last instructions of her mother. In the process, she uses the legacy of her mother''s recordings to get into the mindset of her relationship with Gerard. Is Gerard ready to find his lost love Leonora again... in the likeness of her very daughter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHp3SBil5DMa14QL5JDa02nLPTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289129'),
  ('1132037593063681238', 'The Pleasure Garden', 1925, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Baron Ventimiglia', 'Eliot Stannard', 'Virginia Valli, Carmelita Geraghty, Miles Mander, John Stuart, George Snell, Frederic K. Martini, Florence Helminger', null, 'Two chorus girls at the Pleasure Garden Theatre follow different paths in love and fortune.', 'Two chorus girls at the Pleasure Garden Theatre follow different paths in love and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DpCDqbyxBlSChWTCx42n4WA8BX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64398'),
  ('553483261187758288', 'The Pleasure Girls', 1965, 'Drama', 'Gerry O''Hara, Christopher Dryhurst', 'Gerry O''Hara', 'Klaus Kinski, Ian McShane, Yvonne Antrobus, Kate Binchy, Suzanna Leigh, Francesca Annis, Anneke Wills, Tony Tanner', 'R', 'When Sally moves to London to pursue a modelling career, she moves in with Angela and Dee and discovers the world of the carefree bachelor girl in Swinging London. Over one weekend - filled with parties, blossoming friendships, and romantic encounters with Keith and Nikko (Klaus Kinski) - the vivacious girls learn about life''s pleasures and pains.', 'When Sally moves to London to pursue a modelling career, she moves in with Angela and Dee and discovers the world of the carefree bachelor girl in Swinging London. Over one weekend - filled with parties, blossoming friendships, and romantic encounters with Keith and Nikko (Klaus Kinski) - the vivacious girls learn about life''s pleasures and pains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQk4tHWycHCzX0rTMIt1N3smuj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43644'),
  ('505698967086772959', 'The Pleasure Is All Mine', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Isabelle Broué, Christophe Offenstein', 'Isabelle Broué, Caroline Thivel, Hélène Woillot', 'Marie Gillain, Julien Boisselier, Garance Clavel, Brigitte Roüan, Tsilla Chelton, Lionel Abelanski, Idit Cebula, François Marthouret', null, 'A beautiful, self-centered young woman''s life turns upside down when she suddenly "loses her clitoris" (i.e. her ability to have an orgasm).', 'A beautiful, self-centered young woman''s life turns upside down when she suddenly "loses her clitoris" (i.e. her ability to have an orgasm).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xOrUs0JL9TK0AeuRdk1tzjkok5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48426'),
  ('878196584514985449', 'The Pleasure is Mine', 2015, null, 'Elisa Miller', 'Gabriela Vidal, Elisa Miller', 'Flor Eduarda Gurrola, Fausto Alzati, Camila Sodi, Tina Romero, Tara Parra', null, 'Passionately in love and eager to live together as a couple, Rita and Mateo move out of the city and take refuge in the apparent tranquility of Mateo’s deceased father’s country house. Like every new relationship, it is all sex and fun in the beginning until Rita’s desire to become a mother, Mateo’s fear of commitment.', 'Passionately in love and eager to live together as a couple, Rita and Mateo move out of the city and take refuge in the apparent tranquility of Mateo’s deceased father’s country house. Like every new relationship, it is all sex and fun in the beginning until Rita’s desire to become a mother, Mateo’s fear of commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeAhcXUZf1kqu3pq5cUjJfwLlhV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339208'),
  ('981980045735478832', 'The Pleasure of Being Robbed', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Josh Safdie, Brett Jutkiewicz', 'Josh Safdie, Eléonore Hendricks', 'Eléonore Hendricks, Josh Safdie, Ariel Schulman, Wayne Chin, Dawn Glickman, Van Neistat, Sam Lisenco, Bat ''Batman'' Baxter', 'NR', 'A curious and lost Eleonore looks for something everywhere, even in the bags of strangers who find themselves sadly smiling only well after she''s left their lives. They owe her their thanks.', 'A curious and lost Eleonore looks for something everywhere, even in the bags of strangers who find themselves sadly smiling only well after she''s left their lives. They owe her their thanks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4TVFGuAgx75OEsYwpVn1ESp6iC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42585'),
  ('367052881657840203', 'The Pleasure of His Company', 1961, 'Comedy', 'George Seaton, Robert Burks', 'Samuel A. Taylor', 'Fred Astaire, Debbie Reynolds, Lilli Palmer, Tab Hunter, Gary Merrill, Charles Ruggles, Harold Fong, Elvia Allman', null, 'Biddeford "Pogo" Poole, an urbane charmer, has been absent for most of the life of his daughter, Jessica, but he pops up again as she prepares to marry a California rancher. Though Pogo''s ex-wife remains unimpressed, Jessica quickly falls for her father''s charismatic offensive. Soon, however, his reappearance causes complications for the bride-to-be, and she must decide whether or not to go ahead with the wedding.', 'Biddeford "Pogo" Poole, an urbane charmer, has been absent for most of the life of his daughter, Jessica, but he pops up again as she prepares to marry a California rancher. Though Pogo''s ex-wife remains unimpressed, Jessica quickly falls for her father''s charismatic offensive. Soon, however, his reappearance causes complications for the bride-to-be, and she must decide whether or not to go ahead with the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90GiYW7FGSnbpi60N5pZbY2bH34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110493'),
  ('1144949322743431371', 'The Pleasure of Love in Iran', 1976, 'Documentary, Romance', 'Agnès Varda, Charles Van Damme, Nurith Aviv', 'Agnès Varda', 'Valérie Mairesse, Ali Rafie, Thérèse Liotard', 'NR', 'An Iranian man and a French woman stroll around the city of Isfahan, Iran and find that their love is mirrored perfectly in the architecture and mosaics of the city''s mosques.', 'An Iranian man and a French woman stroll around the city of Isfahan, Iran and find that their love is mirrored perfectly in the architecture and mosaics of the city''s mosques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHw33kFGCTrfcglO9bTyKgGxixZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143499'),
  ('977794291227801147', 'The Pleasure Seekers', 1964, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Drama', 'Jean Negulesco, Daniel L. Fapp, Joseph Lenzi', 'Edith R. Sommer', 'Ann-Margret, Anthony Franciosa, Carol Lynley, Gardner McKay, Pamela Tiffin, André Lawrence, Gene Tierney, Vito Scotti', 'NR', 'A trio of gorgeous American tourists hope to find love while vacationing in Spain. Secretary Maggie Williams falls hard for a married newsman named Paul Barton while fighting off the advances of one of his employees. Singer Fran Hobson sets her sights on a handsome European doctor. And coed Susie Higgins receives an unexpected proposal from smooth-talking womanizer Emilio Lacaya.', 'A trio of gorgeous American tourists hope to find love while vacationing in Spain. Secretary Maggie Williams falls hard for a married newsman named Paul Barton while fighting off the advances of one of his employees. Singer Fran Hobson sets her sights on a handsome European doctor. And coed Susie Higgins receives an unexpected proposal from smooth-talking womanizer Emilio Lacaya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdur0njZcdnIlE6T1HPlYH0iQxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95358'),
  ('449346018580932675', 'The Pledge', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sean Penn, Chris Menges, Brian W. Cook', 'Jerzy Kromolowski, Mary Olson-Kromolowski', 'Jack Nicholson, Helen Mirren, Aaron Eckhart, Robin Wright, Sam Shepard, Benicio del Toro, Patricia Clarkson, Mickey Rourke', 'R', 'A police chief, about to retire, pledges to help a woman find her daughter''s killer.', 'A police chief, about to retire, pledges to help a woman find her daughter''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QOzFL3FPMAUNNPrNiKC3mEDxco.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5955'),
  ('525203677850758760', 'The Plot', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Hwang Ki-suk, Kang Dae-hui, Lee Yo-sup', 'Lee Yo-sup, Szeto Kam-Yuen, Nicholl Tang Nik-Kei', 'Gang Dong-won, Lee Mu-saeng, Lee Mi-sook, Lee Hyun-wook, Tang Joon-sang, Kim Hong-pa, Jung Eun-chae, Kim Shin-rock', null, 'Young-il is a plotter who manipulates murder-for-hire cases to look like accidents. Nobody knows those accidents are in fact perfectly plotted, planned murders. After finishing a flawlessly plotted case with no trace of evidence left behind, Young-il receives a new request. His new target is a prominent political figure who is always under the spotlight. Even with the higher risk of getting exposed, Young-il decides to take the case with his team members, Jackie, Wol-cheon, and Jeom-man. When the plot is ready after immaculate preparation and numerous rehearsals, the team finally makes its move, but some unexpected trouble threatens Young-il’s perfect plan.', 'Young-il is a plotter who manipulates murder-for-hire cases to look like accidents. Nobody knows those accidents are in fact perfectly plotted, planned murders. After finishing a flawlessly plotted case with no trace of evidence left behind, Young-il receives a new request. His new target is a prominent political figure who is always under the spotlight. Even with the higher risk of getting exposed, Young-il decides to take the case with his team members, Jackie, Wol-cheon, and Jeom-man. When the plot is ready after immaculate preparation and numerous rehearsals, the team finally makes its move, but some unexpected trouble threatens Young-il’s perfect plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBZ1N68Ral2rtNzeQAmGFhDadq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865910'),
  ('909449374688153422', 'The Plot Against Harry', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Michael Roemer, Robert M. Young, Michael Kapler', 'Michael Roemer', 'Martin Priest, Ben Lang, Maxine Woods, Henry Nemo, Jacquelyn Taylor, Jean Leslie, Ellen Herbert, Sandra Kazan', null, 'Deadpan, small-time Kosher Nostra mobster Harry Plotnick goes meshugga when he gets into the catering biz with his ex-brother-in-law.', 'Deadpan, small-time Kosher Nostra mobster Harry Plotnick goes meshugga when he gets into the catering biz with his ex-brother-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fh4A5kBDWgK9utwvJRCzgvlHGBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41943'),
  ('919825350248768876', 'The Plot Against the President', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Kenneth Michael II, Daniel Bostic, Amanda Milius', null, 'Michael Anton, Mike Cernovich, Tom Fitton, Matt Gaetz, Rudolph Giuliani, Sebastian Gorka, Ric Grenell, Kimberly Guilfoyle', 'NR', 'Based on Lee Smith''s book of the same name, this documentary follows the story of the biggest political scandal in U.S. history.', 'Based on Lee Smith''s book of the same name, this documentary follows the story of the biggest political scandal in U.S. history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btgFkggVJpTw99vRY5Zck0k3Eb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746605'),
