  ('63758637034122862', 'The Ploy', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Fabio Zamarion, David Grieco, Lorenzo Bertolazzi', 'Guido Bulla, David Grieco', 'Massimo Ranieri, Libero De Rienzo, Matteo Taranto, François-Xavier Demaison, Milena Vukotić, Roberto Citran, Alessandro Sardelli, Paolo Bonacelli', null, 'In the summer of ''75 Pier Paolo Pasolini''s film, "Salò", is stolen from the lab where he is editing it. This is just the first step of an intricate plan that will bring the great poet to his violent death.', 'In the summer of ''75 Pier Paolo Pasolini''s film, "Salò", is stolen from the lab where he is editing it. This is just the first step of an intricate plan that will bring the great poet to his violent death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auQ8RYBHIyYqclf3HD3V82mCnpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389365'),
  ('1124315090282180586', 'The Plumber', 1979, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Peter Weir, David Sanderson', 'Peter Weir', 'Ivar Kants, Judy Morris, Robert Coleby, Candy Raymond, Henri Szeps, Yomi Abioudan, Beverley Roberts, Bruce Rosen', null, 'A young couple, living in a campus apartment complex, are repeatedly harassed by an eccentric plumber, who subjects them to a series of bizarre mind games while making unnecessary repairs to their bathroom.', 'A young couple, living in a campus apartment complex, are repeatedly harassed by an eccentric plumber, who subjects them to a series of bizarre mind games while making unnecessary repairs to their bathroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPdqhZSGAkAGMOEX3OdDqGlv0rA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96909'),
  ('102454905547346371', 'The Plunderers', 1960, 'Western', 'Joseph Pevney, Gene Polito, Robert Saunders', 'Bob Barbash', 'Jeff Chandler, John Saxon, Dolores Hart, Marsha Hunt, Jay C. Flippen, Ray Stricklyn, James Westerfield, Dee Pollock', 'NR', 'Four young toughs have ridden into Trail City and claimed it as easy pickings for their bullying and gunplay. The whole town will be overrun by lawlessness if decent folks like rancher and Civil War veteran Sam Christy don’t take a stand.', 'Four young toughs have ridden into Trail City and claimed it as easy pickings for their bullying and gunplay. The whole town will be overrun by lawlessness if decent folks like rancher and Civil War veteran Sam Christy don’t take a stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KkhFmzDBNNWWpHBJKvOCWMRAkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194487'),
  ('185650292467755057', 'The Pod Generation', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Andrij Parekh, Maïmouna Bancel, Caroline De Schryver', 'Sophie Barthes', 'Emilia Clarke, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Rosalie Craig, Vinette Robinson, Kathryn Hunter, Jean-Marc Barr, Verona Verbakel, Sarah Gallagher', 'PG-13', 'In a not-so-distant future, couples can share pregnancy on a more equal footing via detachable artificial wombs. While botanist Alvy has doubts about this new way of birthing babies, his love for Rachel prompts him to take a leap of faith.', 'In a not-so-distant future, couples can share pregnancy on a more equal footing via detachable artificial wombs. While botanist Alvy has doubts about this new way of birthing babies, his love for Rachel prompts him to take a leap of faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A1gNoYBjmwcShNtxYCfkZkMKIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889675'),
  ('373486517831546821', 'The Poet', 2007, 'Drama, War', 'Damian Lee, David Pelletier', 'Jack Crystal', 'Daryl Hannah, Nina Dobrev, Kim Coates, Colm Feore, Roy Scheider, Jonathan Scarfe, Devon Bostick, Zachary Bennett', 'PG-13', 'At the dawn of World War 2, a Rabbi''s daughter and a disenchanted German soldier fall in love and are separated by the war. They struggle on a perilous journey to find one another.', 'At the dawn of World War 2, a Rabbi''s daughter and a disenchanted German soldier fall in love and are separated by the war. They struggle on a perilous journey to find one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHfqatnKlnMeLel63IOAjH5HAHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48017'),
  ('780335604724156333', 'The Poet and the Boy', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim Yang-hee, Choi Yun-man, Kim Hee-tae', 'Kim Yang-hee', 'Yang Ik-june, Jeon Hye-jin, Jung Ga-ram, Bang Eun-hee, Kim Sung-kyun, Inan, Baek Ji-won, Choi Hee-jin', null, 'Trapped in routine, a Jeju poet finds himself drawn to a boy—and to emotions he’s never dared name.', 'Trapped in routine, a Jeju poet finds himself drawn to a boy—and to emotions he’s never dared name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ao8l1TZu4Tl95xgzXyGydWJxlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469885'),
  ('1144571790122776271', 'The Poet of the Castle', 1959, 'Documentary', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, A.P. Castro', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Manuel Bandeira', null, 'A 10-minute portrait of modernist poet and de Andrade’s godfather, Manuel Bandeira, is clear in its affection for it subject, though like many New-Waveish films of the time, depicts the modern urban landscape as an ominous and alienating force.', 'A 10-minute portrait of modernist poet and de Andrade’s godfather, Manuel Bandeira, is clear in its affection for it subject, though like many New-Waveish films of the time, depicts the modern urban landscape as an ominous and alienating force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6UA7WUzr3qGlOi2q4dg4PlqtFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258112'),
  ('1084671107359845472', 'The Point', 1971, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Fred Wolf', 'Norm Lenzer', 'Ringo Starr, Paul Frees, Lennie Weinrib, Bill Martin, Buddy Foster, Joan Gerber, Mike Lookinland, Alan Barzman', 'NR', 'Years ago, there was a place called The Land of Point, because everything in The Land of Point had one: the barns, the houses, the cars, everything, even the people. Everyone in The Land of Point had a point at the top of its head. Everyone, that is, except Oblio, who was born round-headed. Since he had no point, Oblio, along with his trusty dog, Arrow, was banished to the Pointless Forest. Join them to see what wonders await these two intrepid travelers as they make their way on their amazing, song-filled journey of discovery!', 'Years ago, there was a place called The Land of Point, because everything in The Land of Point had one: the barns, the houses, the cars, everything, even the people. Everyone in The Land of Point had a point at the top of its head. Everyone, that is, except Oblio, who was born round-headed. Since he had no point, Oblio, along with his trusty dog, Arrow, was banished to the Pointless Forest. Join them to see what wonders await these two intrepid travelers as they make their way on their amazing, song-filled journey of discovery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKeEBYEvbpGarecszr4MyOxgjPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23544'),
  ('571291029206122342', 'The Point Men', 2001, 'Action, Drama', 'John Glen, Alec Mills', 'Steven Hartov, Ripley Highsmith', 'Christopher Lambert, Vincent Regan, Cal MacAninch, Nicolas de Pruyssenaere, Donald Sumpter, Maryam D''Abo, Kerry Fox, Oliver Haden', null, 'Some time after their botched operation to capture a known Palestinian terrorist, a team of Israeli agents starts to get killed off one by one. Their leader must get to the bottom of things before the killer(s) plan is complete.', 'Some time after their botched operation to capture a known Palestinian terrorist, a team of Israeli agents starts to get killed off one by one. Their leader must get to the bottom of things before the killer(s) plan is complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNeO3ygV4sgsV0ERrJQzuCbTk8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46943'),
  ('79683404710194248', 'The Point Men', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Cho Gyu-young, Lee Seung-hun, Kim Hae-il', 'Ahn Young-soo', 'Hwang Jung-min, Hyun Bin, Kang Ki-young, Lee Seung-cheol, Jeong Jae-seong, Park Hyoung-soo, Ahn Chang-hwan, Jeon Seong-woo', null, 'A group of Korean tourists is taken hostage by an extremist Taliban group in Afghanistan. The Korean government dispatches Jae-ho, known as one of Korea''s most skilled diplomats, in order to handle the situation. Once he arrives, he asks for the Afghan government''s cooperation and uses every means possible to free the hostages. However, his efforts go in vain. Due to his failure, he''s forced to work with Dae-sik, a special agent who is an expert on the Middle East. As they begin making their move to get to the Taliban, the first hostage death occurs. With nowhere else to turn, the two become unlikely allies in a race against time to save the rest of the hostages.', 'A group of Korean tourists is taken hostage by an extremist Taliban group in Afghanistan. The Korean government dispatches Jae-ho, known as one of Korea''s most skilled diplomats, in order to handle the situation. Once he arrives, he asks for the Afghan government''s cooperation and uses every means possible to free the hostages. However, his efforts go in vain. Due to his failure, he''s forced to work with Dae-sik, a special agent who is an expert on the Middle East. As they begin making their move to get to the Taliban, the first hostage death occurs. With nowhere else to turn, the two become unlikely allies in a race against time to save the rest of the hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBwFfruuNu5JAkeum499yykZibo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606400'),
  ('140360720742254725', 'The Pointer', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Walt Disney, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Mickey and Pluto go hunting for quail. Pluto scares away the first ones they see; Mickey scolds him, then relents. He shows Pluto how to be a pointer, and they set off after another quail, but Mickey accidentally jumps on a bear''s nose, and thinks it''s Pluto. Meanwhile, Pluto finds the quail and points. The babies climb on board and start picking at his hairs, but Pluto''s been told not to move. Mickey finally comes across Pluto, who by now is covered by small animals, and realizes he''s being followed by a bear. Mickey tries to reason with the bear, and backs off a cliff, onto Pluto.', 'Mickey and Pluto go hunting for quail. Pluto scares away the first ones they see; Mickey scolds him, then relents. He shows Pluto how to be a pointer, and they set off after another quail, but Mickey accidentally jumps on a bear''s nose, and thinks it''s Pluto. Meanwhile, Pluto finds the quail and points. The babies climb on board and start picking at his hairs, but Pluto''s been told not to move. Mickey finally comes across Pluto, who by now is covered by small animals, and realizes he''s being followed by a bear. Mickey tries to reason with the bear, and backs off a cliff, onto Pluto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Oejpd9QwEDQ6rrzSw6lJQL8Z0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67599'),
  ('640410497593084727', 'The Pointsman', 1986, 'Drama', 'Jos Stelling', 'George Brugmans, Hans de Wolf, Jos Stelling', 'Jim van der Woude, Stéphane Excoffier, Johnny Kraaijkamp Sr., Josse De Pauw, Ton van Dort', null, 'A woman gets off a train by mistake and finds herself stranded alone with a peculiar man who doesn''t even speak her language.', 'A woman gets off a train by mistake and finds herself stranded alone with a peculiar man who doesn''t even speak her language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6d4qD0NJrsdtgALpHMYbNRpIaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208451'),
  ('290191159253809422', 'The Poison Rose', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Danessa Dudley, Witt Lacy, James Grayford', 'Richard Salvatore, Luca Giliberto, Francesco Cinquemani', 'John Travolta, Morgan Freeman, Peter Stormare, Famke Janssen, Robert Patrick, Brendan Fraser, Kat Graham, Alice Pagani', 'R', 'A down-on-his-luck PI is hired by his old flame to investigate a murder. But while the case at first appears routine, it slowly reveals itself to be a complex interwoven web of crimes, suspects and dead bodies.', 'A down-on-his-luck PI is hired by his old flame to investigate a murder. But while the case at first appears routine, it slowly reveals itself to be a complex interwoven web of crimes, suspects and dead bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSzyUmg719TgAxarFZYWjLLMqvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529983'),
  ('17230115353826552', 'The Poisoner', 2006, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Christian Faure, Willy Stassen, Frédéric Roullier-Gall', 'Olga Vincent, Daniel Riche', 'Muriel Robin, Mélanie Bernier, Jean-Yves Chatelais, Mado Maurin, Frank Geney, Annie Grégorio, Olivier Saladin, Gérard Chaillou', null, 'Loudun, October 1947. Leon Besnard and Marie celebrate their eighteenth wedding anniversary with friends and Ady, a former German prisoner they have "adopted". A few days later, Leon dies. Louise, a friend of the couple''s and probably Leon''s mistress claims that, on his deathbed, the deceased told her that Marie was poisoning him. The whole town soon condemns Marie and she is arrested and sent to jail. Did she really kill Léon as well as twelve other members of her family as she finds herself charged with?', 'Loudun, October 1947. Leon Besnard and Marie celebrate their eighteenth wedding anniversary with friends and Ady, a former German prisoner they have "adopted". A few days later, Leon dies. Louise, a friend of the couple''s and probably Leon''s mistress claims that, on his deathbed, the deceased told her that Marie was poisoning him. The whole town soon condemns Marie and she is arrested and sent to jail. Did she really kill Léon as well as twelve other members of her family as she finds herself charged with?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waAPlaUR9zhdwC41cjYGSSwWdwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164834'),
  ('909350357939921403', 'The Poisoning Angel', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Hugues Poulain, Stéphanie Pillonca', 'Gustave Kervern, Stéphanie Pillonca', 'Déborah François, Benjamin Biolay, Jonathan Zaccaï, Catherine Mouchet, Blanche François, Féodor Atkine, Christophe Miossec, Marthe Guérin Caufman', null, 'In 1800, Brittany is on its knees, overwhelmed by the regime in place and by the omnipotent clergy. It founders in an economic slump without end in sight and, in the middle of all this, a young, suffering girl pushes back as best she can. She is known as the "Poisoning Angel," an isolated child, mistreated by life and rocked by morbid thoughts. She will become one of the world''s most notorious serial killers and will sow death, perhaps merely to be looked at and loved.', 'In 1800, Brittany is on its knees, overwhelmed by the regime in place and by the omnipotent clergy. It founders in an economic slump without end in sight and, in the middle of all this, a young, suffering girl pushes back as best she can. She is known as the "Poisoning Angel," an isolated child, mistreated by life and rocked by morbid thoughts. She will become one of the world''s most notorious serial killers and will sow death, perhaps merely to be looked at and loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6r73eyl3LY7SeQ9juENQK7IDmJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428226'),
  ('270626443908818453', 'The Poker House', 2008, 'Drama', 'Lori Petty, Ken Seng', 'Lori Petty, David Alan Grier', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Selma Blair, Bokeem Woodbine, Chloë Grace Moretz, Sophi Bairley, Casey Tutton, Jayce Ryan, Natalie West', 'R', 'Agnes and her two sisters struggle through a day in a home overrun by gamblers, thieves, and johns.', 'Agnes and her two sisters struggle through a day in a home overrun by gamblers, thieves, and johns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTaqEbszsqhunQIjIMkkfwNMiiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63287'),
  ('231317174565526803', 'The Pokrovsky Gates', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mikhail Kozakov, Nikolay Nemolyaev', 'Leonid Zorin', 'Oleg Menshikov, Sofiya Pilyavskaya, Leonid Bronevoy, Inna Ulyanova, Anatoliy Ravikovich, Viktor Bortsov, Yelena Koreneva, Tatyana Dogileva', null, 'Stories from the lives of the tenants of the Moscow''s communal apartment: Kostik, who is a college student, lives with his aunt while studying; Arkady Velyurov who is a performing artist; Khobotovs, who are a divorced couple; and Sava, who is Margarita Khobotov''s new fiancé. All these people live in one apartment and their lives constantly touch each other''s.', 'Stories from the lives of the tenants of the Moscow''s communal apartment: Kostik, who is a college student, lives with his aunt while studying; Arkady Velyurov who is a performing artist; Khobotovs, who are a divorced couple; and Sava, who is Margarita Khobotov''s new fiancé. All these people live in one apartment and their lives constantly touch each other''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrf1p3LFAllzrm7wgXRWOg6c4We.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37176'),
  ('790977612797168295', 'The Polar Bear', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Greg Littlewood, Granz Henman, Til Schweiger', null, 'Til Schweiger, Karina Krawczyk, Benno Fürmann, Florian Lukas, Jürgen Tarrach, Ralf Richter, Thierry van Werveke, Ralph Herforth', null, 'Four characters become involved in one dramatic story: Nico has a mission to drive a car containing a live bomb to a specified destination, park the car and escape as quickly as she can. Leo has become his client''s target, having carried out a "contract" that unfortunately had already been cancelled. Fabian and Reza want to enjoy themselves without any money, bringing themselves into contact sooner or later with the police. Sooner or later all four will meet up in dramatic circumstances....', 'Four characters become involved in one dramatic story: Nico has a mission to drive a car containing a live bomb to a specified destination, park the car and escape as quickly as she can. Leo has become his client''s target, having carried out a "contract" that unfortunately had already been cancelled. Fabian and Reza want to enjoy themselves without any money, bringing themselves into contact sooner or later with the police. Sooner or later all four will meet up in dramatic circumstances....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9F1selwsaWrzScQIsNupbYuvdIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9321'),
  ('882980300930677360', 'The Polar Bear King', 1991, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Ola Solum, Philip Øgaard', 'Erik Borge', 'Jack Fjeldstad, Maria Bonnevie, Tobias Hoesl, Monica Nordquist, Anna-Lotta Larsson, Jon Laxdal, Helge Jordal, Marika Enstad', null, 'After his father is killed, Prince Valemon ascends the throne, only to be turned into a polar bear by a bitter witch who wants to be his queen.', 'After his father is killed, Prince Valemon ascends the throne, only to be turned into a polar bear by a bitter witch who wants to be his queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gONhmAnzWQaN97ydsRHCH7mIKUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37866'),
  ('847931696706397540', 'The Polar Express', 2004, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Robert Presley, Robert Zemeckis, Don Burgess', 'William Broyles Jr., Robert Zemeckis', 'Tom Hanks, Leslie Zemeckis, Eddie Deezen, Nona Gaye, Peter Scolari, Michael Jeter, Josh Hutcherson, Daryl Sabara', 'G', 'When a doubting young boy takes an extraordinary train ride to the North Pole, he embarks on a journey of self-discovery that shows him that the wonder of life never fades for those who believe.', 'When a doubting young boy takes an extraordinary train ride to the North Pole, he embarks on a journey of self-discovery that shows him that the wonder of life never fades for those who believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOoCzH0MqeGr2taUZO4SwG416PF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5255'),
  ('47180216711969197', 'The Police Are Blundering in the Dark', 1972, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Helia Colombo, Franco Arminio, Giancarlo Pancaldi', 'Helia Colombo', 'Joseph Arkim, Francisco Cortéz, Richard Fielding, Danny P. Gerzog, Gabriella Giorgelli, Halina Zalewska, Margaret Rose Keil, Robert Trewords', 'NR', 'During an outbreak of violent murders in the area targeting young women, a journalist searching for a female friend gone missing ends up in a villa owned by an eccentric photographer.', 'During an outbreak of violent murders in the area targeting young women, a journalist searching for a female friend gone missing ends up in a villa owned by an eccentric photographer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsEYAYnvueOoqKO17WOzusZfaqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105429'),
  ('1040422824172803366', 'The Police Commissioner', 1962, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Vana Caruso, Aldo Scavarda, Franco Montemurro', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Alberto Sordi, Alessandro Cutolo, Franca Tamantini, Alfredo Leggi, Angela Portaluri, Mino Doro, Franco Scandurra, Andrea De Pino', null, 'Popular Italian comic Alberto Sordi does an excellent job of creating a bumbling yet effective police inspector by the unlikely name of Dante Lombardozzi, in this entertaining comedy-murder mystery by director Luigi Comencini.', 'Popular Italian comic Alberto Sordi does an excellent job of creating a bumbling yet effective police inspector by the unlikely name of Dante Lombardozzi, in this entertaining comedy-murder mystery by director Luigi Comencini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PLx9OWz1uHuUQIjpku97JZdyoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157194'),
  ('860602646268816199', 'The Police War', 1979, 'Thriller', 'Alain Maline, Ramón F. Suárez, Robin Davis', 'Jean-Marie Guillaume, Jacques Labib', 'Claude Brasseur, Marlène Jobert, Claude Rich, Georges Staquet, Jean-François Stévenin, Etienne Chicot, David Jalil, Gérard Desarthe', null, 'Fush and Ballestrat are the heads of each department of the French police. Both have the task of combating serious crime and cleaning up the underworld.', 'Fush and Ballestrat are the heads of each department of the French police. Both have the task of combating serious crime and cleaning up the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh81sWlKbOrXaSqpdSMQZi2CtXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136922'),
  ('253944591281751945', 'The Policeman', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ephraim Kishon, David Gurfinkel', 'Ephraim Kishon', 'Shaike Ophir, Yosef Shiloach, Nitza Shaul, Gabi Amrani', null, 'Azulai is a policeman in Jaffa, whose incompetence is only matched by his soft-heartedness. His superiors want to send him to early retirement, but he would like to stay on the force, and the criminals of Jaffa don''t want to see him leave either...', 'Azulai is a policeman in Jaffa, whose incompetence is only matched by his soft-heartedness. His superiors want to send him to early retirement, but he would like to stay on the force, and the criminals of Jaffa don''t want to see him leave either...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOyTqwFXhr0rr4TS7MygtvXqeO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78233'),
  ('338614568560650077', 'The Policeman of the 16th Precinct', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Lakis Antonakos, Takis Vougiouklakis', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Kostas Hatzihristos, Thanasis Veggos, Stavros Xenidis, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Giorgos Gavriilidis, Marika Krevata, Kyveli Theohari, Aliki Georgouli', null, 'Ilias dresses himself in a police uniform as part of a complex burglary plot. Unfortunately for him, the impostor officer is called to assist in the investigation of a real crime. The other officers involved in this case treat him as a colleague, and he is forced to play along in hopes that his cover is not blown.', 'Ilias dresses himself in a police uniform as part of a complex burglary plot. Unfortunately for him, the impostor officer is called to assist in the investigation of a real crime. The other officers involved in this case treat him as a colleague, and he is forced to play along in hopes that his cover is not blown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFz7K8l9mcTMxArnO41nzYzZGEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167487'),
  ('865064064321554203', 'The Policeman''s Lineage', 2022, 'Crime', 'Kim Hyo-seong, Lee Tae-sung, Lee Kyu-man', 'Bae Young-ik', 'Choi Woo-shik, Cho Jin-woong, Lee Hyun-wook, Park Hee-soon, Kwon Yul, Park Myung-hoon, Jeong Seong-mo, Lee Eol', 'R', 'A by-the-book police officer is assigned to secretly investigate a team leader who believes that the rules shouldn''t stop an investigation. As the officer investigates further, his own attitudes begin to mirror the team leader''s.', 'A by-the-book police officer is assigned to secretly investigate a team leader who believes that the rules shouldn''t stop an investigation. As the officer investigates further, his own attitudes begin to mirror the team leader''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YtKjWJweenEg2ic25PdDvRMdff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610321'),
  ('835005040160798304', 'The Policeman''s Wife', 2013, 'Drama', 'Philip Gröning, Philip Gröning, Dirk Gornickel', 'Philip Gröning, Carola Diekmann', 'Alexandra Finder, David Zimmerschied, Chiara Kleemann, Horst Rehberg, Lars Rudolph, Katharina Susewind, Fabian Stromberger', null, 'The story of a young couple who live in a small town with their four-year-old daughter. The husband is so caught up in his work as a policeman that he gradually becomes increasingly alienated from his wife and daughter who become ever closer to one another as they discover the new town. It is only a matter of time before the conflicts within the family manifest themselves.', 'The story of a young couple who live in a small town with their four-year-old daughter. The husband is so caught up in his work as a policeman that he gradually becomes increasingly alienated from his wife and daughter who become ever closer to one another as they discover the new town. It is only a matter of time before the conflicts within the family manifest themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkqjMStvsRVQqb797vaykxn19D0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210228'),
  ('956566932597765366', 'The Policemen''s Little Run', 1907, 'Crime, Comedy', null, 'André Heuzé', null, null, 'A policeman spots a dog stealing a piece of meat from a butcher''s shop, and gives chase. Soon several more policemen have joined the pursuit. But the chase does not turn out as the policemen expect.', 'A policeman spots a dog stealing a piece of meat from a butcher''s shop, and gives chase. Soon several more policemen have joined the pursuit. But the chase does not turn out as the policemen expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEcR3nSWgUh99i3YUWzLJsCP1Td.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127103'),
  ('749908219407938679', 'The Polish Bride', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Karim Traïdia', 'Kees van der Hulst', 'Monic Hendrickx, Jaap Spijkers, Roef Ragas, Rudi Falkenhagen, Hakim Traidia, Soraya Traïdia', null, 'Drama on the dawning love between a Polish woman and a farmer. Anna is forced to work in a brothel, but manages to escape. She''s found, exhausted and scared, by Henk (the farmer) who offers her a place to stay, but her past chases her.', 'Drama on the dawning love between a Polish woman and a farmer. Anna is forced to work in a brothel, but manages to escape. She''s found, exhausted and scared, by Henk (the farmer) who offers her a place to stay, but her past chases her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbO65EHWzqpVibLOgPBgV09E72V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28527'),
  ('840929760538230200', 'The Polka King', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Maya Forbes, Andrei Schwartz', 'Maya Forbes, Wallace Wolodarsky', 'Jack Black, Jenny Slate, Jason Schwartzman, Jacki Weaver, JB Smoove, Robert Capron, Willie Garson, Vanessa Bayer', null, 'Local Pennsylvania polka legend Jan Lewan develops a plan to get rich that shocks his fans and lands him in jail.', 'Local Pennsylvania polka legend Jan Lewan develops a plan to get rich that shocks his fans and lands him in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJXC652ZGCnpDSn94kcucdplKYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419472'),
  ('368683074803164795', 'The Poll Diaries', 2010, 'Drama', 'Chris Kraus, Petra Misovic, Daniela Knapp', 'Chris Kraus, Oda Schaefer', 'Paula Beer, Edgar Selge, Tambet Tuisk, Jeanette Hain, Richy Müller, Enno Trebs, Yevgeni Sitokhin, Susi Stach', null, 'In 1914 on a family estate, Oda helps a wounded anarchist, and as their illicit friendship deepens, a family turmoil erupts as the war closes in.', 'In 1914 on a family estate, Oda helps a wounded anarchist, and as their illicit friendship deepens, a family turmoil erupts as the war closes in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUqYkdROAdjOxXWwsvqoWmphuPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82708'),
  ('460902152141592290', 'The Polygamous Wazzou', 1971, 'Drama', 'Oumarou Ganda', 'Oumarou Ganda', 'Oumarou Ganda, Joseph Salamatou, Zalika Souley, Garba Mamane, Amadou Seyni, Ousmane Diop', null, 'An Islamic faithfull returns from his holy pilgrimage to Mecca with the venerated title “el hadji”. On his return he falls in love with his daughter’s friend Santou, who is already engaged to be married to Garba. El Hadji however already has two wives and his second wife, Gaika, cannot stand the idea of another younger wife entering her house. She plots to kill Santou.', 'An Islamic faithfull returns from his holy pilgrimage to Mecca with the venerated title “el hadji”. On his return he falls in love with his daughter’s friend Santou, who is already engaged to be married to Garba. El Hadji however already has two wives and his second wife, Gaika, cannot stand the idea of another younger wife entering her house. She plots to kill Santou.', null, 'tmdb:movie:271846'),
  ('995974696360342285', 'The Pom Pom Girls', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Stephen M. Katz, Joseph Ruben, Robert J. Rosenthal', 'Joseph Ruben', 'Robert Carradine, Jennifer Ashley, Michael Mullins, Lisa Reeves, Susan Player, Cheryl Smith, Diane Lee Hart, Bill Adler', 'R', 'A football player at Rosedale High School is amorous of one of the cheerleaders, who is going with another guy. Another player can''t decide which of two cheerleaders he wants to be with. Meanwhile, the Big Game with Hardin High School is approaching, and a prank war is in full swing.', 'A football player at Rosedale High School is amorous of one of the cheerleaders, who is going with another guy. Another player can''t decide which of two cheerleaders he wants to be with. Meanwhile, the Big Game with Hardin High School is approaching, and a prank war is in full swing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZ8EfaSU41qBsLMQaokklygrcaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21955'),
  ('927872948993654326', 'The Pomegranate', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Serra Yılmaz, İdil Fırat, Irem Altug, Erdem Akakçe, Şükran Ovalı, Erimşah Bora', null, '“The Pomegranate” tells the story of a woman; seeking her own justice. “The Pomegranate” questions the justice of four people with different beliefs in a house, in half a day and in their own realms of faith. Asuman is a fortune-teller with uncanny psychic powers who lives in the suburbs of Istanbul but tells fortunes of the rich at their own luxurious places.', '“The Pomegranate” tells the story of a woman; seeking her own justice. “The Pomegranate” questions the justice of four people with different beliefs in a house, in half a day and in their own realms of faith. Asuman is a fortune-teller with uncanny psychic powers who lives in the suburbs of Istanbul but tells fortunes of the rich at their own luxurious places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18aR5q4SSciHoC1z1K9MtlV71an.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107889'),
  ('177488275138727269', 'The Poof Point', 2001, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Neal Israel, Robert Seaman, Miriam Footer', 'Ellen Weiss, Mel Friedman', 'Tahj Mowry, Dawnn Lewis, Mark Curry, Raquel Lee, Bruce Newbold, Jan Broberg Felt, Haley McCormick, Matt Grace', 'PG', 'Two teenage siblings must save the lives of their inventor parents after a time-machine experiment goes awry and their parents become younger and younger versions of themselves.', 'Two teenage siblings must save the lives of their inventor parents after a time-machine experiment goes awry and their parents become younger and younger versions of themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47bFtB79twgmBLFATwQZbR9UV28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109169'),
  ('526265184035383085', 'The Pool', 2001, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Boris von Sychowski, Notker Mahr', 'Lorenz Stassen', 'Kristen Miller, Elena Uhlig, Thorsten Grasshoff, Cordelia Bugeja, James McAvoy, Jonah Lotan, John Hopkins, Isla Fisher', 'R', 'International students at an elite Prague school are stalked and murdered by a masked killer while holding a party in an abandoned water park.', 'International students at an elite Prague school are stalked and murdered by a masked killer while holding a party in an abandoned water park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTsnm6cEP9wiSggBByQ05EVusw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11376'),
  ('903920273301861345', 'The Pool', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Prayuk Srithongkul, Jinanavin Veerapatra, Chakkarin Sriwattanamongkol', 'Ping Lumpraploeng', 'Theeradej Wongpuapan, Ratnomnot Ratchiratham, Kongkiat Khomsiri, Avajareen, Suteerush Channukool, Kuensit Suwanwatthakee, Phoranee Srithan, Ekasith Meeprasertsakul', null, 'Left alone to clean up a 6-meter-deep deserted pool, Day falls asleep on an inflatable raft. When he wakes, the water level has sunk so low that he can''t climb out on his own. Stuck in the pool, Day screams for help, but the only thing that hears him is a creature from a nearby crocodile farm.', 'Left alone to clean up a 6-meter-deep deserted pool, Day falls asleep on an inflatable raft. When he wakes, the water level has sunk so low that he can''t climb out on his own. Stuck in the pool, Day screams for help, but the only thing that hears him is a creature from a nearby crocodile farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmND84lMjMx32E40LID5f7WJB7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550201'),
  ('24174107064341563', 'The Pool Boys', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'J.B. Rogers, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Julie O''Hora, Justin Ware', 'Matthew Lillard, Brett Davern, Rachelle Lefevre, Jennifer Walcott, Simona Fusco, Rhoda Griffis, Darla Haun, Tom Arnold', 'R', 'A pool boy and a gardener turn an empty mansion into a home for women who belong to the world''s oldest profession.', 'A pool boy and a gardener turn an empty mansion into a home for women who belong to the world''s oldest profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewmXUCT61YxIj2xICKCX4YZJJdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31880'),
  ('474690805697971104', 'The Pool Hustlers', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Maurizio Ponzi, Carlo Cerchio, Ricky Tognazzi', 'Francesco Nuti, Maurizio Ponzi, Franco Ferrini', 'Francesco Nuti, Giuliana De Sio, Marcello Lotti, Antonio Petrocelli, Novello Novelli, Renato Cecchetto, Claudio Spadaro, Ricky Tognazzi', null, 'Francesco, nicknamed ''Toscano'', is a very good pool player but he never wins when he plays for money. He meets Chiara, a saxophone player, on a late night bus by swapping his case containing the cue with her one, containing the sax. The two fall in love, but in the meantime Francesco loses a big amount of money playing versus ''Scuro'', the long-time Italian champion. His only chance to pay the debt is to win the Italian Championships.', 'Francesco, nicknamed ''Toscano'', is a very good pool player but he never wins when he plays for money. He meets Chiara, a saxophone player, on a late night bus by swapping his case containing the cue with her one, containing the sax. The two fall in love, but in the meantime Francesco loses a big amount of money playing versus ''Scuro'', the long-time Italian champion. His only chance to pay the debt is to win the Italian Championships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eWcYkI7wrNCOUyxLUWo5uh46vF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42129'),
  ('483505439122512589', 'The Poolboy', 2011, 'Comedy', 'José Guridi, José Guridi', 'José Guridi, Sebastián Badilla', 'Sebastián Badilla, Denise Rosenthal, Alejandra Fosalba, Pablo Zuñiga, Fernando Larraín, Juan Pablo Flores, Ingrid Isensee, Justin Page', null, 'Gustavo Ortíz is a university student from a comfortable, middle class family who is forced to spend his summer vacation cleaning pools when his parents are struck down with financial problems. Ever the optimist, Gustavo soon realizes that his new job provides the perfect excuse to get closer to the girl of his dreams - his neighbor and former classmate, Nicole Ivanov.', 'Gustavo Ortíz is a university student from a comfortable, middle class family who is forced to spend his summer vacation cleaning pools when his parents are struck down with financial problems. Ever the optimist, Gustavo soon realizes that his new job provides the perfect excuse to get closer to the girl of his dreams - his neighbor and former classmate, Nicole Ivanov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igi0wJ3xH0iwF68mOSLadrp5FxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75533'),
  ('752381034567790505', 'The Pope Must Die', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Peter Richardson, Frank Gell', 'Peter Richardson, Pete Richens', 'Robbie Coltrane, Beverly D''Angelo, Alex Rocco, Adrian Edmondson, Paul Bartel, Herbert Lom, Peter Richardson, Annette Crosbie', 'R', 'A less-than-qualified and far-from-perfect priest is mistakenly named the new pope. As the pontiff, he must deal with Vatican corruption, the Mob and the reappearance of his old lover.', 'A less-than-qualified and far-from-perfect priest is mistakenly named the new pope. As the pontiff, he must deal with Vatican corruption, the Mob and the reappearance of his old lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oIN7fEJsCs9fAXXM3dszcv53TQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79927'),
  ('630733200901025045', 'The Pope of Greenwich Village', 1984, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Lawrence Tetenbaum, Joe Napolitano', 'Vincent Patrick', 'Eric Roberts, Mickey Rourke, Daryl Hannah, Geraldine Page, Kenneth McMillan, Tony Musante, M. Emmet Walsh, Burt Young', 'R', 'Charlie and his troublesome cousin Paulie decide to steal $150000 in order to back a "sure thing" race horse that Paulie has inside information on. The aftermath of the robbery gets them into serious trouble with the local Mafia boss and the corrupt New York City police department.', 'Charlie and his troublesome cousin Paulie decide to steal $150000 in order to back a "sure thing" race horse that Paulie has inside information on. The aftermath of the robbery gets them into serious trouble with the local Mafia boss and the corrupt New York City police department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5U0HNeGoJVK3xic7hK9lz89Ki9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32081'),
  ('236706924419987609', 'The Pope: Answers', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Jordi Évole, Màrius Sánchez, Júlia Badenes', 'Júlia Badenes, Airy Maragall, Laura Herrero', 'Pope Francis', null, 'Ten young people from all over the world meet in Rome with Pope Francis with the aim of talking and conveying to him the main concerns of their generation. What awaits them is an unprecedented meeting, a face-to-face conversation, and a unique event.', 'Ten young people from all over the world meet in Rome with Pope Francis with the aim of talking and conveying to him the main concerns of their generation. What awaits them is an unprecedented meeting, a face-to-face conversation, and a unique event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAQLc7BO7wRUKpHx7NDNnhOkKWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094266'),
  ('448254808512091875', 'The Pope''s Exorcist', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Julius Avery, Sarah Harte, Dee Doyle', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos, Michael Petroni', 'Russell Crowe, Daniel Zovatto, Alex Essoe, Peter DeSouza-Feighoney, Ralph Ineson, Laurel Marsden, Franco Nero, Ryan O''Grady', 'R', 'Father Gabriele Amorth, Chief Exorcist of the Vatican, investigates a young boy''s terrifying possession and ends up uncovering a centuries-old conspiracy the Vatican has desperately tried to keep hidden.', 'Father Gabriele Amorth, Chief Exorcist of the Vatican, investigates a young boy''s terrifying possession and ends up uncovering a centuries-old conspiracy the Vatican has desperately tried to keep hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFC4LS5qTAT3PinzdEzINfu1CV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758323'),
