  ('841234941413348235', 'The Pope''s Toilet', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'César Charlone, César Charlone, Enrique Fernández', 'Enrique Fernández, César Charlone', 'César Troncoso, Virginia Méndez, Virginia Ruiz, Mario Silva, Jose Arce, Henry De Leon, Rosario Dos Santos, Nelson Lence', null, 'In 1998, a small South American village is in a flurry over the Pope''s upcoming visit for the business opportunities that it will provide. While most of the residents plan to sell food at the parade, a smuggler family man decides to build a pay toilet.', 'In 1998, a small South American village is in a flurry over the Pope''s upcoming visit for the business opportunities that it will provide. While most of the residents plan to sell food at the parade, a smuggler family man decides to build a pay toilet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Zhshgt1l323HmHp812wHFKQDVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8267'),
  ('282271244623062854', 'The Poppy Is Also a Flower', 1966, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Terence Young, Henri Alekan', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Senta Berger, Stephen Boyd, Yul Brynner, Angie Dickinson, Georges Géret, Hugh Griffith, Jack Hawkins, Rita Hayworth', 'NR', 'A special United Nations bureau organises a campaign to trace a drug-smuggling ring across Europe to its source on the Afghanistan-Iran border.', 'A special United Nations bureau organises a campaign to trace a drug-smuggling ring across Europe to its source on the Afghanistan-Iran border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTrajryJ264PcANe0JCahq14MDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119482'),
  ('229250712949997583', 'The Porno Killers', 1980, 'Crime, Action', 'Roberto Mauri', 'Roberto Mauri', 'Carmen Russo, Cintia Lodetti, Vassili Karis, Mario Cutini, Mark Shannon, Bruno Minniti, Rinaldo DeWitt, Angelo Arquilla', null, 'An international drugs deal goes wrong, and two New York hit-women are dispatched to Rome, Italy, to get the missing pay money. Even before departure the girls have a poolside hot party with two young men, and when they get to their hotel in Rome, they share a shower and an intimate moment together. At the beach, they make eye contact with a pair of Italian gigolos, then use judo and wrestling holds to dominate them - and impose their feminist supremacy. Finally, they will get close to the money, but their mission is made easier as the top men are fighting each other for it.', 'An international drugs deal goes wrong, and two New York hit-women are dispatched to Rome, Italy, to get the missing pay money. Even before departure the girls have a poolside hot party with two young men, and when they get to their hotel in Rome, they share a shower and an intimate moment together. At the beach, they make eye contact with a pair of Italian gigolos, then use judo and wrestling holds to dominate them - and impose their feminist supremacy. Finally, they will get close to the money, but their mission is made easier as the top men are fighting each other for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6vDV0RjXW1XL1Huy8yY69YrI9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288985'),
  ('555720100854623445', 'The Port', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alexandr Laneyev, Alexandra Strelyanaya', 'Alexandra Strelyanaya', 'Aleksey Guskov, Mariya Borovicheva, Lev Semashkov, Yura Borisov, Irina Vilkova, Vladimir Daraganov, Roza Khairullina, Timofey Tribuntsev', null, 'Kira is a teenager who is left disabled after a car accident. Her father is a boxing coach and he refuses to accept her situation. He believes that it could be overcome with a special training simulator to rehabilitate her. During this difficult period, Kira meets Andrey. With falling in love her life is changed in an unexpected way. They both face new and daunting challenges, and only the irrepressible desire to live and love can lead them to overcome the mistakes of their youth.', 'Kira is a teenager who is left disabled after a car accident. Her father is a boxing coach and he refuses to accept her situation. He believes that it could be overcome with a special training simulator to rehabilitate her. During this difficult period, Kira meets Andrey. With falling in love her life is changed in an unexpected way. They both face new and daunting challenges, and only the irrepressible desire to live and love can lead them to overcome the mistakes of their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L0RWEOrc4V9VGqB8s8c0t3xMvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563230'),
  ('1052219117455756164', 'The Port', 2024, null, 'Dion Thelmas, Dion Thelmas', 'Dion Thelmas', 'Nichole Albers, Shawn Christopher Anderson, Andrew Artman, Nikia "Kia B" Briggs, Cameron Cottrell, Dennis Doyle Jr.', null, 'Trucking mogul Eric Varelli harbors dark secrets that threaten his Midwest family''s empire. Greed and misunderstandings erode loyalty as deadly betrayals unfold in his dangerous world.', 'Trucking mogul Eric Varelli harbors dark secrets that threaten his Midwest family''s empire. Greed and misunderstandings erode loyalty as deadly betrayals unfold in his dangerous world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OgCc05uXVGLeACGLYLTMddxTEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1333038'),
  ('759194661897022493', 'The Portable Door', 2023, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Walker, Donald McAlpine', 'Leon Ford', 'Patrick Gibson, Christoph Waltz, Damon Herriman, Sophie Wilde, Sam Neill, Demi Harman, Rachel House, Miranda Otto', 'PG-13', 'Paul and Sophie, interns at a mysterious London firm, become steadily aware their employers Humphrey and Dennis are anything but conventional – they are disrupting the world of magic by bringing modern corporate strategy to ancient magical practices.', 'Paul and Sophie, interns at a mysterious London firm, become steadily aware their employers Humphrey and Dennis are anything but conventional – they are disrupting the world of magic by bringing modern corporate strategy to ancient magical practices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49NQGuvaMWYeAD22h135tFd2Grs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830896'),
  ('324025539926585786', 'The Portrait', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Simon Ross, Luke Hanlein', 'David Griffiths', 'Natalia Cordova-Buckley, Ryan Kwanten, Isidora Goreshter, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Virginia Madsen, Santiago Segura, Tensaye Yosef, Steffie Baik', 'R', 'After her husband is devastated by a tragic accident, a devoted wife obsesses over a mysterious portrait that resembles him as he was; but when it starts to terrorize her, she must decide if it''s possessed or if she''s losing her mind.', 'After her husband is devastated by a tragic accident, a devoted wife obsesses over a mysterious portrait that resembles him as he was; but when it starts to terrorize her, she must decide if it''s possessed or if she''s losing her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv5ELWVKi5MSKaBE9RzBIMpYWHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1177411'),
  ('292146973249168483', 'The Portrait of a Lady', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jane Campion, Stuart Dryburgh, Martin Childs', 'Laura Jones', 'Nicole Kidman, John Malkovich, Barbara Hershey, Mary-Louise Parker, Christian Bale, Shelley Winters, Richard E. Grant, Shelley Duvall', 'PG-13', 'Ms. Isabel Archer isn''t afraid to challenge societal norms. Impressed by her free spirit, her kindhearted cousin writes her into his fatally ill father''s will. Suddenly rich and independent, Isabelle ventures into the world, along the way befriending a cynical intellectual and romancing an art enthusiast. However, the advantage of her affluence is called into question when she realizes the extent to which her money colors her relationships.', 'Ms. Isabel Archer isn''t afraid to challenge societal norms. Impressed by her free spirit, her kindhearted cousin writes her into his fatally ill father''s will. Suddenly rich and independent, Isabelle ventures into the world, along the way befriending a cynical intellectual and romancing an art enthusiast. However, the advantage of her affluence is called into question when she realizes the extent to which her money colors her relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoUuMtWTQXzfARYE0nF7Nn7gRuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36758'),
  ('413941219070419866', 'The Portuguese Falcon', 2015, 'Comedy, Action', 'João Leitão, Mário Melo Costa', 'João Leitão, Nuria Leon Bernardo', 'Gonçalo Waddington, David Chan Cordeiro, Matamba Joaquim, José Pinto, Miguel Guilherme, Rui Mendes, Carla Maciel, Pêpê Rapazote', null, 'A satire on anti-communist paranoia in the days of fascist dictatorship in Portugal. The series follows the adventures of the "Lusitanian superhero", the ultra-patriotic Captain Falcão, a man who follows the direct orders of António de Oliveira Salazar in the fight against the "red menace".', 'A satire on anti-communist paranoia in the days of fascist dictatorship in Portugal. The series follows the adventures of the "Lusitanian superhero", the ultra-patriotic Captain Falcão, a man who follows the direct orders of António de Oliveira Salazar in the fight against the "red menace".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuaYyJgZAS48neZKXfqDkue7DQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188621'),
  ('638025726804070685', 'The Portuguese House', 2025, 'Drama', 'Avelina Prat, Santiago Racaj, Irene Roqué', 'Avelina Prat', 'Manolo Solo, Maria de Medeiros, Branka Katić, Rita Cabaço, Xavi Mira, Morgan Blasco, Gonçalo Dantas, Rui Morisson', null, 'The disappearance of his wife leaves Fernando, a quiet geography teacher, completely devastated. Aimless, he assumes another man’s identity as a gardener on a Portuguese estate, where he forms an unexpected friendship with the owner, stepping into a new life that isn’t his own.', 'The disappearance of his wife leaves Fernando, a quiet geography teacher, completely devastated. Aimless, he assumes another man’s identity as a gardener on a Portuguese estate, where he forms an unexpected friendship with the owner, stepping into a new life that isn’t his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Xu3KumdXHDpUOR9inJoAMtIcrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440171'),
