  ('133825808936714', 'The Portuguese Woman', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Rita Azevedo Gomes, Acácio de Almeida', 'Agustina Bessa-Luís', 'Clara Riedenstein, Ingrid Caven, Pierre Léon, Rita Durão, Luna Picoli-Truffaut, João Vicente, Luís Lucas, Manuela de Freitas', null, 'North of Italy, the von Kettens dispute the forces of the Episcopate of Trent. Herr Ketten seeks marriage in a distant country, Portugal. After their honeymoon journey back home, Ketten leaves again for the war. Eleven years elapsed… Rumours are running about the presence of that ''foreigner'' in the castle. Some say she''s a heretic. Until one day, the Bishop of Trento ends up dying and, with the signature of peace, falls the background of von Ketten''s life. Will the Portuguese win, where death seems to be moving in?', 'North of Italy, the von Kettens dispute the forces of the Episcopate of Trent. Herr Ketten seeks marriage in a distant country, Portugal. After their honeymoon journey back home, Ketten leaves again for the war. Eleven years elapsed… Rumours are running about the presence of that ''foreigner'' in the castle. Some say she''s a heretic. Until one day, the Bishop of Trento ends up dying and, with the signature of peace, falls the background of von Ketten''s life. Will the Portuguese win, where death seems to be moving in?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWXB9ylHHPrAmnEHmxC4HpVPbSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507317'),
