  ('489109946416972836', 'The Possessed', 1965, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Leonida Barboni, Meralda Pantanella, Piero Capponi', 'Giulio Questi, Luigi Bazzoni, Franco Rossellini', 'Peter Baldwin, Salvo Randone, Valentina Cortese, Pia Lindström, Pier Giovanni Anchisi, Ennio Balbo, Anna Maria Gherardi, Bruno Scipioni', null, 'While visiting his favorite resort village during winter, a writer investigates the apparent suicide of a woman he was infatuated with.', 'While visiting his favorite resort village during winter, a writer investigates the apparent suicide of a woman he was infatuated with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwa9oWlNqUNrDCuwir3y84iKK8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104244'),
