  ('262123595148760607', 'The Possessed', 1988, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Andrzej Wajda, Witold Adamek', 'Agnieszka Holland, Jean-Claude Carrière, Edward Żebrowski', 'Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Omar Sharif, Bernard Blier, Lambert Wilson, Isabelle Huppert, Bożena Dykiel, Jutta Lampe, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu', null, 'Russia, 1870. A group of young anarchist revolutionaries set out to overthrow the Czarist regime through violence. Their attacks create a climate of psychosis and mutual distrust among the population, but in reality, both revolutionaries and repressors are being manipulated by a diabolical individual.', 'Russia, 1870. A group of young anarchist revolutionaries set out to overthrow the Czarist regime through violence. Their attacks create a climate of psychosis and mutual distrust among the population, but in reality, both revolutionaries and repressors are being manipulated by a diabolical individual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibRevx5qttquBPXA5mIvT8GEOs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169247'),
