  ('977708648605479177', 'The Possession of Hannah Grace', 2018, 'Horror, Drama', 'Diederik Van Rooijen, Lennert Hillege', 'Brian Sieve', 'Shay Mitchell, Kirby Johnson, Grey Damon, Stana Katic, Louis Herthum, J.P. Valenti, Larry Eudene, James A. Watson, Jr', 'R', 'When a cop who is just out of rehab takes the graveyard shift in a city hospital morgue, she faces a series of bizarre, violent events caused by an evil entity in one of the corpses.', 'When a cop who is just out of rehab takes the graveyard shift in a city hospital morgue, she faces a series of bizarre, violent events caused by an evil entity in one of the corpses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDDb0H0uJp2wjoJBbBHbKlYRbug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434555'),
  ('642042710652588619', 'The Possession of Joel Delaney', 1972, 'Horror', 'Waris Hussein, Alan Hopkins, Michael Haley', 'Irene Kamp, Matt Robinson', 'Shirley MacLaine, Perry King, Michael Hordern, David Elliott, Lisa Kohane, Barbara Trentham, Lovelady Powell, Edmundo Rivera Álvarez', 'R', 'An upper-class Manhattan divorcee comes to believe that her brother is possessed by the spirit of a serial killer who beheaded young women in Spanish Harlem.', 'An upper-class Manhattan divorcee comes to believe that her brother is possessed by the spirit of a serial killer who beheaded young women in Spanish Harlem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLZtcVpnHfeTAeirievzvFm6fI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29491'),
  ('673193284229435923', 'The Possession of Michael King', 2014, 'Horror', 'Phil Parmet, Julie McCoy, Craig Borden', 'David Jung, Tedi Sarafian', 'Shane Johnson, Ella Anderson, Cara Pifko, Julie McNiven, Tomas Arana, Dale Dickey, Patricia Healy, Cullen Douglas', 'R', 'The film tells the story of documentary filmmaker Michael King (Shane Johnson), who doesn’t believe in God or the Devil. Following the sudden death of his wife, Michael decides to make his next film about the search for the existence of the supernatural, making himself the center of the experiment – allowing demonologists, necromancers, and various practitioners of the occult to try the deepest and darkest spells and rituals they can find on him – in the hopes that when they fail, he’ll once and for all have proof that religion, spiritualism, and the paranormal are nothing more than myth. But something does happen. An evil and horrifying force has taken over Michael King. And it will not let him go.', 'The film tells the story of documentary filmmaker Michael King (Shane Johnson), who doesn’t believe in God or the Devil. Following the sudden death of his wife, Michael decides to make his next film about the search for the existence of the supernatural, making himself the center of the experiment – allowing demonologists, necromancers, and various practitioners of the occult to try the deepest and darkest spells and rituals they can find on him – in the hopes that when they fail, he’ll once and for all have proof that religion, spiritualism, and the paranormal are nothing more than myth. But something does happen. An evil and horrifying force has taken over Michael King. And it will not let him go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1LrvbUsQHn8ByJIOoeI76F6jR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272692'),
  ('926270951186033526', 'The Possessors', 1958, 'Drama', 'Denys de La Patellière, Louis Page', 'Michel Audiard, Denys de La Patellière', 'Jean Gabin, Annie Ducaux, Jean Desailly, Françoise Christophe, Patrick Millow, Aimé Clariond, Jean Murat, Françoise Delbart', null, 'Noël Schoudler, founder of an empire built on three foundations - sugar, banking and the press - reigns like an absolute sovereign over his business and his family. But someone is about to challenge this authority: his son François...', 'Noël Schoudler, founder of an empire built on three foundations - sugar, banking and the press - reigns like an absolute sovereign over his business and his family. But someone is about to challenge this authority: his son François...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWL0ONtc5FfZtVDVDDiy5f3irvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60187'),
  ('335315671792398671', 'The Post', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Anthony Keating, Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński', 'Liz Hannah, Josh Singer', 'Meryl Streep, Tom Hanks, Sarah Paulson, Bob Odenkirk, Tracy Letts, Bradley Whitford, Bruce Greenwood, Matthew Rhys', 'PG-13', 'A cover-up that spanned four U.S. Presidents pushed the country''s first female newspaper publisher and a hard-driving editor to join an unprecedented battle between journalist and government. Inspired by true events.', 'A cover-up that spanned four U.S. Presidents pushed the country''s first female newspaper publisher and a hard-driving editor to join an unprecedented battle between journalist and government. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4XG3g6uMMPIBPjAoQhC2QIMdkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446354'),
  ('269353239501972161', 'The Post-Truth World', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'If Chen, Ming Wang, Yu Hui-wen', 'Nai-Ching Yeh, Huang Yen-chiao', 'Joseph Chang, Edward Chen, Caitlin Fang, Aviis Zhong, Xie Zhang-ying, Amber An, Shih Chih-tian, Chan Tzu-hsuan', 'R', 'A has-been newscaster Liu Li-min is taken hostage by an escaped inmate Zhang Zheng-yi, who pleads his innocence. To Liu''s astonishment, Zhang claims that he was smeared by Liu''s departed wife. Thus, Liu teams up with Zhang and reinvestigates Zhang''s murder case to help his beloved be cleared of blame. However, the more they get to the bottom of the case, the further the truth is beyond their reach.', 'A has-been newscaster Liu Li-min is taken hostage by an escaped inmate Zhang Zheng-yi, who pleads his innocence. To Liu''s astonishment, Zhang claims that he was smeared by Liu''s departed wife. Thus, Liu teams up with Zhang and reinvestigates Zhang''s murder case to help his beloved be cleared of blame. However, the more they get to the bottom of the case, the further the truth is beyond their reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8doO4KynO8GxiGsQ9bA0cIzFEh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007962'),
  ('949626429487589360', 'The Postman', 1968, 'Drama', 'Hussein Kamal, Hassan Abdel Gelil, Ahmed Khorshed', 'Donya El Papa', 'Shoukry Sarhan, Zizi Mostafa, Salah Mansour, Soheir El Morshedy, Hassan Mostafa, Seif Abdelrahman, Abdel Ghani Qamar, Nahed Samir', null, 'Abbas, a resident of Cairo, is appointed by the government to hold the office of supervisor in a post office in a small village in Upper Egypt.', 'Abbas, a resident of Cairo, is appointed by the government to hold the office of supervisor in a post office in a small village in Upper Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njH1PU2nAYa5yvrJAmwRGmvxqFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258767'),
  ('676488471948541341', 'The Postman', 1972, 'Drama', 'Dariush Mehrjui, Houshang Baharlou', 'Dariush Mehrjui', 'Ali Nasirian, Ezzatollah Entezami, Jaleh Sam, Ahmad Reza Ahmadi, Bahman Forsi, Esmat Safavi, Ezzatollah Ramazanifar, Amrollah Saberi', null, 'A political metaphor based on Karl Buchner''s "Woyzeck": a simpleminded mailman ends up committing a murder.', 'A political metaphor based on Karl Buchner''s "Woyzeck": a simpleminded mailman ends up committing a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6X8Svu7x5tzXfsob8P3ELhIqGwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266232'),
  ('667400932274856215', 'The Postman', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Memduh Ün, Güneş Hicdurmaz, Muzaffer Hiçdurmaz', 'Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Fatma Girik, Erdal Özyağcılar, Gülümser Gülhan, İhsan Yüce, Nezahat Tanyeri, Necdet Yakın, Ulvi Alacakaptan', null, 'Sevtap and Adem, the postman in the neighborhood, are in love with each other. Sevtap remained single until the age of 30 because no one liked her, so she is still a virgin and has settled for Adem. However, there is someone who opposes this love, her older brother Latif, who was raised in German culture but can be described as a complete fool. One day, Sevtap and Adem send a telegram from Sevtap''s father''s mouth to convince him to accept the situation. After this telegram, wedding preparations begin. However, during this time, Latif returns permanently from Germany to Turkey, and the truth about the couple is revealed. Latif opposes the marriage at any cost, even if it means harming Adem. Later, despite his reservations, he accepts the marriage and fulfills Adem''s every request.', 'Sevtap and Adem, the postman in the neighborhood, are in love with each other. Sevtap remained single until the age of 30 because no one liked her, so she is still a virgin and has settled for Adem. However, there is someone who opposes this love, her older brother Latif, who was raised in German culture but can be described as a complete fool. One day, Sevtap and Adem send a telegram from Sevtap''s father''s mouth to convince him to accept the situation. After this telegram, wedding preparations begin. However, during this time, Latif returns permanently from Germany to Turkey, and the truth about the couple is revealed. Latif opposes the marriage at any cost, even if it means harming Adem. Later, despite his reservations, he accepts the marriage and fulfills Adem''s every request.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnfJZWhvnDVHZpvA5jciJOXcoLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148735'),
  ('408607001660349647', 'The Postman', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Stephen F. Windon, Kevin Costner, Alexander Witt', 'Eric Roth, Brian Helgeland', 'Kevin Costner, Will Patton, Larenz Tate, Olivia Williams, James Russo, Daniel von Bargen, Tom Petty, Scott Bairstow', 'R', 'In 2013, there are no highways, no I-ways, no dreams of a better tomorrow, only scattered survivors across what was once the United States. Into this apocalyptic wasteland comes an enigmatic drifter with a mule, a knack for Shakespeare, and something yet undiscovered: the power to inspire hope.', 'In 2013, there are no highways, no I-ways, no dreams of a better tomorrow, only scattered survivors across what was once the United States. Into this apocalyptic wasteland comes an enigmatic drifter with a mule, a knack for Shakespeare, and something yet undiscovered: the power to inspire hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piVzOuKFLHNGLxnjwNtibC26lTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9922'),
