  ('391556832607542038', 'The Postman Strikes Back', 1982, 'Action', 'Ronny Yu, Sin Wi-Gyun, Danny Lee Yau-Tong', 'Chiu Kang-Chien, Goo Siu-Wa, Ronny Yu', 'Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Chow Yun-Fat, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Kuk Jeong-Seok, Eddy Ko Hung, Fan Mei-Sheng, Yuen Yat-Choh, Jang Il-Do', null, 'Four heroes embark on a secret mission for Dr Sun Yat Sen''s Nationalist Guard. Relentlessly pursued by the warriors of notorious Warlord Yue Sai Hoi, they have seven days to reach the Lo Yang Pass with their secret cargo.', 'Four heroes embark on a secret mission for Dr Sun Yat Sen''s Nationalist Guard. Relentlessly pursued by the warriors of notorious Warlord Yue Sai Hoi, they have seven days to reach the Lo Yang Pass with their secret cargo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEVJLfONC1zCsiEIspsX8oKg6Uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79953'),
