  ('495122860348813579', 'The Potemkinists', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Radu Jude, Marius Panduru, Vasile Todinca', 'Radu Jude', 'Alexandru Dabija, Cristina Draghici', null, 'A gesture of defiance against Russia is made in 1905 by the sailors on the cruiser Potemkin, who received political asylum in Romania. In 2021, a sculptor is trying to make a work inspired by this event.', 'A gesture of defiance against Russia is made in 1905 by the sailors on the cruiser Potemkin, who received political asylum in Romania. In 2021, a sculptor is trying to make a work inspired by this event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLhysLTd6rtpr0ykB8UIhF0DyeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968282'),
