  ('785302767390773555', 'The Pout-Pout Fish', 2026, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Ricard Cussó, Rio Harrington, Tania Vincent', 'Elie Choufany, Elise Allen, Dominic Morris', 'Nick Offerman, Nina Oyama, Miranda Otto, Amy Sedaris, Jordin Sparks, Remy Hii, Mark Coles Smith, Nazeem Hussain', 'PG', 'Living on a rundown shipwreck, Mr. Fish one day discovers a hyperactive young sea dragon Pip – who had mistaken his home for a junkyard – pilfering his belongings. The heated argument that ensues leaves both their houses in ruin. But there is hope! Embarking on a seemingly impossible quest in search of the mythical ''Shimmer'' to grant them a wish, there’s only one problem: someone else is on the hunt...', 'Living on a rundown shipwreck, Mr. Fish one day discovers a hyperactive young sea dragon Pip – who had mistaken his home for a junkyard – pilfering his belongings. The heated argument that ensues leaves both their houses in ruin. But there is hope! Embarking on a seemingly impossible quest in search of the mythical ''Shimmer'' to grant them a wish, there’s only one problem: someone else is on the hunt...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcDXgGL14qL46It1XOozEjX5Jws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146058'),
  ('596491309163543054', 'The Power', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Byron Haskin, Ellsworth Fredericks, E. Darrell Hallenbeck', 'John Gay', 'George Hamilton, Aldo Ray, Suzanne Pleshette, Richard Carlson, Yvonne De Carlo, Earl Holliman, Gary Merrill, Ken Murray', null, 'One by one members of a special project team are being killed by telekinesis - the ability to move things with the power of the mind alone. The race is on to determine which of the remaining team members is the murderer and to stop them.', 'One by one members of a special project team are being killed by telekinesis - the ability to move things with the power of the mind alone. The race is on to determine which of the remaining team members is the murderer and to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDo4S3LryO89an2Uq0xvgZUMZN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46015'),
  ('491089572200593159', 'The Power', 1984, 'Horror', 'Stephen Carpenter, Jeffrey Obrow, Stephen Carpenter', 'Jeffrey Obrow, Stephen Carpenter', 'Susan Stokey, Warren Lincoln, Lisa Erickson, Chad Christian, Ben Gilbert, J. Dinan Myrtetus', 'R', 'A man comes into possession of an ancient Aztec doll. However, the doll is possessed by an evil spirit, which takes over his body.', 'A man comes into possession of an ancient Aztec doll. However, the doll is possessed by an evil spirit, which takes over his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lV17QOQXTfBQk9YH3srqhdAyGfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27663'),
  ('546793915866805374', 'The Power', 2021, 'Horror', 'Corinna Faith, Laura Bellingham', 'Corinna Faith', 'Rose Williams, Charlie Carrick, Gbemisola Ikumelo, Theo Barklem-Biggs, Nuala McGowan, Emma Rigby, Diveen Henry, Paul Antony-Barber', null, 'London, 1974. As Britain prepares for electrical blackouts to sweep across the country, trainee nurse Val arrives for her first day at the crumbling East London Royal Infirmary. With most of the patients and staff evacuated to another hospital, Val is forced to work the night shift, finding herself in a dark, near empty building. Within these walls lies a deadly secret, forcing Val to face both her own traumatic past and deepest fears.', 'London, 1974. As Britain prepares for electrical blackouts to sweep across the country, trainee nurse Val arrives for her first day at the crumbling East London Royal Infirmary. With most of the patients and staff evacuated to another hospital, Val is forced to work the night shift, finding herself in a dark, near empty building. Within these walls lies a deadly secret, forcing Val to face both her own traumatic past and deepest fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0aVEjT1DWopUrJehACWZyqpO99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760919'),
  ('726227061579740416', 'The Power and the Glory', 1933, 'Drama', 'William K. Howard, Horace Hough, James Wong Howe', 'Preston Sturges', 'Spencer Tracy, Colleen Moore, Ralph Morgan, Helen Vinson, Phillip Trent, Henry Kolker, Sarah Padden, Billy O''Brien', null, 'A man''s life is retold just after his funeral. Beginning as a track walker, Tom Garner rose through all sorts of railroad jobs to head the company. In the meantime he lost touch with his family. When he saw what was happening it was already too late.', 'A man''s life is retold just after his funeral. Beginning as a track walker, Tom Garner rose through all sorts of railroad jobs to head the company. In the meantime he lost touch with his family. When he saw what was happening it was already too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwVUfud7cLkYHRb4OzlD70Pi3Iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96702'),
  ('450991732564247262', 'The Power of Few', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leone Marucci, Reinhart Peschke, Mike De La Vina', 'Leone Marucci', 'Christopher Walken, Louise Linton, Christian Slater, Nicky Whelan, Anthony Anderson, Derek Richardson, Q''orianka Kilcher, Moon Bloodgood', 'R', 'Spies, cops and armed children cross paths on a day of danger, mystery and possible transformation. Five unusual characters are unknowingly connected to an extraordinary smuggling operation, as religious conspiracy collides with urban crime.', 'Spies, cops and armed children cross paths on a day of danger, mystery and possible transformation. Five unusual characters are unknowingly connected to an extraordinary smuggling operation, as religious conspiracy collides with urban crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2gEURN3dQ2JmUjoFRD7m6Ox1rV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161321'),
  ('385189196447255126', 'The Power of Kangwon Province', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hong Sang-soo, Kim Yeong-cheol, Choi Seok-jae', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Baek Jong-hak, Oh Youn-hong, Kim Yu-seok, Chun Jae-hyun, Park Hyun-young, Im Sun-young, Jo Gwang-je, Park Jeong Hwa', null, 'After a breakup, a young woman goes to a mountain resort on vacation and falls for a married policeman. Unbeknownst to her, her ex is also vacationing there.', 'After a breakup, a young woman goes to a mountain resort on vacation and falls for a married policeman. Unbeknownst to her, her ex is also vacationing there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epY3t44gKpBgtPpvwm2hiuLqIi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86266'),
  ('1137784030101527937', 'The Power of One', 1992, 'Drama', 'John G. Avildsen, Dean Semler, Tim Lewis', 'Robert Mark Kamen', 'Morgan Freeman, Stephen Dorff, Simon Fenton, Guy Witcher, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Alois Moyo, Marius Weyers, Ian Roberts', 'PG-13', 'PK, an English orphan terrorized for his family''s political beliefs in Africa, turns to his only friend, a kindly world-wise prisoner, Geel Piet. Geel teaches him how to box with the motto “fight with your fists and lead with your heart”. As he grows to manhood, PK uses these words to take on the system and the injustices he sees around him - and finds that one person really can make a difference.', 'PK, an English orphan terrorized for his family''s political beliefs in Africa, turns to his only friend, a kindly world-wise prisoner, Geel Piet. Geel teaches him how to box with the motto “fight with your fists and lead with your heart”. As he grows to manhood, PK uses these words to take on the system and the injustices he sees around him - and finds that one person really can make a difference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7RIsoUQb0F1X8mb3YvPr7F8ot5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13823'),
  ('1100921074776639029', 'The Power of Speech', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Caroline Champetier, Pierre Binggeli', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Haroun Tazieff', 'Jean Bouise, Laurence Côte, Lydia Andréï, Jean-Michel Irribaren', null, 'Godard blends elements of literature, cinema and other artistic medias from different historical periods in order to make a stance on how words can be subverted and manipulated to many different contexts, sometimes bearing a similar significance to the original material or even creating an alternate context.', 'Godard blends elements of literature, cinema and other artistic medias from different historical periods in order to make a stance on how words can be subverted and manipulated to many different contexts, sometimes bearing a similar significance to the original material or even creating an alternate context.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyFkky5mKijLeF5AOak47eDpYVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146583'),
