  ('579996041185928726', 'The Power Within', 1995, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Art Camacho, Ken Blakey', 'Joe Hart', 'Ted Jan Roberts, Karen Valentine, Keith Coogan, John O''Hurley, William Zabka, Gerald Okamura, Tracy Melchior, P. J. Soles', 'PG-13', 'Stan Dryer, a teen, afraid to even ask a girl to the prom, finds courage and extreme martial arts skill when he is given a ring by an old man he tried to save from a group of attackers. The ring is a mate to a ring stolen by a double dealing art thief who had been hired to steal it by a criminal mastermind who wanted it for its mystical powers.', 'Stan Dryer, a teen, afraid to even ask a girl to the prom, finds courage and extreme martial arts skill when he is given a ring by an old man he tried to save from a group of attackers. The ring is a mate to a ring stolen by a double dealing art thief who had been hired to steal it by a criminal mastermind who wanted it for its mystical powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yJXxIenaYtEWBroOAOXVaNCsSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79868'),
  ('869953471695917285', 'The Powerpuff Girls Movie', 2002, 'Animation, Action, Family', 'Craig McCracken, Genndy Tartakovsky, Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Lauren Faust, Craig McCracken, Paul Rudish', 'Cathy Cavadini, Tara Strong, E. G. Daily, Roger L. Jackson, Tom Kane, Tom Kenny, Jennifer Hale, Jennifer Martin', 'PG', 'After destroying the city of Townsville in a game of tag, a trio of superpowered little girls must redeem themselves by stopping a vengeful monkey''s plot for world domination.', 'After destroying the city of Townsville in a game of tag, a trio of superpowered little girls must redeem themselves by stopping a vengeful monkey''s plot for world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAFalW8UtdJg1z1gPjXx8C1sXZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59387'),
  ('717587865369692273', 'The Powerpuff Girls: ''Twas the Fight Before Christmas', 2003, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Lauren Faust, Craig McCracken', 'Craig Lewis, Lauren Faust', 'Cathy Cavadini, Tara Strong, E. G. Daily, Tom Kenny, Tom Kane, Mike Bell, Jeff Bennett, Jennifer Hale', null, 'When Princess Morebucks finds out that she''s been put on Santa''s naughty list (in fact, she''s the only one on it!), she does a quick re-write, resulting with Bubbles, Blossom, and Buttercup with nothing but coal for Christmas! On top of all that, Princess gets the one thing she wants for the holidays: super powers! Now, the girls have to stop Princess and make sure that Christmas is saved for children everywhere.', 'When Princess Morebucks finds out that she''s been put on Santa''s naughty list (in fact, she''s the only one on it!), she does a quick re-write, resulting with Bubbles, Blossom, and Buttercup with nothing but coal for Christmas! On top of all that, Princess gets the one thing she wants for the holidays: super powers! Now, the girls have to stop Princess and make sure that Christmas is saved for children everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49F5o4k76E6XvJggrt2igxthuqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212970'),
  ('437716133246603381', 'The Practical Pig', 1939, 'Animation', 'Dick Rickard, Ford Beebe', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Mary Moder, Dorothy Compton, Pinto Colvig, Tommy Wiggins, Tom Buchanan, Ralph Hansell, Leone LeDoux', 'NR', 'After his two brothers are captured, the third little pig invents a machine to capture the big bad wolf.', 'After his two brothers are captured, the third little pig invents a machine to capture the big bad wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0YKVlYc8i3ONY4F0VL8XhM8sIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109340'),
  ('351873994750554625', 'The Practice', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Martín Rejtman, Nicolás San Martín, Juan Segundo Álamos', 'Martín Rejtman', 'Esteban Bigliardi, Manuela Oyarzún, Amparo Noguera, Camila Hirane, Gabriel Cañas, Víctor Montero, Giordano Rossi, Giannina Fruttero', 'PG-13', 'Dealing with a series of increasingly absurd situations and relationships, recently separated yoga instructors Gustavo and Vanesa are finding it difficult to live apart. Their challenges include meddling mothers, amnesiac students, and burgeoning romances. Step by step, they find their way back to the practice.', 'Dealing with a series of increasingly absurd situations and relationships, recently separated yoga instructors Gustavo and Vanesa are finding it difficult to live apart. Their challenges include meddling mothers, amnesiac students, and burgeoning romances. Step by step, they find their way back to the practice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrpG28ewnC14LiohsTGJTpFaCA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713919'),
  ('142171726253391924', 'The Prado Museum: A Collection of Wonders', 2019, 'Documentary, History', 'Marco Alfieri, Valeria Parisi, Mateusz Stolecki', 'Sabina Fedeli, Valeria Parisi', 'Jeremy Irons, Miguel Falomir, Andrés Úbeda de los Cobos, José de la Fuente, Enrique Quintana, Javier Portús, Alejandro Vergara, José Manuel Matilla', null, 'Actor Jeremy Irons embarks on an epic journey through the halls of the Prado Museum in Madrid, Spain, two hundred years after its inauguration, along corridors where thousands of masterpieces of all time tell the lives of rulers and common people, and tales about times of war and madness and times of peace and happiness; because, as Goya said, imagination, the mother of the arts, produces impossible monsters, but also unspeakable wonders.', 'Actor Jeremy Irons embarks on an epic journey through the halls of the Prado Museum in Madrid, Spain, two hundred years after its inauguration, along corridors where thousands of masterpieces of all time tell the lives of rulers and common people, and tales about times of war and madness and times of peace and happiness; because, as Goya said, imagination, the mother of the arts, produces impossible monsters, but also unspeakable wonders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVtTIpHTCahuklhFRddHoUpqBG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588175'),
  ('776416055986837893', 'The Prayer', 2018, 'Drama', 'Cédric Kahn, Yves Cape', 'Fanny Burdino, Cédric Kahn, Samuel Doux', 'Anthony Bajon, Damien Chapelle, Àlex Brendemühl, Louise Grinberg, Hanna Schygulla, Magne-Håvard Brekke, Davide Campagna, Maïté Maillé', null, 'Thomas is a drug addict. In an effort to put an end to his habit, he joins a community of former addicts who live isolated in the mountains and use prayer as a way to cure themselves.', 'Thomas is a drug addict. In an effort to put an end to his habit, he joins a community of former addicts who live isolated in the mountains and use prayer as a way to cure themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78dnETPv7Mcm587KaRo23i8y9e4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499086'),
  ('577741156180223733', 'The Preacher''s Wife', 1996, 'Family, Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Penny Marshall, H.H. Cooper, Miroslav Ondříček', 'Robert E. Sherwood, Leonardo Bercovici', 'Denzel Washington, Whitney Houston, Courtney B. Vance, Gregory Hines, Jenifer Lewis, Loretta Devine, Paul Bates, Justin Pierre Edmund', 'PG', 'Good-natured Reverend Henry Biggs finds that his marriage to choir mistress Julia is flagging, due to his constant absence caring for the deprived neighborhood they live in. On top of all this, his church is coming under threat from property developer Joe Hamilton. In desperation, Biggs prays to God for help – which arrives in the form of an angel named Dudley.', 'Good-natured Reverend Henry Biggs finds that his marriage to choir mistress Julia is flagging, due to his constant absence caring for the deprived neighborhood they live in. On top of all this, his church is coming under threat from property developer Joe Hamilton. In desperation, Biggs prays to God for help – which arrives in the form of an angel named Dudley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1mU4g9poAgoDQRNLcfNdj3iiMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21539'),
