  ('1146108455837760481', 'The Price of Milk', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Harry Sinclair', 'Harry Sinclair', 'Danielle Cormack, Karl Urban, Willa O''Neill, Michael Lawrence, Rangi Motu, Lawrence Makoare, Chris Graham, Ray Bishop', 'PG-13', 'Lucinda lives a fairytale life with dairy farmer Rob, and his 117 cows. But after a freak car accident she decides to test Rob''s love for her by trying to make him angry. He passes her tests until a quilt goes missing from their bed and the price of getting it back is high.', 'Lucinda lives a fairytale life with dairy farmer Rob, and his 117 cows. But after a freak car accident she decides to test Rob''s love for her by trying to make him angry. He passes her tests until a quilt goes missing from their bed and the price of getting it back is high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPbkNfGmCKOSbAVrLqcbYuKT5cE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21620'),
  ('582787900361263134', 'The Price of Money: A Largo Winch Adventure', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Olivier Masset-Depasse, Sophie Casse, Mathilde Snodgrass', 'Olivier Masset-Depasse, Giordano Gederlini', 'Tomer Sisley, James Franco, Clotilde Hesme, Elise Tilloloy, Denis O''Hare, Narayan David Hecter, Koen De Bouw, Supachai Girdsuwan', null, 'Largo Winch, devastated by the kidnapping of his son, realizes that if he finds those responsible for his bankruptcy, maybe he''ll see his son again.', 'Largo Winch, devastated by the kidnapping of his son, realizes that if he finds those responsible for his bankruptcy, maybe he''ll see his son again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myS41ZUmFvslkT8LeD2irAKxyrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000075'),
