  ('1105842469224558847', 'The Price of Power', 1969, 'Western', 'Tonino Valerii, Mahnahén Velasco, Giuseppe Bellecca', 'Massimo Patrizi', 'Giuliano Gemma, Warren Vanders, María Cuadra, Rai Sanders, Fernando Rey, Van Johnson, Julio Peña, José Suárez', null, 'In 1881 Dallas, an ex-Union soldier attempts to expose a conspiracy of Southerners that killed his father, his friend and President James A. Garfield.', 'In 1881 Dallas, an ex-Union soldier attempts to expose a conspiracy of Southerners that killed his father, his friend and President James A. Garfield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEXAqAonZAjS5UuMnd4DtIF7A8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90540'),
  ('340125447755744285', 'The Price of Protest', 2019, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Annebeth Jacobsen, Jobst Knigge', null, 'Nate Boyer, Kent Babb, Patrick Esume, Lilian Thuram, Joe Fernandez, Scott Ostler, Chris Ault, Melina Abdullah', null, 'United States, September 1st, 2016. American football player Colin Kaepernick kneels during the national anthem, protesting police brutality against black people. Part of the population regards the gesture as an unacceptable affront to the flag. Later, he loses his place on his team. Today, however, he is considered by many as a true hero.', 'United States, September 1st, 2016. American football player Colin Kaepernick kneels during the national anthem, protesting police brutality against black people. Part of the population regards the gesture as an unacceptable affront to the flag. Later, he loses his place on his team. Today, however, he is considered by many as a true hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eajDFN88gJBmDqkXncLoMvKPm2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633650'),
  ('227456907688592102', 'The Price of Success', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Teddy Lussi-Modeste, Julien Poupard', 'Teddy Lussi-Modeste', 'Tahar Rahim, Maïwenn, Roschdy Zem, Grégoire Colin, Ali Marhyar, Camille Lellouche, Saïda Bekkouche, Salma Lahmer', null, 'A comedian''s relationship with his family crumbles when his career begins to take off.', 'A comedian''s relationship with his family crumbles when his career begins to take off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubmnTBjq0wMBubx8z6JuWsoWjIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459965'),
  ('604749844306376509', 'The Price to Pay', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Alexandra Leclère', 'Alexandra Leclère', 'Christian Clavier, Gérard Lanvin, Géraldine Pailhas, Patrick Chesnais, Anaïs Demoustier, Maud Buquet, Nathalie Baye, Antoine Smadja', null, 'Jean-Pierre, a wealthy businessman, is lonely. He still desires his wife but she only seems interested in shopping and the beauty salon. Tired of lunching alone every day, one day he decides to invite his chauffeur to join him, and a relationship quickly develops as the two find they have much in common. Are they just cash machines for their wives? Don''t they deserve some love in return? Jean-Pierre confiscates his wife''s credit card, but things don''t turn out exactly the way he''d hoped...', 'Jean-Pierre, a wealthy businessman, is lonely. He still desires his wife but she only seems interested in shopping and the beauty salon. Tired of lunching alone every day, one day he decides to invite his chauffeur to join him, and a relationship quickly develops as the two find they have much in common. Are they just cash machines for their wives? Don''t they deserve some love in return? Jean-Pierre confiscates his wife''s credit card, but things don''t turn out exactly the way he''d hoped...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbFKuolhEAVcLOgx4iPXlpf4aZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13045'),
  ('184180443432848136', 'The Price We Pay', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Horror', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Gerardo Muñoz, Matthias Schubert', 'Christopher Jolley', 'Emile Hirsch, Stephen Dorff, Gigi Zumbado, Tyler Sanders, Erika Ervin, Jesse Kinser, Sabina Mach, Vernon Wells', 'R', 'After a pawn shop robbery goes askew, two criminals take refuge at a remote farmhouse to try to let the heat die down, but find something much more menacing.', 'After a pawn shop robbery goes askew, two criminals take refuge at a remote farmhouse to try to let the heat die down, but find something much more menacing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fwJt0qZieQ7dKaiiqehObWpXYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996727'),
  ('1051938989081177723', 'The Pride and the Passion', 1957, 'War, History, Romance', 'Stanley Kramer, Alfonso Acebal, José María Ochoa', 'Edna Anhalt, Edward Anhalt', 'Cary Grant, Frank Sinatra, Sophia Loren, Theodore Bikel, John Wengraf, Jay Novello, José Nieto, Carlos Larrañaga', null, 'During the Napoleonic Wars, when the French have occupied Spain, some Spanish guerrilla soldiers are going to move a big cannon across Spain in order to help the British defeat the French. A British officer is there to accompany the Spanish and along the way, he falls in love with the leader''s girl.', 'During the Napoleonic Wars, when the French have occupied Spain, some Spanish guerrilla soldiers are going to move a big cannon across Spain in order to help the British defeat the French. A British officer is there to accompany the Spanish and along the way, he falls in love with the leader''s girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2VMSaMcwKMdIsy2vdB2FsXmfyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23102'),
