  ('626711036231170599', 'The Priest', 1978, 'Drama', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Tito Goyanes, Magí Torruella', 'Enrique Barreiro', 'Simón Andreu, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Esperanza Roy, José Franco, Ramón Reparaz, Queta Claver, África Pratt, José Vivó', null, 'Obsessed with fantasies of sex, Father Miguel seeks professional help through his church but they are not listening; thus leaving the Father in a dilemma; leaving the church or should he try, on his own, to surrender to these temptations?', 'Obsessed with fantasies of sex, Father Miguel seeks professional help through his church but they are not listening; thus leaving the Father in a dilemma; leaving the church or should he try, on his own, to surrender to these temptations?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QcIE6PVyl34Gf2BCJx6YfcSwKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47121'),
