  ('966515634392990342', 'The Priest and the Girl', 1966, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mário Carneiro, Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Helena Ignez, Paulo José, Fauzi Arap, Mário Lago, Rosa Sandrini', null, 'In a small town in Minas Gerais, the arrival of a young priest causes a commotion in the conservative atmosphere of the place, aggravated by the sudden attraction this priest feels for a beautiful girl. This forbidden love affair soon turns into an unbridled passion.', 'In a small town in Minas Gerais, the arrival of a young priest causes a commotion in the conservative atmosphere of the place, aggravated by the sudden attraction this priest feels for a beautiful girl. This forbidden love affair soon turns into an unbridled passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfgGDXw92g1P5B3qUJ0M7M7p3vo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119023'),
  ('449872548022112007', 'The Priest''s Children', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vinko Brešan, Mirko Pivčević, Matija Vukšić', 'Mate Matišić, Vinko Brešan, Mate Matišić', 'Krešimir Mikić, Nikša Butijer, Marija Škaričić, Dražen Kuhn, Jadranka Đokić, Lazar Ristovski, Goran Bogdan, Zdenko Botić', null, 'Don Fabijan is a young priest who comes to serve on an unnamed small island in the Adriatic. In order to help increase birth rate on the island, he decides to pierce condoms before they are sold. He therefore teams up with the newsagent Petar and the pharmacist Marin. After they abolish all forms of birth control on the entire island, the consequences become more and more complicated.', 'Don Fabijan is a young priest who comes to serve on an unnamed small island in the Adriatic. In order to help increase birth rate on the island, he decides to pierce condoms before they are sold. He therefore teams up with the newsagent Petar and the pharmacist Marin. After they abolish all forms of birth control on the entire island, the consequences become more and more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shC2CT7MRqf9cvC58Tbtp1jcRNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165463'),
  ('950647573790081652', 'The Priest''s Wife', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Alfio Contini', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Ruggero Maccari', 'Sophia Loren, Marcello Mastroianni, Venantino Venantini, Jacques Stany, Pippo Starnazza, Augusto Mastrantoni, Giuseppe Maffioli, Miranda Campa', 'PG', 'After discovering her boyfriend is married, a young woman attempts suicide but survives and falls for the priest who took her call, leading to complications with his vow of celibacy.', 'After discovering her boyfriend is married, a young woman attempts suicide but survives and falls for the priest who took her call, leading to complications with his vow of celibacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SaNCsv3PUfyDbZ8zL5S0H6iHcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194485'),
