  ('666820419108770081', 'The Prime Gig', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gregory Mosher, John A. Alonzo', 'William Wheeler', 'Vince Vaughn, Julia Ormond, Ed Harris, Rory Cochrane, Wallace Shawn, Stephen Tobolowsky, George Wendt, J.J. Johnston', 'R', 'Pendelton "Penny" Wise is a smooth-talking con-artist who scams people with phoney travel comp vacations over the phone when, desperate for more fast cash, he''s called to work for a shady, veteran con businessman Kelly Grant. The situation takes a turn for the worst when Penny begins a relationship with Grant''s mistress, Caitlin.', 'Pendelton "Penny" Wise is a smooth-talking con-artist who scams people with phoney travel comp vacations over the phone when, desperate for more fast cash, he''s called to work for a shady, veteran con businessman Kelly Grant. The situation takes a turn for the worst when Penny begins a relationship with Grant''s mistress, Caitlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJTeDkT6zYfUlSQFlSiBKfpibwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44015'),
  ('505867492134331676', 'The Prime Minister', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Erik Van Looy, Danny Elsen', 'Carl Joos, Erik Van Looy', 'Koen De Bouw, Tine Reymer, Charlotte Vandermeersch, Dirk Roofthooft, Stijn Van Opstal, Saskia Reeves, Adam Godley, Willy Thomas', null, 'The Belgian PM is abducted and he finds his wife and children taken hostage. If he wants to see them again – alive – he has to kill the person he is meeting later that day. And that person is no less than... the president of the United States.', 'The Belgian PM is abducted and he finds his wife and children taken hostage. If he wants to see them again – alive – he has to kill the person he is meeting later that day. And that person is no less than... the president of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQnBG1FVRZfEZrnYSfmGJJIQ36L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394645'),
  ('1132773198926050596', 'The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie', 1969, 'Drama', 'Ronald Neame, Ted Sturgis, Ted Moore', 'Jay Presson Allen', 'Maggie Smith, Robert Stephens, Pamela Franklin, Celia Johnson, Gordon Jackson, Diane Grayson, Jane Carr, Shirley Steedman', 'PG', 'A headstrong young teacher in a private school in 1930s Edinburgh ignores the curriculum and influences her impressionable 12-year-old charges with her over-romanticized worldview.', 'A headstrong young teacher in a private school in 1930s Edinburgh ignores the curriculum and influences her impressionable 12-year-old charges with her over-romanticized worldview.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEZdKL17yneFK4dbbWPKcbkRbqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5179'),
  ('901234675897752162', 'The Primevals', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Adolfo Bartoli, David Allen', 'Randall William Cook', 'Juliet Mills, Richard Joseph Paul, Leon Russom, Walker Brandt, Tai Thai, Eric Steinberg, Robert Cornthwaite, Dolph Scott', null, 'Deep in the Himalayas, a group of sherpas kills a gigantic humanoid creature. Convinced that it is the legendary Yeti, Dr. Claire Collier organizes an expedition with her former student Matt Connor and hunter Rondo Montana, among others, to search for more specimens. But what awaits them is something that none of them could have imagined. A colorful fusion of real image and stop-motion that is reminiscent of fantastic films from the 1980s.', 'Deep in the Himalayas, a group of sherpas kills a gigantic humanoid creature. Convinced that it is the legendary Yeti, Dr. Claire Collier organizes an expedition with her former student Matt Connor and hunter Rondo Montana, among others, to search for more specimens. But what awaits them is something that none of them could have imagined. A colorful fusion of real image and stop-motion that is reminiscent of fantastic films from the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGfRWFJEybNVxxJUa9hYk8VQJFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632995'),
  ('240562173520704064', 'The Prince', 2014, 'Thriller, Action', 'Brian A. Miller, Yaron Levy', 'Andre Fabrizio, Jeremy Passmore', 'Bruce Willis, Jason Patric, John Cusack, Jessica Lowndes, Gia Mantegna, Rain, 50 Cent, Don Harvey', 'R', 'A family man who turns out to be a retired mob enforcer must travel across the country to find his daughter who has gone missing.', 'A family man who turns out to be a retired mob enforcer must travel across the country to find his daughter who has gone missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22b2fmxhZveWSyWkgUz2y94fp3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241254'),
  ('243494160834280308', 'The Prince', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sebastián Muñoz, Enrique Stindt, Daniel Matesanz', 'Luis Barrales, Sebastián Muñoz', 'Juan Carlos Maldonado, Alfredo Castro, Gastón Pauls, Lux Pascal, Catalina Martin, Paola Volpato, Sebastián Ayala, Jaime Leiva', null, 'Chile, 1970. During a night of heavy drinking, Jaime, a lonely 20-year-old young man, is sentenced to prison. There, he meets “The Stallion”, an older and respected man in whom he finds protection, and from whom he learns about love and loyalty. But as their relationship grows stronger, “The Stallion” faces the violent power struggles within the prison.', 'Chile, 1970. During a night of heavy drinking, Jaime, a lonely 20-year-old young man, is sentenced to prison. There, he meets “The Stallion”, an older and respected man in whom he finds protection, and from whom he learns about love and loyalty. But as their relationship grows stronger, “The Stallion” faces the violent power struggles within the prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fH0IgQCVRULwceSMB2GBYH4IA4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574954'),
  ('255615285022659562', 'The Prince & Me', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martha Coolidge, Alex Nepomniaschy, Jakub Dvorak', 'Jack Amiel, Michael Begler, Katherine Fugate', 'Julia Stiles, Luke Mably, Ben Miller, Miranda Richardson, James Fox, Alberta Watson, John Bourgeois, Zachary Knighton', 'PG', 'A fairy tale love-story about pre-med student Paige who falls in love with a Danish Prince "Eddie" who refused to follow the traditions of his parents and has come to the US to quench his thirst for rebellion. Paige and Edward come from two different worlds, but there is an undeniable attraction between them.', 'A fairy tale love-story about pre-med student Paige who falls in love with a Danish Prince "Eddie" who refused to follow the traditions of his parents and has come to the US to quench his thirst for rebellion. Paige and Edward come from two different worlds, but there is an undeniable attraction between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2voUK98TW1cJ3w0qmDIdB16A3x6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11137'),
  ('813287137130413570', 'The Prince & Me 2: The Royal Wedding', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Catherine Cyran, Vaclav Mottl, Jakub Eliášek', 'Allison Robinson', 'Luke Mably, Kam Heskin, Maryam D''Abo, Clemency Burton-Hill, Jonathan Firth, Joshua Rubin, Jim Holt, David Fellowes', 'PG', 'With just weeks before their royal wedding, Paige and Edvard find their relationship and the Danish monarchy in jeopardy when an old law is brought to light, stating that an unmarried heir to the throne may marry only a woman of noble blood or else he must relinquish his crown.', 'With just weeks before their royal wedding, Paige and Edvard find their relationship and the Danish monarchy in jeopardy when an old law is brought to light, stating that an unmarried heir to the throne may marry only a woman of noble blood or else he must relinquish his crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grw6Z9fGAk8RpPjXWYxKPCyDInd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15590'),
  ('29356029625417240', 'The Prince & Me 4: The Elephant Adventure', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Catherine Cyran, Apichart Chusakul, Pitchaya ''June'' Supasiriluk', 'Blayne Weaver', 'Kam Heskin, Chris Geere, Jonathan Firth, Selina Lo, Ase Wang, Prinya Intachai, Vithaya Pansringarm, Charlie Ruedpokanon', null, 'One year after their royal wedding, King Edvard and Queen Paige of Denmark receive an invitation to attend the wedding of Princess Myra of Sangyoon. Upon their arrival, Paige finds Myra is unhappy with her arranged marriage to the brooding and sinister Kah and is secretly in love with a young elephant handler named Alu.', 'One year after their royal wedding, King Edvard and Queen Paige of Denmark receive an invitation to attend the wedding of Princess Myra of Sangyoon. Upon their arrival, Paige finds Myra is unhappy with her arranged marriage to the brooding and sinister Kah and is secretly in love with a young elephant handler named Alu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEKnwl4m8DRn7MkAqWIt6RN2y67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36515'),
  ('100924415789948681', 'The Prince & Me: A Royal Honeymoon', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Catherine Cyran, Simeon Asenov, Peter Mechkoff', 'Blayne Weaver', 'Kam Heskin, Chris Geere, Adam Croasdell, Todd Jensen, Jonathan Firth, Joshua Rubin, Hristo Mitzkov, Valentin Ganev', 'PG', 'At last! The newly crowned King of Denmark, Edward, and his wife and Queen, Dr. Paige Morgan, find time to fly to Belavia for their secret honeymoon. What better way to spend the Christmas holidays than at a fabulous ski resort? But as they take a tour of Belavia''s natural beauty, Eddie and Paige discover that the evil Prime Minister Polonius has given orders to bulldoze the precious forests - to drill for oil. Then, the couple bump into Paige''s ex-boyfriend, Scott. Eddie immediately becomes jealous - furthermore he suspects Scott cannot be trusted. Paige and Eddie must do everything they can to save the forest, even if it means putting aside their honeymoon.', 'At last! The newly crowned King of Denmark, Edward, and his wife and Queen, Dr. Paige Morgan, find time to fly to Belavia for their secret honeymoon. What better way to spend the Christmas holidays than at a fabulous ski resort? But as they take a tour of Belavia''s natural beauty, Eddie and Paige discover that the evil Prime Minister Polonius has given orders to bulldoze the precious forests - to drill for oil. Then, the couple bump into Paige''s ex-boyfriend, Scott. Eddie immediately becomes jealous - furthermore he suspects Scott cannot be trusted. Paige and Eddie must do everything they can to save the forest, even if it means putting aside their honeymoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25I6X1Y9opO6NGTqftVKbeQ3OoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20036'),
  ('517990631490241252', 'The Prince and the Nature Girl', 1965, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Doris Wishman, Nuri Habib', 'Andrew J. Kuehn', 'Joni Roberts, Jeffery Niles, Sandra Sinclair, William Mayer, Lee Abell, Warrene Gray, Stephen Bloom, Dolores K. Norris', null, 'The leader of a small kingdom falls in love with a beautiful American girl, only to be shocked when he finds out that she''s a nudist.', 'The leader of a small kingdom falls in love with a beautiful American girl, only to be shocked when he finds out that she''s a nudist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGTR5YOaBtCkMX3RF4uMVjivTps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258706'),
  ('329589803533460576', 'The Prince and the Pauper', 1937, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'William Keighley, Leo F. Forbstein, Sol Polito', 'Laird Doyle', 'Errol Flynn, Claude Rains, Henry Stephenson, Barton MacLane, Billy Mauch, Robert J. Mauch, Alan Hale, Eric Portman', 'NR', 'Two boys – the prince Edward and the pauper Tom – are born on the same day. Years later, when young teenage Tom sneaks into the palace garden, he meets the prince. They change clothes with one another before the guards discover them and throw out the prince thinking he''s the urchin. No one believes them when they try to tell the truth about which is which. Soon after, the old king dies and the prince will inherit the throne.', 'Two boys – the prince Edward and the pauper Tom – are born on the same day. Years later, when young teenage Tom sneaks into the palace garden, he meets the prince. They change clothes with one another before the guards discover them and throw out the prince thinking he''s the urchin. No one believes them when they try to tell the truth about which is which. Soon after, the old king dies and the prince will inherit the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCamwylvoQ1gPvQ5xSybo4ymMbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37025'),
  ('71200819003175350', 'The Prince and the Pauper', 1962, 'Adventure, TV Movie', 'Don Chaffey, Paul Beeson, Dennis Bertera', 'Jack Whittingham', 'Guy Williams, Laurence Naismith, Donald Houston, Sean Scully, Niall MacGinnis, Geoffrey Keen, Paul Rogers, Dorothy Alison', 'G', 'In the London of 1537, two boys resembling each other exactly meet accidentally and exchange "roles" for a short while. After many adventures, the prince regains his rightful identity and graciously makes his "twin" a ward of the court.', 'In the London of 1537, two boys resembling each other exactly meet accidentally and exchange "roles" for a short while. After many adventures, the prince regains his rightful identity and graciously makes his "twin" a ward of the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOtGIm3Vge1FWrUOnTAhwxiTvLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73478'),
  ('793507782400485340', 'The Prince and the Pauper', 1977, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Jack Cardiff, Richard Fleischer, Maude Spector', 'Berta Domínguez D., George MacDonald Fraser, Pierre Spengler', 'Mark Lester, Oliver Reed, Charlton Heston, David Hemmings, Ernest Borgnine, George C. Scott, Harry Andrews, Raquel Welch', 'PG', 'Tom Canty is a poor English boy who bears a remarkable resemblance to Edward, Prince of Wales and son of King Henry VIII. The two boys meet and decide to play a joke on the court by dressing in each other''s clothes, but the plan goes awry when they''re separated and each must live the other''s life.', 'Tom Canty is a poor English boy who bears a remarkable resemblance to Edward, Prince of Wales and son of King Henry VIII. The two boys meet and decide to play a joke on the court by dressing in each other''s clothes, but the plan goes awry when they''re separated and each must live the other''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0F3X1Cfst6uBOKRss6N9tHgGhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22815'),
  ('311401016304529101', 'The Prince and the Pauper', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'George Scribner, Thom Enriquez', 'Sam Graham, Gerrit Graham, Jenny Tripp', 'Wayne Allwine, Arthur Burghardt, Bill Farmer, Tony Anselmo, Elvia Allman, Frank Welker, Charlie Adler, Roy Dotrice', 'G', 'Long ago in a land with an ailing king, there was a pair of boys who looked exactly alike, a pauper called Mickey and the other, the Crown Prince.', 'Long ago in a land with an ailing king, there was a pair of boys who looked exactly alike, a pauper called Mickey and the other, the Crown Prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sWpajczOeWzubfw7VLAMU9OeHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25831'),
  ('123836962267433718', 'The Prince and the Pauper: The Movie', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Jeff Baustert, James Quattrochi', 'Amanda Moresco, Jeffrey Hatcher', 'Cole Sprouse, Dylan Sprouse, Kay Panabaker, Vincent Spano, Dedee Pfeiffer, Ed Lauter, Sally Kellerman, Nick Vallelonga', null, 'A modern day telling of the Mark Twain classic, The Prince and the Pauper.', 'A modern day telling of the Mark Twain classic, The Prince and the Pauper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXKDMH96Af8cF4Rf4tsUuvY55i5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58831'),
  ('128592456899136542', 'The Prince and the Pirate', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Maurizio Calvesi, Federico Boldrini Parravicini', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Massimo Ceccherini, Luisa Ranieri, Melanie Gerren, Lucio Allocca, Claudio Angelini, Giorgio Picchianti, Valeria Vitti', null, 'After his father''s death, elementary school teacher Leopoldo discovers he has to share the inheritance with a half-brother he didn''t know existed: hustler and small-time crook Melchiorre, currently in jail.', 'After his father''s death, elementary school teacher Leopoldo discovers he has to share the inheritance with a half-brother he didn''t know existed: hustler and small-time crook Melchiorre, currently in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfnkA9MPKiRxfbfyWln81CisZRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45916'),
  ('899214300117096772', 'The Prince and the Showgirl', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Laurence Olivier, Jack Cardiff, Geoffrey Haine', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Marilyn Monroe, Laurence Olivier, Sybil Thorndike, Richard Wattis, Jeremy Spenser, David Horne, Harold Goodwin, Gladys Henson', null, 'An American showgirl becomes entangled in political intrigue when the Prince Regent of a foreign country attempts to seduce her.', 'An American showgirl becomes entangled in political intrigue when the Prince Regent of a foreign country attempts to seduce her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNnzkk6OPRnx2jApJ4MnbvJFEvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24012'),
  ('411023408829247141', 'The Prince of Darkness', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Ramy Imam, Mohsen Nasr', 'Hamdy Youssef, Khaled Sarhan, Tamer Abdelmonem', 'Adel Emam, Donia Abdel Azziz, Youssef Daoud, Khaled Sarhan, Diaa Abdel Khaleq, Sherine Saif El Nasr, Saeed Saleh, Younes Shalaby', null, 'The film revolves around Saeed AL-Masri (Adel Imam), one of the pilots of the October War who lost his eye-sight after his plane crashed during the war. Saeed AL-Masri is forced to live in a home for disabled people that is managed by a very bureaucratic managers which they turn it into a prison.', 'The film revolves around Saeed AL-Masri (Adel Imam), one of the pilots of the October War who lost his eye-sight after his plane crashed during the war. Saeed AL-Masri is forced to live in a home for disabled people that is managed by a very bureaucratic managers which they turn it into a prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJ7U9hfuJbpXaeYcEB75uxPWSuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86584'),
  ('473480760555742561', 'The Prince of Egypt', 1998, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Brenda Chapman, Steve Hickner, Simon Wells', 'Philip LaZebnik', 'Val Kilmer, Ralph Fiennes, Michelle Pfeiffer, Sandra Bullock, Jeff Goldblum, Danny Glover, Patrick Stewart, Helen Mirren', 'PG', 'The strong bond between two Royal Egyptian brothers is challenged when their chosen responsibilities set them at odds, with extraordinary consequences.', 'The strong bond between two Royal Egyptian brothers is challenged when their chosen responsibilities set them at odds, with extraordinary consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xUjYwL6Ol7TLJPPKs7sYW5PWLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9837'),
