  ('1083579041498070450', 'The Prince of Homburg', 1997, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Andrea Di Stefano, Barbora Bobuľová, Toni Bertorelli, Anita Laurenzi, Fabio Camilli, Gianluigi Fogacci, Italo Dall''Orto, Bruno Corazzari', null, 'The Prince of Homburg, disobeys orders and leads a cavalry charge in battle against the Swedes, which leads to victory. He is court martialled however for disobeying orders and sentenced to death. His love who is now to be betrothed to the King of Sweden, following his execution appeals to the Elector, her uncle, on his behalf, as do his comrades in battle. He must also contend with his own desire to live and conflicting sense of honour.', 'The Prince of Homburg, disobeys orders and leads a cavalry charge in battle against the Swedes, which leads to victory. He is court martialled however for disobeying orders and sentenced to death. His love who is now to be betrothed to the King of Sweden, following his execution appeals to the Elector, her uncle, on his behalf, as do his comrades in battle. He must also contend with his own desire to live and conflicting sense of honour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEdzhdeYwfjcCB6JlOAvZs2A0Qk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125355'),
  ('714691388311804978', 'The Prince of Magicians', 1901, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician does tricks with the aid of his assistant, the Human Pump.', 'A magician does tricks with the aid of his assistant, the Human Pump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmY970rdWRArvgEyOXZf8wntC1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107269'),
  ('890260902328359668', 'The Prince of Nothingwood', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Sonia Kronlund', 'Sonia Kronlund', 'Salim Shaheen', null, 'French documentarist Sonia Kronlund follows actor and director Salim Shaheen, an Afghan movie star who produced more than 110 low-budget movies in a country devastated by war.', 'French documentarist Sonia Kronlund follows actor and director Salim Shaheen, an Afghan movie star who produced more than 110 low-budget movies in a country devastated by war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSHjoeF9zL3l5jHSvqZqf7pYLLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453277'),
  ('1107185909514717345', 'The Prince of Pennsylvania', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ron Nyswaner, Frank Prinzi', 'Ron Nyswaner', 'Keanu Reeves, Fred Ward, Bonnie Bedelia, Amy Madigan, Tracey Ellis, Jay O. Sanders, Jeff Monahan, Jeff Hayenga', 'R', 'Set in a remote Pennsylvania coal-mining town, this off-beat comedy follows the relationship between Carla, a hippie woman, and Rupert, a young punk rocker who feels like a pariah. Hoping to leave their current lives behind, the two conspire to kidnap Rupert''s father and hold him for ransom.', 'Set in a remote Pennsylvania coal-mining town, this off-beat comedy follows the relationship between Carla, a hippie woman, and Rupert, a young punk rocker who feels like a pariah. Hoping to leave their current lives behind, the two conspire to kidnap Rupert''s father and hold him for ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8GSRQUFQe0vaJXQdhINaUCNsYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369775'),
  ('67969887735038319', 'The Prince of Rome', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Edoardo Falcone, Fabio Zamarion, Andrea Vellucci', 'Paolo Costella, Edoardo Falcone', 'Marco Giallini, Giulia Bevilacqua, Filippo Timi, Sergio Rubini, Denise Tantucci, Antonio Bannò, Liliana Bottone, Massimo De Lorenzo', null, 'In 19th-century Papal Rome, Bartolomeo is a wealthy and greedy parvenu who craves a noble title. While trying to raise the money he needs to strike a deal with a prince for the hand of his daughter, he''ll find himself caught in a magical journey between past, present and future. Assisted by some rather illustrious companions, he''ll have to come to terms with whom he really is and give his life a new meaning.', 'In 19th-century Papal Rome, Bartolomeo is a wealthy and greedy parvenu who craves a noble title. While trying to raise the money he needs to strike a deal with a prince for the hand of his daughter, he''ll find himself caught in a magical journey between past, present and future. Assisted by some rather illustrious companions, he''ll have to come to terms with whom he really is and give his life a new meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDPHqWaB3GqWJL1MOnf0u8DFu2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890618'),
  ('17977485570115037', 'The Prince of Tennis: Two Samurais, The First Game', 2005, 'Animation, TV Movie', 'Takayuki Hamana, Takuya Hiramitsu, Hisashi Ezura', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Junko Minagawa, Ryotaro Okiayu, Takayuki Kondo', null, 'The regular players from Seigaku participates in an exhibition game aboard a cruise ship. However, they discover that the event is being run by a corrupt millionaire heavily involved in illegal gambling and betting, who demands that they lose the match on purpose. To add to the confusion, one of the players on the rival team introduces himself as Ryoma''s brother.', 'The regular players from Seigaku participates in an exhibition game aboard a cruise ship. However, they discover that the event is being run by a corrupt millionaire heavily involved in illegal gambling and betting, who demands that they lose the match on purpose. To add to the confusion, one of the players on the rival team introduces himself as Ryoma''s brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6taulaRtux6h927v5jaPSyLYUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47341'),
  ('993157741262220116', 'The Prince of the Pacific', 2000, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Alain Corneau, Patrick Blossier', 'Eric Collins, Jérôme Salle, Thierry Lhermitte', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Patrick Timsit, Anituavau Landé, François Berléand, Marie Trintignant, Thierry Marani, Arnold Mataurua, Heidy Holman', null, 'French war ship is arriving to Polynesian shore during at 1918 - and adventures begin...', 'French war ship is arriving to Polynesian shore during at 1918 - and adventures begin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DZzWd22KukpHD9W76MJhbD303V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80959'),
  ('1001431237011700887', 'The Prince of Tides', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Goldblatt, Barbra Streisand, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Becky Johnston, Pat Conroy', 'Nick Nolte, Barbra Streisand, Blythe Danner, Kate Nelligan, Jeroen Krabbé, Melinda Dillon, George Carlin, Jason Gould', 'R', 'A troubled Southern man talks to his suicidal sister''s psychiatrist about their family history and falls in love with her (and New York City) in the process.', 'A troubled Southern man talks to his suicidal sister''s psychiatrist about their family history and falls in love with her (and New York City) in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AyeW3YlwfhRwLDeUCW686obceb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10333'),
  ('197304072058054690', 'The Prince’s Voyage', 2019, 'Animation', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Xavier Picard, Samuel Feuillade', 'Anik Leray, Jean-François Laguionie, Jean-François Laguionie', 'Marie-Madeleine Burguet, Catherine Lafond, Celia Rosich, Enrico Di Giovanni, Thomas Sagols, Gabriel Le Doze, Frédéric Cerdal, Patrick Bonnel', null, 'The philosophical tale revolves around an elderly monkey prince who wakes up injured and disoriented in an environment he does not recognise. He navigates this new urban world with the support of a young monkey called Tom.', 'The philosophical tale revolves around an elderly monkey prince who wakes up injured and disoriented in an environment he does not recognise. He navigates this new urban world with the support of a young monkey called Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLvX22Ncehj7RtvRudrCUM5d5J8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575557'),
  ('50330983092661932', 'The Princess', 2022, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Le Van Kiet, Lorenzo Senatore, Nikolai Nikolov', 'Jake Thornton, Ben Lustig', 'Joey King, Dominic Cooper, Olga Kurylenko, Veronica Ngô, Alex Reid, Ed Stoppard, Antoni Davidov, Radoslav Parvanov', 'R', 'A beautiful, strong-willed young royal refuses to wed the cruel sociopath to whom she is betrothed and is kidnapped and locked in a remote tower of her father’s castle. With her scorned, vindictive suitor intent on taking her father’s throne, the princess must protect her family and save the kingdom.', 'A beautiful, strong-willed young royal refuses to wed the cruel sociopath to whom she is betrothed and is kidnapped and locked in a remote tower of her father’s castle. With her scorned, vindictive suitor intent on taking her father’s throne, the princess must protect her family and save the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pCoqX24a6rE981fY1O3PmhiwrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759175'),
  ('834275769428243907', 'The Princess & the Marine', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Robe, Phil Robinson', 'Ronni Kern', 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Marisol Nichols, Keith D. Robinson, Pat Skipper, Dave Power, Luck Hari, Sheetal Sheth, Atossa Leoni', null, 'Based on a true story, American Marine Jason Johnson (Goselaar) is sent on assignment to the Emirate of Bahrain. While there, he meets and falls in love with a spirited, lovely young woman, Meriam (Nichols), without realizing she is really a member of the Bahraini Royal Family. Meriam, who does not wish to consent to an arranged marriage, knows her love affair with Jason is dangerous, as he is a Mormon Christian and she a Muslim. Her parents would never consent to their match, and so Meriam and Jason race against time to escape Bahrain and make it to the United States, where they can marry. If Meriam is sent back, however, her life may be in jeopardy.', 'Based on a true story, American Marine Jason Johnson (Goselaar) is sent on assignment to the Emirate of Bahrain. While there, he meets and falls in love with a spirited, lovely young woman, Meriam (Nichols), without realizing she is really a member of the Bahraini Royal Family. Meriam, who does not wish to consent to an arranged marriage, knows her love affair with Jason is dangerous, as he is a Mormon Christian and she a Muslim. Her parents would never consent to their match, and so Meriam and Jason race against time to escape Bahrain and make it to the United States, where they can marry. If Meriam is sent back, however, her life may be in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDzQcIUJDE75RkehI1AF72fRPL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55733'),
  ('880298817176668481', 'The Princess and the Beans', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Viktor Krutin, Villen Novak', 'Marina Mareeva', 'Elena Safonova, Sergey Zhigunov, Aleksandra Nazarova, Vladimir Konkin, Vladimir Eryomin, Mamuka Kikaleishvili, Olha Sumska, Vladislav Galkin', null, 'A wealthy businessman tries to change his not so good sounding last name by marrying the heir of aristocratic family.', 'A wealthy businessman tries to change his not so good sounding last name by marrying the heir of aristocratic family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wh2vjVYHZLfP7Nsdjxr86ol9Tpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402220'),
  ('262828362411477582', 'The Princess and the Bodyguard', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'David Perrault, John Bradshaw', 'Danny Morgan', 'Emily Alatalo, Ryan Bruce, AnnaMaria Demara, David Pinard, Sarah Orenstein, Kevin Bundy, Chad Andrews', null, 'On her 35th birthday, Lexi discovers that she will suddenly have to give up her normal life in New York and become who she always secretly was… a royal Princess. She has two weeks to come to terms with this, reveal her true identity to her best friend, and find a suitable date for the royal gala, where she will be introduced to the world. All under the watchful eye of her handsome but infuriating bodyguard, Noah.', 'On her 35th birthday, Lexi discovers that she will suddenly have to give up her normal life in New York and become who she always secretly was… a royal Princess. She has two weeks to come to terms with this, reveal her true identity to her best friend, and find a suitable date for the royal gala, where she will be introduced to the world. All under the watchful eye of her handsome but infuriating bodyguard, Noah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NE2G0L2wKbmoeijLOU7bW3fVJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950905'),
  ('184932438396527919', 'The Princess and the Call Girl', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gérard Loubeau, Radley Metzger, Dennis T. Benatar', 'Radley Metzger', 'Carol Levy, Victor Bevine, Shannah Hall, Chris Beach, Noel Cohen, Christina Swing, Scott Plank, Steve Gadler', null, 'Two women--one a wealthy society débutante, the other an elegant call girl--with a remarkable resemblance to one another decide to trade professions and social positions temporarily and see what results from it.', 'Two women--one a wealthy society débutante, the other an elegant call girl--with a remarkable resemblance to one another decide to trade professions and social positions temporarily and see what results from it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NBr66mRqntJbsRNF6XGMd8HquE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64670'),
  ('1036405701501454262', 'The Princess and the Frog', 2009, 'Animation, Romance, Fantasy, Family', 'Ron Clements, John Musker', 'Ron Clements, John Musker, Rob Edwards', 'Anika Noni Rose, Bruno Campos, Jim Cummings, Michael-Leon Wooley, Keith David, Jennifer Cody, Peter Bartlett, Jenifer Lewis', 'G', 'A waitress, desperate to fulfill her dreams as a restaurant owner, is set on a journey to turn a frog prince back into a human being, but she has to face the same problem after she kisses him.', 'A waitress, desperate to fulfill her dreams as a restaurant owner, is set on a journey to turn a frog prince back into a human being, but she has to face the same problem after she kisses him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6nAUs62OJ4DXmnnmPFeVmMz8H9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10198'),
  ('514848495921614486', 'The Princess and the Goblin', 1991, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'József Gémes', 'Robin Lyons', 'Sally Ann Marsh, Claire Bloom, Joss Ackland, Roy Kinnear, Peggy Mount, Peter Murray, Victor Spinetti, Mollie Sugden', 'G', 'The story is about the Princess Irene and a young warrior boy named Curty. Irene must use her magic power to fight off goblins and save the kingdom.', 'The story is about the Princess Irene and a young warrior boy named Curty. Irene must use her magic power to fight off goblins and save the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWXeEzpOavcmv1Ca8sjqkorfuIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42001'),
  ('288717901062811572', 'The Princess and the Magic Mirror', 2014, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Ernesto Padrón', 'Ernesto Padrón', 'Javier Rey, María Castro, Carlos Blanco, Monti Castiñeiras, María Pujalte, Luis Iglesia, Keremcem', null, 'Poor farmer''s son Tom Little may be small, but what he lacks in brawn, he more than makes up for in brains and bravery. When a magic mirror shows him that the love of his life is no less than the beautiful princess, he''s determined to win her heart. Meanwhile, a revengeful witch has conjured up a giant tree that covers the royal palace and destroys the court''s fountain. Having heard that the King is offering his daughter''s hand and half the kingdom to whoever manages to free the palace from this spell, Tom tries his luck against all odds.', 'Poor farmer''s son Tom Little may be small, but what he lacks in brawn, he more than makes up for in brains and bravery. When a magic mirror shows him that the love of his life is no less than the beautiful princess, he''s determined to win her heart. Meanwhile, a revengeful witch has conjured up a giant tree that covers the royal palace and destroys the court''s fountain. Having heard that the King is offering his daughter''s hand and half the kingdom to whoever manages to free the palace from this spell, Tom tries his luck against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BwLtoQDMTgBWEeUJgYb4z2C7pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309002'),
  ('624518582145813920', 'The Princess and the Matchmaker', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, History', 'Ryu Hyun-Sang, Hong Chang-pyo, Lee Hyung-deok', 'Lee So-mi', 'Shim Eun-kyung, Lee Seung-gi, Kim Sang-kyung, Yeon Woo-jin, Kang Min-hyuk, Choi Woo-shik, Jo Bok-rae, Minho', null, 'Refusing to allow fate to decide whom she must marry, Princess Songhwa decides to find her own husband. She seeks the help of a man to interpret her marital harmony with four men she wishes to marry.', 'Refusing to allow fate to decide whom she must marry, Princess Songhwa decides to find her own husband. She seeks the help of a man to interpret her marital harmony with four men she wishes to marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hKUJ6YCVzlW9grBDoKps4KoDNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500168'),
  ('621199956311476139', 'The Princess and the Pauper', 1997, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Lamberto Bava, Paolo Giacomo Marino, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Anna Falchi, Lorenzo Crespi, Nicholas Rogers, Mathieu Carrière, Thomas Kretschmann, Max von Sydow, Michaela Merten, Simone Ascani', null, 'A fairy tale about a twin princess and a prince who where seperated after their birth.', 'A fairy tale about a twin princess and a prince who where seperated after their birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p40LVLkfAl5rGNaZM6X7cBD90gd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94895'),
  ('440278623397648363', 'The Princess and the Pea', 1976, 'Romance, Family, Fantasy', 'Boris Rytsarev, Vyacheslav Yegorov, Aleksandr Machilskiy', 'Feliks Mironer', 'Andrey Podoshian, Alisa Freyndlikh, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Irina Malysheva, Irina Yurevich, Yuri Chekulayev, Aleksandr Kalyagin, Vasiliy Kupriyanov', null, 'In one of the realms, there was time for the prince to get married, but the bride would have to be a real princess. A sign was put up on the gates: “ A Princess Wanted”. But in response to it there appeared only a small girl, wet to the bones after the rain and bearing no resemblance to nobility. So the prince was obliged to venture off to other lands in search of a suitable match. Henceforth the prince’s adventures unfold. In one kingdom, he met a fat king, in another – a hospitable king. He also visited the kingdom of arts. He saw enough princesses, beautiful and clever. And yet, the real princess, the only one he longed for, proved to be the girl who had knocked at their door during a rainstorm…', 'In one of the realms, there was time for the prince to get married, but the bride would have to be a real princess. A sign was put up on the gates: “ A Princess Wanted”. But in response to it there appeared only a small girl, wet to the bones after the rain and bearing no resemblance to nobility. So the prince was obliged to venture off to other lands in search of a suitable match. Henceforth the prince’s adventures unfold. In one kingdom, he met a fat king, in another – a hospitable king. He also visited the kingdom of arts. He saw enough princesses, beautiful and clever. And yet, the real princess, the only one he longed for, proved to be the girl who had knocked at their door during a rainstorm…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/547ZlyEDqE7XZuIupcuvmvUxziC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149832'),
  ('664748789675817282', 'The Princess and the Pea', 2002, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Mark Swan', 'Forrest S. Baker III, Ken Cromar, Ray Goldrup', 'Amanda Waving, Jonathan Firth, Dan Finnerty, Steven Webb, Nigel Lambert, Lincoln Hoppe, Ronan Vibert, Eve Karpf', 'G', '"A truly noble heart is sensitive," says the wise old raven, Sebastian, who pokes, prods and analyzes peas seeking the solution that would save the kingdom of Corazion from the revenge of Laird, the king''s brother. As Sebastian seeks to solve the mystery, his friend, Prince Rollo, is searching for a truly sensitive heart in the pedigrees of pampered princesses, until a chance encounter with a kind-hearted peasant girl causes Rollo to ponder where true beauty lies. Can Sebastian discover the answer in time to rescue the kingdom from the cruel schemes of Laird? Join in the quest to reveal the heart of true nobility.', '"A truly noble heart is sensitive," says the wise old raven, Sebastian, who pokes, prods and analyzes peas seeking the solution that would save the kingdom of Corazion from the revenge of Laird, the king''s brother. As Sebastian seeks to solve the mystery, his friend, Prince Rollo, is searching for a truly sensitive heart in the pedigrees of pampered princesses, until a chance encounter with a kind-hearted peasant girl causes Rollo to ponder where true beauty lies. Can Sebastian discover the answer in time to rescue the kingdom from the cruel schemes of Laird? Join in the quest to reveal the heart of true nobility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oC1wcIY9VECwRkRd6nS4DSHVrMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14492'),
  ('918255922926983703', 'The Princess and the Pilot', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Jun Shishido, Satoshi Tasaki', 'Koroku Inumura', 'Haruka, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Daisuke Ono, Takeshi Tomizawa, Takuto Yoshinaga, Masaki Terasoma, Yutaka Nakano, Sumire Morohoshi', null, 'The war between the Levamme Empire and the Amatsukami Imperium has been raging for years. In the midst of this struggle, the prince of the Levamme Empire declares his love for Juana del Moral and vows to end the war in one year, as part of his marriage proposal. When the Amatsukami catch wind of this, they assault the del Moral residence, targeting Juana''s life. As a last-ditch effort to bring the prince his bride, the San Maltilia Airforce employs a mercenary of mixed blood—a bestado—to fly Juana to the prince in secret.', 'The war between the Levamme Empire and the Amatsukami Imperium has been raging for years. In the midst of this struggle, the prince of the Levamme Empire declares his love for Juana del Moral and vows to end the war in one year, as part of his marriage proposal. When the Amatsukami catch wind of this, they assault the del Moral residence, targeting Juana''s life. As a last-ditch effort to bring the prince his bride, the San Maltilia Airforce employs a mercenary of mixed blood—a bestado—to fly Juana to the prince in secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCA0vHemFhbNqAqlTQvoPoiRR2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93013'),
  ('67587784895342724', 'The Princess and the Pirate', 1944, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'David Butler, Victor Milner, Barton Adams', 'Everett Freeman, Don Hartman, Melville Shavelson', 'Bob Hope, Virginia Mayo, Walter Brennan, Walter Slezak, Victor McLaglen, Marc Lawrence, Hugo Haas, Maude Eburne', 'NR', 'Princess Margaret is travelling incognito to elope with her true love instead of marrying the man her father has betrothed her to. On the high seas, her ship is attacked by pirates who know her identity and plan to kidnap her and hold her for a king''s ransom.', 'Princess Margaret is travelling incognito to elope with her true love instead of marrying the man her father has betrothed her to. On the high seas, her ship is attacked by pirates who know her identity and plan to kidnap her and hold her for a king''s ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foAqdD4Xov5q09rLkj4AzRxs9aQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30506'),
  ('686954390558421125', 'The Princess and the Robot', 1984, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Mauricio de Sousa, Amélia Harue Hirota', 'José Marcio Nicolosi, Itsuo Nakashima', 'Ronaldo Batista, Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Paulo Cavalcante, Elza Gonçalves, Denise Simonetto, Araken Saldanha, André Luis', null, 'Lord Raider and an endearing little robot companion reside in the far-off realm of Planet Carrotland. As fate would have it, a cosmic spark from the radiant Pulsar star strikes the robot just as he becomes smitten with Princess Mimi, a charming pink bunny. However, their newfound love faces a significant obstacle when the king decrees a grand tournament in the kingdom, intent on determining who shall earn the honor of marrying the Princess.', 'Lord Raider and an endearing little robot companion reside in the far-off realm of Planet Carrotland. As fate would have it, a cosmic spark from the radiant Pulsar star strikes the robot just as he becomes smitten with Princess Mimi, a charming pink bunny. However, their newfound love faces a significant obstacle when the king decrees a grand tournament in the kingdom, intent on determining who shall earn the honor of marrying the Princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1NJ9XaKHfU5zHosKMOw9opvgDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122214'),
  ('872491792125627634', 'The Princess and the Warrior', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe, Sebastian Fahr-Brix', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Franka Potente, Benno Fürmann, Joachim Król, Lars Rudolph, Ludger Pistor, Jürgen Tarrach, Natja Brunckhorst, Marita Breuer', null, 'Young nurse Sissi lives a secluded life entirely devoted to her patients at Birkenhof asylum. Her first encounter with ex-soldier and drifter Bodo has a lasting impact. He causes an accident in which he provides first aid, Sissi wonders if he may be the man of her dreams. But when she finds him weeks later she is rejected, as Bodo is stuck somewhere between a traumatic past and a criminal future.', 'Young nurse Sissi lives a secluded life entirely devoted to her patients at Birkenhof asylum. Her first encounter with ex-soldier and drifter Bodo has a lasting impact. He causes an accident in which he provides first aid, Sissi wonders if he may be the man of her dreams. But when she finds him weeks later she is rejected, as Bodo is stuck somewhere between a traumatic past and a criminal future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0dMG2C4GvIObHAcOjW9r61WIJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9301'),
  ('157840400210367654', 'The Princess Blade', 2001, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Shinsuke Sato, Kenji Tanigaki, Taro Kawazu', 'Shinsuke Sato, Kei Kunii', 'Yumiko Shaku, Hideaki Ito, Kyūsaku Shimada, Shiro Sano, Yōichi Numata, Yoko Maki, Yoko Chosokabe, Naomasa Musaka', null, 'Raised by assassins, Yuki is the last of the Takemikazuchi royal bloodline. A deadly weapon in her own right, she learns the gruesome truth about the death of her beloved mother and joins forces with a mysterious rebel leader.', 'Raised by assassins, Yuki is the last of the Takemikazuchi royal bloodline. A deadly weapon in her own right, she learns the gruesome truth about the death of her beloved mother and joins forces with a mysterious rebel leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZNxgBOfi6SaAevgYkkeW68vqZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17180'),
  ('42718549304677745', 'The Princess Bride', 1987, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Rob Reiner, Adrian Biddle, Keith Pain', 'William Goldman', 'Cary Elwes, Robin Wright, Mandy Patinkin, Chris Sarandon, Christopher Guest, Wallace Shawn, André Roussimoff, Fred Savage', 'PG', 'In this enchantingly cracked fairy tale, the beautiful Princess Buttercup and the dashing Westley must overcome staggering odds to find happiness amid six-fingered swordsmen, murderous princes, Sicilians and rodents of unusual size. But even death can''t stop these true lovebirds from triumphing.', 'In this enchantingly cracked fairy tale, the beautiful Princess Buttercup and the dashing Westley must overcome staggering odds to find happiness amid six-fingered swordsmen, murderous princes, Sicilians and rodents of unusual size. But even death can''t stop these true lovebirds from triumphing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FC9L9MrjBoGHYjYZjdWQdopVYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2493'),
  ('380732183182615434', 'The Princess Comes Across', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance, Mystery, Thriller', 'William K. Howard, Ted Tetzlaff, Harry Scott', 'Claude Binyon, J. B. Priestley', 'Carole Lombard, Fred MacMurray, Douglass Dumbrille, Alison Skipworth, George Barbier, William Frawley, Porter Hall, Lumsden Hare', 'NR', 'A Swedish princess boards an ocean liner in Europe en route to an acting career in America and finds herself getting inconveniently attached to a bandleader returning home. To complicate matters, a blackmailer on board apparently knows she is not who she claims to be - and he has his sights set on other passengers with secrets of their own. In the meantime an escaped killer has stowed away under someone else''s identity, and is killing again to cover his tracks; five international police detectives on board are heading the investigation to find him. When evidence points to the princess and bandleader, they must find the killer themselves - before he finds them.', 'A Swedish princess boards an ocean liner in Europe en route to an acting career in America and finds herself getting inconveniently attached to a bandleader returning home. To complicate matters, a blackmailer on board apparently knows she is not who she claims to be - and he has his sights set on other passengers with secrets of their own. In the meantime an escaped killer has stowed away under someone else''s identity, and is killing again to cover his tracks; five international police detectives on board are heading the investigation to find him. When evidence points to the princess and bandleader, they must find the killer themselves - before he finds them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cS3hcy32cef12zrgDRdP013j73q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31879'),
  ('686858316091279723', 'The Princess Diaries', 2001, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Marcia Ross', 'Gina Wendkos', 'Anne Hathaway, Julie Andrews, Heather Matarazzo, Caroline Goodall, Héctor Elizondo, Robert Schwartzman, Erik von Detten, Patrick John Flueger', 'G', 'A socially awkward but very bright 15-year-old girl being raised by a single mom discovers that she is the princess of a small European country because of the recent death of her long-absent father, who, unknown to her, was the crown prince of Genovia. She must make a choice between continuing the life of a San Francisco teen or stepping up to the throne.', 'A socially awkward but very bright 15-year-old girl being raised by a single mom discovers that she is the princess of a small European country because of the recent death of her long-absent father, who, unknown to her, was the crown prince of Genovia. She must make a choice between continuing the life of a San Francisco teen or stepping up to the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSw4lzhDGeM5MjQc86BLzJALhBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9880'),
  ('898088821492284803', 'The Princess Diaries 2: Royal Engagement', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Charles Minsky, Garry Marshall, Donna Morong', 'Shonda Rhimes', 'Anne Hathaway, Julie Andrews, Héctor Elizondo, John Rhys-Davies, Heather Matarazzo, Chris Pine, Callum Blue, Larry Miller', 'G', 'Mia Thermopolis is now a college graduate and on her way to Genovia to take up her duties as princess. Accompanied by her friend Lilly, Mia continues her ''princess lessons'', like riding horses side-saddle and archery. But her already complicated life is turned upside down once again when she learns that she is to take the crown as queen earlier than expected, all while she meets a mysteriously charming young man.', 'Mia Thermopolis is now a college graduate and on her way to Genovia to take up her duties as princess. Accompanied by her friend Lilly, Mia continues her ''princess lessons'', like riding horses side-saddle and archery. But her already complicated life is turned upside down once again when she learns that she is to take the crown as queen earlier than expected, all while she meets a mysteriously charming young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XToqGcE4qdfOSaCPWI7kAb1bm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11130'),
  ('138918563085049836', 'The Princess of Montpensier', 2010, 'Action, Drama, History, Romance', 'Bruno de Keyzer, Bertrand Tavernier', 'François-Olivier Rousseau, Jean Cosmos, Bertrand Tavernier', 'Mélanie Thierry, Lambert Wilson, Gaspard Ulliel, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Raphaël Personnaz, Michel Vuillermoz, Philippe Magnan, Florence Thomassin', null, 'Set in the high courts of 16th Century France, where the wars of religion between Catholics and Protestants are raging. Marie de Mézières, a beautiful young aristocrat, is in love with Henri de Guise, but her hand in marriage is promised to the Prince of Montpensier.', 'Set in the high courts of 16th Century France, where the wars of religion between Catholics and Protestants are raging. Marie de Mézières, a beautiful young aristocrat, is in love with Henri de Guise, but her hand in marriage is promised to the Prince of Montpensier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozR4LwG9vjV9oFKtEYUO8VsYamf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57695'),
  ('742989240303767499', 'The Princess Switch', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mike Rohl, Viorel Sergovici, Lulu de Hillerin', 'Megan Metzger, Robin Bernheim Burger', 'Vanessa Hudgens, Sam Palladio, Nick Sagar, Alexa Adeosun, Suanne Braun, Mark Fleischmann, Sara Stewart, Pavel Douglas', 'PG', 'When a down-to-earth Chicago baker and a soon-to-be princess discover they look like twins, they hatch a Christmastime plan to trade places.', 'When a down-to-earth Chicago baker and a soon-to-be princess discover they look like twins, they hatch a Christmastime plan to trade places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8XgZE8CsHiYN243MEd07GLCep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:556803'),
  ('963304228036784599', 'The Princess Switch 3: Romancing the Star', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mike Rohl, Fernando Argüelles, Martin Kelly', 'Robin Bernheim Burger', 'Vanessa Hudgens, Remy Hii, Sam Palladio, Nick Sagar, Amanda Donohoe, Florence Hall, Ricky Norwood, Suanne Braun', 'PG', 'A priceless relic is stolen from identical royals Queen Margaret and Princess Stacy, who enlist the help of their sketchy look-alike cousin Fiona Pembroke to retrieve it.', 'A priceless relic is stolen from identical royals Queen Margaret and Princess Stacy, who enlist the help of their sketchy look-alike cousin Fiona Pembroke to retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d42eVP0SdHEKUoUnaFpF2eMz4hZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785533'),
  ('804876150846392838', 'The Princess Switch: Switched Again', 2020, 'Family, Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Mike Rohl, Julija Mickėnaitė, Fernando Argüelles', 'Megan Metzger, Robin Bernheim Burger', 'Vanessa Hudgens, Sam Palladio, Nick Sagar, Suanne Braun, Mark Fleischmann, Lachlan Nieboer, Rose McIver, Ben Lamb', 'G', 'When Duchess Margaret unexpectedly inherits the throne & hits a rough patch with Kevin, it’s up to Stacy to save the day before a new lookalike — party girl Fiona — foils their plans.', 'When Duchess Margaret unexpectedly inherits the throne & hits a rough patch with Kevin, it’s up to Stacy to save the day before a new lookalike — party girl Fiona — foils their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vOmeimnVCdojwvc4icyeYUCydJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643882'),
  ('806939866055190327', 'The Princess with the Golden Star', 1959, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Martin Frič, Jan Roth, Miroslav Kubišta', 'K.M. Walló, Martin Frič', 'Marie Kyselková, Josef Zíma, František Smolík, Martin Růžek, Jarmila Kurandová, Stanislav Neumann, Eduard Kohout, Josef Vinklář', null, 'A Czech fairy tale about a princess named Lada who runs away from home in a mouse fur disguise in order to escape an unwanted and forced marriage.', 'A Czech fairy tale about a princess named Lada who runs away from home in a mouse fur disguise in order to escape an unwanted and forced marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2KS2n4uqgBMUhfVl4SozRgerWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51959'),
  ('410193814873951782', 'The Princess Xuxa and the Trapalhões', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Jane Guerra Peixe, Ricardo Aragão', 'Carlos Alberto Diniz, Roberto Silveira, Mauro Wilson', 'Renato Aragão, Xuxa Meneghel, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Paulo Reis, Juninho Bill, Rubinho Cabrera', null, 'The diabolical Ratam (Paul Reis) takes over the planet Antar, after the death of the emperor, and orders that all children be enslaved. Always kept within the palace, Princess Xeron (Xuxa) believes that the people of her kingdom are happy. Meanwhile, outside, the princes Mussaim (Mussum) Dedeon (Dede Santana) and Zacaling (Zacarias) join the Nameless Knight (Renato Aragão), so that together they can defeat Ratam.', 'The diabolical Ratam (Paul Reis) takes over the planet Antar, after the death of the emperor, and orders that all children be enslaved. Always kept within the palace, Princess Xeron (Xuxa) believes that the people of her kingdom are happy. Meanwhile, outside, the princes Mussaim (Mussum) Dedeon (Dede Santana) and Zacaling (Zacarias) join the Nameless Knight (Renato Aragão), so that together they can defeat Ratam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Cgup7klrAhrTrF176j7ScvjkT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123571'),
  ('122727920348829179', 'The Principal', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Christopher Cain, Arthur Albert', 'Frank Deese', 'Jim Belushi, Louis Gossett Jr., Rae Dawn Chong, Kelly Jo Minter, Michael Wright, J.J. Cohen, Esai Morales, Troy Winbush', 'R', 'Burglary. Drugs. Assault. Rape. The students at Brandel High are more than new Principal Rick Latimer bargained for. Gangs fight to control the school using knives - even guns - when they have to. When Latimer and the head of security try to clean up the school and stop the narcotics trade, they run up against a teenage mafia. A violent confrontation on the campus leads to a deadly showdown with the drug dealer''s gang, and one last chance for Latimer to save his career... and his life.', 'Burglary. Drugs. Assault. Rape. The students at Brandel High are more than new Principal Rick Latimer bargained for. Gangs fight to control the school using knives - even guns - when they have to. When Latimer and the head of security try to clean up the school and stop the narcotics trade, they run up against a teenage mafia. A violent confrontation on the campus leads to a deadly showdown with the drug dealer''s gang, and one last chance for Latimer to save his career... and his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvgceMHXeiFAjRYgQ7D2qu0Hebv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10081'),
  ('222390441058407731', 'The Principles of Lust', 2003, 'Drama', 'Penny Woolcock, Graham Smith', 'Penny Woolcock', 'Alec Newman, Marc Warren, Sienna Guillory, Lara Clifton, Alexander Popplewell, Julian Barratt, Mackenzie Crook, Gwyn Hollis', null, 'Crippled by his writer''s block, Paul enters into a new, exciting relationship with risk-taking Billy and super-sexy Juliette. As it becomes increasingly tangled, however, he must choose one of them over the other.', 'Crippled by his writer''s block, Paul enters into a new, exciting relationship with risk-taking Billy and super-sexy Juliette. As it becomes increasingly tangled, however, he must choose one of them over the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EH7sX7aWWWQZhZpcfFSSjNoVnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187383'),
  ('399549228676678358', 'The Prison', 2017, 'Crime, Action', 'Jang Han-seung, Kim Min-su, Kim Jae-keun', 'Na Hyun', 'Han Suk-kyu, Kim Rae-won, Jung Woong-in, Jo Jae-yun, Shin Sung-rok, Jeon Bae-soo, Lee Kyung-young, Kang Shin-il', 'NR', 'An imprisoned ex-police inspector discovers that the entire penitentiary is controlled by an inmate running a crime syndicate and becomes part of the crime empire.', 'An imprisoned ex-police inspector discovers that the entire penitentiary is controlled by an inmate running a crime syndicate and becomes part of the crime empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlyaPaVqwbj2QNYZRxUV8AzguBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438798'),
  ('59556025650149760', 'The Prisoner', 1955, 'Drama', 'Peter Glenville, Reginald H. Wyer, Denis O''Dell', 'Bridget Boland', 'Alec Guinness, Jack Hawkins, Wilfrid Lawson, Kenneth Griffith, Jeanette Sterke, Ronald Lewis, Raymond Huntley, Mark Dignam', null, 'A cardinal is arrested for treason against the state. He is a popular hero of his people, for his resistance against the Nazis during the war and his resistance when his country again fell to a totalitarian conqueror. In prison, his interrogator is determined to extract a confession of guilt, and thus destroy his power over his people.', 'A cardinal is arrested for treason against the state. He is a popular hero of his people, for his resistance against the Nazis during the war and his resistance when his country again fell to a totalitarian conqueror. In prison, his interrogator is determined to extract a confession of guilt, and thus destroy his power over his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPlWKXHnBI6egwiISo3KqOUzIEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52857'),
  ('96618024212461571', 'The Prisoner of If Castle', 1989, 'Adventure, TV Movie', 'Georgi Yungvald-Khilkevich, Feliks Hilevych, Anna Podlesnaya', 'Georgi Yungvald-Khilkevich', 'Viktor Avilov, Evgeniy Dvorzhetskiy, Anna Samokhina, Mikhail Boyarskiy, Aleksey Petrenko, Nadira Mirzayeva, Aleksei Zharkov, Svetlana Smirnova', null, 'A Russian version of the classic Alexandre Dumas novel. Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him', 'A Russian version of the classic Alexandre Dumas novel. Edmond Dantes is falsely accused by those jealous of his good fortune, and is sentenced to spend the rest of his life in the notorious island prison, Chateau d''If. While imprisoned, he meets the Abbe Faria, a fellow prisoner whom everyone believes to be mad. The Abbe tells Edmond of a fantastic treasure hidden away on a tiny island, that only he knows the location of. After many years in prison, the old Abbe dies, and Edmond escapes disguised as the dead body. Now free, Edmond must find the treasure the Abbe told him of, so he can use the new-found wealth to exact revenge on those who have wronged him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LIYvEja9WQzFLRihR3xwPki3R7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42652'),
  ('66766048769268300', 'The Prisoner of Second Avenue', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Melvin Frank, Howard Roessel, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Neil Simon', 'Jack Lemmon, Anne Bancroft, Gene Saks, Elizabeth Wilson, Florence Stanley, Maxine Stuart, Ed Peck, Gene Blakely', 'PG', 'Mel Edison has just lost his job after many years and now has to cope with being unemployed at middle age during an intense NYC heat wave.', 'Mel Edison has just lost his job after many years and now has to cope with being unemployed at middle age during an intense NYC heat wave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UjoKjMQt7oE5PcKanfLLFwvAUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19221'),
  ('289806100637539275', 'The Prisoner of Sex', 1978, 'Drama', 'Walter Hugo Khouri, Antonio Meliande', 'Walter Hugo Khouri', 'Roberto Maya, Sandra Bréa, Kate Lyra, Aldine Müller, Nicole Puzzi, Maria Rosa, Mara Husemann, Marisa Leite de Barros', null, 'Bored with their marriage, the architect Marcelo proposes his wife Ana, a relation to three, with another sexual partner. The woman accepts, but the situation escapes from Marcelo''s control because Ana engages lovingly with each other, and Marcelo no longer fits in the triangle proposed.', 'Bored with their marriage, the architect Marcelo proposes his wife Ana, a relation to three, with another sexual partner. The woman accepts, but the situation escapes from Marcelo''s control because Ana engages lovingly with each other, and Marcelo no longer fits in the triangle proposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPf74J6feebSGOSQ6ouG6FLcCPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195483'),
  ('592071573722563132', 'The Prisoner of Shark Island', 1936, 'Drama, History', 'Louis Silvers, John Ford, Edward O''Fearna', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Warner Baxter, Gloria Stuart, Claude Gillingwater, Arthur Byron, O. P. Heggie, Harry Carey, Francis Ford, John McGuire', 'NR', 'After healing the leg of the murderer John Wilkes Booth, responsible for the assassination of President Abraham Lincoln, perpetrated on April 14, 1865, during a performance at Ford''s Theatre in Washington; Dr. Samuel A. Mudd, considered part of the atrocious conspiracy, is sentenced to life imprisonment and sent to the sinister Shark Island Prison.', 'After healing the leg of the murderer John Wilkes Booth, responsible for the assassination of President Abraham Lincoln, perpetrated on April 14, 1865, during a performance at Ford''s Theatre in Washington; Dr. Samuel A. Mudd, considered part of the atrocious conspiracy, is sentenced to life imprisonment and sent to the sinister Shark Island Prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRwHEfjPmRhK9rbqV3XNThERKCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77245'),
  ('238360059293710711', 'The Prisoner of the Iron Bars', 2004, 'Documentary, History', 'Paulo Sacramento', 'Paulo Sacramento', 'Adeir Cupertino, Celso Ferreira de Albuquerque, Cláudio Fabiano, Etelvino Batista da Silva, Flaviano Souza Fonseca Filho, João Vicente Lopes, Joel Aparecido da Silva, Jonas Freitas Cruz', null, 'In 2002, the greatest prison in Latin America, Complex Carandiru, was demolished. A couple of months before its implosion, director Paulo Sacramento trained some inmates and together with his crew, they produced many hours of footage, showing daily life in prison.', 'In 2002, the greatest prison in Latin America, Complex Carandiru, was demolished. A couple of months before its implosion, director Paulo Sacramento trained some inmates and together with his crew, they produced many hours of footage, showing daily life in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgylfs6z1Ji8FK9JQeafoxaEvxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126046'),
  ('422993069660687065', 'The Prisoner of Zenda', 1922, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Rex Ingram, John F. Seitz', 'Slavko Vorkapich, Mary O''Hara', 'Lewis Stone, Alice Terry, Robert Edeson, Stuart Holmes, Ramon Novarro, Barbara La Marr, Malcolm McGregor, Edward Connelly', null, 'A kingdom''s ascending heir, marked for assassination, switches identities with a lookalike, who takes his place at the coronation. When the real king is kidnapped, his followers try to find him, while the stand-in falls in love with the king''s intended bride, the beautiful Princess Flavia.', 'A kingdom''s ascending heir, marked for assassination, switches identities with a lookalike, who takes his place at the coronation. When the real king is kidnapped, his followers try to find him, while the stand-in falls in love with the king''s intended bride, the beautiful Princess Flavia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awHQESDYtiV893E7ovlgPIESh5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144923'),
