  ('532495109793121467', 'The Private Life of a Cat', 1946, 'Documentary', 'Alexander Hammid, Alexander Hammid, Maya Deren', 'Alexander Hammid', null, null, 'An intimate study of the life of a domestic cat, taking place over a period of months as she gives birth to a litter of kittens and cares for them as they grow.', 'An intimate study of the life of a domestic cat, taking place over a period of months as she gives birth to a litter of kittens and cares for them as they grow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mTgSXmUEKaWZizAKt8QbGEig3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122479'),
  ('610095190124871648', 'The Private Life of Don Juan', 1934, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Alexander Korda, Geoffrey Boothby, Muir Mathieson', 'Lajos Biró, Frederick Lonsdale', 'Douglas Fairbanks, Merle Oberon, Bruce Winston, Melville Cooper, Gibson Gowland, Benita Hume, Gina Malo, Binnie Barnes', null, 'What do women want? Don Juan is aging. He''s arrived secretly in Seville after a 20 year absence. His wife Dolores, whom he hasn''t lived with in five years, still loves him. He refuses to see her; he fears the life of a husband. She has bought his debts and will remand him to jail for two years if he won''t come to her. Meanwhile, an impostor is climbing the balconies of Seville claiming to be Don Juan.', 'What do women want? Don Juan is aging. He''s arrived secretly in Seville after a 20 year absence. His wife Dolores, whom he hasn''t lived with in five years, still loves him. He refuses to see her; he fears the life of a husband. She has bought his debts and will remand him to jail for two years if he won''t come to her. Meanwhile, an impostor is climbing the balconies of Seville claiming to be Don Juan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdCif05jERKmsYeAgQxvHUu2FOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38719'),
  ('724030693841191606', 'The Private Life of Henry VIII', 1933, 'History, Drama', 'Alexander Korda, Geoffrey Boothby, Georges Périnal', 'Arthur Wimperis', 'Charles Laughton, Robert Donat, Franklin Dyall, Miles Mander, Laurence Hanray, William Austin, John Loder, Claud Allister', 'NR', 'Renowned for his excess, King Henry VIII goes through a series of wives during his rule. With Anne Boleyn, his second wife, executed on charges of treason, King Henry weds maid Jane Seymour, but that marriage also ends in tragedy. Not one to be single for long, the king picks German-born Anne of Cleves as his bride, but their union lasts only months before an annulment is granted, and King Henry continues his string of spouses.', 'Renowned for his excess, King Henry VIII goes through a series of wives during his rule. With Anne Boleyn, his second wife, executed on charges of treason, King Henry weds maid Jane Seymour, but that marriage also ends in tragedy. Not one to be single for long, the king picks German-born Anne of Cleves as his bride, but their union lasts only months before an annulment is granted, and King Henry continues his string of spouses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncQC8U3gGFhCTWlxxn32nkFr2d4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43122'),
  ('258449865778125641', 'The Private Life of Plants', 1995, 'Documentary, TV Movie', null, null, 'David Attenborough', null, 'David Attenborough takes us on a guided tour through the secret world of plants, to see things no unaided eye could witness. Each episode in this six-part series focuses on one of the critical stages through which every plant must pass if it is to survive:- travelling, growing, and flowering; struggling with one another; creating alliances with other organisms both plant and animal; and evolving complex ways of surviving in the earth''s most ferociously hostile environments.', 'David Attenborough takes us on a guided tour through the secret world of plants, to see things no unaided eye could witness. Each episode in this six-part series focuses on one of the critical stages through which every plant must pass if it is to survive:- travelling, growing, and flowering; struggling with one another; creating alliances with other organisms both plant and animal; and evolving complex ways of surviving in the earth''s most ferociously hostile environments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHuKyJD3hlyZzxZgJ1TBOV3S0YH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39137'),
  ('509544278748159312', 'The Private Life of Sherlock Holmes', 1970, 'Adventure, Mystery, Crime, Comedy', 'Billy Wilder, Christopher Challis, Tom Pevsner', 'I. A. L. Diamond, Billy Wilder', 'Robert Stephens, Colin Blakely, Geneviève Page, Christopher Lee, Tamara Toumanova, Clive Revill, Irene Handl, Mollie Maureen', 'PG-13', 'When a bored Sherlock eagerly takes the case of Gabrielle Valladon following an attempt on her life, the search for her missing husband leads to Loch Ness and the legendary monster.', 'When a bored Sherlock eagerly takes the case of Gabrielle Valladon following an attempt on her life, the search for her missing husband leads to Loch Ness and the legendary monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQSYu0DXkqTOEfWF21AzaqXxYCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5185'),
  ('579804620820583728', 'The Private Life of the Gannets', 1934, 'Documentary', 'Julian Huxley', 'Ronald Lockley', 'A.L. Alexander', null, 'A 1934 GB production that was picked up in 1937 by Educational for 20th Century Fox distribution about the gannet, a beautiful white and exceedingly graceful bird deemed the best fisherman in the world, that inhabits a small rocky island off the coast of Wales. The film won the 1938 Academy Award for Best Short Subject (One-Reel).', 'A 1934 GB production that was picked up in 1937 by Educational for 20th Century Fox distribution about the gannet, a beautiful white and exceedingly graceful bird deemed the best fisherman in the world, that inhabits a small rocky island off the coast of Wales. The film won the 1938 Academy Award for Best Short Subject (One-Reel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9YATmHXynbyTVm232CIxn2swym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183187'),
  ('837863113940488776', 'The Private Lives of Elizabeth and Essex', 1939, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Leo F. Forbstein, W. Howard Greene', 'Norman Reilly Raine, Æneas MacKenzie', 'Bette Davis, Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Donald Crisp, Alan Hale, Vincent Price, Henry Stephenson, Henry Daniell', 'NR', 'This period drama frames the tumultuous affair between Queen Elizabeth I and the man who would be King of England.', 'This period drama frames the tumultuous affair between Queen Elizabeth I and the man who would be King of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76UbFh03IvO8fwD8MywFpdfUCcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16902'),
  ('1022283036307838862', 'The Private Lives of Pippa Lee', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rebecca Miller, Declan Quinn', 'Rebecca Miller', 'Robin Wright, Alan Arkin, Keanu Reeves, Julianne Moore, Winona Ryder, Mike Binder, Cornel West, Zoe Kazan', 'R', 'After her much older husband forces a move to a suburban retirement community, Pippa Lee engages in a period of reflection and finds herself heading toward a quiet nervous breakdown.', 'After her much older husband forces a move to a suburban retirement community, Pippa Lee engages in a period of reflection and finds herself heading toward a quiet nervous breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHN6AaAcks2c8HTVaQzJKSJLp7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4475'),
  ('1149682248280300973', 'The Private War of Major Benson', 1955, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Jerry Hopper', 'William Roberts, Richard Alan Simmons', 'Charlton Heston, Julie Adams, William Demarest, Tim Hovey, Nana Bryant, Tim Considine, Sal Mineo, Milburn Stone', 'NR', 'A Major noted for advancing with his mouth before thinking is given a choice: to be drummed out of the Army, or take command of and shape up the ROTC program at Sheridan Academy before it fails its next inspection. At Sheridan he encounters three hundred pre-teen cadets who range from rascally to adorable, and a female doctor who has just the right prescription for him.', 'A Major noted for advancing with his mouth before thinking is given a choice: to be drummed out of the Army, or take command of and shape up the ROTC program at Sheridan Academy before it fails its next inspection. At Sheridan he encounters three hundred pre-teen cadets who range from rascally to adorable, and a female doctor who has just the right prescription for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0PYsNW7dLXHq7fYfUHyC3HA8R5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110502'),
  ('373980938945035570', 'The Privilege', 2022, 'Horror', 'Felix Fuchssteiner, Katharina Schöde, Gwendolyn Clayton', 'Eckhard Vollmar, Katharina Schöde, Felix Fuchssteiner', 'Max Schimmelpfennig, Lea van Acken, Tijan Marei, Milena Tscharntke, Lise Risom Olsen, Roman Knižka, Nadeshda Brennicke, Horst Janson', 'R', 'A wealthy teen and his friends attending an elite private school uncover a dark conspiracy while looking into a series of strange supernatural events.', 'A wealthy teen and his friends attending an elite private school uncover a dark conspiracy while looking into a series of strange supernatural events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBLi3Nd5JMQGMiOmmfuPgLw5SzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926980'),
  ('360049686200988584', 'The Prize', 1963, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Mark Robson, William H. Daniels, Hank Moonjean', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Paul Newman, Edward G. Robinson, Elke Sommer, Diane Baker, Micheline Presle, Gérard Oury, Sergio Fantoni, Kevin McCarthy', 'NR', 'A group of Nobel laureates descends on Stockholm to accept their awards. Among them is American novelist Andrew Craig, a former literary luminary now writing pulp detective stories to earn a living. Craig, who is infamous for his drinking and womanizing, formulates a wild theory that physics prize winner Dr. Max Stratman has been replaced by an impostor, embroiling Craig and his chaperone in a Cold War kidnapping plot.', 'A group of Nobel laureates descends on Stockholm to accept their awards. Among them is American novelist Andrew Craig, a former literary luminary now writing pulp detective stories to earn a living. Craig, who is infamous for his drinking and womanizing, formulates a wild theory that physics prize winner Dr. Max Stratman has been replaced by an impostor, embroiling Craig and his chaperone in a Cold War kidnapping plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5A9KlSQaCg5epjrMH5RFyYQoTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4025'),
  ('1148991414358629851', 'The Prize', 2011, 'Drama', 'Paula Markovitch, Iván Cuevas, Claudia Sainte-Luce', 'Paula Markovitch', 'Laura Agorreca, Paula Galinelli Hertzog, Viviana Suraniti, Sharon Herrera, Uriel Iasillo, Ludmila López, Chiara Josefina Peralta, Jonathan Raia', null, 'Ceci, a seven year old girl, has to keep a huge secret, but she doesn''t completely understand what is the secret about. The life of her family depends on her silence. But what exactly must she keep silent about? Ceci and her mom live hidden from military repression in Argentina. Ceci asks herself: what must she say? What should she really believe and do in order to deserve the love of her mother and others?', 'Ceci, a seven year old girl, has to keep a huge secret, but she doesn''t completely understand what is the secret about. The life of her family depends on her silence. But what exactly must she keep silent about? Ceci and her mom live hidden from military repression in Argentina. Ceci asks herself: what must she say? What should she really believe and do in order to deserve the love of her mother and others?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9I0UZDaksIieigdRaognEadsNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107073'),
  ('385759026071755150', 'The Prize of Peril', 1983, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Yves Boisset, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Jean Curtelin, Yves Boisset', 'Gérard Lanvin, Michel Piccoli, Marie-France Pisier, Bruno Cremer, Andréa Ferréol, Jean Rougerie, Jean-Claude Dreyfus, Jean-Pierre Bagot', null, 'In a futuristic society, contestants pit their survival skills against each other in a fight to the death for cash prizes, and the contest is aired live on television.', 'In a futuristic society, contestants pit their survival skills against each other in a fight to the death for cash prizes, and the contest is aired live on television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqhdK3tEArToLDakoFtM6izqnT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51259'),
  ('224466076310710428', 'The Prize Pest', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'After listening to one of his favorite radio programs, Porky Pig receives a grand prize from the station. Out of the gift box pops Daffy Duck, who insists on living in Porky''s house.', 'After listening to one of his favorite radio programs, Porky Pig receives a grand prize from the station. Out of the gift box pops Daffy Duck, who insists on living in Porky''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNGSgLtSkCgnRfmE3rBKIu8aPEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236012'),
  ('984073022757689585', 'The Prize Winner of Defiance, Ohio', 2005, 'Drama', 'Jane Anderson, Jonathan Freeman', 'Jane Anderson', 'Julianne Moore, Woody Harrelson, Laura Dern, Trevor Morgan, Ellary Porterfield, Simon Reynolds, Robert Clark, Michael Seater', null, 'A Midwestern housewife supports her large family by entering contests for ad slogans sponsored by consumer product companies, while dealing with abuse from her alcoholic husband. Based on a true story.', 'A Midwestern housewife supports her large family by entering contests for ad slogans sponsored by consumer product companies, while dealing with abuse from her alcoholic husband. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBAxyz9LTvyRlQ6wcMA2La2rYgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27176'),
  ('871121185998088988', 'The Prizefighter and the Lady', 1933, 'Romance, Comedy', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Lester White', 'John Lee Mahin, John Meehan', 'Myrna Loy, Max Baer, Primo Carnera, Jack Dempsey, Walter Huston, Otto Kruger, Vince Barnett, Robert McWade', null, 'An ex-sailor turned boxer finds romance and gets a shot at the heavyweight title.', 'An ex-sailor turned boxer finds romance and gets a shot at the heavyweight title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNHGwt9ij4LFA4xtnxG2HnoqgUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95854'),
  ('627757162803545497', 'The Probability Factor', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gérard Pirès, Michael Seresin', 'Jean-Patrick Manchette, Gérard Pirès', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Mireille Darc, Bernadette Lafont, Lea Massari, Claude Piéplu, Claudia Marsani, Bernard Fresson, Jean Abeillé', null, 'Fred works for an insurance company as a computer engineer. He is bored with enduring the trials of his shrewish wife, so, after using actuarial tables to calculate the most common means of death, he cleverly prepares the family bathroom and brings about her demise. For a while he is content with his new freedom, but then he recognizes that a friend is in a similar situation.', 'Fred works for an insurance company as a computer engineer. He is bored with enduring the trials of his shrewish wife, so, after using actuarial tables to calculate the most common means of death, he cleverly prepares the family bathroom and brings about her demise. For a while he is content with his new freedom, but then he recognizes that a friend is in a similar situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnTrRM7NxDuzokM6mTX66DCDDYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78264'),
  ('183532370225037849', 'The Process', 1972, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This film by Stan Brakhage investigates the process of memory and thought by melting a series of images and a field of color. The positive-negative flickering graphs a sort of shutter-window all over the matter of the vision. Jittery flocks of space are interweaving as pieces of language in a scant illumination, whereas the process of thought is sheared in fuzzy transience.', 'This film by Stan Brakhage investigates the process of memory and thought by melting a series of images and a field of color. The positive-negative flickering graphs a sort of shutter-window all over the matter of the vision. Jittery flocks of space are interweaving as pieces of language in a scant illumination, whereas the process of thought is sheared in fuzzy transience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xecWDfSiFINywIdWAhmN4HRhmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155002'),
  ('429173094119919517', 'The Prodigal Daughter', 1981, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, Pierre Lhomme', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Jane Birkin, Michel Piccoli, Natasha Parry, Eva Renzi, Audrey Matson, René Féret', null, 'A young woman in a deep depression leaves her husband and returns to her parents. She discovers her father is having an affair, becomes jealous of his mistress and tries to turn his feelings in her direction.', 'A young woman in a deep depression leaves her husband and returns to her parents. She discovers her father is having an affair, becomes jealous of his mistress and tries to turn his feelings in her direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2d6crfg2MbgyFfo1DbJ2cuibjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63174'),
  ('1151369457811434823', 'The Prodigal Son', 1981, 'Action, Comedy', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Yuen Biao', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu, Wong Jing', 'Yuen Biao, Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Lam Ching-Ying, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Peter Chan Lung, Paul Chung Fat, Dick Wei, Wai Pak', null, 'A rich man''s son believes himself to be the best kung fu fighter in Canton. Unfortunately, his father, anxious for his son''s safety, bribes all his opponents to lose. After a humiliating defeat at the hands of an actor in a traveling theatre company, the son resolves to find a better teacher.', 'A rich man''s son believes himself to be the best kung fu fighter in Canton. Unfortunately, his father, anxious for his son''s safety, bribes all his opponents to lose. After a humiliating defeat at the hands of an actor in a traveling theatre company, the son resolves to find a better teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ickK7UAYvemICk3jaibCCIOqEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41380'),
  ('988772249793369003', 'The Prodigies', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Antoine Charreyron', 'Matthieu Delaporte, Alexandre de La Patellière', 'Jeffrey Evan Thomas, Jacob Rosenbaum, Dominic Gould, Moon Dailly, Isabelle Van Waes, Dante Bacote, Sophie Chen, Nilton Martins', null, 'Five teenage prodigies brutally beaten in New York’s Central Park plot an apocalyptic revenge against the world. Only master prodigy Jimbo Farrar knows their formidable power. But can he alone hold their rage at bay?', 'Five teenage prodigies brutally beaten in New York’s Central Park plot an apocalyptic revenge against the world. Only master prodigy Jimbo Farrar knows their formidable power. But can he alone hold their rage at bay?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Xbayov6CSIt3BvrnthNP6btNQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61901'),
