  ('973194694126152747', 'The Professor and the Madman', 2019, 'History, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Farhad Safinia, Kasper Tuxen, Ian Adams', 'Todd Komarnicki, Farhad Safinia, John Boorman', 'Mel Gibson, Sean Penn, Natalie Dormer, Eddie Marsan, Jennifer Ehle, Jeremy Irvine, David O''Hara, Anthony Andrews', null, 'Professor James Murray begins work compiling words for the first edition of the Oxford English Dictionary in the mid 19th century, and receives over 10,000 entries from a patient at Broadmoor Criminal Lunatic Asylum, Dr. William Minor.', 'Professor James Murray begins work compiling words for the first edition of the Oxford English Dictionary in the mid 19th century, and receives over 10,000 entries from a patient at Broadmoor Criminal Lunatic Asylum, Dr. William Minor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtGCDLhfjW96qVarwctnuTpGOtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411728'),
  ('416254032220773290', 'The Program', 1993, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'David S. Ward, Victor Hammer, Josh McLaglen', 'David S. Ward, Aaron Latham', 'James Caan, Halle Berry, Omar Epps, Craig Sheffer, Kristy Swanson, Abraham Benrubi, Duane Davis, Jon Pennell', 'R', 'Several players from different backgrounds try to cope with the pressures of playing football at a major university. Each deals with the pressure differently, some turn to drinking, others to drugs, and some to studying.', 'Several players from different backgrounds try to cope with the pressures of playing football at a major university. Each deals with the pressure differently, some turn to drinking, others to drugs, and some to studying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pdbutHc9SLEPmdLKtlVffiLByP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18133'),
  ('888155078262881399', 'The Program', 2015, 'Drama', 'Stephen Frears, Danny Cohen, Barrie McCulloch', 'John Hodge', 'Ben Foster, Chris O''Dowd, Guillaume Canet, Jesse Plemons, Lee Pace, Denis Ménochet, Edward Hogg, Dustin Hoffman', 'PG-13', 'An Irish sports journalist becomes convinced that Lance Armstrong''s performances during the Tour de France victories are fueled by banned substances. With this conviction, he starts hunting for evidence that will expose Armstrong.', 'An Irish sports journalist becomes convinced that Lance Armstrong''s performances during the Tour de France victories are fueled by banned substances. With this conviction, he starts hunting for evidence that will expose Armstrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qb8L1SydRGGc3cuN0EUvOqLnCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271736'),
  ('490688932311181887', 'The Projected Man', 1966, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ian Curteis, Stanley Pavey', 'John Croydon, Peter Bryan', 'Mary Peach, Bryant Haliday, Norman Wooland, Ronald Allen, Derek Farr, Derrick De Marney, Gerard Heinz, Tracey Crisp', 'NR', 'Matter-transmitter sabotage leaves a British scientist (Bryant Halliday) disfigured and full of amps.', 'Matter-transmitter sabotage leaves a British scientist (Bryant Halliday) disfigured and full of amps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yX69WGtHobpiYIitXR3o0ZLSZ3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3210'),
  ('63665648870155093', 'The Projectionist', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'José María Cabral', null, 'Félix Germán, Cindy Galán, Lia Briones, Ana María Arias, María Castillo, Francis Cruz, Jose Cruz, Pavel Marcano', 'NR', 'A lonely man who operates a film projector finds his only solace in a woman he sees on a film reel. After the reel is lost in an accident, he sets out to find the woman through the remotest, poorest places of the Dominican Republic.', 'A lonely man who operates a film projector finds his only solace in a woman he sees on a film reel. After the reel is lost in an accident, he sets out to find the woman through the remotest, poorest places of the Dominican Republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgvKuBUzibEUZ1qXiZHlUPP0Jr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538632'),
  ('426970499730508685', 'The Prolific Magical Egg', 1902, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A human skeleton is placed upon a table by an attendant. When the attendant leaves the room the skeleton begins kicking his legs and throwing his arms about and suddenly turns into a magician. The magician produces an egg, performing several sleight-of-hand tricks, and places it upon the table with the small end downward. He then crudely draws a human face upon the shell, and the egg immediately begins growing larger and larger until it reaches the size of a normal head.', 'A human skeleton is placed upon a table by an attendant. When the attendant leaves the room the skeleton begins kicking his legs and throwing his arms about and suddenly turns into a magician. The magician produces an egg, performing several sleight-of-hand tricks, and places it upon the table with the small end downward. He then crudely draws a human face upon the shell, and the egg immediately begins growing larger and larger until it reaches the size of a normal head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yenWXigsl8aQefLZpo2UsXME1k7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190690'),
  ('809234575877559634', 'The Prom', 1992, 'Drama', 'Steven Shainberg, Carlos Montaner', 'Denis Johnson, Steven Shainberg', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Cole Hauser, Andras Jones, J.T. Walsh, Natalija Nogulich, Tuesday Knight, JD Cullum, Joel Murray', null, 'Marty is not comfortable showing his body at college or private. He is suffering from a skin disease called nevus flammeus. In town he stumbles on The Dunes. A porn-shop-theme-park with one booth named "The Prom". This is where Lana works.', 'Marty is not comfortable showing his body at college or private. He is suffering from a skin disease called nevus flammeus. In town he stumbles on The Dunes. A porn-shop-theme-park with one booth named "The Prom". This is where Lana works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIJx4CvbpCPt8rtznFl7DftkYAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206512'),
  ('501917247072204345', 'The Prom', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ryan Murphy, Scott Robertson, Matthew Libatique', 'Jack Viertel', 'Meryl Streep, James Corden, Nicole Kidman, Kerry Washington, Keegan-Michael Key, Andrew Rannells, Ariana DeBose, Jo Ellen Pellman', 'PG-13', 'After the PTA of a conservative high school in Indiana bans same-sex couples from attending the annual prom, a gang of flamboyant Broadway stars try to boost their image by showing up to support two lesbian students.', 'After the PTA of a conservative high school in Indiana bans same-sex couples from attending the annual prom, a gang of flamboyant Broadway stars try to boost their image by showing up to support two lesbian students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oHvqd1QL5kaqt6zmCuDmM8esjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611213'),
  ('110216213707613625', 'The Promise', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Franz Rath, Jörg Widmer', 'Peter Schneider, Felice Laudadio, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Meret Becker, Corinna Harfouch, Anian Zollner, August Zirner, Eva Mattes, Hark Bohm, Otto Sander, Ulrike Krumbiegel', null, 'East-Berlin, 1961, shortly after the erection of the Wall. Konrad, Sophie and three of their friends plan a daring escape to Western Germany. The attempt is successful, except for Konrad, who remains behind. From then on, and for the next 28 years, Konrad and Sophie will attempt to meet again, in spite of the Iron Curtain. Konrad, who has become a reputed Astrophysicist, tries to take advantage of scientific congresses outside Eastern Germany to arrange encounters with Sophie. But in a country where the political police, the Stasi, monitors the moves of all suspicious people (such as Konrad''s sister Barbara and her husband Harald), preserving one''s privacy, ideals and self-respect becomes an exhausting fight, even as the Eastern block begins its long process of disintegration.', 'East-Berlin, 1961, shortly after the erection of the Wall. Konrad, Sophie and three of their friends plan a daring escape to Western Germany. The attempt is successful, except for Konrad, who remains behind. From then on, and for the next 28 years, Konrad and Sophie will attempt to meet again, in spite of the Iron Curtain. Konrad, who has become a reputed Astrophysicist, tries to take advantage of scientific congresses outside Eastern Germany to arrange encounters with Sophie. But in a country where the political police, the Stasi, monitors the moves of all suspicious people (such as Konrad''s sister Barbara and her husband Harald), preserving one''s privacy, ideals and self-respect becomes an exhausting fight, even as the Eastern block begins its long process of disintegration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pa0g9SFf6LglgrIJ2niDL9v7r6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105045'),
  ('560988660135584147', 'The Promise', 2005, 'Fantasy, Drama, Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Chen Kaige, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Dion Lam', 'Chen Kaige, Charcoal Tan', 'Cecilia Cheung, Liu Ye, Chen Hong, Cheng Qian, Jang Dong-gun, Hiroyuki Sanada, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Yu Jinwei', 'PG-13', 'An orphaned girl, driven by poverty at such a young age, makes a promise with an enchantress. In return for beauty and the admiration of every man, she will never be with the man she loves. This spell cannot be broken unless the impossible happens: snow falling in spring and the dead coming back to life. Now a grown and beautiful princess, she regrets her promise, for all of the men she''s loved has always been met with tragedy.', 'An orphaned girl, driven by poverty at such a young age, makes a promise with an enchantress. In return for beauty and the admiration of every man, she will never be with the man she loves. This spell cannot be broken unless the impossible happens: snow falling in spring and the dead coming back to life. Now a grown and beautiful princess, she regrets her promise, for all of the men she''s loved has always been met with tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdm4mlc27S1d72ub4Y4xcU2OlDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2008'),
  ('740481318503935475', 'The Promise', 2016, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Terry George, Dídac Bono, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Robin Swicord, Terry George', 'Oscar Isaac, Charlotte Le Bon, Christian Bale, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Tom Hollander, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Rade Šerbedžija, Marwan Kenzari', 'PG-13', 'Set during the last days of the Ottoman Empire, a love triangle develops between Mikael, a brilliant medical student, the beautiful and sophisticated artist Ana, and Chris, a renowned American journalist based in Paris.', 'Set during the last days of the Ottoman Empire, a love triangle develops between Mikael, a brilliant medical student, the beautiful and sophisticated artist Ana, and Chris, a renowned American journalist based in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDWer2VFikupdqDc7d5sxCWZ3gW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354859'),
  ('48651173070366504', 'The Promise', 2017, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Siwawut Sewatanon, Niramon Ross, Sophon Sakdaphisit', 'Sopana Chaowwiwatkul, Sophon Sakdaphisit, Supalerk Ningsanond', 'Namthip Jongrachatawiboon, Ladapa Thongkham, Thunyaphat Phatrathinchaicherin, Panisara Rikulsurakan, Deuntem Salitul, Benjamin Joseph Varney, Suchada Poonpattanasuk, Surachai Ningsanont', null, 'Ib and Boum decide to commit suicide together in Bangkok in 1997. After reneging on the promise, the vengeful ghost of Ib returns 20 years later to haunt Boum and her 15 year old daughter, Bell.', 'Ib and Boum decide to commit suicide together in Bangkok in 1997. After reneging on the promise, the vengeful ghost of Ib returns 20 years later to haunt Boum and her 15 year old daughter, Bell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYJDjGUBvCtJFdlmna6EKgjNon0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470719'),
  ('1101929571793124532', 'The Promised Land', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Edward Kłosiński, Wacław Dybowski, Andrzej Wajda', 'Andrzej Wajda', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Wojciech Pszoniak, Andrzej Seweryn, Kalina Jędrusik, Anna Nehrebecka, Bożena Dykiel, Andrzej Szalawski, Stanisław Igar', null, 'In nineteenth-century Łódź, Poland, three friends want to make a lot of money by building and investing in a textile factory. An exceptional portrait of rapid industrial expansion is shown through the eyes of one Polish town.', 'In nineteenth-century Łódź, Poland, three friends want to make a lot of money by building and investing in a textile factory. An exceptional portrait of rapid industrial expansion is shown through the eyes of one Polish town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjk8K5MpQJX0XczTC2KOVWNj0lC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511'),
