  ('195347773104795388', 'The Propaganda Game', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Álvaro Longoria, Diego Dussuel, Rita Noriega', 'Álvaro Longoria', 'Kim Jong-un, Kim Jong-il, Kim Il-sung, Barack Obama, Harry S. Truman, Alejandro Cao de Benós', null, 'North Korea. The last communist country in the world. Unknown, hermetic and fascinating. Formerly known as “The Hermit Kingdom” for its attempts to remain isolated, North Korea is one of the largest sources of instability as regards world peace. It also has the most militarized border in the world, and the flow of impartial information, both going in and out, is practically non-existent. As the recent Sony-leaks has shown, it is the perfect setting for a propaganda war.', 'North Korea. The last communist country in the world. Unknown, hermetic and fascinating. Formerly known as “The Hermit Kingdom” for its attempts to remain isolated, North Korea is one of the largest sources of instability as regards world peace. It also has the most militarized border in the world, and the flow of impartial information, both going in and out, is practically non-existent. As the recent Sony-leaks has shown, it is the perfect setting for a propaganda war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDuEM9FHmRCmdrpQlkBacxLmxqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359746'),
  ('907371542604644471', 'The Property of Republic', 1972, 'Adventure, Crime, Action', 'Vladimir Bychkov, Aleksandr Filatov, Boris Monastyrsky', 'Avenir Zak, Isai Kuznetsov', 'Oleg Tabakov, Andrey Mironov, Spartak Mishulin, Yuriy Tolubeev, Viktor Galkin, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Igor Kvasha, Olga Zhizneva', null, 'Spring of 1918. Tarakanov, managing the estate of Prince Tikhvinsky, with the help of a former court fencing teacher Marquess and a street kid Keshka, is stealing a collection of paintings and sculptures from the abandoned estate owners. Hoping to transport her abroad, criminals wander with a circus troupe, and in their wake goes a tireless criminal investigator — Makar Ovchinnikov.', 'Spring of 1918. Tarakanov, managing the estate of Prince Tikhvinsky, with the help of a former court fencing teacher Marquess and a street kid Keshka, is stealing a collection of paintings and sculptures from the abandoned estate owners. Hoping to transport her abroad, criminals wander with a circus troupe, and in their wake goes a tireless criminal investigator — Makar Ovchinnikov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YCATNYlCVfbYX9xdGk8i3AVMsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65286'),
  ('504307285812744701', 'The Prophecy', 1995, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Gregory Widen, Richard Clabaugh, Bruce Douglas Johnson', 'Gregory Widen', 'Christopher Walken, Elias Koteas, Virginia Madsen, Eric Stoltz, Viggo Mortensen, Amanda Plummer, Moriah ''Shining Dove'' Snyder, Adam Goldberg', 'R', 'The angel Gabriel comes to Earth to collect a soul which will end the stalemated war in Heaven. However, it is hidden inside of a Native American girl and only a former priest and a schoolteacher can stop him.', 'The angel Gabriel comes to Earth to collect a soul which will end the stalemated war in Heaven. However, it is hidden inside of a Native American girl and only a former priest and a schoolteacher can stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZWFhQipzBHJze2llzCzhrSIZsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11980'),
  ('159662786954707542', 'The Prophecy 3: The Ascent', 2000, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Lussier, Nathan Hope', 'Carl V. Dupré, Joel Soisson', 'Christopher Walken, Kayren Butler, Vincent Spano, Dave Buzzotta, Steve Hytner, Brad Dourif, Hi Border, Moriah ''Shining Dove'' Snyder', 'R', 'As the War in Heaven and on Earth rages on, Pyriel, the Angel of Genocide, rises to power, intending to destroy all of mankind. The only one who stands in his way is street preacher Danyael, who was born of an Angel and a woman, the nephilim.', 'As the War in Heaven and on Earth rages on, Pyriel, the Angel of Genocide, rises to power, intending to destroy all of mankind. The only one who stands in his way is street preacher Danyael, who was born of an Angel and a woman, the nephilim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEqrwFt5xTsJozD2avYeprzYXVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9011'),
  ('853178034995349140', 'The Prophecy II', 1998, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Greg Spence, Richard Clabaugh', 'Matt Greenberg, Greg Spence', 'Christopher Walken, Russell Wong, Jennifer Beals, Brittany Murphy, Eric Roberts, Glenn Danzig, Steve Hytner, Bruce Abbott', 'R', 'The archangel Gabriel returns to try to destroy the human race he despises so much, with the help of a suicidal teen and the opposition of the angel Danyael.', 'The archangel Gabriel returns to try to destroy the human race he despises so much, with the help of a suicidal teen and the opposition of the angel Danyael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paHyRgF3uBMvK3i4YRjJ9wwFxbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9033'),
  ('859253219045203279', 'The Prophecy: Forsaken', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Joel Soisson, Gabriel Kosuth', null, 'Kari Wührer, Jason Scott Lee, Tony Todd, John Light, Daria Ciobanu, Georgia Nica, Nicu Constantin, Vasilescu Valentin', 'R', 'In Bucharest, theology student Allison is still protecting the mysterious Lexicon where the last chapter about the Antichrist could the win the stalemated war in heaven for either side. Meanwhile, the evil and jealous leader of the renegade angels, Stark, forces hit-man Dylan to kill Allison to get the information about the Antichrist, but Dylan begins to fall for her, protecting her at what cost?', 'In Bucharest, theology student Allison is still protecting the mysterious Lexicon where the last chapter about the Antichrist could the win the stalemated war in heaven for either side. Meanwhile, the evil and jealous leader of the renegade angels, Stark, forces hit-man Dylan to kill Allison to get the information about the Antichrist, but Dylan begins to fall for her, protecting her at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLZNBe0mow2xbarF3gQJum5PzvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37529'),
  ('26058067848122709', 'The Prophecy: Uprising', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Gabriel Kosuth, Joel Soisson', 'John Sullivan, Joel Soisson', 'Sean Pertwee, John Light, Kari Wührer, Doug Bradley, Dan Chiriac, Boris Petroff, Alin Cristea, Florinel Popescu', 'R', 'There exists an ancient manuscript still writing itself called the Lexicon. It supposedly tells of the coming of the Anti-Christ, and happens to fall into the hands of an unsuspecting woman. Now, she is being pursued by angels intent on obtaining the information from the book.', 'There exists an ancient manuscript still writing itself called the Lexicon. It supposedly tells of the coming of the Anti-Christ, and happens to fall into the hands of an unsuspecting woman. Now, she is being pursued by angels intent on obtaining the information from the book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWdpedZ4EtUQ8gcpc6WYGeqsy20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19564'),
  ('1079335784453094562', 'The Prophet', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Renzo Genta, Francesco Massaro', 'Ettore Scola, Ruggero Maccari', 'Vittorio Gassman, Ann-Margret, Oreste Lionello, Liana Orfei, Yvonne Sanson, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Enzo Robutti, Geoffrey Copleston', null, 'In this comedy, a guru’s groupie plans to seduce him so she can number him among her many conquests.', 'In this comedy, a guru’s groupie plans to seduce him so she can number him among her many conquests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jPsvsAziCgOVQF4h27532VaIcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186629'),
  ('675603851204219552', 'The Prophet of Hunger', 1970, 'Drama', 'Maurice Capovila, Hamilton Almeida', 'Maurice Capovila, Fernando Peixoto', 'José Mojica Marins, Maurício do Valle, Julia Miranda, Sérgio Hingst, Jofre Soares, Lenoir Bittencourt, Adauto Santos, Heladio Brito', null, 'The story of a fakir who works in a decadent circus. He and his colleagues do weirder numbers each day to attract audience, and warrant their survival. The numbers resemble a horror-show and they get marginalized. Through fable and allegory, reality turns stronger and stronger, and more absurd.', 'The story of a fakir who works in a decadent circus. He and his colleagues do weirder numbers each day to attract audience, and warrant their survival. The numbers resemble a horror-show and they get marginalized. Through fable and allegory, reality turns stronger and stronger, and more absurd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t09uJXHVaYRCz3g8697MDENhwZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195152'),
  ('1035707689988730362', 'The Proposal', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Mollie Stallman, David Utley, Raymond Prado', 'Peter Chiarelli', 'Sandra Bullock, Ryan Reynolds, Malin Åkerman, Craig T. Nelson, Mary Steenburgen, Betty White, Denis O''Hare, Oscar Nuñez', 'PG-13', 'When she learns she''s in danger of losing her visa status and being deported, overbearing book editor Margaret Tate forces her put-upon assistant, Andrew Paxton, to marry her.', 'When she learns she''s in danger of losing her visa status and being deported, overbearing book editor Margaret Tate forces her put-upon assistant, Andrew Paxton, to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6stnAm1wSek8ZrislwK4xGTyCnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18240'),
  ('164043699662146624', 'The Proposition', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lesli Linka Glatter, Peter Sova', 'Rick Ramage', 'Madeleine Stowe, Kenneth Branagh, William Hurt, Robert Loggia, Blythe Danner, Ken Cheeseman, Dee Nelson, Pamela Hart', 'R', 'Father Michael McKinnon goes from the UK to Boston circa 1935. For unknown reasons, he avoids at all costs the most prominent parishioners, Arthur and Eleanor Barret. Meanwhile Eleanor and Arthur desperately want to have a child, but Arthur is sterile, so they hire Harvard law student Roger Martin to impregnate Eleanor, but unfortunately Roger falls in love with her.', 'Father Michael McKinnon goes from the UK to Boston circa 1935. For unknown reasons, he avoids at all costs the most prominent parishioners, Arthur and Eleanor Barret. Meanwhile Eleanor and Arthur desperately want to have a child, but Arthur is sterile, so they hire Harvard law student Roger Martin to impregnate Eleanor, but unfortunately Roger falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIPmvZyWLHOTZgpPXgnKgO2pvM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32144'),
  ('928981222338115326', 'The Proposition', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Western', 'John Hillcoat, Benoît Delhomme, Peter McLennan', 'Nick Cave', 'Guy Pearce, Ray Winstone, Danny Huston, Emily Watson, David Wenham, Richard Wilson, John Hurt, Noah Taylor', 'R', 'In 1880s Australia, a lawman offers renegade Charlie Burns a difficult choice. In order to save his younger brother from the gallows, Charlie must hunt down and kill his older brother, who is wanted for rape and murder. Venturing into one of the Outback''s most inhospitable regions, Charlie faces a terrible moral dilemma that can end only in violence.', 'In 1880s Australia, a lawman offers renegade Charlie Burns a difficult choice. In order to save his younger brother from the gallows, Charlie must hunt down and kill his older brother, who is wanted for rape and murder. Venturing into one of the Outback''s most inhospitable regions, Charlie faces a terrible moral dilemma that can end only in violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbSHSJuO5XjrIKMh6QXXLTg3Yzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16608'),
  ('1117421458482961844', 'The Prosecutor', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Donnie Yen, Terry Ng Ka-Wai, Noah Wong Man-Nok', 'Edmond Wong Chi-Mun, Cheung Chun-Ho', 'Donnie Yen, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Michael Hui Koon-Man, Lau Kong, Mason Fung Ho-Yeung, MC Cheung', 'NR', 'A poor young man is wrongly charged with drug trafficking after being deceived. An ex-prosecutor investigates the case, uncovers a corrupt lawyer team''s scheme, and restores justice despite obstruction from evil forces.', 'A poor young man is wrongly charged with drug trafficking after being deceived. An ex-prosecutor investigates the case, uncovers a corrupt lawyer team''s scheme, and restores justice despite obstruction from evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3ZnFqp988MWfIkT8OHofEJfjlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128650'),
  ('923264452337608823', 'The Protagonists', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Luca Guadagnino, Paolo Bravi', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Tilda Swinton, Fabrizia Sacchi, Andrew Tiernan, Claudio Gioè, Paolo Briguglia, Michelle Hunziker, Jhelisa, Laura Betti', null, 'An Italian movie crew goes to London to make a documentary about a murder case that took place a few years before.', 'An Italian movie crew goes to London to make a documentary about a murder case that took place a few years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBMKYC4Wll1kRatN6emw0oxrO3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146140'),
  ('597220038358219742', 'The Protector', 1985, 'Action, Crime', 'James Glickenhaus, Cheung Yiu-Cho, Mark Irwin', 'James Glickenhaus, Edward Tang', 'Jackie Chan, Danny Aiello, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Roy Chiao, Peter Yang Kwan, Sally Yeh, Bill Wallace, Shum Wai', 'R', 'Billy Wong is a New York City cop whose partner is gunned down during a robbery. Billy and his new partner, Danny Garoni, are working security at a fashion show when a wealthy man''s daughter, Laura Shapiro, is kidnapped. The Federal authorities suspect that Laura''s father is involved with Mr. Ko, a Hong Kong drug kingpin, so the NYC police commissioner sends the two cops to Hong Kong to investigate.', 'Billy Wong is a New York City cop whose partner is gunned down during a robbery. Billy and his new partner, Danny Garoni, are working security at a fashion show when a wealthy man''s daughter, Laura Shapiro, is kidnapped. The Federal authorities suspect that Laura''s father is involved with Mr. Ko, a Hong Kong drug kingpin, so the NYC police commissioner sends the two cops to Hong Kong to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri2yctGQr4DPLBODZZ2Ky2yqBoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45408'),
  ('191516771433913448', 'The Protector', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Nattawut Kittikhun, Prachya Pinkaew', 'Joe Wannapin, Prachya Pinkaew, Piyaros Thongdee', 'Tony Jaa, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Bongkoj Khongmalai, Jin Xing, Nathan Jones, Johnny Tri Nguyen, Lateef Crowder, Jonathan Patrick Foo', 'R', 'A young fighter named Kham must go to Australia to retrieve his stolen elephant. With the help of a Thai-born Australian detective, Kham must take on all comers, including a gang led by an evil woman and her two deadly bodyguards.', 'A young fighter named Kham must go to Australia to retrieve his stolen elephant. With the help of a Thai-born Australian detective, Kham must take on all comers, including a gang led by an evil woman and her two deadly bodyguards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKE9BxgtT5g2pE3ZKC7MnzsAbTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8982'),
  ('671008513855550054', 'The Protector', 2006, 'Drama, Action', 'Chris R. Notarile', 'Chris R. Notarile', 'Tony Dadika, Brandon Slagle, Benjamin Toth, Andrew Finnerty, T.J. Glenn, Micah Watterson, Chris R. Notarile, Gregory DePetro', null, 'This is the story of a Golden Age superhero living in the Modern world. In his heyday, the Protector was greatest of all superheroes. But now, as an old man with a heart condition, this former hero is learning that even though his will might be strong, there are some things you can''t save from time.', 'This is the story of a Golden Age superhero living in the Modern world. In his heyday, the Protector was greatest of all superheroes. But now, as an old man with a heart condition, this former hero is learning that even though his will might be strong, there are some things you can''t save from time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDkOHcVXV9AURDGqxO80hCcr1Cj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121506'),
  ('700930186991952024', 'The Protector 2', 2013, 'Action', 'Prachya Pinkaew, Teerawat Rujintham', 'Eakasit Thairaat', 'Tony Jaa, RZA, Petchtai Wongkamlao, JeeJa Yanin, Marrese Crump, Rhatha Phongam, Kazu Patrick Tang, Pornchai Hongrattanaporn', 'R', 'Kham finds himself in trouble when he is accused of killing a trader. While on the run from the trader''s nieces who are martial artists, Kham meets a friend who warns him of a terrorist plot.', 'Kham finds himself in trouble when he is accused of killing a trader. While on the run from the trader''s nieces who are martial artists, Kham meets a friend who warns him of a terrorist plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYTnLRJcIbYZEN9vfYN93fm8l5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110552'),
  ('868430109018111477', 'The Protégé', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Tattersall, Martin Campbell', 'Richard Wenk', 'Maggie Q, Samuel L. Jackson, Michael Keaton, David Rintoul, Patrick Malahide, Ray Fearon, Ori Pfeffer, Robert Patrick', 'R', 'Rescued as a child by the legendary assassin Moody and trained in the family business, Anna is the world’s most skilled contract killer. When Moody, the man who was like a father to her and taught her everything she needs to know about trust and survival, is brutally killed, Anna vows revenge. As she becomes entangled with an enigmatic killer whose attraction to her goes way beyond cat and mouse, their confrontation turns deadly and the loose ends of a life spent killing will weave themselves ever tighter.', 'Rescued as a child by the legendary assassin Moody and trained in the family business, Anna is the world’s most skilled contract killer. When Moody, the man who was like a father to her and taught her everything she needs to know about trust and survival, is brutally killed, Anna vows revenge. As she becomes entangled with an enigmatic killer whose attraction to her goes way beyond cat and mouse, their confrontation turns deadly and the loose ends of a life spent killing will weave themselves ever tighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQUj7MptHUlcXpaMLrqRNZRxGA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645788'),
  ('828628132124887835', 'The Protos Experiment', 2025, 'Horror', 'Brian Avenet-Bradley, Laurence Avenet-Bradley', 'Simon Clark', 'Anja Akstin, Fred Thomas Jr., Ricky Herrera, Trista Robinson, Corey Landis', null, 'In a dystopian future, death row inmates are used like lab rats by a private company who use memory implants to revolutionise the correctional system. Two prisoners who become subject to the experiment must escape or risk losing their minds forever.', 'In a dystopian future, death row inmates are used like lab rats by a private company who use memory implants to revolutionise the correctional system. Two prisoners who become subject to the experiment must escape or risk losing their minds forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owfMEmeP7feba12nQi5juth5iGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365149'),
  ('587897401707452635', 'The Prototype', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Marcelo Grion, Pedro Castro, Michael King', 'Stephen Brown, Stephen Karandy', 'Victoria De Mare, Theresa Tilly, Mark Vasconcellos, Todd Stroik, Ken Belsky, Brittany Levinson, Juan Antonio Devoto', null, 'A government agent stumbles upon an alien conspiracy to conquer Earth. Using a blue liquid created by the aliens to make soldiers stronger, he becomes The Prototype-the only hope for mankind.', 'A government agent stumbles upon an alien conspiracy to conquer Earth. Using a blue liquid created by the aliens to make soldiers stronger, he becomes The Prototype-the only hope for mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGDDRopgIQhemPJ04eI0r0FfmIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425906'),
  ('648957295206803206', 'The Proud and Profane', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Seaton, John F. Warren', 'George Seaton', 'William Holden, Deborah Kerr, Thelma Ritter, Dewey Martin, William Redfield, Ross Bagdasarian, Adam Williams, Marion Ross', 'NR', 'In this romantic drama, beautiful Red Cross volunteer Lee Ashley arrives on the South Pacific island of New Caledonia to learn more about the circumstances surrounding the death of her husband, Howard, in the Battle of Guadalcanal. There, Ashley falls for the gruff, seductive Marine Lt. Col. Colin Buck, but struggle and tragedy follow when the widow learns about the reality of Buck''s life back home.', 'In this romantic drama, beautiful Red Cross volunteer Lee Ashley arrives on the South Pacific island of New Caledonia to learn more about the circumstances surrounding the death of her husband, Howard, in the Battle of Guadalcanal. There, Ashley falls for the gruff, seductive Marine Lt. Col. Colin Buck, but struggle and tragedy follow when the widow learns about the reality of Buck''s life back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SvgEGyjPUnydtbVwuCEPYmXTxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60525'),
  ('262307764522660438', 'The Proud and the Beautiful', 1953, 'Drama', 'Yves Allégret, Alex Phillips, Rafael E. Portas', 'Jean Aurenche', 'Michèle Morgan, Gérard Philipe, Víctor Manuel Mendoza, Carlos López Moctezuma, Michèle Cordoue, André Toffel, Arturo Soto Rangel, Josefina Escobedo', null, 'Life in a small Mexican village where joy and misery, hope and pain, passion and guilt, love and decay, life and death are mixed in the peasants life and two French citizens who end up stranded in there, during a typhoid epidemic.', 'Life in a small Mexican village where joy and misery, hope and pain, passion and guilt, love and decay, life and death are mixed in the peasants life and two French citizens who end up stranded in there, during a typhoid epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLLoXnEGTF0rQsqm3gJvOacQFAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65283'),
  ('264861947324450681', 'The Proud Family Movie', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, TV Movie', 'Bruce W. Smith', 'Ralph Farquhar, John Patrick White, Stiles White', 'Kyla Pratt, Tommy Davidson, Paula Jai Parker, Jo Marie Payton, Orlando Brown, Soleil Moon Frye, Alisa Reyes, Karen Malina White', 'G', 'Penny and her family are lured on an all expenses paid vacation where a mad scientist captures them, refusing to let them go because Oscar won''t reveal his on of his secret Proud Snacks formulas.', 'Penny and her family are lured on an all expenses paid vacation where a mad scientist captures them, refusing to let them go because Oscar won''t reveal his on of his secret Proud Snacks formulas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzq3cG9h5NTjXoCkMFgy0sZtSlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61728'),
  ('1132231833291545284', 'The Proud Ones', 1956, 'Western', 'Robert D. Webb, Lucien Ballard, Ad Schaumer', 'Joseph Petracca, Edmund H. North', 'Robert Ryan, Virginia Mayo, Jeffrey Hunter, Robert Middleton, Walter Brennan, Arthur O''Connell, Rodolfo Acosta, Ken Clark', 'NR', 'Robert Ryan plays an aging sheriff responsible for law and order in a frontier cattle town. Virginia Mayo plays his fiancee. As if handling wild cattle drovers isn''t enough, a crooked casino operator from Ryan''s past comes to town. An early scuffle in the casino leaves Ryan with vision problems that interfere with his duties. Jeffrey Hunter who came to town with a cattle drive encounters Ryan, who killed Hunter''s father when Hunter was young. Feelings of animosity soon change as Hunter begins to sense Ryan is telling the truth about his father. What follows is a plot that continues to thicken to the inevitable showdown.', 'Robert Ryan plays an aging sheriff responsible for law and order in a frontier cattle town. Virginia Mayo plays his fiancee. As if handling wild cattle drovers isn''t enough, a crooked casino operator from Ryan''s past comes to town. An early scuffle in the casino leaves Ryan with vision problems that interfere with his duties. Jeffrey Hunter who came to town with a cattle drive encounters Ryan, who killed Hunter''s father when Hunter was young. Feelings of animosity soon change as Hunter begins to sense Ryan is telling the truth about his father. What follows is a plot that continues to thicken to the inevitable showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLmmAfWiCf4XSov9YYtzEsuh95W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107625'),
  ('384109590241165925', 'The Proud Princess', 1952, 'Family, Comedy', 'Bořivoj Zeman, Milan Vácha, Jan Roth', 'Henryk Bloch, Bořivoj Zeman, Oldřich Kautský', 'Alena Vránová, Vladimír Ráž, Stanislav Neumann, Mária Sýkorová, Jaroslav Seník, Miloš Kopecký, Oldřich Dědek, Karel Effa', null, 'It''s very human and nice story about lofty princess (her father is amiable but incapable - unforgettable performance of S. Neumann) and good, nice, kind and well-principled young king (prince) who tries to make tender her calm heart to get married with her. After being refused (she''s very capricious), he conclude to make her better. He start to work as a gardener at her castle (in secret) and successively bring she to her senses...The story continues when already reformed princess and the young king (she learn about his real identity later) have to take refuge from troops, that princess father (old king) has sent (of course he took a bad and mean counsellors advice). They have to take shelter by several ordinary and poor families, which are always very friendly and give them a help... Of course the tale has happy end.', 'It''s very human and nice story about lofty princess (her father is amiable but incapable - unforgettable performance of S. Neumann) and good, nice, kind and well-principled young king (prince) who tries to make tender her calm heart to get married with her. After being refused (she''s very capricious), he conclude to make her better. He start to work as a gardener at her castle (in secret) and successively bring she to her senses...The story continues when already reformed princess and the young king (she learn about his real identity later) have to take refuge from troops, that princess father (old king) has sent (of course he took a bad and mean counsellors advice). They have to take shelter by several ordinary and poor families, which are always very friendly and give them a help... Of course the tale has happy end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUPcxVcNxbiytMV75XTFjA3K1H7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41228'),
  ('1023084061559680557', 'The Proud Rebel', 1958, 'Western, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Ted D. McCord', 'Lillie Hayward, Joseph Petracca', 'Alan Ladd, Olivia de Havilland, Dean Jagger, David Ladd, Cecil Kellaway, Harry Dean Stanton, Tom Pittman, Henry Hull', 'PG', 'Searching for a doctor who can help him get his son to speak again--the boy hadn''t uttered a word since he saw his mother die in the fire that burned down the family home--a Confederate veteran finds himself facing a 30-day jail sentence when he''s unfairly accused of starting a brawl in a small town. A local woman pays his fine, providing that he works it off on her ranch. He soon finds himself involved in the woman''s struggle to keep her ranch from a local landowner who wants it--and whose sons were responsible for the man being framed for the fight.', 'Searching for a doctor who can help him get his son to speak again--the boy hadn''t uttered a word since he saw his mother die in the fire that burned down the family home--a Confederate veteran finds himself facing a 30-day jail sentence when he''s unfairly accused of starting a brawl in a small town. A local woman pays his fine, providing that he works it off on her ranch. He soon finds himself involved in the woman''s struggle to keep her ranch from a local landowner who wants it--and whose sons were responsible for the man being framed for the fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Q94ZpugICOlgqLLR0TmoH05uuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88431'),
