  ('57314037330728969', 'The Proud Valley', 1940, 'Drama', 'Pen Tennyson, L. C. Rudkin', 'Pen Tennyson, Louis Golding', 'Paul Robeson, Rachel Thomas, Edward Chapman, Simon Lack, Dilys Thomas, Edward Rigby, Janet Johnson, Dilys Davies', null, 'In a Welsh coal mining valley, a young man with a beautiful singing voice is called upon to make the ultimate sacrifice when a pit disaster threatens.', 'In a Welsh coal mining valley, a young man with a beautiful singing voice is called upon to make the ultimate sacrifice when a pit disaster threatens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1aABDgzG5Ew5X05dGI3th49t0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87060'),
