  ('868309298138751588', 'The Psychotronic Man', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jack M. Sell', 'Peter Spelson, Jack M. Sell', 'Peter Spelson, Chris Carbis, Curt Colbert, Robin Newton, Jeff Caliendo, Lindsey Novak, Irwin Lewin, Corney Morgan', 'PG', 'A man discovers that he has psychotronic powers--the ability to will people to die. He begins exercising that power.', 'A man discovers that he has psychotronic powers--the ability to will people to die. He begins exercising that power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld6Mnu8mOm6IMKdVPR9o7HPCeQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100662'),
  ('130847202290312386', 'The Public', 2019, 'Drama', 'Juan Miguel Azpiroz, Emilio Estevez', 'Emilio Estevez', 'Alec Baldwin, Taylor Schilling, Emilio Estevez, Jena Malone, Christian Slater, Jacob Vargas, Gabrielle Union, Derek Polen', 'PG-13', 'An act of civil disobedience turns into a standoff with police when homeless people in Cincinnati take over the public library to seek shelter from the bitter cold.', 'An act of civil disobedience turns into a standoff with police when homeless people in Cincinnati take over the public library to seek shelter from the bitter cold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WVIjVrGvV6yNQNhKUuZhWveHTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331986'),
  ('644701952790372157', 'The Public Enemy', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'William A. Wellman, Devereaux Jennings', 'John Bright, Kubec Glasmon', 'James Cagney, Jean Harlow, Edward Woods, Joan Blondell, Donald Cook, Leslie Fenton, Beryl Mercer, Robert Emmett O''Connor', 'NR', 'Two young Chicago hoodlums, Tom Powers and Matt Doyle, rise up from their poverty-stricken slum life to become petty thieves, bootleggers and cold-blooded killers. But with street notoriety and newfound wealth, the duo feels the heat from the cops and rival gangsters both. Despite his ruthless criminal reputation, Tom tries to remain connected to his family, however, gang warfare and the need for revenge eventually pull him away.', 'Two young Chicago hoodlums, Tom Powers and Matt Doyle, rise up from their poverty-stricken slum life to become petty thieves, bootleggers and cold-blooded killers. But with street notoriety and newfound wealth, the duo feels the heat from the cops and rival gangsters both. Despite his ruthless criminal reputation, Tom tries to remain connected to his family, however, gang warfare and the need for revenge eventually pull him away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVxdaRMprQO2DM4AFyJ6C4qZSFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17687'),
