  ('31922170781846407', 'The Public Pays', 1936, 'Crime, Drama', 'Errol Taggart', 'John C. Higgins', 'Richard Alexander, Barbara Bedford, Harry C. Bradley, Russ Clark, Betty Ross Clarke, John Dilson, Bess Flowers, Karl Hackett', null, 'In this MGM Crime Does Not Pay series short, a protection racket preying on milk distribution is broken through the persistence of law enforcement and the courage of a local businessman.', 'In this MGM Crime Does Not Pay series short, a protection racket preying on milk distribution is broken through the persistence of law enforcement and the courage of a local businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ak1z5XE3laKmR0cENLcUgPShXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130386'),
  ('221593691735049705', 'The Public Voice', 1988, 'Animation', 'Lejf Marcussen, Hasse Christensen, Lejf Marcussen', 'Lejf Marcussen', null, null, 'A short Surrealist animation from Denmark which begins with a zoom into a Paul Delvaux painting, then reverses the process by pulling back from a continually changing picture.', 'A short Surrealist animation from Denmark which begins with a zoom into a Paul Delvaux painting, then reverses the process by pulling back from a continually changing picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWHK7y2l51rp8QR2spwShXzQGot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240641'),
  ('130623955375798411', 'The Public Woman', 1984, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Sacha Vierny', 'Dominique Garnier, Andrzej Żuławski', 'Valérie Kaprisky, Francis Huster, Lambert Wilson, Patrick Bauchau, Gisèle Pascal, Roger Dumas, Diane Delor, Jean-Paul Farré', null, 'An inexperienced young actress is invited to play a role in a film based on Dostoyevsky''s ''The Possessed''. The film director, a Czech immigrant in Paris, takes over her life, and in a short time she is unable to draw the line between acting and reality. She winds up playing a real-life role posing as the dead wife of another Czech immigrant, who is manipulated by the filmmaker into commiting a political assassination.', 'An inexperienced young actress is invited to play a role in a film based on Dostoyevsky''s ''The Possessed''. The film director, a Czech immigrant in Paris, takes over her life, and in a short time she is unable to draw the line between acting and reality. She winds up playing a real-life role posing as the dead wife of another Czech immigrant, who is manipulated by the filmmaker into commiting a political assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MXaIoOKGfxanGqxgrLgv0OtV39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70410'),
  ('293987147708638905', 'The Pubs', 2021, 'Romance', null, null, 'Yoon Yool, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo, Ji Hee, Kenny', null, 'Eun-ah (Yoon-yul) and Hee-jeong (Ji-hee) are working together at an izakaya bar. The owner of the izakaya has a crush on Eun-ah, her charming girl, and makes her secret proposal, and Hee-jeong, who reveals her man too much, has a crush on George, a frequent foreign guest… Will these two be able to continue their business smoothly?!', 'Eun-ah (Yoon-yul) and Hee-jeong (Ji-hee) are working together at an izakaya bar. The owner of the izakaya has a crush on Eun-ah, her charming girl, and makes her secret proposal, and Hee-jeong, who reveals her man too much, has a crush on George, a frequent foreign guest… Will these two be able to continue their business smoothly?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqfprRSQIAIeModlwdfezeaagVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1240815'),
  ('668595085616264072', 'The Puffy Chair', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jay Duplass', 'Mark Duplass, Jay Duplass', 'Mark Duplass, Katie Aselton, Rhett Wilkins, Julie Fischer, Larry Duplass, Bari Hyman, Gerald Finnegan, Henry Barendse', 'R', 'Josh, a struggling musician, wins a vintage recliner in an eBay auction. Since he lives in New York and the chair is in Atlanta, this poses a bit of a problem. He asks his girlfriend, Emily, to accompany him on the trip, and his hippie brother Rhett joins the pair along the way.', 'Josh, a struggling musician, wins a vintage recliner in an eBay auction. Since he lives in New York and the chair is in Atlanta, this poses a bit of a problem. He asks his girlfriend, Emily, to accompany him on the trip, and his hippie brother Rhett joins the pair along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fybmkedrXx02p7i6TZMl9sC5NvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24055'),
  ('291741122257976349', 'The Pumpkin Eater', 1964, 'Drama', 'Jack Clayton, Oswald Morris', 'Harold Pinter', 'Anne Bancroft, Peter Finch, James Mason, Janine Gray, Cedric Hardwicke, Rosalind Atkinson, Alan Webb, Richard Johnson', null, 'Jo, the mother of seven children, divorces her second husband in order to marry Jake, a successful but promiscuous screenwriter. Though they are physically and emotionally compatible, they are slowly torn apart.', 'Jo, the mother of seven children, divorces her second husband in order to marry Jake, a successful but promiscuous screenwriter. Though they are physically and emotionally compatible, they are slowly torn apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5llEDfwte6SnAd2grP065N95yeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69557'),
  ('605108354058744469', 'The Pumpkin Karver', 2006, 'Horror', 'Robert Mann, Sheldon Silverstein', 'Robert Mann, Sheldon Silverstein', 'Amy Weber, Minka Kelly, Charity Shea, Amy Cowieson, Briana Gerber, Rachelle Clune, Lindsey Carpenter, Mistie Adams', 'R', 'After mistaking him for a masked killer, Jonathan fatally stabbed his sister''s boyfriend on Halloween. One year later to the day, the siblings find themselves fighting for their lives against a very familiar masked murderer.', 'After mistaking him for a masked killer, Jonathan fatally stabbed his sister''s boyfriend on Halloween. One year later to the day, the siblings find themselves fighting for their lives against a very familiar masked murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd173De2ujrhD3O30SzL30oVc9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45052'),
  ('198088319566556633', 'The Pumpkin Race', 1908, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Animation', 'Romeo Bosetti', null, null, null, 'Early slapstick short from Louis Feuillade involving runaways, except that, instead of it being a runaway horse (see Griffith''s THE CURTAIN POLE for an example), it is a cartful of what appear to be hundred-pound pumpkins that get away, rushing hither and yon, down sewers, up chimneys, pursued by the drayer, a couple of other people and a very unwilling donkey.', 'Early slapstick short from Louis Feuillade involving runaways, except that, instead of it being a runaway horse (see Griffith''s THE CURTAIN POLE for an example), it is a cartful of what appear to be hundred-pound pumpkins that get away, rushing hither and yon, down sewers, up chimneys, pursued by the drayer, a couple of other people and a very unwilling donkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAJmitXcNpu6Ql7Rb9zLPcCmyPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196532'),
  ('1120649649005724832', 'The Punch and Judy Man', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Summers, Gilbert Taylor', 'Phillip Oakes, Tony Hancock', 'Tony Hancock, Sylvia Syms, Ronald Fraser, Barbara Murray, John Le Mesurier, Eddie Byrne, Mario Fabrizi, Hattie Jacques', null, 'Walter Pinner is the titular Punch And Judy Man plying his trade in the seaside town of Piltdown. Unhappily married to his social climbing wife, who gets him to perform at the 60th Anniversary celebrations of the town in front of all the local dignitaries, his hatred of snobbery comes to a hilarious head.', 'Walter Pinner is the titular Punch And Judy Man plying his trade in the seaside town of Piltdown. Unhappily married to his social climbing wife, who gets him to perform at the 60th Anniversary celebrations of the town in front of all the local dignitaries, his hatred of snobbery comes to a hilarious head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUIAg4tyaoRvbObfYRuJR3AGHHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137375'),
  ('735841842265440996', 'The Punch Bowl', 1944, 'Comedy, Family', 'Helmut Weiss, Ewald Daub', 'Heinrich Spoerl', 'Heinz Rühmann, Karin Himboldt, Hilde Sessak, Erich Ponto, Paul Henckels, Hans Leibelt, Lutz Götz, Hans Richter', null, 'Writer Johannes Pfeiffer who goes undercover as a student in a high school after his friends told him that he missed out on a great life experience since he was home schooled.', 'Writer Johannes Pfeiffer who goes undercover as a student in a high school after his friends told him that he missed out on a great life experience since he was home schooled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPklnEcziGaLCetKtLSwEJrecBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878'),
  ('236515577298981136', 'The Punisher', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Mark Goldblatt, Ian Baker', 'Boaz Yakin', 'Dolph Lundgren, Louis Gossett Jr., Jeroen Krabbé, Kim Miyori, Bryan Marshall, Nancy Everhard, Barry Otto, Brian Rooney', 'R', 'The avenging angel of Marvel Comics fame comes brilliantly to life in this searing action-adventure thriller! Dolph Lundgren stars as Frank Castle, a veteran cop who loses his entire family to a mafia car bomb. His ex-partner believes Castle survived the blast and became the Punisher, living in the sewers and exacting vigilante violence against mob bosses throughout the city. When the populace is caught in the midst of a gang war that he caused, Castle must again emerge from the shadows and save the innocent.', 'The avenging angel of Marvel Comics fame comes brilliantly to life in this searing action-adventure thriller! Dolph Lundgren stars as Frank Castle, a veteran cop who loses his entire family to a mafia car bomb. His ex-partner believes Castle survived the blast and became the Punisher, living in the sewers and exacting vigilante violence against mob bosses throughout the city. When the populace is caught in the midst of a gang war that he caused, Castle must again emerge from the shadows and save the innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tA0O0hYyHX7Hl2Fl8VEtGtfBtjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8867'),
