  ('1077402085291853939', 'The Pyjama Girl Case', 1977, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Flavio Mogherini, Carlo Carlini', 'Flavio Mogherini, Rafael Sánchez Campoy', 'Ray Milland, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Michele Placido, Mel Ferrer, Howard Ross, Ramiro Oliveros, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Antonio Ferrandis', null, 'Two seemingly separate stories in New South Wales: a burned, murdered body of a young woman is found on the beach, and a retired inspector makes inquiries; also, Linda, a waitress and ferry attendant, has several lovers and marries one, but continues seeing the others. The police have a suspect in the murder, but the retired inspector is convinced they''re wrong; he continues a methodical investigation. Linda and her husband separate, and there are complications. Will the stories cross or are they already twisted together?', 'Two seemingly separate stories in New South Wales: a burned, murdered body of a young woman is found on the beach, and a retired inspector makes inquiries; also, Linda, a waitress and ferry attendant, has several lovers and marries one, but continues seeing the others. The police have a suspect in the murder, but the retired inspector is convinced they''re wrong; he continues a methodical investigation. Linda and her husband separate, and there are complications. Will the stories cross or are they already twisted together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dlUKHP94rorboEGH2JWll3zo1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61540'),
