  ('59241480550838763', 'The Quack', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jerzy Hoffman, Jerzy Gościk', 'Jacek Fuksiewicz, Jerzy Hoffman', 'Jerzy Bińczycki, Anna Dymna, Tomasz Stockinger, Bernard Ładysz, Artur Barciś, Andrzej Kopiczyński, Piotr Grabowski, Bożena Dykiel', null, 'A famous surgeon is beaten by drunken bullies, loses his memory and cannot recollect who he was before. He gets to a village, lives in a not so well to do family and becomes the Quack - he slowly regains his talent for medicine and saves the lives of several village patients.', 'A famous surgeon is beaten by drunken bullies, loses his memory and cannot recollect who he was before. He gets to a village, lives in a not so well to do family and becomes the Quack - he slowly regains his talent for medicine and saves the lives of several village patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiwWNWR18UOtKhn5YO7eu0qoCcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68797'),
