  ('1008028104166877154', 'The Quantum Devil', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Larry Wade Carrell', 'Larry Wade Carrell, Stephen Johnston, Woody Keith', 'Neil Dickson, Tyler Tackett, Ariadna Cabrol, Edward Apeagyei, Tamara Radovanović, Mehmet Cerrahoglu, Helen Babic, Marcus Jean Pirae', null, 'A team of scientists face dangerous consequences after they conduct a clandestine experiment to breach the quantum barrier and travel to another dimension.', 'A team of scientists face dangerous consequences after they conduct a clandestine experiment to breach the quantum barrier and travel to another dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h5RRFhIJyiM8VVr0xPkjpskA9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951996'),
  ('724952093072153294', 'The Quare Fellow', 1962, 'Drama', 'Arthur Dreifuss, Peter Hennessy', 'Arthur Dreifuss', 'Patrick McGoohan, Sylvia Syms, Walter Macken, Dermot Kelly, Jack Cunningham, Hilton Edwards, Philip O''Flynn, Leo McCabe', null, 'Thomas Crimmins is a new warder, or guard, in an Irish prison. He is young, naive, and idealistic, determined to serve his country by his part in meting out justice to criminals. His superior, Regan, however, realizes that even prisoners are human beings, and Regan is sick of the eye-for-an-eye attitude that leads the state to execute condemned men, or "quare fellows." Crimmins begins to see that not all is black and white in his new world, and when he becomes involved with Kathleen, the wife of one of the condemned men, his attitude begins to change. When new evidence arises to suggest that Kathleen''s husband may not deserve his fate, Crimmins is torn between his duty and his humanity.', 'Thomas Crimmins is a new warder, or guard, in an Irish prison. He is young, naive, and idealistic, determined to serve his country by his part in meting out justice to criminals. His superior, Regan, however, realizes that even prisoners are human beings, and Regan is sick of the eye-for-an-eye attitude that leads the state to execute condemned men, or "quare fellows." Crimmins begins to see that not all is black and white in his new world, and when he becomes involved with Kathleen, the wife of one of the condemned men, his attitude begins to change. When new evidence arises to suggest that Kathleen''s husband may not deserve his fate, Crimmins is torn between his duty and his humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUOePJEJBoNIVEpJZ9JGaTWwsi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185147'),
  ('149052501141225956', 'The Quarry', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Scott Teems, Michael Alden Lloyd, Andrew Shepherd', 'Andrew Brotzman, Scott Teems', 'Shea Whigham, Michael Shannon, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Bobby Soto, Bruno Bichir, Jimmy Gonzáles, Abel Becerra, Rose Bianco', 'R', 'A man on the run from his own sins, finds himself in a small border town in Texas, impersonating a reverend. The town are quickly drawn to the man''s unorthodox sermons, but so is a police chief who has his suspicions.', 'A man on the run from his own sins, finds himself in a small border town in Texas, impersonating a reverend. The town are quickly drawn to the man''s unorthodox sermons, but so is a police chief who has his suspicions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sxN5XRWPXes5gg2E9sGRTkhMAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598215'),
  ('30383314459792658', 'The Quartet', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fábio Barreto, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Antônio Calmon, Leopoldo Serran', 'Glória Pires, Patricia Pillar, Alexandre Paternost, Bruno Campos, Gianfrancesco Guarnieri, José Lewgoy, Cecil Thiré, Cláudio Mamberti', null, 'The story of two immigrant couples: Teresa and Angelo; Pierina and Massimo. While fighting for survival in the new world, the unexpected love of Massimo and Teresa appears. They react against family and cultural traditions and leave to a new destiny, leaving their partners. Quatrilho is the name of a card game in wich the player have to betray his partner in order to become the champion.', 'The story of two immigrant couples: Teresa and Angelo; Pierina and Massimo. While fighting for survival in the new world, the unexpected love of Massimo and Teresa appears. They react against family and cultural traditions and leave to a new destiny, leaving their partners. Quatrilho is the name of a card game in wich the player have to betray his partner in order to become the champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjv1uWeDGTIezdvF0b6hsbbXTi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67617'),
  ('1043010951911828032', 'The Quatermass Xperiment', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Val Guest, Walter J. Harvey, Bill Shore', 'Val Guest, Richard H. Landau', 'Brian Donlevy, Richard Wordsworth, David King-Wood, Jack Warner, Margia Dean, Maurice Kaufmann, John Wynn, Harold Lang', null, 'The first manned spacecraft, fired from an English launchpad, is first lost from radar, then roars back to Earth and crashes in a farmer''s field, and is found to contain only one of the three men who took off in it; and he is unable to talk but appears to be undergoing a torturous physical and mental metamorphosis.', 'The first manned spacecraft, fired from an English launchpad, is first lost from radar, then roars back to Earth and crashes in a farmer''s field, and is found to contain only one of the three men who took off in it; and he is unable to talk but appears to be undergoing a torturous physical and mental metamorphosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm6cQiUjJ0AUUqESI9WWM7veIbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24580'),
  ('71443087896417349', 'The Queen', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Frank Simon, Robert Elfstrom, Frank Simon', null, 'Jack Doroshow, Bernard Giquel, Mario Montez, Crystal LaBeija, Rachel Harlow, Andy Warhol, Edie Sedgwick, Jim Dine', 'NR', 'In 1967, New York City is host to the Miss All-American Camp Beauty Pageant. This documentary takes a look behind the scenes, transporting the viewer into rehearsals and dressing rooms as the drag queen subculture prepares for this big national beauty contest. Jack/Sabrina is the mistress of ceremonies, and their protégé, Miss Harlow, is in the competition. But, as the pageant approaches, the glamorous contestants veer from camaraderie to tension.', 'In 1967, New York City is host to the Miss All-American Camp Beauty Pageant. This documentary takes a look behind the scenes, transporting the viewer into rehearsals and dressing rooms as the drag queen subculture prepares for this big national beauty contest. Jack/Sabrina is the mistress of ceremonies, and their protégé, Miss Harlow, is in the competition. But, as the pageant approaches, the glamorous contestants veer from camaraderie to tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enAf3MycnyeWFhgz8TOos9NvH4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42649'),
  ('740036288707425564', 'The Queen', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Stephen Frears, Affonso Beato, Peter Wenham', 'Peter Morgan', 'Helen Mirren, Michael Sheen, James Cromwell, Helen McCrory, Alex Jennings, Roger Allam, Sylvia Syms, Paul Barrett', 'PG-13', 'The Queen is an intimate behind the scenes glimpse at the interaction between HM Elizabeth II and Prime Minister Tony Blair during their struggle, following the death of Diana, to reach a compromise between what was a private tragedy for the Royal family and the public''s demand for an overt display of mourning.', 'The Queen is an intimate behind the scenes glimpse at the interaction between HM Elizabeth II and Prime Minister Tony Blair during their struggle, following the death of Diana, to reach a compromise between what was a private tragedy for the Royal family and the public''s demand for an overt display of mourning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v08RH5Cx9EFAQMBWQuE5jHAgHYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1165'),
  ('354940264457352913', 'The Queen of Basketball', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Ben Proudfoot', null, 'Lusia Harris', null, 'Part of the Almost Famous series. She was arguably the greatest women''s basketball player. She won three national trophies; she played in the ’76 Olympics; she was drafted to the NBA. But have you ever heard of Lucy Harris?', 'Part of the Almost Famous series. She was arguably the greatest women''s basketball player. She won three national trophies; she played in the ’76 Olympics; she was drafted to the NBA. But have you ever heard of Lucy Harris?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RjXNAvpH4SsBkEDRsCrEXxOcnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822582'),
  ('342606259250792468', 'The Queen of Black Magic', 1981, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'H. Asmawi, Lilik Sudjio', 'Imam Tantowi', 'Suzzanna, Alan Nuary, Teddy Purba, W.D. Mochtar, Sofia W.D., Siska Widowati, Dorman Borisman, Doddy Sukma', null, 'A woman is seduced by and cast aside by a fickle lover. When the lover marries another woman who starts hallucinating during their wedding, she is accused of being a witch and thrown to her death over a cliff. A strange man rescues her, nurses her back to health, and is told that she must master black magic in order to exact vengeance on her tormentors. She casts a variety of spells over the populace--with the male population as her favorite target, and becomes the queen of black magic. But who, exactly, is the man, and does he have other plans?', 'A woman is seduced by and cast aside by a fickle lover. When the lover marries another woman who starts hallucinating during their wedding, she is accused of being a witch and thrown to her death over a cliff. A strange man rescues her, nurses her back to health, and is told that she must master black magic in order to exact vengeance on her tormentors. She casts a variety of spells over the populace--with the male population as her favorite target, and becomes the queen of black magic. But who, exactly, is the man, and does he have other plans?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9A3ddtR9B7LppWAV7Q7TZtjRgU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40031'),
  ('91550071665547516', 'The Queen of Black Magic', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kimo Stamboel, Fajar Yuskemal, Patrick Tashadian', 'Joko Anwar', 'Hannah Al Rashid, Ario Bayu, Adhisty Zara, Ari Irham, Shenina Cinnamon, Imelda Therinne, Muzakki Ramdhan, Giulio Parengkuan', null, 'Revisiting the orphanage where they grew up, three men and their families discover a horrific supernatural presence lingering in their former home.', 'Revisiting the orphanage where they grew up, three men and their families discover a horrific supernatural presence lingering in their former home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQOBVQjXiBGstCGYvzmgm97EkMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590593'),
  ('925832760747201503', 'The Queen of Clubs', 2010, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jérôme Bonnell, Pascal Lagriffoul, Simon Rooke', 'Jérôme Bonnell', 'Florence Loiret Caille, Malik Zidi, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Nathalie Boutefeu, Marc Citti, Marc Barbé, Sébastien Pouderoux, Brice Cousin', null, 'Aurélien and Argine have never been able to leave each other. Brother and sister, they have always lived together. Aurélien secretly makes ends meet for them by dealing in stolen metal. One night, his accomplice Simon suddenly arrives.', 'Aurélien and Argine have never been able to leave each other. Brother and sister, they have always lived together. Aurélien secretly makes ends meet for them by dealing in stolen metal. One night, his accomplice Simon suddenly arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7rzomC19YPawjRgQXSUAF5R9Uk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72271'),
  ('216562159588660442', 'The Queen of Crime', 2016, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Lee Yo-sup, Lee Hyo-jae, Lim Byeong-woo', 'Lee Yo-sup', 'Park Ji-young, Jo Bok-rae, Kim Dae-hyun, Heo Jeong-do, Baek Soo-jang, Esom, Lee Sung-wook, Oh Chang-kyung', null, 'When her son who lives in a single room is given an outrageous $1,000 water bill, a mother decides to become a detective and find out what is behind it.', 'When her son who lives in a single room is given an outrageous $1,000 water bill, a mother decides to become a detective and find out what is behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMKt4qoeHT122bQglBbyTHDpzGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413740'),
  ('1083028573364844542', 'The Queen of Hearts', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Valérie Donzelli, Céline Bozon, Claire Mathon', 'Valérie Donzelli, Dorothée Sebbagh, Jérémie Elkaïm', 'Valérie Donzelli, Jérémie Elkaïm, Béatrice de Staël, Laure Marsac, Vanessa Seward, Gilles Marchand, Dominik Moll, Benoît Carré', null, 'In this musical take on everyday life, Adele is devastated after a painful breakup. Her distant cousin, Rachel, finds her a job and suggests that Adele sleep with other men to get over her heartbreak. The search begins, but Adele can’t escape the visage of her former lover….', 'In this musical take on everyday life, Adele is devastated after a painful breakup. Her distant cousin, Rachel, finds her a job and suggests that Adele sleep with other men to get over her heartbreak. The search begins, but Adele can’t escape the visage of her former lover….', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5w9FrkgS20YsEhZGEmoUZPPEkoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53988'),
  ('781212048521877266', 'The Queen of Spades', 1949, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Thorold Dickinson, Louis Levy, Otto Heller', 'Rodney Ackland, Arthur Boys', 'Anton Walbrook, Edith Evans, Yvonne Mitchell, Ronald Howard, Mary Jerrold, Anthony Dawson, Miles Malleson, Michael Medwin', 'NR', 'A czarist captain stops at nothing to learn the secrets of a countess rumored to have sold her soul to the devil in order to always win at cards.', 'A czarist captain stops at nothing to learn the secrets of a countess rumored to have sold her soul to the devil in order to always win at cards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aro69lxeXWZN0mKy5DYtFcfx2cX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77546'),
  ('70051332151591253', 'The Queen of Spain', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Trueba, José Luis Alcaine, Sara Mazkiarán', 'Fernando Trueba', 'Penélope Cruz, Antonio Resines, Neus Asensi, Cary Elwes, Mandy Patinkin, Javier Cámara, Clive Revill, Santiago Segura', null, 'After her experiences in Nazi Germany, actress Macarena Granada traveled to Hollywood, where she became a star. In the 1950s, the diva returns to Francoist Spain to star a Hollywood blockbuster about Queen Isabella I of Castile. (A sequel to The Girl of Your Dreams, 1998.)', 'After her experiences in Nazi Germany, actress Macarena Granada traveled to Hollywood, where she became a star. In the 1950s, the diva returns to Francoist Spain to star a Hollywood blockbuster about Queen Isabella I of Castile. (A sequel to The Girl of Your Dreams, 1998.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dPUXLTRn0B68CfXqniTeUdH9jF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401252'),
  ('635563633266143330', 'The Queen of the Lizards', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Burnin'' Percebes, Nando Martínez, Juan González', 'Nando Martínez, Juan González', 'Bruna Cusí, Javier Botet, Miki Esparbé, Ivan Labanda, Al Sarcoli, Roger Coma, Margot Sánchez', null, 'A spaceship is about to come to pick up Javi, so him and Berta have to put an end to their summer love.', 'A spaceship is about to come to pick up Javi, so him and Berta have to put an end to their summer love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQ9aRwvhjYqGdjEuQ2GagskDoHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649072'),
  ('418771349100241236', 'The Queen of the Night', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Arturo Ripstein, René Villareal, Sergio Muñoz', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Alberto Estrella, Blanca Guerra, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Alex Cox, Arturo Alegro, Alejandra Montoya, Marta Aura', null, 'The legendary life of Mexican singer Lucha Reyes is the basis of this fictionalized biography ( or as director Arturo Ripstein puts it "an imaginary biography"). Lucha Reyes was an unconventional, and sexually liberated woman, most famous for her "cancion ranchera" style singing. Her story begins in 1939, where at 33 she still lived at home with her mother, Dona Victora, the madame of a renowned Mexico City whorehouse. Lucha marries the liberal Pedro Calderon and then buys a beggar''s daughter. She becomes the mother to this child, Luzma. Lucha craves lasting love like junkies crave heroin. But for her loyal daughter, she never finds it and in the end no one can help her.', 'The legendary life of Mexican singer Lucha Reyes is the basis of this fictionalized biography ( or as director Arturo Ripstein puts it "an imaginary biography"). Lucha Reyes was an unconventional, and sexually liberated woman, most famous for her "cancion ranchera" style singing. Her story begins in 1939, where at 33 she still lived at home with her mother, Dona Victora, the madame of a renowned Mexico City whorehouse. Lucha marries the liberal Pedro Calderon and then buys a beggar''s daughter. She becomes the mother to this child, Luzma. Lucha craves lasting love like junkies crave heroin. But for her loyal daughter, she never finds it and in the end no one can help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjyKjbLSr09LGnslCitKpsC5Kfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196939'),
  ('892288335145601295', 'The Queen of Versailles', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Lauren Greenfield, Sarah Levy, Tom Hurwitz', 'Lauren Greenfield', 'Jacqueline Siegel, David Siegel, Virginia Nebab, Katie Stam, Lorraine Barrett, June Downs, Phillip Froehlich, Marissa Gaspay', 'PG', 'With the epic dimensions of a Shakespearean tragedy, The Queen of Versailles follows billionaires Jackie and David’s rags-to-riches story to uncover the innate virtues and flaws of their American dream. We open on the triumphant construction of the biggest house in America, a sprawling, 90,000-square-foot mansion inspired by Versailles. Since a booming time-share business built on the real-estate bubble is financing it, the economic crisis brings progress to a halt and seals the fate of its owners. We witness the impact of this turn of fortune over the next two years in a riveting film fraught with delusion, denial, and self-effacing humor.', 'With the epic dimensions of a Shakespearean tragedy, The Queen of Versailles follows billionaires Jackie and David’s rags-to-riches story to uncover the innate virtues and flaws of their American dream. We open on the triumphant construction of the biggest house in America, a sprawling, 90,000-square-foot mansion inspired by Versailles. Since a booming time-share business built on the real-estate bubble is financing it, the economic crisis brings progress to a halt and seals the fate of its owners. We witness the impact of this turn of fortune over the next two years in a riveting film fraught with delusion, denial, and self-effacing humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFMRyapxD7XP5Boj6CLaDtQ1m3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84327'),
  ('824348360438978636', 'The Queen was in the Parlor', 1932, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Ken Darby, Johnny Murray, The King''s Men', null, 'The last Goopy Geer cartoon. The king returns to his castle, and asks where the queen is; she''s in the parlor, and won''t be seen, according to the title song. He goes to his throne and summons his jester, Goopy Geer. A black knight arrives and threatens one of the young ladies in court; Goopy Geer fights him off, first with an ax, then in armor from kitchen utensils, then butting him with a mounted animal head, which makes the knight''s armor fall apart. He pulls it together again and runs away.', 'The last Goopy Geer cartoon. The king returns to his castle, and asks where the queen is; she''s in the parlor, and won''t be seen, according to the title song. He goes to his throne and summons his jester, Goopy Geer. A black knight arrives and threatens one of the young ladies in court; Goopy Geer fights him off, first with an ax, then in armor from kitchen utensils, then butting him with a mounted animal head, which makes the knight''s armor fall apart. He pulls it together again and runs away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCloRGHORJJVCgP6uNlKz1qTp3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161581'),
  ('142808023018402988', 'The Queen''s Corgi', 2019, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Stassen, Vincent Kesteloot, Dirk de Loose', 'Rob Sprackling, Johnny Smith', 'Rusty Shackleford, Jo Wyatt, Mari Devon, Dino Andrade, Joey Camen, Leo Barakat, Nicole Moorea Sherman, Kirk Thornton', 'PG', 'Since his arrival at Buckingham palace, Rex lives a life of luxury. Top dog, he has superseded his three fellow Corgis in Her Majesty’s heart. His arrogance can be quite irritating. When he causes a diplomatic incident during an official dinner with the President of the United States, he falls into disgrace. Betrayed by one of his peers, Rex becomes a stray dog in the streets of London. How can he redeem himself? In love, he will find the resources to surpass himself in the face of great danger…', 'Since his arrival at Buckingham palace, Rex lives a life of luxury. Top dog, he has superseded his three fellow Corgis in Her Majesty’s heart. His arrogance can be quite irritating. When he causes a diplomatic incident during an official dinner with the President of the United States, he falls into disgrace. Betrayed by one of his peers, Rex becomes a stray dog in the streets of London. How can he redeem himself? In love, he will find the resources to surpass himself in the face of great danger…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcl4vYTqqzwn3ihUpjCQz0jqhV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509730'),
  ('127306635112290284', 'The Queen''s Lover', 1948, 'Drama', 'Pierre Billon, Michel Kelber', null, 'Danielle Darrieux, Jean Marais, Marcel Herrand, Gabrielle Dorziat, Alexandre Rignault, Giovanni Grasso, Paul Amiot, Jone Salinas', null, 'Exiled from the court of Spain, Don Salluste, the chief of police, wants to take revenge on the Queen. One day he meets Ruy Blas, a young student who happens to be a lookalike of Don Cesar, his nephew. Salluste disguises Ruy Blas and presents him as Don Cesar. It doesn''t take long before Ruy Blas, intelligent, virtuous and generous as he is becomes popular and the Queen, who has fallen in love with him, appoints him Prime Minister. All seems for the best in the best of worlds but Salluste has not forgotten his revenge, far from that ...', 'Exiled from the court of Spain, Don Salluste, the chief of police, wants to take revenge on the Queen. One day he meets Ruy Blas, a young student who happens to be a lookalike of Don Cesar, his nephew. Salluste disguises Ruy Blas and presents him as Don Cesar. It doesn''t take long before Ruy Blas, intelligent, virtuous and generous as he is becomes popular and the Queen, who has fallen in love with him, appoints him Prime Minister. All seems for the best in the best of worlds but Salluste has not forgotten his revenge, far from that ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubNBBr8h0PSAvCixXpxQYTy2lWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250110'),
  ('902702880274885712', 'The Queens', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Bolognini, Mario Monicelli, Antonio Pietrangeli', 'Ruggero Maccari, Luigi Magni, Luciano Salce', 'Monica Vitti, Enrico Maria Salerno, Claudia Cardinale, Gastone Moschin, Raquel Welch, Jean Sorel, Alberto Sordi, Capucine', null, 'Four comedic shorts explore quirky relationships and misadventures: a teenage girl''s journey home, a self-serving babysitter, a husband confronting infidelity, and a wealthy woman''s drunken escapades with her butler.', 'Four comedic shorts explore quirky relationships and misadventures: a teenage girl''s journey home, a self-serving babysitter, a husband confronting infidelity, and a wealthy woman''s drunken escapades with her butler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtzEDZfxE7Adu1Dpxeol4nsPo1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221717'),
  ('685378066474727263', 'The Queenstown Kings', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jahmil X.T. Qubeka, Willie Nel', 'Jahmil X.T. Qubeka, Clyde Berning', 'Zolisa Xaluva, Likhona Mgali, Unathi Platyi, Enhle Mbali Mlotshwa, Tessa Twala, Thoko Ntshinga, Sandile Mahlangu, Aphiwe Mkefe', null, 'A prodigious young soccer player from rural Queenstown must face the return of his washed-up, pro-footballer father, and navigate the choice between his team''s success and his own dreams.', 'A prodigious young soccer player from rural Queenstown must face the return of his washed-up, pro-footballer father, and navigate the choice between his team''s success and his own dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58mHgWKwYaySV4y6sSsFVazUfOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193708'),
  ('203799975158148441', 'The Quest', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Peter MacDonald, David Gribble', 'Steve Klein, Paul Mones', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Roger Moore, James Remar, Jack McGee, Louis Mandylor, Ryan Cutrona, Ze''ev Revach, Janet Gunn', 'PG-13', 'Ghang-gheng, the ancient winner-take-all competition in which the deadliest fighters from around the world employ the most spectacular feats of martial arts skills ever displayed in order to win the prized Golden Dragon. But fighting prowess alone will not be enough for Chris to triumph over such daunting foes.', 'Ghang-gheng, the ancient winner-take-all competition in which the deadliest fighters from around the world employ the most spectacular feats of martial arts skills ever displayed in order to win the prized Golden Dragon. But fighting prowess alone will not be enough for Chris to triumph over such daunting foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMDo0ewl6XMZei44UNGMfho6eBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9103'),
  ('337808483219488041', 'The Quest', 2006, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Mike Fleiss, Jason A. Carbone', 'Mike Fleiss, Jason A. Carbone', 'Eddie Macsalka, Alexander Loyless, Hans Swolfs, Johnny Milord, Josh Morris, Matt Huntington, Bryan Codi, Andrew Ghertner', null, 'Mike Fleiss, the producer of such reality television shows as The Bachelor and The Bachelorette, makes his feature film debut with The Quest, a reality-film that follows seven Colorado college students as they travel south of the border to Cabo San Lucas, Mexico, for a week of spring-break debauchery. The title refers to the various sexual conquests of the young men as they immerse themselves in alcohol and bikini-clad women for seven days.', 'Mike Fleiss, the producer of such reality television shows as The Bachelor and The Bachelorette, makes his feature film debut with The Quest, a reality-film that follows seven Colorado college students as they travel south of the border to Cabo San Lucas, Mexico, for a week of spring-break debauchery. The title refers to the various sexual conquests of the young men as they immerse themselves in alcohol and bikini-clad women for seven days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfLTDC1JZ0ETMawUaTDXuASurT6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40011'),
  ('592508783780184721', 'The Quest for Tom Sawyer''s Gold', 2023, 'Adventure, Family', 'Kirk Harris, Brian Vilim', 'Jerome Reygner-Kalfon, Nick Pollack, Sebastien Semon', 'Stephen A. Elkins, Max Purget, Bobby Ray Thompson III, Joey Lauren Adams, Patrick Muldoon, Alex Hyde-White, Amanda Joy Erickson, Scott Bailey', 'PG', 'Agatha Armstrong and her trusty sidekick Mrs. Mac were once the world’s most daring adventurers. But when her son Ant came along, everything quickly changed and her devil-may-care ways took a backseat to being over-protective and terrified of anything that posed a risk to her family.', 'Agatha Armstrong and her trusty sidekick Mrs. Mac were once the world’s most daring adventurers. But when her son Ant came along, everything quickly changed and her devil-may-care ways took a backseat to being over-protective and terrified of anything that posed a risk to her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zceLrHeYOgJHw1tw6MUi15N2NUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966576'),
  ('930782709823361368', 'The Quest of Alain Ducasse', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Gilles de Maistre', 'Gilles de Maistre, Éric Le Roux', 'Alain Ducasse', null, 'What can be the quest of Alain Ducasse, the little boy of the Landes now become the chef and most recognized mentor of cooking in the world? What is a man looking for who already seems to have everything? 23 restaurants in the world, 18 Michelin stars, Alain Ducasse never ceases to create addresses that appeal to our time, to build schools, to push the boundaries of his craft to new horizons, his curiosity has no limit. He traveled the world relentlessly, for to him cooking was an infinite universe. This public man, however secret, accepted to be followed for nearly two years, thus opening us the doors of his universe, in perpetual evolution.', 'What can be the quest of Alain Ducasse, the little boy of the Landes now become the chef and most recognized mentor of cooking in the world? What is a man looking for who already seems to have everything? 23 restaurants in the world, 18 Michelin stars, Alain Ducasse never ceases to create addresses that appeal to our time, to build schools, to push the boundaries of his craft to new horizons, his curiosity has no limit. He traveled the world relentlessly, for to him cooking was an infinite universe. This public man, however secret, accepted to be followed for nearly two years, thus opening us the doors of his universe, in perpetual evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kDpTSxKFHMRpGJ95aipTK2ZW7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480245'),
  ('283913575817956027', 'The Quest of the Sex: A Holly Hole', 2005, 'Drama', 'Peony Ma Siu-Ling', 'Gor Yi', 'Carmen Yeung Ka-Man, Le Rong-Rong, Matthew Ng Ting, Chan Chung-Wai, Hoh Kan-Yee, Goo Wai-Jan, Ng Hau-Yiu', null, 'West, Suen & Chu Keep tracking on their "Quest of the Sex". Since Goblin Bone wants to suck west''s water, she seduces West. It is not successful. Bone request her friend, Goblin Spider, to help. Nine Eyes Devil, Spider''s elder sister, uses her magical eyes to subdue Suen.They kidnap West to the Holly Hole. Suen tries to save West. In respect to obtain the mystical Pin, Suen bears to be insulted by Lo Mo. The Pin is extremely powerful. Suen goes to save West......', 'West, Suen & Chu Keep tracking on their "Quest of the Sex". Since Goblin Bone wants to suck west''s water, she seduces West. It is not successful. Bone request her friend, Goblin Spider, to help. Nine Eyes Devil, Spider''s elder sister, uses her magical eyes to subdue Suen.They kidnap West to the Holly Hole. Suen tries to save West. In respect to obtain the mystical Pin, Suen bears to be insulted by Lo Mo. The Pin is extremely powerful. Suen goes to save West......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdWZGbFFI6pHk3A1C4XnwD9lyiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418578'),
  ('187861426950796827', 'The Questor Tapes', 1974, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Richard A. Colla', null, 'Robert Foxworth, Mike Farrell, John Vernon, Lew Ayres, James Shigeta, Robert Douglas, Dana Wynter, Ellen Weston', null, 'Project Questor is brainchild of the genius Dr. Vaslovik: he developed plans to build an android super-human. Although he''s disappeared and half of his programming tape was erased in the attempt to decode it, his former colleagues continue the project and finally succeed. But Vaslovik seems to have installed a secret program in Questor''s brain: He flees and starts to search for Vaslovik. Since half of his knowledge is missing, he needs the help of Jerry Robinson, who''s now under suspect of having stolen the android.', 'Project Questor is brainchild of the genius Dr. Vaslovik: he developed plans to build an android super-human. Although he''s disappeared and half of his programming tape was erased in the attempt to decode it, his former colleagues continue the project and finally succeed. But Vaslovik seems to have installed a secret program in Questor''s brain: He flees and starts to search for Vaslovik. Since half of his knowledge is missing, he needs the help of Jerry Robinson, who''s now under suspect of having stolen the android.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0YjUDqNQh1Rka4xSoUv1JZ14L8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62432'),
  ('21183553997547135', 'The Quick and the Dead', 1987, 'Action, Drama, Western, TV Movie', 'Robert Day, Dick Bush', null, 'Sam Elliott, Kate Capshaw, Tom Conti, Matt Clark, Patrick Kilpatrick, Del Shores, Kurt D. Lott, Kenny Morrison', null, 'In 1876 Wyoming, the gun is the only law. And for Duncan and Suzanna McKaskel, newly arrived settlers beset by outlaws, rugged frontiersman Con Vallian is the only hope.', 'In 1876 Wyoming, the gun is the only law. And for Duncan and Suzanna McKaskel, newly arrived settlers beset by outlaws, rugged frontiersman Con Vallian is the only hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VAY6pSG6Tx1NCmFvg8VhGvlV33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26939'),
  ('298504931720241708', 'The Quick and the Dead', 1995, 'Western, Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sam Raimi, Dante Spinotti, John Cameron', 'Simon Moore', 'Sharon Stone, Gene Hackman, Russell Crowe, Leonardo DiCaprio, Tobin Bell, Roberts Blossom, Kevin Conway, Keith David', 'R', 'A mysterious woman comes to compete in a quick-draw elimination tournament, in a town taken over by a notorious gunman.', 'A mysterious woman comes to compete in a quick-draw elimination tournament, in a town taken over by a notorious gunman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhEmrXJpP6F3cqwyLjvgBgxxxFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12106'),
  ('161112805842097296', 'The Quick Gun', 1964, 'Western', 'Lester Shorr, Sidney Salkow', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Audie Murphy, Merry Anders, James Best, Ted de Corsia, Walter Sande, Rex Holman, Charles Meredith, Frank Ferguson', 'NR', 'Gunslinger Murphy helps an ungrateful town fight off a raid by his former gang.', 'Gunslinger Murphy helps an ungrateful town fight off a raid by his former gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fR52CiPsDtGmSzdyQlWZsbG7E8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125589'),
  ('133125307771097988', 'The Quiet', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'M. David Mullen, Jamie Babbit, Daniel J. Shaw', 'Abdi Nazemian, Micah Schraft', 'Elisha Cuthbert, Camilla Belle, Martin Donovan, Edie Falco, Shawn Ashmore, Katy Mixon, David Gallagher, Shannon Woodward', 'R', 'After her widowed father dies, deaf teenager Dot moves in with her godparents, Olivia and Paul Deer. The Deers'' daughter, Nina, is openly hostile to Dot, but that does not prevent her from telling her secrets to her silent stepsister, including the fact that she wants to kill her lecherous father.', 'After her widowed father dies, deaf teenager Dot moves in with her godparents, Olivia and Paul Deer. The Deers'' daughter, Nina, is openly hostile to Dot, but that does not prevent her from telling her secrets to her silent stepsister, including the fact that she wants to kill her lecherous father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXIuHcRGCRk0YBOi41MCHMvGst5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9813'),
  ('787442882636900748', 'The Quiet American', 1958, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Robert Krasker', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Audie Murphy, Michael Redgrave, Claude Dauphin, Giorgia Moll, Yoko Tani, Fred Sadoff, Bruce Cabot, Kerima', 'NR', 'Cynical British journalist Fowler falls in love with a young Vietnamese woman but is dismayed when a naïve U.S. official also begins vying for her attention. In retaliation, Fowler informs the communists that the American is selling arms to their enemy.', 'Cynical British journalist Fowler falls in love with a young Vietnamese woman but is dismayed when a naïve U.S. official also begins vying for her attention. In retaliation, Fowler informs the communists that the American is selling arms to their enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67Ks7m063DsocmWmo2DyTSuFXZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85514'),
  ('553952720635455130', 'The Quiet American', 2002, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama, War', 'Christopher Doyle, Phillip Noyce, Brad Shield', 'Robert Schenkkan, Christopher Hampton', 'Michael Caine, Brendan Fraser, Đỗ Thị Hải Yến, Tzi Ma, Rade Šerbedžija, Robert Stanton, Holmes Osborne, Ngo Quang Hai', 'R', 'Cynical British journalist Fowler falls in love with a young Vietnamese woman but is dismayed when a naïve U.S. official also begins vying for her attention. In retaliation, Fowler informs the communists that the American is selling arms to their enemy.', 'Cynical British journalist Fowler falls in love with a young Vietnamese woman but is dismayed when a naïve U.S. official also begins vying for her attention. In retaliation, Fowler informs the communists that the American is selling arms to their enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLooNNrvzpf49G7HsB9siQT4036.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8198'),
  ('130693822831347108', 'The Quiet Duel', 1949, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Sōichi Aisaka', 'Akira Kurosawa, Senkichi Taniguchi', 'Toshirō Mifune, Miki Sanjō, Takashi Shimura, Kenjiro Uemura, Isamu Yamaguchi, Noriko Sengoku, Chieko Nakakita, Kenichi Miyajima', null, 'A young army surgeon, Kyoji Fujisaki, accidentally contracts syphilis during a WWII field operation. Back at his father’s clinic, he treats himself in secret and breaks off his engagement rather than risk his fiancée’s future, even as he confronts the irresponsible patient who infected him—testing his ethics, pride, and capacity for sacrifice.', 'A young army surgeon, Kyoji Fujisaki, accidentally contracts syphilis during a WWII field operation. Back at his father’s clinic, he treats himself in secret and breaks off his engagement rather than risk his fiancée’s future, even as he confronts the irresponsible patient who infected him—testing his ethics, pride, and capacity for sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19dqy5MgZDiWLaXEmvz6oOd3M1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37513'),
  ('1052861870883947126', 'The Quiet Earth', 1985, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Geoff Murphy, James Bartle, Lee Tamahori', 'Bruno Lawrence, Sam Pillsbury, Bill Baer', 'Bruno Lawrence, Alison Routledge, Anzac Wallace, Pete Smith, Tom Hyde, Norman Fletcher', 'R', 'After a top-secret experiment misfires, a scientist may be the only man left alive in the world.', 'After a top-secret experiment misfires, a scientist may be the only man left alive in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0X2luIgPtN4LHH9s9so48jMuss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10176'),
  ('566068254648774702', 'The Quiet Family', 1998, 'Horror, Comedy, Crime', 'Kim Jee-woon, Chung Kwang-suk, Lee So-yeong', 'Kim Jee-woon', 'Park In-hwan, Na Moon-hee, Choi Min-sik, Song Kang-ho, Lee Yoon-seong, Go Ho-kyung, Ji Soo-won, Lee Ki-young', null, 'A family decides to buy a lodge in a remote hiking area. Their first customer commits suicide and the distraught family buries his body to avoid the bad publicity. But their luck gets worse, the bodies start piling up, and the family becomes frantic to rectify the situation.', 'A family decides to buy a lodge in a remote hiking area. Their first customer commits suicide and the distraught family buries his body to avoid the bad publicity. But their luck gets worse, the bodies start piling up, and the family becomes frantic to rectify the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VpCKOlhUaoeH0WypQBulnbh8fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74336'),
  ('973418484224418830', 'The Quiet Girl', 2022, 'Drama', 'Colm Bairéad, Kate McCullough', 'Colm Bairéad', 'Catherine Clinch, Andrew Bennett, Carrie Crowley, Michael Patric, Kate Nic Chonaonaigh, Joan Sheehy, Tara Faughnan, Neans Nic Dhonncha', null, 'A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with relatives for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.', 'A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with relatives for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916405'),
  ('145337721549809921', 'The Quiet Man', 1952, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Winton C. Hoch, John Ford, Archie Stout', 'John Ford', 'John Wayne, Maureen O''Hara, Victor McLaglen, Barry Fitzgerald, Ward Bond, Mildred Natwick, Francis Ford, Eileen Crowe', 'NR', 'An American man returns to the village of his birth in Ireland, where he finds love and conflict.', 'An American man returns to the village of his birth in Ireland, where he finds love and conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3B1hVKHE56yBRoxF3Nk9uxHdYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3109'),
  ('1061480410100583121', 'The Quiet Ones', 2014, 'Horror', 'John Pogue, Mátyás Erdély', 'Craig Rosenberg, Oren Moverman, John Pogue', 'Jared Harris, Sam Claflin, Olivia Cooke, Erin Richards, Rory Fleck-Byrne, Laurie Paul Calvert, Max Pirkis, Richard Cunningham', 'PG-13', 'A professor and his students perform a dangerous experiment that causes a young woman to lose her sanity.', 'A professor and his students perform a dangerous experiment that causes a young woman to lose her sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLULlJrFzhWhJhmjgBTUw0OYv3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193612'),
  ('416758372800814374', 'The Quiet Ones', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Frederik Louis Hviid, Adam Wallensten', 'Anders Frithiof August', 'Gustav Dyekjær Giese, Reda Kateb, Amanda Collin, Christopher Wagelin, Jens Hultén, Granit Rushiti, Amin Ahmed, Camilla Lau', null, 'In 2008, a group of men from Denmark and across Europe pull off the biggest heist of all time on Danish soil. Kasper, a boxer with few chances left in life, is offered the opportunity to plan the robbery by its foreign initiators.', 'In 2008, a group of men from Denmark and across Europe pull off the biggest heist of all time on Danish soil. Kasper, a boxer with few chances left in life, is offered the opportunity to plan the robbery by its foreign initiators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NLY1jNwtZX1yVzwVoBeAhaBE8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261050'),
  ('23840544065793185', 'The Quiet Room', 1996, 'Drama', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Celine O''Leary, Paul Blackwell, Chloe Ferguson, Phoebe Ferguson, Kate Greetham, Todd Telford', null, 'A seven-year-old girl adopts a vow of silence in protest when her quarrelsome parents grow increasingly hostile to one another.', 'A seven-year-old girl adopts a vow of silence in protest when her quarrelsome parents grow increasingly hostile to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sjiajW7AxVA0eFyyIR7Cl49KYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88423'),
  ('324535337470259801', 'The Quiet Son', 2025, 'Drama', 'Aurélien Chevalarias, Marie Crabit, Delphine Coulin', 'Muriel Coulin, Delphine Coulin', 'Vincent Lindon, Benjamin Voisin, Stefan Crepon, Maëlle Poesy-Guichard, Édouard Sulpice, Sophie Guillemin, Arnaud Rebotini, Béatrice Pérez', null, 'Pierre, a devoted father in his 50s, raises his two sons alone. When Louis, the youngest, leaves home to attend the Sorbonne in Paris, Fus, slightly older and not as successful academically, becomes more and more secretive. Driven by a fascination for violence, he gets entangled in far-right extremist groups, at the very opposite of his father’s values. Between them, there is love and hate, until tragedy happens.', 'Pierre, a devoted father in his 50s, raises his two sons alone. When Louis, the youngest, leaves home to attend the Sorbonne in Paris, Fus, slightly older and not as successful academically, becomes more and more secretive. Driven by a fascination for violence, he gets entangled in far-right extremist groups, at the very opposite of his father’s values. Between them, there is love and hate, until tragedy happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CLpEUf9FutbFkLX3PGaKKEqXjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118848'),
  ('83629596677471518', 'The Quietude', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Marianela Sberna, Fernando Alcalde, Ana Laura Urriza', 'Pablo Trapero', 'Bérénice Bejo, Martina Gusmán, Edgar Ramírez, Graciela Borges, Joaquín Furriel, Isidoro Tolcachir, Alejandro Viola, Noemí Sayago', null, 'Against the backdrop of a military dictatorship, Eugenia is reunited with her estranged family following her father’s stroke and is forced to confront dark secret.', 'Against the backdrop of a military dictatorship, Eugenia is reunited with her estranged family following her father’s stroke and is forced to confront dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VTB3INNVY3xE72MhKQqN3Yvmjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482936'),
  ('1032064321824533859', 'The Quiller Memorandum', 1966, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Michael Anderson, Erwin Hillier, Clive Reed', 'Harold Pinter', 'George Segal, Alec Guinness, Max von Sydow, Senta Berger, George Sanders, Robert Helpmann, Robert Flemyng, Peter Carsten', null, 'After two British Secret Intelligence Service agents are murdered at the hands of a cryptic neo-Nazi group known as Phoenix, the suave agent Quiller is sent to Berlin to investigate.', 'After two British Secret Intelligence Service agents are murdered at the hands of a cryptic neo-Nazi group known as Phoenix, the suave agent Quiller is sent to Berlin to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8nFEsMLoSVsMwcuz0Dj9Px6YIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46041'),
  ('144473877004611146', 'The Quintessential Quintuplets Movie', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Masato Jimbo, Hajime Takakuwa, Daisuke Chiba', 'Keiichiro Ochi', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kana Hanazawa, Ayana Taketatsu, Miku Ito, Ayane Sakura, Inori Minase, Natsumi Takamori, Satoshi Hino', null, 'When five lovely young girls who hate studying hire part-time tutor Futaro, he guides not only their education but also their hearts. Time spent has brought them all closer, with feelings growing within the girls and Futaro. As they finish their third year of high school and their last school festival approaches, they set their sights on what’s next. Is there a future with one of them and Futaro?', 'When five lovely young girls who hate studying hire part-time tutor Futaro, he guides not only their education but also their hearts. Time spent has brought them all closer, with feelings growing within the girls and Futaro. As they finish their third year of high school and their last school festival approaches, they set their sights on what’s next. Is there a future with one of them and Futaro?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg7klpt1xwK1IJirBI9EHaqQwJ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820067'),
