  ('38722046294161730', 'The Quiz Show Scandal', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Jang Jin', 'Jang Jin', 'Han Jae-suk, Kim Soo-ro, Ryu Seung-ryong, Jang Young-nam, Ryu Deok-hwan, Shim Eun-kyung, Im Won-hee, Shin Ha-kyun', null, 'Due to a massive car accident and a twist of fate, passengers on four cars find out the answer to the final multimillion-dollar question in an upcoming episode of The Quiz Show. Everyone rushes to compete, their only challenge is to get to that final question.', 'Due to a massive car accident and a twist of fate, passengers on four cars find out the answer to the final multimillion-dollar question in an upcoming episode of The Quiz Show. Everyone rushes to compete, their only challenge is to get to that final question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WolG4z8f5DjKNMnx7v4sQsInjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73659'),
  ('522271596834572767', 'The Ra Expeditions', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Lennart Ehrenborg', 'Thor Heyerdahl', 'Thor Heyerdahl, Norman Baker, Roscoe Lee Browne, Carlo Mauri, Abdullah Dilbrine, Santiago Geneves, Kei Ohara, Mandane Ait Ouhanni', null, 'Ra [also known as The Ra Expeditions] is a 1972 documentary film directed by Lennart Ehrenborg and Thor Heyerdahl about the expeditions organised by Thor Heyerdahl in 1969 and 1970 in attempt to cross the Atlantic on papyrus boats. It was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.', 'Ra [also known as The Ra Expeditions] is a 1972 documentary film directed by Lennart Ehrenborg and Thor Heyerdahl about the expeditions organised by Thor Heyerdahl in 1969 and 1970 in attempt to cross the Atlantic on papyrus boats. It was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEkEXrlqGgut2UjQxwmMKQ6fBhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149325'),
  ('709873610827900329', 'The Rabbi''s Cat', 2011, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Joann Sfar, Antoine Delesvaux', 'Joann Sfar', 'François Morel, Hafsia Herzi, Maurice Bénichou, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Daniel Cohen, François Damiens, Mohamed Fellag, Mathieu Amalric', 'NR', 'The story of a rabbi and his talking cat, a sharp-tongued feline philosopher brimming with scathing humor and a less than pure love for the rabbi''s teenage daughter.', 'The story of a rabbi and his talking cat, a sharp-tongued feline philosopher brimming with scathing humor and a less than pure love for the rabbi''s teenage daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcjwhq6hF3z2Wir0ZcKHTxmtRsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75491'),
  ('539468645471938151', 'The Rabbit Is Me', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kurt Maetzig, Hanna Georgi, Siegbert Fischer', 'Manfred Bieler, Kurt Maetzig', 'Angelika Waller, Alfred Müller, Ilse Voigt, Wolfgang Winkler, Carmen-Maja Antoni, Irma Münch, Maria Besendahl, Rudolf Ulrich', null, 'Maria, a young student sees her brother Dieter going to prison for sedition against the state. She starts an affair with Paul, a judge who turns out to be the one who sentenced her brother, which eventually leads to a confrontation.', 'Maria, a young student sees her brother Dieter going to prison for sedition against the state. She starts an affair with Paul, a judge who turns out to be the one who sentenced her brother, which eventually leads to a confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmuIJ76Qewk7fiyCChdv7m4mn9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77691'),
  ('935084356449948204', 'The Race', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Djamel Bensalah, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Djamel Bensalah, Gilles Laurent', 'Lorànt Deutsch, Roschdy Zem, Atmen Kelif, Julien Courbey, Hélène de Fougerolles, Gérard Jugnot, Josiane Balasko, Marina Foïs', null, 'Sami, Tacchini, Yaya and Kader are four small-time crooks from the suburbs of Paris. After a failed robbery, their boss, Carlito, sends them to Canada to spy on his fiancée. There, they are mistaken for a band of professional killers and are hired to assassinate the heiress Léonore de Segonzac...', 'Sami, Tacchini, Yaya and Kader are four small-time crooks from the suburbs of Paris. After a failed robbery, their boss, Carlito, sends them to Canada to spy on his fiancée. There, they are mistaken for a band of professional killers and are hired to assassinate the heiress Léonore de Segonzac...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wStwrhGRURfE8qkzVHhpFuS9Oej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46728'),
  ('118027312306680248', 'The Race for the Sausage', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A dog runs away with a length of sausage. Chaos erupts as the butcher chasing the dog collides with bystanders who angrily follow.', 'A dog runs away with a length of sausage. Chaos erupts as the butcher chasing the dog collides with bystanders who angrily follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vC4yBVBoVrpXh5Ih3N1GPzwE4ZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120029'),
  ('1075107731188438445', 'The Racer', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'James Mather, Kieron J. Walsh, Ian Adams', 'Ciaran Cassidy, Kieron J. Walsh', 'Louis Talpe, Matteo Simoni, Tara Lee, Iain Glen, Karel Roden, Timo Wagner, Ward Kerremans, Paul Robert', null, 'Summer 1998 - the opening stages of Le Tour de France are relocated to Ireland. Belgian rider Dom Chabol (late 30s) has been one of the best “Domestiques” (support riders) on the Tour for the last 20 years. It’s a sacrificial role – setting pace, blocking wind, and providing support to enable the team’s sprinter to victory - winning is not an option. But Dom secretly harbours a desire to wear the yellow jersey - just once before his career is over. At the start of what will likely be his last Tour, Dom is unceremoniously dropped from the Team he has dedicated his life to. His best mate Sonny, the team masseur, fails to reassure him about his future. But a chance liaison with Lynn, a young Irish doctor, softens the blow, and Dom starts to accept - and even enjoy - the idea of civilian life. But as he gears up to go home and to face his estranged sister, a massive doping error knocks another teammate off the Tour and Dom is thrown back in the saddle…', 'Summer 1998 - the opening stages of Le Tour de France are relocated to Ireland. Belgian rider Dom Chabol (late 30s) has been one of the best “Domestiques” (support riders) on the Tour for the last 20 years. It’s a sacrificial role – setting pace, blocking wind, and providing support to enable the team’s sprinter to victory - winning is not an option. But Dom secretly harbours a desire to wear the yellow jersey - just once before his career is over. At the start of what will likely be his last Tour, Dom is unceremoniously dropped from the Team he has dedicated his life to. His best mate Sonny, the team masseur, fails to reassure him about his future. But a chance liaison with Lynn, a young Irish doctor, softens the blow, and Dom starts to accept - and even enjoy - the idea of civilian life. But as he gears up to go home and to face his estranged sister, a massive doping error knocks another teammate off the Tour and Dom is thrown back in the saddle…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwhlCAW285XyDdN0PRlKYxzp68g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305937'),
  ('482828259011284672', 'The Racetrack Murders', 1964, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Richard Angst', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb', 'Hansjörg Felmy, Ann Smyrner, Hans Nielsen, Wolfgang Lukschy, Heinz Engelmann, Helmuth Lohner, Walter Rilla, Harry Riebauer', null, 'The son of a British racehorse owner conspires with a bookie to ruin the odds of his father''s thoroughbred winning an important event.', 'The son of a British racehorse owner conspires with a bookie to ruin the odds of his father''s thoroughbred winning an important event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h962Ua8WSqNn2WpP3iT3nB1nMD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245509'),
  ('1049824341380426307', 'The Rachel Divide', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Laura Brownson', 'Laura Brownson, Jeff Gilbert', 'Rachel Dolezal, Franklin Moore, Izaiah Dolezal, Esther Dolezal, Jeff Humphries, Shawn Vestal, Kitara Johnson, Latoya Brackett', null, 'Rachel Dolezal became infamous when she was unmasked as a white woman passing for black so thoroughly that she had become the head of her local N.A.A.C.P. chapter. This portrait cuts through the very public controversy to reveal Dolezal’s motivations.', 'Rachel Dolezal became infamous when she was unmasked as a white woman passing for black so thoroughly that she had become the head of her local N.A.A.C.P. chapter. This portrait cuts through the very public controversy to reveal Dolezal’s motivations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v52G1noifAdgXHQRR06k9U1pu2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510073'),
  ('960147276758983317', 'The Rachel Papers', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Damian Harris, Simon Moseley, Alex Thomson', 'Damian Harris', 'Dexter Fletcher, Ione Skye, Jonathan Pryce, James Spader, Bill Paterson, Michael Gambon, Lesley Sharp, Jared Harris', 'R', 'Poised to attend Oxford University, 19-year-old Charles Highway decides it''s high time to have a romantic encounter with an older woman. With the help of a computer program and several eccentric relatives, Highway sets his sights on seducing Rachel Noyce, a stunning American in her 20s. However, Highway has his work cut out for him. Noyce has a boyfriend, DeForest, and is not exactly receptive to Highway''s advances — at first, anyway.', 'Poised to attend Oxford University, 19-year-old Charles Highway decides it''s high time to have a romantic encounter with an older woman. With the help of a computer program and several eccentric relatives, Highway sets his sights on seducing Rachel Noyce, a stunning American in her 20s. However, Highway has his work cut out for him. Noyce has a boyfriend, DeForest, and is not exactly receptive to Highway''s advances — at first, anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15KvepBOjWQb2YJ8nYiHkievVIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41944'),
  ('1005994289875891968', 'The Rack', 1956, 'Drama, War', 'Arnold Laven, Paul Vogel', 'Stewart Stern', 'Paul Newman, Wendell Corey, Walter Pidgeon, Edmond O''Brien, Anne Francis, Lee Marvin, Cloris Leachman, Robert Burton', 'NR', 'Army Captain Edward Hall returns to the U.S. after two years in a prison camp in the Korean War. In the camp, he was brainwashed and helped the Chinese convince the other prisoners that they were fighting an unjust war. When he comes back he is charged for collaboration with the enemy. Where does loyalty end in a prison camp, when the camp is a living hell?', 'Army Captain Edward Hall returns to the U.S. after two years in a prison camp in the Korean War. In the camp, he was brainwashed and helped the Chinese convince the other prisoners that they were fighting an unjust war. When he comes back he is charged for collaboration with the enemy. Where does loyalty end in a prison camp, when the camp is a living hell?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX5LTigzW7MOuTZeMBNwdQfC6RV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82838'),
  ('1081868572148075824', 'The Racket', 1928, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tony Gaudio, Lewis Milestone, Nate Watt', 'Del Andrews', 'Thomas Meighan, Louis Wolheim, Marie Prevost, G. Pat Collins, Henry Sedley, George E. Stone, Sam De Grasse, Richard ''Skeets'' Gallagher', null, 'A renegade police captain sets out to catch a sadistic mob boss. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2016.', 'A renegade police captain sets out to catch a sadistic mob boss. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2016.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EuE65PU92QAZ3xEnC9z0iAWzQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27777'),
  ('1012504824275630777', 'The Racket', 1951, 'Crime, Thriller', 'John Cromwell, George E. Diskant, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'W.R. Burnett, William Wister Haines', 'Robert Mitchum, Lizabeth Scott, Robert Ryan, William Talman, Ray Collins, Joyce Mackenzie, Robert Hutton, Virginia Huston', 'NR', 'The big national crime syndicate has moved into town, partnering up with local crime boss Nick Scanlon. McQuigg, the only honest police captain on the force, and his loyal patrolman, Johnson, take on the violent Nick.', 'The big national crime syndicate has moved into town, partnering up with local crime boss Nick Scanlon. McQuigg, the only honest police captain on the force, and his loyal patrolman, Johnson, take on the violent Nick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZI5BAErP5FU0G72DdZaVam8N8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25876'),
  ('1060035736664403555', 'The Racketeer', 1929, 'Crime, Drama', 'Howard Higgin, George Webster, David Abel', null, 'Robert Armstrong, Carole Lombard, Roland Drew, Paul Hurst, Kit Guard, Al Hill, Bobby Dunn, Budd Fine', 'G', 'A dapper gangster sponsors an alcoholic violinist in order to win the love of a glamorous divorced socialite.', 'A dapper gangster sponsors an alcoholic violinist in order to win the love of a glamorous divorced socialite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raoxlj2iaiBpyeZOEzSXg3GP57l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79971'),
  ('1033832926213283340', 'The Radiator Springs 500½', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Rob Gibbs, Scott Morse', null, 'Bonnie Hunt, Larry the Cable Guy, Steve Purcell, John Cygan, Katherine Helmond, Cheech Marin, Lori Alan, April Winchell', null, 'A ''leisurely drive'' planned in honor of Radiator Springs’ town founder, Stanley, turns precarious as Baja pros descend on the town and challenge Lightning McQueen to an off-road race. Meanwhile, the townsfolk, led by a Stanley-costumed Mater, enjoy the planned ''leisurely drive'' to retrace Stanley’s original frontier route. Thinking they’re on the same course, a wrong turn sends McQueen and the Baja pros on a treacherously wild bid for survival. The misunderstanding leaves the racing professionals in awe of the ''legend'' of Stanley: the Original Off-Road Racer.', 'A ''leisurely drive'' planned in honor of Radiator Springs’ town founder, Stanley, turns precarious as Baja pros descend on the town and challenge Lightning McQueen to an off-road race. Meanwhile, the townsfolk, led by a Stanley-costumed Mater, enjoy the planned ''leisurely drive'' to retrace Stanley’s original frontier route. Thinking they’re on the same course, a wrong turn sends McQueen and the Baja pros on a treacherously wild bid for survival. The misunderstanding leaves the racing professionals in awe of the ''legend'' of Stanley: the Original Off-Road Racer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKuGXTnggOmut8A0ZvU1Hh2yOa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286189'),
  ('789185746277398415', 'The Radleys', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Euros Lyn, Nanu Segal', 'Talitha Stevenson, Jo Brand', 'Damian Lewis, Kelly Macdonald, Bo Bragason, Harry Baxendale, Sophia Di Martino, Steven Waddington, Madeleine Power, Shaun Parkes', 'R', 'A seemingly ordinary family harbors a dark secret: they are vampires. They choose not to drink blood despite their natural cravings, but one day, their truth comes to light.', 'A seemingly ordinary family harbors a dark secret: they are vampires. They choose not to drink blood despite their natural cravings, but one day, their truth comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luQa5iUFp7pagD7jVhYM1FlWnJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139713'),
  ('736677989941371659', 'The Raffle', 1991, 'Drama', 'Francesco Laudadio, Maurizio Sciarra, Susanna Napolitano', 'Francesco Laudadio', 'Monica Bellucci, Giulio Scarpati, Massimo Ghini, Paolo Busiri Vici D''Arcevia, Elena Cantarone, Carla Cassola, Sandra Collodel, Paolo De Vita', null, 'Struggling with a financial crisis, a good-looking widow decides to put herself up for grabs. However, going through with it becomes almost impossible with a new love and the legal system thrown into the mix.', 'Struggling with a financial crisis, a good-looking widow decides to put herself up for grabs. However, going through with it becomes almost impossible with a new love and the legal system thrown into the mix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jc60w8ZemDMYqyJUStcQKy6syi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59053'),
  ('775120687139005366', 'The Raft', 2020, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Oded Raz, David Stragmeister', 'Yonatan Bar-Ilan, Daniel Kotz, Amikam Kovner', 'Anna Zak, Omer Dahan, Shahaf Carmel, Idan Shakroka, Ola Schur Selektar, Mikhail Basmadjian, Kobi Maor, Barak Shamir', null, 'Three Israeli teens decide to build a raft and sail to the championship final in Cyprus. During their journey, their friendship will be put to the test as they will get a taste of first love and discover traits and skills in themselves that they didn''t know existed. The innocent adventure evolves into a coming of age journey they will never forget.', 'Three Israeli teens decide to build a raft and sail to the championship final in Cyprus. During their journey, their friendship will be put to the test as they will get a taste of first love and discover traits and skills in themselves that they didn''t know existed. The innocent adventure evolves into a coming of age journey they will never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5x9VYVoBv2ylj8Or9MXA4MrHkRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985101'),
  ('1014844827834020113', 'The Rage', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sidney J. Furie, Donald M. Morgan', 'Greg Mellott, Sidney J. Furie', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Kristen Cloke, Gary Busey, Roy Scheider, Jenny McShane, Ashlee Nicole, Terra Allen, Shannon Lavender', null, 'FBI Special Agent Travis is trying to catch a deranged serial killer and is doing his best despite having a new and unexperienced partner in the form of Kelly McCord.', 'FBI Special Agent Travis is trying to catch a deranged serial killer and is doing his best despite having a new and unexperienced partner in the form of Kelly McCord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av1saKoNl2fk2gNZ4dhRBUgqeaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114936'),
  ('1008141798492289319', 'The Rage', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert Kurtzman, Robert Kurtzman', 'John Bisson', 'Andrew Divoff, Erin Brown, Ryan Hooks, Sean Serino, Rachel Scheer, Christopher Allen Nelson, Reggie Bannister, Anthony Clark', null, 'A crazed scientist experimenting with a rage virus on innocent victims in a laboratory in the woods. When his monstrous subjects escape and vultures devour their remains, they became mutations seeking to feed on humans.', 'A crazed scientist experimenting with a rage virus on innocent victims in a laboratory in the woods. When his monstrous subjects escape and vultures devour their remains, they became mutations seeking to feed on humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSE7BfeHvZWmt80rg7XPwmkYxxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13946'),
  ('159293643176125579', 'The Rage', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Tatyana Khrechkova, Filipp Lamshin', 'Alexey Kazakov', 'Aleksey Serebryakov, Vsevolod Volodin, Evgeniy Tkachuk, Georgiy Dronov, Anna Ukolova, Kirill Poluhin, Angelina Strechina, Aleksandr Ustyugov', null, 'An unprecedented epidemic of rabies is breaking out in the taiga. Infected wolves become more and more ferocious, and even the slightest bite brings certain death. At the same time, a desperate father decides to forcibly isolate his son in one of the hunting lodges in order to save him from addiction. Soon, he and several local residents will have to fight not only with a rabid pack, but also with the most dangerous predator of the forest.', 'An unprecedented epidemic of rabies is breaking out in the taiga. Infected wolves become more and more ferocious, and even the slightest bite brings certain death. At the same time, a desperate father decides to forcibly isolate his son in one of the hunting lodges in order to save him from addiction. Soon, he and several local residents will have to fight not only with a rabid pack, but also with the most dangerous predator of the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQ9TmxMDeWcRHlkbDLZvQ8xAGXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650036'),
  ('1107208689962387087', 'The Rage in Placid Lake', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Ellery Ryan, Tony McNamara', 'Tony McNamara', 'Ben Lee, Rose Byrne, Miranda Richardson, Garry McDonald, Socratis Otto, Toby Schmitz, Nathaniel Dean, Christopher Stollery', 'NR', 'Placid Lake has always been different. As an odd fish in a sea of mediocrity, his brilliant ideas are bound to get him into more trouble than success. So when he finds himself flying off the school roof and breaking every bone in his body on graduation night, Placid decides to make a bid for the elusive normal life. To his parents'' horror, he gets a normal job.', 'Placid Lake has always been different. As an odd fish in a sea of mediocrity, his brilliant ideas are bound to get him into more trouble than success. So when he finds himself flying off the school roof and breaking every bone in his body on graduation night, Placid decides to make a bid for the elusive normal life. To his parents'' horror, he gets a normal job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwJCynrOg4Xr4k8Fi0TBAWZjPru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14868'),
  ('1064433504422812647', 'The Rage of Paris', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Koster, Joseph A. Valentine, Frank Shaw', 'Bruce Manning, Felix Jackson', 'Danielle Darrieux, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Louis Hayward, Helen Broderick, Mischa Auer, Charles Coleman, Samuel S. Hinds, Nella Walker', 'NR', 'Nicole has no job and is several weeks behind with her rent. Her solution to her problems is to try and snare a rich husband. Enlisting the help of her friend Gloria and the maitre''d at a ritzy New York City hotel, the trio plot to have Gloria catch the eye of Bill Duncan, a millionaire staying at the hotel. The plan works and the two quickly become engaged. Nicole''s plan may be thwarted by Bill''s friend, Jim Trevor, who''s met Nicole before and sees through her plot.', 'Nicole has no job and is several weeks behind with her rent. Her solution to her problems is to try and snare a rich husband. Enlisting the help of her friend Gloria and the maitre''d at a ritzy New York City hotel, the trio plot to have Gloria catch the eye of Bill Duncan, a millionaire staying at the hotel. The plan works and the two quickly become engaged. Nicole''s plan may be thwarted by Bill''s friend, Jim Trevor, who''s met Nicole before and sees through her plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkcecPOr93hqwgjJpFAjY68RWsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43856'),
  ('100447837418388988', 'The Rage: Carrie 2', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Katt Shea, Dan Morski, Donald M. Morgan', 'Rafael Moreu', 'Emily Bergl, Jason London, Amy Irving, J. Smith-Cameron, Dylan Bruno, Zachery Ty Bryan, Charlotte Ayanna, Rachel Blanchard', 'R', 'A horrible massacre strikes up after an outcast teenage girl is taunted by a group of high school jocks, all of them unaware of her cutthroat telekinetic powers.', 'A horrible massacre strikes up after an outcast teenage girl is taunted by a group of high school jocks, all of them unaware of her cutthroat telekinetic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJmIf22gwwQPAFJfZ6Tr1MwSpRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7341'),
  ('548501366701438192', 'The Raggedy Rawney', 1988, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Bob Hoskins, Frank Tidy', 'Bob Hoskins, Nicole de Wilde', 'Bob Hoskins, Dexter Fletcher, Zoë Nathenson, Zoë Wanamaker, Timmy Lang, Ian McNeice, Gawn Grainger, Jim Carter', null, 'During WWII a youth deserts his country''s army after a combat experience, but not before wounding his commanding officer with a knife in order to escape. The young man, now very emotionally distraught, dresses in women''s clothes and eventually joins a passing gypsy caravan, who think him a young girl... as well as a kind of seer, or ''rawney''. In time, however, he regains some composure and becomes attracted to one of the gypsy girls, which only leads to problems within the gypsy band, especially when the wounded commanding officer finds him.', 'During WWII a youth deserts his country''s army after a combat experience, but not before wounding his commanding officer with a knife in order to escape. The young man, now very emotionally distraught, dresses in women''s clothes and eventually joins a passing gypsy caravan, who think him a young girl... as well as a kind of seer, or ''rawney''. In time, however, he regains some composure and becomes attracted to one of the gypsy girls, which only leads to problems within the gypsy band, especially when the wounded commanding officer finds him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QX0WXYN4fWqaDd7hG3awKTjeWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146472'),
  ('799297944464296660', 'The Raging Moon', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bryan Forbes, Tony Imi', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Malcolm McDowell, Nanette Newman, Georgia Brown, Bernard Lee, Barry Jackson, Theresa Watson, Gerald Sim, Michael Flanders', null, 'Bruce Pritchard is paralysed in a soccer game and is confined to a wheelchair in a convalescence home. But this doesn''t slow his lust for life. Then he meets Jill and has to think about the effects of disability.', 'Bruce Pritchard is paralysed in a soccer game and is confined to a wheelchair in a convalescence home. But this doesn''t slow his lust for life. Then he meets Jill and has to think about the effects of disability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M3N9v71cAZQcsCwMdXQvEYsMdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185942'),
  ('417794869725020505', 'The Raging Tide', 1951, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'George Sherman, Russell Metty, Frank Shaw', 'Ernest K. Gann', 'Shelley Winters, Richard Conte, Stephen McNally, Charles Bickford, Alex Nicol, John McIntire, Tito Vuolo, Chubby Johnson', 'NR', 'A San Francisco hood is rubbed out by rival Bruno Felkin, who himself reports the crime to Homicide Lt. Kelsey in an alibi scheme which fails. To escape, he stows away on a fishing boat. At sea, skipper Hamil Linder receives Bruno kindly, teaching him fishing; Bruno enlists Hamil''s wayward son Carl to tend his slot machines. Then Carl takes an interest in Bruno''s girl Connie. Climax in a storm at sea.', 'A San Francisco hood is rubbed out by rival Bruno Felkin, who himself reports the crime to Homicide Lt. Kelsey in an alibi scheme which fails. To escape, he stows away on a fishing boat. At sea, skipper Hamil Linder receives Bruno kindly, teaching him fishing; Bruno enlists Hamil''s wayward son Carl to tend his slot machines. Then Carl takes an interest in Bruno''s girl Connie. Climax in a storm at sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjxVfl0jkPDKEuQzLphafu3wEvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61960'),
  ('954605024614404835', 'The Raid', 1954, 'Western, War', 'Ad Schaumer, Hugo Fregonese, Lucien Ballard', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Van Heflin, Anne Bancroft, Richard Boone, Lee Marvin, Tommy Rettig, Peter Graves, Douglas Spencer, Paul Cavanagh', 'NR', 'A group of confederate prisoners escape to Canada and plan to rob the banks and set fire to the small town of Saint Albans in Vermont. To get the lie of the land, their leader spends a few days in the town and finds he is getting drawn into its life and especially into that of an attractive widow and her son.', 'A group of confederate prisoners escape to Canada and plan to rob the banks and set fire to the small town of Saint Albans in Vermont. To get the lie of the land, their leader spends a few days in the town and finds he is getting drawn into its life and especially into that of an attractive widow and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsAt76xPg0aUgvBdhUSd5lJMUVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74074'),
  ('733117178471705451', 'The Raid', 1991, 'Action, Drama', 'Tsui Hark, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Ma Yuk-Sing', 'Yuen Kai-Chi, Tsui Hark', 'Dean Shek Tin, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Corey Yuen, Paul Chu Kong, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Joyce Godenzi, Kei Kong-Hung', null, 'In the 1930s, China was in a state of turmoil and flurry. The dethroned Emperor Pu-Yi had established the Puppet State of Manchukuo in Manchuria and was cooperating with the Japanese in the testing of poisonous gas. The revolutionary army headed by Lieutenant Mong is assigned to crush this vicious plot. During his mission, Mong comes across witty and valiant veteran Uncle Choy and his friends, who volunteer to help. Mong believes that Uncle Choy is too old to join them. How can Uncle Choy prove himself? And can they succeed in their mission?', 'In the 1930s, China was in a state of turmoil and flurry. The dethroned Emperor Pu-Yi had established the Puppet State of Manchukuo in Manchuria and was cooperating with the Japanese in the testing of poisonous gas. The revolutionary army headed by Lieutenant Mong is assigned to crush this vicious plot. During his mission, Mong comes across witty and valiant veteran Uncle Choy and his friends, who volunteer to help. Mong believes that Uncle Choy is too old to join them. How can Uncle Choy prove himself? And can they succeed in their mission?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNyt4vI3RvKIgc071WNmwgJtW23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156077'),
  ('285568416970608322', 'The Raid', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Gareth Evans, Matt Flannery, Dimas Imam Subhono', 'Gareth Evans', 'Iko Uwais, Joe Taslim, Donny Alamsyah, Yayan Ruhian, Pierre Gruno, Ray Sahetapy, Tegar Satrya, Iang Darmawan', 'R', 'Deep in the heart of Jakarta''s slums lies an impenetrable safe house for the world''s most dangerous killers and gangsters. Until now, the run-down apartment block has been considered untouchable to even the bravest of police. Cloaked under the cover of pre-dawn darkness and silence, an elite swat team is tasked with raiding the safe house in order to take down the notorious drug lord that runs it. But when a chance encounter with a spotter blows their cover and news of their assault reaches the drug lord, the building''s lights are cut and all the exits blocked. Stranded on the sixth floor with no way out, the unit must fight their way through the city''s worst to survive their mission. Starring Indonesian martial arts sensation Iko Uwais.', 'Deep in the heart of Jakarta''s slums lies an impenetrable safe house for the world''s most dangerous killers and gangsters. Until now, the run-down apartment block has been considered untouchable to even the bravest of police. Cloaked under the cover of pre-dawn darkness and silence, an elite swat team is tasked with raiding the safe house in order to take down the notorious drug lord that runs it. But when a chance encounter with a spotter blows their cover and news of their assault reaches the drug lord, the building''s lights are cut and all the exits blocked. Stranded on the sixth floor with no way out, the unit must fight their way through the city''s worst to survive their mission. Starring Indonesian martial arts sensation Iko Uwais.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Abnm1Ws3JH0ReCfEhLMPwPcMcGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94329'),
  ('35709515344491629', 'The Raid 2', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gareth Evans, Matt Flannery, Dimas Imam Subhono', 'Gareth Evans', 'Iko Uwais, Arifin Putra, Tio Pakusadewo, Oka Antara, Alex Abbad, Cecep Arif Rahman, Julie Estelle, Very Tri Yulisman', 'R', 'After fighting his way through an apartment building populated by an army of dangerous criminals and escaping with his life, SWAT team member Rama goes undercover, joining a powerful Indonesian crime syndicate to protect his family and uncover corrupt members of his own force.', 'After fighting his way through an apartment building populated by an army of dangerous criminals and escaping with his life, SWAT team member Rama goes undercover, joining a powerful Indonesian crime syndicate to protect his family and uncover corrupt members of his own force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olA39iaXISiKEkACdELgr0ZRvIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180299'),
  ('137743071928043952', 'The Railroad Lady', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Timo von Gunten, Nausheen Dadabhoy', 'Timo von Gunten', 'Jane Birkin, Gilles Tschudi, Lucien Guignard, Mathieu Bisson, Manuela Biedermann, Julie Dray, Viola von Scarpatetti, Nicolas Heini', null, 'Élise Lafontaine has a secret routine. Every morning and evening for many years, she has been waving at the express train that passes her house. One fateful day, she finds a letter from the train conductor in her garden and her lonely life is turned upside down. She engages in a promising correspondence through poetic and thoughtful letters where the two anonymous writers share their worlds with each other. But Elise’s fairytale is cut short when the train line permanently detours for a shorter route to Paris. Not willing to do without her daily delight, Elise prompts a daring escape from her comfort zone and sets out to find the train conductor.', 'Élise Lafontaine has a secret routine. Every morning and evening for many years, she has been waving at the express train that passes her house. One fateful day, she finds a letter from the train conductor in her garden and her lonely life is turned upside down. She engages in a promising correspondence through poetic and thoughtful letters where the two anonymous writers share their worlds with each other. But Elise’s fairytale is cut short when the train line permanently detours for a shorter route to Paris. Not willing to do without her daily delight, Elise prompts a daring escape from her comfort zone and sets out to find the train conductor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48PzBdgju3SAAUCFtfEf0X6IZh5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403252'),
  ('1108419109342873787', 'The Railroad Man', 1956, 'Drama', 'Pietro Germi, Leonida Barboni, Lorenzo Frusca', 'Alfredo Giannetti, Pietro Germi, Luciano Vincenzoni', 'Pietro Germi, Luisa Della Noce, Sylva Koscina, Saro Urzì, Carlo Giuffrè, Renato Speziali, Edoardo Nevola, Antonio Acqua', null, 'Train operator Andrea Marcocci has to witness the suicide of a desperate man who jumps in front of his train. Under the influence of this shock he starts making mistakes. A check up by a doctor reveals that he''s at the brink of becoming an alcoholic. Due to this evaluation he is degraded and must accept a salary cut.', 'Train operator Andrea Marcocci has to witness the suicide of a desperate man who jumps in front of his train. Under the influence of this shock he starts making mistakes. A check up by a doctor reveals that he''s at the brink of becoming an alcoholic. Due to this evaluation he is degraded and must accept a salary cut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i8AlnmKymmeOLhysuiNFGhlFjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57969'),
  ('251740085092978850', 'The Railrodder', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Potterton, Jo Kirkpatrick, Buster Keaton', 'Gerald Potterton', 'Buster Keaton', null, 'After literally swimming across the Atlantic Ocean, an Englishman takes a country trip across Canada on a railcar.', 'After literally swimming across the Atlantic Ocean, an Englishman takes a country trip across Canada on a railcar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvO3xRHgRdqtjGmNOVxo0egmViw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32323'),
  ('446968677615143706', 'The Railway Children', 1970, 'Drama, Family', 'Lionel Jeffries, Arthur Ibbetson', 'Lionel Jeffries', 'Dinah Sheridan, Bernard Cribbins, William Mervyn, Iain Cuthbertson, Jenny Agutter, Sally Thomsett, Gary Warren, Peter Bromilow', 'G', 'At the dawn of the 20th century, following their father''s arrest on suspicion of betraying state secrets, the three Waterbury children—Bobbie, Phyllis and Peter—move with their mother to Yorkshire, where they find themselves involved in unexpected dramas along the railway by their new home.', 'At the dawn of the 20th century, following their father''s arrest on suspicion of betraying state secrets, the three Waterbury children—Bobbie, Phyllis and Peter—move with their mother to Yorkshire, where they find themselves involved in unexpected dramas along the railway by their new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kusEIHfdngzcypY36yjWJVWMShj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37662'),
  ('349726348765144862', 'The Railway Children', 2000, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Catherine Morshead, Chris Dando, Patrick James Stephens', 'Simon Nye', 'Clare Thomas, Jack Blumenau, Jemima Rooper, Jenny Agutter, Michael Kitchen, Gregor Fisher, Amanda Walker, Clive Russell', null, 'At the dawn of the 20th century, following their father''s arrest on suspicion of betraying state secrets, the three Waterbury children—Bobbie, Phyllis and Peter—move with their mother to Yorkshire, where they find themselves involved in unexpected dramas along the railway by their new home.', 'At the dawn of the 20th century, following their father''s arrest on suspicion of betraying state secrets, the three Waterbury children—Bobbie, Phyllis and Peter—move with their mother to Yorkshire, where they find themselves involved in unexpected dramas along the railway by their new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOUhkEhrCeHRldgqZmYZEH8DsTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31920'),
  ('186510346296435267', 'The Railway Children Return', 2022, 'Drama, Family, Adventure', 'Morgan Matthews, Kit Fraser, Jonathan Eckersley', 'Daniel Brocklehurst', 'Jenny Agutter, Sheridan Smith, Tom Courtenay, Beau Gadsdon, KJ Aikens, Austin Haynes, Eden Hamilton, Zac Cudby', 'PG', 'Follow a group of children who are evacuated to a Yorkshire village during the Second World War, where they encounter a young soldier who, like them, is far away from home.', 'Follow a group of children who are evacuated to a Yorkshire village during the Second World War, where they encounter a young soldier who, like them, is far away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbps2oKs5ixtNSQqEae3r4mBq7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826680'),
  ('969762744468657352', 'The Railway Man', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Jonathan Teplitzky, Garry Phillips, Caireen Todd', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce, Andy Paterson', 'Colin Firth, Nicole Kidman, Stellan Skarsgård, Jeremy Irvine, Hiroyuki Sanada, Tanroh Ishida, Michael MacKenzie, Jeffrey Daunton', 'R', 'A victim from World War II''s "Death Railway" sets out to find those responsible for his torture. A true story.', 'A victim from World War II''s "Death Railway" sets out to find those responsible for his torture. A true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuADLCxGCA5rFWk2QDXvX5plBrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127560'),
