  ('1057330883774101821', 'The Rain Killer', 1990, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Ken Stein, Janusz Kamiński', 'Ray Cunneff', 'Ray Sharkey, David Beecroft, Tania Coleridge, Michael Chiklis, Maria Ford, Woody Brown, Gray Daniels, Robert Miano', null, 'Together, a weary cop and an all business FBI agent, team up to catch the latest homicidal manic: The Rain Killer. Just when they think that all the clues have been washed away, they find the one last clue; the one that''s been in plain sight.', 'Together, a weary cop and an all business FBI agent, team up to catch the latest homicidal manic: The Rain Killer. Just when they think that all the clues have been washed away, they find the one last clue; the one that''s been in plain sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwZWHNGp0rBag7QSkRrRE35VP0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90898'),
  ('1115133326022026628', 'The Rain People', 1969, 'Drama', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Richard C. Bennett, Bill Butler', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'James Caan, Shirley Knight, Robert Duvall, Marya Zimmet, Tom Aldredge, Laurie Crews, Andrew Duncan, Margaret Fairchild', 'R', 'When a housewife finds out she is pregnant, she runs out of town looking for freedom to reevaluate her life decisions.', 'When a housewife finds out she is pregnant, she runs out of town looking for freedom to reevaluate her life decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7QoTc6glt5zEpE05Wg5sFgH0Lf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59231'),
  ('570190613809982381', 'The Rainbow', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ken Russell, Billy Williams, Peter Heslop', 'Ken Russell, Vivian Russell', 'Sammi Davis, Paul McGann, Amanda Donohoe, Christopher Gable, David Hemmings, Glenda Jackson, Dudley Sutton, Jim Carter', 'R', 'Born to a rich landowner in the waning days of the Victorian era, Ursula Brangwen grows into a beautiful young woman full of imagination and ambition. The free-spirited Ursula begins to feel trapped by her prim surroundings, but her life changes when she has an erotic experience with Winifred, a bisexual teacher. From then on, Ursula puts all of her passion and creativity into the pursuit of sexual fulfillment. But her insatiable quest becomes a source of anguish.', 'Born to a rich landowner in the waning days of the Victorian era, Ursula Brangwen grows into a beautiful young woman full of imagination and ambition. The free-spirited Ursula begins to feel trapped by her prim surroundings, but her life changes when she has an erotic experience with Winifred, a bisexual teacher. From then on, Ursula puts all of her passion and creativity into the pursuit of sexual fulfillment. But her insatiable quest becomes a source of anguish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZ3iqYCVuNfIKWi56aYerDljYS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41945'),
  ('1076417000862868680', 'The Rainbow Thief', 1994, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Ronnie Taylor', 'Berta Domínguez D.', 'Peter O''Toole, Omar Sharif, Berta Domínguez D., Jane Chaplin, Christopher Lee, Francesco Romano, Peter Dennis, Sheila Keith', null, 'A petty crook, in search of the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow, hopes to cash in by befriending an heir to a huge fortune.', 'A petty crook, in search of the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow, hopes to cash in by befriending an heir to a huge fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rSarDJxbC9sNyaAczwzk8bNXKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35165'),
  ('832498665177194047', 'The Rainbow Troops', 2008, 'Drama', 'Riri Riza, Titien Wattimena, M. Ismaya Nugraha', 'Salman Aristo, Mira Lesmana, Riri Riza', 'Cut Mini, Ikranagara, Lukman Sardi, Ario Bayu, Tora Sudiro, Teuku Rifnu Wikana, Mathias Muchus, Rieke Dyah Pitaloka', null, 'A group of 10 students struggles with poverty and develop hopes for the future in Gantong Village on the farming and tin mining island of Belitung.', 'A group of 10 students struggles with poverty and develop hopes for the future in Gantong Village on the farming and tin mining island of Belitung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoiVrVK09K7GQfrTnRUcAclu3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22421'),
  ('593186109645362393', 'The Rainmaker', 1956, 'Romance, Western', 'Joseph Anthony, Charles Lang, Ralph Axness', 'N. Richard Nash', 'Burt Lancaster, Katharine Hepburn, Wendell Corey, Lloyd Bridges, Earl Holliman, Cameron Prud''Homme, Wallace Ford, Yvonne Lime', null, 'Lizzie Curry is on the verge of becoming a hopeless old maid. Her wit and intelligence and skills as a homemaker can''t make up for the fact that she''s just plain plain! Even the town sheriff, File, for whom she harbors a secrect yen, won''t take a chance --- until the town suffers a drought and into the lives of Lizzie and her brothers and father comes one Bill Starbuck ... profession: Rainmaker!', 'Lizzie Curry is on the verge of becoming a hopeless old maid. Her wit and intelligence and skills as a homemaker can''t make up for the fact that she''s just plain plain! Even the town sheriff, File, for whom she harbors a secrect yen, won''t take a chance --- until the town suffers a drought and into the lives of Lizzie and her brothers and father comes one Bill Starbuck ... profession: Rainmaker!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E2dmfh3e2LOKq0psiNXAGwtZGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43542'),
  ('98903389099764542', 'The Rainmaker', 1997, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Francis Ford Coppola, John Toll, David Kelley', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Michael Herr', 'Matt Damon, Claire Danes, Danny DeVito, Jon Voight, Mary Kay Place, Dean Stockwell, Mickey Rourke, Danny Glover', 'PG-13', 'Fresh out of law school and desperate for work, idealistic rookie Rudy Baylor takes on a powerful insurance company accused of denying a dying boy’s claim. Teaming up with a scrappy, unlicensed paralegal, he finds himself in a David-versus-Goliath courtroom battle that tests his ethics, courage, and belief in justice.', 'Fresh out of law school and desperate for work, idealistic rookie Rudy Baylor takes on a powerful insurance company accused of denying a dying boy’s claim. Teaming up with a scrappy, unlicensed paralegal, he finds himself in a David-versus-Goliath courtroom battle that tests his ethics, courage, and belief in justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twLGHXPjQtS8UyVGp5GXmhJiTM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11975'),
  ('921168739982306445', 'The Rains Came', 1939, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Clarence Brown, Arthur C. Miller', 'Julien Josephson, Philip Dunne', 'Myrna Loy, Tyrone Power, George Brent, Brenda Joyce, Nigel Bruce, Maria Ouspenskaya, Joseph Schildkraut, Mary Nash', 'NR', 'Indian aristocrat Rama Safti returns from medical training in the U.S. to give his life to the poor folk of Ranchipur. Lady Edwina and her drunken artist ex-lover Tom Ransome get in the way, but everyone shapes up when faced by earthquake, flooding, and plague.', 'Indian aristocrat Rama Safti returns from medical training in the U.S. to give his life to the poor folk of Ranchipur. Lady Edwina and her drunken artist ex-lover Tom Ransome get in the way, but everyone shapes up when faced by earthquake, flooding, and plague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQQcSrcnucDGDIXF0NmYd92tsdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115109'),
  ('504119777684398364', 'The Rains of Ranchipur', 1955, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco', 'Merle Miller', 'Lana Turner, Richard Burton, Fred MacMurray, Joan Caulfield, Michael Rennie, Eugenie Leontovich, Carlo Rizzo, Madge Kennedy', null, 'India. The spoilt and stubborn Edwina Esketh, comes to a small town with her husband. She falls in love with an indian doctor, Dr. Safti. She also meets an old friend of hers, the alcoholic Tom Ransome. An awful earthquake is followed by days of rain.', 'India. The spoilt and stubborn Edwina Esketh, comes to a small town with her husband. She falls in love with an indian doctor, Dr. Safti. She also meets an old friend of hers, the alcoholic Tom Ransome. An awful earthquake is followed by days of rain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1HiHDeE40NXIZ2YCXLQYPdp9WC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39695'),
  ('869110003227099859', 'The Rajasaab', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Maruthi Dasari, Kharthik Palani, Sai Kumar Pampana', 'Maruthi Dasari', 'Prabhas, Sanjay Dutt, Zarina Wahab, Nidhhi Agerwal, Malavika Mohanan, Riddhi Kumar, Boman Irani, Samuthirakani', null, 'Seeking his lost grandfather, a young man enters a haunted mansion and awakens a family curse powerful enough to upend both his life and reality.', 'Seeking his lost grandfather, a young man enters a haunted mansion and awakens a family curse powerful enough to upend both his life and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvK6gYa4diCnQkDVN42uoYXPrdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022453'),
  ('302659467320084507', 'The Rake''s Progress', 1945, 'Drama', 'Sidney Gilliat, Wilkie Cooper, Percy Hermes', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder', 'Rex Harrison, Lilli Palmer, Godfrey Tearle, Griffith Jones, Margaret Johnston, Guy Middleton, Jean Kent, Marie Lohr', null, 'Vivian Kenway, a young Englishman from an aristocratic background, flunks out of Oxford, and decides to use his considerable charm to achieve his goal of, apparently, making dissipation his career. His derelictions include seduction, betrayals of sweethearts, family and friends, and Marriage for money. All this with no signs of remorse or redemption, since his life as a completely unprincipled rake is quite enjoyable...for him, at least. Then, World War II breaks out and he is given a chance to die a heroic death for flag and country. Maybe.', 'Vivian Kenway, a young Englishman from an aristocratic background, flunks out of Oxford, and decides to use his considerable charm to achieve his goal of, apparently, making dissipation his career. His derelictions include seduction, betrayals of sweethearts, family and friends, and Marriage for money. All this with no signs of remorse or redemption, since his life as a completely unprincipled rake is quite enjoyable...for him, at least. Then, World War II breaks out and he is given a chance to die a heroic death for flag and country. Maybe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34zxPcBuYeLsiWqDVvuW35r0bUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147520'),
  ('874431712860910212', 'The Ramen Girl', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Allan Ackerman, Ed Licht, Carlo Siliotto', 'Becca Topol', 'Brittany Murphy, Tammy Blanchard, Gabriel Mann, Toshiyuki Nishida, Soji Arai, Kimiko Yo, Renji Ishibashi, Akiko Monou', 'PG-13', 'An American woman is stranded in Tokyo after breaking up with her boyfriend. Searching for direction in life, she trains to be a ramen chef under a tyrannical Japanese master.', 'An American woman is stranded in Tokyo after breaking up with her boyfriend. Searching for direction in life, she trains to be a ramen chef under a tyrannical Japanese master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sK7hW0quKwlYxP2urLirsDFPabD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18585'),
  ('130133809088835777', 'The Range Feud', 1931, 'Mystery, Western, Romance', 'D. Ross Lederman, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Milton Krims', 'Buck Jones, John Wayne, Susan Fleming, Harry Woods, Wallace MacDonald, Will Walling, Edward LeSaint, Frank Austin', 'NR', 'Clint Turner is arrested for the murder of his girlfriend Judy''s father, a rival rancher who was an enemy of his own father, and his best friend, Sheriff Buck Gordon sets out to find the real killer in the face of pressure for a quick lynching of Clint.', 'Clint Turner is arrested for the murder of his girlfriend Judy''s father, a rival rancher who was an enemy of his own father, and his best friend, Sheriff Buck Gordon sets out to find the real killer in the face of pressure for a quick lynching of Clint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k25UXiYOzsyavLNQNjhP8OxnjXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98413'),
  ('294539864549735986', 'The Ranger', 2018, 'Horror', 'Jenn Wexler, James Siewert', 'Giaco Furino, Jenn Wexler', 'Chloë Levine, Jeremy Holm, Granit Lahu, Jeremy Pope, Bubba Weiler, Amanda Grace Benitez, Ted Geoghegan, Larry Fessenden', 'NR', 'After a run-in with the cops at a punk show goes sideways, Chelsea and her pals flee the city in search of a place to lay low. Running to the security of an old, abandoned family cabin in the woods, they fall under the watchful eye of an overzealous park ranger who holds a secret from Chelsea''s past.', 'After a run-in with the cops at a punk show goes sideways, Chelsea and her pals flee the city in search of a place to lay low. Running to the security of an old, abandoned family cabin in the woods, they fall under the watchful eye of an overzealous park ranger who holds a secret from Chelsea''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcymKyUg50iQwB3LgZPfgUJcUHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503751'),
  ('373553675756021278', 'The Ranger, the Cook and a Hole in the Sky', 1995, 'Drama, Western, TV Movie', 'John Kent Harrison, Henry M. Lebo', null, 'Sam Elliott, Jerry O''Connell, Ricky Jay, Molly Parker, Don S. Davis, Robert Wisden, Michael Tayles, Tom Butler', null, 'A young ranger in the Montana wilderness discovers the great forces of nature while learning the importance of honor, trust and integrity. Legendary veteran ranger Bill Bell educates the young man and guides him toward manhood. The year is 1919-a time when being a ranger meant more than operating expensive equipment. Forest fires were fought with guts and courage, not chemicals and airplanes. Bill Bell was the toughest ranger in an elite crew of very rugged men. A figure of heroic proportions, he was generally feared and respected by all. It was even rumored that he had at one time killed a sheep farmer, which only fueled his already enormous reputation. The young ranger does everything to remain in the good graces of Bill Bell, the senior ranger he idolizes. Their tentative rapport grows into a friendship through a hilarious and heroic rite of passage in which the younger ranger meets the test-and the woman of his dreams.', 'A young ranger in the Montana wilderness discovers the great forces of nature while learning the importance of honor, trust and integrity. Legendary veteran ranger Bill Bell educates the young man and guides him toward manhood. The year is 1919-a time when being a ranger meant more than operating expensive equipment. Forest fires were fought with guts and courage, not chemicals and airplanes. Bill Bell was the toughest ranger in an elite crew of very rugged men. A figure of heroic proportions, he was generally feared and respected by all. It was even rumored that he had at one time killed a sheep farmer, which only fueled his already enormous reputation. The young ranger does everything to remain in the good graces of Bill Bell, the senior ranger he idolizes. Their tentative rapport grows into a friendship through a hilarious and heroic rite of passage in which the younger ranger meets the test-and the woman of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4GUo2bHhtjmJw8wCRyQzmNBx0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46942'),
  ('204532971436278408', 'The Ransom of Red Chief', 1998, 'Action, Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Western', 'Bob Clark, Stephen M. Katz', null, 'Christopher Lloyd, Michael Jeter, Alan Ruck, Kaitlin Hopkins, Brent Hinkley, Richard Riehle, Richard Moll, Brad Greenquist', null, 'Two hoboes strike on a get-rich quick scheme to kidnap an overly-energetic 9 year old son of a local banker. Based on the classic story by O. Henry.', 'Two hoboes strike on a get-rich quick scheme to kidnap an overly-energetic 9 year old son of a local banker. Based on the classic story by O. Henry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLlEz4BfrVwYcCs9d5PHzYzIVJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51268'),
  ('406086285758410964', 'The Rape After', 1984, 'Horror', 'Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Melvin Wong, Regina Tsang Hing-Yu, Shrila Chun Wai-Man, Teresa Ha Ping, Chan Yau-Hau, Robert Hung Law-Bat, Seung-Goon Yuk, Lui Tat', null, 'The figure of an evil genie is stolen by a photographer. At night the genie comes to life and rapes his girlfriend while both of them are drunk.', 'The figure of an evil genie is stolen by a photographer. At night the genie comes to life and rapes his girlfriend while both of them are drunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hukpZ6dYxhpHrjZM35QEGVNlwz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97812'),
  ('196681028731196907', 'The Rape of Europa', 2007, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Bonni Cohen, Richard Berge, Nicole Newnham', 'Bonni Cohen, Richard Berge, Nicole Newnham', 'Joan Allen', null, 'World War II was not just the most destructive conflict in humanity, it was also the greatest theft in history: lives, families, communities, property, culture and heritage were all stolen. The story of Nazi Germany''s plundering of Europe''s great works of art during World War II and Allied efforts to minimize the damage.', 'World War II was not just the most destructive conflict in humanity, it was also the greatest theft in history: lives, families, communities, property, culture and heritage were all stolen. The story of Nazi Germany''s plundering of Europe''s great works of art during World War II and Allied efforts to minimize the damage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAtPsP6gv2Fr1xz0cL6LD4CqjmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22905'),
  ('639944335059030924', 'The Rape of the Sabine', 1945, 'Comedy', 'Mario Bonnard, Gastone Bartolucci, Giuseppe La Torre', 'Mario Amendola, Mario Bonnard', 'Totò, Carlo Campanini, Clelia Matania, Laura Gore, Luisa Alliani, Olga Solbelli, Lia Corelli, Fosca Spadaro', null, 'Ernesto is the teacher of the village, he is married and he is dominated by his wife. He has the passion of the theatre and he has written a drama in verse named "Il ratto delle Sabine". Unfortunately he has only an admirer and she is their servant Rosina. When the touring company of Prof. Tromboni arrives in the village, Ernesto decides to let them perform his play, though anonymously. So the day arrives and the theatre is sadly empty. But when the news that the author is the teacher spreads far and wide...', 'Ernesto is the teacher of the village, he is married and he is dominated by his wife. He has the passion of the theatre and he has written a drama in verse named "Il ratto delle Sabine". Unfortunately he has only an admirer and she is their servant Rosina. When the touring company of Prof. Tromboni arrives in the village, Ernesto decides to let them perform his play, though anonymously. So the day arrives and the theatre is sadly empty. But when the news that the author is the teacher spreads far and wide...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSz8AUI4sn0jetXOkCbJkacbOJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74207'),
  ('1026718840667626797', 'The Rape of the Vampire', 1968, 'Horror', 'Jean Rollin, Guy Leblond', 'Alain Yves Beaujour', 'Solange Pradel, Bernard Letrou, Jacqueline Sieger, Catherine Deville, Ursule Pauly, Nicole Romain, Louise D''hour, Marquis Polho', null, 'After a psychoanalyst unsuccessfully tries to convince four sisters that they are not 200 year old vampires, the Queen of the Vampires promulgates the cause of the Undead.', 'After a psychoanalyst unsuccessfully tries to convince four sisters that they are not 200 year old vampires, the Queen of the Vampires promulgates the cause of the Undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUVP3VSbAkbCFXihkQFj6PCBVWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29790'),
  ('867939757726759876', 'The Rapsittie Street Kids: Believe in Santa', 2002, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Music', 'Kevin Saunders Hayes, Colin Slater, Joseph Brad Kluge', 'Trisha Koury, Colin Slater', 'Jack Angel, Jodi Benson, Nancy Cartwright, Grey DeLisle, Eddie Driscoll, Sarina C. Grant, Mark Hamill, Clint Howard', 'G', 'Ricky wants to give his crush Nicole a Christmas gift, but when he does she angrily rejects it as "cheap." She later regrets her mistake and decides to find it.', 'Ricky wants to give his crush Nicole a Christmas gift, but when he does she angrily rejects it as "cheap." She later regrets her mistake and decides to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5W1vFfqqscXYvVzr9WK6LG5C0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413817'),
  ('327834423132701636', 'The Rapture', 1991, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Bojan Bazelli, Michael Tolkin, Marcei A. Brubaker Brown', 'Michael Tolkin', 'Mimi Rogers, David Duchovny, Patrick Bauchau, Kimberly Cullum, Will Patton, Terri Hanauer, Dick Anthony Williams, James Le Gros', 'R', 'A lonely telephone operator leading an empty, amoral life finds God – only to have her faith continually tested in ways beyond what she could have imagined.', 'A lonely telephone operator leading an empty, amoral life finds God – only to have her faith continually tested in ways beyond what she could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EkFm13ecqO0eszr7OKT8vf1YjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1411'),
  ('272691893585986694', 'The Rapture', 2023, 'Drama', 'Vincent Prades, Sylvain Yonnet, Joanne Delachair', 'Iris Kaltenbäck', 'Hafsia Herzi, Alexis Manenti, Nina Meurisse, Younès Boucif, Radmila Karabatic, Ana Blagojević, Grégoire Didelot, Mathieu Perotto', null, 'Lydia, a midwife very invested in her work, is in the middle of a breakup.', 'Lydia, a midwife very invested in her work, is in the middle of a breakup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evcCra9puM8pkaWUTkYwuCEnb3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995757'),
  ('764452319273457326', 'The Rare Breed', 1966, 'Western', 'William H. Clothier, Andrew V. McLaglen, Terry Morse Jr.', 'Ric Hardman', 'James Stewart, Maureen O''Hara, Brian Keith, Juliet Mills, Don Galloway, David Brian, Jack Elam, Ben Johnson', 'NR', 'When her husband dies en route to America, Martha Price and her daughter Hilary are left to carry out his dream: the introduction of Hereford cattle into the American West. They enlist Sam "Bulldog" Burnett in their efforts to transport their lone bull, a Hereford named Vindicator, to a breeder in Texas, but the trail is fraught with danger and even Burnett doubts the survival potential of this "rare breed" of cattle.', 'When her husband dies en route to America, Martha Price and her daughter Hilary are left to carry out his dream: the introduction of Hereford cattle into the American West. They enlist Sam "Bulldog" Burnett in their efforts to transport their lone bull, a Hereford named Vindicator, to a breeder in Texas, but the trail is fraught with danger and even Burnett doubts the survival potential of this "rare breed" of cattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LJ3iQgvfScjM0PMk3fnpCl6HRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38800'),
  ('720756901604278104', 'The Raspberry Reich', 2004, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Bruce LaBruce, James Carman, Marco Volk', 'Bruce LaBruce', 'Susanne Sachße, Daniel Bätscher, Andreas Rupprecht, Dean Monroe, Anton Dickson, Sherry Vine, Ulrike Schirm, Stephan Dilschneider', 'NR', 'Gudrun has modeled her amateur German terrorist group after the 1970s Red Army Faction (Baader-Meinhof Gang). She attempts to imitate her heroes by kidnapping the son of a wealthy industrialist and hopes to negotiate leftist demands from the father. When Gudrun’s not spouting leftist verses (including during a hilariously brilliant fuck session), she’s trying to convince her all-male gang to abandon their heterosexuality, which she believes is the result of mass delusion.', 'Gudrun has modeled her amateur German terrorist group after the 1970s Red Army Faction (Baader-Meinhof Gang). She attempts to imitate her heroes by kidnapping the son of a wealthy industrialist and hopes to negotiate leftist demands from the father. When Gudrun’s not spouting leftist verses (including during a hilariously brilliant fuck session), she’s trying to convince her all-male gang to abandon their heterosexuality, which she believes is the result of mass delusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xv0crpl366W0OHPFHHpBFX8Sn5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27069'),
  ('402379950145466498', 'The Rat Catcher', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Wes Anderson, Guy Trevellyan, Tom Rye', 'Wes Anderson', 'Richard Ayoade, Ralph Fiennes, Rupert Friend, Eliel Ford, Benoît Herlin, Till Sennhenn', 'PG', 'In an English village, a reporter and a mechanic listen to a ratcatcher explain his clever plan to outwit his prey.', 'In an English village, a reporter and a mechanic listen to a ratcatcher explain his clever plan to outwit his prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29WJ7dOHt48AtXK1J1rONEEvIMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172674'),
  ('153351185104062652', 'The Rat Pack', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rob Cohen, Shane Hurlbut, Dodi Lee Rubenstein', 'Kario Salem', 'Ray Liotta, Joe Mantegna, Don Cheadle, Angus Macfadyen, William Petersen, Željko Ivanek, Bobby Slayton, Megan Dodds', 'R', 'After a brief flash-forward to Frank Sinatra as an old man, saying "I miss my guys," the movie''s main narrative begins during high points in the solo careers of the Rat Pack: Dean Martin has become a big success despite the breakup of his partnership with Jerry Lewis; Sinatra''s career is at its peak; Sammy Davis, Jr., is making a comeback after a near fatal car crash, and standup comic Joey Bishop is gaining exposure as an opening act for the other three. The Pack becomes complete when Sinatra reconciles with actor Peter Lawford, who has been ostracized since being seen out publicly with Sinatra''s ex-wife, Ava Gardner.', 'After a brief flash-forward to Frank Sinatra as an old man, saying "I miss my guys," the movie''s main narrative begins during high points in the solo careers of the Rat Pack: Dean Martin has become a big success despite the breakup of his partnership with Jerry Lewis; Sinatra''s career is at its peak; Sammy Davis, Jr., is making a comeback after a near fatal car crash, and standup comic Joey Bishop is gaining exposure as an opening act for the other three. The Pack becomes complete when Sinatra reconciles with actor Peter Lawford, who has been ostracized since being seen out publicly with Sinatra''s ex-wife, Ava Gardner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q720CdZKDSvYy4dux6lbfMOX1MA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25163'),
  ('419122015915353370', 'The Rat Race', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Mulligan, Robert Burks, Richard Caffey', 'Garson Kanin', 'Tony Curtis, Debbie Reynolds, Jack Oakie, Kay Medford, Don Rickles, Marjorie Bennett, Hal K. Dawson, Norman Fell', null, 'An aspiring musician arrives in New York in search of fame and fortune. He soon meets a taxi dancer, moves in with her, and before too long a romance develops.', 'An aspiring musician arrives in New York in search of fame and fortune. He soon meets a taxi dancer, moves in with her, and before too long a romance develops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acVCpz5YNwhRGb0j5G1jPy9HTm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121636'),
  ('158215353385288850', 'The Rat Savior', 1976, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Drama', 'Krsto Papić, Branko Lustig, Ivica Rajković', 'Krsto Papić, Zoran Tadić, Ivo Brešan', 'Ivica Vidović, Mirjana Majurec, Relja Bašić, Fabijan Šovagović, Ilija Ivezić, Branko Špoljar, Petar Dobrić, Edo Peročević', null, 'A poor writer discovers that a species of rats has banded together to impersonate humans and supplant them unnoticed, in a manner reminiscent of the transformations in Eugene Ionesco''s Rhinoceros, or the covert conspiracy of pod-people in The Invasion of the Body Snatchers. This film''s story is based on a book by the Soviet writer Alexander Grin.', 'A poor writer discovers that a species of rats has banded together to impersonate humans and supplant them unnoticed, in a manner reminiscent of the transformations in Eugene Ionesco''s Rhinoceros, or the covert conspiracy of pod-people in The Invasion of the Body Snatchers. This film''s story is based on a book by the Soviet writer Alexander Grin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4IJmmYNzO0nRkkGtavK8cweayb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169250'),
  ('980344095800293025', 'The Rati Horror Show', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Enrique Piñeyro, Pablo Tesoriere, Sol Lopatín', 'Enrique Piñeyro', 'Enrique Piñeyro, Andrés Bagg, Germán Cantore, Agustín Negrussi, Fernando Ariel Carrera', null, '"El Rati Horror Show" is a documentary that portrays the dramatic story of Fernando Ariel Carrera, the case of an ordinary man wrongly sentenced to thirty years in prison - not by mistake but deliberately - through the manipulation of a judicial case in Argentina. The film takes as its central point the way in which Fernando Carrera''s case was fabricated: the manipulation and alteration of evidence at the scene of the crime; the manipulation of all national media by Rubén Maugeri, key witness to the events and president of the Association of Friends of Commissary 34. On the other hand, it shows how Fernando Carrera leads his daily life in prison.', '"El Rati Horror Show" is a documentary that portrays the dramatic story of Fernando Ariel Carrera, the case of an ordinary man wrongly sentenced to thirty years in prison - not by mistake but deliberately - through the manipulation of a judicial case in Argentina. The film takes as its central point the way in which Fernando Carrera''s case was fabricated: the manipulation and alteration of evidence at the scene of the crime; the manipulation of all national media by Rubén Maugeri, key witness to the events and president of the Association of Friends of Commissary 34. On the other hand, it shows how Fernando Carrera leads his daily life in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKKEg1acnBRciDBFbzonGp5SaUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48245'),
  ('210319655435259024', 'The Ratings Game', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Tim Suhrstedt, Danny DeVito', 'Michael Barrie, Jim Mulholland', 'Danny DeVito, Rhea Perlman, Gerrit Graham, Bernadette Birkett, Barry Corbin, Louis Giambalvo, Ronny Graham, Huntz Hall', 'NR', 'A New Jersey trucker creates a hit TV show with help from his girlfriend in the ratings business.', 'A New Jersey trucker creates a hit TV show with help from his girlfriend in the ratings business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4IeHxPpbXnjvBYtwjuzBwqHhE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208614'),
  ('734542781955184862', 'The Rats', 2002, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'John Lafia, David Foreman', 'Frank Deasy', 'Mädchen Amick, Vincent Spano, Shawn Michael Howard, Daveigh Chase, David Fonteno, Sheila McCarthy, Elisa Moolecherry, Joe Pingue', null, 'A clan of evil rats overtakes a Manhattan department store and threatens to overrun the city.', 'A clan of evil rats overtakes a Manhattan department store and threatens to overrun the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XXsqPK8m8brdsFcPlgmVIbqVCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28594'),
  ('974193956187185667', 'The Rats Are Coming! The Werewolves Are Here!', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan, Grahame Steane', 'Andy Milligan', 'Hope Stansbury, Jackie Skarvellis, Noel Collins, Joan Ogden, Douglas Phair, Ian Innes, Berwick Kaler, Andy Milligan', 'PG', 'The daughter in a family of werewolves decides to put an end to the family curse.', 'The daughter in a family of werewolves decides to put an end to the family curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3yBTXt112FyMPMUIrur2aFaU9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74826'),
  ('344107458810105443', 'The Rats: A Witcher Tale', 2025, 'Fantasy, Drama, Adventure', 'Mairzee Almas, Trevor Michael Brown, Mark Walker', 'Haily Hall, Lauren Schmidt Hissrich', 'Christelle Elwin, Ben Radcliffe, Fabian McCallum, Aggy K. Adams, Connor Crawford, Juliette Alexandra, Dolph Lundgren, Ben Robson', 'R', 'To pull off a daring heist, a gang of six misfit outlaws will have to do something they''ve never done before: trust each other — and a washed-up Witcher.', 'To pull off a daring heist, a gang of six misfit outlaws will have to do something they''ve never done before: trust each other — and a washed-up Witcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1T0kO1cgR430AC9I6jurMOezKwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1571470'),
  ('1120029260799716669', 'The Rattle Rat', 1987, 'Crime, Action, Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Wim Verstappen', 'Rogier Proper, Wim Verstappen', 'Rijk de Gooyer, Peter Faber, Marc Klein Essink, Bernard Droog, Sacco van der Made, Marjan Berk, Annemieke Verdoorn, Hidde Maas', null, 'A rich Frisian farmer has been murdered in Amsterdam and police duo Grijpstra & De Gier are sent to investigate. Adjutant Grijpstra has problems at home again and is happy to leave for Friesland to investigate the murder. Sgt. De Gier finds the Frisian Hylke much more interesting than the murder case. In Leeuwarden there is a real Chinese war and a brutal robbery at the cattle market. Suddenly there is that friendly rattling, asthmatic rat who provides an unexpected solution.', 'A rich Frisian farmer has been murdered in Amsterdam and police duo Grijpstra & De Gier are sent to investigate. Adjutant Grijpstra has problems at home again and is happy to leave for Friesland to investigate the murder. Sgt. De Gier finds the Frisian Hylke much more interesting than the murder case. In Leeuwarden there is a real Chinese war and a brutal robbery at the cattle market. Suddenly there is that friendly rattling, asthmatic rat who provides an unexpected solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4n5VXX7M8Wvlt6fJLBtcEK9qyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96524'),
  ('306759129455366565', 'The Raven', 1935, 'Horror', 'Scott R. Beal, Charles J. Stumar, Victor Noerdlinger', 'David Boehm', 'Boris Karloff, Bela Lugosi, Lester Matthews, Irene Ware, Samuel S. Hinds, Spencer Charters, Inez Courtney, Ian Wolfe', null, 'A brilliant but deranged neurosurgeon becomes obsessively fixated on a judge''s daughter. With the help of an escaped criminal whose face he has surgically deformed, the mad man lures her, her father, and her fiancé to his isolated, castle-like home.', 'A brilliant but deranged neurosurgeon becomes obsessively fixated on a judge''s daughter. With the help of an escaped criminal whose face he has surgically deformed, the mad man lures her, her father, and her fiancé to his isolated, castle-like home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVMNfBvKe4XXxi4zrMytZ1c6ejO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17907'),
  ('948418942164032011', 'The Raven', 1951, 'Horror', 'Kurt Steinwendner', 'Wolfgang Kudrnofsky, Kurt Steinwendner', 'Leopold Rudolf, Margit Jergins', null, 'A short horror film based on Edgar Allan Poe''s poem The Raven.', 'A short horror film based on Edgar Allan Poe''s poem The Raven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPSaxvOkYYyguyZ0cXzD5ahQZB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225266'),
  ('912060722009979292', 'The Raven', 1963, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby, Jack Bohrer', 'Richard Matheson', 'Vincent Price, Peter Lorre, Boris Karloff, Hazel Court, Olive Sturgess, Jack Nicholson, John Dierkes, Connie Wallace', null, 'A magician who has been turned into a raven turns to a former sorcerer for help.', 'A magician who has been turned into a raven turns to a former sorcerer for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tt7m22ki1raa0NrvesawJgsQ4Jn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29056'),
  ('625054419094664661', 'The Raven', 2012, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'James McTeigue, Danny Ruhlmann, Frank Walsh', 'Hannah Shakespeare, Ben Livingston', 'John Cusack, Luke Evans, Alice Eve, Brendan Gleeson, Kevin McNally, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Jimmy Yuill, Pam Ferris', 'R', 'A fictionalized account of the last days of Edgar Allan Poe''s life, in which the poet is in pursuit of a serial killer whose murders mirror those in the writer''s stories.', 'A fictionalized account of the last days of Edgar Allan Poe''s life, in which the poet is in pursuit of a serial killer whose murders mirror those in the writer''s stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boE0JFhZRpWLLrKOQE6bCBZGerP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70436'),
  ('836688258509825815', 'The Raven', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Gregori J. Martin, Will Barratt', 'Gregori J. Martin, Edgar Allan Poe', 'Kristos Andrews, Victoria Baldesarra, Tony Todd, William deVry, Rae Dawn Chong', null, 'A grieving man haunted by the death of his beloved Annabel Lee spirals into madness when a mysterious raven appears, leading him on a nightmarish journey through guilt, supernatural encounters, and the eerie space between life and death.', 'A grieving man haunted by the death of his beloved Annabel Lee spirals into madness when a mysterious raven appears, leading him on a nightmarish journey through guilt, supernatural encounters, and the eerie space between life and death.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fe%2Fgracenote%2Fe8422aba85cef3c6de7d5eb61b4c422a.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-raven-2026'),
  ('1104320424838220546', 'The Ravine of Goodbye', 2013, 'Drama', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Ryo Otsuka, Megumu Sawada', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Ryo Takada', 'Yoko Maki, Shima Onishi, Arata Iura, Anne Suzuki, Hirofumi Arai, Mayu Tsuruta, Nao Omori, Jyo Hyuga', null, 'In a valley, with a dense growth of trees, a baby is killed. The baby''s mother Satomi is arrested as the prime suspect. The police also learn that Satomi is involved in a romantic relationship with her next door neighbor Ozaki. The information was provided by the neighbor''s lover Kanako.', 'In a valley, with a dense growth of trees, a baby is killed. The baby''s mother Satomi is arrested as the prime suspect. The police also learn that Satomi is involved in a romantic relationship with her next door neighbor Ozaki. The information was provided by the neighbor''s lover Kanako.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mobBM0bmzVh60mqrgb0o4CAkxMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199278'),
  ('335563748659100014', 'The Ravishing of Frank N. Stein', 1982, 'Animation, Mystery, Horror', 'Georges Schwizgebel', null, null, null, 'The slow construction of an image, to the rhythm of steps, ends when the monster meets his Bride.', 'The slow construction of an image, to the rhythm of steps, ends when the monster meets his Bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulHxnAv3VNLPyV7XI01CxKHsk5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227895'),
  ('839912924144002677', 'The Raw Ones', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Jack Hill, John Lamb, Robert Wilson', null, 'Ron Gans, Charlotte, Diane Webber, Cathy Crowfoot, Kellie Everts, Ann Richards', 'NR', 'Sun-kissed Floridians enjoy volleyball, jumping rope, trampolines, and relaxing in the sun.', 'Sun-kissed Floridians enjoy volleyball, jumping rope, trampolines, and relaxing in the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXToFmP7t1UYrCFbibASabJNHfT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120231'),
  ('402404183587925396', 'The Rawhide Years', 1956, 'Western', 'Irving Glassberg, Rudolph Maté, John Sherwood', 'Earl Felton', 'Tony Curtis, Colleen Miller, Arthur Kennedy, William Demarest, William Gargan, Peter van Eyck, Minor Watson, Donald Randolph', 'NR', 'Ben Matthews gives up the flashy life of a riverboat gambler, hoping to settle down in Galena with his girlfriend, luscious entertainer Zoe. But Galena''s leading citizen is murdered on the boat; Ben, on arrival, finds a lynch mob after his neck, and flees. Three years of wandering later, Zoe''s letters stop coming and Ben returns to find her and attempt the hopeless task of clearing himself.', 'Ben Matthews gives up the flashy life of a riverboat gambler, hoping to settle down in Galena with his girlfriend, luscious entertainer Zoe. But Galena''s leading citizen is murdered on the boat; Ben, on arrival, finds a lynch mob after his neck, and flees. Three years of wandering later, Zoe''s letters stop coming and Ben returns to find her and attempt the hopeless task of clearing himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31rdEDTgxhEBB7byc9D45wB7rwE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140849'),
  ('1055498897201838647', 'The Rays and Shadows', 2026, 'Drama, History, Family', 'Xavier Giannoli, Léo Bourdon, Mélaine Delaunay', 'Xavier Giannoli, Jacques Fieschi, Patrick Godeau', 'Jean Dujardin, Nastya Golubeva Carax, August Diehl, Olivier Chantreau, Anna Próchniak, Lucile Vignolles, Chloé Astor, Vincent Colombe', null, 'Jean and Otto, a French newspaperman and a young German Francophile, are fighting for peace in Europe. Jean’s daughter, Corinne, is launching a brilliant acting career in the film world, but war breaks out and France is occupied. The two friends have a major role to play in this new France. Jean becomes a big press baron and an ardent advocate of collaboration with the occupying forces, while Otto becomes the Reich’s ambassador in Paris. Corinne, meanwhile, finds herself thrown into the lion’s pit.', 'Jean and Otto, a French newspaperman and a young German Francophile, are fighting for peace in Europe. Jean’s daughter, Corinne, is launching a brilliant acting career in the film world, but war breaks out and France is occupied. The two friends have a major role to play in this new France. Jean becomes a big press baron and an ardent advocate of collaboration with the occupying forces, while Otto becomes the Reich’s ambassador in Paris. Corinne, meanwhile, finds herself thrown into the lion’s pit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZL29CVH0cYxN8IMtsj2jMpFJTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318335'),
  ('1080009678406418004', 'The Razor''s Edge', 1946, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edmund Goulding, Arthur C. Miller', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Tyrone Power, Gene Tierney, Herbert Marshall, Anne Baxter, Clifton Webb, John Payne, Lucile Watson, Frank Latimore', 'NR', 'An adventurous young man goes off to find himself and loses his socialite fiancée in the process. But when he returns 10 years later, she will stop at nothing to get him back, even though she is already married.', 'An adventurous young man goes off to find himself and loses his socialite fiancée in the process. But when he returns 10 years later, she will stop at nothing to get him back, even though she is already married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6UTn8J0dftf4YBID6qAf1UeZEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56135'),
  ('38483278635050695', 'The Razor''s Edge', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Byrum, Peter Hannan, Jennifer Shull', 'John Byrum, Bill Murray', 'Bill Murray, Theresa Russell, Catherine Hicks, Denholm Elliott, James Keach, Peter Vaughan, Brian Doyle-Murray, Stephen Davies', 'PG-13', 'An American WWI veteran undertakes a spiritual quest that takes him from Paris to Nepal to the Himalayas and back to his hometown. Upon his return, he discovers he is not the only one who has changed.', 'An American WWI veteran undertakes a spiritual quest that takes him from Paris to Nepal to the Himalayas and back to his hometown. Upon his return, he discovers he is not the only one who has changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBiw9KXH9agSgi4WhgVkFuEhYjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24453'),
  ('623448073970545227', 'The Re-Education of Molly Singer', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andy Palmer', 'Todd M. Friedman, Kevin Haskin', 'Britt Robertson, Ty Simpkins, Nico Santos, Cierra Ramirez, Holland Roden, Wendie Malick, Jaime Pressly, Jonathan Lipnicki', 'R', 'In college, attorney Molly Singer was the life of every party. Now, she''s about to be fired because she can''t leave her partying ways behind. Molly''s boss, Brenda, tells Molly there''s one way to save her job: re-enroll at her old alma mater, befriend Brenda''s socially awkward son, Elliot, and take him from zero to campus hero.', 'In college, attorney Molly Singer was the life of every party. Now, she''s about to be fired because she can''t leave her partying ways behind. Molly''s boss, Brenda, tells Molly there''s one way to save her job: re-enroll at her old alma mater, befriend Brenda''s socially awkward son, Elliot, and take him from zero to campus hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCF5HpbSjMELIYiV9aZKY9ka4Jq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856156'),
  ('337405111080177318', 'The Reader', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Daldry, Chris Menges, Roger Deakins', 'David Hare', 'Ralph Fiennes, Kate Winslet, David Kross, Lena Olin, Bruno Ganz, Jeanette Hain, Hannah Herzsprung, Karoline Herfurth', 'R', 'The story of Michael Berg, a German lawyer who, as a teenager in the late 1950s, had an affair with an older woman, Hanna, who then disappeared only to resurface years later as one of the defendants in a war crimes trial stemming from her actions as a concentration camp guard late in the war. He alone realizes that Hanna is illiterate and may be concealing that fact at the expense of her freedom.', 'The story of Michael Berg, a German lawyer who, as a teenager in the late 1950s, had an affair with an older woman, Hanna, who then disappeared only to resurface years later as one of the defendants in a war crimes trial stemming from her actions as a concentration camp guard late in the war. He alone realizes that Hanna is illiterate and may be concealing that fact at the expense of her freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0WURbmnhgKeBpHcpDULBgRedQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8055'),
  ('984625654387676708', 'The Reading', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Zane Nixon, Courtney Glaude, Lakisha R. Lemons', 'Courtney Glaude', 'Mo''Nique, Chasity Sereal, Denisha Hardeman, Ian Haywood, Mcauley Teters, Lisa Alavi, Charnele Brown, Cooper Helm', null, 'After a deadly home invasion, Emma (Mo''Nique Hicks) copes by writing a book, but when a young psychic and her team perform a reading in her home, a new terror is unleashed.', 'After a deadly home invasion, Emma (Mo''Nique Hicks) copes by writing a book, but when a young psychic and her team perform a reading in her home, a new terror is unleashed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqeTY6g1ZTT7mkrvlSCiVgft8Wr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081694'),
  ('233964541065075132', 'The Real Blonde', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tom DiCillo, Frank Prinzi', 'Tom DiCillo', 'Matthew Modine, Catherine Keener, Daryl Hannah, Maxwell Caulfield, Elizabeth Berkley, Marlo Thomas, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, Buck Henry', 'R', 'An aspiring actor and his girlfriend handle life''s frustrations, while his friend seeks fulfillment with a blonde.', 'An aspiring actor and his girlfriend handle life''s frustrations, while his friend seeks fulfillment with a blonde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJucBNGwwTT4n4pSHU1b44nyju4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29825'),
  ('399923467220785252', 'The Real Bruce Lee', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Jim Markovic, Kim Si Hyeon', 'Dick Randall, Serafim Karalexis, Larry Dolgin', 'Dragon Lee', 'NR', 'The Real Bruce Lee is a martial arts documentary. It begins with a brief biography of Bruce Lee, and shows scenes from four of his childhood films, Bad Boy, Orphan Sam, Kid Cheung, and The Carnival, each sepia-toned and dubbed to English. Next, there is a three-minute highlight reel of Lee imitator Bruce Li. Finally, there is a feature-length film starring Lee imitator Dragon Lee, which is obviously modeled after Bruce Lee''s Fist of Fury.', 'The Real Bruce Lee is a martial arts documentary. It begins with a brief biography of Bruce Lee, and shows scenes from four of his childhood films, Bad Boy, Orphan Sam, Kid Cheung, and The Carnival, each sepia-toned and dubbed to English. Next, there is a three-minute highlight reel of Lee imitator Bruce Li. Finally, there is a feature-length film starring Lee imitator Dragon Lee, which is obviously modeled after Bruce Lee''s Fist of Fury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ml3CHC5CflbRura07Blmov1GQg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54844'),
  ('157730100914050255', 'The Real Cancun', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Rick de Oliveira, Michael Applebaum', 'Brian Caldirola', 'Benjamin Fletcher, Nicole Frilot, Roxanne Frilot, David Ingber, Jeremy Jazwinski, Amber Madison, Paul Malbry, Marquita Marshall', 'R', 'Sixteen American college students drink, flirt, fight and canoodle during their Spring Break vacation in Cancun, Mexico.', 'Sixteen American college students drink, flirt, fight and canoodle during their Spring Break vacation in Cancun, Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyLs32hfhfShhHPJ8h8VzAash55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19153'),
