  ('823144941379832809', 'The Real Glory', 1939, 'Drama, War', 'Henry Hathaway, Richard Talmadge, Edmond F. Bernoudy', 'Robert Presnell Sr., Jo Swerling', 'Gary Cooper, David Niven, Andrea Leeds, Reginald Owen, Broderick Crawford, Kay Johnson, Russell Hicks, Vladimir Sokoloff', 'NR', 'Fort Mysang, southern Philippine Islands, under US rule, 1906. A small group of army officers and native troops resist the fierce and treacherous attacks of the ruthless Alisang and his fanatical followers.', 'Fort Mysang, southern Philippine Islands, under US rule, 1906. A small group of army officers and native troops resist the fierce and treacherous attacks of the ruthless Alisang and his fanatical followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWUlNt585JRfFNBFdYGrfBGO7GS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111750'),
  ('166090269430001387', 'The Real Life of Teachers', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuel Klotz, Albert Pereira-Lazaro', 'Alexandre Jardin, Emmanuel Klotz, Albert Pereira-Lazaro', 'Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Audrey Fleurot, Emir Seghir, Sami Bouzid, Victoire Poupon, Maëva Arnoux, Enzo Vallejos-Celotto, Jessica Errero', null, 'A comedy about a band of voyeuristic students who take their jobs at the school paper to extremes, deciding to uncover the real lives of their teachers.', 'A comedy about a band of voyeuristic students who take their jobs at the school paper to extremes, deciding to uncover the real lives of their teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4jNOqzhJt1DYbx7M3MnIB31twK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169025'),
  ('798698383240591214', 'The Real Macaw', 1998, 'Adventure, Family', 'Mario Andreacchio, David Foreman', 'Bruce Hancock, Matthew Perry', 'Jamie Croft, Deborra-Lee Furness, Joe Petruzzi, John Waters, Jason Robards, John Goodman, Gerry Connolly, Robert Coleby', null, 'An ancient talking macaw named Mac becomes the saving grace for an elderly man threatened with a nursing home, when it is discovered that the talking bird knows the whereabouts of a buried treasure from its days with a pirate. His grandson decides to go off on the hunt only to discover that a resort now exists where the treasure is buried.', 'An ancient talking macaw named Mac becomes the saving grace for an elderly man threatened with a nursing home, when it is discovered that the talking bird knows the whereabouts of a buried treasure from its days with a pirate. His grandson decides to go off on the hunt only to discover that a resort now exists where the treasure is buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubZOcacH6kqr3tiox4BNtgWVEQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91133'),
  ('699731741962175965', 'The Real McCoy', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Denis Crossan, Russell Mulcahy, Dick Ziker', 'William Davies', 'Kim Basinger, Val Kilmer, Terence Stamp, David Dwyer, Gailard Sartain, Raynor Scheine, Andy Stahl, Deborah Hobart', 'PG-13', 'Karen McCoy is released from prison with nothing but the clothes on her back. Before being incarcerated, Karen was the bank robber of her time, but now she wishes for nothing more than to settle down and start a new life. Unfortunately, between a dirty parole officer, old business partners, and an idiot ex, she will have to do the unthinkable in order to save her son.', 'Karen McCoy is released from prison with nothing but the clothes on her back. Before being incarcerated, Karen was the bank robber of her time, but now she wishes for nothing more than to settle down and start a new life. Unfortunately, between a dirty parole officer, old business partners, and an idiot ex, she will have to do the unthinkable in order to save her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sZTcKhLRNp07cVoqgcMZoK9Noo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2047'),
  ('1051400236037589632', 'The Real Thing', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Koji Fukada, Kosuke Haruki', 'Koji Fukada, Shintaro Mitani', 'Win Morisaki, Kaho Tsuchimura, Shohei Uno, Kei Ishibashi, Akari Fukunaga, Shugo Oshinari, Yukiya Kitamura', null, 'Kazumichi Tsuji is a bored office worker in questionable relationships with two women at work. One day he meets the intriguing Ukiyo Hayama at a convenience store. However, having her in his life brings nothing but trouble.', 'Kazumichi Tsuji is a bored office worker in questionable relationships with two women at work. One day he meets the intriguing Ukiyo Hayama at a convenience store. However, having her in his life brings nothing but trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1d1oDDbY5VUZ2zCJwTIk37si9Le.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712172'),
  ('737376916722365175', 'The Reality', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Triana, Carlos Andrés Vallejo, Daniel Moure', 'Dago García', 'Alejandro González, Verónica Orozco, Luis Eduardo Arango, María Irene Toro, Kevin Bury, Diego Garzón, Patricia Tamayo, Jorge Enrique Abello', null, 'The story of an upperclass guy that finds himself singing popular music in a reality show against his friends and family''s endorsement.', 'The story of an upperclass guy that finds himself singing popular music in a reality show against his friends and family''s endorsement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7CFeXsPzlX0STLkxS6vgbLEduC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553795'),
  ('1026936405508902268', 'The Reality of Love', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Larry, Tony Westman, Richard Coleman', 'Chad Hodge', 'Jason Priestley, Bradley Cooper, Emma Caulfield, Mark L. Walberg, Paige Jones, Nicole Oliver, Lauren Lee Smith, Leah Cairns', 'PG', 'Ryan Banks''s manager and old friend, Todd, comes up with the idea to have Ryan be the bachelor on a reality dating show in order to clean up his image. The only problem is, Todd falls in love with Charlie, the girl Ryan has chosen to propose to.', 'Ryan Banks''s manager and old friend, Todd, comes up with the idea to have Ryan be the bachelor on a reality dating show in order to clean up his image. The only problem is, Todd falls in love with Charlie, the girl Ryan has chosen to propose to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlXVkHPwCQxaMqEgtsYXExwxKIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82134'),
  ('590310534414664750', 'The Realm', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Alejandro de Pablo', 'Isabel Peña, Rodrigo Sorogoyen', 'Antonio de la Torre, Josep Maria Pou, Mónica López, Bárbara Lennie, Nacho Fresneda, Ana Wagener, Luis Zahera, Francisco Reyes', null, 'Manuel, a Spanish politician whose high-class lifestyle is based on nefarious and illegal business threatens to break his entire party after a newspaper exposes him to the public eye. Rather than admit to any wrongdoing, he decides to sell out his whole party in an effort to avoid jail time. It''s a decision that will put many lives at risk.', 'Manuel, a Spanish politician whose high-class lifestyle is based on nefarious and illegal business threatens to break his entire party after a newspaper exposes him to the public eye. Rather than admit to any wrongdoing, he decides to sell out his whole party in an effort to avoid jail time. It''s a decision that will put many lives at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C4rnA6r7myYdJBgeZLgCvy5RPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517331'),
  ('262824380412720604', 'The Realm of Fortune', 1986, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Blanca Guerra, Alejandro Parodi, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Socorro Avelar, Juan Antonio Llanes, Carlos Cardán, Loló Navarro', null, 'Poor Dionisio finds himself as recipient of the good fortune, but soon he forgets that everything that goes up also has to go down, and that in the depressing nothingness of his town it is easy to die.', 'Poor Dionisio finds himself as recipient of the good fortune, but soon he forgets that everything that goes up also has to go down, and that in the depressing nothingness of his town it is easy to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLwyHyOCKOX1pqBHkOm20Uh4Dxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268641'),
  ('425950102895800612', 'The Reaping', 2007, 'Horror', 'Stephen Hopkins, Peter Levy, Cliff Lanning', 'Carey Hayes, Chad Hayes', 'Hilary Swank, David Morrissey, Idris Elba, AnnaSophia Robb, Stephen Rea, William Ragsdale, John McConnell, David Jensen', 'R', 'Katherine Morrissey, a former Christian missionary, lost her faith after the tragic deaths of her family. Now she applies her expertise to debunking religious phenomena. When a series of biblical plagues overrun a small town, Katherine arrives to prove that a supernatural force is not behind the occurrences, but soon finds that science cannot explain what is happening. Instead, she must regain her faith to combat the evil that waits in a Louisiana swamp.', 'Katherine Morrissey, a former Christian missionary, lost her faith after the tragic deaths of her family. Now she applies her expertise to debunking religious phenomena. When a series of biblical plagues overrun a small town, Katherine arrives to prove that a supernatural force is not behind the occurrences, but soon finds that science cannot explain what is happening. Instead, she must regain her faith to combat the evil that waits in a Louisiana swamp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8Vl4Vxp5LBth9J6Aa3k6PAefxt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1683'),
  ('410970931642522501', 'The Reason I Jump', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jerry Rothwell, Ruben Woodin Dechamps', null, 'Jordan O''Donegan, David Mitchell, Donna Budway, Emma Budway, Jeremy Dear, Joss Dear, Aarti Khurana, Amrit Khurana', null, 'Based on the book by Naoki Higashida, filmmaker Jerry Rothwell examines the lives of five non-speaking, autistic youngsters.', 'Based on the book by Naoki Higashida, filmmaker Jerry Rothwell examines the lives of five non-speaking, autistic youngsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWbwt0wnE00JH9R4RRmbDxUkIHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653758'),
  ('127922018943928517', 'The Reasons of the Heart', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Arturo Ripstein', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Arcelia Ramírez, Vladimir Cruz, Plutarco Haza, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Alejandro Suárez, Pilar Padilla, Paola Arroyo, Carlos Chávez', null, 'In a reinterpretation of Madame Bovary set on contemporary Mexico City, Emilia, a middle class housewife, tries to deal with the monotony of her life. One day, she loses the two things which makes everything beareable: her lover and her credit card.', 'In a reinterpretation of Madame Bovary set on contemporary Mexico City, Emilia, a middle class housewife, tries to deal with the monotony of her life. One day, she loses the two things which makes everything beareable: her lover and her credit card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qC36rMLEbA69rnHUPZQyHaInvQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85459'),
  ('805761113827742742', 'The Rebel', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Robert Day', 'Ray Galton, Alan Simpson', 'Tony Hancock, George Sanders, Dennis Price, John Le Mesurier, Irene Handl, Paul Massie, Marie Devereux, Margit Saad', null, 'Anthony Hancock gives up his office job to become an abstract artist. He has a lot of enthusiasm, but little talent, and critics scorn his work. Nevertheless, he impresses an emerging very talented artist. Hancock proceeds to con the art world into thinking he is a genius.', 'Anthony Hancock gives up his office job to become an abstract artist. He has a lot of enthusiasm, but little talent, and critics scorn his work. Nevertheless, he impresses an emerging very talented artist. Hancock proceeds to con the art world into thinking he is a genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYNZa2iMbN2HTNVEcJMo0dEBDMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87977'),
  ('261664035344129909', 'The Rebel Intruders', 1980, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Wu Yao-Shen, Chiang Sheng', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Lu Feng, Sun Chien, Wong Lik, Phillip Kwok Chui, Lo Meng, Chiang Sheng, Chui Shing-Chan, Chen Shu-Chi', null, 'China is ripped apart by a civil war, and thousands of displaced refugees swarm into towns not yet ravaged by war. Three such refugees arrive in one town. They join forces with local rebel leaders to escape to the south before getting into trouble with Lu Feng who is out to exterminate all rebels.', 'China is ripped apart by a civil war, and thousands of displaced refugees swarm into towns not yet ravaged by war. Three such refugees arrive in one town. They join forces with local rebel leaders to escape to the south before getting into trouble with Lu Feng who is out to exterminate all rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tl7MAc6jy3U8S8jmGGtzxBa72ly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68107'),
  ('861671602135075043', 'The Rebel Novice', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Tizuka Yamasaki', 'Renato Aragão, Emanuel Rodrigues, Expedito Faggioni', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Tony Ramos, Patricia Pillar, Sandy, Junior Lima, Luma de Oliveira, Cláudio Corrêa e Castro', null, 'The troubled adventures of a country novice who goes to the big city to work as a nanny, taking care of the young and rebel sons of a widow businessman.', 'The troubled adventures of a country novice who goes to the big city to work as a nanny, taking care of the young and rebel sons of a widow businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2mNObUhU3DJXyQtDL1ZsKsiScv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254384'),
  ('114222646220136079', 'The Rebel Set', 1959, 'Drama', 'Gene Fowler Jr.', 'Bernard Girard, Louis Vittes', 'Gregg Palmer, Kathleen Crowley, Edward Platt, John Lupton, Don Sullivan, Ned Glass, Robert Shayne, I. Stanford Jolley', 'NR', 'Three beatniks are brought together to rob an armored car, only to face betrayal from amongst their ranks.', 'Three beatniks are brought together to rob an armored car, only to face betrayal from amongst their ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jZthaY0XP00ZkpX9lmPFY0F5Yo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127186'),
  ('58587601155557608', 'The Rebound', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bart Freundlich, Jonathan Freeman', 'Bart Freundlich', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Justin Bartha, Art Garfunkel, Joanna Gleason, Lynn Whitfield, Andrew Cherry, Kate Jennings Grant, Rob Kerkovich', 'R', 'Upon discovering her husband''s infidelity, Sandy leaves the suburbs and moves into the city. There, she befriends Aram, a guy whose wife only married him so she could get a green card. Sandy hires Aram to be her nanny, and it isn''t long until Aram and Sandy find out they get along wonderfully and start to date. But is their relationship real or is it, in fact, just a rebound for both of them?', 'Upon discovering her husband''s infidelity, Sandy leaves the suburbs and moves into the city. There, she befriends Aram, a guy whose wife only married him so she could get a green card. Sandy hires Aram to be her nanny, and it isn''t long until Aram and Sandy find out they get along wonderfully and start to date. But is their relationship real or is it, in fact, just a rebound for both of them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j82RTG8dNyOYhIKspjk5Z0bEmdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24122'),
  ('942489491482461583', 'The Recall', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jesse Nelson, Ryan Carlsen, Trevor Cunningham', 'Reggie Keyohara III, Sam Action King', 'Wesley Snipes, RJ Mitte, Jedidiah Goodacre, Laura Bilgeri, Niko Pepaj, Hannah Rose May, Scott Nettleton, Sean Millington', 'R', 'When five friends vacation at a remote lake house, they expect nothing less then a good time, unaware that Earth is under attack by an alien invasion and mass-abductions.', 'When five friends vacation at a remote lake house, they expect nothing less then a good time, unaware that Earth is under attack by an alien invasion and mass-abductions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2sQAzHavtot2brA42pHXKgf3ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455551'),
  ('431934788399823985', 'The Recipe', 2010, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Lee Suh-goon, Na Hui-seok', 'Jang Jin, Lee Suh-goon', 'Lee Yo-won, Ryu Seung-ryong, Yoo Seung-mok, Cho Seong-ha, Lee Dong-wook, Nam Jung-hee, Kim Se-dong, Lee Yong-nyeo', null, 'A man on death-row wants to taste "doenjang jjigae" (a spicy Korean bean paste stew) before he dies. Television producer Choi Yu-Jin hears of the inmate and researches his story for an upcoming news report. Choi Yu-Jin then comes across a mysterious woman named Jang Hye-Jin who makes doenjang jjigae that brings tears of joy to those who tastes her recipe. As Choi Yu-Jin delves further, he learns of Jang Hye-Jin''s heart breaking relationship with Kim Hyun-Soo.', 'A man on death-row wants to taste "doenjang jjigae" (a spicy Korean bean paste stew) before he dies. Television producer Choi Yu-Jin hears of the inmate and researches his story for an upcoming news report. Choi Yu-Jin then comes across a mysterious woman named Jang Hye-Jin who makes doenjang jjigae that brings tears of joy to those who tastes her recipe. As Choi Yu-Jin delves further, he learns of Jang Hye-Jin''s heart breaking relationship with Kim Hyun-Soo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSGhY8sK0ccgPem3KslZbVb7iQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58286'),
  ('1040978534922533661', 'The Reckless Moment', 1949, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Burnett Guffey, Max Ophüls, Morris Stoloff', 'Robert Soderberg, Henry Garson', 'James Mason, Joan Bennett, Geraldine Brooks, Henry O''Neill, Shepperd Strudwick, David Bair, Roy Roberts, Jessie Arnold', 'NR', 'After discovering the dead body of her teenage daughter''s lover, a housewife takes desperate measures to protect her family from scandal.', 'After discovering the dead body of her teenage daughter''s lover, a housewife takes desperate measures to protect her family from scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvGt1gbQt7g5vUzJrZU2qWQNEqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28007'),
  ('446473654855265915', 'The Reckoning', 1970, 'Drama', 'Jack Gold, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'John McGrath', 'Nicol Williamson, Rachel Roberts, Paul Rogers, Zena Walker, Ann Bell, Joby Blanshard, J.G. Devlin, Barbara Ewing', 'R', 'Michael Marler, a successful businessman in London, is about to make his way to the top. After 37 years, the death of his father brings him back to his hometown of Liverpool, where he’s confronted with his lost Irish roots. He finds out that his father died in a fight with some Anglo-Saxon teddy boys. It becomes a matter of honour for him to take his revenge without involving the police.', 'Michael Marler, a successful businessman in London, is about to make his way to the top. After 37 years, the death of his father brings him back to his hometown of Liverpool, where he’s confronted with his lost Irish roots. He finds out that his father died in a fight with some Anglo-Saxon teddy boys. It becomes a matter of honour for him to take his revenge without involving the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8CKiZbJEoRakx5C5YeBg9FBgkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153641'),
  ('733669830464597150', 'The Reckoning', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Paul McGuigan, Peter Sova, John Ralph', 'Mark Mills', 'Paul Bettany, Willem Dafoe, Tom Hardy, Brian Cox, Simon McBurney, Luke de Woolfson, Gina McKee, Vincent Cassel', null, 'In 14th Century England, this tale of murder and mystery follows a fugitive priest who falls in with a troupe of actors. As they arrive in a small town, the actors encounter a woman being sentenced to death for practicing witchcraft and murder. Discarding the expected bible stories, the actors now stage a performance based on the crime. Through the performance of the play, they discover a mystery.', 'In 14th Century England, this tale of murder and mystery follows a fugitive priest who falls in with a troupe of actors. As they arrive in a small town, the actors encounter a woman being sentenced to death for practicing witchcraft and murder. Discarding the expected bible stories, the actors now stage a performance based on the crime. Through the performance of the play, they discover a mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pv2ocoAR3b4TJ4oGQMIy1CJx2wQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25935'),
  ('426442038821038061', 'The Reckoning', 2021, 'Horror, Drama', 'Norbert Nagy, Andor Berényi, Ádám Kolos', 'Neil Marshall, Edward Evers-Swindell, Charlotte Kirk', 'Charlotte Kirk, Sean Pertwee, Steven Waddington, Joe Anderson, Suzanne Magowan, Ian Whyte, Callum Goulden, Sarah Lambie', null, 'In the aftermath of the Great Plague and amidst the subsequent witch-hunts against women, a young widow grapples with the tragic death of her husband in a society completely consumed by fear and death. Because she rejects the advances of her landlord, she is falsely accused of being a witch and thrown in jail for a crime she didn’t commit. She must endure physical persecution at the hands of England’s most ruthless witch-hunter and face her own inner demons as the devil himself starts to work his way into her mind.', 'In the aftermath of the Great Plague and amidst the subsequent witch-hunts against women, a young widow grapples with the tragic death of her husband in a society completely consumed by fear and death. Because she rejects the advances of her landlord, she is falsely accused of being a witch and thrown in jail for a crime she didn’t commit. She must endure physical persecution at the hands of England’s most ruthless witch-hunter and face her own inner demons as the devil himself starts to work his way into her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7P5DqW1wDNpX2Ug0kAFKJSL7bX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587130'),
  ('1064708182378658010', 'The Reconquest', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jonás Trueba', 'Jonás Trueba', 'Francesco Carril, Itsaso Arana, Aura Garrido, Candela Recio, Pablo Hoyos', null, 'Manuela and Olmo meet in a future as they had promised fifteen years earlier as teenagers, when they lived their first love. Based on this romantic situation, La Reconquista is in fact a film on a quest for time; or about the awareness of time: of time lost and time recovered; about what we remember about ourselves and what we don''t remember; about the words, gestures and feelings to which we remain faithful, because they define and compel us today, yesterday and tomorrow.', 'Manuela and Olmo meet in a future as they had promised fifteen years earlier as teenagers, when they lived their first love. Based on this romantic situation, La Reconquista is in fact a film on a quest for time; or about the awareness of time: of time lost and time recovered; about what we remember about ourselves and what we don''t remember; about the words, gestures and feelings to which we remain faithful, because they define and compel us today, yesterday and tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8l1F4ZmwAePt5hzYSwy94r63xFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410970'),
  ('643117198045667666', 'The Reconstruction', 2013, 'Drama', 'Juan Taratuto', 'Diego Peretti, Juan Taratuto', 'Diego Peretti, Claudia Fontán, Alfredo Casero, María Casali, Eugenia Aguilar, Ariel Pérez de María', null, 'Eduardo is an obsessive and efficient oil plant worker who finds his solitary routine is altered when summoned to travel to Ushuaia for a few days. The trip and reunion with an old friend and his family tested and make something in it is in motion allowing you rebuild your past, present and maybe the future.', 'Eduardo is an obsessive and efficient oil plant worker who finds his solitary routine is altered when summoned to travel to Ushuaia for a few days. The trip and reunion with an old friend and his family tested and make something in it is in motion allowing you rebuild your past, present and maybe the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KflVPGjnhYqa9u1zpAn1qewEaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226033'),
  ('565805516421573904', 'The Record', 2000, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jong-seok Kim, Gi-hun Kim, Chung Chung-hoon', 'Chang-hak Han', 'Kang Sung-min, Park Eun-hye, Ahn Jae-hwan, Jung Min, Choi Hyun, Han Chae-young, Lee Young-ho, Uhm Ji-won', null, 'A group of students attempt to make a phoney "snuff" film but accidentally kill an innocent peer. They dispose of the body without anyone learning of the incident. A year later, comeuppance is provided by a mysterious man with murderous intent who hunts down everyone complicit in the cover up of the prank gone wrong.', 'A group of students attempt to make a phoney "snuff" film but accidentally kill an innocent peer. They dispose of the body without anyone learning of the incident. A year later, comeuppance is provided by a mysterious man with murderous intent who hunts down everyone complicit in the cover up of the prank gone wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sD4grmKAgtFLEsjSAGQOKGqg4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128167'),
  ('911157002554531569', 'The Recorder Exam', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kangyu Ga-ram, Kim Bora, Kim Gu-young', 'Kim Bora', 'Hwang Jeong-one, Park Myung-shin, Jeong In-gi, Cha Ah-reum, Ji Hwan-jun, Kim Eun-jung', null, 'Nine-year old Eunhee anxiously prepares for her recorder exam as she struggles to find a place within her own family.', 'Nine-year old Eunhee anxiously prepares for her recorder exam as she struggles to find a place within her own family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5njOPo9ZuKkoqqNbiWTgOZhQB11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558432'),
  ('974415865245529955', 'The Recruit', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Roger Donaldson, Stuart Dryburgh, Jeff J.J. Authors', 'Mitch Glazer, Roger Towne, Kurt Wimmer', 'Colin Farrell, Al Pacino, Bridget Moynahan, Gabriel Macht, Karl Pruner, Eugene Lipinski, Mike Realba, Domenico Fiore', 'PG-13', 'A brilliant CIA trainee must prove his worth at the Farm, the agency''s secret training grounds, where he learns to watch his back and trust no one.', 'A brilliant CIA trainee must prove his worth at the Farm, the agency''s secret training grounds, where he learns to watch his back and trust no one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xInKytrHV3EJeCAulOpn5Q0bMxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1647'),
  ('525614617070619895', 'The Red and the Black', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe, Gérard Vigneron', 'Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe', 'Carole Bouquet, Kim Rossi Stuart, Judith Godrèche, Claude Rich, Bernard Verley, Constanze Engelbrecht, Francesco Acquaroli, Maurice Garrel', null, 'In 1827, Berthet, the son of a craftsman and a young seminarian, was tried and sentenced to death for murdering his former mistress, the wife of a noble who had hired him as tutor to his children.', 'In 1827, Berthet, the son of a craftsman and a young seminarian, was tried and sentenced to death for murdering his former mistress, the wife of a noble who had hired him as tutor to his children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di0xd1iXsJwg4IT99jQGVT2eas5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58090'),
  ('530236602970857593', 'The Red and the Blue', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Roberto Cimatti, Giuseppe Piccioni', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Francesca Manieri', 'Margherita Buy, Riccardo Scamarcio, Roberto Herlitzka, Lucia Mascino, Davide Giordano, Nina Torresi, Silvia D''Amico, Elena Lietti', null, 'In a Roman high school, a jaded art professor who lost the spark for the job clashes with an ex pupil of his, an adjunct literature teacher who is trying to rescue an eccentric and rebellious student, while the stern headmistress deals with a student from a difficult background.', 'In a Roman high school, a jaded art professor who lost the spark for the job clashes with an ex pupil of his, an adjunct literature teacher who is trying to rescue an eccentric and rebellious student, while the stern headmistress deals with a student from a difficult background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLdPmXwMrTvL9ncSsle4JaABVem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133788'),
  ('1130623596557127313', 'The Red and the White', 1967, 'War, Drama', 'Miklós Jancsó, Zsolt Kézdi-Kovács, Lilja Kelstein', 'Miklós Jancsó, Valeriy Karen, Luca Karall', 'József Madaras, Tibor Molnár, András Kozák, Juhász Jácint, Anatoli Yabbarov, Sergey Nikonenko, Mikhail Kozakov, Tatyana Konyukhova', null, 'In 1919, Hungarian Communists aid the Bolsheviks'' defeat of Czarists, the Whites. Near the Volga, a monastery and a field hospital are held by one side and then the other.', 'In 1919, Hungarian Communists aid the Bolsheviks'' defeat of Czarists, the Whites. Near the Volga, a monastery and a field hospital are held by one side and then the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksoCAQDpcQl4gmkL9IGdtFCQGnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52885'),
  ('577324204628315740', 'The Red Badge of Courage', 1951, 'War', 'John Huston, Ridgeway Callow, Andrew Marton', 'Albert Band, John Huston', 'Audie Murphy, Bill Mauldin, Douglas Dick, Royal Dano, John Dierkes, Arthur Hunnicutt, Tim Durant, Andy Devine', 'NR', 'Henry Fleming is a young Union soldier in the American Civil War. During his unit''s first engagement, Henry flees the battlefield in fear. When he learns that the Union actually won the battle, shame over his cowardice leads him to lie to his friend Tom and the other soldiers, saying that he had been injured in battle. However, when he learns that his unit will be leading a charge against the enemy, Henry takes the opportunity to face his fears and redeem himself.', 'Henry Fleming is a young Union soldier in the American Civil War. During his unit''s first engagement, Henry flees the battlefield in fear. When he learns that the Union actually won the battle, shame over his cowardice leads him to lie to his friend Tom and the other soldiers, saying that he had been injured in battle. However, when he learns that his unit will be leading a charge against the enemy, Henry takes the opportunity to face his fears and redeem himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7Zll2a82pffazYQ0ssXhbDZQtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59401'),
  ('242141204863365451', 'The Red Ball Express', 1952, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Budd Boetticher, Maury Gertsman, Joseph Gershenson', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Jeff Chandler, Alex Nicol, Charles Drake, Judith Braun, Sidney Poitier, Jacqueline Duval, Bubber Johnson, Davis Roberts', 'NR', 'August 1944: proceeding with the invasion of France, Patton''s Third Army has advanced so far toward Paris that it cannot be supplied. To keep up the momentum, Allied HQ establishes an elite military truck route.', 'August 1944: proceeding with the invasion of France, Patton''s Third Army has advanced so far toward Paris that it cannot be supplied. To keep up the momentum, Allied HQ establishes an elite military truck route.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PwuCRvBdvXk18V1GVR7vUZhI3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149895'),
  ('281016093883463955', 'The Red Baron', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History, War', 'Nikolai Müllerschön, Klaus Merkel, Jakub Dvorak', 'Nikolai Müllerschön', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Til Schweiger, Lena Headey, Joseph Fiennes, Volker Bruch, Julie Engelbrecht, Maxim Mehmet, Steffen Schroeder', 'PG-13', 'Richthofen goes off to war like thousands of other men. As fighter pilots, they become cult heroes for the soldiers on the battlefields. Marked by sportsmanlike conduct, technical exactitude and knightly propriety, they have their own code of honour. Before long he begins to understand that his hero status is deceptive. His love for Kate, a nurse, opens his eyes to the brutality of war.', 'Richthofen goes off to war like thousands of other men. As fighter pilots, they become cult heroes for the soldiers on the battlefields. Marked by sportsmanlike conduct, technical exactitude and knightly propriety, they have their own code of honour. Before long he begins to understand that his hero status is deceptive. His love for Kate, a nurse, opens his eyes to the brutality of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUuryram6Aoa11dCgoXohR8avjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8349'),
  ('958286689754964906', 'The Red Beret', 1953, 'War, Drama', 'Terence Young, John Wilcox, Jack N. Green', 'Richard Maibaum, Frank S. Nugent', 'Alan Ladd, Leo Genn, Susan Stephen, Harry Andrews, Donald Houston, Anthony Bushell, Patric Doonan, Stanley Baker', 'NR', 'Steve MacKendrick resigns from the US Army after causing the needless death of a fellow officer. Wanting to serve in the war, he enlists as a Canadian in the British 1st Parachute Brigade. He proves himself exceptionally skilled for a recruit, arousing the suspicion of his commanding officer who starts an investigation. He redeems himself during combat. The film was titled "Paratrooper" in the US.', 'Steve MacKendrick resigns from the US Army after causing the needless death of a fellow officer. Wanting to serve in the war, he enlists as a Canadian in the British 1st Parachute Brigade. He proves himself exceptionally skilled for a recruit, arousing the suspicion of his commanding officer who starts an investigation. He redeems himself during combat. The film was titled "Paratrooper" in the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MAaA2JGJ655UDOqTn8NeVcIdw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92401'),
  ('25238752385432793', 'The Red Book', 1994, 'Animation', 'Janie Geiser', null, null, null, 'An elliptical, pictographic animated film that uses flat, painted figures and collage elements in both two and three dimensional settings to explore the realms of memory, language and identity from the point of view of a woman amnesiac.', 'An elliptical, pictographic animated film that uses flat, painted figures and collage elements in both two and three dimensional settings to explore the realms of memory, language and identity from the point of view of a woman amnesiac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKQsEEXeyfXAiqwLY92exiLAFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200203'),
  ('1030105329458660571', 'The Red Book Ritual', 2022, 'Horror', 'Guillermo Lockhart, Nicolás Onetti, Christopher West', 'Guillermo Lockhart, Mauro Croche, Ariel Luque', 'Valeria San Martin, Agustin Olcese, Marlene Pedersen Chauviere, Bruno Giacobbe, Agustin Bogliano, Marcos Bogliano, Martín Canalicchio, Ines Corengia', null, 'Three friends decide to play The Red Book game. What they don''t know is that in the house evil is waiting to be released. A long time ago a witch died as part of a satanic ritual. Every question they ask, they get closer and closer to her. The book will reveal the answers to all your questions… but what if your host is an evil entity with a thirst for blood?', 'Three friends decide to play The Red Book game. What they don''t know is that in the house evil is waiting to be released. A long time ago a witch died as part of a satanic ritual. Every question they ask, they get closer and closer to her. The book will reveal the answers to all your questions… but what if your host is an evil entity with a thirst for blood?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nk7v4GoS4xUJapeMH4wZaDTkM4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928391'),
  ('1111829721973436085', 'The Red Circle', 1960, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jürgen Roland, Heinz Pehlke', 'Egon Eis, Wolfgang Menge', 'Klausjürgen Wussow, Renate Ewert, Ernst Fritz Fürbringer, Fritz Rasp, Eddi Arent, Ulrich Beiger, Richard Lauffen, Thomas Alder', null, 'A strange, red circle appears on the neck of a man saved from the guillotine. What is its mysterious meaning? Tragically, it turns out to be something of a family curse, as each generation thereafter bears the same sign, which in turn leads to blackmail and murder.', 'A strange, red circle appears on the neck of a man saved from the guillotine. What is its mysterious meaning? Tragically, it turns out to be something of a family curse, as each generation thereafter bears the same sign, which in turn leads to blackmail and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guvA5p7pSSUQYNj6s6d5Z7GxXGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62216'),
  ('427999657706237542', 'The Red Cockatoo', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dominik Graf, Benedict Neuenfels', 'Karin Aström, Michael Klier', 'Max Riemelt, Jessica Schwarz, Ronald Zehrfeld, Ingeborg Westphal, Devid Striesow, Kathrin Angerer, Klaus Manchen, Nadja Petri', null, 'A coming-of-age story set in Germany in the 1960s. Siggi becomes involved in a love triangle when he falls for Luise, but the tightening political climate forces him to make a fateful decision.', 'A coming-of-age story set in Germany in the 1960s. Siggi becomes involved in a love triangle when he falls for Luise, but the tightening political climate forces him to make a fateful decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHXHAXQbg99T3jFffN76Q4dmDQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11405'),
  ('673961047078182532', 'The Red Collar', 2018, 'Drama', 'Yves Angelo, Jean Becker', 'Jean Becker, Jean-Christophe Rufin', 'François Cluzet, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Sophie Verbeeck, Jean-Quentin Châtelain, Patrick Descamps, Tobias Nuytten, Maurane, Gilles Vandeweerd', null, 'In 1919, in a small town under the crushing heat of summer, a war hero is held prisoner in an abandoned barracks. Outside, his mangy dog barks night and day. Not far off in the countryside, an extraordinarily intelligent young woman works the land, waiting and hoping. A judge whose principles have been sorely shaken by the war is coming to sort out this case of which it is better not to speak.', 'In 1919, in a small town under the crushing heat of summer, a war hero is held prisoner in an abandoned barracks. Outside, his mangy dog barks night and day. Not far off in the countryside, an extraordinarily intelligent young woman works the land, waiting and hoping. A judge whose principles have been sorely shaken by the war is coming to sort out this case of which it is better not to speak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hqPRoszFyxyL7cYaqKNxH7uC8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499151'),
  ('296469615908675243', 'The Red Colored Grey Truck', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Adventure', 'Srđan Koljević', 'Srđan Koljević', 'Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Aleksandra Balmazović, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Bogdan Diklić, Boris Milivojević, Milutin ''Mima'' Karadžić, Raphael Biotteau, Željko Božić', null, 'Belgrade, the summer of 1991. Yugoslavia is falling apart. Gavran can''t get a driving licence because he is color blind. He is a rural Bosnian introvert obsessed with trucks. So, as soon as he is released from prison, he steals a truck to go on a joyride. Suzana, a city girl, discovers she is pregnant, but until she''s due for an abortion, she decides to go to Dubrovnik. She hitchikes and Gavran almost runs her over. She is unhurt, but she blackmails him to take her to Dubrovnik. Two people from different worlds, equally removed from the real one. For him she is the first woman he can talk to; for her he is just another idiot to add to the long list of them that she has so far compiled. But the pressure of danger and the intimations of war force them together. The world about them has become so absurd that they seem to each other the only sober people left.', 'Belgrade, the summer of 1991. Yugoslavia is falling apart. Gavran can''t get a driving licence because he is color blind. He is a rural Bosnian introvert obsessed with trucks. So, as soon as he is released from prison, he steals a truck to go on a joyride. Suzana, a city girl, discovers she is pregnant, but until she''s due for an abortion, she decides to go to Dubrovnik. She hitchikes and Gavran almost runs her over. She is unhurt, but she blackmails him to take her to Dubrovnik. Two people from different worlds, equally removed from the real one. For him she is the first woman he can talk to; for her he is just another idiot to add to the long list of them that she has so far compiled. But the pressure of danger and the intimations of war force them together. The world about them has become so absurd that they seem to each other the only sober people left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGJaWVzJY2k60a7kNSkw1iFVlmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109587'),
  ('993758116034895279', 'The Red Dance', 1928, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Raoul Walsh, Jack A. Marta, Charles G. Clarke', 'James Ashmore Creelman', 'Dolores del Río, Charles Farrell, Ivan Linow, Boris Charsky, Dorothy Revier, Andrés de Segurola, Demetrius Alexis, Henry Armetta', 'NR', 'Tasia (Dolores del Río), a beautiful dancer lower class of Russia, falls heir to the throne Prince, Grand Duke Eugene (Charles Farrell), but only admired from a distance. At the outbreak of the Russian Revolution, the Duke falls in captivity and this allows Tasia be near him.', 'Tasia (Dolores del Río), a beautiful dancer lower class of Russia, falls heir to the throne Prince, Grand Duke Eugene (Charles Farrell), but only admired from a distance. At the outbreak of the Russian Revolution, the Duke falls in captivity and this allows Tasia be near him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK66Iak6yhZkR0MuLoU0yXxucol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189937'),
  ('237045734563281656', 'The Red Dwarf', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yvan Le Moine', 'Yvan Le Moine', 'Jean-Yves Tual, Anita Ekberg, Dyna Gauzy, Michel Peyrelon, Arno Chevrier, Carlo Colombaioni, Alain Flick, Alexandre von Sivers', null, 'Lucien is a dwarf, who works hard in a large legal office. His only friend is trapeze circus artist Isis. One day he gets the attention of singer Paola Bendoni and falls in love with her.', 'Lucien is a dwarf, who works hard in a large legal office. His only friend is trapeze circus artist Isis. One day he gets the attention of singer Paola Bendoni and falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xUBmPGoYzEFDX3nrNTpvZt6uva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91598'),
  ('494953185472523992', 'The Red Eagle', 2010, 'Action, Thriller', 'Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Ananda Everingham, Yarinda Bunnag, Wannasing Prasertkul, Ron Smoorenburg, Pornwut Sarasin, Pattanadesh Asasappakij, Sarai Varawan, Prawit Kittichantheera', null, 'After a hasty plan to construct a nuclear power plant spreads fear among villagers and environmental activists, a hero emerges, who dispenses justice on Bangkok''s corrupt politicians and vile criminals when the law fails to function.', 'After a hasty plan to construct a nuclear power plant spreads fear among villagers and environmental activists, a hero emerges, who dispenses justice on Bangkok''s corrupt politicians and vile criminals when the law fails to function.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wnbQ9d9pQqfTe5uVHarZh8aW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50583'),
  ('850299652393734254', 'The Red Envelope', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Chayanop Bunprakob, Kittiwat Saemarat, Saroch Nuamsamran', 'Sharon Wu, Cheng Wei-hao', 'Putthipong Assaratanakul, Krit Amnuaydechkorn, Arachaporn Pokinpakorn, Piyamas Monayakul, Teravat Anuvatudom, Jaturong Mokjok, Rusameekae Fagerlund, Khunnarong Pratesrat', null, 'After a supernatural marriage binds them for life, thief-turned-informant Menn and his ghost husband Titi set out to solve the mystery of Titi''s death.', 'After a supernatural marriage binds them for life, thief-turned-informant Menn and his ghost husband Titi set out to solve the mystery of Titi''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l9B9TdanJXyJ2sOChXyV5lAIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317920'),
  ('325929939561360421', 'The Red Head', 1932, 'Drama', 'Julien Duvivier, Monniot, Ary Sadoul', 'Julien Duvivier', 'Robert Lynen, Harry Baur, Catherine Fonteney, Christine Dor, Colette Segall, Simone Aubry, Louis Gauthier, Max Fromiot', null, 'A red-haired boy is his mother''s punching bag; only his father''s presence is a great comfort to him, but this weak man is under the shrew''s thumb. His pain is so great he feels suicidal.', 'A red-haired boy is his mother''s punching bag; only his father''s presence is a great comfort to him, but this weak man is under the shrew''s thumb. His pain is so great he feels suicidal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTYYVyAXKZMVsJUjBk59PkS8F5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92413'),
  ('796047455094635742', 'The Red House', 1947, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Delmer Daves, Bert Glennon, Robert Stillman', 'Delmer Daves, Albert Maltz', 'Edward G. Robinson, Lon McCallister, Judith Anderson, Rory Calhoun, Allene Roberts, Julie London, Ona Munson, Harry Shannon', 'NR', 'An old man and his sister are concealing a terrible secret from their adopted teen daughter, concerning a hidden abandoned farmhouse, located deep in the woods.', 'An old man and his sister are concealing a terrible secret from their adopted teen daughter, concerning a hidden abandoned farmhouse, located deep in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BBdps0PfYccltNvVJGq1siip4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30162'),
  ('1015644869990285874', 'The Red Ibis', 1975, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marcel Weiss', 'André Ruellan, Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Michel Serrault, Michel Galabru, Evelyne Buyle, Michel Simon, Jean Le Poulain, Karen Nielsen, Maurice Vallier, Jean Cherlian', null, 'A mentally disturbed man named Jérémie is scouring the area in search of women he can strangle with his scarf, which is embroidered with an ibis.', 'A mentally disturbed man named Jérémie is scouring the area in search of women he can strangle with his scarf, which is embroidered with an ibis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouRivyyCrfLqKBmgeb7myZFFKOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4765'),
  ('1066707863286643734', 'The Red Inn', 1951, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Claude Autant-Lara, André Bac, Jacques Natteau', 'Jean Aurenche, Claude Autant-Lara, Pierre Bost', 'Fernandel, Françoise Rosay, Marie-Claire Olivia, Jean-Roger Caussimon, Nane Germon, Didier d''Yd, Lud Germain, Jacques Charon', null, 'A group of travelers, including a monk, stay in a lonely inn in the mountains. The host confesses the monk his habit of serving poisoned soup to the guests, to rob their possessions and to bury them in the backyard.', 'A group of travelers, including a monk, stay in a lonely inn in the mountains. The host confesses the monk his habit of serving poisoned soup to the guests, to rob their possessions and to bury them in the backyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sX2M4U549oYBUJTjwPtrlD1FfV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28190'),
  ('145666250322136204', 'The Red Inn', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Krawczyk, Gérard Sterin', 'Christian Clavier, Michel Delgado', 'Josiane Balasko, Christian Clavier, Gérard Jugnot, Jean-Baptiste Maunier, Sylvie Joly, Anne Girouard, Urbain Cancelier, Jean-Christophe Bouvet', null, 'A group of travelers, including a monk, stay in a lonely inn in the mountains. The host confesses the monk his habit of serving poisoned soup to the guests, to rob their possessions and to bury them in the backyard. The story unfolds as the monk tries to save the guest''s lives without violating the holy secrecy of the confession.', 'A group of travelers, including a monk, stay in a lonely inn in the mountains. The host confesses the monk his habit of serving poisoned soup to the guests, to rob their possessions and to bury them in the backyard. The story unfolds as the monk tries to save the guest''s lives without violating the holy secrecy of the confession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsYIPEzzUc2PgyjVIykaH16XBlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13732'),
  ('287452958136930899', 'The Red Kimona', 1925, 'Drama', 'Walter Lang, Dorothy Davenport, James Diamond', 'Dorothy Davenport, Malcolm Stuart Boylan', 'Priscilla Bonner, Nellie Bly Baker, Carl Miller, Mary Carr, Virginia Pearson, Tyrone Power Sr., Sheldon Lewis, Theodore von Eltz', 'NR', 'A woman is abandoned by her lover and prostitution is the only way she has to survive.', 'A woman is abandoned by her lover and prostitution is the only way she has to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AidGl5TLcatUqTwaJhz7D6jgmx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184862'),
  ('960086967597853314', 'The Red Lanterns', 1963, 'Drama', 'Vasilis Georgiadis, Nikos Gardelis, Mihail Stilianou', 'Alekos Galanos', 'Jenny Karezi, George Foundas, Dimitris Papamichael, Manos Katrakis, Mairi Hronopoulou, Faidon Georgitsis, Despo Diamantidou, Eleni Anousaki', null, 'The inextricably intertwined stories of five sex workers who live in a brothel at Pireas harbor.', 'The inextricably intertwined stories of five sex workers who live in a brothel at Pireas harbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1nYMzMEpTtyzUo1ghG5GlIflxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47790'),
  ('865145275336370537', 'The Red Light Bandit', 1968, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Rogério Sganzerla, Afonso Coaracy, Peter Overbeck', 'Rogério Sganzerla', 'Paulo Villaça, Luiz Linhares, Helena Ignez, Pagano Sobrinho, Roberto Luna, José Marinho, Ezequiel Neves, Sérgio Mamberti', null, 'Born and raised in the misery of Brazilian slums, Jorge becomes a luxury house burglar in São Paulo and gets nicknamed "The Red Light Bandit" by the sensationalist press. In addition to wearing a red flashlight, he talks to his hostages in an irreverent tone and makes bold breakthroughs to later spend the money extravagantly. His world is the decadent neighbourhood of Boca do Lixo.', 'Born and raised in the misery of Brazilian slums, Jorge becomes a luxury house burglar in São Paulo and gets nicknamed "The Red Light Bandit" by the sensationalist press. In addition to wearing a red flashlight, he talks to his hostages in an irreverent tone and makes bold breakthroughs to later spend the money extravagantly. His world is the decadent neighbourhood of Boca do Lixo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49CQCiWXs3mnFSJmAxVTTYOMQjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186738'),
  ('650829371998058396', 'The Red Lily', 1924, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fred Niblo, Victor Milner, Doran Cox', 'Bess Meredyth', 'Ramon Novarro, Enid Bennett, Frank Currier, Mitchell Lewis, Rosita Marstini, Sidney Franklin, Wallace Beery, George Nichols', null, 'Jean and Marise, young lovers forced from their homes, flee to Paris. Irrevocably separated there, their lives deviate into the slums and hard labor of low-class French society. All the while, the two desperately search for one another.', 'Jean and Marise, young lovers forced from their homes, flee to Paris. Irrevocably separated there, their lives deviate into the slums and hard labor of low-class French society. All the while, the two desperately search for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Err1rWrE3wSnDh7s9OSNS0seda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186201'),
  ('894759083482359207', 'The Red Line', 2026, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Sitisiri Mongkolsiri, Pasit Tandaechanurat, Patitta Thinrat', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee, Tinnapat Banyatpiyapoj', 'Nittha Jirayungyurn, Esther Supreeleela, Chutima Maholakul, Todsapol Maisuk, Tonhon Tantivejakul, Paowalee Pornpimol, Akarat Nimitchai, Nuttanan Kunpat', null, 'Three women fall prey to a ruthless phone scam. To settle the score, they''ll take on the criminal network that stole their money — and their dignity.', 'Three women fall prey to a ruthless phone scam. To settle the score, they''ll take on the criminal network that stole their money — and their dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3ROA6OqVA9rWSsC2DzdkPQvxWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1630433'),
  ('1013048152195906378', 'The Red Mantle', 1967, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Axel, Henning Bendtsen', 'Gabriel Axel', 'Oleg Vidov, Gitte Hænning, Eva Dahlbeck, Birgitte Federspiel, Lisbeth Movin, Johannes Meyer, Håkan Jahnberg, Manfred Reddemann', 'R', 'Seeking revenge against the rival clan responsible for the killing of his father, Hagbard calms down long enough to establish a truce. During a peaceful interlude, he falls in love with Signe, the daughter of the king of the rival clan. However, Hildegisl, who desires Signe''s hand in marriage, disovers the young lover''s plans to wed and sets out to bring about the end of Hagbard.', 'Seeking revenge against the rival clan responsible for the killing of his father, Hagbard calms down long enough to establish a truce. During a peaceful interlude, he falls in love with Signe, the daughter of the king of the rival clan. However, Hildegisl, who desires Signe''s hand in marriage, disovers the young lover''s plans to wed and sets out to bring about the end of Hagbard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekjy13Ra8ev1ffQCgKw77fU0Kdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198783'),
  ('672653768422315211', 'The Red Menace', 1949, 'Crime', 'R.G. Springsteen, John MacBurnie, Arthur J. Vitarelli', 'Albert DeMond, Gerald Geraghty', 'Robert Rockwell, Hanna Axmann-Rezzori, Betty Lou Gerson, Shepard Menken, Lester Luther, William Lally, Lloyd G. Davies, Norman Budd', 'NR', 'A couple try to leave the Communist party after a murder by the group they were once loyal to.', 'A couple try to leave the Communist party after a murder by the group they were once loyal to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4g0surmlqGxdJokgw2r0v4NUQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46148'),
  ('642285392884303895', 'The Red Mill', 1927, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Hendrik Sartov', 'Frances Marion', 'Marion Davies, Owen Moore, Louise Fazenda, George Siegmann, Karl Dane, Russ Powell, Snitz Edwards, William Orlamond', 'NR', 'A servant girl plays matchmaker for the local burgomaster''s daughter while setting her own sights on a visiting Irishman.', 'A servant girl plays matchmaker for the local burgomaster''s daughter while setting her own sights on a visiting Irishman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HTn2bwnJzqwjMed599U2ghNnBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134475'),
  ('364550262533614617', 'The Red Monks', 1989, 'Horror', 'Gianni Martucci', null, 'Gerardo Amato, Lara Wendel, Malisa Longo, Chuck Valenti, Claudio Pacifico, Gaetano Russo, Ludovico Della Jojo', null, 'A young woman weds a seemingly charming young man, and moves into his ancient mansion. She quickly learns to hate the old mansion and its inhabitants, while she gets frustrated with her husband''s secrecy on his late night activities and the contents of the dungeon below. As heads begin to roll she discovers about her husband''s past and his connection to some cult called the Red Monks. However, wait till he finds about HER past.', 'A young woman weds a seemingly charming young man, and moves into his ancient mansion. She quickly learns to hate the old mansion and its inhabitants, while she gets frustrated with her husband''s secrecy on his late night activities and the contents of the dungeon below. As heads begin to roll she discovers about her husband''s past and his connection to some cult called the Red Monks. However, wait till he finds about HER past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tC8WZtabv27b8Wp7uMgLdSN00Do.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121560'),
  ('812672334306947736', 'The Red Pill', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Cassie Jaye, Evan Davies', null, 'Cassie Jaye, Alison Tieman, Attila Vinczer, Barbara Smith, Ben Evans, Brian de Matos, Carnell Smith, Chanty Binx', 'R', 'When a feminist filmmaker sets out to document the mysterious and polarizing world of the Men’s Rights Movement, she begins to question her own beliefs. Chronicling Cassie Jaye’s journey exploring an alternate perspective on gender equality, power and privilege.', 'When a feminist filmmaker sets out to document the mysterious and polarizing world of the Men’s Rights Movement, she begins to question her own beliefs. Chronicling Cassie Jaye’s journey exploring an alternate perspective on gender equality, power and privilege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26V1JWowe0X6VT07tLXR0RF2PpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366696'),
  ('259123841388078650', 'The Red Pony', 1949, 'Action, Drama, Western', 'Lewis Milestone, Robert Aldrich, Tony Gaudio', 'John Steinbeck', 'Myrna Loy, Robert Mitchum, Louis Calhern, Shepperd Strudwick, Peter Miles, Margaret Hamilton, Melinda Byron, Beau Bridges', null, 'Peter Miles stars as Tom Tiflin, the little boy at the heart of this John Steinbeck story set in Salinas Valley. With his incompatible parents -- the city-loving Fred and country-happy Alice -- constantly bickering, Tom looks to cowboy Billy Buck for companionship and paternal love.', 'Peter Miles stars as Tom Tiflin, the little boy at the heart of this John Steinbeck story set in Salinas Valley. With his incompatible parents -- the city-loving Fred and country-happy Alice -- constantly bickering, Tom looks to cowboy Billy Buck for companionship and paternal love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVFxAQEmKqTyY96HNk6xtcgyFCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23395'),
  ('557957445033077088', 'The Red Queen Kills Seven Times', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Emilio P. Miraglia, Alberto Spagnoli', 'Emilio P. Miraglia, Fabio Pittorru', 'Barbara Bouchet, Ugo Pagliai, Marina Malfatti, Marino Masé, Pia Giancaro, Sybil Danning, Nino Korda, Fabrizio Moresco', null, 'After the death of their grandfather, two sisters inherit their family castle, which is said to be haunted by the Red Queen, whom legend says claims seven lives every hundred years. When a mysterious woman in a red cloak starts targeting their circle of friends, the sisters begin to suspect there might be some truth to the legend.', 'After the death of their grandfather, two sisters inherit their family castle, which is said to be haunted by the Red Queen, whom legend says claims seven lives every hundred years. When a mysterious woman in a red cloak starts targeting their circle of friends, the sisters begin to suspect there might be some truth to the legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78LsL4kCR08PzBxRTJzFlKw4M31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40130'),
  ('396022919826976546', 'The Red Scroll', 2020, 'Animation', 'Nelson Botter Jr.', 'Fernando Alonso, Keka Reis, Nelson Botter Jr.', 'Wendel Bezerra, Any Gabrielly, Isaac Bardavid, Vyni Takahashi, Marina Sirabello, Marcelo Palermo, Nelson Machado', null, 'This is the story of Nina, a 13-year-old girl who is transported to the universe of Telurian, a mysterious and Earth-like world inhabited by various fantastic creatures. There she will join a group who must prevent the master of darkness, Lord Dark, from seizing the Red Scroll and opening dimensional portals in various worlds, bringing darkness and destruction upon them.', 'This is the story of Nina, a 13-year-old girl who is transported to the universe of Telurian, a mysterious and Earth-like world inhabited by various fantastic creatures. There she will join a group who must prevent the master of darkness, Lord Dark, from seizing the Red Scroll and opening dimensional portals in various worlds, bringing darkness and destruction upon them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0VBSTNQ2G1zQKvWbPaeYxFaZi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752644'),
  ('938930269572910252', 'The Red Sea Diving Resort', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Gideon Raff, Roberto Schaefer, Shane Bunce', 'Gideon Raff', 'Chris Evans, Haley Bennett, Alessandro Nivola, Michael Kenneth Williams, Michiel Huisman, Alex Hassell, Mark Ivanir, Chris Chalk', 'R', 'Sudan, East Africa, 1980. A team of Israeli Mossad agents plans to rescue and transfer thousands of Ethiopian Jews to Israel. To do so, and to avoid raising suspicions from the inquisitive and ruthless authorities, they establish as a cover a fake diving resort by the Red Sea.', 'Sudan, East Africa, 1980. A team of Israeli Mossad agents plans to rescue and transfer thousands of Ethiopian Jews to Israel. To do so, and to avoid raising suspicions from the inquisitive and ruthless authorities, they establish as a cover a fake diving resort by the Red Sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTgd1QQFTKdxESevtffAvIvCnz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465003'),
  ('325582053285258666', 'The Red Sea Sharks', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Christophe Poujol', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Sophie Arthuys, Marc Moro, Michel Ruhl', null, 'Tintin and his friends travel to Khemed, a Middle East nation, to help its ruler, Emir Mohammed ben Kalish Ezab, who gets into trouble when Bab El Ehr, an arms smuggler and terrorist, rises and takes over.', 'Tintin and his friends travel to Khemed, a Middle East nation, to help its ruler, Emir Mohammed ben Kalish Ezab, who gets into trouble when Bab El Ehr, an arms smuggler and terrorist, rises and takes over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jfoJgZLXTZr31hHV9b7a6PeL2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441332'),
  ('730998555163217776', 'The Red Shade', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre Wallon, Vincent Lombard, Louis Mathieu', 'Claudio Biondi, Jean-Louis Comolli, Gérard Guicheteau', 'Claude Brasseur, Jacques Dutronc, Nathalie Baye, Andréa Ferréol, Nicolas Hossein, Nicola Belsky, Julien Blaine, Michelle Carles', null, 'The time is the 1930s and two Soviet spies (both Frenchmen by nationality) have been helping Communist factions during the Civil War in Spain. It is the time of Stalin''s iron rule in the USSR, and the two agents are suddenly called to Moscow by the KGB. Knowing that they are in trouble for no fault of their own, fear drives one of them to suicide while the other gets his lover and her child and begins a run for his life, knowing that the KGB will never let him go free.', 'The time is the 1930s and two Soviet spies (both Frenchmen by nationality) have been helping Communist factions during the Civil War in Spain. It is the time of Stalin''s iron rule in the USSR, and the two agents are suddenly called to Moscow by the KGB. Knowing that they are in trouble for no fault of their own, fear drives one of them to suicide while the other gets his lover and her child and begins a run for his life, knowing that the KGB will never let him go free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLl5mSHR7YHs0Q7e2N0Rxy7jrbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67553'),
  ('540314500941017584', 'The Red Shoes', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kim Yong-gyun, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Kim Yong-gyun, Hans Christian Andersen, Ma Sang-Ryeol', 'Kim Hye-soo, Kim Sung-su, Park Yeon-ah, Koh Soo-hee, Lee Eol, Kim Ji-eun, Sa Hyeon-jin, Lee Yong-nyeo', null, 'A woman who finds a pair of pink high heels on a subway platform soon realizes that jealousy, greed, and death follow them wherever they go.', 'A woman who finds a pair of pink high heels on a subway platform soon realizes that jealousy, greed, and death follow them wherever they go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ai6ep1b506uXKRkkOtF9y0BOSQU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64792'),
  ('890952208490513947', 'The Red Siren', 2002, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Olivier Megaton, Denis Rouden', 'Alain Berliner, Robert Conrath, Olivier Megaton', 'Jean-Marc Barr, Asia Argento, Frances Barber, Andrew Tiernan, Alexandra Negrão, Édouard Montoute, Vernon Dobtcheff, Johan Leysen', 'R', 'Nearly 13, Alice rebels, telling the Paris police that her mother is a murderer. Alice has no evidence; her mother, Eva, rich and powerful, avoids charges. Alice promptly runs away, determined to find her dad whom she claims lives in Portugal. The police believe he is dead and that Alice is in denial. Nonetheless, they dispatch Anita, an Italian police officer on loan to the French, to find Alice and bring her back. Meanwhile, Eva has launched her own paramilitary force to hunt for Alice, and Alice has found a protector in Hugo, an ex-soldier turned hit man and gang member. He promises to get her to her father. All roads lead to a small town on the Portuguese coast.', 'Nearly 13, Alice rebels, telling the Paris police that her mother is a murderer. Alice has no evidence; her mother, Eva, rich and powerful, avoids charges. Alice promptly runs away, determined to find her dad whom she claims lives in Portugal. The police believe he is dead and that Alice is in denial. Nonetheless, they dispatch Anita, an Italian police officer on loan to the French, to find Alice and bring her back. Meanwhile, Eva has launched her own paramilitary force to hunt for Alice, and Alice has found a protector in Hugo, an ex-soldier turned hit man and gang member. He promises to get her to her father. All roads lead to a small town on the Portuguese coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mgcEZzKTg1pV2TH0g0JUgYfVf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57992'),
  ('733637197829360044', 'The Red Snowball Tree', 1974, 'Drama', 'Vasiliy Shukshin, Anatoliy Zabolotskiy, Viktor Belyarov', 'Vasiliy Shukshin', 'Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Vasiliy Shukshin, Ivan Ryzhov, Mariya Skvortsova, Aleksey Vanin, Mariya Vinogradova, Efimiya Bystrova, Zhanna Prokhorenko', null, 'A thief named Egor, having served a term in prison, goes to the country to meet his pen-friend Lyuba, a kind genial village woman. Egor comes to love Lyuba sincerely. Now he has friends, work and a beloved woman, he decides to break with his criminal past and start a new life. However, his former criminal associates interfere brutally.', 'A thief named Egor, having served a term in prison, goes to the country to meet his pen-friend Lyuba, a kind genial village woman. Egor comes to love Lyuba sincerely. Now he has friends, work and a beloved woman, he decides to break with his criminal past and start a new life. However, his former criminal associates interfere brutally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcqQlRYPiGCVPALF4V3xa1OhAa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38359'),
  ('913926946855199612', 'The Red Spectacles', 1987, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Mamoru Oshii, Kazunori Ito', 'Shigeru Chiba, Machiko Washio, Hideyuki Tanaka, Tessyo Genda, Hideyo Amamoto, Mako Hyodo, Ichiro Nagai, Yasuo Otsuka', null, 'Summer 1995. With the arrival of the "Age of Cats", the former Kerberos police unit is now disbanded. However one member remains, a stray dog who returns to his old roost after a three-years exile. This wild dog no longer has a master, but now the "Young Lady of Fate" will guide him on his journey.', 'Summer 1995. With the arrival of the "Age of Cats", the former Kerberos police unit is now disbanded. However one member remains, a stray dog who returns to his old roost after a three-years exile. This wild dog no longer has a master, but now the "Young Lady of Fate" will guide him on his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FtJ3rdrxbIgdpU5LkZiins4Lex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30198'),
  ('339636593697937728', 'The Red Spectre', 1907, 'Fantasy', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Julienne Mathieu', 'NR', 'A demonic magician attempts to perform his act in a strange grotto, but is confronted by a Good Spirit who opposes him.', 'A demonic magician attempts to perform his act in a strange grotto, but is confronted by a Good Spirit who opposes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhzz6JMftFzZKbDFBqEGOdBqRGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150396'),
  ('312143181705952826', 'The Red Squirrel', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julio Medem, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Julio Medem', 'Emma Suárez, Nancho Novo, María Barranco, Karra Elejalde, Carmelo Gómez, Cristina Marcos, Mónica Molina, Ana Gracia', null, 'Jota''s suicide attempt is interrupted when a motorcyclist crashes off a bridge. After he rescues her, he decides to invent a life story for her — one of love and shared memories — creating a fragile web of deception that intertwines their fates.', 'Jota''s suicide attempt is interrupted when a motorcyclist crashes off a bridge. After he rescues her, he decides to invent a life story for her — one of love and shared memories — creating a fragile web of deception that intertwines their fates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKBXVmQeihhC5WYe4sIcYy8a2SL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2444'),
  ('1032094441064698358', 'The Red Star', 2021, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Marcelo Lavintman, Juan Risso, Carla Finco', 'Pablo Besarón, Gabriel Lichtmann', 'Thelma Fardin, Héctor Díaz, Rafael Spregelburd, Walter Jakob, Juan Leyrado, Ana Katz, Julieta Zylberberg, Javier Drolas', null, 'The investigation about an alleged international spy after the Nazi refugees in Argentina gives way to a plot that expands, becomes delirious and branches off. A mockumentary that has, at its center, an elusive woman whose trail can be traced in the most emphatic convulsions of the 20th century.', 'The investigation about an alleged international spy after the Nazi refugees in Argentina gives way to a plot that expands, becomes delirious and branches off. A mockumentary that has, at its center, an elusive woman whose trail can be traced in the most emphatic convulsions of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wY5x4loEa66GsHMdFrkND62uiyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619325'),
