  ('900723464949448662', 'The Red Sweater', 1979, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michel Drach', 'Michel Drach', 'Serge Avédikian, Michelle Marquais, Claire Deluca, Roland Bertin, Pierre Maguelon, Roger Ibáñez, Jean Benguigui, Georges Beller', null, 'A film version of author Gilles Perrault''s best-selling book about the 1976 trial and execution of Christian Ranucci, the youth who was convicted with extremely inconclusive evidence of murdering an eight-year-old girl in Southern France. The publicity the book and film helped abolish capital punishment in France in 1981.', 'A film version of author Gilles Perrault''s best-selling book about the 1976 trial and execution of Christian Ranucci, the youth who was convicted with extremely inconclusive evidence of murdering an eight-year-old girl in Southern France. The publicity the book and film helped abolish capital punishment in France in 1981.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sonE47qfXuvj7FqEGTF0GejDd6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66955'),
  ('1021004349952688476', 'The Red Tent', 1969, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Mikhail Kalatozov, Marina Volovich, Valerj Sirovski', 'Ennio De Concini, Richard DeLong Adams', 'Peter Finch, Sean Connery, Claudia Cardinale, Hardy Krüger, Eduard Martsevich, Grigoriy Gay, Nikita Mikhalkov, Luigi Vannucchi', 'G', 'Torn by personal guilt, Italian General Umberto Nobile reminisces about his 1928 failed Arctic expedition aboard the airship Italia.', 'Torn by personal guilt, Italian General Umberto Nobile reminisces about his 1928 failed Arctic expedition aboard the airship Italia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywTSr9hrYs72ZjIqZ9b805DNJfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8063'),
