  ('385370018547300679', 'The Red Violin', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Music, Romance', 'François Girard, Alain Dostie', 'François Girard, Don McKellar', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Carlo Cecchi, Irene Grazioli, Anita Laurenzi, Tommaso Puntelli, Aldo Brugnini, Samuele Amighetti, Jean-Luc Bideau', 'R', '300 years of a remarkable musical instrument. Crafted by the Italian master Bussotti (Cecchi) in 1681, the red violin has traveled through Austria, England, China, and Canada, leaving both beauty and tragedy in its wake. In Montreal, Samuel L Jackson plays an appraiser going over its complex history.', '300 years of a remarkable musical instrument. Crafted by the Italian master Bussotti (Cecchi) in 1681, the red violin has traveled through Austria, England, China, and Canada, leaving both beauty and tragedy in its wake. In Montreal, Samuel L Jackson plays an appraiser going over its complex history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPjq8PaNDhFQTzOu4Ce91f6BFgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14283'),
  ('388597986467067605', 'The Red Virgin', 2024, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Paula Ortiz, Pedro J. Márquez, Daniela Forn', 'Eduard Sola, Clara Roquet', 'Najwa Nimri, Alba Planas, Aixa Villagrán, Patrick Criado, Pepe Viyuela, Jon Viar, Pep Ambròs, Pablo Vázquez', null, 'Hildegart is conceived and educated by her mother Aurora to be the woman of the future, to become one of the most brilliant minds of Spain in the 1930s and one of the European references on female sexuality.', 'Hildegart is conceived and educated by her mother Aurora to be the woman of the future, to become one of the most brilliant minds of Spain in the 1930s and one of the European references on female sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWI9nlFB1bMWlU7xExJ4WmkQUyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118028'),
  ('262134327937678794', 'The Red Wolf', 1995, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Yuen Woo-Ping, Yuen Cheung-Yan', 'Ricky Ng', 'Kenny Ho Ka-King, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Collin Chou, Elaine Lui Siu-Ling, Cecilia Ng Sin-Si, Cho Wing, Woo Fung, Mary Hon Ma-Lee', null, 'A group of terrorists murder the captain of a cruise ship and take everyone hostage. Their plan is to steal the uranium being stored in the ship''s safe. It''s up to a security officer and a pickpocketing cocktail waitress to stop them.', 'A group of terrorists murder the captain of a cruise ship and take everyone hostage. Their plan is to steal the uranium being stored in the ship''s safe. It''s up to a security officer and a pickpocketing cocktail waitress to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAtP57ZJR3KN4AwFJreShMaarCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40107'),
  ('250367865687215907', 'The Redeem Team', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Jon Weinbach, Diego Hurtado de Mendoza, Diego Trenas', null, 'Kobe Bryant, LeBron James, Carmelo Anthony, Dwyane Wade, Mike Krzyzewski, Chris Bosh, Carlos Boozer, Chris Paul', null, 'Using unprecedented Olympic footage and behind-the-scenes material, The Redeem Team tells the story of the US Olympic Men''s Basketball Team’s quest for gold at the 2008 Olympic Games in Beijing following the previous team’s shocking performance four years earlier in Athens.', 'Using unprecedented Olympic footage and behind-the-scenes material, The Redeem Team tells the story of the US Olympic Men''s Basketball Team’s quest for gold at the 2008 Olympic Games in Beijing following the previous team’s shocking performance four years earlier in Athens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXu5rPQYean8AktqZHmWb27rOEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018648'),
  ('851871204436855975', 'The Redeemer: Son of Satan!', 1978, 'Horror', 'Constantine S. Gochis', 'William Vernick', 'Damien Knight, Jeannetta Arnette, Nick Carter, Nikki Barthen, Michael Hollingsworth, Gyr Patterson, Christopher Flint, Jessica Bein', null, 'Six people are trapped within the confines of their old high school during their 10th high school reunion with a psychotic, masked preacher who kills them off for their sinful lives they have made for themselves.', 'Six people are trapped within the confines of their old high school during their 10th high school reunion with a psychotic, masked preacher who kills them off for their sinful lives they have made for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyJrdg83ATfyzTDQ3Pf35RYhvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86332'),
  ('343289350032897629', 'The Redemption', 2025, 'Drama', 'Daniel Guzmán, Ibon Antuñano', 'Daniel Guzmán', 'Daniel Guzmán, Rosario García, Itziar Ituño, Susana Abaitua, Luis Tosar, Mona Martínez, Francesc Garrido, Fernando Valdivielso', null, 'Lucas, a 47-year-old boy, and Antonia, an old woman, live together in an apartment in the center of the city. Their life goes on as usual until an investment fund acquires the building to turn it into tourist apartments. Lucas tries to get the necessary money to avoid the loss of the house, but a wrong decision will change the rest of their lives.', 'Lucas, a 47-year-old boy, and Antonia, an old woman, live together in an apartment in the center of the city. Their life goes on as usual until an investment fund acquires the building to turn it into tourist apartments. Lucas tries to get the necessary money to avoid the loss of the house, but a wrong decision will change the rest of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HW6AI665AMtqEVBVIKNfaUcrHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440144'),
  ('492081437871499488', 'The Redemption: Kickboxer 5', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Kristine Peterson, Paul Michelson', null, 'Mark Dacascos, James Ryan, Geoff Meed, Tony Caprari, Greg Latter, Duane Porter, George Moolman, John Matshikiza', 'R', 'Kickboxing champion Matt Reeves witnesses the murder of his friend Johnny. While investigating the crime, he learns that a Mr. Negaal in South Africa has founded a new kickboxing association and does not leave international champions much of a chance. Johnny had to pay with his life when he did not want to join. Neegal seems to kill everybody who is in his way especially David Sloan from the previous Kickboxer films. Matt is on his own now, but suddenly finds an unexpected ally.', 'Kickboxing champion Matt Reeves witnesses the murder of his friend Johnny. While investigating the crime, he learns that a Mr. Negaal in South Africa has founded a new kickboxing association and does not leave international champions much of a chance. Johnny had to pay with his life when he did not want to join. Neegal seems to kill everybody who is in his way especially David Sloan from the previous Kickboxer films. Matt is on his own now, but suddenly finds an unexpected ally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPEaXVR6Ji7c8MkvGKuQP3ZKc5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40661'),
  ('680602111219697175', 'The Redhead from Wyoming', 1953, 'Western', 'Lee Sholem, Winton C. Hoch, Jesse Hibbs', 'Polly James, Herb Meadow', 'Maureen O''Hara, Alex Nicol, William Bishop, Robert Strauss, Alexander Scourby, Gregg Palmer, Jack Kelly, Jeanne Cooper', 'NR', 'A saloonkeeper sides with the sheriff for justice after she''s framed for rustling.', 'A saloonkeeper sides with the sheriff for justice after she''s framed for rustling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVLItfggirK1Wl1EYgM3qqolgXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77645'),
  ('1134791640345980956', 'The Redwood Massacre', 2014, 'Horror', 'David Ryan Keith, David Ryan Keith', 'David Ryan Keith', 'Mark Wood, Lisa Cameron, Lisa Livingstone, Rebecca Wilkie, Adam Coutts, Lee Hutcheon, Benjamin Selway, Alec Westwood', 'R', '​‘THE REDWOOD MASSACRE’ is about five adventurous friends, visiting the legendary murder site of Redwood. It has all the hallmarks of being an exciting and thrilling camping weekend away. They soon discover they’re not the only people in the mysterious location. The fun camping expedition soon turns into a nightmare as they are sadistically stalked by a mysterious unseen killer.', '​‘THE REDWOOD MASSACRE’ is about five adventurous friends, visiting the legendary murder site of Redwood. It has all the hallmarks of being an exciting and thrilling camping weekend away. They soon discover they’re not the only people in the mysterious location. The fun camping expedition soon turns into a nightmare as they are sadistically stalked by a mysterious unseen killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzMrAlzURdxRD0wpai3zTPozKAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339992'),
  ('1057667610089592863', 'The Reeds', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Nick Cohen, Dennis Madden', 'Mark Anthony Galluzzo, Chris Baker', 'Karl Ashman, Geoff Bell, Anna Brewster, Daniel Caltagirone, Emma Catherwood, Reece Chapman, O-T Fagbenle, Scarlett Alice Johnson', 'R', 'A weekend boating party turns into a nightmare for a group of young Londoners when they stumble upon a terrifying secret hidden in the reeds.', 'A weekend boating party turns into a nightmare for a group of young Londoners when they stumble upon a terrifying secret hidden in the reeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxw59MhBv0p6WXkm9Iz8VYyeG28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35197'),
  ('790240988533159651', 'The Reef', 2010, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Andrew Traucki, Simon Christidis, Earle Dresner', 'Andrew Traucki', 'Damian Walshe-Howling, Zoe Naylor, Adrienne Pickering, Gyton Grantley, Kieran Darcy-Smith', 'R', 'A great white shark hunts the crew of a capsized sailboat along the Great Barrier Reef.', 'A great white shark hunts the crew of a capsized sailboat along the Great Barrier Reef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5JGAqmdv1cHlDjMqsmQUkVo2lW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49787'),
  ('32993289687901663', 'The Reef 2: High Tide', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Mark A.Z. Dippé, Taedong Park, Sungwoo Kang', 'Chris Denk, Johnny Hartmann', 'Drake Bell, Andy Dick, Busy Philipps, Jamie Kennedy, Frankie Jonas, Donal Logue, Rob Schneider, Nam Bo-ra', 'G', 'Trained in the skills of sea power, Pi the fish can fight a shark, sink a squid or batter any random predator that ever threatens his friends and neighbors on the reef. Unfortunately, being the only hero in town can take its toll, especially when a group of sharks declares that the end of the reef is soon at hand.', 'Trained in the skills of sea power, Pi the fish can fight a shark, sink a squid or batter any random predator that ever threatens his friends and neighbors on the reef. Unfortunately, being the only hero in town can take its toll, especially when a group of sharks declares that the end of the reef is soon at hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZmLU8yQ7R63lmjImnJzItb0jM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132601'),
  ('739448547139106907', 'The Reef: Stalked', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Justin Brickle, Andrew Traucki', 'Andrew Traucki', 'Teressa Liane, Ann Truong, Saskia Archer, Kate Lister, Bridget Burt, Tim Ross, Wendy P. Mocke, Eva Mocke-Kanaki', 'NR', 'After her sister''s murder, Nic, her younger sister and two friends seek solace through a Pacific island kayaking adventure. Hours into the trip the women are stalked by a shark and must band together, face their fears and save each other.', 'After her sister''s murder, Nic, her younger sister and two friends seek solace through a Pacific island kayaking adventure. Hours into the trip the women are stalked by a shark and must band together, face their fears and save each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmbRg1VkVigS4Se2WCpyT5OV9mo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730167'),
  ('36706559876738176', 'The Ref', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Ted Demme, Adam Kimmel, Ron Oxley', 'Richard LaGravenese, Marie Weiss', 'Denis Leary, Judy Davis, Kevin Spacey, Glynis Johns, Robert J. Steinmiller Jr., Raymond J. Barry, Richard Bright, Christine Baranski', 'R', 'A cat burglar is forced to take a bickering, dysfunctional family hostage on Christmas Eve.', 'A cat burglar is forced to take a bickering, dysfunctional family hostage on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym7Kx3iDmalK8kXKvVQwnFYABEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10872'),
  ('294696213447986013', 'The Referee', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Paolo Zucca, Patrizio Patrizi', 'Paolo Zucca, Barbara Alberti', 'Stefano Accorsi, Geppi Cucciari, Jacopo Cullin, Francesco Pannofino, Benito Urgu, Marco Messeri, Alessio Di Clemente, Grégoire Oestermann', null, 'An ambitious soccer referee ends up handling a crucial match between two small Sardinian teams', 'An ambitious soccer referee ends up handling a crucial match between two small Sardinian teams', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQFudBPEmMt8BDbMr2lXQ5KOxNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223202'),
  ('408144869708880181', 'The Referees', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Eric Cardot, Delphine Lehericey, Yves Hinant', null, 'Howard Webb, Manuel Mejuto González, Roberto Rosetti, Michel Platini, Peter Fröjdfeldt, Massimo Busacca, Zlatan Ibrahimović', null, 'How can a few crucial minutes in a football match change the life of an entire family? How do the "men in black" feel when they are attacked by supporters? Kill the Referee unveils the lives of several professional football referees at the EURO 2008 championship; amongst them, the English referee Howard Webb, who provoked incredible controversy when he gave a penalty to Austria just before the end of the match with Poland, and the Italian Roberto Rosetti, who refereed the final.', 'How can a few crucial minutes in a football match change the life of an entire family? How do the "men in black" feel when they are attacked by supporters? Kill the Referee unveils the lives of several professional football referees at the EURO 2008 championship; amongst them, the English referee Howard Webb, who provoked incredible controversy when he gave a penalty to Austria just before the end of the match with Poland, and the Italian Roberto Rosetti, who refereed the final.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epaGmMdnsonZiW2idJzIilcCFou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42316'),
  ('29166686306466108', 'The Reflecting Pool', 1979, null, 'Bill Viola, Bill Viola', 'Bill Viola', 'Bill Viola', null, 'Viola''s seminal piece, The Reflecting Pool, was made three decades ago on analogue video tape and yet could easily pass for a contemporary digital piece; in it, Viola emerges as central protagonist from a thick forest into a clearing filled by an artificial pool. As the noise of an aeroplane slowly passes and fades overhead, Viola approaches the edge of the pool, whereby he removes his shoes, squats down yelling and then prepares to make a powerful jump.', 'Viola''s seminal piece, The Reflecting Pool, was made three decades ago on analogue video tape and yet could easily pass for a contemporary digital piece; in it, Viola emerges as central protagonist from a thick forest into a clearing filled by an artificial pool. As the noise of an aeroplane slowly passes and fades overhead, Viola approaches the edge of the pool, whereby he removes his shoes, squats down yelling and then prepares to make a powerful jump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOOsTqWcIKL90FoiVp3o99Q5thN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324025'),
  ('412542336527365575', 'The Reflecting Skin', 1990, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Philip Ridley, Dick Pope', 'Philip Ridley', 'Viggo Mortensen, Lindsay Duncan, Jeremy Cooper, Sheila Moore, Duncan Fraser, David Longworth, Robert Koons, David Bloom', 'R', 'In 1950s rural Idaho, a young boy watches helplessly as his friends and brother fall under the spell of a mysterious widow living up the road and becomes convinced that she is a vampire.', 'In 1950s rural Idaho, a young boy watches helplessly as his friends and brother fall under the spell of a mysterious widow living up the road and becomes convinced that she is a vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehUosbTVyCQtf6nAfpmQ8Q3XSd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21168'),
  ('323669092737713736', 'The Reformer. Zwingli: A Life''s Portrait', 2019, 'History', 'Stefan Haupt, Michael Hammon', 'Simone Schmid', 'Maximilian Simonischek, Sarah Sophia Meyer, Charlotte Schwab, Anatole Taubman, Stefan Kurt, Oscar Bingisser, Andrea Zogg, Ueli Jäggi', null, 'Zurich in 1519: The young widow Anna Reinhart lives a barren life between fear of the church and worries about the future of her three children, when the arrival of a man in the city causes turmoil: The young priest Ulrich Zwingli takes up his new position at the Grossmünster in Zurich and sparks fierce discussions with his sermons against the grievances of the Catholic Church. Zwingli''s revolutionary thoughts frighten Anna. But when she sees how Zwingli lives charity and not just preaches, she increasingly becomes fascinated by him. But Zwingli''s success quickly becomes dangerous. His ideas almost trigger a civil war, and at the same time a struggle for power and interpretive sovereignty breaks out in the inner circle of the movement. When the Catholic forces begin to form internationally, the relationship between Zwingli and Anna is put to a hard test.', 'Zurich in 1519: The young widow Anna Reinhart lives a barren life between fear of the church and worries about the future of her three children, when the arrival of a man in the city causes turmoil: The young priest Ulrich Zwingli takes up his new position at the Grossmünster in Zurich and sparks fierce discussions with his sermons against the grievances of the Catholic Church. Zwingli''s revolutionary thoughts frighten Anna. But when she sees how Zwingli lives charity and not just preaches, she increasingly becomes fascinated by him. But Zwingli''s success quickly becomes dangerous. His ideas almost trigger a civil war, and at the same time a struggle for power and interpretive sovereignty breaks out in the inner circle of the movement. When the Catholic forces begin to form internationally, the relationship between Zwingli and Anna is put to a hard test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPDAvTeGPTNDNGFPENisyBFrhio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573468'),
  ('457321820288246535', 'The Refrigerator', 1991, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Nicholas Jacobs, Paul Gibson, Christopher Oldcorn', 'Nicholas Jacobs, Philip Dolin', 'Julia McNeal, Dave Simonds, Phyllis Salaberrios, Angel Caban, Nena Segal, Jaime Rojo, Alex Trisano, Peter Justinus', null, 'A couple move into a bad apartment in a bad neighborhood in New York. The apartment contains a refrigerator, which is the only thing they like in the place. However, they slowly discover that the refrigerator is a monster which kills people in gruesome ways and then sends them to hell. The refrigerator is already gaining mind control over the husband. What will happen?', 'A couple move into a bad apartment in a bad neighborhood in New York. The apartment contains a refrigerator, which is the only thing they like in the place. However, they slowly discover that the refrigerator is a monster which kills people in gruesome ways and then sends them to hell. The refrigerator is already gaining mind control over the husband. What will happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Sq7dOrdFvPFwzx028knEt0u6uE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125540'),
  ('439135222079712509', 'The Reincarnation of Golden Lotus', 1989, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Clara Law, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Wong Kin-Leung', 'Lilian Lee Bik-Wah', 'Joey Wong, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Ku Feng, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Chan Lap-Ban, Chan Si-Nga', 'NR', 'An exceptionally beautiful Chinese woman falls prey to violence and social control. After remembering how her previous reincarnation followed a similar path, she tries to break free of the mould.', 'An exceptionally beautiful Chinese woman falls prey to violence and social control. After remembering how her previous reincarnation followed a similar path, she tries to break free of the mould.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgFZZqvRW76bUdtRZTe13Pr3Ikg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256068'),
  ('289419302398944886', 'The Reincarnation of Peter Proud', 1975, 'Horror, Mystery', 'J. Lee Thompson, Gary Daigler, Ralph S. Singleton', 'Max Ehrlich', 'Michael Sarrazin, Jennifer O''Neill, Margot Kidder, Cornelia Sharpe, Paul Hecht, Tony Stephano, Norman Burton, Anne Ives', 'R', 'When college professor, Peter Proud begins experiencing flashbacks of an earlier life, he''s mysteriously drawn to a place he''s never been to, but which seems familiar and where he soon finds his previous incarnation''s wife.', 'When college professor, Peter Proud begins experiencing flashbacks of an earlier life, he''s mysteriously drawn to a place he''s never been to, but which seems familiar and where he soon finds his previous incarnation''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LwL6rOnJeKbV6i3UM539MoE2Vs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101422'),
  ('742101669138773231', 'The Reincarnation of Sex', 1982, 'Horror', 'Luiz Castellini, Cláudio Portioli, Mário Vaz Filho', 'Luiz Castellini', 'Patrícia Scalvi, Arthur Roveder, Roque Rodrigues, Lia Farrel, Célia Santos, Fábio Vilalonga, Ana Maria Kreisler, Lígia de Paula', null, 'Patricia is in love with Artur, who works in her parents’ farm. Both are very happy and full of plans, but Artur is violently killed by her father, leading her to die of a broken heart. Years later, their souls begin to torment those who live in the house.', 'Patricia is in love with Artur, who works in her parents’ farm. Both are very happy and full of plans, but Artur is violently killed by her father, leading her to die of a broken heart. Years later, their souls begin to torment those who live in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiQOskefaeiCpJsF9MPnlerlW92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181828'),
  ('403646070489936332', 'The Reivers', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Rydell, Richard Moore', 'Irving Ravetch, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Steve McQueen, Sharon Farrell, Ruth White, Michael Constantine, Clifton James, Juano Hernández, Lonny Chapman, Will Geer', 'PG-13', 'In turn-of-the-century Mississippi, an 11-year-old boy comes of age as two mischievous adult friends talk him into sneaking the family car out for a trip to Memphis and a series of adventures.', 'In turn-of-the-century Mississippi, an 11-year-old boy comes of age as two mischievous adult friends talk him into sneaking the family car out for a trip to Memphis and a series of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0XZmvjbS4meN86Jf1Retbo7GlB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5928'),
  ('944899333117522013', 'The Relative Worlds', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Action', 'Yuhei Sakuragi, Kiyoshi Arakawa', 'Yuhei Sakuragi', 'Yuki Kaji, Yoshiki Nakajima, Maaya Uchida, Sayaka Senbongi, Aoi Yuuki, Inori Minase, Kenjiro Tsuda, Toshiyuki Morikawa', null, 'Shin has shut his heart ever since his mother died when he was young. His childhood friend Kotori has been looking after him ever since. Now that they are in the third year of high school, and it seems like they can finally move forward, another Shin from another Japan has suddenly appeared in front of them.', 'Shin has shut his heart ever since his mother died when he was young. His childhood friend Kotori has been looking after him ever since. Now that they are in the third year of high school, and it seems like they can finally move forward, another Shin from another Japan has suddenly appeared in front of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dKAHraRbc4jKNWbvFCeYjtFZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553833'),
  ('484373923224600030', 'The Relatives', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Filipp Lamshin, Vladimir Golov, Larisa Sukhorukova', 'Zhora Kryzhovnikov, Alexey Kazakov', 'Sergey Burunov, Irina Pegova, Semyon Treskunov, Elizaveta Gyrdymova, Katerina Bekker, Anna Ukolova, Nikita Pavlenko, Sergey Shakurov', null, 'One morning, the father of the family decides to fulfill his lifelong dream: to go with his family to the Grushinsky festival and perform his song there. The family is forced to come to terms with the desire of a tyrant father and go on a road trip across all of Russia. Along the way, they will have adventures, various tests and a test of their relationships for strength. But the most important thing they will understand only at the end of this extraordinary trip.', 'One morning, the father of the family decides to fulfill his lifelong dream: to go with his family to the Grushinsky festival and perform his song there. The family is forced to come to terms with the desire of a tyrant father and go on a road trip across all of Russia. Along the way, they will have adventures, various tests and a test of their relationships for strength. But the most important thing they will understand only at the end of this extraordinary trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPrcoahkpl98FbqxhAfvTazvC8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610351'),
  ('783649811097377153', 'The Relic', 1997, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Gary Baugh', 'Amy Holden Jones, John Raffo, Rick Jaffa', 'Penelope Ann Miller, Tom Sizemore, Linda Hunt, James Whitmore, Clayton Rohner, Chi Muoi Lo, Thomas Ryan, Robert Lesser', 'R', 'A homicide detective teams up with an evolutionary biologist to hunt a giant creature that is killing people in a Chicago museum.', 'A homicide detective teams up with an evolutionary biologist to hunt a giant creature that is killing people in a Chicago museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAG4nKPUWEIwGBpP38H64GGV8kl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11015'),
  ('151555636747852468', 'The Reluctant Astronaut', 1967, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Edward Montagne, Rex Wimpy', 'Everett Greenbaum, James Fritzell', 'Don Knotts, Leslie Nielsen, Joan Freeman, Jesse White, Jeanette Nolan, Frank McGrath, Arthur O''Connell, Joan Shawlee', 'NR', 'Roy Fleming is a small-town kiddie-ride operator who is deathly afraid of heights. After learning that his father has signed him up for the space program, Roy reluctantly heads for Houston, only to find out upon arriving that his job is as a janitor, not an astronaut. Anxious to live up to the expectations of his domineering father, Roy manages to keep up a facade of being an astronaut to his family and friends. When NASA decides to launch a layperson into space to prove the worthiness of a new automated spacecraft, Roy gets the chance to confront his fears.', 'Roy Fleming is a small-town kiddie-ride operator who is deathly afraid of heights. After learning that his father has signed him up for the space program, Roy reluctantly heads for Houston, only to find out upon arriving that his job is as a janitor, not an astronaut. Anxious to live up to the expectations of his domineering father, Roy manages to keep up a facade of being an astronaut to his family and friends. When NASA decides to launch a layperson into space to prove the worthiness of a new automated spacecraft, Roy gets the chance to confront his fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSX2LJeoCUGObWmKnxMjmTVfTI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36855'),
  ('154118140770577609', 'The Reluctant Debutante', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William McGarry, Vincente Minnelli, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'William Douglas-Home, Julius J. Epstein', 'Rex Harrison, Kay Kendall, John Saxon, Sandra Dee, Angela Lansbury, Peter Myers, Diane Clare, Sheila Raynor', 'NR', 'While visiting her father, an American teenage girl is thrown into London society during its final "Debutante Season."', 'While visiting her father, an American teenage girl is thrown into London society during its final "Debutante Season."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prqscm98H6Ybt5AD8JvIhOgqXFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64382'),
  ('1066129715261975993', 'The Reluctant Dragon', 1941, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Alfred L. Werker, Hamilton Luske, Bert Glennon', 'Ted Sears, Al Perkins, Larry Clemmons', 'Robert Benchley, Frances Gifford, Buddy Pepper, Nana Bryant, Claud Allister, Barnett Parker, Billy Lee, Florence Gill', 'G', 'Humorist Robert Benchley attempts to find Walt Disney to ask him to adapt a short story about a gentle dragon who would rather recite poetry than be ferocious. Along the way, he is given a tour of Walt Disney Studios, and learns about the animation process.', 'Humorist Robert Benchley attempts to find Walt Disney to ask him to adapt a short story about a gentle dragon who would rather recite poetry than be ferocious. Along the way, he is given a tour of Walt Disney Studios, and learns about the animation process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woyLqPJLeHP7gzF7DOtEapqaJQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22752'),
  ('143795107917430519', 'The Reluctant Fundamentalist', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Mira Nair, Declan Quinn, Spencer Jarvis', 'William Wheeler', 'Riz Ahmed, Kate Hudson, Liev Schreiber, Kiefer Sutherland, Om Puri, Shabana Azmi, Martin Donovan, Nelsan Ellis', 'R', 'In New York, a Pakistani native finds that his American Dream has collapsed in the wake of the 9/11 terrorist attacks.', 'In New York, a Pakistani native finds that his American Dream has collapsed in the wake of the 9/11 terrorist attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbdiRDhStWuAPmrscejIlRCFrQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121677'),
  ('762317890479370085', 'The Reluctant Royal', 2025, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Fair, Andy Hodgson, Ian Adams', 'Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Andrew W. Walker, Emilie de Ravin, Simon Coury, Fiach Kunz, Jade Jordan, Elizabeth Moynihan, Michael James Ford, Michael Glenn Murphy', 'G', 'Philly mechanic Johnny is surprised to learn that his long-lost father is a duke. But the duke isn’t quite what he expected, nor are his growing feelings for the duke’s advisor Prudence.', 'Philly mechanic Johnny is surprised to learn that his long-lost father is a duke. But the duke isn’t quite what he expected, nor are his growing feelings for the duke’s advisor Prudence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0IOjMS9hLsmL32vDrUL9bNuWze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1418290'),
  ('1039876875856260204', 'The Remaining', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Casey La Scala, Doug Emmett', 'Casey La Scala, Chris Dowling', 'Alexa PenaVega, Johnny Pacar, Shaun Sipos, Italia Ricci, Bryan Dechart, Liz E. Morgan, John Pyper-Ferguson, Kim Pacheco', 'PG-13', 'When a group of close-knit friends assemble for the marriage of Skylar and Dan, they have no idea they will witness The Rapture and face a series of catastrophic events turning the celebration into a life-or-death struggle.', 'When a group of close-knit friends assemble for the marriage of Skylar and Dan, they have no idea they will witness The Rapture and face a series of catastrophic events turning the celebration into a life-or-death struggle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFeTfXI67Oj80s65jtbq4uQ4InP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280002'),
  ('947781317704951011', 'The Remains', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Thomas Della Bella, Derrick Sims, Colin Flaherty', 'Thomas Della Bella', 'Todd Lowe, Lisa Brenner, Brooke Serene Butler, Ashley Crow, Maria Olsen, Samuel Larsen, Nikki Hahn, Hannah Nordberg', null, 'After a family moves into an old Victorian home, they discover a chest in the attic containing antiques tainted by a malevolent spirit. As the antiques slowly possess each family member, the spirit grows stronger, hellbent on kidnapping the children.', 'After a family moves into an old Victorian home, they discover a chest in the attic containing antiques tainted by a malevolent spirit. As the antiques slowly possess each family member, the spirit grows stronger, hellbent on kidnapping the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k76aHHeRgqZsdjcSvkzq2KBQLj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407389'),
  ('227685539027929793', 'The Remains of Nothing', 2005, 'History, Drama', 'Antonietta De Lillo, Cesare Accetta', 'Giuseppe Rocca, Laura Sabatino, Antonietta De Lillo', 'Maria de Medeiros, Enzo Moscato, Rosario Sparno, Maria Grazia Grassini, Mimmo Esposito, Carlo Guitto, Daniele Russo, Federico Pacifici', null, 'Set in the 1790s, this historical drama follows the travails of an idealistic noblewoman who helps lead a daring revolution in Italy.', 'Set in the 1790s, this historical drama follows the travails of an idealistic noblewoman who helps lead a daring revolution in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpQS7Bt04DquLB4wwLrOl0gAWm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56943'),
  ('120168277457136543', 'The Remains of the Day', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Christopher Newman, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Anthony Hopkins, Emma Thompson, James Fox, Christopher Reeve, Hugh Grant, Peter Vaughan, Ben Chaplin, Paula Jacobs', 'PG', 'A rule-bound head butler''s world of manners and decorum in the household he maintains is tested by the arrival of a housekeeper who falls in love with him in post-WWI Britain. The possibility of romance and his master''s cultivation of ties with the Nazi cause challenge his carefully maintained veneer of servitude.', 'A rule-bound head butler''s world of manners and decorum in the household he maintains is tested by the arrival of a housekeeper who falls in love with him in post-WWI Britain. The possibility of romance and his master''s cultivation of ties with the Nazi cause challenge his carefully maintained veneer of servitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDGDtqSvuch324WnM7Ukdp1bCAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245'),
  ('587203153185553177', 'The Remarkable Life of Ibelin', 2024, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Benjamin Ree, Rasmus Tukia, Tore Vollan', 'Mats Steen', 'Mats Steen, Robert Steen, Trude Steen, Mia Steen, Lisette Roovers, Kai Simon Fredriksen, Mikkel Riknagel Nielsen, Xenia-Anni Nielsen', 'PG-13', 'The secret life of a young World of Warcraft gamer is vividly reimagined when his online friends contact his family after his death.', 'The secret life of a young World of Warcraft gamer is vividly reimagined when his online friends contact his family after his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gk2F3wrPCPzrnUM81tjVcgyWHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167027'),
  ('114835964244503645', 'The Rembrandt Syndrome', 2025, 'Drama', 'Pierre Schoeller, Marie Crabit, Louise Molière', 'Violette Garcia', 'Camille Cottin, Romain Duris, Denis Podalydès, Céleste Brunnquell, Bruno Podalydès, Kester Lovelace, Joel Ödmann, François Orsoni', null, 'Claire and Yves, trained as physicists, have worked in the nuclear industry their entire lives. During a visit to the National Gallery, Claire is deeply moved by three Rembrandt paintings. This encounter with these three masterful works will change them forever.', 'Claire and Yves, trained as physicists, have worked in the nuclear industry their entire lives. During a visit to the National Gallery, Claire is deeply moved by three Rembrandt paintings. This encounter with these three masterful works will change them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdRh7duuTkn9Nygs96yfoT97rk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001043'),
  ('1092436918056657332', 'The Rendez-Vous of Déjà-Vu', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Antonin Peretjatko, Simon Roca', 'Antonin Peretjatko', 'Vimala Pons, Grégoire Tachnakian, Vincent Macaigne, Marie-Lorna Vaconsin, Thomas Schmitt, Serge Trinquecoste, Estéban, Lucie Borleteau', null, 'Hector meets Truquette on Bastille Day and becomes obsessed with seducing her. The plan is to get her to the seaside pronto. Pator is not complaining, especially if her friend Charlotte comes along for the ride. So off they go, down the country roads of a broke and broken France. Times are hard ! Suddenly the government cancels a month of summer. Everyone back to work! A wad of cash and two gun shots later, the group splits in two like France itself. But careering away from work in no way daunts the remaining trio, dead set on relocating the Bastille Girl and reveling in an endless summer.', 'Hector meets Truquette on Bastille Day and becomes obsessed with seducing her. The plan is to get her to the seaside pronto. Pator is not complaining, especially if her friend Charlotte comes along for the ride. So off they go, down the country roads of a broke and broken France. Times are hard ! Suddenly the government cancels a month of summer. Everyone back to work! A wad of cash and two gun shots later, the group splits in two like France itself. But careering away from work in no way daunts the remaining trio, dead set on relocating the Bastille Girl and reveling in an endless summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMU6s8O3YGEihDpd6vqBUPnpjPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190817'),
  ('877818554843489195', 'The Rendezvous', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kōichi Saitō, Noritaka Sakamoto', 'Kim Ji-heon', 'Keiko Kishi, Kenichi Hagiwara, Rentaro Mikuni, Yoshie Minami, Taiji Tonoyama, Yuriko Hime, Jin Nakayama, Zenichi Inagawa', null, 'The brief love story of an attentive young man and a beautiful woman who meet, fall in love and part during the course of a train ride.', 'The brief love story of an attentive young man and a beautiful woman who meet, fall in love and part during the course of a train ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8G1ppii1YOmQeTKgVTNrJfDqnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254584'),
  ('270117619337271615', 'The Rendlesham UFO : The British Roswell', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Roderick Godman, Mark Christopher Lee, Matt Smith', 'Mark Christopher Lee', 'Mark Christopher Lee, Guy Thompson', null, 'In this thrilling, unique, and sometimes hilarious UFO documentary, tantalising discoveries emerge while delving into Britain’s own Roswell—the 1980 Rendlesham UFO incident where a mysterious craft was reportedly seen landing near a U.S. airbase. As the investigation revisits the original event, the film also chronicles the strange encounters reported in Rendlesham Forest ever since; weird UFO sightings, floating orbs of light, and encounters with terrifying cryptid creatures.', 'In this thrilling, unique, and sometimes hilarious UFO documentary, tantalising discoveries emerge while delving into Britain’s own Roswell—the 1980 Rendlesham UFO incident where a mysterious craft was reportedly seen landing near a U.S. airbase. As the investigation revisits the original event, the film also chronicles the strange encounters reported in Rendlesham Forest ever since; weird UFO sightings, floating orbs of light, and encounters with terrifying cryptid creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7nh087VirkGkfBZMdqT6cHYBqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1502205'),
  ('285532571185326714', 'The Rental', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nic Birdsall, Nick Grau, Dave Franco', 'Dave Franco, Joe Swanberg', 'Dan Stevens, Alison Brie, Sheila Vand, Jeremy Allen White, Toby Huss, Connie Wellman, Anthony Molinari, Chase Barker', 'R', 'Two couples on an oceanside getaway grow suspicious that the host of their seemingly perfect rental house may be spying on them. Before long, what should have been a celebratory weekend trip turns into something far more sinister.', 'Two couples on an oceanside getaway grow suspicious that the host of their seemingly perfect rental house may be spying on them. Before long, what should have been a celebratory weekend trip turns into something far more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ynPnBXQVT2Y0s19fDIPlWKUlxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587496'),
