  ('1011415904667561571', 'The Repeating Student Winked at Dean', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Federico Zanni, Alessandro Metz', 'Mariano Laurenti, Francesco Milizia', 'Anna Maria Rizzoli, Lino Banfi, Alvaro Vitali, Carlo Sposito, Ria De Simone, Leo Colonna, Loredana Martínez, Renzo Ozzano', null, 'Rich girl Angela returns to school and falls for the local hunk. But when he refuses her advances, she pretends to be in love with the principal instead.', 'Rich girl Angela returns to school and falls for the local hunk. But when he refuses her advances, she pretends to be in love with the principal instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgRImjgfYzYCkwYYzRy0vg2ce9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121507'),
  ('122385369968219152', 'The Replacement', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Álex de Pablo, Iñaki Ros, Patricia Picazo', 'María Luisa Calderón, Óscar Aibar', 'Ricardo Gómez, Victoria Luengo, Pere Ponce, Pol López, Joaquín Climent, Nuria Herrero, Cristina Perales, Hans-Peter Deppe', null, 'Spain, 1982. Andrés Expósito, a young police inspector, accepts a posting in Denia, a small town on the Mediterranean coast, in the hope of leading a quieter life and that the natural environment will help improve the fragile health of his daughter; but once in his new post he becomes involved by chance in the investigation of the strange death of the inspector he has come to replace.', 'Spain, 1982. Andrés Expósito, a young police inspector, accepts a posting in Denia, a small town on the Mediterranean coast, in the hope of leading a quieter life and that the natural environment will help improve the fragile health of his daughter; but once in his new post he becomes involved by chance in the investigation of the strange death of the inspector he has come to replace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HEMT4mHLr0YvAwuwxvNbPfELrI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776279'),
  ('406937834540585713', 'The Replacement Killers', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Antoine Fuqua, Peter Lyons Collister, Maria Battle-Campbell', 'Ken Sanzel', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Mira Sorvino, Michael Rooker, Kenneth Tsang, Jürgen Prochnow, Til Schweiger, Danny Trejo, Clifton Collins Jr.', 'R', 'Hired assassin John Lee is asked by Chinatown crime boss Terence Wei to murder the young son of policeman Stan Zedkov. Lee has the boy in his sights, but his conscience gets the better of him, and he spares the child''s life. Afraid that Wei will take revenge on his family in China, Lee seeks out expert forger Meg Coburn to obtain the passport he needs to get out of the country, but a band of replacement killers is soon on his trail.', 'Hired assassin John Lee is asked by Chinatown crime boss Terence Wei to murder the young son of policeman Stan Zedkov. Lee has the boy in his sights, but his conscience gets the better of him, and he spares the child''s life. Afraid that Wei will take revenge on his family in China, Lee seeks out expert forger Meg Coburn to obtain the passport he needs to get out of the country, but a band of replacement killers is soon on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JAVd0lYhkB2dsDtt84Qt6grNIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11702'),
  ('986912568167075118', 'The Replacements', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Howard Deutch, Tak Fujimoto, Allan Graf', 'Vince McKewin', 'Keanu Reeves, Gene Hackman, Brooke Langton, Orlando Jones, Faizon Love, Jon Favreau, Rhys Ifans, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'Maverick old-guard coach Jimmy McGinty is hired in the wake of a players'' strike to help the Washington Sentinels advance to the playoffs. But that impossible dream hinges on whether his replacements can hunker down and do the job. So, McGinty dusts off his secret dossier of ex-players who never got a chance (or screwed up the one they were given) and knits together a bad-dream team of guys who just may give the Sentinels their title shot.', 'Maverick old-guard coach Jimmy McGinty is hired in the wake of a players'' strike to help the Washington Sentinels advance to the playoffs. But that impossible dream hinges on whether his replacements can hunker down and do the job. So, McGinty dusts off his secret dossier of ex-players who never got a chance (or screwed up the one they were given) and knits together a bad-dream team of guys who just may give the Sentinels their title shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qerI41HqkdRlio1sG0d5HLZcFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10393'),
  ('621578248836110675', 'The Report', 1977, 'Drama', 'Ali Reza Zarrindast, Abbas Kiarostami', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Shohreh Aghdashloo, Kurosh Afsharpanah, Mehdi Montazar, Mostafa Tari, Hashem Arkan, Mohamed-Bagher Tavakoh, Tahnaz Esmaili, Bennoosh Rodpoor', null, 'A tax collector is accused of taking bribes, and also has to deal with problems at home.', 'A tax collector is accused of taking bribes, and also has to deal with problems at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYKqtZejNk3OZr59qL2ZyvzC8rZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149507'),
  ('85677294395406813', 'The Report', 2019, 'Drama', 'Scott Z. Burns, Eigil Bryld, Noreen R. Cheleden', 'Scott Z. Burns', 'Adam Driver, Annette Bening, Jon Hamm, Sarah Goldberg, Michael C. Hall, Douglas Hodge, Fajer Al-Kaisi, Ted Levine', 'R', 'The story of Daniel Jones, lead investigator for the US Senate’s sweeping study into the CIA''s Detention and Interrogation Program, which was found to be brutal, immoral and ineffective. With the truth at stake, Jones battled tirelessly to make public what many in power sought to keep hidden.', 'The story of Daniel Jones, lead investigator for the US Senate’s sweeping study into the CIA''s Detention and Interrogation Program, which was found to be brutal, immoral and ineffective. With the truth at stake, Jones battled tirelessly to make public what many in power sought to keep hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sG5NI6TMNR9ftOdTIXmG0hrBYSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524348'),
  ('796402739504956274', 'The Reptile', 1966, 'Horror', 'John Gilling, Arthur Grant, William P. Cartlidge', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Noel Willman, Jennifer Daniel, Ray Barrett, Jacqueline Pearce, Michael Ripper, John Laurie, Marne Maitland, David Baron', null, 'Harry and Valerie Spalding arrive in the remote Cornish village to an unwelcoming and suspicious population. Harry''s brother dies suddenly, bitten by a lethal reptilian bite. They befriend a young woman Anna whose tyrannical father controls her life and, as they discover that others in the village have suffered a similar fate, their investigations lead to Anna. What they uncover is a victim of the most terrifying legacy... a destiny of mutilation and murder.', 'Harry and Valerie Spalding arrive in the remote Cornish village to an unwelcoming and suspicious population. Harry''s brother dies suddenly, bitten by a lethal reptilian bite. They befriend a young woman Anna whose tyrannical father controls her life and, as they discover that others in the village have suffered a similar fate, their investigations lead to Anna. What they uncover is a victim of the most terrifying legacy... a destiny of mutilation and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyDCGewLquVYjXSL0SifoCtlyeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29052'),
  ('990128293903589711', 'The Republic of ShKID', 1966, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Gennadi Poloka, Aleksandr Chechulin, Dmitriy Dolinin', 'Leonid Panteleyev', 'Sergei Yursky, Yuliya Burygina, Pavel Luspekayev, Aleksandr Melnikov, Anatoli Stolbov, Georgy Kolosov, Vera Titova, Violetta Zhukhimovich', null, 'The film is based on the eponymous book, written by two former street gangsters - Grigori Belykh and Leonid Panteleyev. Film is set in the 1920s St. Petersburg, Russia. Streets of the city are full of the homeless boys. They are caught to be raised and educated at the correction school named after Dostoevsky. The boys are street smart and difficult. But the faculty stands up to the challenge. The teaches are being devoted and caring, and gradually win the respect of the most difficult kids. The school director Vicknixor is a refined intellectual, who becomes a role model for the boys.', 'The film is based on the eponymous book, written by two former street gangsters - Grigori Belykh and Leonid Panteleyev. Film is set in the 1920s St. Petersburg, Russia. Streets of the city are full of the homeless boys. They are caught to be raised and educated at the correction school named after Dostoevsky. The boys are street smart and difficult. But the faculty stands up to the challenge. The teaches are being devoted and caring, and gradually win the respect of the most difficult kids. The school director Vicknixor is a refined intellectual, who becomes a role model for the boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvohjlYq5P3AApvyDYSUkgCp4A9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20885'),
  ('249305537018836275', 'The Requin', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Le Van Kiet, Matt S. Bell', 'Le Van Kiet', 'Alicia Silverstone, James Tupper, Deirdre O''Connell, Danny Chung, Jennifer Mudge, Kha Mai, Kameron Hood', 'R', 'A couple on a romantic getaway find themselves stranded at sea when a tropical storm sweeps away their villa. In order to survive, they are forced to fight the elements, while sharks circle below.', 'A couple on a romantic getaway find themselves stranded at sea when a tropical storm sweeps away their villa. In order to survive, they are forced to fight the elements, while sharks circle below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0z8g2VRZP3dhVvvSMilbOZMKqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803114'),
  ('747687682468301980', 'The Rescue', 1988, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Ferdinand Fairfax, Russell Boyd', 'John Thomas, Jim Thomas', 'Edward Albert, James Cromwell, Kevin Dillon, Marc Price, Christine Harnos, Ellen Barber, Ian Giatti, Charles Haid', 'PG', 'A team of Navy Seals are sent to destroy a disabled submarine so it will not fall into the "wrong" hands. They complete their mission, but are captured before they can return to their base. The U.S. Government will not mount a rescue mission to free the soldiers, so their teenage children take over. The kids find a way to venture into the foreign country and then must overcome many obstacles.', 'A team of Navy Seals are sent to destroy a disabled submarine so it will not fall into the "wrong" hands. They complete their mission, but are captured before they can return to their base. The U.S. Government will not mount a rescue mission to free the soldiers, so their teenage children take over. The kids find a way to venture into the foreign country and then must overcome many obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYB1bLNMvZX0hmoFNa63cQDJnCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41368'),
  ('940331582331705091', 'The Rescue', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Miguel López-Castillo', 'Tan Yuli, Wong Sze Man, Yaqing Zhi', 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Wang Yanlin, Xin Zhilei, Lyric Lan, Wang Yutian, Carlos Chan Ka-Lok, Li Mincheng, Zhang Guoqiang', null, 'A rescue unit within the Chinese Coast Guard are forced to overcome their personal differences to resolve a crisis.', 'A rescue unit within the Chinese Coast Guard are forced to overcome their personal differences to resolve a crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojFkOJUOc36O3SA0pZC1ccbAc2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613658'),
  ('186193687847578110', 'The Rescue', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Ian Seabrook, Picha Srisansanee, David Katznelson', 'Wes Tooke', 'Jim Warny, Thanet Natisri, John Volanthen, Derek Anderson, Rick Stanton, Mikko Paasi, Richard Harris, Josh Morris', 'PG', 'The enthralling, against-all-odds story that transfixed the world in 2018: the daring rescue of twelve boys and their coach from deep inside a flooded cave in Northern Thailand.', 'The enthralling, against-all-odds story that transfixed the world in 2018: the daring rescue of twelve boys and their coach from deep inside a flooded cave in Northern Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kC7fVtCkJACwPBaRr2hlj2whfKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680058'),
