  ('483647507161054406', 'The Rescuers Down Under', 1990, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Mike Gabriel, Hendel Butoy, Mary V. Buck', 'Byron Simpson, Jim Cox, Joe Ranft', 'Bob Newhart, Eva Gabor, John Candy, Tristan Rogers, Adam Ryen, George C. Scott, Wayne Robson, Douglas Seale', 'G', 'A lawless poacher wants to capture a majestic and rare golden eagle, so he kidnaps the boy who knows where to find the bird. Not to worry -- the Rescue Aid Society''s top agents, heroic mice Miss Bianca and Bernard, fly to Australia to save the day. Accompanying the fearless duo are bumbling albatross Wilbur and local field operative Jake the Kangaroo Rat.', 'A lawless poacher wants to capture a majestic and rare golden eagle, so he kidnaps the boy who knows where to find the bird. Not to worry -- the Rescue Aid Society''s top agents, heroic mice Miss Bianca and Bernard, fly to Australia to save the day. Accompanying the fearless duo are bumbling albatross Wilbur and local field operative Jake the Kangaroo Rat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5koTDBmMAkJOgAe4PL4163UKjvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11135'),
  ('138943030508934970', 'The Residence', 2025, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Manuel Dacosse, Yann Gozlan, Natalie Engelstein', 'Thomas Kruithof, Yann Gozlan, Nicolas Bouvet', 'Mylène Farmer, Cécile de France, Anna Mouglalis, Lars Mikkelsen, Frédéric Pierrot, Douglas Grauwels, Freya Mavor, Mark Irons', null, 'In the near future, during a health crisis, novelist Clarissa Katsef visits the Ludovico Foundation housing complex in search of inspiration. With the help of her AI assistant Dalloway, she finds fresh inspiration as she immerses herself in her writing.', 'In the near future, during a health crisis, novelist Clarissa Katsef visits the Ludovico Foundation housing complex in search of inspiration. With the help of her AI assistant Dalloway, she finds fresh inspiration as she immerses herself in her writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQwcaFe7rADsEDRDhS3TQTmfzLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315702'),
  ('722460105728464416', 'The Resident', 2011, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Antti J. Jokinen, Guillermo Navarro', 'Antti J. Jokinen, Robert Orr', 'Hilary Swank, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Lee Pace, Christopher Lee, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Sean Rosales, Deborah Martinez, Sheila Ivy Traister', 'R', 'Juliet, a beautiful doctor, has found the perfect New York apartment to start a new life after separating from her husband. It''s got spacious rooms, a spectacular view, and a handy, handsome landlord. But there are secrets behind every wall and terror in every room as Juliet gets the unnerving feeling that she is not alone.', 'Juliet, a beautiful doctor, has found the perfect New York apartment to start a new life after separating from her husband. It''s got spacious rooms, a spectacular view, and a handy, handsome landlord. But there are secrets behind every wall and terror in every room as Juliet gets the unnerving feeling that she is not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoZiRe5EK4vIUjvjRf1aUk5RVg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50671'),
  ('633448640876411013', 'The Resistance', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Soner Caner, Vedat Özdemir, Cem Şimşek', 'Soner Caner', 'Selahattin Paşalı, Ece Çeşmioğlu, Murat Kılıç, Dilara Akan, Ozan Ceylan, Bahadır Buyruk, Burak Dumanoğlu, Ali Ulvi Gülşen', null, 'Ecem and Rahmi, who are at the very beginning of their relationship, live in the basement of an apartment in Istanbul. Their life takes a different turn one night when Ecem''s ex-boyfriend Kazim comes to their doorstep. The anger of Rahmi, who is very jealous, causes a night full of regrets.', 'Ecem and Rahmi, who are at the very beginning of their relationship, live in the basement of an apartment in Istanbul. Their life takes a different turn one night when Ecem''s ex-boyfriend Kazim comes to their doorstep. The anger of Rahmi, who is very jealous, causes a night full of regrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NzJmh1iHDG9XR6lRpZWTFyQqax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948031'),
  ('545017153022865440', 'The Resistance Banker', 2018, 'War, Drama', 'Joram Lürsen, Mark van Aller', 'Marieke van der Pol, Matthijs Bockting, Michael Leendertse', 'Barry Atsma, Jacob Derwig, Pierre Bokma, Götz Schubert, Fockeline Ouwerkerk, Raymond Thiry, Jaap Spijkers, Tjebbo Gerritsma', 'R', 'In the occupied Netherlands during World War II, banker Walraven van Hall is asked to use his financial contacts to help the Dutch resistance. With his brother Gijs, he comes up with a risky plan to take out huge loans and use the money to finance the Resistance.', 'In the occupied Netherlands during World War II, banker Walraven van Hall is asked to use his financial contacts to help the Dutch resistance. With his brother Gijs, he comes up with a risky plan to take out huge loans and use the money to finance the Resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqAJF2muVamUQfmGmrRK9w8s1KS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497916'),
  ('634192288703368663', 'The Resistance Fighter', 2019, 'History, Action, War', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Magdalena Górka, Kacper Habisiak', 'Sylwia Wilkos, Władysław Pasikowski', 'Philippe Tłokiński, Julie Engelbrecht, Bradley James, Martin Butzke, Nico Rogner, Patrycja Volny, Jan Frycz, Tomasz Schuchardt', null, 'Based on the true story of Jan Nowak-Jezioranski, who served as a courier between the commanders of the Polish Home Army and the Polish Government in Exile in London. He must return quickly to Warsaw to transmit orders from the Polish PM to the Home Army''s commander-in-chief before the start of the Warsaw uprising.', 'Based on the true story of Jan Nowak-Jezioranski, who served as a courier between the commanders of the Polish Home Army and the Polish Government in Exile in London. He must return quickly to Warsaw to transmit orders from the Polish PM to the Home Army''s commander-in-chief before the start of the Warsaw uprising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uWOX6yAQLHzgoX3VtZwZIVGeNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582494'),
  ('622033070062505425', 'The Resonator: Miskatonic U', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brooks Davis, Justin Jones, William Butler', 'William Butler', 'Alex Keener, Dane Oliver, Christina Hélène Braa, Jeffrey Byron, Michael Paré, Amanda Wyss, Amanda Jones, Kyle Carrion', null, 'Visionary Miskatonic University student Crawford Tillinghast follows in his late father''s footsteps and becomes obsessed with completing work on the Resonator, an inter-dimensional device that opens doorways to other worlds.', 'Visionary Miskatonic University student Crawford Tillinghast follows in his late father''s footsteps and becomes obsessed with completing work on the Resonator, an inter-dimensional device that opens doorways to other worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QTxwCTMQwyMnzJDMRpRUXudKqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801485'),
  ('1068106567067866861', 'The Resort', 2021, 'Horror', 'Taylor Chien, Adriaan Kirchner, Robert Dyck', 'Taylor Chien', 'Bianca Haase, Brock O''Hurn, Michael Vlamis, Michelle Randolph, Dave Sheridan, Dante Jimenez, Romualdo Castillo, Rodney Gemberling', null, 'Four friends head to Hawaii to investigate reports of a haunting at an abandoned resort in hopes of finding the infamous Half-Faced Girl. When they arrive, they soon learn you should be careful what you wish for.', 'Four friends head to Hawaii to investigate reports of a haunting at an abandoned resort in hopes of finding the infamous Half-Faced Girl. When they arrive, they soon learn you should be careful what you wish for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXZUVJP8Fr3RId7SSsV4RXvjnIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810271'),
  ('151872505905726086', 'The Respectful Prostitute', 1952, 'Drama', 'Marcello Pagliero, Charles Brabant, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Alexandre Astruc, Jacques-Laurent Bost', 'Barbara Laage, Walter Bryant, Ivan Desny, Marcel Herrand, Louis de Funès, Yolande Laffon, Marie Olivier, André Valmy', null, 'Fred, the nephew of a senator,has murdered a Black man on a train. The two only witnesses are Lizzie McKay, a prostitute from New York, and Sidney, a colored man. Fred decides to seduce Lizzie in order to make her give false evidence according to which Sidney has attempted to rape her. The uncle also puts pressure on the young woman. After much hesitation, Lizzie finally accepts but Sidney, who has nearly got lynched, takes refuge at her home...', 'Fred, the nephew of a senator,has murdered a Black man on a train. The two only witnesses are Lizzie McKay, a prostitute from New York, and Sidney, a colored man. Fred decides to seduce Lizzie in order to make her give false evidence according to which Sidney has attempted to rape her. The uncle also puts pressure on the young woman. After much hesitation, Lizzie finally accepts but Sidney, who has nearly got lynched, takes refuge at her home...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXuR4l46lUKKxulpYXBZbJ8WF9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254348'),
  ('623662570945402123', 'The Rest Is Silence', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nae Caranfil, Marius Panduru', 'Nae Caranfil', 'Marius Florea Vizante, Ovidiu Niculescu, Mirela Zeta, Sandu Mihai Gruia, Valentin Popescu, Nicu Mihoc, Gavril Pătru, Silviu Biriș', null, 'In 1911-12, the Romanian movie director Grigore Brezianu and the financial tycoon Leon Popescu made together the 2 hours long movie "Romania''s Independence" - an as faithful as possible screen adaptation of the real Independence War that had been fought in 1877. Now, "Restul e tacere" tells us, in a loose and half-fictionalized way, the story of this movie making.', 'In 1911-12, the Romanian movie director Grigore Brezianu and the financial tycoon Leon Popescu made together the 2 hours long movie "Romania''s Independence" - an as faithful as possible screen adaptation of the real Independence War that had been fought in 1877. Now, "Restul e tacere" tells us, in a loose and half-fictionalized way, the story of this movie making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhClCWtvABM70xxQlTX5NwGhU67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29358'),
  ('754467198194453777', 'The Rest of Us', 2020, 'Drama', 'Aisling Chin-Yee, Daniel Grant, Jeremy Doiron', 'Alanna Francis', 'Heather Graham, Sophie Nélisse, Abigail Pniowsky, Jodi Balfour, Charlie Gillespie, Tameka Griffiths, Inga Cadranel, Gregory Ambrose Calderone', null, 'Two mother-daughter duos must contend with their grief and complicated relationships with one another when the person who connects them dies.', 'Two mother-daughter duos must contend with their grief and complicated relationships with one another when the person who connects them dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMjJ0acrj0W5g9c4XKiW0PFVzP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605874'),
