  ('1033569295188315552', 'The Retirement', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ricardo Díaz Iacoponi, Sol Lopatín', 'Ricardo Díaz Iacoponi, Fernando Castets, Daniel Cúparo', 'Luis Brandoni, Nancy Dupláa, Gabriel Goity, Soledad Silveyra, Marcos Da Cruz, Estela Garelli, Silvina Acosta, Debora Dejtiar', null, 'Rodolfo (Luis Brandoni) is a retired doctor. Since he was widowed a few years ago, he lives alone in his house. For an unexpected event, his daughter Laura (Nancy Dupláa) with whom he barely speaks, needs to move with him for a few days. The coexistence will bring old discussions to the table, wounds that did not heal and the opportunity for them to connect again.', 'Rodolfo (Luis Brandoni) is a retired doctor. Since he was widowed a few years ago, he lives alone in his house. For an unexpected event, his daughter Laura (Nancy Dupláa) with whom he barely speaks, needs to move with him for a few days. The coexistence will bring old discussions to the table, wounds that did not heal and the opportunity for them to connect again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LTgQf2NKmLiDAPUaMfbZ8yOxjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619716'),
  ('686303281690621255', 'The Retirement Plan', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Tonie Chisholm, Mark Irwin, Jeff Chapman', 'Tim Brown', 'Nicolas Cage, Ashley Greene, Thalia Campbell, Ron Perlman, Jackie Earle Haley, Ernie Hudson, Grace Byers, Lynn Whitfield', 'R', 'When Ashley and her young daughter Sarah get caught up in a criminal enterprise that puts their lives at risk, she turns to the only person who can help: her estranged father Matt, currently living the life of a retired beach bum in the Cayman Islands. Their reunion is fleeting as they are soon tracked down on the island by crime boss Donnie and his lieutenant Bobo. As Ashley, Sarah, and Matt become entangled in an increasingly dangerous web, Ashley quickly learns her father had a secret past that she knew nothing about and that there is more to her father than meets the eye.', 'When Ashley and her young daughter Sarah get caught up in a criminal enterprise that puts their lives at risk, she turns to the only person who can help: her estranged father Matt, currently living the life of a retired beach bum in the Cayman Islands. Their reunion is fleeting as they are soon tracked down on the island by crime boss Donnie and his lieutenant Bobo. As Ashley, Sarah, and Matt become entangled in an increasingly dangerous web, Ashley quickly learns her father had a secret past that she knew nothing about and that there is more to her father than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv4n3xgRWtkldaD4kyy1FvpW6bO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866346'),
  ('810046732514063434', 'The Retreat', 2005, 'Horror', 'Matt Cantu, Lance Kawas', 'Lance Kawas', 'Melissa Schuman, Scott Vickaryous, Shanti Lowry, Tobiasz Daszkiewicz, Thomas Zellen, Bob Brown, Randy Bergeron, Michael McKiddy', 'R', 'A group of college students travels to the cottage of their psychology professor Barren in an isolated island as a reward of their teamwork in the research of Barren. They expect to spend the weekend with lots of sex, but a serial-killer turns their party in a nightmare.', 'A group of college students travels to the cottage of their psychology professor Barren in an isolated island as a reward of their teamwork in the research of Barren. They expect to spend the weekend with lots of sex, but a serial-killer turns their party in a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZA8YEkRchRFzZTevbi6cM3VmU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19816'),
