  ('453218597149843423', 'The Return', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Türkan Şoray', 'Safa Önal', 'Türkan Şoray, Kadir İnanır, Bilâl İnci, Osman Alyanak, Hikmet Taşdemir, Mehmet Büyükgüngör, Reşit Çıldam, Nermin Özses', null, 'Gülcan and her husband İbrahim dream of a happy future together in their village. However, they are subjected to the cruelty of the Agha, the local landowner who lords over the entire village. İbrahim is fed up and moves to Germany to find work. On the other hand, Gülcan has to deal with Agha''s evils alone.', 'Gülcan and her husband İbrahim dream of a happy future together in their village. However, they are subjected to the cruelty of the Agha, the local landowner who lords over the entire village. İbrahim is fed up and moves to Germany to find work. On the other hand, Gülcan has to deal with Agha''s evils alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hggcgv0yG2Qicm7wPcb5TGqLfaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265458'),
  ('1053933490097023756', 'The Return', 1980, 'Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Greydon Clark, Daniel Pearl', 'Curtis Burch, Ken Wheat, Jim Wheat', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, Cybill Shepherd, Martin Landau, Raymond Burr, Neville Brand, Brad Rearden, Vincent Schiavelli, Darby Hinton', null, 'Two young children and an adult in a small town have an encounter with an alien spaceship. 25 years later the children are reunited as adults in the same town which is now beset by strange cattle mutilations. Matters become worse when the cattle mutilations are joined by human murders and mutilations.', 'Two young children and an adult in a small town have an encounter with an alien spaceship. 25 years later the children are reunited as adults in the same town which is now beset by strange cattle mutilations. Matters become worse when the cattle mutilations are joined by human murders and mutilations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyRNMNZMFdGKe0S3cuVELIutWPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150273'),
  ('73716256743461984', 'The Return', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jesper Høm, Jens Jørgen Thorsen', null, 'Marco Di Stefano, Johnny Melville, Jed Curtis, Jacob Haugaard, John Hahn-Petersen, Paul Hagen, Atlanta Johnson, Hans Henrik Bærentsen', null, 'Jesus returns to Earth, gets involved in a terrorist group, but keeps his integrity.', 'Jesus returns to Earth, gets involved in a terrorist group, but keeps his integrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbHjlQqO3pUos2HIJcaHSpialrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110243'),
  ('1114100143883863102', 'The Return', 2003, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mikhail Krichman, Andrey Zvyagintsev, Andrey Khudyakov', 'Vladimir Moiseenko, Aleksandr Novototskiy-Vlasov', 'Vladimir Garin, Konstantin Lavronenko, Nataliya Vdovina, Ivan Dobronravov, Lazar Dubovik, Lyubov Kazakova, Galina Petrova, Aleksey Suknovalov', null, 'Two young brothers in contemporary Russia are reunited with a father they know only from an old photograph after his sudden return from a long absence. With their mother’s reluctant consent, they set out on a remote trip that quickly becomes an uneasy test of authority, trust, and masculinity. As the journey moves deeper into the wilderness, the fragile bonds between father and sons are pushed to their limits.', 'Two young brothers in contemporary Russia are reunited with a father they know only from an old photograph after his sudden return from a long absence. With their mother’s reluctant consent, they set out on a remote trip that quickly becomes an uneasy test of authority, trust, and masculinity. As the journey moves deeper into the wilderness, the fragile bonds between father and sons are pushed to their limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7V8iHBs34cPYw7ohpLqliF9x8Gv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11190'),
  ('570567874008287067', 'The Return', 2006, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Asif Kapadia, Roman Osin', 'Adam Sussman', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Peter O''Brien, Adam Scott, Kate Beahan, Sam Shepard, J.C. MacKenzie, Wally Welch, Brad Leland', 'PG-13', 'Joanna Mills has a successful career but feels her personal life is spinning out of control. She has few friends, an estranged father, and a crazy ex-boyfriend who is stalking her. Joanna begins having terrifying visions of a woman''s murder, and it seems that she is the killer''s next target. Determined to solve the mystery and escape her apparent fate, Joanna follows her visions to the victim''s hometown and finds that some secrets just do not stay buried.', 'Joanna Mills has a successful career but feels her personal life is spinning out of control. She has few friends, an estranged father, and a crazy ex-boyfriend who is stalking her. Joanna begins having terrifying visions of a woman''s murder, and it seems that she is the killer''s next target. Determined to solve the mystery and escape her apparent fate, Joanna follows her visions to the victim''s hometown and finds that some secrets just do not stay buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywBeNqMJKBowfwrv274blsVXCB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10093'),
  ('219947918611762212', 'The Return', 2011, 'Drama', 'Hernán Jiménez, Nicolás Wong', 'Hernán Jiménez', 'Bárbara Jimenez, Andre Boxwill, Hernán Jiménez, Luis Fernando Gomez, Daniel Ross Mix, Yessenia Artavia', null, 'After a decade abroad, Antonio returns to Costa Rica for a short visit. Unable to run away as usual, he is confronted with everything he has desperately struggled to put in the past: a broken family, an ailing father, a violent country and long lost friends.', 'After a decade abroad, Antonio returns to Costa Rica for a short visit. Unable to run away as usual, he is confronted with everything he has desperately struggled to put in the past: a broken family, an ailing father, a violent country and long lost friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reozKWfrxIyyIdbjDXNGk5PBxuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232074'),
  ('1524534043825534', 'The Return', 2017, 'Documentary, Action', 'Erich Joiner', 'Derek Boonstra, Erich Joiner', null, null, 'The Return is a 2016 documentary directed by Emmy Award winning director Erich Joiner chronicling Ford GT''s return to 24 Hours of Le Mans after their 1966 1-2-3 victory.', 'The Return is a 2016 documentary directed by Emmy Award winning director Erich Joiner chronicling Ford GT''s return to 24 Hours of Le Mans after their 1966 1-2-3 victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ROvTxTwcCN8CyxrV4Rhun9MhYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463520'),
  ('557879754310554187', 'The Return', 2022, 'Drama', 'Stefano Chiantini', null, 'Emma Marrone, Fabrizio Rongione, Lorenzo Ciamei, Tihana Lazović, Beatrice Schiaffino, Diego Capretta Quilez, Luca Capretta Quilez, Sandra Ceccarelli', null, 'Teresa, a mother from the Lazio suburbs, finds herself making an extreme gesture to defend her family from an unscrupulous loan shark. After serving her prison sentence, she must face the return to everyday life.', 'Teresa, a mother from the Lazio suburbs, finds herself making an extreme gesture to defend her family from an unscrupulous loan shark. After serving her prison sentence, she must face the return to everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX34hT6U8rpLggupmmZ9QRVSo9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052005'),
  ('799012724976145826', 'The Return', 2024, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'Uberto Pasolini, Marius Panduru', 'John Collee, Edward Bond, Uberto Pasolini', 'Ralph Fiennes, Juliette Binoche, Charlie Plummer, Marwan Kenzari, Claudio Santamaria, Ángela Molina, Nikitas Tsakiroglou, Tom Rhys Harries', 'R', 'After twenty years away, Odysseus washes up on the shores of Ithaca, haggard and unrecognizable. The king has finally returned home, but much has changed in his kingdom since he left to fight in the Trojan war.', 'After twenty years away, Odysseus washes up on the shores of Ithaca, haggard and unrecognizable. The king has finally returned home, but much has changed in his kingdom since he left to fight in the Trojan war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSj6EbdwHs3MFT2tRj9L3I7TE5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975511'),
  ('618734608352585713', 'The Return from Olympus', 1969, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya', 'Aleksey Simukov', 'Erast Garin, Aleksei Gribov, Natalya Kustinskaya, Mikhail Pogorzhelsky, Sofya Zajkova, Mikhail Novokhizhin, Aleksey Konsovskiy', null, 'Olympus. Here are all the most important gods: mighty Zeus, his treacherous wife Hera, handsome singer Apollo, ruler of the seas Poseidon, warrior Ares, goddess of beauty and love Aphrodite and wise Athena. Here is the illegitimate son of Zeus, Hercules - a demigod-half-man. Having missed the Earth, he begs for travel on it from Zeus before sunrise. He is accompanied by an eagle - a cunning and insinuating creature, the same one who once pecked Prometheus and from which Hercules saved him. On Earth, Hercules enters the temple dedicated to him and his twelve feats. There he remembers some of them.', 'Olympus. Here are all the most important gods: mighty Zeus, his treacherous wife Hera, handsome singer Apollo, ruler of the seas Poseidon, warrior Ares, goddess of beauty and love Aphrodite and wise Athena. Here is the illegitimate son of Zeus, Hercules - a demigod-half-man. Having missed the Earth, he begs for travel on it from Zeus before sunrise. He is accompanied by an eagle - a cunning and insinuating creature, the same one who once pecked Prometheus and from which Hercules saved him. On Earth, Hercules enters the temple dedicated to him and his twelve feats. There he remembers some of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4A6FITWRZwZ40RihqLTq2U9ssg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440629'),
  ('468473581642462322', 'The Return of a Man Called Horse', 1976, 'Western, Adventure', 'Irvin Kershner, Owen Roizman, Michael D. Moore', 'Jack DeWitt', 'Richard Harris, Gale Sondergaard, Geoffrey Lewis, Jorge Luke, Jorge Russek, Claudio Brook, Enrique Lucero, William Lucking', 'PG', 'Lord John Morgan has returned to civilized life in England, but finds he has nothing but disdain for that life. Yearning to embrace the simplicity of the American West, and the Sioux tribe he left behind, Morgan returns to the their land only to discover that they''ve been decimated by ruthless, government-backed fur traders. Led by Horse, they fight to repossess their land.', 'Lord John Morgan has returned to civilized life in England, but finds he has nothing but disdain for that life. Yearning to embrace the simplicity of the American West, and the Sioux tribe he left behind, Morgan returns to the their land only to discover that they''ve been decimated by ruthless, government-backed fur traders. Led by Horse, they fight to repossess their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rY1APSm1zlu0nX9VeIe10J67SRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35200'),
  ('1061080357247958439', 'The Return of Bruno', 1987, 'Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'James Yukich, Jeff Zimmerman', 'Paul Flattery, Bruce Willis', 'Bruce Willis, Jon Bon Jovi, Ringo Starr, Elton John, Phil Collins, Michael J. Fox, Bill Graham, Dick Clark', null, 'A "documentary" about the major influence that a ''60s rock singer named Bruno has had on rock music, as attested to by such rock legends as Ringo Starr, Brian Wilson and the Bee Gees, among others.', 'A "documentary" about the major influence that a ''60s rock singer named Bruno has had on rock music, as attested to by such rock legends as Ringo Starr, Brian Wilson and the Bee Gees, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnusKQ8dYC4RCyHweNKsb5fyAyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132542'),
  ('926074105564212802', 'The Return of Bulldog Drummond', 1934, 'Crime', 'Walter Summers, Jack Parker', 'Walter Summers', 'Ralph Richardson, Ann Todd, Francis L. Sullivan, Claud Allister, H. Saxon-Snell, Spencer Trevor, Charles Mortimer, Wallace Geoffrey', null, 'Bulldog Drummond forms a gang to rescue his wife and thwart his nemesis, Carl Peterson.', 'Bulldog Drummond forms a gang to rescue his wife and thwart his nemesis, Carl Peterson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71H8SnL7Wdk1V6nn0OJfptcaCA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140469'),
  ('1054129095424313587', 'The Return of Cagliostro', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Daniele Ciprì, Franco Maresco, Daniele Ciprì', 'Franco Maresco, Daniele Ciprì', 'Robert Englund, Luigi Maria Burruano, Franco Vito Gaiezza, Pietro Giordano, Davide Marotta, Franco Scaldati, Mauro Spitaleri, Gino Carista', null, 'In the Sicily of the late 1940s, two brother sculptors, tired of selling madonnas to the local churches, finally realize their dream, and set up a Sicilian production company, thanks to the help of a local bishop. They start producing one box-office failure Z-movie after the other, all with terribly bad local non-pros as actors. Covered in debts, they finally have their great chance, when a local nobleman obsessed by magic decides to invest all his wealth in the making of a movie about Cagliostro, just one year after Orson Welles'' Black Magic (1949). They hire a famous American actor (Robert Englund) and start shooting "The Return of Cagliostro".', 'In the Sicily of the late 1940s, two brother sculptors, tired of selling madonnas to the local churches, finally realize their dream, and set up a Sicilian production company, thanks to the help of a local bishop. They start producing one box-office failure Z-movie after the other, all with terribly bad local non-pros as actors. Covered in debts, they finally have their great chance, when a local nobleman obsessed by magic decides to invest all his wealth in the making of a movie about Cagliostro, just one year after Orson Welles'' Black Magic (1949). They hire a famous American actor (Robert Englund) and start shooting "The Return of Cagliostro".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7W2WbHSXUTkjTxl7pys0ACFHck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77562'),
  ('78567703563794439', 'The Return of Captain Invincible', 1983, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Philippe Mora, Mike Molloy', 'Steven E. de Souza, Andrew Gaty, Peter Smalley', 'Alan Arkin, Christopher Lee, Kate Fitzpatrick, Bill Hunter, Michael Pate, David Argue, John Bluthal, Chelsea Brown', 'PG', 'In WWII, Captain Invincible used his superpowers against the Nazis and was hailed as a hero. But when he was accused of treason, he retired to Australia in disgrace. Cut to the present, when a US super secret super weapon is stolen and he''s asked to come back to the States in order to help stop evil and restore his sterling reputation. Unfortunately, Captain Invincible is a drunk now...', 'In WWII, Captain Invincible used his superpowers against the Nazis and was hailed as a hero. But when he was accused of treason, he retired to Australia in disgrace. Cut to the present, when a US super secret super weapon is stolen and he''s asked to come back to the States in order to help stop evil and restore his sterling reputation. Unfortunately, Captain Invincible is a drunk now...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTdItOSkEkNbWd2sWfIRPDMFYtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71016'),
  ('789463309642989988', 'The Return of Casanova', 1992, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Édouard Niermans, Jean Penzer', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Alain Delon, Fabrice Luchini, Elsa Lunghini, Wadeck Stanczak, Delia Boccardo, Gilles Arbona, Violetta Sanchez, Jacques Boudet', null, 'After many years of rambling across Europe the aging Giacomo Casanova is impoverished. He wants to return to the Republic of Venice but he doesn''t dare going there directly because he was a fugitive when he left. While he tries to find a way to get a pardon he meets a young lady named Marcelina. The more he shows his affection, the more ostentatiously she rejects him. Even so he doesn''t give up on her because her lover Lorenzo has grave gaming debts. In return for the required money Lorenzo tells Casanova about a looming secret rendezvous with Marcelina. Moreover he lets Casanova take his place. Undercover of the night Casanova finally seduces her. Lorenzo later feels his honor was besmirched and demands satisfaction. Casanova kills him in a duel and then goes home to Venice.', 'After many years of rambling across Europe the aging Giacomo Casanova is impoverished. He wants to return to the Republic of Venice but he doesn''t dare going there directly because he was a fugitive when he left. While he tries to find a way to get a pardon he meets a young lady named Marcelina. The more he shows his affection, the more ostentatiously she rejects him. Even so he doesn''t give up on her because her lover Lorenzo has grave gaming debts. In return for the required money Lorenzo tells Casanova about a looming secret rendezvous with Marcelina. Moreover he lets Casanova take his place. Undercover of the night Casanova finally seduces her. Lorenzo later feels his honor was besmirched and demands satisfaction. Casanova kills him in a duel and then goes home to Venice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnWR4huwfUjKZUw0eOsBEd655Nn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172303'),
  ('36731704765852321', 'The Return of Chandu', 1934, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance, Adventure, Horror', 'Ray Taylor, John Hickson', 'Vera M. Oldham, Harry A. Earnshaw, R.R. Morgan', 'Bela Lugosi, Maria Alba, Murdock MacQuarrie, Clara Kimball Young, Dean Benton, Phyllis Ludwig, Lucien Prival, Cyril Armbrister', null, 'Chandu consults his crystal ball and sees that Nadji, Princess of Egypt, is in danger. She is about to be sacrificed by the black magic cult of Ubasti. Headed for the magic island of Lemuria, he is shipwrecked , washed ashore and captured. He becomes invisible, escapes and after numerous detours is able to rescue the princess.', 'Chandu consults his crystal ball and sees that Nadji, Princess of Egypt, is in danger. She is about to be sacrificed by the black magic cult of Ubasti. Headed for the magic island of Lemuria, he is shipwrecked , washed ashore and captured. He becomes invisible, escapes and after numerous detours is able to rescue the princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuL3h5VAwMtcmle7b6dQnL1WGIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100100'),
  ('980066511345718824', 'The Return of Count Yorga', 1971, 'Horror', 'Bob Kelljan, Jack Oliver, Bill Butler', 'Bob Kelljan, Yvonne Wilder', 'Robert Quarry, Mariette Hartley, Roger Perry, Yvonne Wilder, Tom Toner, Rudy De Luca, George Macready, Walter Brooke', 'R', 'Count Yorga continues to prey on the local community while living by a nearby orphanage. He also intends to take a new wife, while feeding his bevy of female vampires.', 'Count Yorga continues to prey on the local community while living by a nearby orphanage. He also intends to take a new wife, while feeding his bevy of female vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GFQ3MbdJlIRxlmjAeqhUsrOTtv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28855'),
  ('506158047860928722', 'The Return of Doctor X', 1939, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Vincent Sherman, Sidney Hickox', 'Lee Katz', 'Humphrey Bogart, Rosemary Lane, Wayne Morris, Dennis Morgan, John Litel, Lya Lys, Huntz Hall, Charles C. Wilson', null, 'When news reporter Walter Garrett arrives at the hotel room of bombshell actress Angela Merrova to conduct an interview, he finds her dead from multiple stab wounds. He returns with the police to find the hotel empty and the body vanished. Garrett writes about the incident but is fired when Merrova, alive and well, goes to the paper to complain. Now his only chance to get his job back is to find the truth, which involves the grisly scheme of a madman.', 'When news reporter Walter Garrett arrives at the hotel room of bombshell actress Angela Merrova to conduct an interview, he finds her dead from multiple stab wounds. He returns with the police to find the hotel empty and the body vanished. Garrett writes about the incident but is fired when Merrova, alive and well, goes to the paper to complain. Now his only chance to get his job back is to find the truth, which involves the grisly scheme of a madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZoZ5iyiBx0DDmNs3C7nCvUvbES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3575'),
  ('463643037326524956', 'The Return of Don Camillo', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Julien Duvivier, Anchise Brizzi, Michel Romanoff', 'René Barjavel, Julien Duvivier', 'Fernandel, Gino Cervi, Arturo Bragaglia, Édouard Delmont, Alexandre Rignault, Saro Urzì, Paolo Stoppa, Thomy Bourdelle', null, 'Energetic priest Don Camillo returns to the town of Brescello for more political and personal duels with Communist mayor Peppone.', 'Energetic priest Don Camillo returns to the town of Brescello for more political and personal duels with Communist mayor Peppone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DPSCKSwMYsGnu2X4w7iOGI9vHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11578'),
  ('978179515827690097', 'The Return of Dr. Fu Manchu', 1930, 'Adventure, Mystery, Romance, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Rowland V. Lee, Archie Stout', 'Lloyd Corrigan, Florence Ryerson', 'Warner Oland, O. P. Heggie, Jean Arthur, Neil Hamilton, Evelyn Hall, William Austin, Margaret Fealy, Shayle Gardner', 'NR', 'The sinister Dr. Fu Manchu returns to destroy the people he holds responsible for the death of his family.', 'The sinister Dr. Fu Manchu returns to destroy the people he holds responsible for the death of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0EMfzvv8fq9LiQ2vxjSNek4nS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177876'),
  ('760820124397322', 'The Return of Dr. Mabuse', 1961, 'Crime, Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Harald Reinl, Karl Löb, Carl von Barany', 'Marc Behm, Ladislas Fodor', 'Gert Fröbe, Lex Barker, Daliah Lavi, Werner Peters, Fausto Tozzi, Joachim Mock, Rudolf Forster, Rudolf Fernau', null, 'The supposedly dead and buried Mabuse returns to his criminal activities, as his longtime foe Police Inspector Lohmann, a dauntless girl reporter, and an American - who may be an FBI agent, or maybe a Chicago mobster - investigate a series of gruesome murders connected to a maximum security prison and involving a minister who has written a book called "The Anatomy Of The Devil".', 'The supposedly dead and buried Mabuse returns to his criminal activities, as his longtime foe Police Inspector Lohmann, a dauntless girl reporter, and an American - who may be an FBI agent, or maybe a Chicago mobster - investigate a series of gruesome murders connected to a maximum security prison and involving a minister who has written a book called "The Anatomy Of The Devil".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wUn7RotbM1RSq9wdpRNJtakRWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19129'),
  ('443148506703904362', 'The Return of Dracula', 1958, 'Horror', 'Paul Landres, Jack MacKenzie', 'Pat Fielder', 'Francis Lederer, Norma Eberhardt, Ray Stricklyn, John Wengraf, Virginia Vincent, Gage Clarke, Jimmy Baird, Greta Granstedt', 'NR', 'After a vampire leaves his native Balkans, he murders a Czech artist, assumes his identity, and moves in with the dead man''s American cousins.', 'After a vampire leaves his native Balkans, he murders a Czech artist, assumes his identity, and moves in with the dead man''s American cousins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRL3lGJ1WoWXbsqcClBw7KrrsJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53187'),
  ('116163496639534210', 'The Return of Frank James', 1940, 'Western', 'Fritz Lang, George Barnes, Hal Herman', 'Sam Hellman', 'Henry Fonda, Jackie Cooper, Gene Tierney, Henry Hull, John Carradine, J. Edward Bromberg, Donald Meek, Eddie Collins', 'NR', 'Farmer Frank and his ward hunt brother Jesse''s killers, the back-shooting Fords.', 'Farmer Frank and his ward hunt brother Jesse''s killers, the back-shooting Fords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4e2X31I53QCIIxxLD62pjevLrSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43821'),
  ('323063879636639165', 'The Return of Godzilla', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Kazutami Hara, Toshimitsu Oneda, Koji Hashimoto', 'Hideichi Nagahara', 'Keiju Kobayashi, Ken Tanaka, Yasuko Sawaguchi, Shin Takuma, Yōsuke Natsuki, Eitarō Ozawa, Taketoshi Naitō, Nobuo Kaneko', null, 'After a fishing boat is attacked, the sole surviving crew member realizes it is none other than a resurrected Godzilla. However, efforts to bring the story to light are suppressed by the Japanese government amid growing political tensions between the United States and the Soviet Union, who are both willing to bomb Japan to stop the monster.', 'After a fishing boat is attacked, the sole surviving crew member realizes it is none other than a resurrected Godzilla. However, efforts to bring the story to light are suppressed by the Japanese government amid growing political tensions between the United States and the Soviet Union, who are both willing to bomb Japan to stop the monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6jPBig1P30VZmFTZJdLzFk3hrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421467'),
  ('803147672722310744', 'The Return of Ironside', 1993, 'TV Movie', 'Gary Nelson', 'Rob Hedden, William Read Woodfield', 'Raymond Burr, Don Galloway, Barbara Anderson, Elizabeth Baur, Don Mitchell, Dana Wynter, Perrey Reeves, Eddie Jones', null, 'After forty years of good and faithful services, Robert T. Ironside, reprocessed police force of San Francisco, is finally on the point of tasting with the joys of a rest deserved well with Katherine, his wife, in their vineyard recently bought. However, a few days after his official departure, he is contacted by persons in charge for the police force of Denver, which offers the post of general manager temporarily to him their services, following the assassination for preceding occupying of the station in question. Initially reticent, Ironside ends up yielding and, with the agreement of his wife, agrees to take up the challenge, the more so as he has pleasure to find Susan, the girl of the one of her former assistants.', 'After forty years of good and faithful services, Robert T. Ironside, reprocessed police force of San Francisco, is finally on the point of tasting with the joys of a rest deserved well with Katherine, his wife, in their vineyard recently bought. However, a few days after his official departure, he is contacted by persons in charge for the police force of Denver, which offers the post of general manager temporarily to him their services, following the assassination for preceding occupying of the station in question. Initially reticent, Ironside ends up yielding and, with the agreement of his wife, agrees to take up the challenge, the more so as he has pleasure to find Susan, the girl of the one of her former assistants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzIs0DiavsZPbQ9dD6F3ZyuS9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174966'),
  ('399637619903162563', 'The Return of Jafar', 1994, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Romance', 'Tad Stones, Alan Zaslove, Toby Shelton', 'Brian Swenlin, Mirith J. Colao, Bob Roth', 'Scott Weinger, Linda Larkin, Jonathan Freeman, Gilbert Gottfried, Dan Castellaneta, Frank Welker, Val Bettin, Jason Alexander', 'G', 'The evil Jafar escapes from the magic lamp as an all-powerful genie, ready to plot his revenge against Aladdin. From battling elusive villains atop winged horses, to dodging flames inside an exploding lava pit, it''s up to Aladdin - with Princess Jasmine and the outrageously funny Genie by his side - to save the kingdom once and for all.', 'The evil Jafar escapes from the magic lamp as an all-powerful genie, ready to plot his revenge against Aladdin. From battling elusive villains atop winged horses, to dodging flames inside an exploding lava pit, it''s up to Aladdin - with Princess Jasmine and the outrageously funny Genie by his side - to save the kingdom once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SC793qtORB6YL4mu0F5o3hfjDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15969'),
  ('807674021696633753', 'The Return of James Battle', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy, Horror', 'Didier Poiraud, Thierry Poiraud, Philippe Le Sourd', 'Jean-Phillippe Dugand, Marie Garel-Weiss, Didier Poiraud', 'Vanessa Paradis, Jason Flemyng, Benoît Poelvoorde, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Venantino Venantini, Vincent Tavier, Bouli Lanners, Jacky Lambert', null, 'James Bataille is in love. He attempts to stage an elaborate motorcycle stunt to impress the girl, but when it goes sour, he ends up in prison with a 133-year sentence. Bataille escapes from behind bars to make an appointment to fix the car of music biz tycoon, as well as watch the love of his life take part in the town''s annual talent show.', 'James Bataille is in love. He attempts to stage an elaborate motorcycle stunt to impress the girl, but when it goes sour, he ends up in prison with a 133-year sentence. Bataille escapes from behind bars to make an appointment to fix the car of music biz tycoon, as well as watch the love of his life take part in the town''s annual talent show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5rF1Ryz6dCmiPKQUjmiRBWNzMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25714'),
  ('582744549083892814', 'The Return of La Llorona', 2021, 'Horror', 'Liana Hassim', 'Patricia Ramos', 'Lucila Benedith, Claudia Mercedes Cruz Flores, Hebert Castro, Jessica Redondo, Carlos Arturo San Martin Amador, Laura Gisela Castejon Martinez, Edgar Otoniel Merlo Paz, Bryan Josue Mendoza Sarmiento', null, 'La Llorona, a supernatural being who seeks revenge for the death of her daughters, attacks a group of young people on vacation at the beach after they accidentally kill a young girl.', 'La Llorona, a supernatural being who seeks revenge for the death of her daughters, attacks a group of young people on vacation at the beach after they accidentally kill a young girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G4MSlG8bSWXATU95o1hqsFxZkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888111'),
  ('973763672644260387', 'The Return of Martin Guerre', 1982, 'Drama, History', 'André Neau, Daniel Vigne, Paul Maigret', 'Daniel Vigne, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Gérard Depardieu, Nathalie Baye, Maurice Barrier, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Isabelle Sadoyan, Rose Thiéry, Chantal Deruaz, André Chaumeau', null, 'Village of Artigat, southern France, summer 1542, during the reign of Francis I. Martin Guerre and Bertrande de Rols marry. A few years later, accused of having committed a robbery, Martin suddenly disappears. When, almost a decade later, a man arrives in Artigat claiming to be Martin, the Guerre family recognizes him as such; but doubts soon arise about his true identity.', 'Village of Artigat, southern France, summer 1542, during the reign of Francis I. Martin Guerre and Bertrande de Rols marry. A few years later, accused of having committed a robbery, Martin suddenly disappears. When, almost a decade later, a man arrives in Artigat claiming to be Martin, the Guerre family recognizes him as such; but doubts soon arise about his true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNMjsqJYUt79YYwdO43OF7mpAKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4483'),
  ('815094232458172089', 'The Return of Mr. Hook', 1945, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Lake, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Seaman Hook has big plans for after the war, mostly involving rushing home and marrying his sweetie. So do his fellow seaman, but theirs involve buying bonds.', 'Seaman Hook has big plans for after the war, mostly involving rushing home and marrying his sweetie. So do his fellow seaman, but theirs involve buying bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Nc5sK9osMxU3mtCqUdT6rimZwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236996'),
  ('272122077652322901', 'The Return of Pom Pom', 1984, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ricky Lau, Philip Chan Yan-Kin', 'Jo Chan Wai-Yee', 'Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, John Shum Kin-Fun, Deanie Ip, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Lam Ching-Ying, Philip Chan Yan-Kin, James Tien Chun, Maria Chung Wai-Bing', null, 'Hong Kong detectives Chau and Beethoven return in this sequel to "Pom Pom." This time out, they join forces with their boss, Inspector Chan, to find the notorious Flying Spider, who is suspected of stealing government money Chan was responsible for. Meanwhile, Beethoven falls in love with Flying Spider''s daughter, Mimi.', 'Hong Kong detectives Chau and Beethoven return in this sequel to "Pom Pom." This time out, they join forces with their boss, Inspector Chan, to find the notorious Flying Spider, who is suspected of stealing government money Chan was responsible for. Meanwhile, Beethoven falls in love with Flying Spider''s daughter, Mimi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKmM0p4sF8XbldouGZebtLjTwG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380819'),
  ('211931299590994667', 'The Return of Ringo', 1965, 'Western', 'Duccio Tessari, Francisco Marín, Mahnahén Velasco', 'Duccio Tessari, Fernando Di Leo', 'Giuliano Gemma, Lorella De Luca, Fernando Sancho, Antonio Casas, Nieves Navarro, Manuel Muñiz, Mónica Sugranes, Víctor Bayo', 'NR', 'Once again billed as Montgomery Wood, Giuliano Gemma plays a civil war soldier who returns to his family land to find his family decimated, his property taken over by a family of Mexican bandits and his fiancee about to marry the Mexican gangster behind all this. Bent on revenge, he goes undercover disguised as a Mexican and discovers he has a daughter!', 'Once again billed as Montgomery Wood, Giuliano Gemma plays a civil war soldier who returns to his family land to find his family decimated, his property taken over by a family of Mexican bandits and his fiancee about to marry the Mexican gangster behind all this. Bent on revenge, he goes undercover disguised as a Mexican and discovers he has a daughter!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jsEyb8KTNRfUq35TrTIzmdbnfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63260'),
  ('1138862748370690383', 'The Return of Sister Street Fighter', 1975, 'Action, Crime', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi, Takashi Hio, Shunichi Kajima', 'Masahiro Kakefuda, Takeo Kaneko', 'Etsuko Shihomi, Yasuaki Kurata, Akane Kawasaki, Miwa Cho, Mitchi Love, Rinichi Yamamoto, Masashi Ishibashi, Jirô Chiba', null, 'When Koryu''s childhood friend Shurei is abducted by gangsters, the desperate young woman recruits a female martial artist and a tough-as-nails stranger to join her for a dangerous rescue mission.', 'When Koryu''s childhood friend Shurei is abducted by gangsters, the desperate young woman recruits a female martial artist and a tough-as-nails stranger to join her for a dangerous rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psto61LrBvp7enqKrztjo5Ix2K6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91845'),
  ('951568945370870070', 'The Return of Superfly', 1990, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Sig Shore, Anghel Decca, Sarah Hyde Hamlet', 'Anthony Wisdom', 'Nathan Purdee, Margaret Avery, Leonard L. Thomas, Christopher Curry, Carlos Carrasco, Samuel L. Jackson, Luis Antonio Ramos, Kirk Taylor', 'R', 'Priest returns to New York from Paris to find his friend''s murderer. With a couple of new allies, he attempts to bring the killers to justice while trying not to get into criminal activity like he did years ago.', 'Priest returns to New York from Paris to find his friend''s murderer. With a couple of new allies, he attempts to bring the killers to justice while trying not to get into criminal activity like he did years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qh511iOJJ36TgDA7yUN3iRBtN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14707'),
  ('388666068295743858', 'The Return of Superman', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kunt Tulgar, Arif Erkus, Galip Kizilova', 'Necdet Tok', 'Tayfun Demir, Güngör Bayrak, Yıldırım Gencer, Nejat Özbek, Eşref Kolçak, Renan Fosforoğlu, Şeref Çokşeker, Reha Yurdakul', null, 'Born out of a Christmas ornaments-filled heaven, Turkish Superman fights the mob in order to save the day!', 'Born out of a Christmas ornaments-filled heaven, Turkish Superman fights the mob in order to save the day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCSP0r65Sc0zxB9yWdXZ61HLVAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106913'),
  ('409833421967938268', 'The Return of Swamp Thing', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jim Wynorski, Zoran Hochstätter', 'Neil Cuthbert, Grant Morris', 'Louis Jourdan, Heather Locklear, Sarah Douglas, Dick Durock, Joey Sagal, Ace Mask, Monique Gabrielle, RonReaco Lee', 'PG-13', 'The Swamp Thing returns to battle the evil Dr. Arcane, who has a new science lab full of creatures transformed by genetic mutation, and chooses Heather Locklear as his new object of affection.', 'The Swamp Thing returns to battle the evil Dr. Arcane, who has a new science lab full of creatures transformed by genetic mutation, and chooses Heather Locklear as his new object of affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sm1Yi1hgj805b9o2a1uC6BXhqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19142'),
  ('1092607124729500449', 'The Return Of The ''Saint Luke''', 1970, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Anatoliy Bobrovskiy, Vasily Kosteltsev, Arnold Ides', 'Vladimir Kuznetsov, Boris Shustrov, Sergey Derkovskiy', 'Vsevolod Sanayev, Vladislav Dvorzhetsky, Oleg Basilashvili, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Natalya Rychagova, Valeri Ryzhakov, Vladimir Smirnov, Valeri Belyakov', null, 'In the first movie colonel Zorin is trying to find a stolen "Saint Luke" painting.', 'In the first movie colonel Zorin is trying to find a stolen "Saint Luke" painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcvM1mY32p6Jse6U9c1TmYOo3GO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92527'),
  ('875214018098070728', 'The Return of the Exorcist', 1975, 'Horror', 'Franco Lo Cascio, Angelo Pannacciò, Franco Villa', 'Giulio Albonico, Franco Brocani, Aldo Crudo', 'Richard Conte, Françoise Prévost, Patrizia Gori, Jean-Claude Vernè, Sonia Viviani, Elisabeth Tulin, Mimma Biscardi, Franco Garofalo', null, 'An archaeology student photographs a mysterious naked woman by a waterfall, unaware that she is a female demon called Haggia, who soon takes possession of him via a cursed amulet.', 'An archaeology student photographs a mysterious naked woman by a waterfall, unaware that she is a female demon called Haggia, who soon takes possession of him via a cursed amulet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDPbaz8KdrGIjQGtTy4MmXSds2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174650'),
  ('989098706187909104', 'The Return of the Incredible Hulk', 1977, 'TV Movie, Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alan J. Levi, Charles W. Short, Walt Gilmore', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Bill Bixby, Jack Colvin, Lou Ferrigno, Laurie Prange, Dorothy Tristan, John McLiam, William Daniels, Gerald McRaney', null, 'Continuing his solitary flight, David Banner arrives in a small town where he saves the life of a young heiress, the target of a deadly conspiracy orchestrated by her stepmother and a corrupt physician. While working undercover to protect the girl and dismantle the plot, Banner must struggle to contain the beast within, especially when the arrival of reporter Jack McGee threatens to expose his secret to the world.', 'Continuing his solitary flight, David Banner arrives in a small town where he saves the life of a young heiress, the target of a deadly conspiracy orchestrated by her stepmother and a corrupt physician. While working undercover to protect the girl and dismantle the plot, Banner must struggle to contain the beast within, especially when the arrival of reporter Jack McGee threatens to expose his secret to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myEZ1ne2jvM09NRPm3PwUedPqiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166890'),
  ('394119294564844196', 'The Return of the King', 1980, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass', 'Romeo Muller', 'Orson Bean, Roddy McDowall, John Huston, Theodore Gottlieb, Casey Kasem, Sonny Melendrez, Theodore Bikel, William Conrad', 'NR', 'Two Hobbits struggle to destroy the Ring in Mount Doom while their friends desperately fight evil Lord Sauron''s forces in a final battle.', 'Two Hobbits struggle to destroy the Ring in Mount Doom while their friends desperately fight evil Lord Sauron''s forces in a final battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTwUT4NsSyUQlHV20Mx3C96JHq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361'),
  ('862014363148732021', 'The Return of the Lame Hero', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tong Zhijian, Piao Xinghai, Zhao Nan', 'Chen Junyi, Tu Hua', 'Wang Anyu, Zhang Tian''ai, Nie Yuan, Wang Yanlin, Feng Bing, Wu Jiakai, Kong Lingmei, Huang Xiaolei', null, 'Hiding among the gangsters is like walking on thin ice—can the fiery youth hold onto their original aspirations and prove themselves? As the wheels of time roll on, the gangsters'' rampant activities and "spectacles" have faded away. Today''s peace and security are our best "proof".', 'Hiding among the gangsters is like walking on thin ice—can the fiery youth hold onto their original aspirations and prove themselves? As the wheels of time roll on, the gangsters'' rampant activities and "spectacles" have faded away. Today''s peace and security are our best "proof".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP2tCUDhvgqTShBNdtfuGtqJH9R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1402481'),
  ('507685537544863375', 'The Return of the Living Dead', 1985, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jules Brenner, Dan O''Bannon, Scott Javine', 'Dan O''Bannon', 'Clu Gulager, James Karen, Don Calfa, Thom Mathews, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Brian Peck, John Philbin, Linnea Quigley', 'R', 'When two bumbling employees at a medical supply warehouse accidentally release a deadly gas into the air, the vapors cause the dead to rise again as zombies.', 'When two bumbling employees at a medical supply warehouse accidentally release a deadly gas into the air, the vapors cause the dead to rise again as zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNsV9BychAe4Sk6xFKp558Rlpyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10925'),
  ('793384331362044862', 'The Return of the Man from U.N.C.L.E.: The Fifteen Years Later Affair', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fred J. Koenekamp, Ray Austin, Craig Huston', 'Michael Sloan, Sam Rolfe', 'Robert Vaughn, David McCallum, Patrick Macnee, George Lazenby, Tom Mason, Gayle Hunnicutt, Geoffrey Lewis, Anthony Zerbe', null, 'When THRUSH steals a nuclear weapon and demands a ransom delivered by Napoleon Solo, UNCLE recalls him and his partner to duty.', 'When THRUSH steals a nuclear weapon and demands a ransom delivered by Napoleon Solo, UNCLE recalls him and his partner to duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63RlXOunT1lFlyIOZnoxQsOzHzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94116'),
  ('462276481261720922', 'The Return of the Musketeers', 1989, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Richard Lester, Bernard Lutic, Clive Reed', 'George MacDonald Fraser', 'Michael York, Oliver Reed, Frank Finlay, C. Thomas Howell, Kim Cattrall, Geraldine Chaplin, Roy Kinnear, Christopher Lee', 'PG', 'It''s 1649: Mazarin hires the impoverished D''Artagnan to find the other musketeers: Cromwell has overthrown the English king, so Mazarin fears revolt, particularly from the popular Beaufort. Porthos, bored with riches and wanting a title, signs on, but Aramis, an abbé, and Athos, a brawler raising an intellectual son, assist Beaufort in secret. When they fail to halt Beaufort''s escape from prison, the musketeers are expendable, and Mazarin sends them to London to rescue Charles I. They are also pursued by Justine, the avenging daughter of Milady de Winter, their enemy 20 years ago. They must escape England, avoid Justine, serve the Queen, and secure Beauford''s political reforms.', 'It''s 1649: Mazarin hires the impoverished D''Artagnan to find the other musketeers: Cromwell has overthrown the English king, so Mazarin fears revolt, particularly from the popular Beaufort. Porthos, bored with riches and wanting a title, signs on, but Aramis, an abbé, and Athos, a brawler raising an intellectual son, assist Beaufort in secret. When they fail to halt Beaufort''s escape from prison, the musketeers are expendable, and Mazarin sends them to London to rescue Charles I. They are also pursued by Justine, the avenging daughter of Milady de Winter, their enemy 20 years ago. They must escape England, avoid Justine, serve the Queen, and secure Beauford''s political reforms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KP0TNYT2yH1yo7sfV5hQWQ4qWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41946'),
  ('541066881794067505', 'The Return of the Native', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jack Gold, Alan Hume, Paul Morris', 'Robert W. Lenski', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Ray Stevenson, Clive Owen, Joan Plowright, Steven Mackintosh, Claire Skinner, Celia Imrie, William Waghorn', null, 'Eustacia Vye, an exquisite beauty despairing at her boring life on an English moor, sets up a fateful lovers'' triangle when she uses her wiles to entice two men, a dashing suitor and a successful man who made his name abroad and returned to his home on the heath.', 'Eustacia Vye, an exquisite beauty despairing at her boring life on an English moor, sets up a fateful lovers'' triangle when she uses her wiles to entice two men, a dashing suitor and a successful man who made his name abroad and returned to his home on the heath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBHRyY1eokAr6MXteomI04fHhXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26799'),
  ('12091157296841859', 'The Return of the Pink Panther', 1975, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Blake Edwards, Geoffrey Unsworth, Bert Batt', 'Blake Edwards, Frank Waldman', 'Peter Sellers, Christopher Plummer, Catherine Schell, Herbert Lom, Peter Arne, Peter Jeffrey, Grégoire Aslan, David Lodge', 'G', 'The famous Pink Panther jewel has once again been stolen and Inspector Clouseau is called in to catch the thief. The Inspector is convinced that ''The Phantom'' has returned and utilises all of his resources – himself and his Asian manservant – to reveal the identity of ''The Phantom''.', 'The famous Pink Panther jewel has once again been stolen and Inspector Clouseau is called in to catch the thief. The Inspector is convinced that ''The Phantom'' has returned and utilises all of his resources – himself and his Asian manservant – to reveal the identity of ''The Phantom''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMyjHGfCT89RpwLeN7ofmfgDru7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11843'),
  ('727427240959042747', 'The Return of the Prodigal Parrot (Part 1)', 1984, 'Animation', 'Valentin Karavaev, Svetlana Kashcheeva, Vladimir Kutuzov', 'Valentin Karavaev, Aleksandr Kurlyandskiy', 'Gennadiy Khazanov, Margarita Korabelnikova, Zinaida Naryshkina, Eduard Nazarov', null, 'Animated series about the adventures of a parrot Kesha, "the hero of our time." The action is concentrated in the city and its surroundings. Kesh lives in the apartment of Vova, a schoolchild, but because of his hot-tempered, arrogant character, he periodically runs away and gets into trouble, eventually returning to Vovka with a confession. The humor of the series is based on the eccentric behavior of Keshi, on recognizable realities, as well as on the multiple quotations used by the parrot.', 'Animated series about the adventures of a parrot Kesha, "the hero of our time." The action is concentrated in the city and its surroundings. Kesh lives in the apartment of Vova, a schoolchild, but because of his hot-tempered, arrogant character, he periodically runs away and gets into trouble, eventually returning to Vovka with a confession. The humor of the series is based on the eccentric behavior of Keshi, on recognizable realities, as well as on the multiple quotations used by the parrot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMiJsjauanK5QVP9KsIJecKcbYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198988'),
  ('421977466701343085', 'The Return of the Prodigal Parrot (Part 2)', 1987, 'Animation', 'Aleksandr Davydov', 'Aleksandr Kurlyandskiy, Valentin Karavaev', 'Gennadiy Khazanov, Natalya Chenchik, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy', null, 'The Cat shows off his new player. Kesha, jealous, returns home and makes a scene for his owner. After that, he leaves home and tries to sell himself for 1,000 rubles. Meeting Vovka''s rich neighbor, he goes to live with him. But life turns out to be not so sweet.', 'The Cat shows off his new player. Kesha, jealous, returns home and makes a scene for his owner. After that, he leaves home and tries to sell himself for 1,000 rubles. Meeting Vovka''s rich neighbor, he goes to live with him. But life turns out to be not so sweet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qomSd0j1mfn16BghlCu4x89E4o9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469815'),
  ('618530501627529620', 'The Return of the Prodigal Son', 1967, 'Drama', 'Evald Schorm, Josef Krameš, František Uldrich', 'Sergej Machonin, Evald Schorm', 'Jan Kačer, Jana Brejchová, Jiří Menzel, Milan Morávek, Dana Medřická, Anna Lebedová, Antonín Lebeda, Jiřina Třebická', null, 'Engineer Jan Sebek (Jan Kacer) is undergoing treatment in a mental home after his unsuccessful attempt to commit suicide. His therapist, via discussions both with the patient and with people who know him, tries to find out what made the young and seemingly satisfied man decide to end his own life. Jan''s pretty wife Jana (Jana Brejchová) claims not to know about anything but she is conducting an affair with a family friend, almost publicly and with the blessing of her parents.', 'Engineer Jan Sebek (Jan Kacer) is undergoing treatment in a mental home after his unsuccessful attempt to commit suicide. His therapist, via discussions both with the patient and with people who know him, tries to find out what made the young and seemingly satisfied man decide to end his own life. Jan''s pretty wife Jana (Jana Brejchová) claims not to know about anything but she is conducting an affair with a family friend, almost publicly and with the blessing of her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPR8U3CnzzvIta6ujGp9kaRGHsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104306'),
  ('739008832986346950', 'The Return of the Six-Million-Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Ray Austin, William B. Jurgensen', 'Michael Sloan', 'Lindsay Wagner, Lee Majors, Tom Schanley, Richard Anderson, Martin E. Brooks, Lee Majors II, Martin Landau, Gary Lockwood', null, 'Ten years after his retirement from the government, Colonel Steve Austin must again team up with Jaime Sommers to stop a terrorist group. Complicating matters for Austin are his estranged son Michael, who struggles for his father''s acceptance as he graduates from flight school, and Jaime, who must cope with her and Steve''s past. When Michael is severely injured in a crash, Steve must make the same decision about fitting him with bionics that he had to make with Jaime years ago after her accident.', 'Ten years after his retirement from the government, Colonel Steve Austin must again team up with Jaime Sommers to stop a terrorist group. Complicating matters for Austin are his estranged son Michael, who struggles for his father''s acceptance as he graduates from flight school, and Jaime, who must cope with her and Steve''s past. When Michael is severely injured in a crash, Steve must make the same decision about fitting him with bionics that he had to make with Jaime years ago after her accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpXR4j7s4vDLOfEjxcuOwGVYum6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82085'),
  ('1054993729844285323', 'The Return of the Soldier', 1983, 'Drama', 'Crispian Sallis, Michael Zimbrich, Peter Waller', 'Hugh Whitemore', 'Julie Christie, Glenda Jackson, Ann-Margret, Alan Bates, Ian Holm, Frank Finlay, Jeremy Kemp, Hilary Mason', null, 'The horrors of World War I have robbed returning veteran Chris Baldry of his memory. The traumatized soldier doesn''t even recognize his own wife, Kitty, or remember their years together. While Baldry attempts to cope with the unfamiliar surroundings of his own home, he seeks out the company of an old flame from his childhood, Margaret Grey. His amnesia also makes him a ready target for the affections of his older cousin, Jenny.', 'The horrors of World War I have robbed returning veteran Chris Baldry of his memory. The traumatized soldier doesn''t even recognize his own wife, Kitty, or remember their years together. While Baldry attempts to cope with the unfamiliar surroundings of his own home, he seeks out the company of an old flame from his childhood, Margaret Grey. His amnesia also makes him a ready target for the affections of his older cousin, Jenny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMEOCQLuZymCll9Gy8aCmARCUfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198491'),
  ('924345854200185879', 'The Return of the Tall Blond Man with One Black Shoe', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert, René Mathelin', 'Yves Robert, Francis Veber', 'Pierre Richard, Jean Carmet, Jean Rochefort, Mireille Darc, Jean Bouise, Colette Castel, Henri Guybet, Hervé Sand', null, 'With "little captain" Cambrai raising serious doubts about the reality of the so-called "super spy," Colonel Toulouse kidnaps Christine and forces Francois to play again the character of "The Tall Blond Man with One Black Shoe" in some fake adventures. All this to stop the investigation into the death of Colonel Milan.', 'With "little captain" Cambrai raising serious doubts about the reality of the so-called "super spy," Colonel Toulouse kidnaps Christine and forces Francois to play again the character of "The Tall Blond Man with One Black Shoe" in some fake adventures. All this to stop the investigation into the death of Colonel Milan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sPd0v3SHRUl9qCwao7ggpW36uG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10939'),
  ('483255813237460731', 'The Return of the Texas Chainsaw Massacre', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Kim Henkel, Ed Cathell III, Levie Isaacks', 'Kim Henkel', 'Renée Zellweger, Matthew McConaughey, Robert Jacks, Tonie Perensky, Joe Stevens, Lisa Marie Newmyer, John Harrison, Tyler Shea Cone', 'R', 'A group of teenagers get into a car crash in the Texas woods on prom night, and then wander into an old farmhouse that is home to Leatherface and his insane family of cannibalistic psychopaths.', 'A group of teenagers get into a car crash in the Texas woods on prom night, and then wander into an old farmhouse that is home to Leatherface and his insane family of cannibalistic psychopaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1ikqofvLBddrZJ73IjmJWhUYus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16780'),
  ('419746806547778974', 'The Return of the Vampire', 1943, 'Horror', 'Lew Landers, L. William O''Connell, John Stumar', 'Griffin Jay', 'Bela Lugosi, Nina Foch, Roland Varno, Matt Willis, Frieda Inescort, Miles Mander, Ottola Nesmith, Gilbert Emery', null, 'In 1918, an English family is terrorized by a vampire, until they learn how to deal with it. They think their troubles are over, but German bombs in WWII free the monster. He reclaims the soul of his wolfman ex-servant, and assuming the identity of a scientist who has just escaped from a concentration camp, he starts out on a plan to get revenge upon the family.', 'In 1918, an English family is terrorized by a vampire, until they learn how to deal with it. They think their troubles are over, but German bombs in WWII free the monster. He reclaims the soul of his wolfman ex-servant, and assuming the identity of a scientist who has just escaped from a concentration camp, he starts out on a plan to get revenge upon the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp8aCa4ajBcCozBNDATIWimZiFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32858'),
  ('1071523388747440696', 'The Return of the Whistler', 1948, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Philip Tannura, D. Ross Lederman', 'Maurice Tombragel, Edward Bock', 'Michael Duane, Lenore Aubert, Richard Lane, James Cardwell, Ann Shoemaker, Sarah Padden, Abigail Adams, Ann Doran', null, 'When a woman goes missing on the eve of her wedding, her fiancee hires a detective to track her down', 'When a woman goes missing on the eve of her wedding, her fiancee hires a detective to track her down', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpIPt3NfOp42wZaT6LzqMt6gNZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33687'),
  ('613324606011076021', 'The Returned', 2004, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Robin Campillo, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Brigitte Tijou, Robin Campillo', 'Géraldine Pailhas, Jonathan Zaccaï, Frédéric Pierrot, Catherine Samie, Victor Garrivier, Djemel Barek, Marie Matheron, Saady Delas', null, 'The lives of the residents of a small French town are changed when thousands of the recently dead inexplicably come back to life and try to integrate themselves into society that has changed for them.', 'The lives of the residents of a small French town are changed when thousands of the recently dead inexplicably come back to life and try to integrate themselves into society that has changed for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86NALpTJd7xD4EiVYzXk4nf8KCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65513'),
  ('155725039077503677', 'The Returned', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Manuel Carballo, Javier Salmones', 'Hatem Khraiche', 'Emily Hampshire, Kristen Holden-Ried, Shawn Doyle, Claudia Bassols, Melina Matthews, Barry Flatman, Oluniké Adeliyi, Steven Gallagher', 'NR', 'In a post-zombie world, where the infected live normal lives, their retroviral drug is running out.', 'In a post-zombie world, where the infected live normal lives, their retroviral drug is running out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMdNeOFGmYXdan1ov835HOio1Qn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227094'),
  ('736323639159420300', 'The Returned', 2019, 'Drama, Horror', 'Leonardo Hermo, Laura Casabé, Lisandro Bera', 'Laura Casabé, Lisandro Bera, Paulo Soria', 'María Soldi, Lali González, Alberto Ajaka, Javier Drolas, Edgardo Castro, Cristian Salguero, Sebastián Aquino, Ema Cuañeri', null, 'Julia, wife of a wealthy lord living near the Iguazu Falls, has nightmares for several days. The lord builds a fence to ward off the indigenous people, the Guarani tribe, but Julia is still anxious about her son Manuel’s safety. One day Manuel suddenly disappears, and when searching for him, Julia runs into her maid, Kerana, who was believed to have died one year before, under the falls.', 'Julia, wife of a wealthy lord living near the Iguazu Falls, has nightmares for several days. The lord builds a fence to ward off the indigenous people, the Guarani tribe, but Julia is still anxious about her son Manuel’s safety. One day Manuel suddenly disappears, and when searching for him, Julia runs into her maid, Kerana, who was believed to have died one year before, under the falls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxLpL75ssq7aNueni6LuITAiJIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648310'),
  ('824929785683031591', 'The Reunion', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Fulvio Gicca Palli, Mino Giarda', 'Ugo Liberatore, Enrico Ribulsi, Vittoriano Petrilli', 'Walter Chiari, Francisco Rabal, Letícia Román, Dominique Boschero, Riccardo Garrone, Mino Guerrini, Gastone Moschin, Paul Guers', null, 'Two members of a former group of friends find themselves after many years by chance through the streets of Milan; after a moment, memories of the past resurface.', 'Two members of a former group of friends find themselves after many years by chance through the streets of Milan; after a moment, memories of the past resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve0yqgVHMsGTRv24Xg2j1aLby58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156129'),
  ('920280554545983971', 'The Reunion', 2011, 'Drama, Action', 'Michael Pavone, Kevin Black, Kenneth Zunder', 'Michael Pavone', 'John Cena, Ethan Embry, Amy Smart, Boyd Holbrook, Michael Rispoli, Gregg Henry, Lela Loren, Jack Conley', 'PG-13', 'The Cleary brothers, Sam, Leo and Douglas took dysfunctional families to a new level: Sam and Leo have grown up hating each other and neither likes their juvenile delinquent kid brother, Douglas, to whom they''ve only recently been introduced. The sons share the same father, a womanizing drunk, but all have different mothers. Their father died a rich man and when they''re brought together by their sister Nina to learn which of them will inherit the old man''s fortune, they are handed an unpleasant surprise.', 'The Cleary brothers, Sam, Leo and Douglas took dysfunctional families to a new level: Sam and Leo have grown up hating each other and neither likes their juvenile delinquent kid brother, Douglas, to whom they''ve only recently been introduced. The sons share the same father, a womanizing drunk, but all have different mothers. Their father died a rich man and when they''re brought together by their sister Nina to learn which of them will inherit the old man''s fortune, they are handed an unpleasant surprise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsaQsYf58wY8wdYy1zxbZHXwxCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77879'),
  ('314286828037025884', 'The Reunion', 2013, 'Drama', 'Anna Odell, Sophie Helsing', 'Anna Odell, Michael S. Kaufman', 'Anna Odell, Sandra Andreis, Kamila Benhamza, Anders Berg, Erik Ehn, Niklas Engdahl, Per Fenger-Krog, Robert Fransson', null, 'A film between fiction and reality, highlighting questions about group dynamics and established hierarchies. A group of people meet for their high school reunion 20 years later. One of them talks about her being bullied and outcast and soon the former classmates fall back to the roles they used to have back in school. But this is just half of the film.', 'A film between fiction and reality, highlighting questions about group dynamics and established hierarchies. A group of people meet for their high school reunion 20 years later. One of them talks about her being bullied and outcast and soon the former classmates fall back to the roles they used to have back in school. But this is just half of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2m4ncyUtpBQbYZoSxwrR80Nkq6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202573'),
  ('591067630993167167', 'The Reunion - Friends for Life', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Tilde Harkamp', 'Claudia Boderke, Lars Mering', 'Nicolaj Kopernikus, Troels Lyby, Anders W. Berthelsen, Helle Fagralid, Tomas Villum Jensen', 'Not Rated', 'Thomas is a stay-at-home father of twins, Andreas has found love, while Niels is struggling with depression and erectile dysfunction after cancer, so they plan a wild surprise for him to discover the joy of life again', 'Thomas is a stay-at-home father of twins, Andreas has found love, while Niels is struggling with depression and erectile dysfunction after cancer, so they plan a wild surprise for him to discover the joy of life again', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6iBh6xwZiYn0ikO8XIiTYFTWnok.jpg', 'plex:movie:klassefesten-4-venner-for-livet'),
  ('880594700849506259', 'The Reunions', 2021, 'Drama', 'Wang Shiqing, Tiger Gao, Dong Chengpeng', 'Dong Chengpeng', 'Jixiang Wang, Dong Chengpeng, Liu Lu', null, 'Rework on Dong Chengpeng''s previous award winning short "A Final Reunion". A comedy director has come up with an idea of breaking through his common filmmaking take by shooting a short film about how his grandmother would have spent on the New Year''s day, crews recruited, the protagonist on set, everyone ready in the rural remote country where he was born and raised while out of everyone''s expectation, the grandma passed. The movie has to go on, hence the narrative metamorphosizes from here... You can''t always get what you want, as a storyteller, he leads the whole crew into another diverged yet moving journey.', 'Rework on Dong Chengpeng''s previous award winning short "A Final Reunion". A comedy director has come up with an idea of breaking through his common filmmaking take by shooting a short film about how his grandmother would have spent on the New Year''s day, crews recruited, the protagonist on set, everyone ready in the rural remote country where he was born and raised while out of everyone''s expectation, the grandma passed. The movie has to go on, hence the narrative metamorphosizes from here... You can''t always get what you want, as a storyteller, he leads the whole crew into another diverged yet moving journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejBeuSHxCfFUAHTqPn1G3hSjBks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736516'),
  ('1042205790571416145', 'The Revelation of the Pyramids', 2010, 'Documentary, History, Mystery', 'Patrice Pooyard', 'Jacques Grimault', 'Alika Del Sol, Jean-Pierre Adam, Joseph Davidovits, Guillemette Andreu, Guillemette Andreu, Guillemette Andreu', null, 'For centuries, the Great Pyramids have fascinated Mankind. Patrice Pooyard''s The Revelation Of The Pyramids reveals what lies behind the greatest of archaeological mysteries: a message of paramount importance for humanity. From China to Peru, from Egypt to Mexico, through the world''s most enigmatic and most beautiful sites, the director has spent 6 years meeting eminent scientific specialists and verifying his discoveries. The result will shake the teaching of history to its very core, and revolutionize Egyptology entirely. A great odyssey along a breathtaking route climaxes in a revelation as unexpected as it is staggering.', 'For centuries, the Great Pyramids have fascinated Mankind. Patrice Pooyard''s The Revelation Of The Pyramids reveals what lies behind the greatest of archaeological mysteries: a message of paramount importance for humanity. From China to Peru, from Egypt to Mexico, through the world''s most enigmatic and most beautiful sites, the director has spent 6 years meeting eminent scientific specialists and verifying his discoveries. The result will shake the teaching of history to its very core, and revolutionize Egyptology entirely. A great odyssey along a breathtaking route climaxes in a revelation as unexpected as it is staggering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I2cpFAeN1MlRqtVa3yfIqHpwwS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73111'),
  ('202828335222099406', 'The Revenant', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror, War', 'D. Kerry Prior, Peter Hawkins', 'D. Kerry Prior', 'Chris Wylde, David Anders, Louise Griffiths, Jacy King, Eric Payne, Bernardo Badillo, Floyd Van Buskirk, Mark Elias', 'R', 'A horror movie/buddy comedy about Joey and his undead friend Bart who comes back from the dead as a revenant: an articulate zombie that needs to drink blood to arrest the decomposition of his body.', 'A horror movie/buddy comedy about Joey and his undead friend Bart who comes back from the dead as a revenant: an articulate zombie that needs to drink blood to arrest the decomposition of his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bECzzYkRFlCZZAjQ9wboMGyWFcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79896'),
  ('283460354716868407', 'The Revenant', 2015, 'Western, Drama, Adventure', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Emmanuel Lubezki, Chris Beach', 'Mark L. Smith, Alejandro González Iñárritu', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Tom Hardy, Domhnall Gleeson, Will Poulter, Forrest Goodluck, Duane Howard, Arthur Redcloud, Melaw Nakehk''o', 'R', 'In the 1820s, a frontiersman, Hugh Glass, sets out on a path of vengeance against those who left him for dead after a bear mauling.', 'In the 1820s, a frontiersman, Hugh Glass, sets out on a path of vengeance against those who left him for dead after a bear mauling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ji3ecJphATlVgWNY0B0RVXZizdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281957'),
  ('756966888926570241', 'The Revenge', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jan Kwieciński, Andrzej Wajda, Paweł Edelman', 'Andrzej Wajda', 'Roman Polanski, Janusz Gajos, Andrzej Seweryn, Katarzyna Figura, Daniel Olbrychski, Agata Buzek, Rafał Królikowski, Lech Dyblik', null, 'A winter day at a Polish castle, half owned by a fatalistic notary and half by a volcanic old soldier''s niece. The old soldier, Cupbearer, and the notary are sworn enemies, which may doom the love between the niece, Klara, and the notary''s son, Waclaw. On this day, the tongue-tied Cupbearer asks a braggart courtier, Papkin, to sue on his behalf for the hand of the widow Hanna. Papkin succeeds and', 'A winter day at a Polish castle, half owned by a fatalistic notary and half by a volcanic old soldier''s niece. The old soldier, Cupbearer, and the notary are sworn enemies, which may doom the love between the niece, Klara, and the notary''s son, Waclaw. On this day, the tongue-tied Cupbearer asks a braggart courtier, Papkin, to sue on his behalf for the hand of the widow Hanna. Papkin succeeds and', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8Xrdyf1kSt3WfxMGycHhINNuuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19721'),
  ('726408335197216287', 'The Revenge of Dr. X', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Arnold Dibble, Norman Thomson', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'James Craig, James Yagi, John Stanley, Atsuko Rome, Tota Kondo, Lawrence O''Neill, Al Ricketts, Edward M. Shannon', null, 'A mad scientist creates man eating creatures from carnivorous plants.', 'A mad scientist creates man eating creatures from carnivorous plants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLMbmNJMCo5aL7ApNYSqxflEIAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37579'),
  ('1010243474592261853', 'The Revenge of Frankenstein', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Fisher, Jack Asher', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Peter Cushing, Francis Matthews, Eunice Gayson, Michael Gwynn, John Welsh, Lionel Jeffries, Oscar Quitak, Richard Wordsworth', 'NR', 'Rescued from the guillotine by his devoted dwarf Fritz, the Baron relocates to Carlsbruck, where he continues his gruesome experiments.', 'Rescued from the guillotine by his devoted dwarf Fritz, the Baron relocates to Carlsbruck, where he continues his gruesome experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SKLAELeQFislTtdXF9r1aVp4a7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3127'),
  ('67499995170699053', 'The Revenge of Hercules', 1960, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Vittorio Cottafavi, Mario Montuori', 'Marcello Baldi, Nicolò Ferrari, Duccio Tessari', 'Mark Forest, Broderick Crawford, Gaby André, Leonora Ruffo, Philippe Hersent, Wandisa Guida, Sandro Moretti, Claudio Undari', null, 'A warrior returning home to his country must battle giant bats, three-headed dogs and a vicious dragon to save his wife, and his people, from the machinations of an evil ruler.', 'A warrior returning home to his country must battle giant bats, three-headed dogs and a vicious dragon to save his wife, and his people, from the machinations of an evil ruler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qD3HfD4b4fHceXgrQEKzkyqhY0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43033'),
  ('1049310141108063025', 'The Revenge of the Shiny Shrimps', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jérôme Alméras, Maxime Govare, Cédric Le Gallo', 'Romain Choay, Cédric Le Gallo, Maxime Govare', 'Nicolas Gob, Michaël Abiteboul, David Baïot, Romain Lancry, Roland Menou, Geoffrey Couët, Romain Brau, Félix Martinez', null, 'Two years after the death of Jean, Matthias, the coach, decides to take Selime, a young man from the suburbs he believes is gay, to accompany the Shiny Shrimps to the Gay Games in Tokyo, on a trip to pay tribute to their friend who left too early. But after they miss their connection, they find themselves stranded in Russia, in one of the not the most gay-friendly regions in the world. The start of a crazy adventure as incredible as it is perilous.', 'Two years after the death of Jean, Matthias, the coach, decides to take Selime, a young man from the suburbs he believes is gay, to accompany the Shiny Shrimps to the Gay Games in Tokyo, on a trip to pay tribute to their friend who left too early. But after they miss their connection, they find themselves stranded in Russia, in one of the not the most gay-friendly regions in the world. The start of a crazy adventure as incredible as it is perilous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pN7nwsTtpFZKzLizINrQk68QnLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741674'),
  ('1036993379271041591', 'The Revenge of the Siren', 2012, 'History, Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Hansjörg Thurn', 'Dirk Salomon, Thomas Wesskamp', 'Alexandra Neldel, Bert Tischendorf, Esther Schweins, Kristyna Synkova, Götz Otto, Nadja Becker, Julian Weigend, Johannes Krisch', null, 'In 1427, Lady Maria Van Arnstein is informed that her beloved husband Michel Van Arnstein was murdered in a battle against the Hussitas. However he was actually betrayed by his ambitious cousin Hettenhein that wants his lands and castle. The Pope''s Great Inquisitor Janus Suppertour meets King König Sigismund and tells that he wants Maria for him.', 'In 1427, Lady Maria Van Arnstein is informed that her beloved husband Michel Van Arnstein was murdered in a battle against the Hussitas. However he was actually betrayed by his ambitious cousin Hettenhein that wants his lands and castle. The Pope''s Great Inquisitor Janus Suppertour meets King König Sigismund and tells that he wants Maria for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYfeitlUW8kgnnUxb6oaQw5D4Mj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92998'),
  ('1152040758740705617', 'The Revenger', 1989, 'Action, Thriller', 'Cedric Sundstrom, George Bartels, Gary Graver', 'John Cianetti', 'Oliver Reed, Frank Zagarino, Jeff Celentano, Nancy Mulford, Sean Taylor, Norman Anstey, John Cianetti, John Pasternack', 'R', 'When saxophonist Mike Teller''s brother Mackie is killed before being able to deliver $500,000 to mob boss Jack Fisher, Mike is arrested as an accomplice and thrown into prison for five years. Upon his release, he finds Fisher has kidnapped his wife, Lisa, believing Mike has the stolen drug money. With the help of Mackie''s old Vietnam war buddy, Harry Crawford, Mike and Harry rescue Lisa, but now have to escape the clutches of the mob in Harry''s remote cabin. Will Jack Fisher retrieve his money or will Mike get his revenge?', 'When saxophonist Mike Teller''s brother Mackie is killed before being able to deliver $500,000 to mob boss Jack Fisher, Mike is arrested as an accomplice and thrown into prison for five years. Upon his release, he finds Fisher has kidnapped his wife, Lisa, believing Mike has the stolen drug money. With the help of Mackie''s old Vietnam war buddy, Harry Crawford, Mike and Harry rescue Lisa, but now have to escape the clutches of the mob in Harry''s remote cabin. Will Jack Fisher retrieve his money or will Mike get his revenge?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQG8TvVm3hzYA1uhmEoQMV4GKwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122863'),
  ('159341298299572453', 'The Revengers', 1972, 'Action, Western, Crime', 'Daniel Mann, Gabriel Torres', 'Wendell Mayes', 'William Holden, Ernest Borgnine, Woody Strode, Susan Hayward, Roger Hanin, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Jorge Luke, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos', 'PG', 'The life of peaceful rancher John Benedict is torn apart when his family is massacred by a gang of marauding outlaws and his farm is destroyed. He assembles a team of mean, lawless convicts to act as his posse as he pursues the gang responsible for the deaths of his loved ones.', 'The life of peaceful rancher John Benedict is torn apart when his family is massacred by a gang of marauding outlaws and his farm is destroyed. He assembles a team of mean, lawless convicts to act as his posse as he pursues the gang responsible for the deaths of his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkTz0NgUxn4bbNLBXPpjHlVbCgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127475'),
  ('514557418061096920', 'The Revengers'' Comedies', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Malcolm Mowbray, Romain Winding, Lizzie Turvey', 'Malcolm Mowbray', 'Sam Neill, Helena Bonham Carter, Kristin Scott Thomas, Rupert Graves, Martin Clunes, Steve Coogan, John Wood, Liz Smith', null, 'After saving each other from jumping off a bridge, Henry Bell and Karen Knightly plot to avenge the people who drove them to suicide. Henry will ruin the life of the woman who married Karen''s boyfriend, while Karen will work as a secretary for the man who took Henry''s job. Whether revenge will be sweet – or bittersweet – is anyone''s guess.', 'After saving each other from jumping off a bridge, Henry Bell and Karen Knightly plot to avenge the people who drove them to suicide. Henry will ruin the life of the woman who married Karen''s boyfriend, while Karen will work as a secretary for the man who took Henry''s job. Whether revenge will be sweet – or bittersweet – is anyone''s guess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cF66jVvsRbT187EGrEC4fXOOBLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2166'),
  ('383898561898173068', 'The Revived Monster', 1953, 'Horror', 'Chano Urueta, Víctor Herrera, Valerio Olivo', 'Chano Urueta, Dino Maiuri', 'Miroslava, Carlos Navarro, José María Linares Rivas, Fernando Wagner, Alberto Mariscal, Stefan Berne', null, 'Set in the Balkans, this story concerns a bored journalist, Nora who is ordered by her boss to follow up a mysterious advertisement placed by Dr Ling. Ling turns out to be a misshapen creature who, rejected by his peers, has become the stereotypical mad scientist, here specializing in plastic surgery. He falls in love with Nora but fearing she will betray him he resuscitates a young man who committed suicide, Ariel by transplanting a new brain into him, and order him to fetch Nora so that he can kill her.', 'Set in the Balkans, this story concerns a bored journalist, Nora who is ordered by her boss to follow up a mysterious advertisement placed by Dr Ling. Ling turns out to be a misshapen creature who, rejected by his peers, has become the stereotypical mad scientist, here specializing in plastic surgery. He falls in love with Nora but fearing she will betray him he resuscitates a young man who committed suicide, Ariel by transplanting a new brain into him, and order him to fetch Nora so that he can kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrg31YCVrrVeH6EeEkMyJhcVqxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296280'),
  ('898687653833530866', 'The Revolt of Job', 1983, 'Drama', 'Barna Kabay, Imre Gyöngyössy, Gábor Szabó', 'Barna Kabay, Katalin Petényi, Imre Gyöngyössy', 'Ferenc Zenthe, Hédi Temessy, Péter Rudolf, Gábor Fehér, Heinrich Starhemberg, István Verebes, Léticia Cano, Nóra Görbe', null, 'The story of a childless Jewish couple in WWII-era Hungary who adopt a Hungarian boy and raise him with their values and traditions.', 'The story of a childless Jewish couple in WWII-era Hungary who adopt a Hungarian boy and raise him with their values and traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEJ4PBvDkgfPalvRmvJu0sDKUUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42111'),
  ('102479843993884109', 'The Revolt of Mamie Stover', 1956, 'Drama', 'Raoul Walsh, Leo Tover, Joseph E. Rickards', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Jane Russell, Richard Egan, Joan Leslie, Agnes Moorehead, Jorja Curtright, Michael Pate, Richard Coogan, Alan Reed', null, 'In the early ’40s, a San Francisco prostitute is run out of town just as World War II has begun to intensify. She settles down in Hawaii, hoping to start a new life.', 'In the early ’40s, a San Francisco prostitute is run out of town just as World War II has begun to intensify. She settles down in Hawaii, hoping to start a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RhQTlnbX2HZyW0ePUtbBK2pIYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102293'),
  ('594302322605041136', 'The Revolution of the Crabs', 2004, 'Animation', 'Arthur de Pins', 'Arthur de Pins', null, null, 'In the Gironde estuary, a tragedy affects a species of crabs: they can''t turn. Everything changes when they find a leader.', 'In the Gironde estuary, a tragedy affects a species of crabs: they can''t turn. Everything changes when they find a leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7TJn3mvFZg6YzkgyT5yxAoD7dT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146941'),
  ('1148211803721990585', 'The Revolution Will Not Be Televised', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Kim Bartley, Donnacha O''Briain', null, 'Hugo Chávez', null, 'Hugo Chavez was a colourful, unpredictable folk hero who was beloved by his nation’s working class. He was elected president of Venezuela in 1998, and proved to be a tough, quixotic opponent to the power structure that wanted to depose him. When he was forcibly removed from office on 11 April 2002, two independent filmmakers were inside the presidential palace.', 'Hugo Chavez was a colourful, unpredictable folk hero who was beloved by his nation’s working class. He was elected president of Venezuela in 1998, and proved to be a tough, quixotic opponent to the power structure that wanted to depose him. When he was forcibly removed from office on 11 April 2002, two independent filmmakers were inside the presidential palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OeVe8oGS7vccKjsiuIGTwBlAFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33222'),
  ('627003635982229460', 'The Rewrite', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marc Lawrence, Jonathan Brown', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Hugh Grant, Marisa Tomei, Bella Heathcote, J.K. Simmons, Chris Elliott, Allison Janney, Caroline Aaron, Steven Kaplan', 'PG-13', 'An Oscar-winning writer in a slump leaves Hollywood to teach screenwriting at a college on the East Coast, where he falls for a single mom taking classes there.', 'An Oscar-winning writer in a slump leaves Hollywood to teach screenwriting at a college on the East Coast, where he falls for a single mom taking classes there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IrJiEtUa2OhZvFEM2pseyaxChd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289727'),
  ('414852619730658376', 'The Rezort', 2015, 'Horror', 'Steve Barker, Roman Osin, Neus Bibiloni', 'Paul Gerstenberger', 'Dougray Scott, Jessica De Gouw, Martin McCann, Elen Rhys, Jassa Ahluwalia, Claire Goose, Richard Laing, Bentley Kalu', 'R', 'The ReZort, a post apocalyptic safari, offers paying guests the opportunity to kill zombies in the wake of an outbreak.', 'The ReZort, a post apocalyptic safari, offers paying guests the opportunity to kill zombies in the wake of an outbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXeDhUJaOxUs1n6fHRhWVuuVBju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343173'),
  ('659124809036312193', 'The Rhythm of Crime', 1981, 'Horror, Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Zoran Tadić, Srećko Jurdana, Živorad Tomić', 'Zoran Tadić', 'Ivica Vidović, Fabijan Šovagović, Božidarka Frajt, Dragutin Klobučar, Zdenka Trach, Tošo Jelić, Tomislav Gotovac, Đorđe Rapajić', null, 'Old houses in Zagreb are destroyed in order to build new, bigger blocks. A teacher who lives in one of these houses allows a stranger to share his home with him. The stranger has a fascination with statistics, and claims he can predict crimes based on statistical analyses. When a predicted murder did not occur, the stranger is adamant that the whole town will suffer unless a balance is achieved - and he leaves.', 'Old houses in Zagreb are destroyed in order to build new, bigger blocks. A teacher who lives in one of these houses allows a stranger to share his home with him. The stranger has a fascination with statistics, and claims he can predict crimes based on statistical analyses. When a predicted murder did not occur, the stranger is adamant that the whole town will suffer unless a balance is achieved - and he leaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7H7HV1pJOsv5Tqo4esTw0Btcmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256750'),
  ('803711409943213156', 'The Rhythm Section', 2020, 'Action, Thriller', 'Richard Styles, Jonny Benson, George Walker', 'Mark Burnell', 'Blake Lively, Jude Law, Sterling K. Brown, Ivana Basic, Nasser Memarzia, Max Casella, Richard Brake, Raza Jaffrey', 'R', 'When she discovers the plane crash that claimed the lives of her family was no accident, Stephanie Patrick enters the dark, complex world of international espionage seeking vengeance. With nothing left to lose, Stephanie transforms from victim to assassin and discovers that neither revenge nor the truth are what they appear.', 'When she discovers the plane crash that claimed the lives of her family was no accident, Stephanie Patrick enters the dark, complex world of international espionage seeking vengeance. With nothing left to lose, Stephanie transforms from victim to assassin and discovers that neither revenge nor the truth are what they appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spTr0VYyRtl36Lkk6nCnnbFXhus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466622'),
  ('362130268086716411', 'The Rich Man''s Wife', 1996, 'Thriller', 'Amy Holden Jones, Todd Y. Murata, John R. Woodward', 'Amy Holden Jones', 'Halle Berry, Peter Greene, Clive Owen, Frankie Faison, Charles Hallahan, Allan Rich, Clea Lewis, Christopher McDonald', 'R', 'A rich man''s wife finds she has a bad prenuptial agreement with an even worse husband. Over drinks with a stranger, she fantasizes about doing her husband in to void the prenup — but much to her surprise, the stranger decides to turn her imagination into reality.', 'A rich man''s wife finds she has a bad prenuptial agreement with an even worse husband. Over drinks with a stranger, she fantasizes about doing her husband in to void the prenup — but much to her surprise, the stranger decides to turn her imagination into reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uE7BXhR6QkSGCIK6gTPGfFRAggY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44465'),
  ('522796675888689653', 'The Rich One''s Kitchen', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Başar Sabuncu', 'Başar Sabuncu', 'Şener Şen, Nilüfer Açıkalın, Okday Korunan, Gökhan Mete, Osman Görgen', null, 'Lutfu is a cook in the mansion of the wealthy Kerim. One morning he sees that there is nobody at home. The maid is to get engaged on that day but her fiancée does not show up either. From the brother of their driver, he learns that workers are on strike and their boss Kerim has gone to Europe. Things get back to normal.', 'Lutfu is a cook in the mansion of the wealthy Kerim. One morning he sees that there is nobody at home. The maid is to get engaged on that day but her fiancée does not show up either. From the brother of their driver, he learns that workers are on strike and their boss Kerim has gone to Europe. Things get back to normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCWHyA7ng1qP9txYmXq5bRvXyLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432080'),
  ('829597131376225428', 'The Rich, the Pauper and the Butler', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Morgan Bertacca', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Giuliana Lojodice, Guadalupe Lancho, Sara D''Amario, Massimo Popolizio, Francesca Neri', null, 'A wealthy broker, his loyal butler, and a poor street seller all see their social positions change in a twist of fate.', 'A wealthy broker, his loyal butler, and a poor street seller all see their social positions change in a twist of fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjnOjxruO6rmUwF2nnnoynYhUHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310126'),
  ('383533086452921063', 'The Richest Girl in the World', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Seiter, Nicholas Musuraca, Rex Bailey', 'Norman Krasna', 'Miriam Hopkins, Joel McCrea, Fay Wray, Henry Stephenson, Reginald Denny, Beryl Mercer, George Meeker, Wade Boteler', 'NR', 'Millionairess Dorothy Hunter is tired of finding out that her boyfriends love her for her money, and equally weary of losing eligible beaus who don''t want to be considered fortune-hunters. That''s why she trades identities with her secretary Sylvia before embarking on her next romance with Tony Travers. This causes numerous complications not only for Dorothy and Tony but for Sylvia, whose own husband Philip is not the most patient of men.', 'Millionairess Dorothy Hunter is tired of finding out that her boyfriends love her for her money, and equally weary of losing eligible beaus who don''t want to be considered fortune-hunters. That''s why she trades identities with her secretary Sylvia before embarking on her next romance with Tony Travers. This causes numerous complications not only for Dorothy and Tony but for Sylvia, whose own husband Philip is not the most patient of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chaTWxg3aUHPqNgwR1Vy00hNkwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111623'),
  ('964307983842744567', 'The Richest Woman in the World', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thierry Klifa, Hichame Alaouié, Sarah Teper', 'Jacques Fieschi, Thierry Klifa, Cédric Anger', 'Isabelle Huppert, Marina Foïs, Laurent Lafitte, Raphaël Personnaz, André Marcon, Mathieu Demy, Joseph Olivennes, Micha Lescot', null, 'An elderly billionaire woman gives hundreds of millions of euros to a younger gay artist she is close to. Her daughter files a complaint for abuse of a vulnerable person and a scandal erupts.', 'An elderly billionaire woman gives hundreds of millions of euros to a younger gay artist she is close to. Her daughter files a complaint for abuse of a vulnerable person and a scandal erupts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95a1udNepqKENUWKdyJeyOM3XLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309725'),
  ('666449164887795962', 'The Rickshaw Man', 1958, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Kazuo Yamada, Teruo Maru', 'Mansaku Itami, Hiroshi Inagaki', 'Toshirō Mifune, Hideko Takamine, Hiroshi Akutagawa, Chōko Iida, Chishū Ryū, Haruo Tanaka, Jun Tatara, Seiji Miyaguchi', null, 'A poor rickshaw driver finds himself helping a young woman and her son after the woman''s husband dies suddenly.', 'A poor rickshaw driver finds himself helping a young woman and her son after the woman''s husband dies suddenly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TGbTPMq2Dao441QUQ55lKESpZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43121'),
  ('330290695643979336', 'The Riddle', 2007, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Brendan Foley', null, 'Vinnie Jones, Julie Cox, Vera Day, Magda Rodriguez, Derek Jacobi, Vanessa Redgrave, Jason Flemyng, P.H. Moriarty', 'PG-13', 'A journalist investigates a series of murders that follows the discovery of an unpublished novel by Charles Dickens in the cellar of an old Thames pub.', 'A journalist investigates a series of murders that follows the discovery of an unpublished novel by Charles Dickens in the cellar of an old Thames pub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6iivsXc6jjLhVoazzZHlshyQtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16178'),
  ('74167450346840342', 'The Riddle of Lumen', 1972, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, '“The Riddle of Lumen” presents an evenly paced sequence of images, which seem to follow an elusive logic. As in “Zorns Lemma” the viewer is called upon to recognize or invent a principle of association linking each shot with its predecessor. However, here the connection is nonverbal. A similarity, or an antithesis, of color, shape, saturation, movement, composition, or depth links one shot to another. A telling negative moment occurs in the film when we see a child studying a didactic reader in which simply represented objects are coupled with their monosyllabic names in alphabetical order. –P. Adams Sitney. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', '“The Riddle of Lumen” presents an evenly paced sequence of images, which seem to follow an elusive logic. As in “Zorns Lemma” the viewer is called upon to recognize or invent a principle of association linking each shot with its predecessor. However, here the connection is nonverbal. A similarity, or an antithesis, of color, shape, saturation, movement, composition, or depth links one shot to another. A telling negative moment occurs in the film when we see a child studying a didactic reader in which simply represented objects are coupled with their monosyllabic names in alphabetical order. –P. Adams Sitney. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/un5vZ9WTxflyqSnB1c9epdDZkr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199821'),
  ('1142091248917606482', 'The Riddle of the Sands', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Tony Maylam, Christopher Challis', 'Tony Maylam', 'Simon MacCorkindale, Michael York, Jenny Agutter, Alan Badel, Jürgen Andersen, Michael Sheard, Olga Lowe, Hans Meyer', null, 'In the early years of the 20th Century, two British yachtsmen (Michael York and Simon MacCorkindale) stumble upon a German plot to invade the east coast of England in a flotilla of specially designed barges. They set out to thwart this terrible scheme, but must outwit not only the cream of the German Navy, but the feared Kaiser Wilhelm himself.', 'In the early years of the 20th Century, two British yachtsmen (Michael York and Simon MacCorkindale) stumble upon a German plot to invade the east coast of England in a flotilla of specially designed barges. They set out to thwart this terrible scheme, but must outwit not only the cream of the German Navy, but the feared Kaiser Wilhelm himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLJDkngQr2y6HYQG08NoBCXiibe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11765'),
  ('40129780757608283', 'The Ride', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jan Svěrák, David Rauch, F. A. Brabec', 'Jan Svěrák, Martin Dostál', 'Anna Geislerová, Radek Pastrňák, Jakub Špalek, Filip Renč', null, 'Two guys buy a car and travel through the country until they meet a lonely girl on the road. They begin travelling together, having fun, enjoying life. But then there is another guy who has a better car and who is looking for this girl because he is her lover, her first one. What is going on inside the mind of this girl? Nobody knows, until the very end.', 'Two guys buy a car and travel through the country until they meet a lonely girl on the road. They begin travelling together, having fun, enjoying life. But then there is another guy who has a better car and who is looking for this girl because he is her lover, her first one. What is going on inside the mind of this girl? Nobody knows, until the very end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZOVjHhojWBuZdbC50Wl95UWXHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81400'),
  ('342803722453084023', 'The Ride', 1997, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael T. Balog, Michael O. Sajbel', 'Michael O. Sajbel, David Bowen', 'Michael Biehn, Clarence Felder, Brock Pierce, Jennifer O''Neill, Jennifer Blanc, Charles W. Young, Chris Owen, Martin Spanjers', 'PG', 'A has-been cowboy is given a second chance at the hands of an unexpected teacher.', 'A has-been cowboy is given a second chance at the hands of an unexpected teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z1woKsDVF8hLmR6Ri4WNmNEGFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149220'),
  ('285780559836601480', 'The Ride', 2018, 'Drama', 'Reuben Steinberg, Alex Ranarivelo', 'Alex Ranarivelo, Hadeel Reda', 'Shane Graham, Ludacris, Sasha Alexander, Blake Sheldon, Jessica Serfaty, Ali Afshar, Montanna Gillis, Anna Zielinski', 'PG-13', 'The story of John Buultjens, who has dedicated his life to the sport of BMX.', 'The story of John Buultjens, who has dedicated his life to the sport of BMX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rJtBIjA9NEJ23Em5wXSYXFXHLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526103'),
  ('934075247628105807', 'The Ride Back', 1957, 'Western', 'Allen H. Miner, Oscar Rudolph, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Antony Ellis', 'Anthony Quinn, William Conrad, Lita Milan, Victor Millan, Jorge Treviño, Ellen Hope Monroe, Joe Dominguez, Louis Towers', 'NR', 'A troubled sheriff, a failure at everything in his life, tries to redeem himself by extraditing a popular gunfighter from Mexico to stand trial for murder.', 'A troubled sheriff, a failure at everything in his life, tries to redeem himself by extraditing a popular gunfighter from Mexico to stand trial for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3iJcQR77sSTuAo9o1qv8sZJ2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150456'),
  ('907118855943069654', 'The Ride to Hangman''s Tree', 1967, 'Action, Romance, Western', 'Alan Rafkin, Gene Polito, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Jack Natteford, William Bowers, Luci Ward', 'Jack Lord, Melodie Johnson, James Farentino, Don Galloway, Richard Anderson, Ed Peck, Robert Yuro, Robert Cornthwaite', 'NR', 'Three young outlaws try to stay together and keep one step ahead of the law.', 'Three young outlaws try to stay together and keep one step ahead of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikMpgrCmW4hr4DxPSZHINvHEfbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73902'),
  ('404640553543377901', 'The Ride to the Abyss', 1992, 'Animation, Music', 'Georges Schwizgebel', 'Georges Schwizgebel', null, null, '‘La course à l’abîme’ is a depiction of the final ride into hell from ‘La Damnation de Faust’ (1846) by Hector Berlioz.', '‘La course à l’abîme’ is a depiction of the final ride into hell from ‘La Damnation de Faust’ (1846) by Hector Berlioz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7d19GIDxV2SKBLZ76RTacnNhuOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234467'),
  ('119254999333344566', 'The Rider', 2018, 'Drama, Western', 'Chloé Zhao, Joshua James Richards', 'Chloé Zhao', 'Brady Jandreau, Tim Jandreau, Lilly Jandreau, Cat Clifford, Terri Dawn Pourier, Lane Scott, Tanner Langdeau, James Calhoon', 'R', 'Once a rising star of the rodeo circuit, and a gifted horse trainer, young cowboy Brady is warned that his riding days are over after a horse crushed his skull at a rodeo. In an attempt to regain control of his own fate, Brady undertakes a search for a new identity and what it means to be a man in the heartland of the United States.', 'Once a rising star of the rodeo circuit, and a gifted horse trainer, young cowboy Brady is warned that his riding days are over after a horse crushed his skull at a rodeo. In an attempt to regain control of his own fate, Brady undertakes a search for a new identity and what it means to be a man in the heartland of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFsrA0Is5xode2INrPj1VJcQ18n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453278'),
  ('484310916033082450', 'The Rider of F.M. Stereo', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Omiros Efstratiadis', 'Giorgos Mylonas', 'Stathis Psaltis, Kaiti Finou, Nefeli Orfanou, Ilias Konstadinou, Mary Lambraki, Hristos Fotidis, Tasos Kostis, Giannis Smyrnaios', null, 'A poor and "arbitrary" young man creates a radio station to send messages of love to his girlfriend. Suddenly, however, an unexpected will grants him a respectable name and a huge fortune, which creates endless problems for him. Even his life is in danger...', 'A poor and "arbitrary" young man creates a radio station to send messages of love to his girlfriend. Suddenly, however, an unexpected will grants him a respectable name and a huge fortune, which creates endless problems for him. Even his life is in danger...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFTgXGKBzFIulbaOkVMK36Ee0Oc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369248'),
