  ('487061694729139941', 'The Ridiculous 6', 2015, 'Western, Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Naython Vane, Nicholas Mastandrea, Rosemary C. Cremona', 'Tim Herlihy, Adam Sandler', 'Adam Sandler, Terry Crews, Jorge Garcia, Taylor Lautner, Rob Schneider, Luke Wilson, Will Forte, Steve Zahn', 'PG-13', 'When his long-lost outlaw father returns, Tommy "White Knife" Stockburn goes on an adventure-filled journey across the Old West with his five brothers.', 'When his long-lost outlaw father returns, Tommy "White Knife" Stockburn goes on an adventure-filled journey across the Old West with his five brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPc80jywR5Nm2KIQjkY5i4VXSx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347969'),
  ('493947481048633101', 'The Ridiculous Spring Festival Gala Tour', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Wang Ying Lun', 'Wang Ying Lun, Zhang Yu Qian', null, null, 'A movie about the Spring Festival Gala, the homesickness and New Year customs of Chinese overseas. It records a group of Chinese who carefully prepared a Spring Festival Gala for their beliefs. However, there are many difficulties in the process of preparation. A series of funny stories have taken places.', 'A movie about the Spring Festival Gala, the homesickness and New Year customs of Chinese overseas. It records a group of Chinese who carefully prepared a Spring Festival Gala for their beliefs. However, there are many difficulties in the process of preparation. A series of funny stories have taken places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZlQUyWDsMbOUqF5Gsu81uARYta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030398'),
  ('125268052861463523', 'The Rifleman', 2019, 'War, Drama, History', 'Kristaps Krūmiņš, Dzintars Dreibergs, Valdis Celmiņš', 'Boris Frumin', 'Oto Brantevics, Vilis Daudziņš, Ivars Krasts, Gatis Gāga, Martins Vilsons, Rēzija Kalniņa, Raimonds Celms, Jēkabs Reinis', null, 'The love story of sixteen-year-old Arturs is interrupted by the First World War. After losing his mother and his home, he finds some consolation in joining the army, because this is the first time national battalions are allowed in the Russian Empire. But war is nothing like Arturs imagined – no glory, no fairness. It is brutal and painful. Arturs is now completely alone as war takes the lives of his father and brother. Also, no progress is made in the promised quick resolution of the war and timely return home. Within the notion that only he alone cares about returning home and that his homeland is just a playground for other nations, Arturs finds strength for the final battle and eventually returns home to start everything from scratch, just like his newly born country.', 'The love story of sixteen-year-old Arturs is interrupted by the First World War. After losing his mother and his home, he finds some consolation in joining the army, because this is the first time national battalions are allowed in the Russian Empire. But war is nothing like Arturs imagined – no glory, no fairness. It is brutal and painful. Arturs is now completely alone as war takes the lives of his father and brother. Also, no progress is made in the promised quick resolution of the war and timely return home. Within the notion that only he alone cares about returning home and that his homeland is just a playground for other nations, Arturs finds strength for the final battle and eventually returns home to start everything from scratch, just like his newly born country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3lVSySBEW17JK4k5RZJ5mALHM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567566'),
  ('479479501839748334', 'The Rifleman of the Voroshilov Regiment', 1999, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Gennadi Engstrem, Boris Zolin', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Yuri Polyakov', 'Mikhail Ulyanov, Anna Sinyakina, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Vladislav Galkin, Irina Rozanova, Ilya Drevnov, Aleksey Makarov, Marat Basharov', null, 'A very typical post-Soviet era storyline. A bunch of vagabonds lured an innocent teenage girl to their apartment, offered her a drink, intimidated, then gang raped her. Local cops are incapable to undertake an adequate actions against the scoundrels - prevented by the superior chief of the local police, who is the dad of one of the scumbags. The case is closed. The girl''s granddad tired of an endless circumlocution decides to take revenge in his own hands.', 'A very typical post-Soviet era storyline. A bunch of vagabonds lured an innocent teenage girl to their apartment, offered her a drink, intimidated, then gang raped her. Local cops are incapable to undertake an adequate actions against the scoundrels - prevented by the superior chief of the local police, who is the dad of one of the scumbags. The case is closed. The girl''s granddad tired of an endless circumlocution decides to take revenge in his own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDUPockuLcjeh6Sn4wNRt4ZYDRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71186'),
  ('649035029922228423', 'The Rift', 1990, 'Action, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Juan Piquer Simón, Juan Mariné', 'David Coleman', 'Jack Scalia, R. Lee Ermey, Ray Wise, Deborah Adair, John Toles-Bey, Ely Pouget, Emilio Linder, Tony Isbert', 'R', 'An experimental submarine with a very experienced crew, the "Siren II" is sent to find out what happened to the "Siren I" after it mysteriously disappeared in a submarine rift. Things go awry when they begin to find things that shouldn''t be there...', 'An experimental submarine with a very experienced crew, the "Siren II" is sent to find out what happened to the "Siren I" after it mysteriously disappeared in a submarine rift. Things go awry when they begin to find things that shouldn''t be there...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyigQNqSK7acJD0lcF7eY9uIvmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28450'),
  ('556699041660539309', 'The Rig', 2010, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Peter Atencio, Douglas E. Davis, Stanley B. Gill', 'Marilee A. Benson, Scott Martin, Lori Chavez', 'William Forsythe, Stacey Hinnen, Serah D''Laine, Marcus T. Paulk, Carmen Gloria Pérez, Dan Benson, Robert Zachar, Scott Martin', null, 'In the midst of a tropical storm, the crew of an offshore oil rig must survive the rampage of a creature after invading its undersea habitat.', 'In the midst of a tropical storm, the crew of an offshore oil rig must survive the rampage of a creature after invading its undersea habitat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qf7OXFj0bomUAFy9xR3jSN4zF7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46368'),
  ('1123669290985519920', 'The Right Distance', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Luca Bigazzi', 'Doriana Leondeff, Carlo Mazzacurati, Claudio Piersanti', 'Valentina Lodovini, Giovanni Capovilla, Ahmed Hafiene, Giuseppe Battiston, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Marina Rocco, Natalino Balasso, Dario Cantarelli', null, 'The arrival of an attractive young teacher in a small town in the Po valley disturbs the drowsy life of the place, leading eventually to a murder.', 'The arrival of an attractive young teacher in a small town in the Po valley disturbs the drowsy life of the place, leading eventually to a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZySEbzk0dQ3wsytqg9nItn8jlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57052'),
  ('80767518306532308', 'The Right Kind of Wrong', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jeremiah S. Chechik, Luc Montpellier, Ehud Ellman', 'Megan Martin', 'Ryan Kwanten, Catherine O''Hara, Will Sasso, Sara Canning, Ryan McPartlin, Kristen Hager, James A. Woods, Jennifer Baxter', 'R', 'A stubborn idealist spies a bride on her way to her wedding and immediately falls in love with her.', 'A stubborn idealist spies a bride on her way to her wedding and immediately falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qw3cFdCxLOP4cENuhHemrVzwfOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209406'),
  ('305989557693130876', 'The Right of the Weakest', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Lucas Belvaux, Claude Semal, Patrick Descamps, Natacha Régnier, Gilbert Melki, Éric Caravaca, Elie Belvaux, Philippe Anciaux', null, 'In the Belgian town of Liege, in order to buy a moped for the wife of their friend Patrick, three men decide to organise a large-scale hold-up. As expected, nothing goes to plan.', 'In the Belgian town of Liege, in order to buy a moped for the wife of their friend Patrick, three men decide to organise a large-scale hold-up. As expected, nothing goes to plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8rQ9K9FeeG2LvScbgZQlcpWbkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71732'),
  ('778016825917394653', 'The Right One', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ken Mok', 'Ken Mok', 'Iliza Shlesinger, Cleopatra Coleman, Nick Thune, David Koechner, Leanne Lapp', 'R', 'Sara, a novelist struggling with writer''s block, needs inspiration — and finds it when she serendipitously meets Godfrey, a down-on-his-luck oddball who constantly changes personas and alter egos in order to cope with his past and avoid reality. Just as Godfrey begins to open up to Sara, he discovers that she’s been using him as inspiration for her next novel, and he vanishes from her life. Did Sara just lose the man of her dreams, or will she be able to find him and make things right?', 'Sara, a novelist struggling with writer''s block, needs inspiration — and finds it when she serendipitously meets Godfrey, a down-on-his-luck oddball who constantly changes personas and alter egos in order to cope with his past and avoid reality. Just as Godfrey begins to open up to Sara, he discovers that she’s been using him as inspiration for her next novel, and he vanishes from her life. Did Sara just lose the man of her dreams, or will she be able to find him and make things right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgX0Yez6cYoFZeGGmaAIKDduhYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774785'),
  ('688421949050741104', 'The Right Side of My Brain', 1984, 'Drama', 'Richard Kern', 'Richard Kern, Lydia Lunch', 'Lydia Lunch, Henry Rollins, J.G. Thirlwell, Norman Westberg, Brian Moran, Eric Willenbrink, Sally Ven Yu Berg', null, 'Lydia Lunch and Richard Kern''s first collaborative effort, The Right Side of My Brain, is a glimpse into the world of unsatiable female lust, narrated by Lydia Lunch. The film was initially dismissed and dismayed by critics such as J. Hoberman, but the criticism of The Right Side of My Brain received only pushed the two to go one step further with Fingered (1986).', 'Lydia Lunch and Richard Kern''s first collaborative effort, The Right Side of My Brain, is a glimpse into the world of unsatiable female lust, narrated by Lydia Lunch. The film was initially dismissed and dismayed by critics such as J. Hoberman, but the criticism of The Right Side of My Brain received only pushed the two to go one step further with Fingered (1986).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tK5P0f3VDBSYNDGJfXV3icISmdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143521'),
  ('496125963335122334', 'The Right Stuff', 1983, 'Drama, History, Adventure', 'Caleb Deschanel, Philip Kaufman', 'Philip Kaufman', 'Sam Shepard, Scott Glenn, Ed Harris, Dennis Quaid, Fred Ward, Barbara Hershey, Kim Stanley, Veronica Cartwright', 'PG', 'At the dawn of the Space Race, seven test pilots set out to become the first American astronauts to enter space. However, the road to making history brings momentous challenges.', 'At the dawn of the Space Race, seven test pilots set out to become the first American astronauts to enter space. However, the road to making history brings momentous challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFR1p46HXJVVMpmOil8bNWnAQ50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9549'),
  ('164431016601920818', 'The Right Temptation', 2000, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Lyndon Chubbuck, Eric J. Goldstein, Stephen J. Fisher', 'Larry Brand', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Rebecca De Mornay, Dana Delany, Adam Baldwin, Joanna Cassidy, Michael Ralph, Robert Jayne, Neil Flynn', 'NR', 'A detective falls for the man she''s supposed to be investigating; dire complications follow.', 'A detective falls for the man she''s supposed to be investigating; dire complications follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UCwEsLUywrV58DjW8u1nr9ZJse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55921'),
