  ('603691759307521480', 'The Right-Minded Madman', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Kostas Karagiannis, Aris Papatheodorou', 'Lakis Mihailidis', 'Labros Konstadaras, Smaro Stefanidou, Ketty Panou, Katerina Gogou, Alekos Tzanetakos, Theodoros Katsadramis, Despoina Stylianopoulou, Giorgos Kappis', null, 'A wretch employee wins a lot of money in the lottery and loses his mind. When he comes out of the mental hospital, he finds out that things at his home have changed radically.', 'A wretch employee wins a lot of money in the lottery and loses his mind. When he comes out of the mental hospital, he finds out that things at his home have changed radically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouPc6jrHyCv2EXrUEiq2mDQRpUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399827'),
  ('898675965387501357', 'The Ring', 1927, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Jack E. Cox, Frank Mills', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Alma Reville', 'Carl Brisson, Lillian Hall-Davis, Ian Hunter, Forrester Harvey, Harry Terry, Gordon Harker, Clare Greet, Tom Helmore', null, 'Both Jack Sander and Bob Corby are boxers in love with Mabel. Jack and Mabel wed, but their marriage is flat. The young wife looks to Bob for comfort.', 'Both Jack Sander and Bob Corby are boxers in love with Mabel. Jack and Mabel wed, but their marriage is flat. The young wife looks to Bob for comfort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VeNRpyspVlJzkrNAyszdGtmy9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36056'),
  ('188575834738536102', 'The Ring', 1996, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Armand Mastroianni, Gideon Porath', 'Carmen Culver', 'Nastassja Kinski, Michael York, Rupert Penry-Jones, Carsten Nørgaard, Tim DeKay, Alessandro Nivola, Linda Lavin, James B. Sikking', null, 'During WW II, a young German woman is separated from her family and imprisoned by the Nazis. After being freed she falls in love with and marries a German officer. When Berlin falls to the Russians, and her husband killed, she flees to America, carrying his unborn child, all the while not giving up hope that she will find her family, tied together by her mother''s ring.', 'During WW II, a young German woman is separated from her family and imprisoned by the Nazis. After being freed she falls in love with and marries a German officer. When Berlin falls to the Russians, and her husband killed, she flees to America, carrying his unborn child, all the while not giving up hope that she will find her family, tied together by her mother''s ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13aZNi1Eosj1cVG2tm85z0nHEGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72394'),
  ('352872042598968144', 'The Ring', 2002, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Bojan Bazelli, Gore Verbinski, Marco Rubeo', 'Ehren Kruger, Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Naomi Watts, Martin Henderson, David Dorfman, Brian Cox, Jane Alexander, Lindsay Frost, Amber Tamblyn, Rachael Bella', 'PG-13', 'Journalist Rachel Keller investigates a strange videotape that may be behind the untimely deaths of four teenagers. There is an urban legend about this tape: the viewer will die seven days after watching it. Rachel tracks down the video... and watches it. Now she has just seven days to unravel the mystery of the Ring in order to save herself and her son.', 'Journalist Rachel Keller investigates a strange videotape that may be behind the untimely deaths of four teenagers. There is an urban legend about this tape: the viewer will die seven days after watching it. Rachel tracks down the video... and watches it. Now she has just seven days to unravel the mystery of the Ring in order to save herself and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeRpUynJKDpJveklBJipOYrVxCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565'),
  ('1141798908731951610', 'The Ring Finger', 2005, 'Drama', 'Diane Bertrand, Alain Duplantier', 'Diane Bertrand', 'Olga Kurylenko, Marc Barbé, Stipe Erceg, Édith Scob, Hanns Zischler, Sotigui Kouyaté, Doria Achour, Anne Benoît', 'NR', 'When she is slightly hurt in the factory where she works, Iris quits her job and finds a new one as an assistant in a laboratory of a very peculiar kind. Without fully grasping what is at play around her, she gradually engages in a disturbing love affair with her enigmatic employer.', 'When she is slightly hurt in the factory where she works, Iris quits her job and finds a new one as an assistant in a laboratory of a very peculiar kind. Without fully grasping what is at play around her, she gradually engages in a disturbing love affair with her enigmatic employer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ToULCjxL4E9owW271jQXNBfkr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46280'),
  ('267608280033456224', 'The Ring Thing', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Peter Steuger, Mark Schippert', null, 'Gwendolyn Rich, Edward Piccin, Leo Roos, Sebastian Arenas, Ralph Vogt, Armin Arnold, Yoav Parish, Enzo Esposito', null, 'All Friedrich wanted was to propose to Heidi, his supervisor, on a business trip. But while rehearsing on an airplane toilet, he and his ring drop out into the sky over the alps. Only to land in a very strange fairytale world. Come to find out, Middle Earth is right in the heart of Switzerland! To make matters worse, the quirky inhabitants mistake Friedrich for Frido the Tellyhobbie. Before he can say Tolkien, he‘s on a mission to save the world from an evil wizard who wants to dip the whole planet in one huge sizzling Swiss cheese fondue. A mission so crazy… it just might wake the hero in him. A spoof of the Lord of the Rings Trilogy set in Switzerland.', 'All Friedrich wanted was to propose to Heidi, his supervisor, on a business trip. But while rehearsing on an airplane toilet, he and his ring drop out into the sky over the alps. Only to land in a very strange fairytale world. Come to find out, Middle Earth is right in the heart of Switzerland! To make matters worse, the quirky inhabitants mistake Friedrich for Frido the Tellyhobbie. Before he can say Tolkien, he‘s on a mission to save the world from an evil wizard who wants to dip the whole planet in one huge sizzling Swiss cheese fondue. A mission so crazy… it just might wake the hero in him. A spoof of the Lord of the Rings Trilogy set in Switzerland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nW7h23nSZ75GFDu8bTNfqehMbE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10248'),
  ('1095960627919522627', 'The Ring Two', 2005, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Gabriel Beristain, Hideo Nakata, Doug Metzger', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Naomi Watts, Simon Baker, David Dorfman, Elizabeth Perkins, Gary Cole, Sissy Spacek, Ryan Merriman, Emily VanCamp', 'PG-13', 'After the ordeal with Samara, Rachel and Aiden move to a rural town. But soon Rachel learns about the death of a girl in a similar fashion. To save Aiden, she must dig into Samara''s past even further.', 'After the ordeal with Samara, Rachel and Aiden move to a rural town. But soon Rachel learns about the death of a girl in a similar fashion. To save Aiden, she must dig into Samara''s past even further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHbz7z2pecTawhkqLpuC2m0qywe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10320'),
  ('498376940369357428', 'The Ring Virus', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Dong-bin', 'Kim Dong-bin', 'Shin Eun-kyung, Jung Jin-young, Bae Doona, Kim Chang-wan, Yun Ju-sang, Kwon Nam-hee, Lee Hyeong-soo, Kim Kkot-ji', null, 'Sun-ju is a reporter who uncovers a series of inexplicable deaths that occurred simultaneously. Her investigation leads her to a resort, where she finds a videotape filled with mysterious images. After viewing it, a message appears on the screen that she has just been cursed, and that in order to save herself she must - end of tape. Somebody has erased the rest, leaving her horrified and uncertain of her next move.', 'Sun-ju is a reporter who uncovers a series of inexplicable deaths that occurred simultaneously. Her investigation leads her to a resort, where she finds a videotape filled with mysterious images. After viewing it, a message appears on the screen that she has just been cursed, and that in order to save herself she must - end of tape. Somebody has erased the rest, leaving her horrified and uncertain of her next move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wngS3q4BDWnVzwMlaYRYl18kVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37576'),
  ('815678262460439737', 'The Ring with a Crowned Eagle', 1992, 'War, Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda, Dariusz Kuc', 'Andrzej Kotkowski, Maciej Karpiński, Andrzej Wajda', 'Rafał Królikowski, Adrianna Biedrzyńska, Cezary Pazura, Jerzy Kamas, Mirosław Baka, Piotr Bajor, Jadwiga Jankowska-Cieślak, Andrzej Blumenfeld', null, 'A Polish Resistance fighter who survived the Nazi years cannot accept the new Communist power.', 'A Polish Resistance fighter who survived the Nazi years cannot accept the new Communist power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keCAhuevZUmPRqd7sS8u2QgXvcz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270737'),
  ('537461558521462723', 'The Ringer', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Barry W. Blaustein, Mark Irwin, K.C. Hodenfield', 'Ricky Blitt', 'Johnny Knoxville, Brian Cox, Katherine Heigl, Luis Ávalos, Jed Rees, Leonard Earl Howze, Geoffrey Arend, Edward Barbanell', 'PG-13', 'Pressured by a greedy uncle and a pile of debt, lovable loser Steve Barker resorts to an unthinkable, contemptible, just-crazy-enough-to-work scheme. He pretends to be mentally challenged to rig the upcoming Special Olympics and bring home the gold. But when Steve''s fellow competitors get wise to the con, they inspire him to rise to the greatest challenge of all: becoming a better person.', 'Pressured by a greedy uncle and a pile of debt, lovable loser Steve Barker resorts to an unthinkable, contemptible, just-crazy-enough-to-work scheme. He pretends to be mentally challenged to rig the upcoming Special Olympics and bring home the gold. But when Steve''s fellow competitors get wise to the con, they inspire him to rise to the greatest challenge of all: becoming a better person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEkEGRMaqDj4SMofgjOYVGR4o18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9927'),
  ('764712718565448541', 'The Ringmaster', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Søren Juul Petersen, Tobias Scavenius', 'Søren Juul Petersen', 'Anne Bergfeld, Karin Michelsen, Damon Younger, Mads Koudal, Kristoffer Fabricius, Kim Sønderholm, Gustav Scavenius, Lars Knutzon', null, 'Nationwide quietness. The streets are empty. Everyone’s glued to their screens at home, watching the final game. In the outskirts of Denmark, close to the German border, a small gas station needs to be open for service, even on this special night. Two young women have the shift. Ambitious Agnes is in the backroom putting finishing touches on her thesis, while free-spirited Belinda is on her phone, hoping to get the attention of her boyfriend. Unfortunately, the shift is not going to be as uneventful as they think, because no customers also means no witnesses, and the girls have been spotted to play a special part in a very different sort of game.', 'Nationwide quietness. The streets are empty. Everyone’s glued to their screens at home, watching the final game. In the outskirts of Denmark, close to the German border, a small gas station needs to be open for service, even on this special night. Two young women have the shift. Ambitious Agnes is in the backroom putting finishing touches on her thesis, while free-spirited Belinda is on her phone, hoping to get the attention of her boyfriend. Unfortunately, the shift is not going to be as uneventful as they think, because no customers also means no witnesses, and the girls have been spotted to play a special part in a very different sort of game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icbD0G01qRvAoj0Rpn7DAkEGXnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462347'),
  ('966274128585963940', 'The Rink', 1916, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh, Tom Harrington', 'Vincent Bryan, Maverick Terrell', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, James T. Kelley, Eric Campbell, Lloyd Bacon, Albert Austin, Henry Bergman, Leota Bryan', 'G', 'After amusements working in a restaurant, a waiter uses his lunch break to go roller skating.', 'After amusements working in a restaurant, a waiter uses his lunch break to go roller skating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaKKcsUChu117urmWBz9Os23Ad9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2077'),
  ('223012590860736399', 'The Riot', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nils Gaup, Anders Bohman', 'Christopher Grøndal', 'Otto Fahlgren, Alexandra Gjerpen, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Stig Henrik Hoff, Pernille Sandøy, Simon J. Berger, Heidi Ruud Ellingsen, Sofia Jannok', null, 'In 1907, the miners in Sulitjelma in Fauske in Nordland made a famous rebellion against greedy mine owners.', 'In 1907, the miners in Sulitjelma in Fauske in Nordland made a famous rebellion against greedy mine owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLbFl9JdtAuaC66hljn2GYh71Kj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964258'),
  ('462822812650857109', 'The Riot Club', 2014, 'Drama', 'Lone Scherfig, Sebastian Blenkov, Andrea Matheson', 'Laura Wade', 'Max Irons, Sam Claflin, Douglas Booth, Holliday Grainger, Jessica Brown Findlay, Natalie Dormer, Sam Reid, Tom Hollander', null, 'Two first-year students at Oxford University join a secret society and learn that their reputations can be made or destroyed over the course of one evening.', 'Two first-year students at Oxford University join a secret society and learn that their reputations can be made or destroyed over the course of one evening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r334FPNCgmYbiFDrZCmWGeWNMBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270302'),
  ('839092601601951280', 'The Rip', 2026, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Joe Carnahan, Jesse Rosenthal, Marvin Williams', 'Joe Carnahan', 'Matt Damon, Ben Affleck, Teyana Taylor, Steven Yeun, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Sasha Calle, Kyle Chandler, Scott Adkins', 'R', 'Trust frays when a team of Miami cops discovers millions in cash inside a run-down stash house, calling everyone — and everything — into question.', 'Trust frays when a team of Miami cops discovers millions in cash inside a run-down stash house, calling everyone — and everything — into question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZo31Dhl5BQ6GfbMNf3oU0tUvPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306368'),
  ('580559745026819669', 'The Ripper', 1985, 'Horror', 'Christopher Lewis, Paul MacFarlane', 'Bill Groves', 'Tom Schreier, Mona Van Pernis, Wade Tower, Tom Savini, Andrea Adams, Randall White, Bennie Lee McGowan, Jeffrey R. Fontana', 'NR', 'An old antique ring turns a college professor into a homicidal maniac when he puts it on. The ring originaly belonged to Jack the Ripper, and the Ripper''s spirit possesses whoever wears it.', 'An old antique ring turns a college professor into a homicidal maniac when he puts it on. The ring originaly belonged to Jack the Ripper, and the Ripper''s spirit possesses whoever wears it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKjMHkvTiVvcsiGy7bkGNeHvLPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85008'),
  ('777288000671549031', 'The Ripper', 1997, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Horror', 'Janet Meyers', 'Robert Rodat', 'Patrick Bergin, Gabrielle Anwar, Samuel West, Michael York, Adam Couper, Essie Davis', null, 'It is 1888, and London is in the grip of one of the most gruesome and mysterious crime sprees in history. Under extreme pressure from the Royal family, the head of Scotland Yard assigns its top man to the grisly case.', 'It is 1888, and London is in the grip of one of the most gruesome and mysterious crime sprees in history. Under extreme pressure from the Royal family, the head of Scotland Yard assigns its top man to the grisly case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmDWgKgwYFMZL2k6BBA0jWLCn5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218485'),
  ('367692785319267645', 'The Rise', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Rowan Athale, Stuart Bentley', 'Rowan Athale', 'Luke Treadaway, Timothy Spall, Matthew Lewis, Iwan Rheon, Neil Maskell, Vanessa Kirby, Gerard Kearns, Lewis Rainer', null, 'After being released from prison for a crime he didn''t commit, Harvey Miller has revenge on his mind. He recruits his three best friends to help him rob the local drug kingpin whose betrayal put him away in the first place.', 'After being released from prison for a crime he didn''t commit, Harvey Miller has revenge on his mind. He recruits his three best friends to help him rob the local drug kingpin whose betrayal put him away in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uRwVWdcrOs3aCi8gxL5KTaG40r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128241'),
  ('1085498867944391849', 'The Rise and Fall of Legs Diamond', 1960, 'Crime, History', 'Budd Boetticher, Lucien Ballard, Gene Anderson Jr.', 'Joseph Landon', 'Ray Danton, Karen Steele, Elaine Stewart, Jesse White, Simon Oakland, Robert Lowery, Judson Pratt, Warren Oates', 'NR', 'Jack Diamond and his sickly brother arrive in prohibition New York as jewelry thieves. After a spell in jail, the coldly ambitious Diamond hits on the idea of stealing from thieves himself and sets about getting close to gangster boss Arnold Rothstein to move in on his booze, girls, gambling, and drugs operations.', 'Jack Diamond and his sickly brother arrive in prohibition New York as jewelry thieves. After a spell in jail, the coldly ambitious Diamond hits on the idea of stealing from thieves himself and sets about getting close to gangster boss Arnold Rothstein to move in on his booze, girls, gambling, and drugs operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtKdsKykX4Oz5o3nbtyAtWthkKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43046'),
  ('119569207297755677', 'The Rise and Rise of Michael Rimmer', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Billington, Alex Thomson, Michael Dryhurst', 'Peter Cook, John Cleese, Graham Chapman', 'Peter Cook, Denholm Elliott, Arthur Lowe, John Cleese, Vanessa Howard, Ronald Fraser, Graham Chapman, Ann Beach', null, 'Fresh-faced young Michael Rimmer worms his way into an opinion poll company and is soon running the place. He uses this as a springboard to get into politics and in the mini-skirted flared-trousered world of 1970 Britain starts to rise through the Tory ranks.', 'Fresh-faced young Michael Rimmer worms his way into an opinion poll company and is soon running the place. He uses this as a springboard to get into politics and in the mini-skirted flared-trousered world of 1970 Britain starts to rise through the Tory ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZErhDlHsWW8NufqfqieFvnZHtm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77882'),
  ('324453499512138139', 'The Rise of a Tomboy', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Guo Dalei', 'Xiong Jia Nan', 'Zhao Liying, Hans Zhang, Kimmy Tong Fei, Jung Il-woo, He Wenhui, Alan Dawa Dolma, Jiang Tao, Simon Twu', null, 'In the rising populations of Tomboys in China, one rise up to develop a "Love Formula" App to find true love. Will the Love Coach, Do, played by Simon Twu, be able to save the world in helping people finding True Love?', 'In the rising populations of Tomboys in China, one rise up to develop a "Love Formula" App to find true love. Will the Love Coach, Do, played by Simon Twu, be able to save the world in helping people finding True Love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OrgcIFZtdgdokLNSLRzdRMjoBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388892'),
  ('985940367453150360', 'The Rise of Catherine the Great', 1934, 'Drama, History', 'Georges Périnal, Paul Czinner, Geoffrey Boothby', 'Marjorie Deans', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Elisabeth Bergner, Flora Robson, Gerald du Maurier, Irene Vanbrugh, Joan Gardner, Dorothy Hale, Diana Napier', 'NR', 'The woman who will become Catherine the Great marries into the Russian royal family when she weds Grand Duke Peter, the nephew of Empress Elizabeth. Although the couple has moments of contentment, Peter''s cruel and erratic behavior causes a rift between him and Catherine. Mere months after Peter succeeds his aunt as the ruler of Russia, a revolt is brewing, and Catherine is poised to ascend to the throne as the country''s new empress.', 'The woman who will become Catherine the Great marries into the Russian royal family when she weds Grand Duke Peter, the nephew of Empress Elizabeth. Although the couple has moments of contentment, Peter''s cruel and erratic behavior causes a rift between him and Catherine. Mere months after Peter succeeds his aunt as the ruler of Russia, a revolt is brewing, and Catherine is poised to ascend to the throne as the country''s new empress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcfc8jgMrmP0R6VD2cSqr58D1IQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43687'),
  ('836924916058149486', 'The Rise of the Red Hot Chili Peppers: Our Brother, Hillel', 2026, 'Documentary, History, Music', 'Ben Feldman, Jeff Powers', null, 'Hillel Slovak, Anthony Kiedis, Flea, Alain Johannes, Jack Irons', 'R', 'Gritty, formative years of the Los Angeles band, and the influence of original guitarist Hillel Slovak, who died in 1988. It features interviews with bandmates Flea and Anthony Kiedis who discuss the band''s early evolution.', 'Gritty, formative years of the Los Angeles band, and the influence of original guitarist Hillel Slovak, who died in 1988. It features interviews with bandmates Flea and Anthony Kiedis who discuss the band''s early evolution.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fy9hHoO3eB7l3ZjYUZoJUJpZW22V.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-rise-of-the-red-hot-chili-peppers-our-brother-hillel-2026'),
  ('1094714969439919895', 'The Rising Hawk', 2019, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Akhtem Seitablaiev, Yurii Korol, John Wynn', 'Rich Ronat', 'Alex MacNicoll, Poppy Drayton, Rocky Myers, Alina Kovalenko, Robert Patrick, Tommy Flanagan, Alison Doody, Andrii Isaienko', null, 'During the 13th century, a small village fights for freedom in the frontier landscape of the Carpathian Mountains against Mongolian invaders.', 'During the 13th century, a small village fights for freedom in the frontier landscape of the Carpathian Mountains against Mongolian invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmLNbyXKpuEKXjmaEWIEAoiS0OB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468816'),
  ('112833686431294423', 'The Rising of the Moon', 1957, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Ford, Robert Krasker, Dennis Bertera', 'Frank S. Nugent', 'Tyrone Power, Noel Purcell, Cyril Cusack, Jack MacGowran, Jimmy O''Dea, Tony Quinn, Paul Farrell, Kevin Casey', null, 'Three vignettes of old Irish country life, based on a series of short stories. In "The Majesty of the Law," a police officer must arrest an old-fashioned, traditional fellow for assault. The man''s principles have the policeman and the whole village, including the man he slugged, sympathizing with him. "One Minute''s Wait" is about a little train station and glimpses into the lives of the passengers, with a series of comic setups. The third piece, "1921," is about a condemned Irish nationalist and his daring escape.', 'Three vignettes of old Irish country life, based on a series of short stories. In "The Majesty of the Law," a police officer must arrest an old-fashioned, traditional fellow for assault. The man''s principles have the policeman and the whole village, including the man he slugged, sympathizing with him. "One Minute''s Wait" is about a little train station and glimpses into the lives of the passengers, with a series of comic setups. The third piece, "1921," is about a condemned Irish nationalist and his daring escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUBhv0tHDYgYQmvjSSdEUPwXADv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178103'),
  ('923271351473536521', 'The Rite', 1969, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Ingrid Thulin, Anders Ek, Gunnar Björnstrand, Erik Hell, Ingmar Bergman', null, 'Called to court on obscenity charges, a theatre troupe are forced to expose their neuroses and inner psychological torments.', 'Called to court on obscenity charges, a theatre troupe are forced to expose their neuroses and inner psychological torments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rlNfkvnDbxtoDpKGxFmbJgWpfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65092'),
  ('658947612853304295', 'The Rite', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Ben Davis, Mikael Håfström, John Greaves', 'Michael Petroni', 'Anthony Hopkins, Colin O''Donoghue, Alice Braga, Rutger Hauer, Ciarán Hinds, Toby Jones, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Marta Gastini', 'PG-13', 'Seminary student Michael Kovak reluctantly attends exorcism school at the Vatican. While he’s in Rome, Michael meets an unorthodox priest who introduces him to the darker side of his faith, uncovering the devil’s reach even to one of the holiest places on Earth.', 'Seminary student Michael Kovak reluctantly attends exorcism school at the Vatican. While he’s in Rome, Michael meets an unorthodox priest who introduces him to the darker side of his faith, uncovering the devil’s reach even to one of the holiest places on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRTxM95huMwIDfZBJWjuifMTfpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48171'),
  ('157423023195181798', 'The Rite of Spring', 2022, 'Drama', 'Fernando Franco, Santiago Racaj', 'Fernando Franco, Begoña Arostegui', 'Valèria Sorolla, Telmo Irureta, Emma Suárez', null, 'Laura has just arrived in Madrid to study at University. One night, she accidentally meets David, who has cerebral palsy. The relationship with the boy and his mother will give Laura the push she needs to overcome her complexes and insecurities and confidently enter a new phase. A story about that vital moment when anything is possible and how the most unexpected encounters can change our lives.', 'Laura has just arrived in Madrid to study at University. One night, she accidentally meets David, who has cerebral palsy. The relationship with the boy and his mother will give Laura the push she needs to overcome her complexes and insecurities and confidently enter a new phase. A story about that vital moment when anything is possible and how the most unexpected encounters can change our lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWGiksYltgeqN7itKActKRYRqLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003685'),
  ('651569357423532816', 'The Rites of May', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Mike de Leon, Rody Lacap', 'Gil Quito, Clodualdo del Mundo Jr.', 'Charo Santos, Tommy Abuel, Mona Lisa, Mario Montenegro, Sarah K. Joaquin, Susan Valdez-LeGoff, Moody Diaz', null, 'During a return to his provincial home, a young man gets involved with a woman who is ultimately possessed by her sister''s spirit, paving the way to revealing the painful truth about her unsolved disappearance.', 'During a return to his provincial home, a young man gets involved with a woman who is ultimately possessed by her sister''s spirit, paving the way to revealing the painful truth about her unsolved disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqlIWYsmPaiFyD5KlGy9PDqEL9r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208579'),
  ('945933398511400532', 'The Ritual', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'David Bruckner, Valeriu Chiran, Liam Lock', 'Joe Barton', 'Rafe Spall, Arsher Ali, Robert James-Collier, Sam Troughton, Paul Reid, Matthew Needham, Jacob James Beswick, Maria Erwolter', 'R', 'A group of college friends reunite for a trip to the forest, but encounter a menacing presence in the woods that''s stalking them.', 'A group of college friends reunite for a trip to the forest, but encounter a menacing presence in the woods that''s stalking them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9022CYEGqYETCeXN1oE3uwYJWub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433808'),
  ('711030817141112804', 'The Ritual', 2025, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'David Midell, Adam Biddle, Ruben Mazzoleni', 'David Midell', 'Dan Stevens, Abigail Cowen, Al Pacino, Patricia Heaton, Ashley Greene, Patrick Fabian, María Camila Giraldo, Meadow Williams', 'NR', 'Two priests, one in crisis with his faith and the other confronting a turbulent past, must overcome their differences to perform a risky exorcism.', 'Two priests, one in crisis with his faith and the other confronting a turbulent past, must overcome their differences to perform a risky exorcism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uubL8yvtEBjz3V7DFQHjCuSQO8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278950'),
  ('857582110651678673', 'The Ritual Killer', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'George Gallo, Andrzej Sekula, Jared Briley', 'Bob Bowersox, Jennifer Lemmon, Francesco Cinquemani', 'Morgan Freeman, Cole Hauser, Vernon Davis, Peter Stormare, Giuseppe Zeno, Murielle Hilaire, Luke Stratte-McClure, Brian Kurlander', 'NR', 'Unable to process the death of his daughter, Detective Boyd embarks on a hunt for a serial killer who murders according to a brutal tribal ritual: Muti. The only person who can help Boyd is Professor Mackles, an anthropologist who hides an unspeakable secret. The line between sanity and madness thins as Boyd goes deeper into the killer’s world.', 'Unable to process the death of his daughter, Detective Boyd embarks on a hunt for a serial killer who murders according to a brutal tribal ritual: Muti. The only person who can help Boyd is Professor Mackles, an anthropologist who hides an unspeakable secret. The line between sanity and madness thins as Boyd goes deeper into the killer’s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VtHaELqLMovl8EueBWHDtihhzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862552'),
  ('772819495439317853', 'The Ritz', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Richard Lester, Paul Wilson, Terry Madden', 'Terrence McNally', 'Jack Weston, Rita Moreno, Jerry Stiller, Kaye Ballard, F. Murray Abraham, Paul B. Price, Treat Williams, John Everson', 'R', 'To escape from a mobster, businessman Gaetano Proclo orders a cab driver to take him to a place where he can''t be found. Unfortunately for Gaetano, the place turns out to be a gay bathhouse.', 'To escape from a mobster, businessman Gaetano Proclo orders a cab driver to take him to a place where he can''t be found. Unfortunately for Gaetano, the place turns out to be a gay bathhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5z2AvjDFVMJmGN2EE4vS7tSw1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63848'),
  ('322659390785299401', 'The River', 1929, 'Romance, Drama', 'Frank Borzage, Ernest Palmer, Lew Borzage', 'Philip Klein, Dwight Cummins', 'Charles Farrell, Mary Duncan, Ivan Linow, Margaret Mann, Alfred Sabato, Bert Woodruff', 'NR', 'Passion carried an innocent boy and a worldly woman beyond the barriers of conscience.', 'Passion carried an innocent boy and a worldly woman beyond the barriers of conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1nLU2KRURRFIbsBGnFap5BSm0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110736'),
  ('18367642452613536', 'The River', 1938, 'Documentary', 'Pare Lorentz, Stacy Woodard, Willard Van Dyke', 'Pare Lorentz', 'Thomas Chalmers', null, 'This short Depression-era documentary describes the importance of the Mississippi River to the United States and laments the environmental destruction committed in the name of progress, particularly farming and timber practices and their impact on impoverished farmers.', 'This short Depression-era documentary describes the importance of the Mississippi River to the United States and laments the environmental destruction committed in the name of progress, particularly farming and timber practices and their impact on impoverished farmers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRlUXe5GMArNFisoaSBStEkf2P4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119767'),
  ('817394236110086400', 'The River', 1951, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Renoir, Jean Renoir, Harisadhan Dasgupta', 'Jean Renoir, Rumer Godden', 'Nora Swinburne, Esmond Knight, Arthur Shields, Suprova Mukerjee, Thomas E. Breen, Patricia Walters, Radha Burnier, Adrienne Corri', null, 'Director Jean Renoir’s entrancing first color feature—shot entirely on location in India—is a visual tour de force. Based on the novel by Rumer Godden, the film eloquently contrasts the growing pains of three young women with the immutability of the Bengal river around which their daily lives unfold. Enriched by Renoir’s subtle understanding and appreciation for India and its people, The River gracefully explores the fragile connections between transitory emotions and everlasting creation.', 'Director Jean Renoir’s entrancing first color feature—shot entirely on location in India—is a visual tour de force. Based on the novel by Rumer Godden, the film eloquently contrasts the growing pains of three young women with the immutability of the Bengal river around which their daily lives unfold. Enriched by Renoir’s subtle understanding and appreciation for India and its people, The River gracefully explores the fragile connections between transitory emotions and everlasting creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rC1k4xkffb5sdQlktiP2TyiBxT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45218'),
  ('808476512209203852', 'The River', 1984, 'Drama', 'Mark Rydell, Christopher Wilkinson, Jerry Ziesmer', 'Robert Dillon, Julian Barry', 'Mel Gibson, Sissy Spacek, Scott Glenn, Billy Green Bush, Shane Bailey, Becky Jo Lynch, Don Hood, James Tolkan', 'PG', 'Tom and Mae Garvey are a Tennessee farming couple battling violent floods to save their land. In addition to natural disasters, the Garveys fight to stop a selfish land developer and a local corporation from foreclosing on their farm. While Mae stays at home to care for their children and tend to the crops, Tom finds work as a scab at a steel mill to preserve his family''s property.', 'Tom and Mae Garvey are a Tennessee farming couple battling violent floods to save their land. In addition to natural disasters, the Garveys fight to stop a selfish land developer and a local corporation from foreclosing on their farm. While Mae stays at home to care for their children and tend to the crops, Tom finds work as a scab at a steel mill to preserve his family''s property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXIlE2QVIarVug9wpyPIz2xiWxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38557'),
  ('490762575428656423', 'The River', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung, Wang Ming-tai', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Yi-chun Tsai, Pi-ying Yang', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Miao Tian, Lu Yi-ching, Chen Shiang-Chyi, Ann Hui, Chen Chao-jung, Yang Kuei-mei, Lin Hsiao-Lan', null, 'A young man develops severe neck pain after swimming in a polluted river for a movie shoot, but nobody can provide him any relief.', 'A young man develops severe neck pain after swimming in a polluted river for a movie shoot, but nobody can provide him any relief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Z4jHXRPf86hIsnvHXnTp2dt5pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54291'),
  ('1012528410990285352', 'The River and Death', 1954, 'Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, Raúl Martínez Solares, Ignacio Villareal', 'Luis Buñuel, Luis Alcoriza', 'Columba Domínguez, Miguel Torruco, Joaquín Cordero, Jaime Fernández, Víctor Alcocer, Silvia Derbez, José Elías Moreno, Carlos Martínez Baena', null, 'A useless and bloody vendetta has been going on for ages between two families in this Mexican village. Men, sons, have killed each other for generations, for a so-called conception of honor in a revenge that never ends since it is also triggered by people of the village. Now, today, there are only two sons left, one in each family. One has become a doctor in the big city and his culture is modern. The other last one - of the other family - hasn''t left the village and is waiting for the doctor to come "home" as he plans to kill him, to settle this war on this matter of honor once and for all. And the people of the village want blood.', 'A useless and bloody vendetta has been going on for ages between two families in this Mexican village. Men, sons, have killed each other for generations, for a so-called conception of honor in a revenge that never ends since it is also triggered by people of the village. Now, today, there are only two sons left, one in each family. One has become a doctor in the big city and his culture is modern. The other last one - of the other family - hasn''t left the village and is waiting for the doctor to come "home" as he plans to kill him, to settle this war on this matter of honor once and for all. And the people of the village want blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3UJBsso5jaEybQsdYiX4euau5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114354'),
  ('1129849643689808925', 'The River Fuefuki', 1960, 'War, Drama, History', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda, Yoshikazu Ōtsuki', 'Keisuke Kinoshita', 'Takahiro Tamura, Hideko Takamine, Matsumoto Hakuō II, Kichiemon Nakamura II, Shinji Tanaka, Shima Iwashita, Michiko Araki, Yūsuke Kawazu', null, 'In a time of continuous civil wars ravaging the fields of feudal Japan, the eldest son of a very poor peasant family, living alongside the bridge over the Fuefuki river, decides to serve a warlord to escape his miserable condition, being soon followed by his younger brothers. Although not all the men of the family take this tragic path of death, women of the family will be doomed to endure the pain of loss during the next five generations.', 'In a time of continuous civil wars ravaging the fields of feudal Japan, the eldest son of a very poor peasant family, living alongside the bridge over the Fuefuki river, decides to serve a warlord to escape his miserable condition, being soon followed by his younger brothers. Although not all the men of the family take this tragic path of death, women of the family will be doomed to endure the pain of loss during the next five generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3ORnhmHSKAj7q31p6Z91SieUwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219233'),
  ('201922946025896511', 'The River King', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nick Willing, Paul Sarossy', 'David Kane', 'Edward Burns, Jennifer Ehle, John Kapelos, Rachelle Lefevre, Bruce Murphy, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Jonathan Malen, Karl Pruner', null, 'Abel Grey is sent to investigate the death of a boy from an exclusive local school, who is found floating in the river. Fearing scandal, the school insists it was suicide. But after discovering from the boy''s girlfriend, Carlin, that he was being badly bullied, Abel suspects that a dangerous schoolboy initiation has gone horribly wrong and he secretly solicits the help of a sympathetic teacher, Betsy. He is warned off the investigation by his boss, as the school is a generous benefactor to the Police benevolent fund. Abel, however, cannot let the case go, not only because his own brother committed suicide years before, but also it seems that the spirit of the dead boy is leaving them clues as to what really happened that night.', 'Abel Grey is sent to investigate the death of a boy from an exclusive local school, who is found floating in the river. Fearing scandal, the school insists it was suicide. But after discovering from the boy''s girlfriend, Carlin, that he was being badly bullied, Abel suspects that a dangerous schoolboy initiation has gone horribly wrong and he secretly solicits the help of a sympathetic teacher, Betsy. He is warned off the investigation by his boss, as the school is a generous benefactor to the Police benevolent fund. Abel, however, cannot let the case go, not only because his own brother committed suicide years before, but also it seems that the spirit of the dead boy is leaving them clues as to what really happened that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXrjpHBftZftvqC4vfU2ZCSJpXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45072'),
  ('1016870847685066684', 'The River Murders', 2011, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Rich Cowan, Dan Heigh', 'Steve Anderson', 'Ray Liotta, Christian Slater, Ving Rhames, Gisele Fraga, Sarah Ann Schultz, Michael Rodrick, Melora Walters, Chris LeBlanc', 'R', 'The sins of the past are not forgotten in this chilling suspense thriller. When the first body was discovered, it seemed a coincidence. But now homicide detective Jack Verdon has cause to worry: the victims of a series of brutal sex murders are all his former girlfriends. Suspected by the FBI agent who’s taken over the case and suspended by his captain, Jack must work outside the law if he’s to find the killer, save his future and protect what’s left of his past.', 'The sins of the past are not forgotten in this chilling suspense thriller. When the first body was discovered, it seemed a coincidence. But now homicide detective Jack Verdon has cause to worry: the victims of a series of brutal sex murders are all his former girlfriends. Suspected by the FBI agent who’s taken over the case and suspended by his captain, Jack must work outside the law if he’s to find the killer, save his future and protect what’s left of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knNV0LnSvL8W7sKvmcKD3VQVQMN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70009'),
  ('554005104544484448', 'The River Rat', 1984, 'Adventure, Crime, Family, Drama', 'Thomas Rickman, Jan Kiesser', 'Thomas Rickman', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Martha Plimpton, Brian Dennehy, Shawn Smith, Nancy Lea Owen, Norman Bennett, Tony Frank, Angie Bolling', 'PG', 'On the lazy banks of the Mississippi, a young girl is reunited with her time-served but innocent father. But the reunion is tainted with the whereabouts of the stolen loot, and those who come looking for it...', 'On the lazy banks of the Mississippi, a young girl is reunited with her time-served but innocent father. But the reunion is tainted with the whereabouts of the stolen loot, and those who come looking for it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFA3NWg1qEKnruLza6QcQNcdxVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47638'),
  ('891797326740070008', 'The River Train', 2026, 'Music, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lorenzo Ferro, Lucas A. Vignale, Thomas Costa Grinberg', 'Lorenzo Ferro, Lucas A Vignale', 'Milo Barria, Rita Pauls, Mariano Barria, Lucrecia Pazos, Mailen Barria', null, 'Nine-year-old Milo lives in a remote Argentinian village where he studies the Malambo, a folk dance full of bravura. He is an excellent dancer, but Milo’s only desire is to escape the countryside on a train for the Buenos Aires of his dreams.', 'Nine-year-old Milo lives in a remote Argentinian village where he studies the Malambo, a folk dance full of bravura. He is an excellent dancer, but Milo’s only desire is to escape the countryside on a train for the Buenos Aires of his dreams.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwElH8qOEoF1Fl09DI0CA82AW4oe.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-river-train-2026'),
  ('425317303351989435', 'The River Why', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Leutwyler', 'Thomas A. Cohen', 'William Hurt, Amber Heard, Zach Gilford, Dallas Roberts, Gattlin Griffith, Daniel Nelson, Nikki DeLoach, Kathleen Quinlan', 'PG-13', 'A young man abandons his family for a solitary life of fly-fishing. His goal was to find his own way in the fishing world and thereby find himself and love.', 'A young man abandons his family for a solitary life of fly-fishing. His goal was to find his own way in the fishing world and thereby find himself and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpqQDzTjZmHQvPN3acBfNwfyq87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11403'),
  ('179227357824081540', 'The River Wild', 1994, 'Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'Curtis Hanson, Robert Elswit, David Kelley', 'Denis O''Neill', 'Meryl Streep, David Strathairn, Kevin Bacon, John C. Reilly, Joseph Mazzello, Benjamin Bratt, William Lucking, Stephanie Sawyer', 'PG-13', 'Gail and Tom Hartman are struggling to stay together and decide to take a white-water rafting holiday adventure in Montana for their son Roarke''s 10th birthday, only to meet up with a pair of mysterious men whose desperation grows, turning their vacation into a nightmare.', 'Gail and Tom Hartman are struggling to stay together and decide to take a white-water rafting holiday adventure in Montana for their son Roarke''s 10th birthday, only to meet up with a pair of mysterious men whose desperation grows, turning their vacation into a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVgQ2T63ThjIsY4R0qoHXjyllql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8987'),
  ('866953345572291839', 'The River''s Edge', 1957, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Allan Dwan, Harold Lipstein, Henry Spitz', 'James Leicester, Harold Jacob Smith', 'Ray Milland, Anthony Quinn, Debra Paget, Harry Carey, Jr., Chubby Johnson, Byron Foulger, Tom McKee, Frank Gerstle', 'NR', 'A murderous thief on the run with stolen loot forces a poor rancher to guide him across the desert into Mexico. Accompanying them is the rancher''s wife, who happens to be the killer''s former girlfriend.', 'A murderous thief on the run with stolen loot forces a poor rancher to guide him across the desert into Mexico. Accompanying them is the rancher''s wife, who happens to be the killer''s former girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nRwD4kaAVy531CAdQqXZJb1m8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71144'),
  ('702247754584572126', 'The Riverman', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bill Eagles, Steve Cosens', 'Tom Towler', 'Bruce Greenwood, Cary Elwes, Sam Jaeger, Sarah Manninen, Kathleen Quinlan, David Lawrence Brown, Jeremy Akerman, Cindy Sampson', null, 'A series of interviews are conducted with convicted serial killer Ted Bundy in hopes of gaining insight into the Green River Killer who is terrorizing Seattle.', 'A series of interviews are conducted with convicted serial killer Ted Bundy in hopes of gaining insight into the Green River Killer who is terrorizing Seattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQfpeqbiwAxGn359nryCe98lQyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56766'),
  ('948996355310611094', 'The Riverside Murder', 1935, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Albert Parker, Cecil Dixon, Alex Bryce', null, 'Basil Sydney, Judy Gunn, Zoe Davis, Alastair Sim, Reginald Tate, Ian Fleming, Tom Helmore, Martin Lewis', null, 'Investor Robert Norman murdered before meeting. Police investigate. Journalist Claire Haines pursues story to impress editor. Intertwining narratives of crime solving and reporting unfold.', 'Investor Robert Norman murdered before meeting. Police investigate. Journalist Claire Haines pursues story to impress editor. Intertwining narratives of crime solving and reporting unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHmgT1zhoNy2bqS5tDHKAV2YzHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198982'),
  ('162104249871237986', 'The Riveter', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Donald is a riveter who has trouble with the riveting gun, heights, and the foreman, Pete. Pete chases him throughout the construction site, causing the building to collapse. Donald runs away while Pete is trapped in cement, holding a water hose in the pose of a statue.', 'Donald is a riveter who has trouble with the riveting gun, heights, and the foreman, Pete. Pete chases him throughout the construction site, causing the building to collapse. Donald runs away while Pete is trapped in cement, holding a water hose in the pose of a statue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utEZVKM3drVdEI0fgDXrvSRlCh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77049'),
  ('102427578128375778', 'The Road', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Turgay Aksoy, Muzaffer Hiçdurmaz, Ali Kıvırcık', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Tarık Akan, Şerif Sezer, Halil Ergün, Meral Orhonsay, Necmettin Çobanoğlu, Hikmet Çelik, Tuncay Akça, Sevda Aktolga', 'PG', 'When five Kurdish prisoners are granted one week''s home leave, they find to their dismay that they face continued oppression outside of prison from their families, the culture, and the government.', 'When five Kurdish prisoners are granted one week''s home leave, they find to their dismay that they face continued oppression outside of prison from their families, the culture, and the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oblv2iaKFvrleCqBMLNHzcOCufR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52556'),
  ('1122340684763230080', 'The Road', 2006, 'Drama', 'Zhang Jiarui, Jong Lin', 'Zhang Jiarui, Daju Yuan', 'Zhang Jingchu, Fan Wei, Nie Yuan, Huang Lu, Jing Yang, Wang Jing', null, 'A young girl comes of age -- while also coming to terms with her destiny, pre-determined by the Communist Party -- in this beautiful, sweeping Chinese drama.', 'A young girl comes of age -- while also coming to terms with her destiny, pre-determined by the Communist Party -- in this beautiful, sweeping Chinese drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZJisS2DrvkjXibIgGdPu0xMXvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69810'),
  ('1100398444772673313', 'The Road', 2009, 'Adventure, Drama', 'John Hillcoat, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Joe Penhall', 'Viggo Mortensen, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Charlize Theron, Robert Duvall, Guy Pearce, Molly Parker, Michael Kenneth Williams, Garret Dillahunt', 'R', 'A father and his son walk alone through burned America. Nothing moves in the ravaged landscape save the ash on the wind and water. It is cold enough to crack stones and, when the snow falls, it is gray. Their destination is the warmer south, although they don''t know what, if anything, awaits them there.', 'A father and his son walk alone through burned America. Nothing moves in the ravaged landscape save the ash on the wind and water. It is cold enough to crack stones and, when the snow falls, it is gray. Their destination is the warmer south, although they don''t know what, if anything, awaits them there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLaXnLzqleBWQtjvZ6JGVSaKoC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20766'),
  ('1059452414470250229', 'The Road Builder', 1971, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Alastair Reid, Alex Thomson, Michael Dryhurst', 'Roald Dahl', 'Patricia Neal, Pamela Brown, Nicholas Clay, Jean Anderson, Graham Crowden, Yootha Joyce, Peter Sallis, Brigit Forsyth', 'R', 'The dreary existence of middle-aged spinster Maura Prince takes an unexpected turn with the arrival of young handyman Billy Jarvis, but there may be more to him than meets the eye.', 'The dreary existence of middle-aged spinster Maura Prince takes an unexpected turn with the arrival of young handyman Billy Jarvis, but there may be more to him than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiZQhG7yaxGGTNKAQZxmvQZMc3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86979'),
  ('1047354227019161196', 'The Road Dance', 2022, 'Drama', 'Richie Adams, Morris Milne, Elliott Day', 'Richie Adams', 'Hermione Corfield, Morven Christie, Mark Gatiss, Will Fletcher, Ali Fumiko Whitney, Ian Pirie, Jeff Stewart, David Brooks', null, 'A young girl lives in the Outer Hebrides in a small village in the years just before WWI. Isolated and hard by the shore, her life takes a dramatic change when a terrible tragedy befalls her.', 'A young girl lives in the Outer Hebrides in a small village in the years just before WWI. Isolated and hard by the shore, her life takes a dramatic change when a terrible tragedy befalls her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHEV0oXxludb6QfT3KS1DMRbY2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864866'),
