  ('67854338385337009', 'The Road to El Dorado', 2000, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Bibo Bergeron, Don Paul, Jeffrey Katzenberg', 'Terry Rossio, Ted Elliott', 'Kenneth Branagh, Kevin Kline, Rosie Perez, Armand Assante, Edward James Olmos, Jim Cummings, Frank Welker, Tobin Bell', 'PG', 'Stowing away after a failed con, a pair of swindlers end up on El Dorado, the fabled "city of gold", where they quickly get in over their heads when they are mistaken as gods by the inhabitants.', 'Stowing away after a failed con, a pair of swindlers end up on El Dorado, the fabled "city of gold", where they quickly get in over their heads when they are mistaken as gods by the inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQuqhUBACMcGqCvliHxpJreBfXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10501'),
  ('499190195574726154', 'The Road to Fort Alamo', 1964, 'Western', 'Mario Bava, Mario Bava, Ubaldo Terzano', 'Livia Contardi', 'Ken Clark, Jany Clair, Michel Lemoine, Adreina Paul, Alberto Cevenini, Antonio Gradoli, Gustavo De Nardo, Gérard Herter', null, 'A lone rider comes across a dying soldier, the victim of an Indian attack, who gives him a paper authorizing the payment of $150,000 to the U.S. Army. The rider gathers some colleagues who disguise themselves as soldiers and who take the paper to a bank. They get the money but a shoot-out occurs, an old woman is killed, and the gang acrimoniously splits up. Later some members of the gang meet up with some real U.S. Cavalry soldiers and together they must fight off new Indian attacks.', 'A lone rider comes across a dying soldier, the victim of an Indian attack, who gives him a paper authorizing the payment of $150,000 to the U.S. Army. The rider gathers some colleagues who disguise themselves as soldiers and who take the paper to a bank. They get the money but a shoot-out occurs, an old woman is killed, and the gang acrimoniously splits up. Later some members of the gang meet up with some real U.S. Cavalry soldiers and together they must fight off new Indian attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p03XwK0NN4f5vVfZDpWMz8rXXsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117567'),
  ('473217076563168408', 'The Road to Guantanamo', 2006, 'Drama', 'Mat Whitecross, Michael Winterbottom, Marcel Zyskind', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Riz Ahmed, Farhad Harun, Waqar Siddiqui, Afran Usman, Shahid Iqbal, Sher Khan, Jason Salkey', 'R', 'Part drama, part documentary, The Road to Guantánamo focuses on the Tipton Three, a trio of British Muslims who were held in Guantanamo Bay for two years until they were released without charge.', 'Part drama, part documentary, The Road to Guantánamo focuses on the Tipton Three, a trio of British Muslims who were held in Guantanamo Bay for two years until they were released without charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deM5htQLvRjcRkeIFtaOdd5TDrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7872'),
  ('1030609429036337549', 'The Road to Hong Kong', 1962, 'Comedy, Adventure, Music, Science Fiction', 'Norman Panama, Bluey Hill, Jack Hildyard', 'Melvin Frank, Norman Panama', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Joan Collins, Robert Morley, Walter Gotell, Felix Aylmer, Dorothy Lamour, Roger Delgado', 'NR', 'When Chester accidentally memorises and destroys the only copy of a secret Russian formula for a new and improved rocket fuel, he and Harry are thrust into international intrigue, trying to stay alive while keeping the formula out of enemy hands.', 'When Chester accidentally memorises and destroys the only copy of a secret Russian formula for a new and improved rocket fuel, he and Harry are thrust into international intrigue, trying to stay alive while keeping the formula out of enemy hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HWu1UwUbXls12RgyLh4EvrHT6u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31804'),
  ('791575969948973371', 'The Road to Love', 2001, 'Drama', 'Rémi Lange', 'Antoine Parlebas, Rémi Lange', 'Karim Tarek, Riyad Echahi, Sihem Benamoune, Zakariya Gouram, Abdellah Taïa, Mustapha Khaddar, Farid Tali, Mehdi Jouhar', 'NR', 'This romantic-kitsch story goes from Paris to Marseille, from Amsterdam to Morocco via Jean Genet''s grave in Larache, and on to Tangiers. The movie tells the story of an Algerian-French heterosexual young man beginning a sociology study of gay islamic homosexualities and discovering gay love with a young French steward.', 'This romantic-kitsch story goes from Paris to Marseille, from Amsterdam to Morocco via Jean Genet''s grave in Larache, and on to Tangiers. The movie tells the story of an Algerian-French heterosexual young man beginning a sociology study of gay islamic homosexualities and discovering gay love with a young French steward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIrJdCNz2FbEw4UO5Sees7d7Xox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107039'),
  ('848907803069180252', 'The Road to Ruin', 1934, 'Drama', 'Dorothy Davenport, Melville Shyer, George Curtner', 'Dorothy Davenport, Willis Kent', 'Helen Foster, Nell O''Day, Glen Boles, Robert Quirk, Paul Page, Richard Hemingway, Virginia True Boardman, Richard Tucker', null, 'A young girl gets involved with a crowd that smokes marijuana, drinks and has sex. She winds up an alcoholic, pregnant drug addict and is forced to get an abortion.', 'A young girl gets involved with a crowd that smokes marijuana, drinks and has sex. She winds up an alcoholic, pregnant drug addict and is forced to get an abortion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1QH4DoUNqbrrz4vOJn7Idvt5Ua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95943'),
  ('869783249142130921', 'The Road to Sampo', 1975, 'Drama', 'Lee Man-hee, Kim Deok-jin, Son Yeong-cheol', 'Yoo Dong-hun', 'Baek Il-seob, Kim Jin-kyu, Moon Sook, Kim Yong-hak, Kim Ki-beom, Sok In-soo, Sung Moung-sun, Jang In-han', null, 'Passing through a jail and a construction site, a young laborer meets a middle-aged man returning to Sampo after ten years'' absence. Together, they track down a young woman who ran away from the restaurant she was waitressing at, but instead of turning her in for a reward, the trio decide to go on an adventure together.', 'Passing through a jail and a construction site, a young laborer meets a middle-aged man returning to Sampo after ten years'' absence. Together, they track down a young woman who ran away from the restaurant she was waitressing at, but instead of turning her in for a reward, the trio decide to go on an adventure together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDQGp69PmClJYb6aAlJ8O89nAe0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271781'),
  ('560270265153227444', 'The Road to San Diego', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Sorin', 'Carlos Sorin', 'Ignacio Benitez, Carlos Wagner La Bella, Paola Rotela, Silvina Fontelles, Miguel González Colman, José Armónico, Toti Rivas, Marisa Córdoba', null, 'A young Argentine learns that soccer star Diego Maradona is ailing in a Buenos Aires hospital, and resolves to bring him a tree root he''s discovered.', 'A young Argentine learns that soccer star Diego Maradona is ailing in a Buenos Aires hospital, and resolves to bring him a tree root he''s discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puD96NJtvFmaYFpwBdXPhqSFCgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64209'),
  ('38140978428267807', 'The Road to Shame', 1959, 'Thriller', 'Édouard Molinaro, Robert Juillard', 'Albert Simonin, Gilles Morris-Dumoulin', 'Robert Hossein, Magali Noël, Estella Blain, Philippe Clay, Jane Marken, Robert Lombard, François Darbon, Pierre Collet', null, 'Pierre Rossi and Béatrice live in the same block of flats in Marseille and love each other. One night, Béatrice leaves her apartment. Pierre knows that his fiancée goes to a rendezvous, but she would not tell him more than just that. Worried, Pierre follows her but he is attacked and stolen his identity papers by two men, Tom and Nasol, on the payroll of Quaglio, one of the city''s bosses. Later on, Quaglio kills Nasol and deposits the body in a garage, leaving Pierre''s papers nearby. As for Pierre, he manages to follow Tom to a villa where several young women have been invited. Pierre, horrified, realizes that this place is the headquarters for the white slave trade. - Written by Guy Bellinger', 'Pierre Rossi and Béatrice live in the same block of flats in Marseille and love each other. One night, Béatrice leaves her apartment. Pierre knows that his fiancée goes to a rendezvous, but she would not tell him more than just that. Worried, Pierre follows her but he is attacked and stolen his identity papers by two men, Tom and Nasol, on the payroll of Quaglio, one of the city''s bosses. Later on, Quaglio kills Nasol and deposits the body in a garage, leaving Pierre''s papers nearby. As for Pierre, he manages to follow Tom to a villa where several young women have been invited. Pierre, horrified, realizes that this place is the headquarters for the white slave trade. - Written by Guy Bellinger', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEGUOhmp6vz994T8yRgbOqCi4Tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271711'),
  ('490455334472730270', 'The Road to Singapore', 1931, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alfred E. Green, Robert Kurrle', 'J. Grubb Alexander', 'William Powell, Doris Kenyon, Marian Marsh, Louis Calhern, Alison Skipworth, Lumsden Hare, Tyrell Davis, A.E. Anson', 'NR', 'A woman''s life falls to pieces when she''s caught cheating on her husband.', 'A woman''s life falls to pieces when she''s caught cheating on her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AqrnTfyUDpyAY62m10OX7wmaDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222459'),
