  ('822076526638088675', 'The Road to Wellville', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Alan Parker, Peter Biziou, Trey Batchelor', 'Alan Parker', 'Anthony Hopkins, Bridget Fonda, Matthew Broderick, John Cusack, Dana Carvey, Michael Lerner, Colm Meaney, John Neville', 'R', 'An unhappy young couple visit the infamous Kellogg spa in Battle Creek, Michigan while a young hustler tries get into the breakfast-cereal business and compete against John Kellogg''s corn flakes.', 'An unhappy young couple visit the infamous Kellogg spa in Battle Creek, Michigan while a young hustler tries get into the breakfast-cereal business and compete against John Kellogg''s corn flakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh7OVdFMpqpZ027z9RgVIwzxYjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10467'),
  ('812596423207783941', 'The Road Within', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gren Wells, Christopher Baffa', 'Gren Wells', 'Robert Sheehan, Dev Patel, Zoë Kravitz, Robert Patrick, Kyra Sedgwick, Ali Hillis, Jim Calvert, Louisa Kendrick', 'R', 'A young man with Tourette''s Syndrome embarks on a road trip with his recently-deceased mother''s ashes.', 'A young man with Tourette''s Syndrome embarks on a road trip with his recently-deceased mother''s ashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lkp87orcl6IjrdJJTJPnY2gEoc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228108'),
  ('508873623081644791', 'The Roads Not Taken', 2020, 'Drama', 'Sally Potter, Robbie Ryan, Adam Lock', 'Sally Potter', 'Javier Bardem, Elle Fanning, Salma Hayek Pinault, Laura Linney, Branka Katić, Dimitri Andreas, Katia Mullova-Brind, Milena Tscharntke', 'R', 'The film follows 24 hours in the life of father and daughter Leo and Molly, as they weave their way around New York City, until their ordinary but stressful day takes on a hallucinatory and epic quality.', 'The film follows 24 hours in the life of father and daughter Leo and Molly, as they weave their way around New York City, until their ordinary but stressful day takes on a hallucinatory and epic quality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GtX3NDh8S8ImqtTp4Ww02SXh4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567714'),
  ('816466865206490430', 'The Roaring Game', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Sport', 'Tom DeNucci, Marcus Friedlander, Alexis Taylor', 'Tom DeNucci', 'Darin Brooks, Mickey Rourke, Justin Chatwin, Rob Gronkowski, Eddie Kaye Thomas', 'Not Rated', 'A janitor brings together a misfit team to compete and win back his girlfriend, who has been selected to play hockey for the U.S. team at the World Games. He intends to use his janitor skills to win the gold medal in the sports of curling.', 'A janitor brings together a misfit team to compete and win back his girlfriend, who has been selected to play hockey for the U.S. team at the World Games. He intends to use his janitor skills to win the gold medal in the sports of curling.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F62e6f70a1aacd77f49f9c9205683f2bf.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-roaring-game-2026'),
  ('965574063946410877', 'The Roaring Twenties', 1939, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Raoul Walsh, Ernest Haller', 'Jerry Wald, Richard Macaulay, Robert Rossen', 'James Cagney, Priscilla Lane, Humphrey Bogart, Gladys George, Jeffrey Lynn, Frank McHugh, Paul Kelly, Elisabeth Risdon', null, 'After World War I, Armistice Lloyd Hart goes back to practice law, former saloon keeper George Hally turns to bootlegging, and out-of-work Eddie Bartlett becomes a cab driver. Eddie builds a fleet of cabs through delivery of bootleg liquor and hires Lloyd as his lawyer. George becomes Eddie''s partner and the rackets flourish until love and rivalry interfere.', 'After World War I, Armistice Lloyd Hart goes back to practice law, former saloon keeper George Hally turns to bootlegging, and out-of-work Eddie Bartlett becomes a cab driver. Eddie builds a fleet of cabs through delivery of bootleg liquor and hires Lloyd as his lawyer. George becomes Eddie''s partner and the rackets flourish until love and rivalry interfere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkymdElqwJBm2bl3F6hJp4xJggD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37698'),
  ('758368584422109272', 'The Roast of Tom Brady', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Beth McCarthy-Miller', 'Mike Gibbons', 'Tom Brady, Kevin Hart, Jeff Ross, Nikki Glaser, Bert Kreischer, Tom Segura, Andrew Schulz, Tony Hinchcliffe', 'R', 'Offensive lines. Full-contact comedy. Kevin Hart hosts this all-star roast of NFL legend Tom Brady.', 'Offensive lines. Full-contact comedy. Kevin Hart hosts this all-star roast of NFL legend Tom Brady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guph6RgrrQSDQpDckGaIHLS5wzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278360'),
  ('310467543955443300', 'The Robber', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Benjamin Heisenberg, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Benjamin Heisenberg, Martin Prinz', 'Andreas Lust, Michael Welz, Franziska Weisz, Florian Wotruba, Johann Bednar, Markus Schleinzer, Peter Vilnai, Max Edelbacher', null, 'A champion marathoner leads a double life as a serial bank robber, sprinting between fixes (and away from police cavalcades) as many as three times a day.', 'A champion marathoner leads a double life as a serial bank robber, sprinting between fixes (and away from police cavalcades) as many as three times a day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxJ579nYUXzy9WeI13hIPld8tDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54524'),
  ('1068219887278384674', 'The Robber Hotzenplotz', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gernot Roll', 'Claus Peter Hant', 'Armin Rohde, Piet Klocke, Martin Stührk, Manuel Steitz, Rufus Beck, Katharina Thalbach, Christiane Hörbiger, Barbara Schöneberger', null, 'Somewhere in the Bavarian province the robber Hotzenplotz is up to mischief. One day he robs Kasperl''s grandmother''s coffee grinder. Since the goofy sergeant Dimpfelmoser sees little hope of finding the robber, Kasperl and his best friend Seppel decide to track down the robber themselves. With a ruse, they manage to find the robber''s cave, but are then caught by Hotzenplotz, who sells Kasperl to the magician Zwackelmann.', 'Somewhere in the Bavarian province the robber Hotzenplotz is up to mischief. One day he robs Kasperl''s grandmother''s coffee grinder. Since the goofy sergeant Dimpfelmoser sees little hope of finding the robber, Kasperl and his best friend Seppel decide to track down the robber themselves. With a ruse, they manage to find the robber''s cave, but are then caught by Hotzenplotz, who sells Kasperl to the magician Zwackelmann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjtTYaNDJi2YNaW9EWAHicxmBQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39404'),
  ('818261818635054305', 'The Robber Hotzenplotz', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Michael Krummenacher, Marc Achenbach, Nils Engler', 'Matthias Pacht', 'Nicholas Ofczarek, Hans Marquardt, Benedikt Jenke, Hedi Kriegeskotte, Olli Dittrich, August Diehl, Christiane Paul, Luna Wedler', null, 'When the infamous Robber Hotzenplotz leaves his hideout in the forest to steal a beloved musical coffee grinder belonging to Kasperl’s grandmother, the town’s clumsy police sergeant proves to be of little help with arresting him. The young Kasperl and his friend Seppel decide that they will track down the thief themselves, but stopping him will not be easy – especially when Hotzenplotz involves the wicked magician Petrosilius who lives in a terrifying castle where he will imprison our heroes. Joined by a fairy-turned-toad, Kasperl and Seppel must escape the castle, catch the two vicious crooks, and bring the coffee grinder back to Kasperl’s beloved grandmother!', 'When the infamous Robber Hotzenplotz leaves his hideout in the forest to steal a beloved musical coffee grinder belonging to Kasperl’s grandmother, the town’s clumsy police sergeant proves to be of little help with arresting him. The young Kasperl and his friend Seppel decide that they will track down the thief themselves, but stopping him will not be easy – especially when Hotzenplotz involves the wicked magician Petrosilius who lives in a terrifying castle where he will imprison our heroes. Joined by a fairy-turned-toad, Kasperl and Seppel must escape the castle, catch the two vicious crooks, and bring the coffee grinder back to Kasperl’s beloved grandmother!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyFSYQnIQihxWZthKusLc3AP2nh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982124'),
  ('382299058927582085', 'The Robber Kitten', 1935, 'Animation', 'David Hand', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Shirley Reed', 'NR', 'A kitten runs off to be a robber with a dog.', 'A kitten runs off to be a robber with a dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ujb3np6gErCGHM5BiHC7lzXCVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109314'),
  ('757972554748492347', 'The Robbers', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Yang Shupeng', 'Yang Shupeng', 'Hu Jun, Jiang Wu, Lee Li-Chun, Xiao Wang, Yu Xiaolei, Lü Zhong, Yang Shupeng', null, 'Set during the Tang Dynasty, The Robbers tells the story of two robbers'' adventures in a seemingly peaceful Bitter Bamboo Village, where they encounter a beautiful woman, a group of soldiers and a village head scheming to kill the duo.', 'Set during the Tang Dynasty, The Robbers tells the story of two robbers'' adventures in a seemingly peaceful Bitter Bamboo Village, where they encounter a beautiful woman, a group of soldiers and a village head scheming to kill the duo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMj1vmGYQViOEkEfrdqV7QrkSwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37849'),
  ('416304570428193001', 'The Robe', 1953, 'Drama, History', 'Henry Koster, Leon Shamroy', 'Albert Maltz, Philip Dunne', 'Richard Burton, Jean Simmons, Victor Mature, Richard Boone, Leon Askin, Michael Rennie, Dean Jagger, Jay Robinson', 'NR', 'Drunk and disillusioned Roman, Marcellus Gallio, wins Jesus'' robe in a dice game after the crucifixion. Marcellus has never been a man of faith like his slave, Demetrius, but when Demetrius escapes with the robe, Marcellus experiences disturbing visions and feels guilty for his actions. Convinced that destroying the robe will cure him, Marcellus sets out to find Demetrius — and discovers his Christian faith along the way.', 'Drunk and disillusioned Roman, Marcellus Gallio, wins Jesus'' robe in a dice game after the crucifixion. Marcellus has never been a man of faith like his slave, Demetrius, but when Demetrius escapes with the robe, Marcellus experiences disturbing visions and feels guilty for his actions. Convinced that destroying the robe will cure him, Marcellus sets out to find Demetrius — and discovers his Christian faith along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFYZNGzftIM8dqGMJBToGraAFJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29912'),
  ('749348065579459236', 'The Robot vs. The Aztec Mummy', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Rafael Portillo, Enrique Wallace', null, 'Ramón Gay, Rosita Arenas, Crox Alvarado, Luis Aceves Castañeda, Jorge Mondragón, Arturo Martínez, Emma Roldán, Julián de Meriche', 'NR', 'A mad doctor builds a robot in order to steal a valuable Aztec treasure from a tomb guarded by a centuries old living mummy.', 'A mad doctor builds a robot in order to steal a valuable Aztec treasure from a tomb guarded by a centuries old living mummy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5NR8SLZQ9bcSXig9z72YLAqtzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31243'),
  ('305072004326358500', 'The Rock', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Michael Bay, John Schwartzman', 'Douglas S. Cook, David Weisberg, Mark Rosner', 'Sean Connery, Nicolas Cage, Ed Harris, John Spencer, David Morse, William Forsythe, Michael Biehn, Vanessa Marcil', 'R', 'When vengeful General Francis X. Hummel seizes control of Alcatraz Island and threatens to launch missiles loaded with deadly chemical weapons into San Francisco, only a young FBI chemical weapons expert and notorious Federal prisoner have the skills to penetrate the impregnable island fortress and take him down.', 'When vengeful General Francis X. Hummel seizes control of Alcatraz Island and threatens to launch missiles loaded with deadly chemical weapons into San Francisco, only a young FBI chemical weapons expert and notorious Federal prisoner have the skills to penetrate the impregnable island fortress and take him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBcoxveWzzXQrCrwWMGAROcqgpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9802'),
  ('556055379658977054', 'The Rocker', 2008, 'Comedy, Music', 'Peter Cattaneo, Anthony B. Richmond, Branko Racki', 'Wallace Wolodarsky, Maya Forbes', 'Rainn Wilson, Teddy Geiger, Josh Gad, Emma Stone, Christina Applegate, Jeff Garlin, Jane Lynch, Jason Sudeikis', 'PG-13', 'In the 1980s, a drummer is abandoned by his band just before they become rock superstars. Twenty years later, the drummer sees his second chance at stardom arise when he is asked to perform with his teenage nephew''s high school rock band.', 'In the 1980s, a drummer is abandoned by his band just before they become rock superstars. Twenty years later, the drummer sees his second chance at stardom arise when he is asked to perform with his teenage nephew''s high school rock band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzgFC7jOEMtf9D6CSdI7ckUMtwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10186'),
  ('811704571427617070', 'The Rocket', 2005, 'Drama', 'Charles Binamé, Pierre Gill, Marc Larose', 'Ken Scott', 'Roy Dupuis, Julie Le Breton, Stephen McHattie, Michel Barrette, Rémy Girard, Tony Calabretta, Philip Craig, Paul Doucet', null, 'The story of Quebec''s most beloved hockey player, Maurice "The Rocket" Richard, focusing on the struggles of a French Canadian in the National Hockey League dominated by Anglophones.', 'The story of Quebec''s most beloved hockey player, Maurice "The Rocket" Richard, focusing on the struggles of a French Canadian in the National Hockey League dominated by Anglophones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uH55rXL4ad8TEm0vtlsFtXhZwKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49081'),
  ('611841144989706631', 'The Rocket from Calabuch', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Francisco Sempere', 'Luis García Berlanga, Ennio Flaiano, Florentino Soria', 'Edmund Gwenn, Valentina Cortese, Juan Calvo, Franco Fabrizi, Félix Fernández, José Isbert, José Luis Ozores, Nicolás D. Perchicot', null, 'Professor Hamilton, a naive Nuclear scientist who once thought bombs were good for humanity, realizes his mistake and runs away from his inventions. He hides in Calabuch, a beautiful seaside town where people still believe in humor and friendship.', 'Professor Hamilton, a naive Nuclear scientist who once thought bombs were good for humanity, realizes his mistake and runs away from his inventions. He hides in Calabuch, a beautiful seaside town where people still believe in humor and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejmJiM64jy6bRnyBLSJnETvPtCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107612'),
  ('285972270190614279', 'The Rocketeer', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Family', 'Joe Johnston, Hiro Narita, Edward T. McAvoy', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', 'Billy Campbell, Jennifer Connelly, Alan Arkin, Timothy Dalton, Paul Sorvino, Terry O''Quinn, Ed Lauter, Jon Polito', 'PG', 'A stunt pilot comes across a prototype jetpack that gives him the ability to fly. However, evil forces of the world also want this jetpack at any cost.', 'A stunt pilot comes across a prototype jetpack that gives him the ability to fly. However, evil forces of the world also want this jetpack at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tDFRESFwKww1LHRE8W1Exj9edH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10249'),
  ('500872504831049253', 'The Rocking Horse Winner', 1949, 'Drama', 'Anthony Pelissier, Desmond Dickinson', 'Anthony Pelissier', 'Valerie Hobson, John Howard Davies, Ronald Squire, John Mills, Hugh Sinclair, Charles Goldner, Susan Richards, Cyril Smith', 'NR', 'A strange and tragic tale of a young boy who is able to predict race winners at the horse track by riding his own rocking horse to aid his parents out of their endless round of debts.', 'A strange and tragic tale of a young boy who is able to predict race winners at the horse track by riding his own rocking horse to aid his parents out of their endless round of debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orGyd5eUmjGwvjggTgmKK2bi9NR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43438'),
  ('1015727696110858347', 'The Rocky Horror Picture Show', 1975, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Jim Sharman, Peter Suschitzky, Mike Gowans', 'Jim Sharman, Richard O''Brien', 'Tim Curry, Susan Sarandon, Barry Bostwick, Richard O''Brien, Patricia Quinn, Nell Campbell, Jonathan Adams, Peter Hinwood', 'R', 'After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr. Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.', 'After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr. Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pyE6ZqDbuJi7zrNzzQzcKTWdmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36685'),
  ('347662872020455120', 'The Rocky Horror Picture Show: Let''s Do the Time Warp Again', 2016, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Luc Montpellier, Kenny Ortega, Rico Gerussi', 'Richard O''Brien, Jim Sharman, Richard O''Brien', 'Laverne Cox, Victoria Justice, Ryan McCartan, Annaleigh Ashford, Adam Lambert, Reeve Carney, Christina Milian, Staz Nair', null, 'After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr. Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.', 'After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr. Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56KEpnJWe5KvpiPu5XmK14L7Wyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377448'),
  ('1046460346373408683', 'The Rodriguez and the Beyond', 2019, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Carles Gusi, Paco Arango', 'Paco Arango', 'Edu Soto, Mariana Treviño, Rodrigo Simón, Sara Jiménez, María Blanco, Geraldine Chaplin, Omar Chaparro, Lucas Laso', 'G', 'When a young boy finds a message from his late grandfather, his ordinary family discovers an extraordinary secret about themselves — and the universe.', 'When a young boy finds a message from his late grandfather, his ordinary family discovers an extraordinary secret about themselves — and the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZ2GteDrYUHrDk81PnlxjZGAsi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636041'),
  ('129142670132563799', 'The Roe''s Room', 1997, 'Music, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lech Majewski', 'Lech Majewski', 'Rafał Olbrychski, Elzbieta Mazur, Mieczyslaw Czepulonis, Agnieszka Wróblewska', null, 'Bound to a suffocating existence, a young man embarks on a marvelous journey of the imagination, transforming ordinary details of his room into fantastic images of natural beauty, where the cycles of life mysteriously play themselves out.', 'Bound to a suffocating existence, a young man embarks on a marvelous journey of the imagination, transforming ordinary details of his room into fantastic images of natural beauty, where the cycles of life mysteriously play themselves out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geWnMgmken7U7seKME3yo6Mrz4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180695'),
  ('103471153546954931', 'The Rogue''s Trial', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Flávia Lacerda, Guel Arraes, Gustavo Hadba', 'Jorge Furtado, Adriana Falcão', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Selton Mello, Taís Araújo, Humberto Martins, Luis Miranda, Eduardo Sterblitch, Fabiula Nascimento, Virginia Cavendish', null, 'After 20 years missing, João Grilo returns to Taperoá to join his old friend Chicó and, after his story of resurrection spreads, he is disputed as an electoral candidate by the two most powerful politicians in the city.', 'After 20 years missing, João Grilo returns to Taperoá to join his old friend Chicó and, after his story of resurrection spreads, he is disputed as an electoral candidate by the two most powerful politicians in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRuYcFAq2kUha5ceFe42HR14335.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1099413'),
  ('773812848377302348', 'The Role', 1977, 'Drama, Music', 'Manohar B. Ghanekar, Prahlad Kakar, Dayal Nihalani', 'Hansa Wadkar', 'Smita Patil, Anant Nag, Naseeruddin Shah, Amrish Puri, Amol Palekar, Sulabha Deshpande, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Baby Rukshana', null, 'The film follows the life of a successful film star, revealing her increasing alienation in a role both glamorized and patronized by society. After being forced into show business by her family, she spends her time between studios and disastrous love affairs, and feels more and more dissatisfied.', 'The film follows the life of a successful film star, revealing her increasing alienation in a role both glamorized and patronized by society. After being forced into show business by her family, she spends her time between studios and disastrous love affairs, and feels more and more dissatisfied.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUd2o6UmfdtHjaIn50679hHf79l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78819'),
  ('759145274713691852', 'The Role of Her Life', 2004, 'Comedy', 'François Favrat, Pascal Marti, Marc Tévanian', 'François Favrat, Jérôme Beaujour, Roger Bohbot', 'Agnès Jaoui, Karin Viard, Jonathan Zaccaï, Marcial Di Fonzo Bo, Claude Crétient, Annie Mercier, Laurent Lafitte, Denis Sebbah', null, 'A humble copy editor becomes a personal assistant to her favorite actress and eventually loses herself both in the actress'' demands and her own ego.', 'A humble copy editor becomes a personal assistant to her favorite actress and eventually loses herself both in the actress'' demands and her own ego.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGkKVcNOzO6ODyKgPUz6cZwSCDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59054'),
  ('1077487511401478115', 'The Roll-Call', 1971, 'Animation', 'Ryszard Czekała', 'Ryszard Czekała', null, null, 'A penal gymnastics session is underway during a roll call in a concentration camp. A brutal voice shouts furious commands: "nieder - auf!" (down – up!). One of the prisoners will not obey the commands, another one will almost survive', 'A penal gymnastics session is underway during a roll call in a concentration camp. A brutal voice shouts furious commands: "nieder - auf!" (down – up!). One of the prisoners will not obey the commands, another one will almost survive', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTQiuczOUkRDE3m5vBdBmznWFra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175916'),
  ('11696940651793583', 'The Roller Blade Seven', 1991, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Donald G. Jackson, Donald G. Jackson', 'Scott Shaw, Donald G. Jackson', 'Scott Shaw, Frank Stallone Jr., Karen Black, Don Stroud, William Smith, Joe Estevez, Rhonda Shear, Mark Richardson', 'R', 'In a futuristic society, a sword-wielding roller skater fights evil ninjas, punk roller skaters and is sent on an important rescue mission.', 'In a futuristic society, a sword-wielding roller skater fights evil ninjas, punk roller skaters and is sent on an important rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onSF0EGET7W5t2CPgkR5PA5j2wb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88090'),
  ('583675727297285984', 'The Rolling Bed', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Georges Bazot', null, 'An impecunious chap is unable to pay his rent, whereupon he is ejected, but all his furniture is retained and he is allowed to remove only his rolling bed. Pulling this a few blocks, he is exhausted and lies down on the bed to rest. He is soon the center of attraction, and the crowd continues to gather, when the police order him away, and as he refuses to move he is started off by the officers, who guide him for a time, but are forcibly deterred by indignant citizens from further interference. The impecunious man and his bed, which gains momentum as it runs down the inclines, cause much excitement en route, and finally arrive at the business center, where it comes to a stop alongside the walk. Our friend has purloined a fur coat and an auto horn on his tour, and now presents a modern chauffeur. (Gaumont catalogue)', 'An impecunious chap is unable to pay his rent, whereupon he is ejected, but all his furniture is retained and he is allowed to remove only his rolling bed. Pulling this a few blocks, he is exhausted and lies down on the bed to rest. He is soon the center of attraction, and the crowd continues to gather, when the police order him away, and as he refuses to move he is started off by the officers, who guide him for a time, but are forcibly deterred by indignant citizens from further interference. The impecunious man and his bed, which gains momentum as it runs down the inclines, cause much excitement en route, and finally arrive at the business center, where it comes to a stop alongside the walk. Our friend has purloined a fur coat and an auto horn on his tour, and now presents a modern chauffeur. (Gaumont catalogue)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPloeQaVo0kpboBDpO5drnhsoki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120038'),
  ('467730431387965014', 'The Rolling Stones Rock and Roll Circus', 1996, 'Music', 'Michael Lindsay-Hogg, Anthony B. Richmond', null, 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Brian Jones, Charlie Watts, Bill Wyman, Ian Anderson, Glenn Cornick, Tony Iommi', null, 'A 1968 event put together by The Rolling Stones. The film is comprised of two concerts on a circus stage and included such acts as The Who, Taj Mahal, Marianne Faithfull, and Jethro Tull. John Lennon and his fiancee Yoko Ono performed as part of a supergroup called The Dirty Mac, along with Eric Clapton, Mitch Mitchell, and Keith Richards.', 'A 1968 event put together by The Rolling Stones. The film is comprised of two concerts on a circus stage and included such acts as The Who, Taj Mahal, Marianne Faithfull, and Jethro Tull. John Lennon and his fiancee Yoko Ono performed as part of a supergroup called The Dirty Mac, along with Eric Clapton, Mitch Mitchell, and Keith Richards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vm06pTpw2yfjaMV1j2weXkTJYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18944'),
  ('661497817118286185', 'The Rolling Stones: Live at the Max', 1991, 'Music', 'Noel Archambault, David Douglas, Julien Temple', null, 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Charlie Watts, Ronnie Wood, Bill Wyman', null, 'A filming of the 1990 Rolling Stones "Steel Wheels" concert that traveled Europe. This was filmed in the IMAX process, which allows the film to be projected in a size ten times the size of a regular 35mm projected image.', 'A filming of the 1990 Rolling Stones "Steel Wheels" concert that traveled Europe. This was filmed in the IMAX process, which allows the film to be projected in a size ten times the size of a regular 35mm projected image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhYVylMSytAHqGASdCAb0vxPtro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50667'),
  ('379478968151096879', 'The Roman Orgy', 1911, 'History, Drama', 'Louis Feuillade', null, 'Jean Aymé, Louise Lagrange, Luitz-Morat, Léonce Perret', null, 'The tyrant Emperor Heliogabalus lives a life of debauchery and set lions loose among his guests.', 'The tyrant Emperor Heliogabalus lives a life of debauchery and set lions loose among his guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euAQqaJg8IdoTYFOtt5qb6mVuvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113664'),
  ('1056926808289086286', 'The Roman Spring of Mrs. Stone', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harry Waxman, José Quintero', 'Gavin Lambert', 'Vivien Leigh, Warren Beatty, Lotte Lenya, Coral Browne, Jill St. John, Ernest Thesiger, Jeremy Spenser, Stella Bonheur', 'NR', 'Critics and the public say Karen Stone is too old -- as she approaches 50 -- for her role in a play she is about to take to Broadway. Her businessman husband, 20 years her senior, has been the angel for the play and gives her a way out: They are off to a holiday in Rome for his health. He suffers a fatal heart attack on the plane. Mrs. Stone stays in Rome. She leases a magnificent apartment with a view of the seven hills from the terrace. Then the contessa comes calling to introduce a young man named Paolo to her. The contessa knows many presentable young men and lonely American widows.', 'Critics and the public say Karen Stone is too old -- as she approaches 50 -- for her role in a play she is about to take to Broadway. Her businessman husband, 20 years her senior, has been the angel for the play and gives her a way out: They are off to a holiday in Rome for his health. He suffers a fatal heart attack on the plane. Mrs. Stone stays in Rome. She leases a magnificent apartment with a view of the seven hills from the terrace. Then the contessa comes calling to introduce a young man named Paolo to her. The contessa knows many presentable young men and lonely American widows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frw7Z2CMR8S0VaciAo335YKNtUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36731'),
  ('384013422369697749', 'The Roman Spring of Mrs. Stone', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Robert Allan Ackerman, Sandra Corbally, Edoardo Ferretti', 'Martin Sherman', 'Helen Mirren, Olivier Martinez, Anne Bancroft, Brian Dennehy, Rodrigo Santoro, Roger Allam, Victor Alfieri, Suzanne Bertish', null, 'An aging actress'' husband dies of a heart attack en route to Rome, where they''d planned to holiday. There, she rents an apartment and, through the Contessa, she meets a young man, with whom she begins an affair.', 'An aging actress'' husband dies of a heart attack en route to Rome, where they''d planned to holiday. There, she rents an apartment and, through the Contessa, she meets a young man, with whom she begins an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ty6DKxqNJjgWA4xb1C1ZtySoQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158928'),
  ('319587299468030717', 'The Romance of Aniceto and Francisca', 1967, 'Romance, Drama', 'Leonardo Favio', 'Leonardo Favio, Carlos Flores, Jorge Zuhair Jury', 'Federico Luppi, Elsa Daniel, María Vaner, Edgardo Suárez, Cacho Mendoza, Ernesto Cutrera, Walter Sanchez, Joly Bergali', null, 'Aniceto is used to being lonely. When Francisca offers him her love, his personal limitations and little miseries arise.', 'Aniceto is used to being lonely. When Francisca offers him her love, his personal limitations and little miseries arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbch7Aq4M4F777mGcsO7dQ1RamM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214487'),
  ('465754761189422385', 'The Romance of Astrea and Celadon', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Éric Rohmer, Diane Baratier', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Andy Gillet, Stéphanie Crayencour, Cécile Cassel, Véronique Reymond, Rosette, Jocelyn Quivrin, Mathilde Mosnier, Rodolphe Pauly', null, 'In an enchanted forest, back in the time of the Druids, the shepherd Céladon and the shepherdess Astrée share a pure and chaste love. Fooled by a suitor, Astrée dismisses Céladon, who throws himself into a river out of despair. She thinks he''s dead, but he''s been secretly rescued by some nymphs. Faithful to the promise he made to Astrée to never appear before her again, Céladon must overcome many obstacles to break the curse. Mad with love and despair, coveted by the nymphs, surrounded by rivals, and obliged to disguise himself as a woman to be near the one he loves, will he manage to make himself known without breaking his oath? A romance filled with doubt, hazards, and delicious temptations.', 'In an enchanted forest, back in the time of the Druids, the shepherd Céladon and the shepherdess Astrée share a pure and chaste love. Fooled by a suitor, Astrée dismisses Céladon, who throws himself into a river out of despair. She thinks he''s dead, but he''s been secretly rescued by some nymphs. Faithful to the promise he made to Astrée to never appear before her again, Céladon must overcome many obstacles to break the curse. Mad with love and despair, coveted by the nymphs, surrounded by rivals, and obliged to disguise himself as a woman to be near the one he loves, will he manage to make himself known without breaking his oath? A romance filled with doubt, hazards, and delicious temptations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kXhylg76Hxx4gUtdPN0RHvnjIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45458'),
  ('963015373906734941', 'The Romancing Star', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Wong Jing, David Choi Wa-Sing', 'Wong Jing', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Maggie Cheung, Sharla Cheung, Wong Jing, Stuart Yung Sai-Kit', null, 'Ah Fat, foul-mouthed, along with his two close buddies, Traffic Light and Ugly, are working in a garage. Their boss, Ken, is harsh and stingy. However, a warm and close friendship has been established amongh the four. In order for Ah Fat to get over his heartbreak at getting dumped by his girlfriend, Ken suggests a tour to Penang to cheer him up. They come across two beautiful girls, Tung Tung and Man Chi, strolling leisurely on the beach as if they were very wealthy. Since then they decide who''s whose. And Ah Fat, the winner, chooses Tung Tung to be his sole target. By the rules of the game, Ken, Traffic Light and Ugly have to compete to see who in the end will win the heart of Man Chi.', 'Ah Fat, foul-mouthed, along with his two close buddies, Traffic Light and Ugly, are working in a garage. Their boss, Ken, is harsh and stingy. However, a warm and close friendship has been established amongh the four. In order for Ah Fat to get over his heartbreak at getting dumped by his girlfriend, Ken suggests a tour to Penang to cheer him up. They come across two beautiful girls, Tung Tung and Man Chi, strolling leisurely on the beach as if they were very wealthy. Since then they decide who''s whose. And Ah Fat, the winner, chooses Tung Tung to be his sole target. By the rules of the game, Ken, Traffic Light and Ugly have to compete to see who in the end will win the heart of Man Chi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gUdY8J8bNGTSIE5tW9aVhAFgjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147950'),
  ('1055770544604960640', 'The Romancing Star II', 1988, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, David Choi Wa-Sing', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Carina Lau, Elizabeth Lee Mei-Fung, Wong Jing, Yan Ning', null, 'Chow Yun Fat leaves his buddies Eric Tsang, Stanley Fung, and Nat Chan Bak Cheung to their own devices, so the first thing the trio do is get taken hostage in a bank robbery! The trio makes it onto TV, which equals instant celebrity, but the big station in town won''t give them a job. Enter Andy Lau, who gives the guys their own talk show on a rival station, where they beat up their guests for being annoying. Meanwhile, a trio of comely females (including Elizabeth Lee and Carina Lau) move in next door, and the chase is on!', 'Chow Yun Fat leaves his buddies Eric Tsang, Stanley Fung, and Nat Chan Bak Cheung to their own devices, so the first thing the trio do is get taken hostage in a bank robbery! The trio makes it onto TV, which equals instant celebrity, but the big station in town won''t give them a job. Enter Andy Lau, who gives the guys their own talk show on a rival station, where they beat up their guests for being annoying. Meanwhile, a trio of comely females (including Elizabeth Lee and Carina Lau) move in next door, and the chase is on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ir5ciLv5gZXpkFLwKhaGRhIVZlE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152291'),
  ('1091063406799761770', 'The Romantic Englishwoman', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Joseph Losey, Gerry Fisher, Richard Rambaut', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Glenda Jackson, Michael Caine, Helmut Berger, Michael Lonsdale, Béatrice Romand, Kate Nelligan, Nathalie Delon, Reinhard Kolldehoff', 'R', 'A marriage crisis between a writer and his wife leads her to flee to Germany and eventually return with another man, through whom the writer is going to overcome his writer''s block.', 'A marriage crisis between a writer and his wife leads her to flee to Germany and eventually return with another man, through whom the writer is going to overcome his writer''s block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMqiH1N4rCEyGy0pLQvnt5iuyul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42266'),
  ('842193552443828342', 'The Romantic Exiles', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jonás Trueba, Santiago Racaj', 'Jonás Trueba', 'Renata Antonante, Francesco Carril, Vito Sanz, Isabelle Stoffel, Luis E. Parés, Vahina Giocante, Miren Iza, Sigfrid Monleón', null, 'Vito, Luis and Francesco are three Spanish friends around thirty who travel by van to Paris for no apparent reason, just looking for a reunion with their respective ancient, idyllic and yet ephemeral love affairs, perhaps with the only mission of surprising themselves and continue to still feel alive.', 'Vito, Luis and Francesco are three Spanish friends around thirty who travel by van to Paris for no apparent reason, just looking for a reunion with their respective ancient, idyllic and yet ephemeral love affairs, perhaps with the only mission of surprising themselves and continue to still feel alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XNBQpcmfmmvWg7AgQA7ZErj9e6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331460'),
  ('659310529819914276', 'The Romantics', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Galt Niederhoffer, Sam Levy', 'Galt Niederhoffer', 'Katie Holmes, Anna Paquin, Josh Duhamel, Dianna Agron, Adam Brody, Malin Åkerman, Elijah Wood, Jeremy Strong', 'PG-13', 'Alliances are tested when seven college pals reunite to watch two of their own say “I do” at a seaside wedding. But the maid of honor and the groom share a passionate history, and the bride isn’t the only one who’s wondering if it’s all in the past.', 'Alliances are tested when seven college pals reunite to watch two of their own say “I do” at a seaside wedding. But the maid of honor and the groom share a passionate history, and the bride isn’t the only one who’s wondering if it’s all in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKXGDEgtqbXZBvwcZiZeWydqIEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41556'),
  ('533259327295026138', 'The Ron Clark Story', 2006, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Randa Haines, Derick V. Underschultz, Pierre Tremblay', 'Annie DeYoung, Max Enscoe', 'Matthew Perry, Hannah Hodson, C.J. Jackman-Zigante, Griffin Cork, Melissa De Sousa, Aaron Grain, Brandon Mychal Smith, Judith Buchan', 'PG', 'Passionate and innovative teacher Ron Clark leaves his small hometown to teach in one of Harlem''s toughest schools. But to break through to the students, he must use unconventional methods, including his ground-breaking classroom rules, to help them reach their potential. Based on a true story.', 'Passionate and innovative teacher Ron Clark leaves his small hometown to teach in one of Harlem''s toughest schools. But to break through to the students, he must use unconventional methods, including his ground-breaking classroom rules, to help them reach their potential. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSu3GKl3fYt8yFPr8ZYAZWoQNok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25527'),
  ('452895130978471867', 'The Roof', 1956, 'Drama', 'Franco Montemurro, Luisa Alessandri, Vittorio De Sica', 'Cesare Zavattini', 'Gabriella Pallotta, Giorgio Listuzzi, Gastone Renzelli, Maria Di Rollo, Luciano Pigozzi, Maria Di Fiori, Emilia Maritini, Angelo Bigioni', null, 'Under provincial Italian law at the time, once a roof is erected, the occupants cannot be evicted from a building. This comedy follows the efforts of a family to erect the roof on a house overnight so that a newlywed couple can have their own home.', 'Under provincial Italian law at the time, once a roof is erected, the occupants cannot be evicted from a building. This comedy follows the efforts of a family to erect the roof on a house overnight so that a newlywed couple can have their own home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiBsp3DTOSJLoLuUPBmfw5iHiXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113936'),
  ('967865965339436616', 'The Rooftop', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Jay Chou, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Jay Chou', 'Jay Chou, Alan Kuo, Li Xinai, Darren Chiu, Wang Xueqi, Edison Huang, Xu Fan, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai', 'NR', 'Wax and his friends are the happiest kids in the city of Galilee. Living on the rooftops of this bustling metropolis, sometimes life can be tough, but they still churn out songs all day, and dance under the stars at night. But when Wax meets his dream girl, a billboard beauty named Starling, fate takes him on a wild ride through the high and low parts of the town he loves.', 'Wax and his friends are the happiest kids in the city of Galilee. Living on the rooftops of this bustling metropolis, sometimes life can be tough, but they still churn out songs all day, and dance under the stars at night. But when Wax meets his dream girl, a billboard beauty named Starling, fate takes him on a wild ride through the high and low parts of the town he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2IaBKoIejpWXyHcfh0gr1LqhwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206260'),
  ('1086271838636699661', 'The Rookie', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green, Buddy Van Horn', 'Boaz Yakin, Scott Spiegel', 'Clint Eastwood, Charlie Sheen, Raúl Juliá, Sonia Braga, Tom Skerritt, Lara Flynn Boyle, Xander Berkeley, Coleby Lombardo', 'R', 'Veteran cop Nick Pulovski is used to playing musical partners; many of the partners he''s had in the past have died on the job, and often as a result of Nick''s risky tactics. But the rookie who''s been assigned to help Nick bust a carjacking ring is almost as hotheaded as he is … and when Nick gets kidnapped, his newbie partner is his only hope.', 'Veteran cop Nick Pulovski is used to playing musical partners; many of the partners he''s had in the past have died on the job, and often as a result of Nick''s risky tactics. But the rookie who''s been assigned to help Nick bust a carjacking ring is almost as hotheaded as he is … and when Nick gets kidnapped, his newbie partner is his only hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr37i12Qe1gGxMBf6GTIDZvfFIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6723'),
  ('505852962795847359', 'The Rookie', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'John Lee Hancock, John Schwartzman', 'Mike Rich', 'Dennis Quaid, Rachel Griffiths, Jay Hernandez, Beth Grant, Angus T. Jones, Brian Cox, Rick Gonzalez, Chad Lindberg', 'G', 'Jim Morris never made it out of the minor leagues before a shoulder injury ended his pitching career twelve years ago. Now a married-with-children high-school chemistry teacher and baseball coach in Texas, Jim''s team makes a deal with him: if they win the district championship, Jim will try out with a major-league organization. The bet proves incentive enough for the team, and they go from worst to first, making it to state for the first time in the history of the school. Jim, forced to live up to his end of the deal, is nearly laughed off the try-out field--until he gets onto the mound, where he confounds the scouts (and himself) by clocking successive 98 mph fastballs, good enough for a minor-league contract with the Tampa Bay Devil Rays. Jim''s still got a lot of pitches to throw before he makes it to The Show, but with his big-league dreams revived, there''s no telling where he could go.', 'Jim Morris never made it out of the minor leagues before a shoulder injury ended his pitching career twelve years ago. Now a married-with-children high-school chemistry teacher and baseball coach in Texas, Jim''s team makes a deal with him: if they win the district championship, Jim will try out with a major-league organization. The bet proves incentive enough for the team, and they go from worst to first, making it to state for the first time in the history of the school. Jim, forced to live up to his end of the deal, is nearly laughed off the try-out field--until he gets onto the mound, where he confounds the scouts (and himself) by clocking successive 98 mph fastballs, good enough for a minor-league contract with the Tampa Bay Devil Rays. Jim''s still got a lot of pitches to throw before he makes it to The Show, but with his big-league dreams revived, there''s no telling where he could go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNmLsseIs6thkBKne91iQZDGyBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14635'),
  ('380832052434504436', 'The Rookie Guide', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Mechelen, Stéphane Le Parc, Hamza Boumalki', 'Philippe Mechelen', 'Hakim Jemili, Christian Clavier, Michel Blanc, Manon Azem, Fred Testot, Medi Sadoun, Aude Gogny-Goubert, Yann Papin', null, 'Yann can’t find a job he likes or can keep, and dreams of a better life. One day he learns that the famous travel guide Le Routard pays its employees to travel the world. Surely the perfect free holiday! Smooth-talking his way through the door, Yann manages to get himself hired for a trial research trip to Morocco, but he rapidly comes to realise that he’s seriously underestimated the job… Beguiled by Sofia, a feisty tourist guide, Yann gets swept up in an art trafficking operation led by the infamous mobster art dealer Dr Charoux and is plunged into an adventure where nothing will go as planned!', 'Yann can’t find a job he likes or can keep, and dreams of a better life. One day he learns that the famous travel guide Le Routard pays its employees to travel the world. Surely the perfect free holiday! Smooth-talking his way through the door, Yann manages to get himself hired for a trial research trip to Morocco, but he rapidly comes to realise that he’s seriously underestimated the job… Beguiled by Sofia, a feisty tourist guide, Yann gets swept up in an art trafficking operation led by the infamous mobster art dealer Dr Charoux and is plunged into an adventure where nothing will go as planned!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSxrzckEOWAFBBPwt9X4AHfVEA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191666'),
  ('768994412444969563', 'The Rookies', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Kennedy Xu, Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Milla Jovovich, Darren Wang, Sandrine Pinna, Timmy Xu, Liu Meitong, Xiao Zhan, David Lee McInnis, Bernadett Ostorházi', null, 'Extreme sport lover Zhou Feng got involved in an international illegal trade by accident. So he had to follow an international special agent Bruce to Budapest. Together with a crappy police officer Miao Yan, a non-professional scientist Ding Shan and an unemployed doctor LV, they became an amateur unit. In company with the senior agent Bruce, these four rookies started a fight with the terrorists that was both thrilling and hilarious.', 'Extreme sport lover Zhou Feng got involved in an international illegal trade by accident. So he had to follow an international special agent Bruce to Budapest. Together with a crappy police officer Miao Yan, a non-professional scientist Ding Shan and an unemployed doctor LV, they became an amateur unit. In company with the senior agent Bruce, these four rookies started a fight with the terrorists that was both thrilling and hilarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3vWi7s6WqX66BU6O3wsjSZ4sIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546110'),
  ('997861627298629429', 'The Room', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Sion Sono, Shigenori Miki, Kunifumi Yoshida', 'Sion Sono', 'Akaji Maro, Yoriko Doguchi, Shiro Sano, Sayoko Takahashi', null, 'A quiet killer is looking for a room. The real state agent, shy and expressionless, guides him through Tokyo, towards the ruins the decadent economy has left behind, in hopes of finding The Room.', 'A quiet killer is looking for a room. The real state agent, shy and expressionless, guides him through Tokyo, towards the ruins the decadent economy has left behind, in hopes of finding The Room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGPC6TPwf8XQ8xLatwLxBNfAf8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88426'),
  ('234654038535671147', 'The Room', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tommy Wiseau, Sandy Schklair, Todd Barron', 'Tommy Wiseau', 'Tommy Wiseau, Juliette Danielle, Greg Sestero, Philip Haldiman, Carolyn Minnott, Robyn Paris, Kyle Vogt, Scott Holmes', 'R', 'Johnny is a successful banker with great respect for and dedication to the people in his life, especially his future wife Lisa. The happy-go-lucky guy sees his world being torn apart when his friends begin to betray him one-by-one.', 'Johnny is a successful banker with great respect for and dedication to the people in his life, especially his future wife Lisa. The happy-go-lucky guy sees his world being torn apart when his friends begin to betray him one-by-one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QscHN4pXj6Ja1k7e1ZT4vWDGnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17473'),
  ('929022903050533867', 'The Room', 2006, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Giles Daoust', 'Giles Daoust', 'Pascal Duquenne, Caroline Veyt, Philippe Résimont, Francoise Mignon', null, 'When a strange door appears in a troubled family''s house, they will have to face their darkest secrets.', 'When a strange door appears in a troubled family''s house, they will have to face their darkest secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCvfwkIqzjxvGfNjmTCKzcqPQbb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64479'),
  ('974793691123217309', 'The Room', 2019, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Emilie Paris, Christian Volckman, Reynald Capurro', 'Christian Volckman, Éric Forestier, Gaia Guasti', 'Olga Kurylenko, Kevin Janssens, Francis Chapman, Joshua Wilson, John Flanders, Carole Weyers, Michaël Kahya, Marianne Bourg', 'NR', 'Kate and Matt discover that a part of their house can grant wishes. In the wake of two miscarriages, what they want most is a child.', 'Kate and Matt discover that a part of their house can grant wishes. In the wake of two miscarriages, what they want most is a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWyQwZziHh1DK9F59eqahZD8Upc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582913'),
  ('746221723972238726', 'The Room Next Door', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Bogdana Orleanova, Júlia Marcos Lázaro', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Julianne Moore, Tilda Swinton, John Turturro, Alessandro Nivola, Juan Diego Botto, Raúl Arévalo, Victoria Luengo, Alex Høgh Andersen', 'PG-13', 'Ingrid and Martha were close friends in their youth, when they worked together at the same magazine. Ingrid went on to become an autofiction novelist while Martha became a war reporter, and they were separated by the circumstances of life. After years of being out of touch, they meet again in an extreme but strangely sweet situation.', 'Ingrid and Martha were close friends in their youth, when they worked together at the same magazine. Ingrid went on to become an autofiction novelist while Martha became a war reporter, and they were separated by the circumstances of life. After years of being out of touch, they meet again in an extreme but strangely sweet situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMibLyArrlBJ87AoqQBeVaFeRXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088514'),
  ('378373654119872', 'The Roommate', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Christian E. Christiansen, Phil Parmet, Mark Anthony Little', 'Sonny Mallhi', 'Leighton Meester, Minka Kelly, Cam Gigandet, Aly Michalka, Danneel Ackles, Frances Fisher, Tomas Arana, Billy Zane', 'PG-13', 'When Sara, a young design student from Iowa, arrives for college in Los Angeles, she is eager to fit in and get to know the big city. Her wealthy roommate, Rebecca, is more than eager to take Sara under her wing and show her the ropes. The two become close, but when Sara begins to branch out and make more friends on campus, Rebecca becomes resentful. Alarmed, Sara moves in with her new boyfriend, causing Rebecca''s behavior to take a violent turn.', 'When Sara, a young design student from Iowa, arrives for college in Los Angeles, she is eager to fit in and get to know the big city. Her wealthy roommate, Rebecca, is more than eager to take Sara under her wing and show her the ropes. The two become close, but when Sara begins to branch out and make more friends on campus, Rebecca becomes resentful. Alarmed, Sara moves in with her new boyfriend, causing Rebecca''s behavior to take a violent turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQZcOn5rDuwpbQTluC4Wm0amYmR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49950'),
  ('729148296764624656', 'The Roommate', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Pablo Ibarra', 'Miguel García Moreno, Adriana Pelusi, El Huevo Charlie Barrientos', 'Fiona Palomo, José Eduardo Derbez, Giuseppe Gamba, Victoria Ruffo, Bárbara de Regil, Edgar Vivar, Maite Perroni, Eréndira Ibarra', null, 'Vivi is a young writer who is forced to find a roommate to pay the mortgage on her apartment. What she does not suspect is that Roy, the supposed perfect partner she found, has a peculiar lifestyle: he never pays rent.', 'Vivi is a young writer who is forced to find a roommate to pay the mortgage on her apartment. What she does not suspect is that Roy, the supposed perfect partner she found, has a peculiar lifestyle: he never pays rent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaRzz2BxjxIVb7ja0gSedj1Hn1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229913'),
  ('865020375180003471', 'The Roommates', 1973, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Mike Messenger, Arthur Marks, Harry J. May', 'John Durren, Arthur Marks', 'Marki Bey, Pat Woodell, Roberta Collins, Laurie Rose, David Moses, Ken Scott, Kipp Whitman, Christina Hart', 'R', 'Looking to spend a swinging summer at Lake Arrowhead, Carla, Beth, Brea, Heather, and Heather''s cousin Paula head to the picturesque hills for a little R&R... but a pall soon casts over the girls'' sunny vacation when a mysterious murderer begins picking off the lake''s bevy of beauties. Can the killer be stopped before the coeds'' summer fun ends in blood-spattered chaos?', 'Looking to spend a swinging summer at Lake Arrowhead, Carla, Beth, Brea, Heather, and Heather''s cousin Paula head to the picturesque hills for a little R&R... but a pall soon casts over the girls'' sunny vacation when a mysterious murderer begins picking off the lake''s bevy of beauties. Can the killer be stopped before the coeds'' summer fun ends in blood-spattered chaos?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uv04HHtlUjoX7uRuZzNfRG46G4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251499'),
  ('870367465420969810', 'The Roommates Party', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Alexandra Leclère, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Alexandra Leclère', 'Karin Viard, Didier Bourdon, Valérie Bonneton, Michel Vuillermoz, Josiane Balasko, Patrick Chesnais, Sandra Zidani, Michèle Moretti', null, 'An unusually cold winter forces the french government to push the best housed people to accommodate some poor fellow citizens. The decree called "Le Grand Partage" creates some trouble among the residents of a Paris upscale apartment block.', 'An unusually cold winter forces the french government to push the best housed people to accommodate some poor fellow citizens. The decree called "Le Grand Partage" creates some trouble among the residents of a Paris upscale apartment block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSHOcTFsDHJInyweF7LcilPprp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366566'),
  ('279232524122381853', 'The Roost', 2005, 'Horror', 'Ti West', 'Ti West', 'Karl Jacob, Vanessa Horneff, Sean Reid, Larry Fessenden, Tom Noonan, Wil Horneff, John Speredakos, Ti West', 'NR', 'Following a near-death car accident, four friends on their way to a Halloween wedding, venture to a secluded farm for help. Little do they know however, they will soon disturb an ancient evil with far more ghastly plans in store for them...', 'Following a near-death car accident, four friends on their way to a Halloween wedding, venture to a secluded farm for help. Little do they know however, they will soon disturb an ancient evil with far more ghastly plans in store for them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ounpk1FoUejhejEOJkeowaUYhcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27417'),
  ('1152407422735411349', 'The Rooster', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Lasse Hallström, Jörgen Persson', 'Ivar Lo-Johansson, Olle Hellbom, Lasse Hallström', 'Magnus Härenstam, Allan Edwall, Pernilla August, Maria Johansson, Åsa Bjerkerot, Suzanne Ernrup, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Ellionor Bille', null, 'In 1944, Cederqvist comes to a small cloth factory to see how the all-women employees can work more efficiently. At the beginning he is greeted with suspicion and his efforts at courting the young ladies are futile. But as soon as he buys himself a car it becomes much easier, especially since he has the power to relocate people to an easier line of work. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'In 1944, Cederqvist comes to a small cloth factory to see how the all-women employees can work more efficiently. At the beginning he is greeted with suspicion and his efforts at courting the young ladies are futile. But as soon as he buys himself a car it becomes much easier, especially since he has the power to relocate people to an easier line of work. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrV466DqhdPavyT7aadAMg98aUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29862'),
  ('1057931412445381598', 'The Roots of Heaven', 1958, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Oswald Morris, John Huston', 'Patrick Leigh-Fermor, Romain Gary', 'Errol Flynn, Trevor Howard, Eddie Albert, Juliette Gréco, Orson Welles, Paul Lukas, Herbert Lom, Edric Connor', 'NR', 'In French Equatorial Africa, an idealist campaigns to save the African elephant, gaining support from a nightclub hostess and an ex-soldier. His cause attracts a mix of characters, including a U.S. commentator, a government aide opposed to him, and an ivory hunter with conflicting interests.', 'In French Equatorial Africa, an idealist campaigns to save the African elephant, gaining support from a nightclub hostess and an ex-soldier. His cause attracts a mix of characters, including a U.S. commentator, a government aide opposed to him, and an ivory hunter with conflicting interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o61Y2bK2Oqnc48C6rUM7hecpUBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75799'),
  ('911407560898996751', 'The Rope Curse', 2018, 'Horror', 'Meteor Cheung, Liao Shih-han', 'Ma Tzu-ming', 'Hsia Yu-chiao, Vicci Pan, Tou Tsung-hua, Chu Chung-heng, Ying Tsai-Ling, Jason Tsou, Chen Bo-zheng, Vera Chen', null, 'Hoping to make a viral video by streaming a mysterious rope ritual, a couple falls into a deadly curse instead that turns their lives upside down.', 'Hoping to make a viral video by streaming a mysterious rope ritual, a couple falls into a deadly curse instead that turns their lives upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxRA1KOJRTyHchU0mF6T1MU3hOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552737'),
  ('652596102775799876', 'The Rope Curse 2', 2020, 'Horror', 'Lee Ming, Liao Shih-han, Chen Po-yen', 'Ma Tzu-ming', 'Hsu An-chih, Vera Chen, Lee Kang-sheng, Chen Bo-zheng, Yen Cheng-kuo, Jason Tsou, Hsia Yu-chiao, Lei Hung', null, 'Jia-min, who was born sensitive to the paranormal, tries to summon "Yi-A-Gu" with two streamers. Huo-ge helps Jia-min subdue the spirit when the situation goes out of hand. Huo-ge possesses supernatural powers but lost his will to exorcise demons during a battle with the Thai Demon five years ago. As the wave of suicides continues, the village is thrown into chaos. Another battle is about to begin.', 'Jia-min, who was born sensitive to the paranormal, tries to summon "Yi-A-Gu" with two streamers. Huo-ge helps Jia-min subdue the spirit when the situation goes out of hand. Huo-ge possesses supernatural powers but lost his will to exorcise demons during a battle with the Thai Demon five years ago. As the wave of suicides continues, the village is thrown into chaos. Another battle is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1ms0vDzh2XPdGVCKrCQ6sHnubR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737519'),
