  ('20535703311085087', 'The Rosa Parks Story', 2002, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Julie Dash, David Claessen', 'Paris Qualles', 'Angela Bassett, Peter Francis James, Von Coulter, Cicely Tyson, Afemo Omilami, Charles Black, Sonny Shroyer, Mike Pniewski', null, 'A seamstress recalls events leading to her act of peaceful defiance that prompted the 1955 bus boycott in Montgomery, Alabama.', 'A seamstress recalls events leading to her act of peaceful defiance that prompted the 1955 bus boycott in Montgomery, Alabama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YBX7mJ73Y4m7BQ9GFiweCmMV6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49635'),
