  ('766571479884629531', 'The Rose Seller', 1998, 'Drama, Crime', 'Víctor Gaviria, Rodrigo Lalinde, Carlos Henao', 'Víctor Gaviria, Carlos Henao, Diana Ospina', 'Lady Tabares, Marta Correa, Mileider Gil, Diana Murillo, Liliana Giraldo, Yuli García, Giovanni Quiroz, Álex Bedoya', null, 'Monica is 13 years old and has already created her own world, on the street, where she fights courageously to defend what little she has: her friends, her boyfriend, who sells drugs, and her dignity and pride that makes no concessions to anyone. On Christmas night, like every night, she sells roses to make a living. But life brings her a new appointment with loneliness, poverty, drugs and death.', 'Monica is 13 years old and has already created her own world, on the street, where she fights courageously to defend what little she has: her friends, her boyfriend, who sells drugs, and her dignity and pride that makes no concessions to anyone. On Christmas night, like every night, she sells roses to make a living. But life brings her a new appointment with loneliness, poverty, drugs and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2tizTBmh8mATLFjo617wrNWjXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97038'),
  ('313852037345337064', 'The Rose Tattoo', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Mann, Alex North, James Wong Howe', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Anna Magnani, Burt Lancaster, Marisa Pavan, Ben Cooper, Virginia Grey, Jo Van Fleet, Sandro Giglio, Mimi Aguglia', 'NR', 'A grieving widow embarks on a new romance when she discovers her late husband had been cheating on her.', 'A grieving widow embarks on a new romance when she discovers her late husband had been cheating on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W3dgP2l24JJWq6sVEl6TddLwbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65550'),
  ('1047182437891999954', 'The Roses', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jay Roach, Florian Hoffmeister, Jessica Laws', 'Tony McNamara', 'Olivia Colman, Benedict Cumberbatch, Andy Samberg, Kate McKinnon, Belinda Bromilow, Ncuti Gatwa, Sunita Mani, Zoë Chao', 'R', 'Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy and Theo: successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo''s career nosedives while Ivy''s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites.', 'Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy and Theo: successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo''s career nosedives while Ivy''s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99O8HLHklXGzvF2TqiRqr7WddzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1267905'),
  ('516877877119702949', 'The Roses of the Desert', 2006, 'War, Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Saverio Guarna, Paolo Giacomo Marino', 'Alessandro Bencivenni, Mario Monicelli, Domenico Saverni', 'Michele Placido, Alessandro Haber, Giorgio Pasotti, Claudio Bigagli, Moran Atias, Fulvio Falzarano, Tatti Sanguineti, Tiziano Scarpa', null, 'A sanitary battalion of Italian Army is sent to Sorman oasis in Lybia during the Africa campaign in 1940. Soon an Italian missionary, living nearby, succeed to transform the occupation by Italian Army in a kind of humanitarian mission. In fact all the battalion is involved to help the local population. The war anyway goes on with no regards to human feelings. The "glorious" Fascist campaign is going to became a fast retreat.', 'A sanitary battalion of Italian Army is sent to Sorman oasis in Lybia during the Africa campaign in 1940. Soon an Italian missionary, living nearby, succeed to transform the occupation by Italian Army in a kind of humanitarian mission. In fact all the battalion is involved to help the local population. The war anyway goes on with no regards to human feelings. The "glorious" Fascist campaign is going to became a fast retreat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzW15mnUnKovV06Ggyomr1asp4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63074'),
  ('394147588370811731', 'The Rothschilds', 1940, 'Drama', 'Erich Waschneck', null, 'Erich Ponto, Carl Kuhlmann, Albert Lippert, Hans Stiebner, Herbert Hübner, Hilde Weissner, Hans Leibelt, Bernhard Minetti', null, 'Biopic about the Rothschilds, a Jewish family whose members rose to the top of the European banking community during the Napoleonic era.', 'Biopic about the Rothschilds, a Jewish family whose members rose to the top of the European banking community during the Napoleonic era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgLOKOE3fn19Px2CvgqdcYKljgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277452'),
  ('709490598484326669', 'The Rotten Link', 2015, 'Horror, Drama', 'Valentín Javier Diment, Fernando Marticorena', 'Sebastián Cortés, Martín Blousson, Valentín Javier Diment', 'Luis Ziembrowski, Marilú Marini, Paula Brasca, Germán de Silva, Marta Haller, Susana Pampín, Luis Aranosky, Lola Berthet', null, 'Prostitute Roberta lives with her brother and demented mother in an Argentinian rural village. Mother warns Roberta that she can have sex with almost any man in the village, except one – because then she would be killed. However, this last candidate, Sicilio, has put his sights on her.', 'Prostitute Roberta lives with her brother and demented mother in an Argentinian rural village. Mother warns Roberta that she can have sex with almost any man in the village, except one – because then she would be killed. However, this last candidate, Sicilio, has put his sights on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vG9MrGMCcJrmkOzAFIlAi730iu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347766'),
