  ('1006842337474705831', 'The Roundup 4: Punishment', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Heo Myeong-haeng, Park Sung-chan, Lee Seong-je', 'Oh Sang-ho', 'Don Lee, Kim Moo-yul, Park Ji-hwan, Lee Dong-hwi, Lee Ju-bin, Lee Beom-soo, Kim Min-jae, Lee Ji-hoon', null, '''Monster Cop'' Ma Seok-do investigates an illegal online gambling business led by a former STS Baek and an IT genius CEO Chang. Ma proposes an unexpected alliance to Jang and begins hunting down the criminals.', '''Monster Cop'' Ma Seok-do investigates an illegal online gambling business led by a former STS Baek and an IT genius CEO Chang. Ma proposes an unexpected alliance to Jang and begins hunting down the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk38mNoJpsswmk9o7i7eLhO4mc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017163'),
  ('713878952557115079', 'The Rover', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Michôd, Natasha Braier, Deborah Antoniou', 'David Michôd', 'Guy Pearce, Robert Pattinson, Scoot McNairy, David Field, Susan Prior, Anthony Hayes, Tawanda Manyimo, Nash Edgerton', 'R', 'Ten years after a severe economic collapse in the western world, lawlessness reigns and life is cheap. Eric is a lone drifter, and his car is his only possession. When a gang steals it, Eric comes across the injured Rey, left behind by the car thieves. The pair form an unlikely and uneasy alliance.', 'Ten years after a severe economic collapse in the western world, lawlessness reigns and life is cheap. Eric is a lone drifter, and his car is his only possession. When a gang steals it, Eric comes across the injured Rey, left behind by the car thieves. The pair form an unlikely and uneasy alliance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/734OOkr69mt8lyPk8iw3TwgQ90R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157845'),
  ('878436123187699735', 'The Row', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Matty Beckerman, Jamie Barber, Lorenzo Grasso', 'Sarah Scougal', 'Lala Kent, Mia Rose Frampton, Randy Couture, Dylan Sprayberry, Sarah McDaniel, Lexi Atkins, Natali Yura, Shea Buckner', 'R', 'A killer stalks and terrorizes a group of sorority girls on a college campus.', 'A killer stalks and terrorizes a group of sorority girls on a college campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xR2PZ92HTZDFuEpxePJhf0WBCyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529649'),
  ('812742736609200443', 'The Royal Bed', 1931, 'Comedy', 'Lowell Sherman, F. Harmon Weight, Leo Tover', 'J. Walter Ruben', 'Lowell Sherman, Mary Astor, Anthony Bushell, Hugh Trevor, Nance O''Neil, Robert Warwick, Gilbert Emery, Alan Roscoe', null, 'The hapless king of a small European nation must put up with a domineering queen, a daughter who wants to elope with her boyfriend, a peasant revolt and a scheming general.', 'The hapless king of a small European nation must put up with a domineering queen, a daughter who wants to elope with her boyfriend, a peasant revolt and a scheming general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16lrzvHiQMwK0z3tgKAow4868MF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156448'),
  ('797966504029724614', 'The Royal Exchange', 2017, 'History, Drama', 'Marc Dugain, Gilles Porte, Valérie Houdart', 'Marc Dugain, Chantal Thomas', 'Lambert Wilson, Anamaria Vartolomei, Olivier Gourmet, Catherine Mouchet, Kacey Mottet Klein, Igor van Dessel, Juliane Lepoureau, Andréa Ferréol', null, 'After many years of confrontation, the treasures of Spain and France are empty. In 1721, the regent of France draws up an ambitious plan to inaugurate an era of peace and prosperity that will heal the economies of both nations: his intention is to build a solid network of marriage alliances that will involve four children of very different ages who know nothing of betrayals and power games…', 'After many years of confrontation, the treasures of Spain and France are empty. In 1721, the regent of France draws up an ambitious plan to inaugurate an era of peace and prosperity that will heal the economies of both nations: his intention is to build a solid network of marriage alliances that will involve four children of very different ages who know nothing of betrayals and power games…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yV7IjJKHl29kwmK2rQCJTr28l2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440355'),
  ('120502118634564253', 'The Royal Family of Broadway', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Cyril Gardner, George Cukor, George J. Folsey', 'Gertrude Purcell', 'Ina Claire, Fredric March, Mary Brian, Henrietta Crosman, Charles Starrett, Arnold Korff, Frank Conroy, Royal C. Stout', null, 'Julie Cavendish comes from a family of great Broadway actors. Her mother Fanny staunchly continues acting. Her boisterous brother Tony is fleeing a breach of promise suit in Hollywood. Her daughter Gwen must decide between going on stage, or settling down in a conventional marriage. Julie is just thinking that it would be nice to retire and get married, when who should turn up but her old beau, Gilmore Marshall, the platinum magnate from South America.', 'Julie Cavendish comes from a family of great Broadway actors. Her mother Fanny staunchly continues acting. Her boisterous brother Tony is fleeing a breach of promise suit in Hollywood. Her daughter Gwen must decide between going on stage, or settling down in a conventional marriage. Julie is just thinking that it would be nice to retire and get married, when who should turn up but her old beau, Gilmore Marshall, the platinum magnate from South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pQK0meFVbnuH39PDl99CG1ozDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104209'),
  ('555347827465452167', 'The Royal Game', 2021, 'History, Drama, War, Thriller', 'Philipp Stölzl, Thomas W. Kiennast', 'Eldar Grigorian', 'Oliver Masucci, Albrecht Schuch, Birgit Minichmayr, Rolf Lassgård, Andreas Lust, Samuel Finzi, Lukas Miko, Joel Basman', null, '1938. While the Nazi troops march into Vienna, the lawyer Josef Bartok hastily tries to escape to the USA with his wife but is arrested by the Gestapo. Bartok remains steadfast and refuses to cooperate with the Gestapo that requires confidential information from him. Thrown into solitary confinement, Bartok is psychologically tormented for months and begins to weaken. However, when he steals an old book about chess it sets him on course to overcome the mental suffering inflicted upon him, until it becomes a dangerous obsession.', '1938. While the Nazi troops march into Vienna, the lawyer Josef Bartok hastily tries to escape to the USA with his wife but is arrested by the Gestapo. Bartok remains steadfast and refuses to cooperate with the Gestapo that requires confidential information from him. Thrown into solitary confinement, Bartok is psychologically tormented for months and begins to weaken. However, when he steals an old book about chess it sets him on course to overcome the mental suffering inflicted upon him, until it becomes a dangerous obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IWHrRYTsmVc7N0TdgkSoa3vYFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748787'),
  ('116493596518547708', 'The Royal Hotel', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kitty Green, Michael Latham, James Dubay', 'Kitty Green, Oscar Redding', 'Julia Garner, Jessica Henwick, Hugo Weaving, Daniel Henshall, Ursula Yovich, Toby Wallace, James Frecheville, Herbert Nordrum', 'R', 'After running out of money while backpacking in a tiny, male-dominated town in the Australian outback, two friends resort to a working holiday at the Royal Hotel. When the locals'' behavior starts crossing the line, the girls find themselves trapped in an unnerving situation that grows rapidly out of their control.', 'After running out of money while backpacking in a tiny, male-dominated town in the Australian outback, two friends resort to a working holiday at the Royal Hotel. When the locals'' behavior starts crossing the line, the girls find themselves trapped in an unnerving situation that grows rapidly out of their control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJwb2PV1LGxDp6Q3lynrjADxOIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944952'),
  ('853129944296298566', 'The Royal Hunt of the Sun', 1969, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Irving Lerner, Roger Barlow', 'Peter Shaffer', 'Robert Shaw, Christopher Plummer, Nigel Davenport, Leonard Whiting, Michael Craig, Andrew Keir, William Marlowe, James Donald', 'G', 'The Spanish explorer Pizarro captures the Inca god-chief Atahualpa and promises to free him upon the delivery of a hoard of gold. But Pizarro finds himself torn between his desire for conquest and his sense of honor after friendship and respect develops between captive and captor.', 'The Spanish explorer Pizarro captures the Inca god-chief Atahualpa and promises to free him upon the delivery of a hoard of gold. But Pizarro finds himself torn between his desire for conquest and his sense of honor after friendship and respect develops between captive and captor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijFNkTpBVkbMISIZmGr1F66XHxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202886'),
  ('647892598003824774', 'The Royal Nanny', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jonathan Wright, Russ Goozee', 'Brook Durham', 'Rachel Skarsten, Dan Jeannotte, Greta Scacchi, Toussaint Meghie, Katie Sheridan, Martin Swabey, Isabelle Wilson, Phoenix Laroche', 'G', 'Claire is an MI5 agent who goes undercover as the royal nanny. She must overcome the challenges of her assignment, like resisting the charms of Prince Colin, while keeping the family safe at Christmas.', 'Claire is an MI5 agent who goes undercover as the royal nanny. She must overcome the challenges of her assignment, like resisting the charms of Prince Colin, while keeping the family safe at Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svpc5CdExIpsNkX091K70HY8gpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028182'),
  ('984917566087492974', 'The Royal Scoundrel', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Johnnie To, Jonathan Ki-Yee Chik, Lo Kim-Wah', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Wong Yat-Fei, Wong Tin-Lam, Alan Chui Chung-San, Lam Chung', null, 'Beach Boy is a maverick cop whose unorthodox and incompetent ways are frowned upon by his uptight superiors. His inept partner Mr. Chow isn''t much help, and is more concerned with taking care of his many, many children. On a routine stakeout, Beach Boy and Mr. Chow rescue a lovely Mainland girl named Ah Yuk, who was previously abused by her criminal uncle.', 'Beach Boy is a maverick cop whose unorthodox and incompetent ways are frowned upon by his uptight superiors. His inept partner Mr. Chow isn''t much help, and is more concerned with taking care of his many, many children. On a routine stakeout, Beach Boy and Mr. Chow rescue a lovely Mainland girl named Ah Yuk, who was previously abused by her criminal uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwGMZFP49Qrl9SVriwLzXX4EbMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183159'),
  ('954944922584754111', 'The Royal Siren', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Hansjörg Thurn, Gerhard Schirlo', 'Gabriele Kister', 'Alexandra Neldel, Alexander Beyer, Bert Tischendorf, Lili Gesler, Julian Weigend, Nadja Becker, Michael Brandner, Götz Otto', null, 'Constance, 1410. Marie, daughter of the richest bourgeois of the city, is on the eve of marrying a prestigious lawyer, son of an earl. Although the compromise fills with pride the girl''s father, anxious to ennoble, Marie is not just convinced about her fiancé, who she has only seen twice. Her suspicions are confirmed tragically on the eve of the wedding when, after signing the marriage contract, a stranger breaks into the house ensuring that Marie has slept with other men in exchange for gifts, like a vile harlot. From that moment, the life of the girl will give a terrible unexpected turnaround. Alone, with his reputation ruined, she will have no choice to survive than partnering with a prostitute and lying on the roads.', 'Constance, 1410. Marie, daughter of the richest bourgeois of the city, is on the eve of marrying a prestigious lawyer, son of an earl. Although the compromise fills with pride the girl''s father, anxious to ennoble, Marie is not just convinced about her fiancé, who she has only seen twice. Her suspicions are confirmed tragically on the eve of the wedding when, after signing the marriage contract, a stranger breaks into the house ensuring that Marie has slept with other men in exchange for gifts, like a vile harlot. From that moment, the life of the girl will give a terrible unexpected turnaround. Alone, with his reputation ruined, she will have no choice to survive than partnering with a prostitute and lying on the roads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM0rdJGzTIJShIeefffqiSyDhqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46873'),
  ('656550552965569243', 'The Royal Tailor', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'Lee Won-suk, Kim Ji-yong', 'Lee Byoung-hak', 'Han Suk-kyu, Go Soo, Park Shin-hye, Yoo Yeon-seok, Lee Yu-bi, Don Lee, Shin So-yul, Bae Sung-woo', null, 'Lee Gong-jin, a young tailor, helps the Queen with her dress and both fall in love with each other. However, his success catches the ire of Jo Dol-seok, the royal tailor, who vows retribution.', 'Lee Gong-jin, a young tailor, helps the Queen with her dress and both fall in love with each other. However, his success catches the ire of Jo Dol-seok, the royal tailor, who vows retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrWD1J3CRamqGgHm5UgH9jN0Iqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314327'),
  ('998368835702286708', 'The Royal Tenenbaums', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wes Anderson, Robert D. Yeoman, Kathryn-Ann Oaks Shertzer', 'Wes Anderson, Owen Wilson', 'Gene Hackman, Anjelica Huston, Ben Stiller, Gwyneth Paltrow, Luke Wilson, Owen Wilson, Bill Murray, Danny Glover', 'R', 'Royal Tenenbaum and his wife Etheline had three children and then they separated. All three children are extraordinary --- all geniuses. Virtually all memory of the brilliance of the young Tenenbaums was subsequently erased by two decades of betrayal, failure, and disaster. Most of this was generally considered to be their father''s fault. "The Royal Tenenbaums" is the story of the family''s sudden, unexpected reunion one recent winter.', 'Royal Tenenbaum and his wife Etheline had three children and then they separated. All three children are extraordinary --- all geniuses. Virtually all memory of the brilliance of the young Tenenbaums was subsequently erased by two decades of betrayal, failure, and disaster. Most of this was generally considered to be their father''s fault. "The Royal Tenenbaums" is the story of the family''s sudden, unexpected reunion one recent winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nG7hZJn7wQTSDCQT39Gy3s3tbrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9428'),
  ('1009259511134039611', 'The Royal Tigress', 1916, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Pastrone, Segundo de Chomón, Giovanni Tomatis', 'Giovanni Verga', 'Pina Menichelli, Alberto Nepoti, Febo Mari, Valentina Frascaroli, Ernesto Vaser, Enrico Gemelli, Bonaventura Ibáñez, Gabriel Moreau', null, '"Tigre Reale" (1916) was the film that consolidated Frau Menichelli''s stardom, a film more than suitable for her performing skills and silent idiosyncrasy that any silent diva would kill to star in… In "Tigre Reale", Frau Menichelli performs the part of Frau Natka, a Russian countess with a troublesome past and an uncertain future. She was married to a revolutionary and the matrimony ended in tragedy. She likes to flirt with men but due to her traumatic sentimental past, she doesn''t allow herself attachments. That is until she meets a young diplomat who will help her to make up her mind and exorcize her old sentimental traumas.', '"Tigre Reale" (1916) was the film that consolidated Frau Menichelli''s stardom, a film more than suitable for her performing skills and silent idiosyncrasy that any silent diva would kill to star in… In "Tigre Reale", Frau Menichelli performs the part of Frau Natka, a Russian countess with a troublesome past and an uncertain future. She was married to a revolutionary and the matrimony ended in tragedy. She likes to flirt with men but due to her traumatic sentimental past, she doesn''t allow herself attachments. That is until she meets a young diplomat who will help her to make up her mind and exorcize her old sentimental traumas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30JdKhinReDareP5o8ncFuOOlGw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174581'),
  ('276488759761004044', 'The Royal Treatment', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'John Cavill, Rick Jacobson', 'Holly Hester', 'Laura Marano, Mena Massoud, Chelsie Preston Crayford, Grace Bentley-Tsibuah, Cameron Rhodes, Sonia Gray, Amanda Billing, Elizabeth Hawthorne', null, 'Isabella runs her own salon and isn’t afraid to speak her mind, while Prince Thomas runs his own country and is about to marry for duty rather than love. When Izzy and her fellow stylists get the opportunity of a lifetime to do the hair for the royal wedding, she and Prince Thomas learn that taking control of their own destiny requires following their hearts.', 'Isabella runs her own salon and isn’t afraid to speak her mind, while Prince Thomas runs his own country and is about to marry for duty rather than love. When Izzy and her fellow stylists get the opportunity of a lifetime to do the hair for the royal wedding, she and Prince Thomas learn that taking control of their own destiny requires following their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYAv0YUoXJzLxIdEirOken8Quwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790142'),
  ('512843063251444190', 'The Royal Tutor Movie', 2019, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Katsuya Kikuchi', null, 'Keisuke Ueda, Yūya Asato, Daisuke Hirose, Shouta Aoi, Shouhei Hashimoto', null, 'The four princes of the Kingdom of Granzreich are aiming to become the next king. Under the guidance of the royal tutor Heine Wittgenstein, while overcoming various obstacles and sometimes hesitating, they grow little by little. Appearing before them are twin princes from the Kingdom of Romano. Even though these princes look cute on the surface, they are actually extremely sadistic...! Towards such an unprecedented crisis, Heine and the four princes perform "educational guidance"!?', 'The four princes of the Kingdom of Granzreich are aiming to become the next king. Under the guidance of the royal tutor Heine Wittgenstein, while overcoming various obstacles and sometimes hesitating, they grow little by little. Appearing before them are twin princes from the Kingdom of Romano. Even though these princes look cute on the surface, they are actually extremely sadistic...! Towards such an unprecedented crisis, Heine and the four princes perform "educational guidance"!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96z2nt0c8agVjlfvDys5n1LeBfL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553932'),
  ('263884089274192542', 'The Ruby in the Smoke', 2006, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Brian Percival, Peter Greenhalgh, Debbie Bowser', 'Adrian Hodges', 'Billie Piper, Matt Smith, Julie Walters, JJ Feild, Hayley Atwell, Elliot Cowan, Sian Thomas, Trevor Cooper', null, 'Sally Lockhart has struck a man dead with just three words, sent to her in a message from her father just before he drowned in the South China Seas. But unfortunately, Sally has no idea what the words The Seven Blessings mean. Before long, she is drawn into a mystery filled with opium, secrets from her own past and, at the heart of it all, the Ruby of Agrapur.', 'Sally Lockhart has struck a man dead with just three words, sent to her in a message from her father just before he drowned in the South China Seas. But unfortunately, Sally has no idea what the words The Seven Blessings mean. Before long, she is drawn into a mystery filled with opium, secrets from her own past and, at the heart of it all, the Ruby of Agrapur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfa8Xeb4NhB0PmXbRvGJ8BBaK3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46687'),
  ('416909654187559730', 'The Ruffian', 1983, 'Drama, Adventure, Comedy', 'José Giovanni, Jean-Paul Schwartz, Philippe Berger', 'José Giovanni', 'Lino Ventura, Bernard Giraudeau, Claudia Cardinale, Pierre Frag, Béatrix Van Til, August Schellenberg, Danyl Wahayenni-Martin, Jacklin Webb', null, 'The adventures of a group of friends who plan to recover crates full of gold from a fall in Canada.', 'The adventures of a group of friends who plan to recover crates full of gold from a fall in Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZedKiJGo8vdNZPJE3UxSkFpAXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71630'),
  ('980819250200585297', 'The Rugrats Movie', 1998, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Drama', 'Norton Virgien, Igor Kovalyov', 'David N. Weiss, J. David Stem', 'Whoopi Goldberg, David Spade, E. G. Daily, Tara Strong, Christine Cavanaugh, Kath Soucie, Cheryl Chase, Tim Curry', 'G', 'The Pickles family welcome a new arrival, Dil, whose constant crying and need for attention quickly exhaust the other toddlers. Seeking to return the "broken" baby to the hospital, the gang embarks on a journey in a Reptar Wagon that inadvertently veers off course, leaving them stranded in a vast, dangerous forest. While facing off against escaped circus monkeys and a predatory wolf, Tommy must overcome his own resentment to protect his brother and make it back home.', 'The Pickles family welcome a new arrival, Dil, whose constant crying and need for attention quickly exhaust the other toddlers. Seeking to return the "broken" baby to the hospital, the gang embarks on a journey in a Reptar Wagon that inadvertently veers off course, leaving them stranded in a vast, dangerous forest. While facing off against escaped circus monkeys and a predatory wolf, Tommy must overcome his own resentment to protect his brother and make it back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZejGKCSd6nwfMx8U0Td37U2fTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14444'),
  ('950785354632771312', 'The Ruins', 2008, 'Horror', 'Carter Smith, Darius Khondji, Brian Edmonds', 'Scott B. Smith', 'Jonathan Tucker, Jena Malone, Shawn Ashmore, Laura Ramsey, Joe Anderson, Sergio Calderón, Jesse Ramirez, Balder Moreno', 'R', 'Americans Amy, Stacy, Jeff and Eric look for fun during a sunny holiday in Mexico, but they get much more than that after visiting an archaeological dig in the jungle.', 'Americans Amy, Stacy, Jeff and Eric look for fun during a sunny holiday in Mexico, but they get much more than that after visiting an archaeological dig in the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HpicbiT7xmlMjQXOSCeNoLZGpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11152'),
  ('277060158769783367', 'The Rule of Jenny Pen', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Ashcroft, Matt Henley', 'Eli Kent, James Ashcroft', 'John Lithgow, Geoffrey Rush, Nathaniel Lees, Maaka Pohatu, Thomas Sainsbury, Ian Mune, Ginette McDonald, Holly Shanahan', 'R', 'Confined to a secluded rest home and trapped within his stroke-ridden body, a former Judge must stop an elderly psychopath who employs a child''s puppet to abuse the home''s residents with deadly consequences.', 'Confined to a secluded rest home and trapped within his stroke-ridden body, a former Judge must stop an elderly psychopath who employs a child''s puppet to abuse the home''s residents with deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vqK1wbrgmUvqHn6yPt9b6qT9iL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212742'),
  ('742796925833934907', 'The Rules of Art', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Dominique Baumard, Jeremy Mazza, Laure Donnadieu', 'Dominique Baumard, Benjamin Charbit', 'Sofiane Zermani, Melvil Poupaud, Steve Tientcheu, Julia Piaton, Nitsa Benchetrit, Hamed Souna, Sophie Vannier, Héra Vartuvarian', null, 'Jonathan, an expert in luxury watches, leads a gray and monotonous life until he meets Eric, a charming conman and dealer in stolen goods. Fascinated by his lifestyle, Jonathan is drawn deeper and deeper into the world of criminal transactions. The situation spirals out of control when the virtuoso thief Joe joins them. In 2010, the trio committed one of the most daring robberies in history - they stole five masterpieces by Picasso, Matisse and Modigliani from the Museum of Modern Art in Paris.', 'Jonathan, an expert in luxury watches, leads a gray and monotonous life until he meets Eric, a charming conman and dealer in stolen goods. Fascinated by his lifestyle, Jonathan is drawn deeper and deeper into the world of criminal transactions. The situation spirals out of control when the virtuoso thief Joe joins them. In 2010, the trio committed one of the most daring robberies in history - they stole five masterpieces by Picasso, Matisse and Modigliani from the Museum of Modern Art in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIkBEP788zO54h0UlEKqPJTYahb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208695'),
  ('1078916447734194755', 'The Rules of Attraction', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Roger Avary, Robert Brinkmann', 'Roger Avary', 'James Van Der Beek, Shannyn Sossamon, Ian Somerhalder, Jessica Biel, Kate Bosworth, Jay Baruchel, Thomas Ian Nicholas, Russell Sams', 'R', 'The incredibly spoiled and overprivileged students of Camden College are a backdrop for an unusual love triangle between a drug dealer, a virgin and a bisexual classmate.', 'The incredibly spoiled and overprivileged students of Camden College are a backdrop for an unusual love triangle between a drug dealer, a virgin and a bisexual classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OybelUmwUkDm7fbX1BI7OhpYeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1809'),
  ('318475125112465816', 'The Rules of the Game', 1939, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jean Renoir, Jean Bachelet, Jean-Paul Alphen', 'Jean Renoir', 'Jean Renoir, Marcel Dalio, Nora Gregor, Julien Carette, Roland Toutain, Paulette Dubost, Gaston Modot, Mila Parély', 'NR', 'The Marquis de la Chesnaye and his wife host a weekend gala where a variety of complicated romantic and social entanglements between guests and servants lead to tragedy, all against the backdrop of a looming war.', 'The Marquis de la Chesnaye and his wife host a weekend gala where a variety of complicated romantic and social entanglements between guests and servants lead to tragedy, all against the backdrop of a looming war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JOzt7uFZyshcuzCBmYU6CDJL4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776'),
  ('5289108587992581', 'The Rules of the Game', 1999, 'Crime', 'Steve Cheng Wai-Man, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Nam Yin', 'Louis Koo, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Kristy Yang Rongru, Edmond So Chi-Wai, Sam Lee, Simon Lui Yu-Yeung, Berg Ng Ting-Yip, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung', null, 'David Chow infiltrates a gang to take revenge on a triad boss, Shing. His close friend, Chun, was beaten so brutally by Shing that he was left paralyzed. To add to his pain, David’s crush, Ann, chooses to date Shing instead of him. Therefore, David joins Shing’s gang under the pretense of seeking wealth and a better future. Secretly, he plans his revenge against Shing.', 'David Chow infiltrates a gang to take revenge on a triad boss, Shing. His close friend, Chun, was beaten so brutally by Shing that he was left paralyzed. To add to his pain, David’s crush, Ann, chooses to date Shing instead of him. Therefore, David joins Shing’s gang under the pretense of seeking wealth and a better future. Secretly, he plans his revenge against Shing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWPUbU78DDAowWjMuYDSfd3REaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75983'),
  ('11508519122674402', 'The Ruling Class', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Medak, Ken Hodges, Bill Westley', 'Peter Barnes', 'Peter O''Toole, Alastair Sim, Arthur Lowe, Harry Andrews, Coral Browne, Michael Bryant, Nigel Green, William Mervyn', 'PG', 'When the Earl of Gurney dies in a cross-dressing accident, his schizophrenic son, Jack, inherits the Gurney estate. Jack is not the average nobleman; he sings and dances across the estate and thinks he is Jesus reincarnated. Believing that Jack is mentally unfit to own the estate, the Gurney family plots to steal Jack''s inheritance. As their outrageous schemes fail, the family strives to cure Jack of his bizarre behavior, with disastrous results.', 'When the Earl of Gurney dies in a cross-dressing accident, his schizophrenic son, Jack, inherits the Gurney estate. Jack is not the average nobleman; he sings and dances across the estate and thinks he is Jesus reincarnated. Believing that Jack is mentally unfit to own the estate, the Gurney family plots to steal Jack''s inheritance. As their outrageous schemes fail, the family strives to cure Jack of his bizarre behavior, with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29EZjwr3jDFWtdj9Lpq2BtCvKga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30892'),
  ('450747504632796016', 'The Rum Diary', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruce Robinson, Dariusz Wolski, Jeffrey Waldron', 'Bruce Robinson', 'Johnny Depp, Amber Heard, Aaron Eckhart, Michael Rispoli, Giovanni Ribisi, Richard Jenkins, Amaury Nolasco, Marshall Bell', 'R', 'Tired of the noise and madness of New York and the crushing conventions of late Eisenhower-era America, itinerant journalist Paul Kemp travels to the pristine island of Puerto Rico to write for a local San Juan newspaper run by the downtrodden editor Lotterman. Adopting the rum-soaked lifestyle of the late ‘50s version of Hemingway’s ''The Lost Generation'', Paul soon becomes entangled with a very attractive American woman and her fiancée, a businessman involved in shady property development deals. It is within this world that Kemp ultimately discovers his true voice as a writer and integrity as a man.', 'Tired of the noise and madness of New York and the crushing conventions of late Eisenhower-era America, itinerant journalist Paul Kemp travels to the pristine island of Puerto Rico to write for a local San Juan newspaper run by the downtrodden editor Lotterman. Adopting the rum-soaked lifestyle of the late ‘50s version of Hemingway’s ''The Lost Generation'', Paul soon becomes entangled with a very attractive American woman and her fiancée, a businessman involved in shady property development deals. It is within this world that Kemp ultimately discovers his true voice as a writer and integrity as a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uErFROiMrpk7owQWKK3bpD4hSJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23514'),
  ('153898840789885708', 'The Rumyantsev Case', 1956, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Iosif Kheifits, Lev Sokolsky, Moisey Magid', 'Yuri German, Iosif Kheifits', 'Aleksey Batalov, Nelli Podgornaya, Sergei Lukyanov, Gennadiy Yukhtin, Vladimir Lepko, Evgeni Leonov, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Viktor Chekmaryov', null, 'Sasha Rumyantsev, a long-range driver, becomes an unwitting accomplice in a crime committed by the head of the motor depot where he works. The honest guy is accused of stealing a car of a hard-to-find product. The collective of the motor depot amicably stands up to protect their comrade and helps the investigator, Colonel Afanasyev, to find and expose the true criminals.', 'Sasha Rumyantsev, a long-range driver, becomes an unwitting accomplice in a crime committed by the head of the motor depot where he works. The honest guy is accused of stealing a car of a hard-to-find product. The collective of the motor depot amicably stands up to protect their comrade and helps the investigator, Colonel Afanasyev, to find and expose the true criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LSMgfC0QygTDu7ULPQMRL0Ryd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129806'),
  ('620682736085919225', 'The Run of the Country', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mike Southon, Mary Gough, Lisa Mulcahy', 'Shane Connaughton', 'Albert Finney, Matt Keeslar, Victoria Smurfit, Anthony Brophy, David Kelly, Dearbhla Molloy, Pat Kinevane, Vinnie McCabe', 'R', 'An Irish lad who fled from his oppressive, widowed father falls for a girl from an affluent family.', 'An Irish lad who fled from his oppressive, widowed father falls for a girl from an affluent family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArlhiYSVjDeJKSl1qfCNdQH3DMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221917'),
  ('739630772776808884', 'The Runaway', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jean-Bernard Marlin', 'Jean-Bernard Marlin', 'Médina Yalaoui, Adel Bencherif, Sabine Gavaudan, Agnès Cauchon Riondet', null, 'A youth worker in a home for juvenile offenders goes to court along with one of the teenagers he''s in charge of, Sabrina.', 'A youth worker in a home for juvenile offenders goes to court along with one of the teenagers he''s in charge of, Sabrina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7Bs4tq1e375v9yN38dfuRODWti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325176'),
  ('1070163969144666405', 'The Runaway Bus', 1953, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Val Guest', 'Val Guest', 'Frankie Howerd, Margaret Rutherford, Petula Clark, George Coulouris, Terence Alexander, Toke Townley, Belinda Lee, John Horsley', 'NR', 'When heavy fog prevents any flights from leaving London Airport, a group of passengers are put on a bus driven by Percy Lamb to drive to another airport. The fog is that heavy Percy doesn''t know where he is going or that he is carrying stolen gold bullion that the robbers and police are relentlessly pursuing.', 'When heavy fog prevents any flights from leaving London Airport, a group of passengers are put on a bus driven by Percy Lamb to drive to another airport. The fog is that heavy Percy doesn''t know where he is going or that he is carrying stolen gold bullion that the robbers and police are relentlessly pursuing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdyvc3Ggrw4P7HRb9pzKDZ2ZPuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53626'),
  ('954095883016312934', 'The Runaways', 2010, 'Drama, Music', 'Benoît Debie, Floria Sigismondi, Paul-Edouard Laurens', 'Floria Sigismondi', 'Kristen Stewart, Dakota Fanning, Michael Shannon, Stella Maeve, Scout Taylor-Compton, Alia Shawkat, Riley Keough, Johnny Lewis', 'R', 'Joan Jett and Cherie Currie, two rebellious teenagers from Southern California, become the frontwomen for The Runaways -- the now-legendary group that paved the way for future generations of female rockers. Under the Svengali-like influence of impresario Kim Fowley, the band becomes a huge success.', 'Joan Jett and Cherie Currie, two rebellious teenagers from Southern California, become the frontwomen for The Runaways -- the now-legendary group that paved the way for future generations of female rockers. Under the Svengali-like influence of impresario Kim Fowley, the band becomes a huge success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqO3jz1VaunIloF17e3LvNqIkMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27586'),
  ('95487018360050386', 'The Rundown', 2003, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Tobias A. Schliessler, Peter Berg, Michael J. Moore', 'R.J. Stewart', 'Dwayne Johnson, Seann William Scott, Rosario Dawson, Christopher Walken, Ewen Bremner, Jon Gries, William Lucking, Ernie Reyes Jr.', 'PG-13', 'When Travis, the mouthy son of a criminal, disappears in the Amazon in search of a treasured artifact, his father sends in Beck, who becomes Travis''s rival for the affections of Mariana, a mysterious Brazilian woman. With his steely disposition, Beck is a man of few words -- but it takes him all the discipline he can muster to work with Travis to nab a tyrant who''s after the same treasure.', 'When Travis, the mouthy son of a criminal, disappears in the Amazon in search of a treasured artifact, his father sends in Beck, who becomes Travis''s rival for the affections of Mariana, a mysterious Brazilian woman. With his steely disposition, Beck is a man of few words -- but it takes him all the discipline he can muster to work with Travis to nab a tyrant who''s after the same treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJX06UwlLIwbLLt9UQ6DlkHF4jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10159'),
  ('232337921721816433', 'The Runestone', 1991, 'Horror, Adventure', 'Willard Carroll, Phil Robinson, Mikhail Suslov', 'Willard Carroll', 'Peter Riegert, Joan Severance, William Hickey, Tim Ryan, Mitchell Laurance, Lawrence Tierney, Dawan Scott, Chris Young', 'NR', 'A New York detective takes the case of a bulletproof monster sprung to life from Viking legend.', 'A New York detective takes the case of a bulletproof monster sprung to life from Viking legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN6cVMyUhJBcNAley0zdFomImvl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71912'),
  ('483663250163569799', 'The Runner', 1984, 'Drama', 'Firooz Malekzadeh, Amir Naderi', 'Behrouz Gharibpour, Amir Naderi', 'Majid Niroumand, Musa Torkizadeh, Abbas Nazeri, Alireza Gholmzade, Ali Pasdarzade, Shirzad Bashkal', null, 'A young orphan named Amiro lives alone in an abandoned tanker in the Iranian port city of Abadan. He survives by shining shoes, selling water, and collecting deposit bottles. Although he sometimes finds himself at odds with both adults and competing older kids, he finds solace in dreams about departing cargo ships and airplanes—and by running.', 'A young orphan named Amiro lives alone in an abandoned tanker in the Iranian port city of Abadan. He survives by shining shoes, selling water, and collecting deposit bottles. Although he sometimes finds himself at odds with both adults and competing older kids, he finds solace in dreams about departing cargo ships and airplanes—and by running.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X2Lle2CWxGCKcoYyMgqT2x43rR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213938'),
  ('186793268401504500', 'The Runner', 2015, 'Drama', 'Austin Stark, Elliot Davis', 'Austin Stark', 'Nicolas Cage, Sarah Paulson, Connie Nielsen, Peter Fonda, Bryan Batt, Wendell Pierce, Fredric Lehne, Christopher Berry', 'R', 'In the aftermath of the BP oil spill, an idealistic but imperfect New Orleans politician (Nicolas Cage) finds his plans of restoration unraveling as his own life becomes contaminated with corruption, scandal and deceit.', 'In the aftermath of the BP oil spill, an idealistic but imperfect New Orleans politician (Nicolas Cage) finds his plans of restoration unraveling as his own life becomes contaminated with corruption, scandal and deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fPnVkWueayfbqk2g66fSTLoyWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277546'),
  ('1067614497300095292', 'The Running Jumping & Standing Still Film', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Richard Lester', 'Richard Lester, Spike Milligan, Peter Sellers', 'Richard Lester, Peter Sellers, Spike Milligan, Mario Fabrizi, David Lodge, Leo McKern, Graham Stark, Bruce Lacey', null, 'A short film without any direct action designed more as an experiment, with disjointed comic scenes with no common thread.', 'A short film without any direct action designed more as an experiment, with disjointed comic scenes with no common thread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i63PTdHuLtjHxcTzs8j2Lvypv22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105721'),
  ('190726426515117660', 'The Running Man', 1963, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Carol Reed, Harold Haysom, Peter Bolton', 'John Mortimer', 'Laurence Harvey, Lee Remick, Alan Bates, Felix Aylmer, Eleanor Summerfield, Colin Gordon, Allan Cuthbertson, Harold Goldblatt', 'NR', 'An Englishman with a grudge against an insurance company for a disallowed claim fakes his own death and escapes to Spain, but is soon pursued by an insurance investigator.', 'An Englishman with a grudge against an insurance company for a disallowed claim fakes his own death and escapes to Spain, but is soon pursued by an insurance investigator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tKUyNMhnhWeezI0AwLWc6tWyZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144299'),
  ('314622649454786004', 'The Running Man', 1987, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Paul Michael Glaser, Thomas Del Ruth, Richard Peter Schroer', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Richard Dawson, María Conchita Alonso, Yaphet Kotto, Jim Brown, Jesse Ventura, Erland van Lidth, Marvin J. McIntyre', 'R', 'By 2017, the global economy has collapsed and U.S. society has become a totalitarian police state, censoring all cultural activity. The government pacifies the populace by broadcasting a number of game shows in which convicted criminals fight for their lives, including the gladiator-style The Running Man, hosted by the ruthless Damon Killian, where “runners” attempt to evade “stalkers” and certain death for a chance to be pardoned and set free.', 'By 2017, the global economy has collapsed and U.S. society has become a totalitarian police state, censoring all cultural activity. The government pacifies the populace by broadcasting a number of game shows in which convicted criminals fight for their lives, including the gladiator-style The Running Man, hosted by the ruthless Damon Killian, where “runners” attempt to evade “stalkers” and certain death for a chance to be pardoned and set free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GTAUOhO4BN0peJVvxGEQydJvUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865'),
  ('191615327344561696', 'The Running Man', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Edgar Wright, Chung Chung-hoon, Darrin Prescott', 'Michael Bacall, Edgar Wright', 'Glen Powell, William H. Macy, Lee Pace, Michael Cera, Emilia Jones, Daniel Ezra, Jayme Lawson, Sean Hayes', 'R', 'Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards is convinced by The Running Man''s charming but ruthless producer to enter the deadly competition game as a last resort. But Ben''s defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favorite — and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters, but a nation addicted to watching him fall.', 'Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards is convinced by The Running Man''s charming but ruthless producer to enter the deadly competition game as a last resort. But Ben''s defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favorite — and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters, but a nation addicted to watching him fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKL78O9zxczVgjtNcQ9UkbYLzqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798645'),
  ('1008284190017343079', 'The Russell Girl', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Charles Minsky, Jeff Bleckner', 'Jill E. Blotevogel', 'Amber Tamblyn, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Jennifer Ehle, Henry Czerny, Paul Wesley, Tim DeKay, Daniel Clark, Max Morrow', null, 'Sarah Russell, a 23-year-old aspiring medical school student, visits her loving family to share some important news, but instead finds herself attempting to finally confront a difficult period from her past.', 'Sarah Russell, a 23-year-old aspiring medical school student, visits her loving family to share some important news, but instead finds herself attempting to finally confront a difficult period from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJhxajiBsW3BiH7qzLyubaBxiOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18445'),
  ('1068215493915028037', 'The Russia House', 1990, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker, Jim Morahan', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Sean Connery, Michelle Pfeiffer, Roy Scheider, James Fox, John Mahoney, Michael Kitchen, J.T. Walsh, Ken Russell', 'R', 'Barley Scott Blair, a Lisbon-based editor of Russian literature who unexpectedly begins working for British intelligence, is commissioned to investigate the purposes of Dante, a dissident scientist trapped in the decaying Soviet Union that is crumbling under the new open-minded policies.', 'Barley Scott Blair, a Lisbon-based editor of Russian literature who unexpectedly begins working for British intelligence, is commissioned to investigate the purposes of Dante, a dissident scientist trapped in the decaying Soviet Union that is crumbling under the new open-minded policies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFvwQGcpEdXkuPJaS15Xtl6h6P4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10170'),
  ('176542956422256301', 'The Russian Bride', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Orr, Michael S. Ojeda', 'Michael S. Ojeda', 'Corbin Bernsen, Oksana Orlan, Kristina Pimenova, Gregory O''Gallagher, Yuliya Zelenskaya, Yefim Somin, Alison Korman, Michael Robert Brandon', 'NR', 'A Russian woman travels to America with her daughter to marry a reclusive billionaire offering them a better life, but soon begins to suspect her new husband might have a far more sinister plan for their arrangement.', 'A Russian woman travels to America with her daughter to marry a reclusive billionaire offering them a better life, but soon begins to suspect her new husband might have a far more sinister plan for their arrangement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Mv09q2IHhG6YPPffgnESQw2fcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524787'),
  ('476004153645172809', 'The Russian Girl', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Aritz Ortiz Flores, Israel Seoane, Quino Piñero', 'Aritz Ortiz Flores', 'Monika Kowalska, Xosé Núñez, Manuel Larrea, Eduardo Rosa, José Carlos Valadés', null, 'Returning home after 15 years, a man finds himself faced with an oppressed village, a powerful enemy and a woman who may change his life forever.', 'Returning home after 15 years, a man finds himself faced with an oppressed village, a powerful enemy and a woman who may change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPvlWpef0E71ygjVn4a7tRcX24d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700065'),
