  ('446373640649786407', 'The Russian Specialist', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Dolph Lundgren, Ross W. Clarkson, Mark Roper', 'Bryan Edward Hill', 'Dolph Lundgren, Ben Cross, Ivan Petrushinov, Olivia Lee, Raicho Vasilev, Assen Blatechki, Antony Argirov, Valeri Yordanov', 'R', 'A Russian ex-hit man is called back to Russia for one last job. This time against his former employees, the Russian mob.', 'A Russian ex-hit man is called back to Russia for one last job. This time against his former employees, the Russian mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojnpoHH7ofeJymSs19FiXHOtu5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26116'),
  ('462852710327672853', 'The Russians Are Coming! The Russians Are Coming!', 1966, 'Comedy, War', 'Norman Jewison, Joseph F. Biroc, Kurt Neumann', 'William Rose', 'Carl Reiner, Eva Marie Saint, Alan Arkin, Brian Keith, Paul Ford, Theodore Bikel, Jonathan Winters, Tessie O''Shea', 'NR', 'When a Soviet submarine gets stuck on a sandbar off the coast of a New England island, its commander orders his second-in-command, Lieutenant Rozanov, to get them moving again before there is an international incident. Rozanov seeks assistance from the island locals, including the police chief and a vacationing television writer, while trying to allay their fears of a Communist invasion by claiming he and his crew are Norwegian sailors.', 'When a Soviet submarine gets stuck on a sandbar off the coast of a New England island, its commander orders his second-in-command, Lieutenant Rozanov, to get them moving again before there is an international incident. Rozanov seeks assistance from the island locals, including the police chief and a vacationing television writer, while trying to allay their fears of a Communist invasion by claiming he and his crew are Norwegian sailors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgo7cQg6Zo0xuCgb8ckou0RX4Bj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31918'),
  ('1000192881987579321', 'The Ruthless', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Vincenzo Cataleta, Michele Iorio, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Federico Gnesini, Valentina Strada, Renato De Maria', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Sara Serraiocco, Alessio Praticò, Alessandro Tedeschi, Marie-Ange Casta, Sara Cardinaletti, Angelo Libri, Adele Tirante', null, 'Milan, Italy, 1967. Santo Russo, a boy of Calabrian origin, arrives north with his parents and younger brother to find better living conditions. Due to an absurd misunderstanding and his father''s contempt, Santo ends up in prison, where he gets a “true education.” In 1978, he and his friends Slim and Mario embark on a 15-year criminal career, a successful and ruthless spiral of robberies, kidnappings, murders and heroin smuggling.', 'Milan, Italy, 1967. Santo Russo, a boy of Calabrian origin, arrives north with his parents and younger brother to find better living conditions. Due to an absurd misunderstanding and his father''s contempt, Santo ends up in prison, where he gets a “true education.” In 1978, he and his friends Slim and Mario embark on a 15-year criminal career, a successful and ruthless spiral of robberies, kidnappings, murders and heroin smuggling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlm4Jtl8WJfoW2jg52f5ewKQWym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571495'),
  ('568754078119751539', 'The Ruthless Four', 1968, 'Western', 'Sergio D''Offizi, Giorgio Capitani', 'Fernando Di Leo', 'Van Heflin, Gilbert Roland, Klaus Kinski, George Hilton, Sarah Ross, Federico Boido, Sergio Doria, Giovanni Ivan Scratuglia', null, 'After years of hard work, old Sam Cooper has finally found a gold mine. Since he cannot take everything he has found with him, he blows up the entrance. To help him exploit his discovery, he calls on his godson Manolo Sanchez. But Manolo is accompanied by "the blond," a strange man who seems to dominate him. Sam has no choice but to accept his company. He persuades his old friend Mason to travel with them as well. Greed and paranoia will eventually completely destroy the small band.', 'After years of hard work, old Sam Cooper has finally found a gold mine. Since he cannot take everything he has found with him, he blows up the entrance. To help him exploit his discovery, he calls on his godson Manolo Sanchez. But Manolo is accompanied by "the blond," a strange man who seems to dominate him. Sam has no choice but to accept his company. He persuades his old friend Mason to travel with them as well. Greed and paranoia will eventually completely destroy the small band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5ZObogXnBecx65syZ79mtoyXDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57879'),
  ('754390260761696046', 'The Rutles: All You Need Is Cash', 1978, 'Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Eric Idle, Gary Weis, Clive Hedges', 'Eric Idle', 'Eric Idle, Neil Innes, Ricky Fataar, John Halsey, Michael Palin, Mick Jagger, George Harrison, John Belushi', 'NR', 'The story of the rise and fall of the Pre-Fab Four.', 'The story of the rise and fall of the Pre-Fab Four.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZJ5r5mYH1uRYa6aW5JFpjHasrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16378'),
  ('1092999623737974412', 'The Ryan White Story', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Herzfeld, Steven Shaw', null, 'Judith Light, Michael Bowen, Nikki Cox, George Dzundza, Sarah Jessica Parker, Mitchell Ryan, Peter Scolari, Grace Zabriskie', null, 'The story of Ryan White, a 13-year-old haemophiliac who contracted AIDS from factor VIII, which was used to control this disorder.', 'The story of Ryan White, a 13-year-old haemophiliac who contracted AIDS from factor VIII, which was used to control this disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LmjDAUMWoVuwF4a043m22Sid4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111027'),
  ('986662785706885686', 'The Rye Horn', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jaione Camborda, Rui Poças', 'Jaione Camborda', 'Janet Novás, Siobhan Fernandes, Carla Rivas, Daniela Hernán Marchán, Diego Anido, María Lado, Julia Gómez, José Navarro', null, 'Maria is a shellfisherwoman and midwife in a small village in the Illa de Arousa in 1970s Galicia. After an unexpected event, she is forced to flee to Portugal.', 'Maria is a shellfisherwoman and midwife in a small village in the Illa de Arousa in 1970s Galicia. After an unexpected event, she is forced to flee to Portugal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aj69iGogPWnDz7mJigZj0olq9KW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816888'),
  ('605049755333732099', 'The Sacrament', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ti West, Eric Robbins', 'Ti West', 'Joe Swanberg, AJ Bowen, Kentucker Audley, Gene Jones, Amy Seimetz, Kate Forbes, Conphidance, Derek Roberts', 'R', 'Two journalists set out to document their friend''s journey to reunite with his estranged sister. They track her to an undisclosed location where they are welcomed into the remote world of "Eden Parish," a self-sustained rural utopia composed of nearly two hundred members and overseen by a mysterious leader known only as "Father." It quickly becomes evident to the newcomers that this paradise may not be as it seems. Eden Parish harbors a twisted secret. What started as just another documentary shoot soon becomes a fight for survival.', 'Two journalists set out to document their friend''s journey to reunite with his estranged sister. They track her to an undisclosed location where they are welcomed into the remote world of "Eden Parish," a self-sustained rural utopia composed of nearly two hundred members and overseen by a mysterious leader known only as "Father." It quickly becomes evident to the newcomers that this paradise may not be as it seems. Eden Parish harbors a twisted secret. What started as just another documentary shoot soon becomes a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thdioQOYqqusDUfT6trgwMIoNaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211067'),
  ('1140733314160075168', 'The Sacred Family', 2006, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Díaz, Sebastián Lelio, Paula del Fierro', 'Sebastián Lelio', 'Néstor Cantillana, Patricia López, Sergio Hernández, Coca Guazzini, Macarena Teke, Mauricio Diocares, Juan Pablo Miranda', 'NR', 'It''s Easter in the beach house of a Chilean well-to-do and nowadays family. A self-centered and successful father, a disoriented mother and a son overshadowed by his successful father. The three of them, wait for the arrival of the son''s first official girlfriend; a disturbing and rebellious young lady who will invade the house with her powerful sexual load and other "gifts", breaking loose an emotional cataclysm with no stepping back.', 'It''s Easter in the beach house of a Chilean well-to-do and nowadays family. A self-centered and successful father, a disoriented mother and a son overshadowed by his successful father. The three of them, wait for the arrival of the son''s first official girlfriend; a disturbing and rebellious young lady who will invade the house with her powerful sexual load and other "gifts", breaking loose an emotional cataclysm with no stepping back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9quwwH5h4C45kOQ4J7jVsMnepZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83887'),
  ('1065198007450976160', 'The Sacred Mound', 1993, 'Drama', 'Hrafn Gunnlaugsson, Per Källberg', 'Bo Jönsson, Hrafn Gunnlaugsson', 'Steinþór Rafn Matthíasson, Alda Sigurðardóttir, Helgi Skúlason, Tinna Finnbogadóttir, Valdimar Örn Flygenring, Agneta Prytz, Edda Björgvinsdóttir, Arne Nyberg', null, 'A seven-year-old boy is sent to a farm on a remote island, when his mother goes abroad. On the island the boy gets to know a twenty-year-old woman who seems willing to take on a mother''s role. But the boy is reaching an age of sexual awareness and instead of regarding her as a mother figure; he falls obsessively in love with her.', 'A seven-year-old boy is sent to a farm on a remote island, when his mother goes abroad. On the island the boy gets to know a twenty-year-old woman who seems willing to take on a mother''s role. But the boy is reaching an age of sexual awareness and instead of regarding her as a mother figure; he falls obsessively in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ee3Hh5SIJWTc8gzzuRsgaCeeaoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335710'),
  ('794420582254430894', 'The Sacred Spirit', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chema García Ibarra, Ion de Sosa', 'Chema García Ibarra', 'Nacho Fernández, Llum Arques, Joanna Valverde, Rocío Ibáñez, José Angel Asensio, Ainara Paredes, David Terol, Gorka Tszyu', null, 'José Manuel and the other members of the ufology association Ovni-Levante meet weekly to exchange information about extraterrestrial messages and abductions. Julio, their leader, dies unexpectedly, leaving José Manuel as the only person who knows about the cosmic secret that could alter the human future.', 'José Manuel and the other members of the ufology association Ovni-Levante meet weekly to exchange information about extraterrestrial messages and abductions. Julio, their leader, dies unexpectedly, leaving José Manuel as the only person who knows about the cosmic secret that could alter the human future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJa3nYAaL9hzTG94jXNLUXKJgJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846779'),
  ('300763159002049259', 'The Sacrifice', 2020, 'War, History, Action, Drama', 'Liu Yin, Frant Gwo, Lu Yang', 'Gao Linyang, Guan Hu, Ge Rui', 'Zhang Yi, Wu Jing, Li Jiuxiao, Vision Wei, Deng Chao, Ou Hao, Qiu Tian, Zhou Siyu', null, 'In 1953 the Korean War is entering the final stage. The People''s Volunteer Army of China has launched its last major battle in Kumsong. In order to arrive on time and deliver enough ammo to the Kumsong front line, the soldiers have to defend themselves against the never ending bombardments of enemy bombers and race against time to repair the last bridge, all while facing supply shortages and with inferior equipment.', 'In 1953 the Korean War is entering the final stage. The People''s Volunteer Army of China has launched its last major battle in Kumsong. In order to arrive on time and deliver enough ammo to the Kumsong front line, the soldiers have to defend themselves against the never ending bombardments of enemy bombers and race against time to repair the last bridge, all while facing supply shortages and with inferior equipment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYP6pF7p71zcNpT5vJcMmOBEW8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748685'),
  ('45804656932434137', 'The Sacrifice Game', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jenn Wexler, Alexandre Bussière', 'Jenn Wexler, Sean Redlitz', 'Georgia Acken, Mena Massoud, Olivia Scott Welch, Gus Kenworthy, Chloë Levine, Derek Johns, Laurent Pitre, Madison Baines', 'NR', 'Christmas break, 1971. Samantha and Clara, two students who are staying behind for the holidays at their boarding school, must survive the night after the arrival of uninvited visitors.', 'Christmas break, 1971. Samantha and Clara, two students who are staying behind for the holidays at their boarding school, must survive the night after the arrival of uninvited visitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6w9Wphe5O5zySyoGxlYJ5irwh4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973471'),
  ('157886748073527720', 'The Sad Sack', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Jean Renoir, Jean Bachelet, Armand Pascal', 'Jean Renoir, Claude Heymann', 'Georges Pomiès, Michel Simon, Félix Oudart, Jean Storm, Paul Velsa, Louis Zellas, Fridette Fatton, Jeanne Helbling', null, 'The tale of a rich, flaky poet and his servant who both join the army and wind up in the same barracks.', 'The tale of a rich, flaky poet and his servant who both join the army and wind up in the same barracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7GisuYLzkxOhijaN70IEe1IjCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80486'),
  ('416538839848521143', 'The Sad Sack', 1957, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, Loyal Griggs, Charles C. Coleman', 'Edmund Beloin, Nate Monaster', 'Jerry Lewis, David Wayne, Phyllis Kirk, Peter Lorre, Joe Mantell, Gene Evans, George Dolenz, Liliane Montevecchi', 'NR', 'Private Meredith Bixby is so out of step in the Army that his six weeks of planned basic training has now stretched to 17 months. After he loses a tank, WAC Major Shelton, a psychologist, is assigned to make a good soldier out of him. She requests Corporal Dolan and Private Stan Wensalawsky to help with the training. Dolan and Stan both have scores to settle with Bixby and their "guidance" leads to more mishaps. Sergeant Pulley has them shipped out to Morocco. On leave in North Africa, Bixy wanders alone into a bar, has a few Moroccan Delights, which he thinks are malted milks, and becomes convinced that exotic singer-dancer Zita is THE girl for him.', 'Private Meredith Bixby is so out of step in the Army that his six weeks of planned basic training has now stretched to 17 months. After he loses a tank, WAC Major Shelton, a psychologist, is assigned to make a good soldier out of him. She requests Corporal Dolan and Private Stan Wensalawsky to help with the training. Dolan and Stan both have scores to settle with Bixby and their "guidance" leads to more mishaps. Sergeant Pulley has them shipped out to Morocco. On leave in North Africa, Bixy wanders alone into a bar, has a few Moroccan Delights, which he thinks are malted milks, and becomes convinced that exotic singer-dancer Zita is THE girl for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kroFIkdhrGqP3bpC7kaIAJ9xJ54.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43251'),
  ('929260450462702481', 'The Saddest Music in the World', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Guy Maddin, Richard O''Brien-Moran, Danielle Dumesnil', 'George Toles, Guy Maddin', 'Isabella Rossellini, Mark McKinney, Maria de Medeiros, David Fox, Ross McMillan, Louis Negin, Darcy Fehr, Claude Dorge', 'R', 'In Depression-era Winnipeg, a legless beer baroness hosts a contest for the saddest music in the world, offering a grand prize of $25,000.', 'In Depression-era Winnipeg, a legless beer baroness hosts a contest for the saddest music in the world, offering a grand prize of $25,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ATs79HpMv82hcPM3iv6kwugyDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37209'),
  ('1148325820210438296', 'The Sadist', 1963, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Landis, Vilmos Zsigmond, Rod Moss', 'James Landis', 'Arch Hall Jr., Richard Alden, Marilyn Manning, Helen Hovey, Don Russell, Arch Hall Sr., Joan Howard', 'NR', 'Three people driving into Los Angeles for a Dodgers game have car trouble and pull off into an old wrecking yard where they are held at bay by a bloodthirsty psycho and his crazy girlfriend.', 'Three people driving into Los Angeles for a Dodgers game have car trouble and pull off into an old wrecking yard where they are held at bay by a bloodthirsty psycho and his crazy girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3m1pUOGi568pXGNO3pQYi9ko8JR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29103'),
  ('1035108708993735667', 'The Sadist of Notre Dame', 1979, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jesús Franco, Raymond Heil', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco, Lina Romay, Olivier Mathot, Pierre Taylou, Antonio de Cabo, Nadine Pascal, France Nicolas, Claude Boisson', null, 'Jesus Franco directs and stars in this cut-copy-and-paste-version of one of his own movies. Here, he plays a mad priest going around killing sinful people in the name of God, all while trying to get a book published.', 'Jesus Franco directs and stars in this cut-copy-and-paste-version of one of his own movies. Here, he plays a mad priest going around killing sinful people in the name of God, all while trying to get a book published.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY8dGFHEisQMzuC8dKO2jhrbgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341457'),
  ('626601645646759506', 'The Sadistic Baron Von Klaus', 1962, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Ana Castor, Howard Vernon, Paula Martel, Georges Rollin, Hugo Blanco, Gogó Rojo, Fernando Delgado, Manuel Alexandre', null, 'In the eerie village of Holfen, a series of gruesome murders sparks rumors of a centuries-old curse, with a noble heir caught between suspicion and his own dark urges.', 'In the eerie village of Holfen, a series of gruesome murders sparks rumors of a centuries-old curse, with a noble heir caught between suspicion and his own dark urges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nWMIgBzyc2S3TKQ6bAFtV2tmSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53184'),
  ('540547248201417861', 'The Sadness', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bonnie Chen, Jie-Li Bai, Schiele Lee', 'Rob Jabbaz', 'Berant Zhu, Regina Lei, Wang Tzu-chiang, Apple Chen, Lan Wei-hua, Ralf Chiu, Lueh-Geng Huang, Emerson Tsai', 'R', 'A young couple is pushed to the limits of sanity as they attempt to be reunited amid the chaos of a pandemic outbreak. The streets erupt into violence and depravity, as those infected are driven to enact the most cruel and ghastly things imaginable.', 'A young couple is pushed to the limits of sanity as they attempt to be reunited amid the chaos of a pandemic outbreak. The streets erupt into violence and depravity, as those infected are driven to enact the most cruel and ghastly things imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mi5lh2brPMzuWYddyUKuCtcnjt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776797'),
  ('250683730392500181', 'The Safe House', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Patrick Lindenmaier, Lionel Baier, Aurelie Zemlic', 'Lionel Baier, Catherine Charrier', 'Dominique Reymond, Michel Blanc, William Lebghil, Aurélien Gabrielli, Liliane Rovère, Ethan Chimienti, Adrien Barazzone, Larisa Faber', null, 'An eccentric family portrait set during the May 1968 protests in Paris. A nine-year-old boy stays with his grandparents and uncles while his parents protest. When an illustrious guest seeks refuge in the apartment, the family’s dynamics change.', 'An eccentric family portrait set during the May 1968 protests in Paris. A nine-year-old boy stays with his grandparents and uncles while his parents protest. When an illustrious guest seeks refuge in the apartment, the family’s dynamics change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9xf19feljoQSQrTFmcrikID4Kq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266809'),
  ('620856204001525901', 'The Safety of Objects', 2002, 'Drama', 'Rose Troche, Enrique Chediak', 'Rose Troche', 'Glenn Close, Dermot Mulroney, Jessica Campbell, Patricia Clarkson, Joshua Jackson, Moira Kelly, Robert Klein, Timothy Olyphant', 'R', 'In a suburban landscape, the lives of several families interlace with loss, despair and personal crisis. Esther Gold has lost focus on all but caring for her comatose son, Paul, and neglects her daughter and husband. Lawyer Jim Train is devoted to his career, not his family. Helen Christianson wants to find a new spark in life, while Annette Jennings tries to rebuild hers.', 'In a suburban landscape, the lives of several families interlace with loss, despair and personal crisis. Esther Gold has lost focus on all but caring for her comatose son, Paul, and neglects her daughter and husband. Lawyer Jim Train is devoted to his career, not his family. Helen Christianson wants to find a new spark in life, while Annette Jennings tries to rebuild hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7w5Q2HP3dI6UbN59l3ZL55weir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24186'),
  ('375394644891012155', 'The Saga of Gösta Berling', 1924, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mauritz Stiller, Julius Jaenzon', 'Mauritz Stiller, Ragnar Hyltén-Cavallius', 'Greta Garbo, Lars Hanson, Gerda Lundequist, Karin Swanström, Jenny Hasselqvist, Mona Mårtenson, Sven Scholander, Ellen Hartman-Cederström', null, 'Gösta Berling is a young and attractive minister. Because of his alcoholism and his daring sermons, he is finally defrocked. He becomes a tutor of countess Marta''s stepdaughter and they fall in love. But the countess has a plan of her own.', 'Gösta Berling is a young and attractive minister. Because of his alcoholism and his daring sermons, he is finally defrocked. He becomes a tutor of countess Marta''s stepdaughter and they fall in love. But the countess has a plan of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BswfOz9qdy52WKdnwM6rGQIk5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38759'),
  ('347744556987075540', 'The Saga of the Viking Women and Their Voyage to the Waters of the Great Sea Serpent', 1957, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Roger Corman, Monroe P. Askins, Jack Bohrer', 'Lawrence L. Goldman', 'Abby Dalton, Richard Devon, Susan Cabot, Betsy Jones-Moreland, Jonathan Haze, Jay Sayer, Bradford Jackson, June Kenney', null, 'A group of Viking women build a ship and set off across the sea to locate their missing menfolk, only to fall into the clutches of the barbarian Grimolts who hold their men captive and worship the sea serpent which overturned their ship.', 'A group of Viking women build a ship and set off across the sea to locate their missing menfolk, only to fall into the clutches of the barbarian Grimolts who hold their men captive and worship the sea serpent which overturned their ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQ2BZf0K7jJOvBZqgVE0m7rFmnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85854'),
  ('124207711826550845', 'The Saga of Windwagon Smith', 1961, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Rex Allen, Rex Allen, Pat Brady, Tommy Doss, Hugh Farr, Karl Farr, J. Pat O''Malley, Lloyd Perryman', 'NR', 'Sea Captain Windwagon Smith hits Westport, Kansas, the starting point of the old Oregon and Santa Fe Trails, and is quickly the laughing stock of the town; instead of traveling in the usual oxen-drawn covered wagon, he is at the helm and wheel of a Contestoga-type wagon with a full set of sails. He plans to go to Oregon by taking advantage of the prairie winds. First, he wins over the town mayor, falls in love with the mayor''s beautiful daughter, Molly Crum, and then secures financial backing from the townspeople. He sets sail across the plains, with Molly Crum as a covered-wagon stowaway, and a Kansas twister looming on the horizon. And, then, the wind hits the sails. And the fan, too, if he had had one.', 'Sea Captain Windwagon Smith hits Westport, Kansas, the starting point of the old Oregon and Santa Fe Trails, and is quickly the laughing stock of the town; instead of traveling in the usual oxen-drawn covered wagon, he is at the helm and wheel of a Contestoga-type wagon with a full set of sails. He plans to go to Oregon by taking advantage of the prairie winds. First, he wins over the town mayor, falls in love with the mayor''s beautiful daughter, Molly Crum, and then secures financial backing from the townspeople. He sets sail across the plains, with Molly Crum as a covered-wagon stowaway, and a Kansas twister looming on the horizon. And, then, the wind hits the sails. And the fan, too, if he had had one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PL57svoiXOU36x8g0nfSX3aW4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56010'),
  ('396337119060655271', 'The Sailor Who Fell from Grace with the Sea', 1976, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lewis John Carlino, Douglas Slocombe, Anthony Waye', 'Lewis John Carlino', 'Sarah Miles, Kris Kristofferson, Jonathan Kahn, Margo Cunningham, Earl Rhodes, Paul Tropea, Gary Lock, Stephen Black', null, 'When a widowed mother falls in love with an American sailor, her troubled young son is pressured by the bullying leader of his clique to seek revenge.', 'When a widowed mother falls in love with an American sailor, her troubled young son is pressured by the bullying leader of his clique to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11JflHMNFgn84uH4B8YAh3Mgwah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92298'),
  ('183984705909638343', 'The Saimaa Gesture', 1981, 'Documentary, Music', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Mika Kaurismäki, Lasse Naukkarinen', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Mika Kaurismäki', 'Juice Leskinen, Vesa Sytelä, Safka Pekkonen, Petteri Salminen, Ila Louenranta, Jari Yliaho, Ismo Alanko, Jussi Kinnunen', null, 'A documentary film about a tour of three Finnish rock bands around Saimaa lake system in a steam boat in 1981. The bands (Juice Leskinen Slam, Eppu Normaali and Hassisen Kone) are shown playing songs in their gigs and, in between, the members give intimate interviews or just act plain silly and have a good time.', 'A documentary film about a tour of three Finnish rock bands around Saimaa lake system in a steam boat in 1981. The bands (Juice Leskinen Slam, Eppu Normaali and Hassisen Kone) are shown playing songs in their gigs and, in between, the members give intimate interviews or just act plain silly and have a good time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wfuBDM4QOhMTGrlvctRLL2sGMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148482'),
  ('914137246680531912', 'The Saint', 1997, 'Thriller, Action, Romance, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Phillip Noyce, Phil Meheux, Leslie Tomkins', 'Jonathan Hensleigh, Wesley Strick', 'Val Kilmer, Elisabeth Shue, Rade Šerbedžija, Henry Goodman, Alun Armstrong, Michael Byrne, Irina Apeksimova, Lev Prygunov', 'PG-13', 'Simon Templar (The Saint), is a thief for hire, whose latest job to steal the secret process for cold fusion puts him at odds with a traitor bent on toppling the Russian government, as well as the woman who holds its secret.', 'Simon Templar (The Saint), is a thief for hire, whose latest job to steal the secret process for cold fusion puts him at odds with a traitor bent on toppling the Russian government, as well as the woman who holds its secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k43wPAVeepqzGwP52dKcknQjquj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10003'),
  ('586344755932585828', 'The Saint', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Jesse Alexander, Tony Giglio', 'Adam Rayner, Eliza Dushku, Ian Ogilvy, James Remar, Roger Moore, Enrique Murciano, Thomas Kretschmann, Beatrice Rosen', 'PG-13', 'International master thief, Simon Templar, also known as The Saint, is asked by a desperate rich man to find his kidnapped daughter. However, in addition to evading the authorities, Simon must face a dangerous adversary from his past.', 'International master thief, Simon Templar, also known as The Saint, is asked by a desperate rich man to find his kidnapped daughter. However, in addition to evading the authorities, Simon must face a dangerous adversary from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8tsrPLem70exhXHfSausV7FlPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463906'),
  ('319946083830195768', 'The Saint in London', 1939, 'Mystery, Drama', 'John Paddy Carstairs, Claude Friese-Greene', 'Lynn Root, Frank Fenton', 'George Sanders, Sally Gray, David Burns, Gordon McLeod, Athene Seyler, Henry Oscar, John Abbott, Ralph Truman', 'NR', 'Suave soldier of fortune Simon Templer gets mixed up with a gang of counterfeiters who''ve murdered and robbed an European count of 1,000,000 pounds. He is aided reluctantly by Scotland Yard inspector Teal, who''s convinced that Templar himself pulled off the heist, and less reluctantly by light-fingered Dugan and dizzy socialite Penny Parker.', 'Suave soldier of fortune Simon Templer gets mixed up with a gang of counterfeiters who''ve murdered and robbed an European count of 1,000,000 pounds. He is aided reluctantly by Scotland Yard inspector Teal, who''s convinced that Templar himself pulled off the heist, and less reluctantly by light-fingered Dugan and dizzy socialite Penny Parker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cd9zyNy3wnnivh3kiEVOQuVV5wZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74545'),
  ('166223219164734197', 'The Saint in New York', 1938, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ben Holmes, Joseph H. August, Perry Ferguson', 'Charles Kaufman, Mortimer Offner', 'Louis Hayward, Kay Sutton, Sig Ruman, Jonathan Hale, Jack Carson, Paul Guilfoyle, Frederick Burton, Ben Welden', 'NR', 'A crime spree in New York forces the police commissioner to turn to Englishman Simon Templar, who fights lawlessness and corruption through unorthodox methods. Templar sets his sights on individual crimes bosses, and after bringing down two vicious leaders through disguise and deception, discovers that there is a mastermind behind all the city''s crime.', 'A crime spree in New York forces the police commissioner to turn to Englishman Simon Templar, who fights lawlessness and corruption through unorthodox methods. Templar sets his sights on individual crimes bosses, and after bringing down two vicious leaders through disguise and deception, discovers that there is a mastermind behind all the city''s crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj8KUoMJiwNmlOnvmde5pulQWLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47743'),
  ('1136185257734270550', 'The Saint In Palm Springs', 1941, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Jack Hively, Harry J. Wild, Carroll Clark', 'Jerome Cady', 'George Sanders, Wendy Barrie, Paul Guilfoyle, Jonathan Hale, Linda Hayes, Ferris Taylor, Harry Shannon, Eddie Dunn', 'NR', 'George Sanders makes his final appearance as crook-turned-detective Simon Templar, a.k.a. "The Saint," in The Saint in Palm Springs. The gimmick in this one is a set of rare stamps, smuggled from England. Wendy Barrie is the true heir to this treasure, and the Saint is engaged to protect her and the stamps. Our hero meets Barrie in a posh Palm Springs resort, where a gang of homicidal thieves have converged to relieve the girl of her inheritance. Three murders and one kidnapping attempt later, the villains are foiled by the Saint, with the aid of his onetime partner in crime Pearly Gates (Paul Guilfoyle). The Saint in Palm Springs is the sixth in RKO''s series of films based on the character created by Leslie Charteris.', 'George Sanders makes his final appearance as crook-turned-detective Simon Templar, a.k.a. "The Saint," in The Saint in Palm Springs. The gimmick in this one is a set of rare stamps, smuggled from England. Wendy Barrie is the true heir to this treasure, and the Saint is engaged to protect her and the stamps. Our hero meets Barrie in a posh Palm Springs resort, where a gang of homicidal thieves have converged to relieve the girl of her inheritance. Three murders and one kidnapping attempt later, the villains are foiled by the Saint, with the aid of his onetime partner in crime Pearly Gates (Paul Guilfoyle). The Saint in Palm Springs is the sixth in RKO''s series of films based on the character created by Leslie Charteris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKGqbKpvCeqw2LyxPhI30lINrUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74547'),
  ('179230021563618801', 'The Saint Inspector', 1996, 'Animation', 'Mike Booth, Fred Reed', 'Mike Booth', null, null, 'A buddha-like figure meditating on a high platform is fussily scrutinized by a whirring, clicking, mechanical bureaucrat.', 'A buddha-like figure meditating on a high platform is fussily scrutinized by a whirring, clicking, mechanical bureaucrat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbzuKOfMUAB1DhHVccwHQDJUhL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68886'),
  ('949570159445902158', 'The Saint of Fort Washington', 1993, 'Drama', 'Tim Hunter, Frederick Elmes', 'Lyle Kessler', 'Danny Glover, Matt Dillon, Rick Aviles, Nina Siemaszko, Ving Rhames, Adam Trese, Joe Seneca, Bahni Turpin', null, 'Matthew, a young schizophrenic, finds himself out on the street when a slumlord tears down his apartment building. Soon, he finds himself in even more dire straits, when he is threatened by Little Leroy, a thug who is one of the tough denizens of the Fort Washington Shelter for Men. He reaches out to Jerry, a streetwise combat veteran, who takes Matthew under his wing as a son. The relationship between these two men grows as they attempt to conquer the numbing isolation of homelessness.', 'Matthew, a young schizophrenic, finds himself out on the street when a slumlord tears down his apartment building. Soon, he finds himself in even more dire straits, when he is threatened by Little Leroy, a thug who is one of the tough denizens of the Fort Washington Shelter for Men. He reaches out to Jerry, a streetwise combat veteran, who takes Matthew under his wing as a son. The relationship between these two men grows as they attempt to conquer the numbing isolation of homelessness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8ie1x22wFEo63LQBbpBDqIH4oY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56583'),
  ('192891981826730501', 'The Saint of Gamblers', 1995, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Wong Jing', 'Eric Kot Man-Fai, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Diana Pang Dan, Donnie Yen, Ashton Chen, Corey Yuen', null, 'Blackie Tat looks for a new Saint of Gamblers, and finds him in the form of a dimwitted mainlander.', 'Blackie Tat looks for a new Saint of Gamblers, and finds him in the form of a dimwitted mainlander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQbnF2uefQqq59MWLKXpJgV7fqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91007'),
  ('698972446945597470', 'The Saint Strikes Back', 1939, 'Mystery, Crime', 'John Farrow, Frank Redman, Roy Webb', 'John Twist', 'George Sanders, Wendy Barrie, Jonathan Hale, Jerome Cowan, Barry Fitzgerald, Neil Hamilton, Robert Elliott, Russell Hopton', 'NR', 'Suave private detective Simon "The Saint" Templar arrives in San Francisco and meets Val, a woman whose police inspector father killed himself after being accused of corruption and dismissed from the force. Convinced of the man''s innocence, Templar takes it upon himself to vindicate the memory of Val''s father. To do so he must take on the city''s most dangerous criminal gang, while also battling hostile members of the police department.', 'Suave private detective Simon "The Saint" Templar arrives in San Francisco and meets Val, a woman whose police inspector father killed himself after being accused of corruption and dismissed from the force. Convinced of the man''s innocence, Templar takes it upon himself to vindicate the memory of Val''s father. To do so he must take on the city''s most dangerous criminal gang, while also battling hostile members of the police department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iu69qjh9jPcOJn6UglqTKCbye2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47744'),
  ('104869919091333669', 'The Saint Takes Over', 1940, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Jack Hively, Frank Redman', 'Lynn Root, Frank Fenton', 'George Sanders, Wendy Barrie, Jonathan Hale, Paul Guilfoyle, Morgan Conway, Robert Emmett Keane, Cy Kendall, James Burke', 'NR', 'The Saint Takes Over, released in 1940 by RKO Pictures, was the fifth motion picture featuring the adventures of Simon Templar, a.k.a. "The Saint" the Robin Hood-inspired crimefighter created by Leslie Charteris. This film focuses on the character of Inspector Henry Farnack. When Farnack is framed by a gang he is investigating, it is up to The Saint to clear his name.', 'The Saint Takes Over, released in 1940 by RKO Pictures, was the fifth motion picture featuring the adventures of Simon Templar, a.k.a. "The Saint" the Robin Hood-inspired crimefighter created by Leslie Charteris. This film focuses on the character of Inspector Henry Farnack. When Farnack is framed by a gang he is investigating, it is up to The Saint to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iodpZwq09hNPJwkcySmkfgMJeuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54756'),
  ('546732823284078380', 'The Saint''s Double Trouble', 1940, 'Crime, Mystery', 'J. Roy Hunt, Jack Hively', 'Ben Holmes', 'George Sanders, Helene Reynolds, Jonathan Hale, Bela Lugosi, Donald MacBride, John F. Hamilton, Thomas W. Ross, Elliott Sullivan', 'NR', 'Reformed jewel thief Simon Templar lands in hot water when a look-alike smuggles stolen goods out of Egypt.', 'Reformed jewel thief Simon Templar lands in hot water when a look-alike smuggles stolen goods out of Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9Pb1AJ3jfynF75IAzu12UOtdJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45571'),
  ('1015464674539614196', 'The Saint''s Return', 1953, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Seymour Friedman, Jimmy Sangster, Walter J. Harvey', 'Allan MacKinnon', 'Louis Hayward, Naomi Chance, Sydney Tafler, Charles Victor, Jane Carr, Harold Lang, William Russell, Diana Dors', null, 'A private detective goes after the people who murdered his girlfriend.', 'A private detective goes after the people who murdered his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEY04M2vDvLHjuCrpbvGGFldakr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83659'),
  ('986507492669350414', 'The Salamander', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alain Tanner, Renato Berta, Sandro Bernardoni', 'John Berger, Alain Tanner', 'Bulle Ogier, Jean-Luc Bideau, Jacques Denis, Véronique Alain, Dominique Catton, Daniel Stuffel, Marblum Jequier, Marcel Vidal', null, 'Pierre and Paul, journalist and writer respectively, team up to write a screenplay based on the real story of a young woman accused by her uncle of trying to kill him. They decide to meet her.', 'Pierre and Paul, journalist and writer respectively, team up to write a screenplay based on the real story of a young woman accused by her uncle of trying to kill him. They decide to meet her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dx6Pm0akwdxWo3wfIPhp6TWLiVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62978'),
  ('149415961574615759', 'The Salamander', 1981, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Marcello Gatti, Peter Zinner, Tony Brandt', 'Robert Katz', 'Franco Nero, Anthony Quinn, Martin Balsam, Claudia Cardinale, Sybil Danning, Christopher Lee, Cleavon Little, Paul L. Smith', 'NR', 'An Italian policeman investigates a series of murders involving people in prominent positions. Left behind at each murder scene is a drawing of a salamander. The policeman begins to suspect these murders are linked to a plot to seize control of the government.', 'An Italian policeman investigates a series of murders involving people in prominent positions. Left behind at each murder scene is a drawing of a salamander. The policeman begins to suspect these murders are linked to a plot to seize control of the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EF8FzjXCAFZWugLWaXmvuUb5xV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157286'),
  ('939316517664076024', 'The Salesman', 2011, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Pilote, Michel La Veaux', 'Sébastien Pilote', 'Gilbert Sicotte, Nathalie Cavezzali, Jérémy Tessier, Jean-François Boudreau, Pierre Leblanc, Pierre Mailloux, Sébastien Harvey, Alain Cadieux', null, 'With an enthralling central performance by Gilbert Sicotte, this masterful debut feature examines the life of the top car salesman in a fading Quebec town as events challenge the 67-year-old’s sense of identity and the meaning of life at the most profound level.', 'With an enthralling central performance by Gilbert Sicotte, this masterful debut feature examines the life of the top car salesman in a fading Quebec town as events challenge the 67-year-old’s sense of identity and the meaning of life at the most profound level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSoae3FtktC2fP6xVVTiTk9kYH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81658'),
  ('440440301167842414', 'The Salesman', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Somayeh Mirshamsi, Kaveh Sajjadi, Amin Khankal', 'Asghar Farhadi', 'Shahab Hosseini, Taraneh Alidoosti, Babak Karimi, Mina Sadati, Mehdi Koushki, Farid Sajjadi Hosseini, Maral Baniadam, Mojtaba Pirzadeh', 'PG-13', 'Forced out of their apartment due to dangerous works on a neighboring building, Emad and Rana move into a new flat in the center of Tehran. An incident linked to the previous tenant will dramatically change the young couple’s life.', 'Forced out of their apartment due to dangerous works on a neighboring building, Emad and Rana move into a new flat in the center of Tehran. An incident linked to the previous tenant will dramatically change the young couple’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4PIuYU5ZMMXiTrheNR8vCTYPBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375315'),
  ('1002576355607658593', 'The Salt of Life', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Gian Enrico Bianchi, Matilde Barbagallo', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Valerio Attanasio', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Valeria De Franciscis, Alfonso Santagata, Elisabetta Piccolomini, Valéria Cavalli, Aylin Prandi, Kristina Cepraga, Michelangelo Ciminale', null, 'Gianni is sixty. He is retired but has not become lazy for all that. In fact he is a helpful fellow who gives a hand to all those who need one: shopping for his wife, walking the pretty neighbor''s dog, and so on. Everybody likes Gianni, but is it for the right reasons? Doesn''t his wife profit by the situation (she still works so it is only logical that Gianni do all the chores)? Isn''t he subject to the excruciating whims of his rich mother?... Sure, everybody LIKES Gianni, but who LOVES him? Agreed, being kind to them, he is the ladies pet, but he does not attract them anymore. That is why, when his macho lawyer friend Alfonso blames him for not having young mistresses "like every other senior Italian male", Gianni, who is beginning to ask himself questions about what it is like to become old, starts chasing dames.', 'Gianni is sixty. He is retired but has not become lazy for all that. In fact he is a helpful fellow who gives a hand to all those who need one: shopping for his wife, walking the pretty neighbor''s dog, and so on. Everybody likes Gianni, but is it for the right reasons? Doesn''t his wife profit by the situation (she still works so it is only logical that Gianni do all the chores)? Isn''t he subject to the excruciating whims of his rich mother?... Sure, everybody LIKES Gianni, but who LOVES him? Agreed, being kind to them, he is the ladies pet, but he does not attract them anymore. That is why, when his macho lawyer friend Alfonso blames him for not having young mistresses "like every other senior Italian male", Gianni, who is beginning to ask himself questions about what it is like to become old, starts chasing dames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwaW8GlkydCtNDNfiNDXWsXmSZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56959'),
  ('232019211531538959', 'The Salt of Tears', 2020, 'Drama', 'Laura Tuillier, Paolo Trotta, Laetitia Dom', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Philippe Garrel, Arlette Langmann', 'Logann Antuofermo, Oulaya Amamra, Louise Chevillotte, Souheila Yacoub, André Wilms, Aline Belibi, Martin Mesnier, Teddy Chawa', null, 'Luc travels to Paris for the first time to sit the entrance exam for a carpentry school. There he meets Djemila, a young worker with whom he enjoys a short romance, before returning to his home town and beginning a relationship with Geneviève, whom he has known since childhood. Caught between two passions, Luc runs, resolving to fulfil his father''s dreams by devoting himself to his future... until finally, he experiences true love.', 'Luc travels to Paris for the first time to sit the entrance exam for a carpentry school. There he meets Djemila, a young worker with whom he enjoys a short romance, before returning to his home town and beginning a relationship with Geneviève, whom he has known since childhood. Caught between two passions, Luc runs, resolving to fulfil his father''s dreams by devoting himself to his future... until finally, he experiences true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olm8W60bpxKRp8yOQLs4We02ioN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574094'),
  ('912156659567629848', 'The Salt of the Earth', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Juliano Ribeiro Salgado, Wim Wenders, Juliano Ribeiro Salgado', 'Wim Wenders, Juliano Ribeiro Salgado, Camille Delafon', 'Sebastião Salgado, Wim Wenders, Juliano Ribeiro Salgado, Hugo Barbier, Lélia Wanick Salgado, Jacques Barthélémy, Régis Muller, João Pessoa Mattos', 'PG-13', 'During the last forty years, the photographer Sebastião Salgado has been travelling through the continents, in the footsteps of an ever-changing humanity. He has witnessed the major events of our recent history: international conflicts, starvations and exodus… He is now embarking on the discovery of pristine territories, of the wild fauna and flora, of grandiose landscapes: a huge photographic project which is a tribute to the planet''s beauty. Salgado''s life and work are revealed to us by his son, Juliano, who went with him during his last journeys, and by Wim Wenders, a photographer himself.', 'During the last forty years, the photographer Sebastião Salgado has been travelling through the continents, in the footsteps of an ever-changing humanity. He has witnessed the major events of our recent history: international conflicts, starvations and exodus… He is now embarking on the discovery of pristine territories, of the wild fauna and flora, of grandiose landscapes: a huge photographic project which is a tribute to the planet''s beauty. Salgado''s life and work are revealed to us by his son, Juliano, who went with him during his last journeys, and by Wim Wenders, a photographer himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRmQNj8NacAHJnzwfvFvglKSGB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265297'),
  ('679917059496218454', 'The Salt Path', 2025, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Marianne Elliott, Dixie Chassay', 'Rebecca Lenkiewicz', 'Gillian Anderson, Jason Isaacs, James Lance, Hermione Norris, Rebecca Ineson, Tucker St. Ivany, Denis Lill, Angus Wright', 'NR', 'A couple lose their home and later discover the husband has been diagnosed with a terminal illness as they embark on a year long coastal trek.', 'A couple lose their home and later discover the husband has been diagnosed with a terminal illness as they embark on a year long coastal trek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBtmFkjzPzd6KvNgoJwwsm1nyXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127625'),
  ('865883921621709173', 'The Salton Sea', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'D.J. Caruso, Amir Mokri, Tony Adler', 'Tony Gayton', 'Val Kilmer, Vincent D''Onofrio, Adam Goldberg, Luis Guzmán, Doug Hutchison, Anthony LaPaglia, Glenn Plummer, Peter Sarsgaard', 'R', 'After the murder of his beloved wife, a man in search of redemption is set adrift in a world where nothing is as it seems. On his journey, he befriends slacker Jimmy "The Finn", becomes involved in rescuing his neighbor Colette from her own demons, and gets entangled in a web of deceit full of unexpected twists and turns.', 'After the murder of his beloved wife, a man in search of redemption is set adrift in a world where nothing is as it seems. On his journey, he befriends slacker Jimmy "The Finn", becomes involved in rescuing his neighbor Colette from her own demons, and gets entangled in a web of deceit full of unexpected twists and turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3InMSlLUNBEdQTKazMdyVP1ryX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11468'),
  ('427068544296870193', 'The Salvation', 2014, 'Drama, Western', 'Robyn Glaser, David Tumahole, Andre Weavind', 'Kristian Levring, Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Eva Green, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Mikael Persbrandt, Éric Cantona, Douglas Henshall, Michael Raymond-James, Jonathan Pryce', 'R', 'In 1870s America, a peaceful American settler kills his family''s murderer which unleashes the fury of a notorious gang leader. His cowardly fellow townspeople then betray him, forcing him to hunt down the outlaws alone.', 'In 1870s America, a peaceful American settler kills his family''s murderer which unleashes the fury of a notorious gang leader. His cowardly fellow townspeople then betray him, forcing him to hunt down the outlaws alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQsv3OI8UT6s9Rn3C0WxO24bnEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266285'),
  ('245673212135692378', 'The Salvation Hunters', 1925, 'Drama', 'Josef von Sternberg, Edward Gheller', 'Josef von Sternberg', 'George K. Arthur, Georgia Hale, Bruce Guerin, Otto Matieson, Nellie Bly Baker, Olaf Hytten, Stuart Holmes', null, 'A hopelessly hopeful drifter, a bitter young woman, and a helpless child live on the docks, spending their days in poverty and listless wandering. Overhead, a dredge hauls up mud and trash from the nearby seabed-- the same mud and trash from the day before. They finally decide to leave for the city to seek fulfillment, only to encounter further privation, destitution, temptation.', 'A hopelessly hopeful drifter, a bitter young woman, and a helpless child live on the docks, spending their days in poverty and listless wandering. Overhead, a dredge hauls up mud and trash from the nearby seabed-- the same mud and trash from the day before. They finally decide to leave for the city to seek fulfillment, only to encounter further privation, destitution, temptation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/As8KmNf1bLLLTUqywGqY17zI6WA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105539'),
  ('474660189851266127', 'The Salvation Of The World As We Know It', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Til Schweiger, René Richter', 'Til Schweiger, Lo Malinke', 'Til Schweiger, Emilio Sakraya, Bettina Lamprecht, Emma Schweiger, Tijan Marei, Maya Lauterbach, Herbert Knaup, Emily Cox', null, 'At first glance, Paul is just a normal eighteen-year-old. What no one knows is that Paul is bipolar. He is helplessly at the mercy of the radical mood swings in his brain. When a depressive episode ends in a suicide attempt, his single father Hardy has to commit him to a therapy center for mentally ill teenagers. At the clinic, Paul meets teenagers who are also struggling with mental problems. He has to make a decision: Does he continue to run away from his illness?', 'At first glance, Paul is just a normal eighteen-year-old. What no one knows is that Paul is bipolar. He is helplessly at the mercy of the radical mood swings in his brain. When a depressive episode ends in a suicide attempt, his single father Hardy has to commit him to a therapy center for mentally ill teenagers. At the clinic, Paul meets teenagers who are also struggling with mental problems. He has to make a decision: Does he continue to run away from his illness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xirOA3MYZSjYhMak5nisbZA80cp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896483'),
  ('252986335719164457', 'The Salzburg Connection', 1972, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lee H. Katzin, Wolfgang Treu', 'Edward Anhalt, Oscar Millard', 'Barry Newman, Anna Karina, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Karen Jensen, Joe Maross, Wolfgang Preiss, Helmut Schmid, Udo Kier', null, 'An American lawyer on vacation in Europe is asked by a book publisher to stop by the Austrian town of Salzburg to see a photographer who''s taking pictures for a book on picturesque Austrian lakes. Upon his arrival he senses that something is wrong when the photographer seems to have vanished, leaving a near panic-stricken wife and a sinister, secretive brother. Before he knows it, the lawyer finds himself mixed up with spies, assassins, and the hunt for a list made up by the Nazis during World War II of people who collaborated with them.', 'An American lawyer on vacation in Europe is asked by a book publisher to stop by the Austrian town of Salzburg to see a photographer who''s taking pictures for a book on picturesque Austrian lakes. Upon his arrival he senses that something is wrong when the photographer seems to have vanished, leaving a near panic-stricken wife and a sinister, secretive brother. Before he knows it, the lawyer finds himself mixed up with spies, assassins, and the hunt for a list made up by the Nazis during World War II of people who collaborated with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVuYFgxvcsvUH0ip59jgPBpTQkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359611'),
  ('457436415701618043', 'The Samaritan', 2012, 'Thriller', 'David Weaver, François Dagenais, Avrel Fisher', 'Elan Mastai, David Weaver', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Luke Kirby, Ruth Negga, Tom Wilkinson, A.C. Peterson, Gil Bellows, Aaron Poole, Tom McCamus', 'R', 'After twenty years in prison, Foley is finished with the grifter''s life. When he meets an elusive young woman named Iris, the possibility of a new start looks real. But his past is proving to be a stubborn companion.', 'After twenty years in prison, Foley is finished with the grifter''s life. When he meets an elusive young woman named Iris, the possibility of a new start looks real. But his past is proving to be a stubborn companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oimc19nfcUTPveC85EhPyQUQ3CE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98339'),
  ('899762165283082730', 'THE SAMCA FILE', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'George ve Gänaeaard, Horia Cucuta', 'George ve Gänaeaard, Horia Cucuta, Matthew Michael Morrison', 'Dana Marineci, Razvan Ilie, Alin Florea, Silviu Debu, Emilian Oprea', null, '15 years after 3 bizarre murders shook a small provincial town, a team of documentary filmmakers revisit the case, confronting theories of a satanic cult, local conspiracies, and the terrifying possibility of a killer still on the loose.', '15 years after 3 bizarre murders shook a small provincial town, a team of documentary filmmakers revisit the case, confronting theories of a satanic cult, local conspiracies, and the terrifying possibility of a killer still on the loose.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fs1OL1p3VtLsLb2BqQ8z0Z46ohbk.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-samca-file'),
  ('856647451798786919', 'The Samurai', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Till Kleinert, Martin Hanslmayr', 'Till Kleinert', 'Michel Diercks, Pit Bukowski, Uwe Preuss, Kaja Blachnik, Ulrike Hanke-Haensch, Christopher Kane, Ulrike Bliefert', 'NR', 'Jakob, a young policeman from a remote village, has his world unhinged when a stranger in a dress emerges from the forest and begins killing villagers with a sword.', 'Jakob, a young policeman from a remote village, has his world unhinged when a stranger in a dress emerges from the forest and begins killing villagers with a sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Bfxo1tuW4fApjJAh8vcYK0Rbrj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254007'),
  ('482611033492155452', 'The Samurai I Loved', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Mitsuo Kurotsuchi, Shinji Kugimiya', 'Mitsuo Kurotsuchi', 'Matsumoto Kōshirō X, Yoshino Kimura, Koji Imada, Ryo Fukawa, Mieko Harada, Ken Ogata, Yuko Nakamura, Yoji Tanaka', null, 'A young samurai stuck at the bottom of the hierarchical order attempts to rescue his childhood sweetheart from an evil clan lord after learning of a plot to kill her and her infant child. Bunshiro Maki is a skilled swordfighter who''s lethal with a blade, yet still can''t rise through the ranks of the system. After his father is accused of plotting against his clan and forced to commit ritual suicide, his longtime love Fuku is sent to Edo to become the clan lord''s concubine. A few years later, Fuku has bore the clan lord a son. When Maki learns that the clan has hatched a plan to kill Fuku and her son to secure succession to the throne, he recruits two childhood friends to help thwart the diabolical plot.', 'A young samurai stuck at the bottom of the hierarchical order attempts to rescue his childhood sweetheart from an evil clan lord after learning of a plot to kill her and her infant child. Bunshiro Maki is a skilled swordfighter who''s lethal with a blade, yet still can''t rise through the ranks of the system. After his father is accused of plotting against his clan and forced to commit ritual suicide, his longtime love Fuku is sent to Edo to become the clan lord''s concubine. A few years later, Fuku has bore the clan lord a son. When Maki learns that the clan has hatched a plan to kill Fuku and her son to secure succession to the throne, he recruits two childhood friends to help thwart the diabolical plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnSVO8S3VFFbF8eDjekPh7sDZFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56661'),
  ('295040264322517676', 'The Sanatorium', 2010, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Federico Lang, Miguel Alejandro Gomez', 'Miguel Alejandro Gomez, Antonio Chamu', 'Luis Carlos Bogantes, Kurt Dyer, María Luisa Garita, Olger González, Kabek Gutierrez, Álvaro Marenco, Pablo Masís, Allen Obando Pinkay', null, 'A group of friends decide to make a documentary about the ghosts that are supposed to be haunting The Sanatorium in Costa Rica, things get creepy when the arrive to the place.', 'A group of friends decide to make a documentary about the ghosts that are supposed to be haunting The Sanatorium in Costa Rica, things get creepy when the arrive to the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bncTqAs913QNuEq8CGPOTNopfh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203151'),
  ('777940210358797074', 'The Sand', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Isaac Gabaeff, Matt Wise', 'Ben Powell, Alex Greenfield', 'Brooke Serene Butler, Cleo Berry, Cynthia Murell, Dean Geyer, Meagan Holder, Mitchel Musso, Nikki Leigh, Hector David Jr.', null, 'After an all-night graduation beach party, a group of hung-over students wakes up under the blazing sun to find their numbers somewhat depleted. An enormous alien creature has burrowed down deep and anyone foolish enough to make contact with the sand finds themselves at the mercy of a sea of flesh-eating tentacles. Will they ever be able to escape its carnivorous clutches?', 'After an all-night graduation beach party, a group of hung-over students wakes up under the blazing sun to find their numbers somewhat depleted. An enormous alien creature has burrowed down deep and anyone foolish enough to make contact with the sand finds themselves at the mercy of a sea of flesh-eating tentacles. Will they ever be able to escape its carnivorous clutches?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiahhUWOvxUhH0QAj1hb5NDcWj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347847'),
  ('824009181014216084', 'The Sand Bath', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'A middle-aged man bare chest and wearing trousers, clears a shallow trench in the sand while a young woman draped in a long, flimsy veil looks on. The man leaves, but stays in the nearby wood at a watching distance, glancing at the girl divesting of her robe, sitting in the trench as if to sunbathe. She shifts positions a couple of times, but then the man returns, and starts covering her with sand. Unhappy, the girl gets up, picks a flask of lotion from the trench, and leaves with the man.', 'A middle-aged man bare chest and wearing trousers, clears a shallow trench in the sand while a young woman draped in a long, flimsy veil looks on. The man leaves, but stays in the nearby wood at a watching distance, glancing at the girl divesting of her robe, sitting in the trench as if to sunbathe. She shifts positions a couple of times, but then the man returns, and starts covering her with sand. Unhappy, the girl gets up, picks a flask of lotion from the trench, and leaves with the man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXVlHjcbrE0XZ5Kw7QNDGMKtwkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196487'),
  ('107291893263536993', 'The Sand Castle', 1977, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Co Hoedeman', null, null, null, 'This short animated film features the sandman and the creatures he sculpts out of sand. These lively creatures build a castle and celebrate the completion of their new home, only to be interrupted by an uninvited guest. Cleverly constructed with nuance, the film leaves interpretation open to the viewer. The film took home an Oscar® for Best Animated Short Film.', 'This short animated film features the sandman and the creatures he sculpts out of sand. These lively creatures build a castle and celebrate the completion of their new home, only to be interrupted by an uninvited guest. Cleverly constructed with nuance, the film leaves interpretation open to the viewer. The film took home an Oscar® for Best Animated Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJSZhwCY8ujgA7CVSLL1T5SxsD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148514'),
  ('1074861023500924541', 'The Sand Castle', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Fantasy', 'Matty Brown, Jeremy Snell', 'Matty Brown, Hend Fakhroo, Yassmina Karajah', 'Nadine Labaki, Ziad Bakri, Zain Al Rafeea, Riman Al Rafeea', 'PG-13', 'Stranded on a deserted island, a family of four scavenges for survival as their past unravels, sending them into a downward spiral of painful events.', 'Stranded on a deserted island, a family of four scavenges for survival as their past unravels, sending them into a downward spiral of painful events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paesE1W2WFqJEBNMFUszFVcuDsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1185719'),
  ('254293342139548342', 'The Sand Pebbles', 1966, 'Drama, War', 'Robert Wise, Joseph MacDonald, Ridgeway Callow', 'Robert Anderson', 'Steve McQueen, Richard Attenborough, Richard Crenna, Candice Bergen, Mako, Larry Gates, Charles Robinson, Simon Oakland', 'PG-13', 'Engineer Jake Holman arrives aboard the gunboat USS San Pablo, assigned to patrol a tributary of the Yangtze in the middle of exploited and revolution-torn 1926 China. His iconoclasm and cynical nature soon clash with the ''rice-bowl'' system which runs the ship and the uneasy symbiosis between Chinese and foreigner on the river. Hostility towards the gunboat''s presence reaches a climax when the boat must crash through a river-boom and rescue missionaries upriver at China Light Mission.', 'Engineer Jake Holman arrives aboard the gunboat USS San Pablo, assigned to patrol a tributary of the Yangtze in the middle of exploited and revolution-torn 1926 China. His iconoclasm and cynical nature soon clash with the ''rice-bowl'' system which runs the ship and the uneasy symbiosis between Chinese and foreigner on the river. Hostility towards the gunboat''s presence reaches a climax when the boat must crash through a river-boom and rescue missionaries upriver at China Light Mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muZyCXWoayEtwVkxc0ql48X1h6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5923'),
  ('556869263570621095', 'The Sandlot', 1993, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Anthony B. Richmond, David Mickey Evans, William M. Elvin', 'David Mickey Evans, Robert Gunter', 'Tom Guiry, Mike Vitar, Patrick Renna, Chauncey Leopardi, Marty York, Brandon Quintin Adams, Grant Gelt, James Earl Jones', 'PG', 'During a summer of friendship and adventure, one boy becomes a part of the gang, nine boys become a team and their leader becomes a legend by confronting the terrifying mystery beyond the right field wall.', 'During a summer of friendship and adventure, one boy becomes a part of the gang, nine boys become a team and their leader becomes a legend by confronting the terrifying mystery beyond the right field wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PYqz0viEuW8qTvuGinUMjDWMnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11528'),
  ('75846994230124204', 'The Sandlot 2', 2005, 'Family, Comedy', 'David Mickey Evans, David Pelletier, Ashley Bell', 'David Mickey Evans', 'Max Lloyd-Jones, James Willson, Samantha Burton, Brett Kelly, Cole Evan Weiss, Neilen Benvegnu, Sean Berdy, Jessica King', 'PG', 'A decade has passed in the small town where the original Sandlot gang banded together during the summer of ’62 to play baseball and battle the Beast. Now, back at the dugout, nine new kids descend on the diamond only to discover that a descendant of the Beast lives in Mr. Mertle’s backyard – a monster of mythical proportions known as ''The Great Fear''.', 'A decade has passed in the small town where the original Sandlot gang banded together during the summer of ’62 to play baseball and battle the Beast. Now, back at the dugout, nine new kids descend on the diamond only to discover that a descendant of the Beast lives in Mr. Mertle’s backyard – a monster of mythical proportions known as ''The Great Fear''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLc3jTAKAOCg7lBWp9vzyAJNLay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18500'),
  ('354165444462808952', 'The Sandlot: Heading Home', 2007, 'Family', 'William Dear, Trevor McWhinney, Pascal Jean Provost', 'Keith Mitchell, Allie Dvorin', 'Danny Nucci, Keanu Pires, Chauncey Leopardi, Sarah Deakins, Cole Heppell, Kai James, Brandon Olds, Cainan Wiebe', 'PG', 'A successful professional baseball player gets his ego in check when he travels back in time to his boyhood sandlot ball-playing days.', 'A successful professional baseball player gets his ego in check when he travels back in time to his boyhood sandlot ball-playing days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zK38pUotFcEhVhau22Og02OWQ8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21138'),
