  ('161340026932269760', 'The Sandman', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Peter Luisi', null, 'Fabian Krüger, Irene Brügger, Beat Schlatter, Florine Elena Deplazes, Kaspar Weiss, Michel Gammenthaler, Urs Jucker, This Moser', null, 'One fine morning, Benno finds sand in his bed. While he tries to ignore this at first, he soon must realize that he himself is loosing the sand.', 'One fine morning, Benno finds sand in his bed. While he tries to ignore this at first, he soon must realize that he himself is loosing the sand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UgL9OsMdJh5u6xeoP8yk0cvqLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70752'),
