  ('912586317273466596', 'The Sannikov Land', 1973, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Leonid Popov, Albert Mkrtchyan, Mikhail Koroptsov', 'Vladislav Fedoseyev, Mark Zakharov', 'Vladislav Dvorzhetsky, Georgiy Vitsin, Oleg Dal, Yuriy Nazarov, Makhmud Esambayev, Nikolai Gritsenko, Alyona Chukhray, Gregory Chepchyan', null, 'A group of people setting out to find a previously assumed land and upon reaching it, not knowing how to deal with the customs of the place, have to deal with all the consequences.', 'A group of people setting out to find a previously assumed land and upon reaching it, not knowing how to deal with the customs of the place, have to deal with all the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njw7cjjW0F7zqISkN2dhF0DUeTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57757'),
  ('347162063208036080', 'The Santa Class', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Lucie Guest, Justin Sebastian', 'Russell Hainline', 'Kimberley Sustad, Benjamin Ayres, Trevor Lerner, Lindsay Winch, Eric Pollins, Sheila Tyson, Peter Kelamis, Alessandro Miro', null, 'Kate North reluctantly takes over her father’s struggling Santa School, where she and a colleague discover an amnesiac Santa Claus and must help him regain his memories through their training program to save both the school and Christmas.', 'Kate North reluctantly takes over her father’s struggling Santa School, where she and a colleague discover an amnesiac Santa Claus and must help him regain his memories through their training program to save both the school and Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxgpLCC1TJIwLauSJo4hTokAJD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361225'),
  ('953296185725655439', 'The Santa Claus Gang', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Simone Rosso, Sophie Chiarello, Eufrosina Paglia', 'Giordano Preda, Valerio Bariletti, Giacomo Poretti', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Angela Finocchiaro, Giovanni Esposito, Sara D''Amario, Silvana Fallisi, Antónia Lišková', null, 'On Christmas Eve, three friends dressed as Santa Claus are arrested in what looks like an attempted burglary and charged with being the infamous "Santa Claus Gang". While trying to prove their innocence to the police, the trio explains why they found themselves in such a strange situation...', 'On Christmas Eve, three friends dressed as Santa Claus are arrested in what looks like an attempted burglary and charged with being the infamous "Santa Claus Gang". While trying to prove their innocence to the police, the trio explains why they found themselves in such a strange situation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPiRMJ2JrIy7ouEmoUcy7Q8rlub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58013'),
  ('149557260680417511', 'The Santa Clause', 1994, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Walt Lloyd, John Pasquin, Michael Johnson', 'Leo Benvenuti, Steve Rudnick', 'Tim Allen, Judge Reinhold, Wendy Crewson, Eric Lloyd, David Krumholtz, Larry Brandenburg, Mary Gross, Paige Tamada', 'PG', 'On Christmas Eve, divorced dad Scott Calvin and his son discover Santa Claus has fallen off their roof. When Scott takes the reins of the magical sleigh, he finds he is now the new Santa, and must convince a world of disbelievers, including himself.', 'On Christmas Eve, divorced dad Scott Calvin and his son discover Santa Claus has fallen off their roof. When Scott takes the reins of the magical sleigh, he finds he is now the new Santa, and must convince a world of disbelievers, including himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvV2rI60qOYELT7tHHLpxtafnBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11395'),
  ('812533310950386548', 'The Santa Clause 2', 2002, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Michael Lembeck, Adam Greenberg, Bruce Franklin', 'Don Rhymer, Cinco Paul, Ken Daurio', 'Tim Allen, Judge Reinhold, Wendy Crewson, Elizabeth Mitchell, David Krumholtz, Eric Lloyd, Spencer Breslin, Liliana Mumy', 'G', 'Better watch out! The big guy in red is coming to town once again. This time, Scott Calvin -- also known as Santa Claus -- finds out there''s an obscure clause in his contract requiring him to take on a wife. He has to leave the North Pole to fulfill his obligations, or else he''ll be forced to give up his Yuletide gig.', 'Better watch out! The big guy in red is coming to town once again. This time, Scott Calvin -- also known as Santa Claus -- finds out there''s an obscure clause in his contract requiring him to take on a wife. He has to leave the North Pole to fulfill his obligations, or else he''ll be forced to give up his Yuletide gig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EAMkz0z1pbr9weOY1Y7buy2AxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9021'),
  ('513151680504940739', 'The Santa Clause 3: The Escape Clause', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Michael Lembeck, Valerie Green, Luke Freeborn', 'Ed Decter, John J. Strauss', 'Tim Allen, Elizabeth Mitchell, Judge Reinhold, Wendy Crewson, Ann-Margret, Eric Lloyd, Spencer Breslin, Liliana Mumy', 'G', 'Now that Santa and Mrs. Claus have the North Pole running smoothly, the Counsel of Legendary Figures has called an emergency meeting on Christmas Eve! The evil Jack Frost has been making trouble, looking to take over the holiday! So he launches a plan to sabotage the toy factory and compel Scott to invoke the little-known Escape Clause and wish he''d never become Santa.', 'Now that Santa and Mrs. Claus have the North Pole running smoothly, the Counsel of Legendary Figures has called an emergency meeting on Christmas Eve! The evil Jack Frost has been making trouble, looking to take over the holiday! So he launches a plan to sabotage the toy factory and compel Scott to invoke the little-known Escape Clause and wish he''d never become Santa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvaWMSRzRwtcxyHKNLX6phiQp8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13767'),
  ('1002157130664652972', 'The Santa Con', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Melissa Joan Hart, Adrian Peng Correia', 'David Breckman', 'Barry Watson, Melissa Sagemiller, Scott Grimes, Tucker Meek, Melissa Joan Hart, Jaleel White, John Ratzenberger, Wendy Williams', null, 'Small-time con man Nick DeMarco is ordered by his parole officer to take a minimum-wage job as a department store Santa during the holidays...and he hates it. Near the end of his first shift, he hastily promises a young boy, Billy, that Santa will bring his estranged parents back together by Christmas. Nick decides to make good on his promise to the child, somehow. But after meeting the boy''s mother Carol, will Nick ultimately choose to put the happiness of others ahead of his own?', 'Small-time con man Nick DeMarco is ordered by his parole officer to take a minimum-wage job as a department store Santa during the holidays...and he hates it. Near the end of his first shift, he hastily promises a young boy, Billy, that Santa will bring his estranged parents back together by Christmas. Nick decides to make good on his promise to the child, somehow. But after meeting the boy''s mother Carol, will Nick ultimately choose to put the happiness of others ahead of his own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2KJSaES1D4697uatrqaLG6Xpwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311765'),
  ('755881025519833743', 'The Santa Squad', 2020, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'John Bradshaw', 'Mark Valenti', 'Rebecca Dalton, Aaron Ashmore, Jayne Eastwood, Michael Therriault, Paniz Zade, Chris Sandiford, Hattie Kragten, James Kall', 'NR', 'Allie, an out of work art teacher, has to accept a job with the Santa Squad to help wealthy widower Gordon and his two precious daughters rediscover the magic of Christmas. As Allie is lifting the holiday spirits of the family with Christmas decorations, cookies and shopping, her kindness is rewarded with the most unexpected of gifts: love!', 'Allie, an out of work art teacher, has to accept a job with the Santa Squad to help wealthy widower Gordon and his two precious daughters rediscover the magic of Christmas. As Allie is lifting the holiday spirits of the family with Christmas decorations, cookies and shopping, her kindness is rewarded with the most unexpected of gifts: love!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEl9MFJnZjwVn0MsZMpJ6xvk0h2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744949'),
  ('266864803733412586', 'The Santa Stakeout', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Peter Benson, Geoff Wallace', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Tamera Mowry-Housley, Paul Campbell, Joe Pantoliano, Peter Bryant, Tom Pickett, Liza Huget, David A. Kaye, Devon Alexander', 'G', 'Tanya is a police detective who is reluctantly partnered with fellow detective Ryan to solve a recent string of heists taking place during high-profile holiday parties around town.', 'Tanya is a police detective who is reluctantly partnered with fellow detective Ryan to solve a recent string of heists taking place during high-profile holiday parties around town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7H4cvUmGC4dQ60ViOrELatrrFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874238'),
  ('273969269505331028', 'The Santa Summit', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Suderman, Jeff Beesley', 'Russell Hainline', 'Hunter King, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Amy Groening, Stephanie Sy, Dan De Jaeger, Rodrigo Beilfuss, Adam Hurtig, Erik Athavale', 'G', 'Amidst a sea of Santas at their town''s annual Christmas celebration, three friends all find what they’re looking for: Christmas spirit, potential romance, and a strengthened bond of friendship.', 'Amidst a sea of Santas at their town''s annual Christmas celebration, three friends all find what they’re looking for: Christmas spirit, potential romance, and a strengthened bond of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mS7fQ7GQf8U3WYodaYgPZ8FLtgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142712'),
  ('884577759185970374', 'The Saphead', 1920, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Winchell Smith, Herbert Blaché, Harold Wenstrom', 'Bronson Howard, Victor Mapes, Winchell Smith', 'Buster Keaton, William H. Crane, Beulah Booker, Irving Cummings, Edward Jobson, Edward Connelly, Edward Alexander, Carol Holloway', null, 'Nick Van Alstyne owns the Henrietta silver mine and is very rich and his son Bertie is naive and spoiled. His daughter Rose is married to shady investor Mark. Mark wrecks Bertie''s wedding plans by making him take the blame for Mark''s illegitimate daughter, and also nearly ruins the family business by selling off some stock at too low a price.', 'Nick Van Alstyne owns the Henrietta silver mine and is very rich and his son Bertie is naive and spoiled. His daughter Rose is married to shady investor Mark. Mark wrecks Bertie''s wedding plans by making him take the blame for Mark''s illegitimate daughter, and also nearly ruins the family business by selling off some stock at too low a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1i7g4dGkV6oKxPpFJJYk2gVhh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51392'),
  ('643384401960255917', 'The Sapphires', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Warwick Thornton, Wayne Blair', 'Tony Briggs, Keith Thompson', 'Chris O''Dowd, Deborah Mailman, Jessica Mauboy, Shari Sebbens, Miranda Tapsell, Tory Kittles, Don Battee, Eka Darville', 'PG-13', 'It''s 1968, and four young, talented Australian Aboriginal girls learn about love, friendship, and war when they entertain the US troops in Vietnam as singing group The Sapphires.', 'It''s 1968, and four young, talented Australian Aboriginal girls learn about love, friendship, and war when they entertain the US troops in Vietnam as singing group The Sapphires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3249QNApOMITMcIrnt16ckxd8Z8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110146'),
  ('918452502589025312', 'The Saragossa Manuscript', 1966, 'Fantasy, Mystery, History', 'Mieczysław Jahoda, Wojciech Has, Halina Garus', 'Tadeusz Kwiatkowski', 'Zbigniew Cybulski, Iga Cembrzyńska, Elżbieta Czyżewska, Gustaw Holoubek, Stanisław Igar, Joanna Jędryka, Janusz Kłosiński, Bogumił Kobiela', null, 'During the Napoleonic wars, a Spanish officer and an opposing officer find a book written by the former''s grandfather.', 'During the Napoleonic wars, a Spanish officer and an opposing officer find a book written by the former''s grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6LnCMQUwsHWPTNDuUuuKR5zgjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8785'),
  ('926885617448688470', 'The Sasquatch Gang', 2006, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Tim Skousen, Munn Powell', 'Tim Skousen', 'Justin Long, Jeremy Sumpter, Addie Land, Joey Kern, Rob Pinkston, Michael Mitchell, Hubbel Palmer, Jon Gries', 'PG-13', 'Young fantasy and science fiction aficionado Gavin Gore and his friends stumble onto some huge footprints in the woods. A local cop, reporter, and a renowned Sasquatch authority investigate, while two of Gavin''s dim-witted neighbors hatch a scheme to profit from the situation.', 'Young fantasy and science fiction aficionado Gavin Gore and his friends stumble onto some huge footprints in the woods. A local cop, reporter, and a renowned Sasquatch authority investigate, while two of Gavin''s dim-witted neighbors hatch a scheme to profit from the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7Vnrik2tsozzG1DRfgIBmJvUCx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19033'),
  ('718155952503797852', 'The Satan Bug', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'John Sturges, Robert Surtees', 'James Clavell, Edward Anhalt', 'George Maharis, Richard Basehart, Anne Francis, Dana Andrews, John Larkin, Richard Bull, Frank Sutton, Ed Asner', 'NR', 'A US government germ warfare lab has had an accident. The first theory is that one of the germs has been released and killed several scientists. The big fear is that a more virulent strain, named The Satan Bug because all life can be killed off by it should it escape, may have been stolen.', 'A US government germ warfare lab has had an accident. The first theory is that one of the germs has been released and killed several scientists. The big fear is that a more virulent strain, named The Satan Bug because all life can be killed off by it should it escape, may have been stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMqA1ooDaqQqaifI5hnU7tw9hf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27709'),
  ('1051374786256110813', 'The Satanic Rites of Dracula', 1973, 'Horror', 'Alan Gibson, Brian Probyn, Derek Whitehurst', 'Don Houghton', 'Christopher Lee, Peter Cushing, Michael Coles, William Franklyn, Freddie Jones, Joanna Lumley, Richard Vernon, Barbara Yu Ling', 'R', 'The police and British security forces call in Professor Van Helsing to help them investigate Satanic ritual which has been occurring in a large country house, and which has been attended by a government minister, an eminent scientist and secret service chief. The owner of the house is a mysterious property tycoon who is found to be behind a sinister plot involving a deadly plague. It is in fact Dracula who, sick of his interminable existence, has decided that he must end it all in the only possible way- by destroying every last potential victim.', 'The police and British security forces call in Professor Van Helsing to help them investigate Satanic ritual which has been occurring in a large country house, and which has been attended by a government minister, an eminent scientist and secret service chief. The owner of the house is a mysterious property tycoon who is found to be behind a sinister plot involving a deadly plague. It is in fact Dracula who, sick of his interminable existence, has decided that he must end it all in the only possible way- by destroying every last potential victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixkF1HcgQ8wlafCok5hHzi3iYI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35669'),
  ('862649748998822983', 'The Satanist', 1968, 'Horror', 'Zoltan G. Spencer', null, 'Pat Barrington, Mary Bauer', null, 'A young couple''s marriage becomes threatened when an attractive female occultist enters their lives, enticing them into a strange world of drugs, sex, and satanic rites.', 'A young couple''s marriage becomes threatened when an attractive female occultist enters their lives, enticing them into a strange world of drugs, sex, and satanic rites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ApV0wV15w2vrTHpsCBHqqYmcnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282812'),
  ('1146506371951709568', 'The Satellite Girl and Milk Cow', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Chang Hyung-yun', 'Jeong Eun-kyeong, Park Jee-youn', 'Yoo Ah-in, Jung Yu-mi, Lee Don-yong, Hwang Seok-jeong, Chang Hyung-yun, Yeon Sang-ho, Hong Deok-pyo', null, 'Il-ho, a satellite girl, wants to learn about human emotions, and crash lands on Earth. She transforms into a human girl and tries to help Kyung-chun after he is transformed into a milk cow.', 'Il-ho, a satellite girl, wants to learn about human emotions, and crash lands on Earth. She transforms into a human girl and tries to help Kyung-chun after he is transformed into a milk cow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXDJwfaECWJvt3FBcUpb9LfLn7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252509'),
  ('315440377514399609', 'The Saturday Night Kid', 1929, 'Comedy, Romance', 'A. Edward Sutherland, Harry Fischbeck', null, 'Clara Bow, Jean Arthur, James Hall, Edna May Oliver, Charles Sellon, Ethel Wales, Hyman Meyer, Irving Bacon', 'NR', 'Mayme and sister Janie are salesgirls in Ginsberg''s Department Store. Mayme is in love with store clerk Bill, but Janie tries to steal him from her. Hazel, another salesgirl, is Jean Harlow''s first credited role.', 'Mayme and sister Janie are salesgirls in Ginsberg''s Department Store. Mayme is in love with store clerk Bill, but Janie tries to steal him from her. Hazel, another salesgirl, is Jean Harlow''s first credited role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meqBlRzgUBjLYfY8IeaBelm2OzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160795'),
  ('1011096667473242522', 'The Savage', 1952, 'Western, Action', 'George Marshall, John F. Seitz', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Charlton Heston, Susan Morrow, Peter Hansen, Joan Taylor, Richard Rober, Don Porter, Ted de Corsia, Ian MacDonald', null, 'The only white survivor of a Crow Indian raid on a wagon train is a young boy. He is rescued by the Sioux, and the Sioux chief raises him as an Indian in very way. Years later, the white men and the Sioux threaten to go to war and the Indian-raised white man is torn between his racial loyalties and his adopted tribe.', 'The only white survivor of a Crow Indian raid on a wagon train is a young boy. He is rescued by the Sioux, and the Sioux chief raises him as an Indian in very way. Years later, the white men and the Sioux threaten to go to war and the Indian-raised white man is torn between his racial loyalties and his adopted tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29J2vhwuQAbXLdKDaIfXfXWHs1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112067'),
  ('251706368019995963', 'The Savage Bees', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Bruce Geller, Scott U. Adam, Richard C. Glouner', 'Guerdon Trueblood', 'Ben Johnson, Michael Parks, Paul Hecht, Gretchen Corbett, Horst Buchholz, Bruce French, James Best, David L. Gray', 'NR', 'In this horror-drama the festive fun of the annual Mardi Gras celebration is brought to a halt when a swarm of African killer bees escape from a foreign freighter.', 'In this horror-drama the festive fun of the annual Mardi Gras celebration is brought to a halt when a swarm of African killer bees escape from a foreign freighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOav0HwhUnrooOpWtaOzwz583uy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29105'),
  ('1064636467095803384', 'The Savage Eye', 1960, 'Drama', 'Ben Maddow, Sidney Meyers, Joseph Strick', 'Ben Maddow, Sidney Meyers, Joseph Strick', 'Barbara Baxley, Gary Merrill, Herschel Bernardi, Jean Hidey, Elizabeth Zemach', null, 'Resentful after an ugly divorce from her unfaithful husband, Judith McGuire moves to Los Angeles. Adrift and detached, she spends her days and nights wandering through her new city, cynically remarking on the hypocrisy, vanity and brutality of the modern world and humanity''s alienation from themselves and each other.', 'Resentful after an ugly divorce from her unfaithful husband, Judith McGuire moves to Los Angeles. Adrift and detached, she spends her days and nights wandering through her new city, cynically remarking on the hypocrisy, vanity and brutality of the modern world and humanity''s alienation from themselves and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZF7ya6meVOlNS3Duq8jL6JVDxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49966'),
  ('1050617086191695348', 'The Savage Five', 1974, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Godfrey Ho, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Chen Kuan-Tai, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Wong Chung, Wai Wang, Wong Ching, Chiang Tao', null, 'A pacifist village is beset by bandits in this martial arts thriller. "Savage Five" hands-down rivals the ornateness of "Kid With The Golden Arm" and the twist-heavy "Five Deadly Venoms". The always great David Chiang plays a lesser version of his Rover character from "Duel Of The Iron Fist", and Ti Lung, looking incredible here, is at his physical best. Accolades to Chen Kuan Tai and Wang Chung in great sympathetic roles, too. A kung fu classic where the actual martial arts display takes a back seat to the mesmerizing story.', 'A pacifist village is beset by bandits in this martial arts thriller. "Savage Five" hands-down rivals the ornateness of "Kid With The Golden Arm" and the twist-heavy "Five Deadly Venoms". The always great David Chiang plays a lesser version of his Rover character from "Duel Of The Iron Fist", and Ti Lung, looking incredible here, is at his physical best. Accolades to Chen Kuan Tai and Wang Chung in great sympathetic roles, too. A kung fu classic where the actual martial arts display takes a back seat to the mesmerizing story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXj3PcSSp0IWsbgyHJNASrIU8jr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65192'),
  ('544141060826750838', 'The Savage Innocents', 1960, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Nicholas Ray, Peter Hennessy, Aldo Tonti', 'Nicholas Ray', 'Anthony Quinn, Yoko Tani, Peter O''Toole, Carlo Giustini, Marie Yang, Marco Guglielmi, Anthony Chinn, Kaida Horiuchi', null, 'An Eskimo who has had little contact with white men goes to a trading post where he accidentally kills a missionary and finds himself being pursued by the police.', 'An Eskimo who has had little contact with white men goes to a trading post where he accidentally kills a missionary and finds himself being pursued by the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zWw2SCxCygE9tGs8wMuwb9Fws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94393'),
  ('863898746265627064', 'The Savage Seven', 1968, 'Action, Crime', 'Richard Rush, László Kovács', 'Michael Fisher', 'Robert Walker Jr., Joanna Frank, John Garwood, Larry Bishop, Adam Roarke, Max Julien, Richard Anders, Charles Bail', null, 'Biker gang leader Kisum (Adam Roarke) loves waitress Marcia Little Hawk (Joanna Frank). Her brother Johnnie Little Hawk (Robert Walker, Jr.), the leader of a group of American Indians disapproves. At various times these two groups are adversaries and allies. The two groups join forces but crooked businessmen scheme to have them at each other''s throats again. The theme song "Anyone for Tennis" is by Cream. The Iron Butterfly are heard playing their classic "Iron Butterfly Theme." Producer Dick Clark and director Richard Rush made "Psych-Out" earlier in the year.', 'Biker gang leader Kisum (Adam Roarke) loves waitress Marcia Little Hawk (Joanna Frank). Her brother Johnnie Little Hawk (Robert Walker, Jr.), the leader of a group of American Indians disapproves. At various times these two groups are adversaries and allies. The two groups join forces but crooked businessmen scheme to have them at each other''s throats again. The theme song "Anyone for Tennis" is by Cream. The Iron Butterfly are heard playing their classic "Iron Butterfly Theme." Producer Dick Clark and director Richard Rush made "Psych-Out" earlier in the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7qSjolJgRHOuj0EVAFssiwCG2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42650'),
  ('264022713935082663', 'The Savages', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tamara Jenkins, W. Mott Hupfel III', 'Tamara Jenkins', 'Laura Linney, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Philip Bosco, Peter Friedman, David Zayas, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Cara Seymour, Tonye Patano', 'R', 'A sister and brother face the realities of familial responsibility as they begin to care for their ailing father.', 'A sister and brother face the realities of familial responsibility as they begin to care for their ailing father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY54gSmTOmSXlQpWDB7DWp4u8a7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8272'),
  ('1016379404486652815', 'The Sawmill', 1922, 'Comedy, Romance, Action', 'Norman Taurog, Larry Semon, Hans F. Koenekamp', 'Larry Semon, Norman Taurog', 'Larry Semon, Oliver Hardy, Frank Alexander, Kathleen O''Connor, Ann Hastings, Al Thompson', null, 'A bumbling sawmill employee tries to win the hand of the owner''s daughter while staying out of the clutches of the mill''s bullying foreman.', 'A bumbling sawmill employee tries to win the hand of the owner''s daughter while staying out of the clutches of the mill''s bullying foreman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTOibafoq1tZi45UNr7PlrMls9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95347'),
  ('795137222992295350', 'The Scalphunters', 1968, 'Comedy, Western', 'Sydney Pollack, Charles R. Scott Jr., Richard Moore', 'William W. Norton', 'Burt Lancaster, Shelley Winters, Telly Savalas, Ossie Davis, Dabney Coleman, Paul Picerni, Dan Vadis, Armando Silvestre', 'NR', 'Forced to trade his valuable furs for a well-educated escaped slave, a rugged trapper vows to recover the pelts from the Indians and later the renegades that killed them.', 'Forced to trade his valuable furs for a well-educated escaped slave, a rugged trapper vows to recover the pelts from the Indians and later the renegades that killed them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m82aMr1Pcqt5t0cpSCwq5REdajY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32068'),
  ('61165810291344017', 'The Scam', 2009, 'Crime, Adventure, Thriller, Action', 'Kang Dae-hui, Lee Ho-jae, Ki Se-hun', 'Lee Jae-hon', 'Park Yong-ha, Kim Min-joung, Park Hee-soon, Kim Moo-yul, Jun Kim, Lee Dong-yong, Jo Jae-yun, Park Jae-woong', null, 'Hyun-soo is a skillful individual stock investor, so-called ‘ant’. One day, he cashes in up seventy thousand dollars through stock trading and this jackpot gets him implicated in a $60 million stock manipulation by scam artists from various fields. With a huge pot of money before their eyes, the scam seems to be perfectly unfolding. But another scam is emerging underneath team as the scammers chase each other and are being chased at the end.', 'Hyun-soo is a skillful individual stock investor, so-called ‘ant’. One day, he cashes in up seventy thousand dollars through stock trading and this jackpot gets him implicated in a $60 million stock manipulation by scam artists from various fields. With a huge pot of money before their eyes, the scam seems to be perfectly unfolding. But another scam is emerging underneath team as the scammers chase each other and are being chased at the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/md0ioEXLgAcIrZKyK1A15gbEJzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19529'),
  ('775261886939399124', 'The Scammers', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Faure, Hervé Mimran, Mathieu Hiltzer', 'Igor Gotesman, William Gotesman, Hervé Mimran', 'Gérard Darmon, Didier Bourdon, Chantal Lauby, Paloma Coquant, Laurent Capelluto, Yoann Eloundou Noah, Noémie Chicheportiche, Martine Schambacher', null, 'Two friends on a small island in Brittany discover the lottery winner is dead with the winning ticket. They plan a village-wide scam to take his place.', 'Two friends on a small island in Brittany discover the lottery winner is dead with the winning ticket. They plan a village-wide scam to take his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BAXWoVP71jCIHtD0pRXmupe6w5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140721'),
  ('422794769900505448', 'The Scamp', 1957, 'Drama', 'Wolf Rilla', 'Wolf Rilla', 'Richard Attenborough, Dorothy Alison, Colin Petersen, Terence Morgan, Jill Adams, Maureen Delaney, Margaretta Scott, David Franks', null, 'Tod is a motherless boy, who is mistreated by his violent father. He eventually finds happiness with kindly foster parents.', 'Tod is a motherless boy, who is mistreated by his violent father. He eventually finds happiness with kindly foster parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FYFTPGvV1r20pQF0LsFQbct9tt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241024'),
  ('742579549133063197', 'The Scandalous Adventures of Buraikan', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Shūji Terayama', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Shima Iwashita, Tetsuro Tamba, Shoichi Ozawa, Masakane Yonekura, Fumio Watanabe, Kei Yamamoto, Atsuo Nakamura', null, 'An outlaw pushes the residents of Edo''s red light district to rebel against a growing number of stifling, moralistic laws.', 'An outlaw pushes the residents of Edo''s red light district to rebel against a growing number of stifling, moralistic laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgqgCx9lEpkosJ10dF7ycmOuvck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213692'),
  ('244325063708027164', 'The Scandalous Lady W', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance, History', 'Sheree Folkson, Shane Daly', 'David Eldridge, Hallie Rubenhold', 'Natalie Dormer, Aneurin Barnard, Shaun Evans, Peter Sullivan, Jessica Gunning, Robert Morgan, Alex Beckett, Michael Bott', null, 'A gripping 18th century drama details the scandalous life of Lady Seymour Worsley, who dared to leave her husband and elope with his best friend, Captain George Bisset. Lady Seymour Worsley escapes her troubled marriage only to find herself at the centre of a very public trial brought by her powerful husband Sir Richard Worsley.', 'A gripping 18th century drama details the scandalous life of Lady Seymour Worsley, who dared to leave her husband and elope with his best friend, Captain George Bisset. Lady Seymour Worsley escapes her troubled marriage only to find herself at the centre of a very public trial brought by her powerful husband Sir Richard Worsley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekegcpp9Ri1R4slhtJrJwT4Euw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352733'),
  ('889938362230025425', 'The Scapegoat', 1959, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Hamer, Paul Beeson', 'Robert Hamer', 'Alec Guinness, Bette Davis, Nicole Maurey, Irene Worth, Pamela Brown, Annabel Bartlett, Geoffrey Keen, Noel Howlett', 'NR', 'An Englishman in France unwittingly is placed into the identity, and steps into the vacated life, of a look-alike French nobleman.', 'An Englishman in France unwittingly is placed into the identity, and steps into the vacated life, of a look-alike French nobleman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWtYyQ9U0k5aDwaQKAxrLHoIXWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126919'),
  ('482162119570562284', 'The Scapegoat', 2012, 'Mystery, Drama, Adventure', 'Charles Sturridge, Matt Gray', 'Charles Sturridge', 'Matthew Rhys, Jodhi May, Eileen Atkins, Sheridan Smith, Andrew Scott, Phoebe Nicholls, Anton Lesser, Eloise Webb', null, 'In 1952, as England prepares for the coronation, two very different men have one thing in common—a face.', 'In 1952, as England prepares for the coronation, two very different men have one thing in common—a face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qm7405EUohvZvGjINJkGYNsqU03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139463'),
  ('352929540548515449', 'The Scapegoat', 2013, 'Drama', 'Nicolas Bary, Patrick Duroux', 'Nicolas Bary, Serge Frydman, Jérôme Fansten', 'Raphaël Personnaz, Bérénice Bejo, Emir Kusturica, Mélanie Bernier, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Thierry Neuvic, Armande Boulanger, Adrien Ferran', 'PG-13', 'There is something strange - some would even say abnormal - about the Malaussène family. But if you take a closer look, no one could be happier than this cheerfully chaotic family, even though their mother is usually off on one romantic adventure or another. Life is never a bore for Benjamin Malaussène, professional scapegoat and the older brother responsible for this horde of kids. But when incidents happen wherever he goes, police and colleagues begin to eye him suspiciously. It soon becomes a matter of life and death to find out what is going on and who is so interested in ruining his life. Written by Pathe International', 'There is something strange - some would even say abnormal - about the Malaussène family. But if you take a closer look, no one could be happier than this cheerfully chaotic family, even though their mother is usually off on one romantic adventure or another. Life is never a bore for Benjamin Malaussène, professional scapegoat and the older brother responsible for this horde of kids. But when incidents happen wherever he goes, police and colleagues begin to eye him suspiciously. It soon becomes a matter of life and death to find out what is going on and who is so interested in ruining his life. Written by Pathe International', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tCDPkbqhEwxMf1wVNiAt20RMdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204709'),
  ('1031787106777011738', 'The Scapular', 1968, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Servando González, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Rafael García Travesí, Servando González', 'Enrique Lizalde, Ofelia Guilmáin, Enrique Aguilar, Carlos Cardán, Federico Falcón, Alicia Bonet, Eleazar García, Jorge Russek', null, 'A woman who is about to die calls the town''s priest and hands him a scapulary, saying that she knows of its great powers. Anybody who does not believe in them will end up dead.', 'A woman who is about to die calls the town''s priest and hands him a scapulary, saying that she knows of its great powers. Anybody who does not believe in them will end up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1krO4DeXUCQA33ZU4Xv0Vjkyj5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141758'),
  ('5769565337572320', 'The Scar', 1976, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Wierzbicki, Marek Piestrak', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Franciszek Pieczka, Mariusz Dmochowski, Jerzy Stuhr, Jan Skotnicki, Stanisław Igar, Stanisław Michalski, Michał Tarkowski, Andrzej Skupień', null, 'When a political decision is made as to the location of a new large chemical factory, Stefan Bednarz is put in charge of it. This honest communist party man has to confront the local community opposing the construction.', 'When a political decision is made as to the location of a new large chemical factory, Stefan Bednarz is put in charge of it. This honest communist party man has to confront the local community opposing the construction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JdHCHy36tG6RVB7Y4AKfkqDX92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49134'),
  ('831768378521535176', 'The Scarecrow', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton, Elgin Lessley', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Joe Keaton, Joe Roberts, Sybil Seely, Al St. John', 'NR', 'Two farmhands compete for the love of the farmer''s daughter.', 'Two farmhands compete for the love of the farmer''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTrS56W99XsdeJTboae2Sozt3O1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51357'),
  ('187628723827215021', 'The Scarehouse', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kelly Chmilar, Alison Milward, Bryon Umbenhower', 'Gavin Michael Booth', 'Sarah Booth, Kimberly-Sue Murray, Katherine Barrell, Dani Barker, Teagan Vincze, Emily Alatalo, Jennifer Miller, Ivana Kingston', null, 'When two friends open a Halloween fun house on Devil''s Night it is all fun and games until their former sorority sisters begin to arrive. These six sisters are confronted by their past as the night spins out of control.', 'When two friends open a Halloween fun house on Devil''s Night it is all fun and games until their former sorority sisters begin to arrive. These six sisters are confronted by their past as the night spins out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dE6VEAOTvJOu0ER6nkSkfJKxCG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273187'),
  ('763511217931645305', 'The Scarf', 1951, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Franz Planer, E.A. Dupont, Emmett Emerson', 'E.A. Dupont', 'John Ireland, Mercedes McCambridge, James Barton, Emlyn Williams, Lloyd Gough, Basil Ruysdael, David Bauer, Harry Shannon', 'NR', 'A man who is believed to have murdered a woman, escapes from the insane asylum to find if he was the one to actually kill her using the scarf she was wearing.', 'A man who is believed to have murdered a woman, escapes from the insane asylum to find if he was the one to actually kill her using the scarf she was wearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Zd6CptQgAKbQlMaGq3qGKPJTZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41591'),
  ('1029173753672680973', 'The Scarlet and the Black', 1983, 'Drama, History, TV Movie, War', 'Jerry London, Gianni Cozzo, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'David Butler', 'Gregory Peck, Christopher Plummer, John Gielgud, Raf Vallone, Kenneth Colley, Walter Gotell, Barbara Bouchet, Olga Karlatos', 'PG', 'Fr. Hugh O''Flaherty is a Vatican official in 1943-45 who has been hiding downed pilots, escaped prisoners of war, and Italian resistance families. His activities become so large that the Nazis decide to assassinate him the next time he leaves the Vatican.', 'Fr. Hugh O''Flaherty is a Vatican official in 1943-45 who has been hiding downed pilots, escaped prisoners of war, and Italian resistance families. His activities become so large that the Nazis decide to assassinate him the next time he leaves the Vatican.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6nTRZC0RbdrUhauvhFjWlcbiTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44691'),
  ('576901491304729667', 'The Scarlet Blade', 1963, 'Adventure, War, History', 'John Gilling, Jack Asher, Douglas Hermes', 'John Gilling', 'Lionel Jeffries, Oliver Reed, Jack Hedley, June Thorburn, Michael Ripper, Harold Goldblatt, Duncan Lamont, Clifford Elkin', null, 'A cruel Roundhead Colonel is on the trail of royalist sympathizers, but unaware of his daughters royalist sympathies. When she falls into a love triangle with Cavalier Edward Beverly and Roundhead officer Captain Sylvester the stage is set for double crossing and derring-do.', 'A cruel Roundhead Colonel is on the trail of royalist sympathizers, but unaware of his daughters royalist sympathies. When she falls into a love triangle with Cavalier Edward Beverly and Roundhead officer Captain Sylvester the stage is set for double crossing and derring-do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thOckwFO0Ld9fCeMByyMEuYuVoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82807'),
  ('1998289439225740', 'The Scarlet Claw', 1944, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy William Neill, George Robinson', 'Edmund L. Hartmann, Roy William Neill', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Gerald Hamer, Paul Cavanagh, Arthur Hohl, Miles Mander, Kay Harding, David Clyde', 'NR', 'When a woman is found dead with her throat torn out, the local villagers blame a supernatural monster. But Sherlock Holmes, who gets drawn into the case from nearby Quebec, suspects a human murderer.', 'When a woman is found dead with her throat torn out, the local villagers blame a supernatural monster. But Sherlock Holmes, who gets drawn into the case from nearby Quebec, suspects a human murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1laSfU5KqQjwgxRqyTUuSmTZIZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33423'),
  ('839006962798574709', 'The Scarlet Clue', 1945, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Phil Rosen', 'George Callahan', 'Sidney Toler, Benson Fong, Mantan Moreland, Robert Homans, I. Stanford Jolley, Virginia Brissac, Jack Norton, Janet Shaw', 'NR', 'Chinese sleuth Charlie Chan discovers a scheme for the theft of government radar plans while investigating several murders.', 'Chinese sleuth Charlie Chan discovers a scheme for the theft of government radar plans while investigating several murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsDnujk7PDjccm2oJyDSRLXDlaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38467'),
  ('1022250986160958430', 'The Scarlet Dove', 1961, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kalle Peronkoski, Matti Kassila', 'Juha Nevalainen', 'Tauno Palo, Gunvor Sandkvist, Helen Elde, Matti Oravisto, Risto Mäkelä, Uuno Montonen, Anton Soini, Paavo Hukkinen', null, 'Dr. Aitamaa is spending holiday with his family at their summer villa. He accidentally reads a letter that was meant to his wife. The letter is from another man. Aitamaa follows his wife to the city and finds out that she has a lover. Later the wife is found killed and Aitamaa becomes the prime suspect.', 'Dr. Aitamaa is spending holiday with his family at their summer villa. He accidentally reads a letter that was meant to his wife. The letter is from another man. Aitamaa follows his wife to the city and finds out that she has a lover. Later the wife is found killed and Aitamaa becomes the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtiiV0IabEOTTQxSgkb3YTAddKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224642'),
  ('782203868333752118', 'The Scarlet Empress', 1934, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Josef von Sternberg, Bert Glennon', 'Manuel Komroff, Eleanor McGeary', 'Marlene Dietrich, John Lodge, Sam Jaffe, Louise Dresser, C. Aubrey Smith, Gavin Gordon, Olive Tell, Ruthelma Stevens', 'NR', 'During the 18th century, German noblewoman Sophia Frederica, who would later become Catherine the Great, travels to Moscow to marry the dimwitted Grand Duke Peter, the heir to the Russian throne. Their arranged marriage proves to be loveless, and Catherine takes many lovers, including the handsome Count Alexei, and bears a son. When the unstable Peter eventually ascends to the throne, Catherine plots to oust him from power.', 'During the 18th century, German noblewoman Sophia Frederica, who would later become Catherine the Great, travels to Moscow to marry the dimwitted Grand Duke Peter, the heir to the Russian throne. Their arranged marriage proves to be loveless, and Catherine takes many lovers, including the handsome Count Alexei, and bears a son. When the unstable Peter eventually ascends to the throne, Catherine plots to oust him from power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCoyv38br7T4hFPJF0OnfAGuzbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31527'),
  ('419103392939940789', 'The Scarlet Flower', 1952, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Lev Atamanov, Roman Kachanov, Mikhail Druyan', 'Georgiy Grebner', 'Nina Krachkovskaya, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Nikolai Bogolyubov, Olga Chepurova, Mariya Babanova, Vladimir Gribkov', null, 'Before going on an overseas journey, a merchant father asks his three daughters what they would like him to bring back for them. The eldest asks for a shining tiara, the middle asks for a frame through which her face would always appear young, and the youngest (Nastenka) asks her father to bring her a beautiful scarlet flower like one which she saw in her dreams. Her elder sisters laugh at this simple wish. The father''s trip is successful and he finds everything that he came for, with the exception of Nastenka''s scarlet flower. Nevertheless, the ship heaves off and they begin to head back while the father scans the lands around him for a scarlet flower.', 'Before going on an overseas journey, a merchant father asks his three daughters what they would like him to bring back for them. The eldest asks for a shining tiara, the middle asks for a frame through which her face would always appear young, and the youngest (Nastenka) asks her father to bring her a beautiful scarlet flower like one which she saw in her dreams. Her elder sisters laugh at this simple wish. The father''s trip is successful and he finds everything that he came for, with the exception of Nastenka''s scarlet flower. Nevertheless, the ship heaves off and they begin to head back while the father scans the lands around him for a scarlet flower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfVjidg334LK7TbNvSlKNKndFjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81604'),
  ('455302936244942676', 'The Scarlet Flower', 1978, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Oleksandr Antypenko, Irina Povolotskaya, Boris Golev', 'Natalya Ryazantseva', 'Marina Ilyichyova, Lev Durov, Alla Demidova, Aleksandr Abdulov, Aleksei Chernov, Valentin Gneuschov, Yelena Vodolazova, Vadim Uryupin', null, 'A merchant is living in a fairytale Russia of hundreds of years ago. When he is making a journey to market, his three daughters each ask for a present to be brought back...', 'A merchant is living in a fairytale Russia of hundreds of years ago. When he is making a journey to market, his three daughters each ask for a present to be brought back...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BmSjdoSp3WBAnOVzXU3W7EbRWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14489'),
  ('670102686845415981', 'The Scarlet Hour', 1956, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Curtiz, Lionel Lindon, William McGarry', 'Alford Van Ronkel, John Meredyth Lucas, Frank Tashlin', 'Carol Ohmart, Tom Tryon, Jody Lawrance, James Gregory, Elaine Stritch, E.G. Marshall, Edward Binns, David Lewis', 'NR', 'An unhappy wife uses her powers of manipulation to draw an infatuated man into an ill-fated jewelry heist.', 'An unhappy wife uses her powers of manipulation to draw an infatuated man into an ill-fated jewelry heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtObLezqgP23nhePWHuwTDigVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74422'),
  ('443961907160990699', 'The Scarlet Letter', 1927, 'Drama, History', 'Victor Sjöström, Harold S. Bucquet', 'Nathaniel Hawthorne', 'Lillian Gish, Lars Hanson, Henry B. Walthall, Karl Dane, William H. Tooker, Marcelle Corday, Fred Herzog, Jules Cowles', null, 'In Puritan Boston, seamstress Hester Prynne and kindly Reverend Arthur Dimmesdale fall in love. After Dimmesdale must go away for a time to England, he returns to discover that Hester has given birth to their child and is the focus of local censure.', 'In Puritan Boston, seamstress Hester Prynne and kindly Reverend Arthur Dimmesdale fall in love. After Dimmesdale must go away for a time to England, he returns to discover that Hester has given birth to their child and is the focus of local censure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r17PMluxZvEFOHGILuf2iHuyQCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85638'),
  ('1014377469055881670', 'The Scarlet Letter', 1934, 'Drama', 'Robert G. Vignola, Jesse Duffy, James S. Brown Jr.', 'Leonard Fields, David Silverstein', 'Colleen Moore, Hardie Albright, Henry B. Walthall, Cora Sue Collins, Alan Hale, Virginia Howell, William Kent, William Farnum', null, 'In the seventeenth century, in Massachusetts, a young woman is forced to wear a scarlet "A" on her dress for bearing a child out of wedlock.', 'In the seventeenth century, in Massachusetts, a young woman is forced to wear a scarlet "A" on her dress for bearing a child out of wedlock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUEL3cWVss4KTVqNzLu1zLy7ZWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43647'),
  ('39707365148236430', 'The Scarlet Letter', 1973, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Wim Wenders, Robby Müller', 'Wim Wenders, Bernardo Fernández, Tankred Dorst', 'Senta Berger, Hans Christian Blech, Lou Castel, Rüdiger Vogler, Yelena Samarina, Yella Rottländer, William Layton, Alfredo Mayo', null, 'In 17th-century Salem, Hester Prynne must wear a scarlet A because she is an adulteress, with a child out of wedlock. For seven years, she has refused to name the father. A vigorous older stranger arrives, recognized by Hester but unknown to others as her missing husband. He poses as Chillingworth, a doctor, watching Hester and searching out the identity of her lover. His eye soon rests on Dimmesdale, a young overwrought pastor. Enmity grows between the two men; Chillingworth applies psychological pressure, and the pastor begins to crack. A ship stops in Salem, and Hester sees it as a providential refuge for her daughter, herself, and her lover. But will Dimmesdale flee with her?', 'In 17th-century Salem, Hester Prynne must wear a scarlet A because she is an adulteress, with a child out of wedlock. For seven years, she has refused to name the father. A vigorous older stranger arrives, recognized by Hester but unknown to others as her missing husband. He poses as Chillingworth, a doctor, watching Hester and searching out the identity of her lover. His eye soon rests on Dimmesdale, a young overwrought pastor. Enmity grows between the two men; Chillingworth applies psychological pressure, and the pastor begins to crack. A ship stops in Salem, and Hester sees it as a providential refuge for her daughter, herself, and her lover. But will Dimmesdale flee with her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WZQzkhx61tK2juepl7O1hM2Ilm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42461'),
  ('572464388109028141', 'The Scarlet Letter', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roland Joffé, Alex Thomson, Buddy Joe Hooker', 'Douglas Day Stewart', 'Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Lisa Andoh, Edward Hardwicke, Robert Prosky, Roy Dotrice, Joan Plowright', 'R', 'Set in puritanical Boston in the mid 1600s, the story of seamstress Hester Prynne, who is outcast after she becomes pregnant by a respected reverend. She refuses to divulge the name of the father, is "convicted" of adultery and forced to wear a scarlet "A" until an Indian attack unites the Puritans and leads to a reevaluation of their laws and morals.', 'Set in puritanical Boston in the mid 1600s, the story of seamstress Hester Prynne, who is outcast after she becomes pregnant by a respected reverend. She refuses to divulge the name of the father, is "convicted" of adultery and forced to wear a scarlet "A" until an Indian attack unites the Puritans and leads to a reevaluation of their laws and morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gIU7O3oV6NyWUjlL6ppbpnIZLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10533'),
  ('534871147875684792', 'The Scarlet Letter', 2004, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Romance', 'Won Jin, Byun Hyuk', 'Kang Hyun-joo, Byun Hyuk', 'Han Suk-kyu, Lee Eun-ju, Sung Hyun-ah, Uhm Ji-won, Kim Jin-geun, Choi Gyu-hwan, Do Yong-gu, Jung Yoon-seo', null, 'A cop''s desire for love gets in the way of his job and his professional life. Secret love affairs begin to dangerously collide as he gets assigned to a new homicide case.', 'A cop''s desire for love gets in the way of his job and his professional life. Secret love affairs begin to dangerously collide as he gets assigned to a new homicide case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKX61echirKRwARuxp6HcAeTMq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56485'),
  ('307684112057550117', 'The Scarlet Pimpernel', 1934, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Harold Young, Harold Rosson, Geoffrey Boothby', 'Lajos Biró, S. N. Behrman, Robert E. Sherwood', 'Leslie Howard, Merle Oberon, Raymond Massey, Nigel Bruce, Bramwell Fletcher, Anthony Bushell, Joan Gardner, Walter Rilla', 'NR', '18th century English aristocrat Sir Percy Blakeney leads a double life. He appears to be merely the effete aristocrat, but in reality is part of an underground effort to free French nobles from Robespierre''s Reign of Terror.', '18th century English aristocrat Sir Percy Blakeney leads a double life. He appears to be merely the effete aristocrat, but in reality is part of an underground effort to free French nobles from Robespierre''s Reign of Terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sPfawJsdTnlmdNmPHrsOA9bx2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22614'),
  ('208297527684246508', 'The Scarlet Pimpernel', 1982, 'Romance, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Clive Donner, Dennis C. Lewiston', null, 'Anthony Andrews, Jane Seymour, Ian McKellen, James Villiers, Eleanor David, Malcolm Jamieson, Denis Lill, Ann Firbank', 'PG', 'During the French Revolution, a mysterious English nobleman known only as The Scarlet Pimpernel (a humble wayside flower), snatches French aristos from the jaws of the guillotine, while posing as the foppish Sir Percy Blakeney in society. Percy falls for and marries the beautiful actress Marguerite St. Just, but she is involved with Chauvelin and Robespierre, and Percy''s marriage to her may endanger the Pimpernel''s plans to save the little Dauphin', 'During the French Revolution, a mysterious English nobleman known only as The Scarlet Pimpernel (a humble wayside flower), snatches French aristos from the jaws of the guillotine, while posing as the foppish Sir Percy Blakeney in society. Percy falls for and marries the beautiful actress Marguerite St. Just, but she is involved with Chauvelin and Robespierre, and Percy''s marriage to her may endanger the Pimpernel''s plans to save the little Dauphin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89jU2EH7ccpK6jDEJ6fO9bIe2RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23615'),
  ('653455367041893047', 'The Scarlet Pumpernickel', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Daffy tries to sell movie studio head J.L. his script for a swashbuckler set in Merry Olde England, a plot involving a maiden in distress, a scheming Chamberlain, an evil Grand Duke and a dashing masked hero (to be played by Daffy, of course).', 'Daffy tries to sell movie studio head J.L. his script for a swashbuckler set in Merry Olde England, a plot involving a maiden in distress, a scheming Chamberlain, an evil Grand Duke and a dashing masked hero (to be played by Daffy, of course).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPQmzB9gohRPnxr1Wh8oacTq9ub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88766'),
  ('518575324294530945', 'The Scary House', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Matthias Pötsch, Daniel Prochaska', 'Timo Lombeck, Marcel Kawentel', 'Leon Orlandianyi, Benno Rosskopf, Marii Weichsler, Lars Bitterlich, Julia Koschitz, Michael Pink, Inge Maux', 'NR', 'When a big-city family moves to a remote town, two young brothers and their new friends try to solve the menacing mystery that haunts their home.', 'When a big-city family moves to a remote town, two young brothers and their new friends try to solve the menacing mystery that haunts their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N5KeZaw8bQrt30UaV9qtPLjkwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735595'),
  ('875447327581592774', 'The Scary of Sixty-First', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hunter Zimny, Melisande Bliss, Jono Eshleman', 'Dasha Nekrasova, Madeline Quinn', 'Betsey Brown, Madeline Quinn, Dasha Nekrasova, Mark H. Rapaport, Jason Grisell, Stephen Gurewitz, Michael M. Bilandic, Ruby McCollister', 'NR', 'Two roommates’ lives are upended after finding out that their new Manhattan apartment harbors a dark secret.', 'Two roommates’ lives are upended after finding out that their new Manhattan apartment harbors a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP2x1rjh6H2dKSm5eFxAo2e46Jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723377'),
  ('857332727702468750', 'The Scavengers', 1972, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Ermanno Olmi, Ermanno Olmi', 'Mario Rigoni Stern, Tullio Kezich, Ermanno Olmi', 'Antonio Lunardi, Andreino Carli, Alessandra Micheletto, Pietro Tolin, Marilena Rossi, Ivano Frigo, Oreste Costa, Mario Strazzabosco', null, 'After World War II an Italian soldier returns to his hometown near the Alps and, unable to find a job, hooks up with a crotchety hermit who scavenges buried shells and bombs for scrap metal.', 'After World War II an Italian soldier returns to his hometown near the Alps and, unable to find a job, hooks up with a crotchety hermit who scavenges buried shells and bombs for scrap metal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/je9Djl2fHc1VaIYnTONYbrR3YnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231014'),
  ('823569821794108520', 'The Scenic Route', 1978, 'Drama', 'Mark Rappaport, Fred Murphy', 'Mark Rappaport', 'Randy Danson, Marilyn Jones, Kevin Wade, Grant Stewart, Arthur Ginsberg, Milton Ginsberg, Marion Greenstone, Claudia Weill', null, 'An experimental drama that spins the tale of a woman, her sister, and the man who completes the triangle. Told through such fertile sources as grand opera, classical painting, and Victorian melodrama.', 'An experimental drama that spins the tale of a woman, her sister, and the man who completes the triangle. Told through such fertile sources as grand opera, classical painting, and Victorian melodrama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX3pU4rNEXafixambssHPkg4JHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128042'),
  ('37753607007556538', 'The Scent', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Yu Cheol, Kim Hyoung-jun', 'Hwang Sung-goo', 'Park Hee-soon, Park Si-yeon, Ju Sang-uk, Kim Jung-tae, Lee Han-wi, Lee Kwang-soo, Cha Soo-yeon, Baek Yoon-jae', null, 'A detective Seon-woo, who moonlights as a private investigator, has a beautiful new client Soo-Jin. The woman asks the detective to take photos of her husband in the midst of having an affair with another woman. When the detective goes to take pictures he discovers that the woman''s husband is already dead. Now the detective becomes a suspect. The detective is chased by another detective Gil-ro. He must now set out for the real killer.', 'A detective Seon-woo, who moonlights as a private investigator, has a beautiful new client Soo-Jin. The woman asks the detective to take photos of her husband in the midst of having an affair with another woman. When the detective goes to take pictures he discovers that the woman''s husband is already dead. Now the detective becomes a suspect. The detective is chased by another detective Gil-ro. He must now set out for the real killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mq5XTPbangf2dBqS2paqRa1OXSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115134'),
  ('777424406877639939', 'The Scent of Blood', 2004, 'Drama', 'Cesare Accetta, Andrea De Rosa, Fabio Casti', 'Mario Martone', 'Fanny Ardant, Michele Placido, Giovanna Giuliani, Sergio Tramonti, Giuseppe De Marco, Daniele Fior, Fabio Mascagni, Alessandro Riceci', null, 'A couple of bourgeois intellectuals, Carlo and Silvia, have been married for twenty years. While she lives in their flat in Rome, he spends most of his time in the country house where he writes his books, openly living with his younger lover, Lù. In return, Carlo has long accepted that her wife may have lovers, but her volatile relationship with a young neo-fascist suddenly rekindles his jealousy.', 'A couple of bourgeois intellectuals, Carlo and Silvia, have been married for twenty years. While she lives in their flat in Rome, he spends most of his time in the country house where he writes his books, openly living with his younger lover, Lù. In return, Carlo has long accepted that her wife may have lovers, but her volatile relationship with a young neo-fascist suddenly rekindles his jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lX2JG3fANI2LauTBhjPPiB7qL4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62027'),
  ('695204064900457102', 'The Scent of Green Papaya', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Trần Anh Hùng, Benoît Delhomme', 'Trần Anh Hùng', 'Trần Nữ Yên Khê, Man San Lu, Thi Loc Truong, Ánh Hoa, Hoa Hoi Vuong, Ngoc Trung Tran, Vantha Talisman, Keo Souvannavong', 'NR', '1950s Saigon through the eyes of Mui, a Vietnamese servant girl. At 10 years-old, Mui leaves her village to work for an affluent, troubled family. As she comes of age, Mui finds work in the household of a pianist she has admired since childhood, and finds their relationship growing in complexity.', '1950s Saigon through the eyes of Mui, a Vietnamese servant girl. At 10 years-old, Mui leaves her village to work for an affluent, troubled family. As she comes of age, Mui finds work in the household of a pianist she has admired since childhood, and finds their relationship growing in complexity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9lJFQ54IiNqN4fcmn5JxXdqQtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19552'),
  ('111247322319301916', 'The Scent of Mandarin', 2015, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Gilles Legrand, Yves Angelo', 'Guillaume Laurant', 'Georgia Scalliet, Olivier Gourmet, Dimitri Storoge, Hélène Vincent, Marine Vallée, Fred Ulysse, Romain Bouteille, Michel Robin', null, 'During World War I, a home care nurse treats a man who lost one leg on the front lines. A strong bond arises between them and evolves into a passionate love affair.', 'During World War I, a home care nurse treats a man who lost one leg on the front lines. A strong bond arises between them and evolves into a passionate love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myMkjZXRJBSCkFCWP2SjsU7f8zB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362571'),
  ('743325367213646208', 'The Scent Of Pho', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Minh Beta, Dominic Pereira', null, 'Xuân Hinh, Quốc Tuấn, Bảo Nam, Thu Trang', null, 'A story of generational conflict and the clash between tradition and modern life, centered on phở—an icon of Vietnamese cuisine. Beneath the disputes and disagreements, hidden truths gradually surface, unfolding a journey back to familial warmth through humor, wit, and charming moments.', 'A story of generational conflict and the clash between tradition and modern life, centered on phở—an icon of Vietnamese cuisine. Beneath the disputes and disagreements, hidden truths gradually surface, unfolding a journey back to familial warmth through humor, wit, and charming moments.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fs4VRZ7evHr0E0REWdqawStHPRjQ.jpg', 'plex:movie:scent-of-pho'),
  ('264478743303571063', 'The Scent of the Night', 1998, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claudio Caligari, Gianluca Mazzella, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Claudio Caligari', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Marco Giallini, Giorgio Tirabassi, Alessia Fugardi, Emanuel Bevilacqua, Francesca D''Aloja, Little Tony, Giampiero Lisarelli', null, 'A former policeman turns full-time robber and goes on a downward spiral of crime in 1970s Rome.', 'A former policeman turns full-time robber and goes on a downward spiral of crime in 1970s Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5k0KPAYO7C1J8apX74ezWc7Ztb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63276'),
  ('28403144812254463', 'The Scheming Gambler''s Paradise', 1905, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A combination gambling den and bawdy house is set up so that croupiers, patrons, prostitutes, and the owner can quickly change it all into a mercantile establishment when the cops stage a raid.', 'A combination gambling den and bawdy house is set up so that croupiers, patrons, prostitutes, and the owner can quickly change it all into a mercantile establishment when the cops stage a raid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I36EI3D7TQezq4e6gyMj8htpLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44330'),
  ('663729506143100140', 'The Scheming Women', 1954, null, 'Henri Decoin', null, 'Raymond Rouleau, Jeanne Moreau, Raymond Pellegrin, Etchika Choureau, Marcel André, Paul Azaïs, Claude Borelli, Jacques Charon', null, 'The renowned theatre manager, Paul Rémy, is accused by his general secretary Andrieux of having killed his partner. On the advice of his wife Mona, Paul goes into hiding in a psychiatric hospital to escape from the police. But Andrieux seduces Mona who then turns against her husband.', 'The renowned theatre manager, Paul Rémy, is accused by his general secretary Andrieux of having killed his partner. On the advice of his wife Mona, Paul goes into hiding in a psychiatric hospital to escape from the police. But Andrieux seduces Mona who then turns against her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knbLfgi7tXpozqI5Awb2rknogze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78518'),
