  ('591195899328952562', 'The School for Good and Evil', 2022, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Rory Bruen, Melissa R. Stubbs, John Schwartzman', 'Paul Feig, David Magee, Laura Solon', 'Sofia Wylie, Sophia Anne Caruso, Kerry Washington, Charlize Theron, Laurence Fishburne, Jamie Flatters, Earl Cave, Holly Sturton', 'PG-13', 'Best friends Sophie and Agatha navigate an enchanted school for young heroes and villains — and find themselves on opposing sides of the battle between good and evil.', 'Best friends Sophie and Agatha navigate an enchanted school for young heroes and villains — and find themselves on opposing sides of the battle between good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oZeEu1GDILdwezmZ5e2xWISf1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779782'),
  ('473031819722688564', 'The School Girls', 1970, 'Drama', 'Klaus Werner, Ernst Hofbauer', 'Kurt Seelmann, Günther Hunold', 'Günther Kieslich, Wolf Harnisch, Helga Kruck, Peter Dornseif, Marion Haberl, Christina Hoeltel, Claudia Höll, Sandra Kruger', null, 'Mockumentary about German schoolgirls openly talking about their scandalous sexual experiences. Some of these are illustrated through inserted vignettes. Also, a street reporter asks actual common folk about their views on sex.', 'Mockumentary about German schoolgirls openly talking about their scandalous sexual experiences. Some of these are illustrated through inserted vignettes. Also, a street reporter asks actual common folk about their views on sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwm7aj1XdzrO5UwMgOhyan11z0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36888'),
  ('209525890521530752', 'The School of Flesh', 1998, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Benoît Jacquot, Caroline Champetier', 'Jacques Fieschi', 'Isabelle Huppert, Vincent Martinez, Vincent Lindon, Marthe Keller, François Berléand, Danièle Dubroux, Bernard Le Coq, Roxane Mesquida', 'R', 'Fashion executive Dominique''s obsession for Quentin, a young bisexual hustler, fills her desire for physical love but leaves her taxed emotionally. Twists and turns in the relationship, along with the man''s violent and abusive nature, force Dominique to reconcile the conflicts created by her passion. In this quest, Dominique is aided, and sometimes hindered, by friends, clients, and Quentin''s former and current acquaintances.', 'Fashion executive Dominique''s obsession for Quentin, a young bisexual hustler, fills her desire for physical love but leaves her taxed emotionally. Twists and turns in the relationship, along with the man''s violent and abusive nature, force Dominique to reconcile the conflicts created by her passion. In this quest, Dominique is aided, and sometimes hindered, by friends, clients, and Quentin''s former and current acquaintances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esyIrOG6cjRYIAfjI3Sj9ijA8LQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77936'),
  ('359129216636881073', 'The School of Mischief', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Galal El Sharkawy, Abdallah El Sheikh', 'Ali Salem', 'Adel Emam, Saeed Saleh, Younes Shalaby, Ahmed Zaki, Hadi El Gayar, Soheir El-Bably, Hassan Mostafa, Abdallah Farghaly', null, 'In a high school plagued by five unruly students who have failed to graduate for over a decade, the principal hires a new teacher in a last-ditch effort to restore order. Effat, the newly appointed instructor, takes on the challenge with hopes of reforming the troublemakers into model students.', 'In a high school plagued by five unruly students who have failed to graduate for over a decade, the principal hires a new teacher in a last-ditch effort to restore order. Effat, the newly appointed instructor, takes on the challenge with hopes of reforming the troublemakers into model students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBeGvLqm1LvGOPYyfI2SJgOHJx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57004'),
  ('502822786497973487', 'The School of Power', 2009, 'TV Movie', 'Raoul Peck', 'Ève de Castro, Raoul Peck, Aaron Barzman', 'Robinson Stévenin, Élodie Navarre, Céline Sallette, Thibault Vinçon, Valentin Merlet, Émilie Deville, Julien Héteau, Linda Hardy', null, 'A retelling in two parts, from 1977 to 1986, of the education and the rise to power of a group of young graduates of the prestigious ENA school.', 'A retelling in two parts, from 1977 to 1986, of the education and the rise to power of a group of young graduates of the prestigious ENA school.', null, 'tmdb:movie:289717'),
  ('632549908260319270', 'The School of the Magical Animals', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gregor Schnitzler, Wolfgang Aichholzer, Lars Krüger', 'Viola Schmidt, John Chambers', 'Emilia Maier, Leonard Artur Conrads, Loris Sichrovsky, Nadja Uhl, Justus von Dohnányi, Heiko Pinkowski, Marleen Lohse, Milan Peschel', null, 'Ida Kronenberg must transfer to a new school, where she soon realizes the students are unkind to each other. However, that all changes when a new teacher, Miss Cornfield, begins to educate them on the value of friendship and magic.', 'Ida Kronenberg must transfer to a new school, where she soon realizes the students are unkind to each other. However, that all changes when a new teacher, Miss Cornfield, begins to educate them on the value of friendship and magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJl7go7W9MG4yVOQ3qCLTWo6oe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793937'),
  ('145955087999880598', 'The School Teacher', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Nando Cicero, Giancarlo Ferrando, Michele Massimo Tarantini', 'Francesco Milizia, Tito Carpi', 'Edwige Fenech, Vittorio Caprioli, Alfredo Pea, Mario Carotenuto, Carlo Delle Piane, Stefano Amato, Leo Colonna, Alvaro Vitali', null, 'A rich Sicilian, Fefè Mottola, decides to call a wealthy girl graduate: Giovanna, who is about to become a teacher, because his son needs repetitions. The boy, named Franco, is shocked by the physical beauty of the teacher, and so to restrain himself decides to pose as gay. But the deception does not last long, because the sexual impulses of Alfredo explode.', 'A rich Sicilian, Fefè Mottola, decides to call a wealthy girl graduate: Giovanna, who is about to become a teacher, because his son needs repetitions. The boy, named Franco, is shocked by the physical beauty of the teacher, and so to restrain himself decides to pose as gay. But the deception does not last long, because the sexual impulses of Alfredo explode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKXvN2Ez55CloBZL8ny31u4IE2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106909'),
  ('881790511193193595', 'The School Teacher', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Claude Berri, Françoise Lehérissey, Colin Mounier', 'Claude Berri, Jules Celma', 'Coluche, Josiane Balasko, Jacques Debary, Roland Giraud, Charlotte de Turckheim, André Chaumeau, Jean Champion, Georges Staquet', null, 'After having lost his job for having saved a child accused of shop lifting, Frédéric Barbier decides to become a school teacher with some funny results.The great comedy actor Coluche is excellent as a simple school teacher.', 'After having lost his job for having saved a child accused of shop lifting, Frédéric Barbier decides to become a school teacher with some funny results.The great comedy actor Coluche is excellent as a simple school teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ToezxqfIvCcuFzVmGp82FOBkQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53179'),
  ('640512136391715318', 'The School Trip', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Lars Montag, Harald Cremer', 'Robert Löhr', 'Josefine Preuß, Marlon Kittel, Kostja Ullmann, Tom Lass, Jennifer Ulrich, Mark Dimant, Yasmin Asadie, Philipp Danne', null, 'Not Rome, Paris or Florence - the 11c class trip goes to the “spectacular” Sauerland. Nessie, the class representative, is to blame for this; she chose the desolate destination. It''s clear that something like this doesn''t go without consequences: As soon as he arrives at the country school, the newcomer Erik reveals the secret about Nessie''s "full" breasts in front of the entire team. The receipt comes promptly: Nessie gives him a bloody nose and starts a campaign of revenge with her friend Tobi...', 'Not Rome, Paris or Florence - the 11c class trip goes to the “spectacular” Sauerland. Nessie, the class representative, is to blame for this; she chose the desolate destination. It''s clear that something like this doesn''t go without consequences: As soon as he arrives at the country school, the newcomer Erik reveals the secret about Nessie''s "full" breasts in front of the entire team. The receipt comes promptly: Nessie gives him a bloody nose and starts a campaign of revenge with her friend Tobi...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vig2W8ZKjLNwpqzcVzWmxwjvRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36920'),
  ('291435113137489244', 'The School Waltz', 1977, 'Family, Romance, Drama', 'Pavel Lyubimov, Pyotr Kataev, Leonard Bukhov', 'Anna Rodionova', 'Elena Tsyplakova, Sergei Nasibov, Yevgeniya Simonova, Yuriy Solomin, Natalya Vilkina, Viktor Kamaev, Nina Menshikova, Viktor Proskurin', null, 'The ten-graders Gosha and Zosya are in love with each other. The last school waltz has been played and it seems nothing stands any longer in the way of the young people being together. However, getting the news that he’s going to be a father soon, Gosha chooses a “free life” and… marries Dina who has long been in love with him, though with no reciprocity. But already at the registry office, the lucky winner realizes that getting Gosha as her husband doesn’t mean getting his love, that unintentionally she made her loved one unhappy and they have no future together…', 'The ten-graders Gosha and Zosya are in love with each other. The last school waltz has been played and it seems nothing stands any longer in the way of the young people being together. However, getting the news that he’s going to be a father soon, Gosha chooses a “free life” and… marries Dina who has long been in love with him, though with no reciprocity. But already at the registry office, the lucky winner realizes that getting Gosha as her husband doesn’t mean getting his love, that unintentionally she made her loved one unhappy and they have no future together…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4flLxTjKoess8Nai6iOaExHAkaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149887'),
  ('1092891414506364648', 'The Schoolmate', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Pasquale Rachini, Marina Mattoli', 'Francesco Milizia, Franco Mercuri', 'Lilli Carati, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Alvaro Vitali, Antonio Melidoni, Lino Banfi, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Gigi Ballista, Stefano Amato', null, 'Lilli Carati plays a high school student being pursued by a very persistent young man in this Italian sex-comedy', 'Lilli Carati plays a high school student being pursued by a very persistent young man in this Italian sex-comedy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgZKesPoWYSovyoIGMZS2C2zcut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127745'),
  ('277610396830813867', 'The Science of Sleep', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Michel Gondry, Jean-Louis Bompoint', 'Michel Gondry', 'Gael García Bernal, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Miou-Miou, Alain Chabat, Emma de Caunes, Aurélia Petit, Sacha Bourdo, Pierre Vaneck', 'R', 'A man entranced by his dreams and imagination is lovestruck with a French woman and feels he can show her his world.', 'A man entranced by his dreams and imagination is lovestruck with a French woman and feels he can show her his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bummqwU6MV65ZJvNtKx8Y3NIEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300'),
  ('343009148162770328', 'The Scientist', 2020, 'Horror, Drama', 'Derrick Granado, Kevin Keller', 'Derrick Granado', 'Robb Hudspeth, Kristin Keith, Addison McGarry, J. Alan Nelson, David Dittmeier, Shannon Denay, Cassidy Kennedy, Daniel B. Davis', 'NR', 'An unconventional scientist, struggling to care for his terminally-ill wife, embarks on a journey to develop a cure for her. However, his methods of treatment and tampering with human DNA, could lead to the extinction of humanity.', 'An unconventional scientist, struggling to care for his terminally-ill wife, embarks on a journey to develop a cure for her. However, his methods of treatment and tampering with human DNA, could lead to the extinction of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIkKM1nlzk8DThFT4vxgW1KoofL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715658'),
  ('910776216097211470', 'The Scissors Massacre', 2008, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Kotaro Terauchi', 'Carolco', 'Rin Asuka, Yukie Kawamura, Mayuko Iwasa, Akihiro Mayama, Yousuke Saito, Miki Hayashi, Erina, Haruka Nishimoto', null, 'Three sisters grow up on a chicken farm in a small town in Gifu. The oldest sister, Yukie Sawada, is engaged to be married, the middle sister, Sachiko works at a beauty salon and the youngest, Mayu, is on the track team in high school. Their happy, carefree lives are changed forever when Yukie''s ex-boyfriend Suzuki commits an atrocious crime. Half-crazed and bent on revenge against the Sawada family, Suzuki mistakes Mayu for Yukie and pours acid all over her face. Overwhelmed by physical and psychological trauma, Mayu sinks deeper into depression and isolation, unresponsive to her sisters encouragement. Meanwhile, chilling news of a serial murderer, who preys on the alumni of Mayu''s high school, sends shockwaves through their small town...', 'Three sisters grow up on a chicken farm in a small town in Gifu. The oldest sister, Yukie Sawada, is engaged to be married, the middle sister, Sachiko works at a beauty salon and the youngest, Mayu, is on the track team in high school. Their happy, carefree lives are changed forever when Yukie''s ex-boyfriend Suzuki commits an atrocious crime. Half-crazed and bent on revenge against the Sawada family, Suzuki mistakes Mayu for Yukie and pours acid all over her face. Overwhelmed by physical and psychological trauma, Mayu sinks deeper into depression and isolation, unresponsive to her sisters encouragement. Meanwhile, chilling news of a serial murderer, who preys on the alumni of Mayu''s high school, sends shockwaves through their small town...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iR1HGdw2hBdpWcMLGBDkqqu2Wy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79278'),
  ('1004479960805117139', 'The Scooby-Doo Project', 1999, 'Animation, Mystery, Horror, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Casper Kelly, Larry Morris, Steve Patrick', 'Casper Kelly, Steve Patrick, Larry Morris', 'B.J. Ward, Mary Kay Bergman, Frank Welker, Scott Innes', null, 'In the Fall of 1999, four teenage sleuths and their Great Dane got lost in the woods while in search of a mystery. This is their story.', 'In the Fall of 1999, four teenage sleuths and their Great Dane got lost in the woods while in search of a mystery. This is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOEdNxSqrWMiYLFJEM6poBu3bSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423336'),
  ('252269432782879380', 'The Scopone Game', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Luca Fabriani, Silla Bettini', 'Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Silvana Mangano, Joseph Cotten, Bette Davis, Mario Carotenuto, Domenico Modugno, Antonella Di Maggio, Daniele Dublino', 'NR', 'An aging American millionairess journeys to Rome each year with her chauffeur George to play the card game scopone with destitute Peppino and his wife Antonia.', 'An aging American millionairess journeys to Rome each year with her chauffeur George to play the card game scopone with destitute Peppino and his wife Antonia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nOaPSZ9zQCFlwUUclJRBi4OR78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56341'),
  ('538204742626317277', 'The Score', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Frank Oz, Rob Hahn, David Sardi', 'Kario Salem, Scott Marshall Smith, Lem Dobbs', 'Robert De Niro, Edward Norton, Marlon Brando, Angela Bassett, Gary Farmer, Jamie Harrold, Paul Soles, Martin Drainville', 'R', 'An aging thief hopes to retire and live off his ill-gotten wealth when a young kid convinces him into doing one last heist.', 'An aging thief hopes to retire and live off his ill-gotten wealth when a young kid convinces him into doing one last heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsb4m9XW59mei8GKznvI3lLzcfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11371'),
  ('116402939008532790', 'The Scorpion King', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chuck Russell, John R. Leonetti, Greg Michael', 'Stephen Sommers, William Osborne, David Hayter', 'Dwayne Johnson, Steven Brand, Michael Clarke Duncan, Sherri Howard, Bernard Hill, Grant Heslov, Kelly Hu, Peter Facinelli', 'PG-13', 'In ancient Egypt, peasant Mathayus is hired to exact revenge on the powerful Memnon and the sorceress Cassandra, who are ready to overtake Balthazar''s village. Amid betrayals, thieves, abductions and more, Mathayus strives to bring justice to his complicated world.', 'In ancient Egypt, peasant Mathayus is hired to exact revenge on the powerful Memnon and the sorceress Cassandra, who are ready to overtake Balthazar''s village. Amid betrayals, thieves, abductions and more, Mathayus strives to bring justice to his complicated world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aITIsX20tACn6jgtyDcCYpRT216.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9334'),
  ('290297298589626933', 'The Scorpion King 2: Rise of a Warrior', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Russell Mulcahy, Glynn Speeckaert', 'Randall McCormick', 'Michael Copon, Randy Couture, Karen David, Simon Quarterman, Tom Wu, Andreas Wisniewski, Natalie Becker, Jeremy Crutchley', 'PG-13', 'The heroic tale of young Mathayus and his relentless quest for justice against an evil and powerful villain, King Sargon. Mathayus faces heart-stopping tribulations during his adventurous, odds-defying trajectory toward his ultimate destiny: becoming the formidable warrior king of an ancient desert empire.', 'The heroic tale of young Mathayus and his relentless quest for justice against an evil and powerful villain, King Sargon. Mathayus faces heart-stopping tribulations during his adventurous, odds-defying trajectory toward his ultimate destiny: becoming the formidable warrior king of an ancient desert empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osZ6HJJBPwptZLTXFYbGQ0Jc7WB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13486'),
  ('267978612078411231', 'The Scorpion King 3: Battle for Redemption', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'Shane Kuhn, Brendan Cowles', 'Victor Webster, Bostin Christopher, Temuera Morrison, Krystal Vee, Selina Lo, Ron Perlman, Kimbo Slice, Dave Bautista', 'PG-13', 'Since his triumphant rise to power in the original blockbuster "The Scorpion King", Mathayus'' kingdom has fallen and he''s lost his queen to plague. Now an assassin for hire, he must defend a kingdom from an evil tyrant and his ghost warriors for the chance to regain the power and glory he once knew. Starring Ron Perlman ("Hellboy") and Billy Zane ("Titanic"), and featuring 6-time WWE champion Dave Bautista and UFC star Kimbo Slice, "The Scorpion King 3: Battle for Redemption" takes "The Mummy" phenomenon to an all-new level of epic action and non-stop adventure.', 'Since his triumphant rise to power in the original blockbuster "The Scorpion King", Mathayus'' kingdom has fallen and he''s lost his queen to plague. Now an assassin for hire, he must defend a kingdom from an evil tyrant and his ghost warriors for the chance to regain the power and glory he once knew. Starring Ron Perlman ("Hellboy") and Billy Zane ("Titanic"), and featuring 6-time WWE champion Dave Bautista and UFC star Kimbo Slice, "The Scorpion King 3: Battle for Redemption" takes "The Mummy" phenomenon to an all-new level of epic action and non-stop adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmLWbxZhZADXk4gpzLiHs5blDkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78049'),
  ('875248306882327023', 'The Scorpion King 4: Quest for Power', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mike Elliott, Trevor Michael Brown, Irina Niculescu', 'Michael D. Weiss', 'Victor Webster, Ellen Hollman, Barry Bostwick, Will Kemp, M. Emmet Walsh, Brandon Hardesty, Esmé Bianco, Rodger Halston', 'PG-13', 'When he is betrayed by a trusted friend, Mathayus must marshal all his strength and cunning to outwit a formidable opponent who will stop at nothing to unlock a supreme ancient power.', 'When he is betrayed by a trusted friend, Mathayus must marshal all his strength and cunning to outwit a formidable opponent who will stop at nothing to unlock a supreme ancient power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GISNwtHWbmYJdbFHMpLoaotYhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297291'),
  ('393193117462607127', 'The Scoundrel', 1935, 'Drama', 'Lee Garmes, Ben Hecht, Charles MacArthur', null, 'Noël Coward, Julie Haydon, Stanley Ridges, Martha Sleeper, Ernest Cossart, Alexander Woollcott, Everley Gregg, Rosita Moreno', null, 'A ruthless, cynical, hated publisher is killed in a plane crash, doomed to be a "restless" spirit for being unloved. A heavenly power gives him a month on Earth to find one person to shed a tear for him before his fate is sealed.', 'A ruthless, cynical, hated publisher is killed in a plane crash, doomed to be a "restless" spirit for being unloved. A heavenly power gives him a month on Earth to find one person to shed a tear for him before his fate is sealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6sF5TE0vBFvsByvV4dSGPmZGYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37089'),
  ('993406246649035521', 'The Scoundrels', 2018, 'Crime, Action', 'Chen Ko-chin, Hung Tzu-hsuan', 'Chien-Ming Huang', 'JC Lin, Wu Kang-ren, Lee Chien-na, Nikki Hsieh, Frederick Lee, Jack Kao, Ark Zheng, Shih Ming-shuai', null, 'A former basketball player bonds with a robber and becomes attracted to a dark lifestyle.', 'A former basketball player bonds with a robber and becomes attracted to a dark lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCtkH2wWspjRB9tjwgATXRdqzUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548669'),
  ('542928692693744895', 'The Scout', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Michael Ritchie, László Kovács, Thomas J. Mack', 'Monica Johnson, Andrew Bergman, Albert Brooks', 'Albert Brooks, Brendan Fraser, Dianne Wiest, Anne Twomey, Lane Smith, Michael Rapaport, Barry Shabaka Henley, John Capodice', 'PG-13', 'When his star recruit botches a Major League Baseball debut, humiliated talent scout Al Percolo gets banished to rural Mexico, where he finds a potential gold mine in the arm of young phenom Steve Nebraska. Soon, the New York Yankees put a $55 million contract on the table—provided a psychiatrist can affirm Nebraska''s mental stability.', 'When his star recruit botches a Major League Baseball debut, humiliated talent scout Al Percolo gets banished to rural Mexico, where he finds a potential gold mine in the arm of young phenom Steve Nebraska. Soon, the New York Yankees put a $55 million contract on the table—provided a psychiatrist can affirm Nebraska''s mental stability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5b1k4wmZShLu1Fo19SzcOJKRlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35233'),
  ('870965236586182294', 'The Scream Team', 2002, 'Fantasy, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Stuart Gillard, Philip Linzey, Andrew Shea', null, 'Mark Rendall, Kat Dennings, Robert Bockstael, Eric Idle, Tommy Davidson, Gary Reineke, Nigel Bennett, Kathy Najimy', null, 'Eccentric Frank Carlyle ran a horror shop in small-town Steeple Falls, which takes pride in and profit from its Halloween traditions. Frank''s widower grandson Richard grudgingly returns there from Boston with his own kids, bright Ian and bratty Claire, to settle the inheritance. Ian discovers great-grandpa''s house is really haunted, and not just, as legend holds, by historic owner Zachariah Kull, who was burned on the stake.', 'Eccentric Frank Carlyle ran a horror shop in small-town Steeple Falls, which takes pride in and profit from its Halloween traditions. Frank''s widower grandson Richard grudgingly returns there from Boston with his own kids, bright Ian and bratty Claire, to settle the inheritance. Ian discovers great-grandpa''s house is really haunted, and not just, as legend holds, by historic owner Zachariah Kull, who was burned on the stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yNkp4WVF2gRS5jw0YXU4NWagXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109164'),
  ('173802268228931668', 'The Screaming Skull', 1958, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alex Nicol, Floyd Crosby, Maurice Vaccarino', 'John Kneubuhl', 'John Hudson, Peggy Webber, Russ Conway, Alex Nicol, Tony Johnson', 'NR', 'Newlyweds Eric and Jenni Whitlock retire to his desolate mansion, where Eric''s first wife Marianne died from a mysterious freak accident. Jenni, who has a history of mental illness, begins to see strange things including a mysterious skull, which may or may not be a product of her imagination.', 'Newlyweds Eric and Jenni Whitlock retire to his desolate mansion, where Eric''s first wife Marianne died from a mysterious freak accident. Jenni, who has a history of mental illness, begins to see strange things including a mysterious skull, which may or may not be a product of her imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvobVaHdaPn0y7KNZT6Nfmgohr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34078'),
  ('446309332989737719', 'The Screaming Woman', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jack Smight, Brad Arrison, Sam Leavitt', 'Merwin Gerard', 'Olivia de Havilland, Ed Nelson, Laraine Stephens, Joseph Cotten, Walter Pidgeon, Charles Robinson, Alexandra Hay, Lonny Chapman', 'NR', 'A wealthy former mental patient goes home to her estate to rest and recuperate. While walking the grounds one day she hears the screams of a woman coming from underneath the ground. Her family, however, refuses to believe her story, and sees the incident as an opportunity to prove the woman''s mind has snapped so they can take control of her money.', 'A wealthy former mental patient goes home to her estate to rest and recuperate. While walking the grounds one day she hears the screams of a woman coming from underneath the ground. Her family, however, refuses to believe her story, and sees the incident as an opportunity to prove the woman''s mind has snapped so they can take control of her money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/310ZkynMZGRo9uSdblxWd23jhZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134800'),
  ('19351195588063262', 'The Screw-Up', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Mieczysław Krawicz, Stanisław Lipiński', 'Napoleon Sądek, Jan Fethke', 'Adolf Dymsza, Renata Radojewska, Michał Znicz, Józef Orwid, Wanda Jarszewska, Andrzej Bogucki, Seweryna Broniszówna, Irena Skwierczyńska', null, 'Polish comedian Adolf Dymsza cross-dressing and masquerading as a woman in order to gain the confidence of his sweetheart''s domineering guardian.', 'Polish comedian Adolf Dymsza cross-dressing and masquerading as a woman in order to gain the confidence of his sweetheart''s domineering guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVKKOn0ij76Q7lVxzPX7mNXdkfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:577956'),
  ('1093883302673726421', 'The Screwball', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alex Lovy', null, 'Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers, Harold Peary', 'NR', 'It''s the day of the big baseball game between the Drips and the Droops and Woody Woodpecker is trying to crash the gate and get in without paying for a ticket. A policeman keeps tossing him out but Woody puts on a baseball uniform---including a baseball-cap, since baseball players do not wear hats---gets inside and soon gets involved with the game. He ends up pinned to the scoreboard by a deluge of baseballs thrown by everybody in the ballpark.', 'It''s the day of the big baseball game between the Drips and the Droops and Woody Woodpecker is trying to crash the gate and get in without paying for a ticket. A policeman keeps tossing him out but Woody puts on a baseball uniform---including a baseball-cap, since baseball players do not wear hats---gets inside and soon gets involved with the game. He ends up pinned to the scoreboard by a deluge of baseballs thrown by everybody in the ballpark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNBofrk8UWv6ndNWt9I9rmQsFMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88153'),
  ('747567967862437082', 'The Screwdriver', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walter Lantz', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Woody Woodpecker is driving through the countryside and is, shall we say, not a stickler for the rules. He''s practically asking for trouble when he confronts a traffic cop who explains he is looking for speeders. Woody reveals himself to be a speeder by driving to Alaska and back in less than a minute. The cop tries to arrest him but Woody states, "I bet ya wouldn''t be so tough without that uniform." The officer undresses but Woody attacks him with a boxing glove camera. Woody also gets his goat by dressing as a farmer on horse-and-buggy and as a Chinaboy with rickshaw. Finally, the cop flips out and is sent to a mental hospital with Woody as his caretaker.', 'Woody Woodpecker is driving through the countryside and is, shall we say, not a stickler for the rules. He''s practically asking for trouble when he confronts a traffic cop who explains he is looking for speeders. Woody reveals himself to be a speeder by driving to Alaska and back in less than a minute. The cop tries to arrest him but Woody states, "I bet ya wouldn''t be so tough without that uniform." The officer undresses but Woody attacks him with a boxing glove camera. Woody also gets his goat by dressing as a farmer on horse-and-buggy and as a Chinaboy with rickshaw. Finally, the cop flips out and is sent to a mental hospital with Woody as his caretaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQYkZmZ2zuP44kdWC8vwraTFbfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88509'),
  ('207008139437514619', 'The Screwfly Solution', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Joe Dante', 'Sam Hamm', 'Jason Priestley, Elliott Gould, Kerry Norton, Linda Darlow, Brenna O''Brien, Steve Lawlor', null, 'A strange virus renders the entire human male population into homicidal maniacs who end up wiping out all females, leaving a woman and her daughter to fend for themselves.', 'A strange virus renders the entire human male population into homicidal maniacs who end up wiping out all females, leaving a woman and her daughter to fend for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7idInYDe0UWZZdsIsm0legVqUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68418'),
  ('551431322002154341', 'The Screwy Truant', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Wally Maher', null, 'The truant officer is after Screwy Squirrel for not going to school.', 'The truant officer is after Screwy Squirrel for not going to school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1veAMwvOPVla0cX43YFV3vCO9DN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87215'),
  ('186579741349296388', 'The Scribbler', 2014, 'Thriller', 'John Suits, Mark Putnam, Jonathan Southard', 'Dan Schaffer', 'Michelle Trachtenberg, Katie Cassidy, Eliza Dushku, Sasha Grey, Gina Gershon, Garret Dillahunt, Kunal Nayyar, Ashlynn Yennie', 'R', 'Suki is a young woman confronting her destructive mental illness using "The Siamese Burn," an experimental machine designed to eliminate multiple personalities. The closer Suki comes to being "cured," she''s haunted by a thought... what if the last unwanted identity turns out to be her?', 'Suki is a young woman confronting her destructive mental illness using "The Siamese Burn," an experimental machine designed to eliminate multiple personalities. The closer Suki comes to being "cured," she''s haunted by a thought... what if the last unwanted identity turns out to be her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNIVl3C53zbImduusZsWXCo2RTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251852'),
  ('471654829885148515', 'The Scribe', 1966, 'Comedy', 'John Sebert', 'Clifford Braggins, Paul Sutherland', 'Buster Keaton, Jack Creley, Cec Linder', null, 'Comedy short produced by the Construction Safety Association of Ontario, Canada. It demonstrates the dos and don''ts of construction site safety. The film is the last professionally filmed footage of film legend Buster Keaton, shot months before his death from lung cancer on February 1, 1966. He recreates several routines from his youth, as well as some new material for the film. Most notable was his recreation of a gag from his 1918 film The Bell Boy in which he mops the floor using only the tip of the mop, little by little while sitting on the floor.', 'Comedy short produced by the Construction Safety Association of Ontario, Canada. It demonstrates the dos and don''ts of construction site safety. The film is the last professionally filmed footage of film legend Buster Keaton, shot months before his death from lung cancer on February 1, 1966. He recreates several routines from his youth, as well as some new material for the film. Most notable was his recreation of a gag from his 1918 film The Bell Boy in which he mops the floor using only the tip of the mop, little by little while sitting on the floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ckUjLdcjafkFUBGX0XyQu20gyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53621'),
  ('961490321424773105', 'The Scythian Lamb', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Daihachi Yoshida, Akiko Ashizawa, Seitaro Kai', 'Masahito Kagawa', 'Ryo Nishikido, Fumino Kimura, Ryuhei Matsuda, Kazuki Kitamura, Yûka, Mikako Ichikawa, Shingo Mizusawa, Min Tanaka', null, 'Based on a manga written by Tatsuhiko Yamagami, the story is set in a former seaport town Uobuka, where 6 former criminals were sent to live there by the government, with the intention of re-socialising them. Aside from the few who know about the project, the general townsfolk has no idea of the former convicts'' identities. Tsukisue is the pleasant and efficient municipal official put in charge of the programme. As he slowly learns about their past, a body is discovered.', 'Based on a manga written by Tatsuhiko Yamagami, the story is set in a former seaport town Uobuka, where 6 former criminals were sent to live there by the government, with the intention of re-socialising them. Aside from the few who know about the project, the general townsfolk has no idea of the former convicts'' identities. Tsukisue is the pleasant and efficient municipal official put in charge of the programme. As he slowly learns about their past, a body is discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AGEsJGR6ywe1pDkDEpf6WlfQTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418109'),
  ('250517713312339916', 'The Sea', 1962, 'Drama', 'Paolo Bianchini, Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Alfio Valdarnini, Giuseppe Patroni Griffi', 'Umberto Orsini, Françoise Prévost, Dino Mele, Renato Scala, Celestino Cafiero, Gianni Chervatini, Salvatore de Pasqualis, Alfredo Di Stéfano', null, 'A well known actor comes to off-season Capri to unwind and meets a young man. The attraction is immediate and mutual but before their relationship can get off the ground, an alluring woman with a spontaneous sexuality and care free attitude joins the triangle and the boy is slowly pushed out of the picture.', 'A well known actor comes to off-season Capri to unwind and meets a young man. The attraction is immediate and mutual but before their relationship can get off the ground, an alluring woman with a spontaneous sexuality and care free attitude joins the triangle and the boy is slowly pushed out of the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UJoWZ8dmmqiJe9PszrjJ0I1He1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372234'),
  ('681655440080587013', 'The Sea', 2000, 'War, Drama', 'Agustí Villaronga, Jaume Peracaula', 'Agustí Villaronga, Antonio Aloy, Biel Mesquida', 'Roger Casamajor, Bruno Bergonzini, Antonia Torrens, Juli Mira, Simón Andreu, Ángela Molina, Nilo Mur, Hernán González Villamil', null, 'Childhood friends reunite later in life in Spanish tuberculosis sanitorium. Pressures of death all around combine with dark secrets of their past.', 'Childhood friends reunite later in life in Spanish tuberculosis sanitorium. Pressures of death all around combine with dark secrets of their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wsNLhToOjGfsBIdLJywmSHZI9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41425'),
  ('849713128318218745', 'The Sea and Poison', 1986, 'Drama, War', 'Masao Tochizawa, Kei Kumai, Kazuo Hara', 'Kei Kumai', 'Eiji Okuda, Ken Watanabe, Takahiro Tamura, Kyôko Kishida, Mikio Narita, Shigeru Kōyama, Toshie Negishi, Masumi Okada', null, 'Two interns and a nurse are interrogated by American MPs for their involvement in an atrocity during the war: the vivisections of a downed American air crew.', 'Two interns and a nurse are interrogated by American MPs for their involvement in an atrocity during the war: the vivisections of a downed American air crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvDpxWlgrrs1ipm2jWAWo6dz1Hu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103393'),
  ('180353775292100108', 'The Sea and the Weather', 1989, 'Drama', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, José Luis Alcaine', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez', 'Rafaela Aparicio, Pepe Soriano, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Cristina Marsillach, Iñaki Miramón, Ramón Madaula, Emma Cohen', null, 'Jesus returns to Spain after a long exile in Argentina. The family he meets is very different from the one he left: they live under the sadness of being the losers of the war, Marcela, before a beautiful young woman, is now an alcoholic, and the youngest can not even understand them. Jesus wants to start a new life in Spain but he feels out of place; Time has turned him into an inhabitant of the other side of the ''puddle''.', 'Jesus returns to Spain after a long exile in Argentina. The family he meets is very different from the one he left: they live under the sadness of being the losers of the war, Marcela, before a beautiful young woman, is now an alcoholic, and the youngest can not even understand them. Jesus wants to start a new life in Spain but he feels out of place; Time has turned him into an inhabitant of the other side of the ''puddle''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yO4wzOAXAabQSlkERrUn5BizXLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160457'),
  ('484768745121190426', 'The Sea Around Us', 1953, 'Documentary', 'Irwin Allen', 'Irwin Allen', 'Don Forbes, Theodore von Eltz', null, 'Irwin Allen explores the mysteries of the deep blue sea in this Technicolor documentary. Based on Rachel L. Carson''s famous study, this Oscar winning project investigates everything under the sea, from sharks, whales and octopuses to microscopical creatures and their coexistence in this vast underwater world.', 'Irwin Allen explores the mysteries of the deep blue sea in this Technicolor documentary. Based on Rachel L. Carson''s famous study, this Oscar winning project investigates everything under the sea, from sharks, whales and octopuses to microscopical creatures and their coexistence in this vast underwater world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4zZIQUcJAAaXBMaOftr1hIOXCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104989'),
  ('250219248374196025', 'The Sea Bat', 1930, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Lionel Barrymore, Ira H. Morgan, Wesley Ruggles', 'Bess Meredyth, John Howard Lawson', 'Raquel Torres, Charles Bickford, Nils Asther, George F. Marion, John Miljan, Boris Karloff, Gibson Gowland, Edmund Breese', 'NR', 'The sister of a sponge diver killed by a stingray loves an escaped convict posing as a priest.', 'The sister of a sponge diver killed by a stingray loves an escaped convict posing as a priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoRiafSb8K4iJtMSmEt4aY94jNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174759'),
  ('221940727672501698', 'The Sea Beast', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Family, Fantasy', 'Zach Parrish, Chris Williams', 'Nell Benjamin, Chris Williams', 'Karl Urban, Zaris-Angel Hator, Jared Harris, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Benjamin Plessala, Somali Rose, Kaya McLean, Davis Pak', 'PG', 'When a young girl stows away on the ship of a legendary sea monster hunter, they launch an epic journey into uncharted waters — and make history to boot.', 'When a young girl stows away on the ship of a legendary sea monster hunter, they launch an epic journey into uncharted waters — and make history to boot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Zfv4Ap1e8eKOYnZPtYaWhLkk0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560057'),
  ('590961930814432202', 'The Sea Chase', 1955, 'War, Action, Drama', 'John Farrow, William H. Clothier', 'John Twist, James Warner Bellah', 'John Wayne, Lana Turner, David Farrar, James Arness, Tab Hunter, Lyle Bettger, Paul Fix, Claude Akins', 'NR', 'As the Second World War breaks out, German freighter captain Karl Ehrlich is about to leave Sydney, Australia with his vessel, the Ergenstrasse. Ehrlich, an anti-Nazi but proud German, hopes to outrun or out-maneuver the British warship pursuing him. Aboard his vessel is Elsa Keller, a woman Ehrlich has been ordered to return to Germany safely along with whatever secrets she carries. When Ehrlich''s fiercely Nazi chief officer Kirchner commits an atrocity, the British pursuit becomes deadly.', 'As the Second World War breaks out, German freighter captain Karl Ehrlich is about to leave Sydney, Australia with his vessel, the Ergenstrasse. Ehrlich, an anti-Nazi but proud German, hopes to outrun or out-maneuver the British warship pursuing him. Aboard his vessel is Elsa Keller, a woman Ehrlich has been ordered to return to Germany safely along with whatever secrets she carries. When Ehrlich''s fiercely Nazi chief officer Kirchner commits an atrocity, the British pursuit becomes deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFzBvq70zOqCb25pJL7pjGBrVAN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40578'),
  ('277082274472556351', 'The Sea Gull', 1968, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Gerry Fisher', 'Moura Budberg', 'James Mason, Vanessa Redgrave, Simone Signoret, David Warner, Harry Andrews, Denholm Elliott, Eileen Herlie, Alfred Lynch', 'G', 'Film adaptation of Anton Chekhov''s story of life in rural Russia during the latter part of the 19th century.', 'Film adaptation of Anton Chekhov''s story of life in rural Russia during the latter part of the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wrC6cJWAYwsn177gscZXBjagmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184795'),
  ('875741092680533234', 'The Sea Hawk', 1924, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Frank Lloyd, Norbert Brodine', 'Rafael Sabatini', 'Lloyd Hughes, Wallace Beery, Milton Sills, Enid Bennett, Marc McDermott, Wallace MacDonald, Bert Woodruff, Claire Du Brey', 'NR', 'The adventures of Oliver Tressilian, who goes from English gentry to galley slave to captain of a Moorish fighting ship.', 'The adventures of Oliver Tressilian, who goes from English gentry to galley slave to captain of a Moorish fighting ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OR57fvegCkpamwvX4DKI6lHwRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50329'),
  ('673490445816743271', 'The Sea Hawk', 1940, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Jean Negulesco, Nathan Levinson', 'Seton I. Miller, Howard W. Koch', 'Errol Flynn, Brenda Marshall, Claude Rains, Donald Crisp, Flora Robson, Alan Hale, Henry Daniell, Una O''Connor', 'NR', 'Dashing pirate Geoffrey Thorpe plunders Spanish ships for Queen Elizabeth I and falls in love with Dona Maria, a beautiful Spanish royal he captures.', 'Dashing pirate Geoffrey Thorpe plunders Spanish ships for Queen Elizabeth I and falls in love with Dona Maria, a beautiful Spanish royal he captures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBJhR84lKoScUPSUfC9mO4yEhjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26201'),
  ('184199934547901565', 'The Sea Horse', 1935, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, André Raymond', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, 'Examines the sea horse, the only fish that swims upright. We watch it use its prehensile tail to wrap around plants and other sea horses. A frontal bulge houses organs including an air ballast. Three fins propel this fish. We see a female place her eggs in a male''s pouch where they are fertilized and nurtured until birth in violent contractions. Inside the pouch are nurturing blood vessels. We then follow the growth of an embryo, greatly magnified: we examine its heart beating and its dorsal fin moving. Young sea horses attach themselves to each other. The film ends with images of many sea horses moving on the ocean floor, superimposed on a horse race.', 'Examines the sea horse, the only fish that swims upright. We watch it use its prehensile tail to wrap around plants and other sea horses. A frontal bulge houses organs including an air ballast. Three fins propel this fish. We see a female place her eggs in a male''s pouch where they are fertilized and nurtured until birth in violent contractions. Inside the pouch are nurturing blood vessels. We then follow the growth of an embryo, greatly magnified: we examine its heart beating and its dorsal fin moving. Young sea horses attach themselves to each other. The film ends with images of many sea horses moving on the ocean floor, superimposed on a horse race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysPmvDgZkIdE3ad6KlfQp14wpcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117592'),
  ('1019511621438871460', 'The Sea Inside', 2004, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Javier Aguirresarobe, Walter Prieto', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Mateo Gil', 'Javier Bardem, Belén Rueda, Lola Dueñas, Joan Dalmau, Josep Maria Pou, Mabel Rivera, Celso Bugallo, Clara Segura', 'PG-13', 'Ramón Sampedro is a ship mechanic and part-time poet left a quadriplegic following a diving accident. Ramón fought for 30 years for the legal right to end his own life. He develops close relationships with his long-term lawyer Julia and his friend Rosa, who tries to convince him that his life is worth living. Despite his situation, Ramón manages to inspire those around him to live life to the fullest.', 'Ramón Sampedro is a ship mechanic and part-time poet left a quadriplegic following a diving accident. Ramón fought for 30 years for the legal right to end his own life. He develops close relationships with his long-term lawyer Julia and his friend Rosa, who tries to convince him that his life is worth living. Despite his situation, Ramón manages to inspire those around him to live life to the fullest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQW1JJKCUg02cmWBzr9JFu9vM1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1913'),
  ('339131588159362080', 'The Sea Is Watching', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kei Kumai, Kazuo Okuhara', 'Akira Kurosawa, Kei Kumai', 'Misa Shimizu, Nagiko Tono, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Eiji Okuda, Miho Tsumiki, Masatoshi Nagase, Michiko Kawai, Yumiko Nogawa', null, 'O-Shin is a young brothel worker who, one night, helps a young samurai escape from his pursuers. Against the warnings of her fellow workers, particularly Kikuno and the brothel''s owner, O-Shin falls in love with the samurai.', 'O-Shin is a young brothel worker who, one night, helps a young samurai escape from his pursuers. Against the warnings of her fellow workers, particularly Kikuno and the brothel''s owner, O-Shin falls in love with the samurai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEmmSvxEg1C2CSJ4qFdo06fyjzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41453'),
  ('275999780132350875', 'The Sea of Grass', 1947, 'Drama, Western, Romance', 'Elia Kazan, Sid Sidman, Richard Rosson', 'Vincent Lawrence, Marguerite Roberts', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Hepburn, Robert Walker, Melvyn Douglas, Phyllis Thaxter, Edgar Buchanan, Harry Carey, Ruth Nelson', 'NR', 'On America''s frontier, a St. Louis woman marries a New Mexico cattleman who is seen as a tyrant by the locals.', 'On America''s frontier, a St. Louis woman marries a New Mexico cattleman who is seen as a tyrant by the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa7D7ThFCvvRTk4J0UocAjFuX1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87531'),
  ('326578987443732164', 'The Sea of Ravens', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Albert Brés, Alfred Guichard, Paul Guichard', 'Jean Epstein', null, null, 'Jean Epstein’s short documentary filmed on the Breton island of Sein, which film preservationist and cinephile Henri Langlois called “one of the most beautiful documentaries in the history of French film, a true poem about Brittany and the sea."', 'Jean Epstein’s short documentary filmed on the Breton island of Sein, which film preservationist and cinephile Henri Langlois called “one of the most beautiful documentaries in the history of French film, a true poem about Brittany and the sea."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYUls1jj8IFEsw2OEWSzo6XBvAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270090'),
  ('67735084515259561', 'The Sea of Trees', 2016, 'Drama', 'Gus Van Sant, Kasper Tuxen, Robert E. Kay', 'Chris Sparling', 'Matthew McConaughey, Naomi Watts, Ken Watanabe, Ryoko Seta, Sienna Tow, Naoko Marshall, Michiko Tomura, Yusuke Tozawa', 'PG-13', 'In Japan''s Aokigahara Forest, a troubled teacher meets a mysterious lost stranger who takes him on a life-changing journey of love and redemption.', 'In Japan''s Aokigahara Forest, a troubled teacher meets a mysterious lost stranger who takes him on a life-changing journey of love and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmVGIEfzxupZUTer1Z5n80CHFnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291351'),
  ('1144462761348680345', 'The Sea People', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Elisabeth Kleppe, Henrik Hylland Uhlving, Elin Sander', 'Henrik Hylland Uhlving, Elisabeth Kleppe, Elin Sander', null, null, 'Of love to the coastal people and an expansion of the story of the Norwegian, exploring what life close to the sea and far from the center of power has done to the coastal people''s temperament, way of life and outlook on life.', 'Of love to the coastal people and an expansion of the story of the Norwegian, exploring what life close to the sea and far from the center of power has done to the coastal people''s temperament, way of life and outlook on life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FHSAbfEQgZC32v4OUk5nzKQrcob.jpg', 'plex:movie:havfolket'),
  ('495977623253315210', 'The Sea Pirate', 1966, 'Adventure', 'Sergio Bergonzelli, Juan Gelpí', 'Georges de La Grandière, Gerald Savery, Giovanni Simonelli', 'Gérard Barray, Terence Morgan, Antonella Lualdi, Geneviève Casile, Armand Mestral, Gérard Tichy, Alberto Cevenini, Giani Esposito', 'NR', 'A young naval officer becomes a corsair to make enough money to marry a pretty girl, and fights injustice and snobbery to reach home safely.', 'A young naval officer becomes a corsair to make enough money to marry a pretty girl, and fights injustice and snobbery to reach home safely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7ZOtUbDC5lPwyekSfeGugaelfb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113572'),
  ('250751020506810482', 'The Sea Shall Not Have Them', 1954, 'Drama, War', 'Lewis Gilbert, Stephen Dade, Muir Mathieson', 'Vernon Harris, Lewis Gilbert', 'Michael Redgrave, Dirk Bogarde, Jack Watling, Bonar Colleano, Anthony Steel, Nigel Patrick, James Kenney, Sydney Tafler', 'NR', 'During the autumn of 1944, RAF Hudson, carrying a VIP passenger in possession of highly secret information, is shot down and ditches in the North Sea. Fighting the elements and trying to keep up morale, the occupants of the aircraft''s dinghy talk about their lives awaiting the rescue they hope will come. The film''s title reflects the motto of the RAF''s Air Sea Rescue Service, one of whose high speed launches battles against its own mechanical problems, enemy action, time and the weather to locate and rescue the downed crew and the vital secret papers they carry.', 'During the autumn of 1944, RAF Hudson, carrying a VIP passenger in possession of highly secret information, is shot down and ditches in the North Sea. Fighting the elements and trying to keep up morale, the occupants of the aircraft''s dinghy talk about their lives awaiting the rescue they hope will come. The film''s title reflects the motto of the RAF''s Air Sea Rescue Service, one of whose high speed launches battles against its own mechanical problems, enemy action, time and the weather to locate and rescue the downed crew and the vital secret papers they carry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn2OmRN99wGsJ4TijcdNKHN1UgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65799'),
  ('493956520552989551', 'The Sea Wall', 2009, 'Drama', 'Rithy Panh, Pierre Milon, Pascal Guerin', 'Michel Fessler, Rithy Panh', 'Gaspard Ulliel, Isabelle Huppert, Stéphane Rideau, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Vincent Grass, Randal Douc, Lucy Harrison, Duong Vanthon', null, 'The film centers on a young French widow and her two adolescent children as they attempt to carve out a meager life for themselves by farming rice fields alongside the ocean in French Indo-China in the 1930s. Their efforts are hampered each year by the presence of the sea, which invariably floods the fields with saltwater and wipes out the crops. In desperation, the mother realizes that their only hope lies in the construction of a sea wall to prevent continued flooding, but the mother must cut a swath through the local bureaucracy in an almost Sisyphean attempt to make this happen. Meanwhile, her obstinate daughter, Suzanne, draws the romantic obsessions of a well-to-do Chinese gentleman, Monsieur Jo. Though he could easily provide a way out, the possibility of a romantic relationship between Jo and Suzanne could just as easily fall prey to local racial prejudices that would damage or ruin the lives of both.', 'The film centers on a young French widow and her two adolescent children as they attempt to carve out a meager life for themselves by farming rice fields alongside the ocean in French Indo-China in the 1930s. Their efforts are hampered each year by the presence of the sea, which invariably floods the fields with saltwater and wipes out the crops. In desperation, the mother realizes that their only hope lies in the construction of a sea wall to prevent continued flooding, but the mother must cut a swath through the local bureaucracy in an almost Sisyphean attempt to make this happen. Meanwhile, her obstinate daughter, Suzanne, draws the romantic obsessions of a well-to-do Chinese gentleman, Monsieur Jo. Though he could easily provide a way out, the possibility of a romantic relationship between Jo and Suzanne could just as easily fall prey to local racial prejudices that would damage or ruin the lives of both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raQCfa5T9wD7N9Dfsx32T1v5AgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52492'),
  ('866926512948205839', 'The Sea Wolf', 1941, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Sol Polito, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Robert Rossen', 'Edward G. Robinson, Ida Lupino, John Garfield, Alexander Knox, Gene Lockhart, Barry Fitzgerald, Stanley Ridges, David Bruce', 'NR', 'Shipwrecked fugitives try to escape a brutal sea captain who''s losing his mind.', 'Shipwrecked fugitives try to escape a brutal sea captain who''s losing his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgpzaiHupKqvozTcXuqF5Ew5QVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33931'),
  ('690371124881118093', 'The Sea Wolf', 1993, 'Adventure, TV Movie', 'Michael Anderson', null, 'Charles Bronson, Catherine Mary Stewart, Marc Singer, Len Cariou, Clive Revill, Christopher Reeve, Shane Kelly, Gavin Buhr', 'PG', 'Jack London''s brutal Wolf Larson brings a shipwrecked aristocrat and a con woman aboard his doomed ship, the Ghost.', 'Jack London''s brutal Wolf Larson brings a shipwrecked aristocrat and a con woman aboard his doomed ship, the Ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zTInlGnnfSm9m1Xnnh3DBm01v9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267314'),
  ('642484406623102910', 'The Sea Wolves', 1980, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Andrew V. McLaglen', 'James Leasor, Reginald Rose', 'Gregory Peck, Roger Moore, David Niven, Trevor Howard, Barbara Kellerman, Patrick Macnee, Kenneth Griffith, Patrick Allen', 'PG', 'A German spy is passing on information about the location of Allied ships in the neutral harbor of Goa, India, with catastrophic results. Unable to undertake a full military operation in the Portuguese stronghold, English intelligence brings out of retirement a crew of geriatric ex-soldiers, veterans from World War I, using their age as cover. These old soldiers are asked to take to the seas and pull off an unlikely undercover mission.', 'A German spy is passing on information about the location of Allied ships in the neutral harbor of Goa, India, with catastrophic results. Unable to undertake a full military operation in the Portuguese stronghold, English intelligence brings out of retirement a crew of geriatric ex-soldiers, veterans from World War I, using their age as cover. These old soldiers are asked to take to the seas and pull off an unlikely undercover mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kb1YjjKpCrqqsmJDXnlbieJ3wC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19664'),
  ('211250769976796723', 'The Seafarers', 1953, 'Documentary', 'Stanley Kubrick, Stanley Kubrick', 'Will Chasan', 'Don Hollenbeck, Paul Hall', 'NR', 'Stanley Kubrick’s first color film, commissioned by the Seafarers International Union to promote the benefits of union membership. Shot inside the union’s Atlantic and Gulf Coast District facilities, it features scenes of ships, machinery, cafeteria life, and meetings, highlighting the daily routines and camaraderie of seafarers. Thought lost for decades, the film was rediscovered in 1973 and preserved by the Library of Congress.', 'Stanley Kubrick’s first color film, commissioned by the Seafarers International Union to promote the benefits of union membership. Shot inside the union’s Atlantic and Gulf Coast District facilities, it features scenes of ships, machinery, cafeteria life, and meetings, highlighting the daily routines and camaraderie of seafarers. Thought lost for decades, the film was rediscovered in 1973 and preserved by the Library of Congress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSucFIAQ5CowEE1WZ87mz3OsbQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45314'),
  ('35736353526061280', 'The Seagull', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yuli Karasik, Mikhail Suslov, Valeriya Rublyova', 'Yuli Karasik', 'Alla Demidova, Vladimir Chetverikov, Nikolai Plotnikov, Ludmila Savelyeva, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Sofya Pavlova, Valentina Telichkina, Yuriy Yakovlev', null, 'Based on the play of the same name by Anton Chekhov. About the searches and doubts of the Russian intelligentsia at the end of the 19th century. Events unfold on the estate of Pyotr Sorin, which brought together representatives of secular society - actress Irina Arkadina, the host''s sister and her lover, the famous writer Trigorin. Sorin’s nephew, Konstantin Treplev, in love with a neighbor girl Nina Zarechnaya, who dreams of becoming an actress, writes for her a play that she plays in the scenery of Sorin’s garden.', 'Based on the play of the same name by Anton Chekhov. About the searches and doubts of the Russian intelligentsia at the end of the 19th century. Events unfold on the estate of Pyotr Sorin, which brought together representatives of secular society - actress Irina Arkadina, the host''s sister and her lover, the famous writer Trigorin. Sorin’s nephew, Konstantin Treplev, in love with a neighbor girl Nina Zarechnaya, who dreams of becoming an actress, writes for her a play that she plays in the scenery of Sorin’s garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEDuoy45I0CvpV2ylBcQCQiTVWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68262'),
  ('25125397157829187', 'The Seagull', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Mayer, Matthew J. Lloyd, James McMillan', 'Stephen Karam', 'Annette Bening, Saoirse Ronan, Corey Stoll, Elisabeth Moss, Mare Winningham, Jon Tenney, Glenn Fleshler, Michael Zegen', 'PG-13', 'At a picturesque lakeside estate, a love triangle unfolds between the legendary diva Irina, her lover Boris, and the ingénue Nina.', 'At a picturesque lakeside estate, a love triangle unfolds between the legendary diva Irina, her lover Boris, and the ingénue Nina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nVjSIUScmDScEEfnc7i0eSBthc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341735'),
  ('773773827487174200', 'The Seamstress', 2009, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jesse James Miller, Corey Robson', 'Mark Garbett', 'Lance Henriksen, Kailin See, David Kopp, James Kirk, Lara Gilchrist, Sarah Mutch, Richard Stroh, Kevin McNulty', 'R', 'The Seamstress was brought into being by the desperate curse of an innocent woman being tortured to death by a vigilante mob. Voracious for blood, the hideously-mutilated specter hunts a small group of friends who become trapped on the island where she died.', 'The Seamstress was brought into being by the desperate curse of an innocent woman being tortured to death by a vigilante mob. Voracious for blood, the hideously-mutilated specter hunts a small group of friends who become trapped on the island where she died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t02zryYHwy8nxv5nDIptwzkpKK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22745'),
  ('744147175932851752', 'The Seamstress', 2017, 'Drama', 'Leo Resende Ferreira, Alice Gomez, Thiago Sutir', 'Patrícia Andrade', 'Nanda Costa, Marjorie Estiano, Ângelo Antônio, Claudio Jaborandy, Cyria Coentro, Fábio Lago, Gabriel Stauffer, Júlio Machado', null, 'In the thirties, two sisters separated by fate face prejudice and sexism, one by the high society in a big city and the other by a group of renegades in the countryside. Despite the distance, they know that they can only count on each other and both of them will assert themselves in their own and surprising way.', 'In the thirties, two sisters separated by fate face prejudice and sexism, one by the high society in a big city and the other by a group of renegades in the countryside. Despite the distance, they know that they can only count on each other and both of them will assert themselves in their own and surprising way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr4gHti4EFjd1d7jXvr6KFuXFeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475756'),
  ('1039687036461399914', 'The Sean Connery Paradox', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Grégory Monro', null, 'Sean Connery, John Boorman, Andy Garcia, Rob Brown, Murray Grigor, Lisa Funnell, Michael Feeney Callan, Bray Christopher', null, 'Having become a world star thanks to James Bond, Sean Connery, who died in 2020, has never stopped trying to shed the image of a sexy and slightly brutal macho that stuck to 007. A look back at an eclectic career, carried out with panache.', 'Having become a world star thanks to James Bond, Sean Connery, who died in 2020, has never stopped trying to shed the image of a sexy and slightly brutal macho that stuck to 007. A look back at an eclectic career, carried out with panache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlsfWXn0eR1EEyYUoq18rnWSQfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012041'),
  ('716278372379082726', 'The Search', 1948, 'Drama, War', 'Fred Zinnemann, Míla Mellanová, Emil Berna', 'Richard Schweizer', 'Montgomery Clift, Ivan Jandl, Aline MacMahon, Wendell Corey, Jarmila Novotná, Mary Patton, Ewart G. Morrison, Leopold Borkowski', 'NR', 'In postwar Germany, a displaced Czech boy, separated from his family during wartime, is befriended by an American GI while the boy''s mother desperately searches for him.', 'In postwar Germany, a displaced Czech boy, separated from his family during wartime, is befriended by an American GI while the boy''s mother desperately searches for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDP8XxQUJTTofJPkhFER3aBYDqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41131'),
  ('90050195378008421', 'The Search', 1966, 'Crime, Drama', 'Angelino Fons', 'Pío Baroja, Juan Cesarabea, Angelino Fons', 'Jacques Perrin, Emma Penella, Sara Lezana, Hugo Blanco, Lola Gaos', null, 'Manuel Jacques Perrin is a young man from the country who tries to make it in Madrid in this somber melodrama. He struggles to survive in the unforgiving city where only the strongest will prosper. Manuel defends himself and kills a murderous thief in a fight then quietly waits for the police to reach the scene of the crime.', 'Manuel Jacques Perrin is a young man from the country who tries to make it in Madrid in this somber melodrama. He struggles to survive in the unforgiving city where only the strongest will prosper. Manuel defends himself and kills a murderous thief in a fight then quietly waits for the police to reach the scene of the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftJnR7zcH0WEW65w26MvPrAjmJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204178'),
  ('58387239466610816', 'The Search', 2014, 'Drama', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Anne Cadiou, Patricia Ruelle', 'David Wechsler, Richard Schweizer', 'Bérénice Bejo, Annette Bening, Maxim Emelianov, Abdul Khalim Mamutsiev, Zukhra Duishvili, Yuriy Tsurilo, Dmytro Rybalevskyi, Leila Bekauri', null, 'A woman who works for a non-governmental organization (NGO) forms a special relationship with a young boy in war-torn Chechnya.', 'A woman who works for a non-governmental organization (NGO) forms a special relationship with a young boy in war-torn Chechnya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKBssmqkeguXW3TxncwU980fuZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245692'),
  ('406265985650694425', 'The Search for General Tso', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Ian Cheney', null, null, null, 'From New York City to the farmlands of the Midwest, there are 50,000 Chinese restaurants in the U.S., yet one dish in particular has conquered the American culinary landscape with a force befitting its military moniker—“General Tso’s Chicken.” But who was General Tso and how did this dish become so ubiquitous? Ian Cheney’s delightfully insightful documentary charts the history of Chinese Americans through the surprising origins of this sticky, sweet, just-spicy-enough dish that we’ve adopted as our own.', 'From New York City to the farmlands of the Midwest, there are 50,000 Chinese restaurants in the U.S., yet one dish in particular has conquered the American culinary landscape with a force befitting its military moniker—“General Tso’s Chicken.” But who was General Tso and how did this dish become so ubiquitous? Ian Cheney’s delightfully insightful documentary charts the history of Chinese Americans through the surprising origins of this sticky, sweet, just-spicy-enough dish that we’ve adopted as our own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSPlCpa4LMN3xYNBdW6XcFUcSGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261041'),
  ('25852200279690921', 'The Search for One-eye Jimmy', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Lodge Kerrigan, Chuck Levey, Richard Rosser', 'Sam Henry Kass', 'Michael Badalucco, Ray Mancini, Holt McCallany, Nicholas Turturro, Steve Buscemi, Samuel L. Jackson, Anne Meara, Tony Sirico', 'R', 'While working on a documentary on his old neighborhood, a young film school graduate shifts the focus of his production onto the disappearance of a local resident and the strange characters who are conducting the search to find him.', 'While working on a documentary on his old neighborhood, a young film school graduate shifts the focus of his production onto the disappearance of a local resident and the strange characters who are conducting the search to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/da9r0FJxecJvLK6X5iqirRLMxks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67365'),
  ('126741057491458297', 'The Search for Santa Paws', 2010, 'Family, Adventure', 'Robert Vince, Kamal Derkaoui', 'Robert Vince, Anna McRoberts', 'Kaitlyn Maher, Madison Pettis, Zachary Gordon, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Richard Riehle, John Ducey, Bonnie Somerville, Richard Kind', 'G', 'When Santa and his new best friend, Paws, discover that the boys and girls of the world have lost the spirit of the season, they take a trip to New York City. But after Santa loses his memory, it''s up to Paws, a faithful orphan named Quinn, her new friend Will, and a wonderful group of magical talking dogs to save St. Nick and show the world what Christmas is really all about.', 'When Santa and his new best friend, Paws, discover that the boys and girls of the world have lost the spirit of the season, they take a trip to New York City. But after Santa loses his memory, it''s up to Paws, a faithful orphan named Quinn, her new friend Will, and a wonderful group of magical talking dogs to save St. Nick and show the world what Christmas is really all about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4tJ1AhJKWUUWoDsXvnGS6fQdiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48844'),
  ('271798489044441013', 'The Searchers', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Yngvar Lande, Sten Holmberg, Peter Mokrosinski', 'Daniel Fridell', 'Liam Norberg, Ray Jones IV, Thorsten Flinck, Malou Bergman, Jonas Karlsson, Musse Hasselvall, Örjan Ramberg, Rebecka Hemse', null, 'Jocke has grown up in one of Stockholm''s rough suburbs. Nowadays he spends the daytime getting into trouble at school and going into Stockholm in the evenings and getting into even more trouble. After being sentenced to prison he meets Tony. After their release they begin a series of robberies.', 'Jocke has grown up in one of Stockholm''s rough suburbs. Nowadays he spends the daytime getting into trouble at school and going into Stockholm in the evenings and getting into even more trouble. After being sentenced to prison he meets Tony. After their release they begin a series of robberies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWkOfWaV87QIkvi7vbiAiBu0NOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60911'),
  ('2693702556536906', 'The Seashell and the Clergyman', 1928, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Germaine Dulac, Paul Parguel, Louis Ronjat', 'Antonin Artaud, Germaine Dulac', 'Alex Allin, Lucien Bataille, Genica Athanasiou', null, 'Obsessed with a general''s wife, a clergyman has strange visions of death and lust, struggling against his own eroticism.', 'Obsessed with a general''s wife, a clergyman has strange visions of death and lust, struggling against his own eroticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5NKxt5XH6rEizJWlHsK0WFLOjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118014'),
  ('410999435084444441', 'The Seaside Motel', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kentaro Moriya', 'Yukio Okada', 'Toma Ikuta, Kumiko Aso, Takayuki Yamada, Tetsuji Tamayama, Riko Narumi, Arata Furuta, Hijiri Kojima, Tetsuhiro Ikeda', null, 'The Seaside Motel is trapped in the mountains, without even enough water to serve their guests 24 hours a day, much less having a view of a body of water of any kind.', 'The Seaside Motel is trapped in the mountains, without even enough water to serve their guests 24 hours a day, much less having a view of a body of water of any kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2ziJW6dyJ7P5zc9tlslhco1CUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56232'),
  ('388803782743623128', 'The Season for Love', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sacha Vierny, Pierre Kast, Sophie Becker', 'Pierre Kast, Alain Aptekman', 'Françoise Arnoul, Daniel Gélin, Françoise Prévost, Pierre Vaneck, Alexandra Stewart, Ursula Vian-Kübler, Anne-Marie Baumann, Michèle Verez', null, 'Sylvain, a suave, witty player as well as an accomplished writer and Genevieve met 10 months ago. He wanted a serious relationship for the first time so they moved to the country so they could be together and he could write.', 'Sylvain, a suave, witty player as well as an accomplished writer and Genevieve met 10 months ago. He wanted a serious relationship for the first time so they moved to the country so they could be together and he could write.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pySFoNhTxEeoFulwbhPevEnpxyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438330'),
  ('1118772713201122169', 'The Seasoning House', 2012, 'Horror', 'Paul Hyett, Adam Etherington, Luis San Martin', 'Paul Hyett, Conal Palmer, Adrian Rigelsford', 'Rosie Day, Sean Pertwee, Kevin Howarth, Anna Walton, Jemma Powell, Alec Utgoff, David Lemberg, Dominique Provost-Chalkley', null, 'The Seasoning House - where young girls are prostituted to the military. An orphaned deaf mute is enslaved to care for them. She moves between the walls and crawlspaces, planning her escape. Planning her ingenious and brutal revenge.', 'The Seasoning House - where young girls are prostituted to the military. An orphaned deaf mute is enslaved to care for them. She moves between the walls and crawlspaces, planning her escape. Planning her ingenious and brutal revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AJQlfKsaNuWM1uCpXwLzYk6vx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127651'),
  ('1123348252120142632', 'The Seasons', 1969, 'Romance, Animation', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Vladimir Sarukhanov, Yuri Norstein', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano', null, null, 'A delicate stroll through the nature‘s wilderness at different times of the year.', 'A delicate stroll through the nature‘s wilderness at different times of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pc0a6ktSJDeRVwyY3uQmkLVBPZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210861'),
  ('739207680736800780', 'The Seasons', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian, Mikhail Vartanov', 'Artavazd Peleshian', null, null, 'The last collaboration of Artavazd Peleshian and cinematographer Mikhail Vartanov is a film-essay about Armenia''s shepherds, about the contradiction and the harmony between man and nature, scored to Vivaldi''s Four Seasons.', 'The last collaboration of Artavazd Peleshian and cinematographer Mikhail Vartanov is a film-essay about Armenia''s shepherds, about the contradiction and the harmony between man and nature, scored to Vivaldi''s Four Seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj57TV88eeqgdmc2U11waA83kO2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44357'),
  ('879422886530391807', 'The Seasons of Pleasure', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Radu Mihăileanu, William Lubtchansky', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Patrick Rambaud', 'Jean-Luc Bideau, Bernadette Lafont, Jacqueline Maillan, Charles Vanel, Denise Grey, Darry Cowl, Jean Poiret, Éva Darlan', null, 'Charles and Emmanuelle organize as every year, the congress of perfumers who distribute their products in their castle. Garibaldi, their mutilated and somewhat disturbed son-in-law, will be the butler.', 'Charles and Emmanuelle organize as every year, the congress of perfumers who distribute their products in their castle. Garibaldi, their mutilated and somewhat disturbed son-in-law, will be the butler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gFfOyR3xFTOcBoD3HW72OzAylU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66903'),
  ('859180185387911681', 'The Seat', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Kyle Thrash, Patrick Golan', null, 'Andrea Kimi Antonelli, Toto Wolff, Peter "Bono" Bonnington, Bradley Lord, Gwen Lagrue, James Allison, Amy Walker, Sergi Àvila', null, '''The Seat'' is an unprecedented inside look that led to a once-in-a-generation driver change in Mercedes and F1 history. It reveals the private conversations that led the Mercedes team and Toto Wolff, its Team Principal and CEO, to its decision to promote 18-year-old Italian-born Kimi Antonelli to a Formula 1 Driver, making him the third-youngest rookie in the sport''s history. The film follows Kimi, in the lead up to his first Formula 1 season as he takes on his destiny.', '''The Seat'' is an unprecedented inside look that led to a once-in-a-generation driver change in Mercedes and F1 history. It reveals the private conversations that led the Mercedes team and Toto Wolff, its Team Principal and CEO, to its decision to promote 18-year-old Italian-born Kimi Antonelli to a Formula 1 Driver, making him the third-youngest rookie in the sport''s history. The film follows Kimi, in the lead up to his first Formula 1 season as he takes on his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvhMN5xl8ZdkTnvCJMQVUlwD5iv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1475666'),
  ('588274915431496933', 'The Seats of the Alcazar', 1989, 'Comedy, History', 'Luc Moullet, Richard Copans, Marie Bécheras', 'Luc Moullet', 'Olivier Maltinti, Elizabeth Moreau, Sabine Haudepin, Dominique Zardi, Micha Bayard, Richard Martin-Jordan, Jean Abeillé, Jean-Luc Caron', null, 'A French man recalls his moviegoing adventures at a now defunct titular theater as a journalist for the film magazine Cahiers du Cinéma during the mid-1950s.', 'A French man recalls his moviegoing adventures at a now defunct titular theater as a journalist for the film magazine Cahiers du Cinéma during the mid-1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxfbWh7T1ui7tqhkVJVpXGRW6YQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181123'),
