  ('1021330590791800744', 'The Second Act', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rémi Bouvier, Bastien Chaboche, Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Léa Seydoux, Louis Garrel, Vincent Lindon, Raphaël Quenard, Manuel Guillot, Laurent Nicolas, Françoise Gazio, Valérie Vogt', null, 'Florence wants to introduce David, the man she’s madly in love with, to her father Guillaume. But David isn’t attracted to Florence and wants to throw her into the arms of his friend Willy. The four characters meet in a restaurant in the middle of nowhere.', 'Florence wants to introduce David, the man she’s madly in love with, to her father Guillaume. But David isn’t attracted to Florence and wants to throw her into the arms of his friend Willy. The four characters meet in a restaurant in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lc5ZJA4C55n6nzNtkNnDwOvpEtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161108'),
  ('1151656000551759021', 'The Second Arrival', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Kevin Tenney, Corinne Joudiou', 'Mark David Perry', 'Patrick Muldoon, Jane Sibbett, Michael Sarrazin, Catherine Blythe, Michael Scherer, Larry Day, Steve Adams, Emidio Michetti', 'R', 'After Zane Ziminski is found dead five people received envelopes with details of an alien invasion. This group of five includes 3 scientists, Zane''s brother Jack, and a reporter. Quickly, the group is down to three and then Jack and Bridget, the reporter. With a small piece of alien technology, they must escape from the aliens, who take human form, and try to convince others that aliens exist.', 'After Zane Ziminski is found dead five people received envelopes with details of an alien invasion. This group of five includes 3 scientists, Zane''s brother Jack, and a reporter. Quickly, the group is down to three and then Jack and Bridget, the reporter. With a small piece of alien technology, they must escape from the aliens, who take human form, and try to convince others that aliens exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mjqRwjs6KbmNuMHYIz2gualCZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19154'),
  ('755263215740756491', 'The Second Best Exotic Marigold Hotel', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Madden, George Walker, Ben Smithard', 'Ol Parker', 'Dev Patel, Judi Dench, Richard Gere, Maggie Smith, Bill Nighy, Celia Imrie, Penelope Wilton, Ronald Pickup', 'PG', 'As the Best Exotic Marigold Hotel has only a single remaining vacancy - posing a rooming predicament for two fresh arrivals - Sonny pursues his expansionist dream of opening a second hotel.', 'As the Best Exotic Marigold Hotel has only a single remaining vacancy - posing a rooming predicament for two fresh arrivals - Sonny pursues his expansionist dream of opening a second hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4PARl3gDpv2K45YAv0tgocLW5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268238'),
  ('468548336460261451', 'The Second Circle', 1990, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Pyotr Aleksandrov, Nadezhda Rodnova, Tamara Timofeeva, Aleksandr Bystryakov, Sergey Vybornov, Nikolay Butenin, Stepan Krylov, Andrey Tenetko', null, 'A man tries to come to terms with his father''s death and to deal with the mundane details of his burial in a society cut off from spirituality.', 'A man tries to come to terms with his father''s death and to deal with the mundane details of his burial in a society cut off from spirituality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTcbmLyAAgolPQaWDxeR37wwv6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145147'),
  ('832878461016682641', 'The Second Civil War', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie, War', 'Joe Dante, Mac Ahlberg', 'Martyn Burke', 'Beau Bridges, Joanna Cassidy, James Coburn, Kevin Dunn, Phil Hartman, Dan Hedaya, James Earl Jones, Denis Leary', 'R', 'When a planeload of Pakistani orphans are shipped to his state for permanent relocation, the governor of Idaho defies the president and closes the state''s border. News Net Television, a cable news program that makes hay by reporting on political scandals, quickly spins the racist act into an overnight media sensation, creating a divide in national opinion over the issue.', 'When a planeload of Pakistani orphans are shipped to his state for permanent relocation, the governor of Idaho defies the president and closes the state''s border. News Net Television, a cable news program that makes hay by reporting on political scandals, quickly spins the racist act into an overnight media sensation, creating a divide in national opinion over the issue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVdrnRbP38f2R0u9OxqRUC8Wr09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45046'),
  ('72409062505512513', 'The Second Death', 2012, 'Horror', 'Santiago Fernández Calvete', 'Santiago Fernández Calvete', 'Evangelina Cueto, María Laura Cali, Luz Kertz ..., Guillermo Arengo, Tomás Lizzio, Agustina Lecouna, Roxana Ramos, Mauricio Dayub', null, 'Clueless on a gruesome case, a skeptical and lonely policewoman in a small village, is guided by a newly arrived clairvoyance gifted boy, who claims that the murderer is the Virgin Mary.', 'Clueless on a gruesome case, a skeptical and lonely policewoman in a small village, is guided by a newly arrived clairvoyance gifted boy, who claims that the murderer is the Virgin Mary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AMQjdJZ3A0zwRRS4SaIHRhTUHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197255'),
  ('1068097287675908849', 'The Second Jungle Book: Mowgli & Baloo', 1997, 'Adventure, Family', 'Dee McLachlan, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Bayard Johnson, Matthew Horton', 'Jamie Williams, Amy Robbins, Hal Fowler, Gulshan Grover, Cornelia Hayes O''Herlihy, Billy Campbell, Roddy McDowall, B.J. Hogg', 'PG', 'In this exciting live-action adventure, young Mowgli, an orphan raised by wolves, is spotted by a scout for a giant circus. Accompanied by a cruel hunter and a snake charmer, the scout sets out to trap Mowgli. But with the help of Baloo the bear and Bagheera the panther, little Mowgli leads the adults into his biggest and wildest adventure yet! A fun-filled movie every member of the family will enjoy.', 'In this exciting live-action adventure, young Mowgli, an orphan raised by wolves, is spotted by a scout for a giant circus. Accompanied by a cruel hunter and a snake charmer, the scout sets out to trap Mowgli. But with the help of Baloo the bear and Bagheera the panther, little Mowgli leads the adults into his biggest and wildest adventure yet! A fun-filled movie every member of the family will enjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLzE0IluHeY920jshiTsLz92ZEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50850'),
  ('834334213561177712', 'The Second Night', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Gamboa', null, 'Irán Castillo, Mariana Ávila, Francesca Guillén, Sherlyn, Osvaldo Benavides', null, 'Girls just want to have fun; but often they must do some growing up first...and fast! Four teenage friends explore the grey area between sexual attraction and responsible behavior and just where love fits in.', 'Girls just want to have fun; but often they must do some growing up first...and fast! Four teenage friends explore the grey area between sexual attraction and responsible behavior and just where love fits in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9rfaCxTHHKfip4xbEy5XOdphLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165266'),
