  ('329672231965212045', 'The Second Sight', 2013, 'Horror', 'Pornchai Hongrattanaporn', 'Sukosin Akkrapat, Pornchai Hongrattanaporn, Chanintorn Ulit', 'Nawat Kulrattanarak, Rhatha Phongam, Anon Saisangcharn, Klaokaew Sinteppadon, Lapassalan Jiravechsoontornkul', null, 'Jet is a young defense lawyer with a twisted gift to see how people will die - a vision he''s been doomed with since birth. When Jet falls in love with a woman, Joom, he finds himself headed down a sinister path as he tries to twist fate.', 'Jet is a young defense lawyer with a twisted gift to see how people will die - a vision he''s been doomed with since birth. When Jet falls in love with a woman, Joom, he finds himself headed down a sinister path as he tries to twist fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOfomkTitUOwNFGylBTBt4GDLQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241202'),
  ('536266500380117466', 'The Second Time', 1995, 'Drama', 'Andrea Molaioli, Alessandro Pesci, Mimmo Calopresti', 'Heidrun Schleef, Mimmo Calopresti, Francesco Bruni', 'Nanni Moretti, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Valeria Milillo, Simona Caramelli, Roberto De Francesco, Francesca Antonelli, Paolo De Vita, Antonio Petrocelli', null, 'A convicted terrorist out on parole meets a man she nearly murdered 15 years before, without recognizing him. He does so, but he chooses to keep quiet and spend time with her—desperate to understand the reasons behind her gesture.', 'A convicted terrorist out on parole meets a man she nearly murdered 15 years before, without recognizing him. He does so, but he chooses to keep quiet and spend time with her—desperate to understand the reasons behind her gesture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etludnz4CkLluKXBe0LYgDDeinX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144622'),
  ('423129589770334065', 'The Second Time Around', 1961, 'Western, Comedy', 'Vincent Sherman, Ellis W. Carter, Jack R. Berne', 'Clair Huffaker, Oscar Saul', 'Debbie Reynolds, Steve Forrest, Andy Griffith, Juliet Prowse, Thelma Ritter, Ken Scott, Isobel Elsom, Rodolfo Acosta', 'NR', 'In 1911, a widow with two children leaves New York City for territorial Arizona and becomes a ranch hand and later gets herself elected sheriff. A gambler and a rancher become rivals for her affections.', 'In 1911, a widow with two children leaves New York City for territorial Arizona and becomes a ranch hand and later gets herself elected sheriff. A gambler and a rancher become rivals for her affections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiumXeVmlft8cGAAOFWCdBDWv18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111037'),
  ('547173509622260478', 'The Second Tragic Fantozzi', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Salce, Franco Coduti, Erico Menczer', 'Luciano Salce', 'Paolo Villaggio, Anna Mazzamauro, Gigi Reder, Ugo Bologna, Mauro Vestri, Plinio Fernando, Antonino Faà di Bruno, Nietta Zocchi', null, 'The frustrating adventures of a humble employee who all the time has to fullfill the wishes and desires of his bosses.', 'The frustrating adventures of a humble employee who all the time has to fullfill the wishes and desires of his bosses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c51PWa2X6QoxE3q7zai0vayvrUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37769'),
  ('478286903983174967', 'The Second Wedding Night', 2005, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Roberto Farina, Pasquale Rachini', 'Pupi Avati', 'Antonio Albanese, Neri Marcorè, Katia Ricciarelli, Angela Luce, Marisa Merlini, Robert Madison, Toni Santagata, Sandro Dori', null, 'When his destituite widowed sister-in-law—whom he had never stopped harbouring feelings for—and her ne''er-do-well son come to live with him after World War II, a mentally-ill farmer who spends all his time destroying unexploded ordnance scattered across the countryside finds a new purpose in his lonely life.', 'When his destituite widowed sister-in-law—whom he had never stopped harbouring feelings for—and her ne''er-do-well son come to live with him after World War II, a mentally-ill farmer who spends all his time destroying unexploded ordnance scattered across the countryside finds a new purpose in his lonely life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNJRHoNtz6JaZCiMWHWbN3LQA2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56994'),
  ('48245921546614516', 'The Second Wife', 1967, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Salah Abu Seif, Abdel Halim Nasr', 'Mohamed Mostafa Sami, Saad al-Din Wahbah, Salah Abu Seif', 'Soad Hosny, Shoukry Sarhan, Sanaa Gamil, Salah Mansour, Abdel Moneim Ibrahim, Soheir El Morshedy, Hassan El Baroudy, Naima ElSoghier', null, 'A story in the Egyptian countryside about an unjust mayor who controls everything in the village with his power.', 'A story in the Egyptian countryside about an unjust mayor who controls everything in the village with his power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMrB8xkOZkdDifrf5ZbVOLM2F8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260105'),
