  ('157306266332938445', 'The Second Wind', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alain Corneau, Yves Angelo', 'Alain Corneau', 'Daniel Auteuil, Monica Bellucci, Michel Blanc, Jacques Dutronc, Éric Cantona, Gilbert Melki, Daniel Duval, Nicolas Duvauchelle', null, 'Gu, a famous gangster, has just escaped from jail. All french police is after him. Before leaving the country with Manouche, the woman he loves, Gu needs a final job to get some money. The job works, but a police''s scheming makes Gu appear as a traitor to his own accomplices. Gu will do whatever it takes to clean his honor...', 'Gu, a famous gangster, has just escaped from jail. All french police is after him. Before leaving the country with Manouche, the woman he loves, Gu needs a final job to get some money. The job works, but a police''s scheming makes Gu appear as a traitor to his own accomplices. Gu will do whatever it takes to clean his honor...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auxgoI3jxk7S5ht0bq1wN135w9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59918'),
  ('1096922941483207617', 'The Second Woman', 1950, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Hal Mohr, James V. Kern', 'Mort Briskin, Robert Smith', 'Robert Young, Betsy Drake, John Sutton, Florence Bates, Morris Carnovsky, Henry O''Neill, Jean Rogers, Raymond Largay', 'NR', 'In flashback from a ''Rebecca''-style beginning: Ellen Foster, visiting her aunt on the California coast, meets neighbor Jeff Cohalan and his ultramodern clifftop house. Ellen is strongly attracted to Jeff, who''s being plagued by unexplainable accidents, major and minor. Bad luck, persecution...or paranoia? Warned that Jeff could be dangerous, Ellen fears that he''s in danger, as the menacing atmosphere darkens.', 'In flashback from a ''Rebecca''-style beginning: Ellen Foster, visiting her aunt on the California coast, meets neighbor Jeff Cohalan and his ultramodern clifftop house. Ellen is strongly attracted to Jeff, who''s being plagued by unexplainable accidents, major and minor. Bad luck, persecution...or paranoia? Warned that Jeff could be dangerous, Ellen fears that he''s in danger, as the menacing atmosphere darkens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6Bt8EEBcbPwSC642xQzSVSoQSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62661'),
  ('908948611773389057', 'The Secret', 1974, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Étienne Becker, Robert Enrico, Claire Denis', 'Robert Enrico', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Marlène Jobert, Philippe Noiret, Solange Pradel, Antoine Saint-John, Michel Delahaye, Maurice Vallier, Frédéric Santaya', null, 'A stranger enters into and forever alters the life of a couple. He claims to be pursued by certain authorities who intend to prevent him from disclosing a secret that only he holds, whence the title. Is he lying, or insane - or is he telling the truth? Who, if anyone, is after him? And what *is* - the secret?', 'A stranger enters into and forever alters the life of a couple. He claims to be pursued by certain authorities who intend to prevent him from disclosing a secret that only he holds, whence the title. Is he lying, or insane - or is he telling the truth? Who, if anyone, is after him? And what *is* - the secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1jxYs95oDeXNxmi5Oj6au6vSDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5901'),
  ('460278345084375558', 'The Secret', 1979, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ann Hui, David Chung', 'Joyce Chan Wan-Man', 'Sylvia Chang, Angie Chiu Nga-Chi, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Lai Cheuk-Cheuk, Lee Hae-suk, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Lo Kwok Hung, Kenneth Tsang', null, 'A tangled murder mystery unfolds amid a complex love triangle. As conflicting witness accounts emerge, the truth about the victim and key suspects is revealed, leading investigators down a dark and twisty path where nothing is as it seems.', 'A tangled murder mystery unfolds amid a complex love triangle. As conflicting witness accounts emerge, the truth about the victim and key suspects is revealed, leading investigators down a dark and twisty path where nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyLzMaF5grWyd2ztYkzAvFnTtdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176219'),
  ('766282491670360101', 'The Secret', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Virginie Wagon, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Virginie Wagon', 'Anne Coesens, Michel Bompoil, Tony Todd, Jacqueline Jehanneuf, Aladin Reibel, Quentin Rossi, Valérie Vogt, Frédéric Sauzay', null, 'Marie, who works as a successful door-to-door encyclopedia salesperson, has been married to her husband Francois for 12 years and has a two-year-old son. Though she is relatively content with her life, she feels something is wanting. Enter 50-year old African-American Bill. Initially she is annoyed by his insouciance, but she finds that she is irresistibly attracted to him. Soon the two are in the midst of sordid illicit affair. She knows little about her new lover, and he seems uninterested in learning about her, but the long sessions of lovemaking are something else entirely. Feeling out of control, Marie is increasingly repelled by her own actions. Psychologically, she struggles to reconcile her torrid encounters with Bill and mundane domestic chores such as bathing her son. Moreover, she finds herself incapable of hiding her adulterous behavior, rather she comes home with scratches and hickeys all over her body, to the devastation Francois.', 'Marie, who works as a successful door-to-door encyclopedia salesperson, has been married to her husband Francois for 12 years and has a two-year-old son. Though she is relatively content with her life, she feels something is wanting. Enter 50-year old African-American Bill. Initially she is annoyed by his insouciance, but she finds that she is irresistibly attracted to him. Soon the two are in the midst of sordid illicit affair. She knows little about her new lover, and he seems uninterested in learning about her, but the long sessions of lovemaking are something else entirely. Feeling out of control, Marie is increasingly repelled by her own actions. Psychologically, she struggles to reconcile her torrid encounters with Bill and mundane domestic chores such as bathing her son. Moreover, she finds herself incapable of hiding her adulterous behavior, rather she comes home with scratches and hickeys all over her body, to the devastation Francois.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkszgIaZnxNQx5fE3pl114fyxPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1837'),
  ('1060761386657811972', 'The Secret', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Drew Heriot, Sean Byrne', 'Rhonda Byrne', 'Bob Proctor, Joe Vitale, John Assaraf, Loral Langemeier, Marie Diamond, Michael Bernard Beckwith, Neale Donald Walsch, Jack Canfield', null, 'Interviews with leading authors, philosophers and scientists, with an in-depth discussion of the Law of Attraction. The audience is shown how they can learn and use ''The Secret'' in their everyday lives.', 'Interviews with leading authors, philosophers and scientists, with an in-depth discussion of the Law of Attraction. The audience is shown how they can learn and use ''The Secret'' in their everyday lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDpyYUrVAgyWYADeYbGY4vWKjZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26594'),
  ('1055129227055460383', 'The Secret', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vincent Perez, Paul Sarossy', 'Ann Cherkis', 'David Duchovny, Olivia Thirlby, Lili Taylor, Millie Tresierra, Trisha LaFache, Laurence Leboeuf, Kathleen Mackey, Corey Sevier', 'R', 'Husband, wife, and daughter have moved from Boston to Williamstown. At 16, Samantha treats her mother shabbily, but when the two of them are in a horrific car crash, the mother wills Sam to live, somehow losing her own life while her spirit enters Sam.', 'Husband, wife, and daughter have moved from Boston to Williamstown. At 16, Samantha treats her mother shabbily, but when the two of them are in a horrific car crash, the mother wills Sam to live, somehow losing her own life while her spirit enters Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDbUMwVkAGrokuvclmaiLVEFtSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14432'),
  ('692546657928709594', 'The Secret', 2010, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Horror', 'Gilberto de Anda', 'Gilberto de Anda', 'Christian Bach, Juan Ferrara, Mauricio Islas, Ana Belen Lander, Rafael Leon, Miguel Pizarro, María Prado, Gaby Ramirez', null, 'The life of a woman changes completely after the murder of her mother and when she comes to live with her aunt, she realizes that she keeps a secret that has remained hidden and protected for centuries.', 'The life of a woman changes completely after the murder of her mother and when she comes to live with her aunt, she realizes that she keeps a secret that has remained hidden and protected for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9YsAMJJSEr4sQHzPUsxycJ65Do.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127724'),
  ('977136063629944803', 'The Secret Adventures of Tom Thumb', 1993, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Horror', 'Dave Borthwick', 'Dave Borthwick', 'Nick Upton, Deborah Collard, Frank Passingham, Pete Townshend', null, 'A boy born the size of a small doll is kidnapped by a genetic lab and must find a way back to his father in this inventive adventure filmed using stop motion animation techniques.', 'A boy born the size of a small doll is kidnapped by a genetic lab and must find a way back to his father in this inventive adventure filmed using stop motion animation techniques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98yogK8pBvjqpQ7mtohuaBMLUJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18242'),
  ('379970129929948517', 'The Secret Agent', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho, Evgenia Alexandrova, Pethrus Tiburcio', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Wagner Moura, Tânia Maria, Alice Carvalho, Maria Fernanda Cândido, Gabriel Leone, Udo Kier, Carlos Francisco, Thomás Aquino', 'R', 'Brazil, 1977. Marcelo, a technology expert in his early 40s, is on the run. Hoping to reunite with his son, he travels to Recife during Carnival but soon realizes that the city is not the safe haven he was expecting.', 'Brazil, 1977. Marcelo, a technology expert in his early 40s, is on the run. Hoping to reunite with his son, he travels to Recife during Carnival but soon realizes that the city is not the safe haven he was expecting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZqolYhxMEe6TZZTjSmFw9crDTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1220564'),
  ('607518241546608302', 'The Secret Agent Club', 1996, 'Family, Comedy, Action', 'John Murlowski', 'Rory Johnston', 'Hulk Hogan, Lesley-Anne Down, Matthew McCurley, Richard Moll, Maurice Woods, Barry Bostwick, Edward Albert, James Hong', null, 'A secret agent masquerades as a toy-seller, successfully concealing his alter ego even from his young son until, on a daring mission, he is captured by an evil arms dealer, then it falls to his inexperienced offspring to save the day.', 'A secret agent masquerades as a toy-seller, successfully concealing his alter ego even from his young son until, on a daring mission, he is captured by an evil arms dealer, then it falls to his inexperienced offspring to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sSzmMHoEccf5ZWuokhPCmNsT63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80546'),
  ('886922542072262460', 'The Secret Agent''s Blunder', 1968, 'Mystery', 'Venyamin Dorman, Mikhail Goikhberg', 'Oleg Shmelyov, Vladimir Vostokov', 'Georgi Zhzhyonov, Mikhail Nozhkin, Oleg Zhakov, Efim Kopelyan, Nikolai Prokopovich, Eleonora Shashkova, Vladimir Gusev, Irina Miroshnichenko', null, 'In the spring of 1961, KGB officers received information that an experienced intelligence officer Mikhail Zarokov, son of the Russian emigrant Count Tulyev, with extensive international experience and knowledge in various operations was abandoned on the territory of the Soviet Union. He is sent to Russia to carry out a very difficult and risky task, which is directly related to the nuclear industrial complex and transfer the collected information abroad...', 'In the spring of 1961, KGB officers received information that an experienced intelligence officer Mikhail Zarokov, son of the Russian emigrant Count Tulyev, with extensive international experience and knowledge in various operations was abandoned on the territory of the Soviet Union. He is sent to Russia to carry out a very difficult and risky task, which is directly related to the nuclear industrial complex and transfer the collected information abroad...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkw3l0RbWU6usgIKscfp05AB56L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59431'),
  ('513340455549994532', 'The Secret Agent''s Destiny', 1970, 'Mystery', 'Venyamin Dorman, Mikhail Goikhberg', 'Vladimir Vostokov, Oleg Shmelyov', 'Georgi Zhzhyonov, Mikhail Nozhkin, Andrei Vertogradov, Efim Kopelyan, Rostislav Plyatt, Nikolai Prokopovich, Zhanna Bolotova, Eve Kivi', null, 'After Tulyev''s arrest, Soviet counterintelligence continues the radio game with the enemy, sending encryptions signed "Nadezhda" to the Western intelligence center. KGB officer Sinitsyn, friendly towards Tulyev, tries to persuade him to take his side — he arranges a meeting to a scout with Mariya and her son, whom he has never seen before. In addition, Mikhail learns that his father didn''t die of his own death, but was most likely killed. Meanwhile, a young Soviet scientist Borkov, who spoke at an international conference about his innovative work, finds himself in the spotlight of the Western security services.', 'After Tulyev''s arrest, Soviet counterintelligence continues the radio game with the enemy, sending encryptions signed "Nadezhda" to the Western intelligence center. KGB officer Sinitsyn, friendly towards Tulyev, tries to persuade him to take his side — he arranges a meeting to a scout with Mariya and her son, whom he has never seen before. In addition, Mikhail learns that his father didn''t die of his own death, but was most likely killed. Meanwhile, a young Soviet scientist Borkov, who spoke at an international conference about his innovative work, finds himself in the spotlight of the Western security services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqN2tQnVI7pIaaqLFqFsYXDg2gq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59432'),
  ('95723084026579777', 'The Secret Agent’s End', 1986, 'Adventure, Action', 'Venyamin Dorman, Vadim Kornilyev', 'Oleg Shmelyov, Vladimir Vostokov', 'Georgi Zhzhyonov, Pyotr Velyaminov, Nikolai Prokopovich, Yevgeni Gerasimov, Leonid Bronevoy, Iren Azer, Yevgeni Kindinov, Aleksandr Grave', null, 'Operation "Resident", which lasted 15 years, is coming to an end. But the indestructible agent of "Nadezhda" has one important mission left. Agent Carl Brockmann, who intends to steal the work of Academician Nikolai Nesterov in the defense sector, has been abandoned in the USSR. KGB leadership asks Mikhail Tulyev to return to the Soviet Union to find the spy. Meanwhile, Brockmann recruits former fascist collaborator Mikhail Kutepov for involvement in a dangerous operation.', 'Operation "Resident", which lasted 15 years, is coming to an end. But the indestructible agent of "Nadezhda" has one important mission left. Agent Carl Brockmann, who intends to steal the work of Academician Nikolai Nesterov in the defense sector, has been abandoned in the USSR. KGB leadership asks Mikhail Tulyev to return to the Soviet Union to find the spy. Meanwhile, Brockmann recruits former fascist collaborator Mikhail Kutepov for involvement in a dangerous operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TXJheZt9V342Uj3Jm6Yf2I2IFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59460'),
  ('171584326468436104', 'The Secret Agent''s Return', 1982, 'Mystery', 'Venyamin Dorman, Vadim Kornilyev', 'Oleg Shmelyov, Vladimir Vostokov', 'Georgi Zhzhyonov, Pyotr Velyaminov, Nikolai Prokopovich, Yevgeni Gerasimov, Leonid Bronevoy, Boris Khimichev, Iren Azer, Vadim Zakharchenko', null, 'After returning from the USSR, Tulyev was subjected to rigorous verification of his former "owners". He continues his work in Western intelligence, but already as a Soviet intelligence officer through the First Main Directorate of the KGB of the USSR. In a new capacity, he establishes the whereabouts of Hitler’s criminal Hoffmann, who was once sentenced to death, and helps the authorities arrest him. However, as a result of the conflict within NATO intelligence, Charlie Brighton, Hoffman''s assistant, begins to hunt for him. At the same time, Tulyev manages to establish the identity of the murderer of his father, Karl Brockmann, with whom they crossed in the service of mercenaries somewhere in hot countries. He wants revenge, but, by an evil irony of fate, he must help prepare Brockmann for being cast as a spy in the Soviet Union.', 'After returning from the USSR, Tulyev was subjected to rigorous verification of his former "owners". He continues his work in Western intelligence, but already as a Soviet intelligence officer through the First Main Directorate of the KGB of the USSR. In a new capacity, he establishes the whereabouts of Hitler’s criminal Hoffmann, who was once sentenced to death, and helps the authorities arrest him. However, as a result of the conflict within NATO intelligence, Charlie Brighton, Hoffman''s assistant, begins to hunt for him. At the same time, Tulyev manages to establish the identity of the murderer of his father, Karl Brockmann, with whom they crossed in the service of mercenaries somewhere in hot countries. He wants revenge, but, by an evil irony of fate, he must help prepare Brockmann for being cast as a spy in the Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf2ZfVsouwFJEc9VG8wqdw2jMuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59459'),
  ('1101089073043122685', 'The Secret Between Us', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Tamera Hill', 'Tamera Hill', 'Karen Abercrombie, Lisa Arrindell, Reggie Currelley, Denzell Dandridge, Vickie Eng', null, 'A man admired for his integrity watches his perfect life unravel when an unexpected visitor shows up at his front door and forces him to confront the painful consequences of his past betrayal.', 'A man admired for his integrity watches his perfect life unravel when an unexpected visitor shows up at his front door and forces him to confront the painful consequences of his past betrayal.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9R8k8Znr9GOb7AbekbdJ0OIVnOU.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-secret-between-us'),
  ('169329930532868945', 'The Secret Bride', 1934, 'Drama', 'William Dieterle, Russell Saunders, Ernest Haller', 'Mary C. McCall, Jr., Tom Buckingham, F. Hugh Herbert', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Warren William, Glenda Farrell, Grant Mitchell, Arthur Byron, Henry O''Neill, Douglass Dumbrille, Arthur Aylesworth', 'NR', 'Before Ruth Vincent, daughter of a state governor, and state attorney general Robert Sheldon can announce their marriage, the governor is accused of bribe-taking. To avoid the appearance of a conflict of interest, they decide to keep their marriage secret. The political intrigue becomes more involved, and no one is quite what they seem. Soon Sheldon and Ruth must decide between saving the governor''s career and an innocent person''s life.', 'Before Ruth Vincent, daughter of a state governor, and state attorney general Robert Sheldon can announce their marriage, the governor is accused of bribe-taking. To avoid the appearance of a conflict of interest, they decide to keep their marriage secret. The political intrigue becomes more involved, and no one is quite what they seem. Soon Sheldon and Ruth must decide between saving the governor''s career and an innocent person''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqfEvHLzp0z5r7IkRHRjpHnqdCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136548'),
  ('862588285608882029', 'The Secret Cinema', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Paul Bartel, Fred Wellington', 'Paul Bartel', 'Amy Vane, Gordon Felio, Connie Ellison, Philip Carlson, Estelle Omens, Barry Dennen, Mara Lepmanis, Camille Fife', null, 'Welcome to the Secret Cinema, now featuring a series of films on the real-life misadventures of Jane, a New York City office secretary. See Jane being sexually harassed by her boss, Mr. Troppogrosso. See Jane get dumped by her boyfriend, Dick. See Jane humiliated in lots of ways. And here''s the kicker: Jane doesn''t know that her life is being filmed, or that she''s being set up by some of the people closest to her. But she''s starting to have her suspicions.', 'Welcome to the Secret Cinema, now featuring a series of films on the real-life misadventures of Jane, a New York City office secretary. See Jane being sexually harassed by her boss, Mr. Troppogrosso. See Jane get dumped by her boyfriend, Dick. See Jane humiliated in lots of ways. And here''s the kicker: Jane doesn''t know that her life is being filmed, or that she''s being set up by some of the people closest to her. But she''s starting to have her suspicions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LCdZ8HdRR9lnZgHPOiItZmQg4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106562'),
  ('491272260664841773', 'The Secret Diaries of Miss Anne Lister', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'James Kent, Lee Trevor, James Mountain', 'Jane English', 'Maxine Peake, Anna Madeley, Susan Lynch, Christine Bottomley, Gemma Jones, Alan David, Richenda Carey, Michael Culkin', null, 'A lesbian in the 1800s who keeps a detailed account of her life written in coded diaries attempts to live independently while juggling an affair with a married woman.', 'A lesbian in the 1800s who keeps a detailed account of her life written in coded diaries attempts to live independently while juggling an affair with a married woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpJHzNNRkLFdY41JwOdZYuAmZ23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42548'),
  ('263582037672469611', 'The Secret Diary of an Exchange Student', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dante Belluti, Anita Barbosa, Irina Neves', 'Bruno Garotti, Sylvio Gonçalves', 'Larissa Manoela, Thati Lopes, Bruno Montaleone, David Sherod, Maiara Walsh, Flávia Garrafa, Kathy-Ann Hart, Ray Faiola', null, 'Two best friends embark on a life-changing adventure abroad as exchange students.', 'Two best friends embark on a life-changing adventure abroad as exchange students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tladXTnCvsMDqJI8RiU3LpasSbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760154'),
  ('381031956139003318', 'The Secret Face', 1991, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Ömer Kavur, Erdal Kahraman, Arslan Kaçar', 'Orhan Pamuk', 'Zuhal Olcay, Fikret Kuşkan, Sevda Ferdağ, Rutkay Aziz, Savaş Yurttaş, Arslan Kaçar, Ahmet Açan, Tomris İncer', null, 'A woman is searching for a face in photographs taken by a photographer. The face she hopes to meet one day belongs to a watch repairman, but the shop has long since closed.', 'A woman is searching for a face in photographs taken by a photographer. The face she hopes to meet one day belongs to a watch repairman, but the shop has long since closed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPBxlzA6MbvEercVxJyy5ye1Zg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203975'),
  ('982011339368127765', 'The Secret Floor', 2026, 'Family, History, Drama', 'Norbert Lechner', 'Katrin Milhahn, Antonia Rothe-Liermann, Antonia Rothe Liermann', 'John Silas, Annika Benzin, Marie Jung, Tobias Resch, Oliver Rosskopf', null, 'Twelve-year-old Karli is helping his parents renovate an old grand hotel. He discovers that he can travel back in time there and ends up in 1938. He befriends a Jewish girl and learns of the dangers that lie ahead', 'Twelve-year-old Karli is helping his parents renovate an old grand hotel. He discovers that he can travel back in time there and ends up in 1938. He befriends a Jewish girl and learns of the dangers that lie ahead', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsiHVSp7n6nYrP2zx3F5IN78ggZB.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-secret-floor-2026'),
  ('1110151839943689497', 'The Secret Formula', 1965, 'Drama', 'Rubén Gámez, Rubén Gámez', 'Santos Núñez Gómez, Juan Rulfo', 'José Castillo, Manuel Gaitán, Pilar Islas, Nico-Nito, Paloma, Jaime Sabines, José Tirado', null, 'A cinematographic essay, full of surreal moments and provocative scenarios related to intellectual debates about the Mexican national character.', 'A cinematographic essay, full of surreal moments and provocative scenarios related to intellectual debates about the Mexican national character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OSmRLxD0Fh8IQyKFTLJr6D32ZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151545'),
  ('428897427498858039', 'The Secret Fury', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leo Tover, Mel Ferrer, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Lionel Houser', 'Claudette Colbert, Robert Ryan, Jane Cowl, Paul Kelly, Philip Ober, Elisabeth Risdon, Doris Dudley, Dave Barbour', 'NR', 'The wedding of Ellen and David is halted by a stranger who insists that the bride is already married to someone else. Though the flabbergasted Ellen denies the charge, the interloper produces enough evidence that his accusation must be investigated. Ellen and David travel to the small coastal town where her first wedding allegedly occurred. There, they meet a number of individuals whose stories make Ellen question her own sanity.', 'The wedding of Ellen and David is halted by a stranger who insists that the bride is already married to someone else. Though the flabbergasted Ellen denies the charge, the interloper produces enough evidence that his accusation must be investigated. Ellen and David travel to the small coastal town where her first wedding allegedly occurred. There, they meet a number of individuals whose stories make Ellen question her own sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wS7c3XQEeZdiFAK7ew5XkNdQRP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74437'),
  ('886316416079607849', 'The Secret Garden', 1949, 'Family, Drama', 'Fred M. Wilcox, Ray June, Jack Gertsman', 'Robert Ardrey', 'Margaret O''Brien, Dean Stockwell, Herbert Marshall, Gladys Cooper, Elsa Lanchester, Brian Roper, Reginald Owen, George Zucco', null, 'When Cholera takes the parents of Mary Lennox, she is shipped from India to England to live with her Uncle Craven. Mary changes the lives of those she encounters at her Uncle''s remote estate.', 'When Cholera takes the parents of Mary Lennox, she is shipped from India to England to live with her Uncle Craven. Mary changes the lives of those she encounters at her Uncle''s remote estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a28DY7ar8klmQAgDQIlpluzeBgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43439'),
  ('442691604445845563', 'The Secret Garden', 1987, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family', 'Alan Grint, Robert Paynter', 'Frances Hodgson Burnett, Blanche Hanalis', 'Gennie James, Barret Oliver, Jadrien Steele, Michael Hordern, Billie Whitelaw, Derek Jacobi, Cassie Stuart, Pat Heywood', 'PG', 'When a spoiled English girl living in 19th century India loses both parents in a cholera epidemic, she is sent back to England to live in a country mansion. The lord is a strange old man-- frail and deformed, immensely kind but so melancholy. She wishes to discover what has caused him so much sorrow and to bring joy back to the household. It all must have something to do with the screams and wails which echo through the house at night and no one wants to talk about.', 'When a spoiled English girl living in 19th century India loses both parents in a cholera epidemic, she is sent back to England to live in a country mansion. The lord is a strange old man-- frail and deformed, immensely kind but so melancholy. She wishes to discover what has caused him so much sorrow and to bring joy back to the household. It all must have something to do with the screams and wails which echo through the house at night and no one wants to talk about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42Y7COT8Mpn4h7SnSbH5dgaYQx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46975'),
  ('984116414835580322', 'The Secret Garden', 1993, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Agnieszka Holland, Roger Deakins, John King', 'Caroline Thompson', 'Kate Maberly, Heydon Prowse, Andrew Knott, Maggie Smith, Irène Jacob, Laura Crossley, John Lynch, Walter Sparrow', 'G', 'A young British girl born and reared in India loses her neglectful parents in an earthquake. She is returned to England to live at her uncle''s castle. Her uncle is very distant due to the loss of his wife ten years before. Neglected once again, she begins exploring the estate and discovers a garden that has been locked and forgotten. Aided by one of the servants'' boys, she begins restoring the garden, and eventually discovers some other secrets of the manor.', 'A young British girl born and reared in India loses her neglectful parents in an earthquake. She is returned to England to live at her uncle''s castle. Her uncle is very distant due to the loss of his wife ten years before. Neglected once again, she begins exploring the estate and discovers a garden that has been locked and forgotten. Aided by one of the servants'' boys, she begins restoring the garden, and eventually discovers some other secrets of the manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zf6h5dJ7wVG7LqMO9dhHGHVejzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11236'),
  ('752357891202893224', 'The Secret Garden', 1994, 'Animation, Family', 'Dave Edwards', 'Libby Hinson', 'Honor Blackman, Derek Jacobi, Glynis Johns, Anndi McAfee', null, 'Animated TV-film version of Frances Hodgson Burnett''s classic children''s story about a spoiled English orphan who lives in India but is transplanted to her uncle''s old, mysterious house in England after her parents'' deaths. After making friends with a country boy and several animals, who talk here, she discovers many secrets on the grounds, including a locked-up, neglected garden and a locked-up, sickly boy, who turns out to be her cousin.', 'Animated TV-film version of Frances Hodgson Burnett''s classic children''s story about a spoiled English orphan who lives in India but is transplanted to her uncle''s old, mysterious house in England after her parents'' deaths. After making friends with a country boy and several animals, who talk here, she discovers many secrets on the grounds, including a locked-up, neglected garden and a locked-up, sickly boy, who turns out to be her cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEMC4L92uU0tNSdAqoADH9kvWhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215685'),
  ('1023793126807987934', 'The Secret Garden', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy, Drama', 'Marc Munden, Solomon Honey, Lol Crawley', 'Jack Thorne', 'Dixie Egerickx, Tommy Gene Surridge, Colin Firth, Julie Walters, Maeve Dermody, Edan Hayhurst, Amir Wilson, Isis Davis', 'PG', 'Mary Lennox is born in India to wealthy British parents who never wanted her. When her parents suddenly die, she is sent back to England to live with her uncle. She meets her sickly cousin, and the two children find a wondrous secret garden lost in the grounds of Misselthwaite Manor.', 'Mary Lennox is born in India to wealthy British parents who never wanted her. When her parents suddenly die, she is sent back to England to live with her uncle. She meets her sickly cousin, and the two children find a wondrous secret garden lost in the grounds of Misselthwaite Manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MSDwUcqnGodFTvtlLiLKK0XKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521034'),
  ('1130851690495079884', 'The Secret Gift of Christmas', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Christie Will Wolf, Becky Parsons', 'Christie Will Wolf', 'Meghan Ory, Christopher Russell, Aria Publicover, Jenn Grant', 'G', 'Bonnie is a personal shopper who helps her new, widowed client Patrick reconnect with his young daughter. Though Bonnie and Patrick''s ideas of shopping couldn''t be more different, she is determined to get Patrick and his daughter everything on their wish list.', 'Bonnie is a personal shopper who helps her new, widowed client Patrick reconnect with his young daughter. Though Bonnie and Patrick''s ideas of shopping couldn''t be more different, she is determined to get Patrick and his daughter everything on their wish list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVRiiNfen5uEQPGXsHSToS3TnPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180686'),
  ('559895500935657958', 'The Secret Ingredient', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Suderman, Chi Fung, Michael T. Burgess', 'Nancy Naigle', 'Erin Cahill, Brendan Penny, Amy Groening, Adam Hurtig, Erik Athavale, Cherissa Richards, Aidan Moreno, Cheryl Soluk', null, 'Small-town baker, Kelly, gets a big surprise when she is invited to compete on a Valentine''s Day baking show in New York City - and an even bigger surprise when she runs into her ex-fiance.', 'Small-town baker, Kelly, gets a big surprise when she is invited to compete on a Valentine''s Day baking show in New York City - and an even bigger surprise when she runs into her ex-fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loyO1ZVWGQeqSfBGJBsjdYnPvD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661334'),
  ('1068044604829312040', 'The Secret Invasion', 1964, 'War', 'Roger Corman, Arthur E. Arling, Charles B. Griffith', 'R. Wright Campbell', 'Stewart Granger, Raf Vallone, Mickey Rooney, Edd Byrnes, Henry Silva, William Campbell, Peter Coe, Špela Rozin', null, 'During World War II, convicts are recruited by the Allies for an extremely hazardous mission.', 'During World War II, convicts are recruited by the Allies for an extremely hazardous mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AhywIKyyom2ec8RgDxy2wTEGyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29032'),
  ('104875707018881296', 'The Secret Kingdom', 2023, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Matt Drummond, Graeme Mitchell', 'Matt Drummond', 'Sam Everingham, Alyla Browne, Alice Parkinson, Beth Champion, Christopher Gabardi, Darius Williams, Gabrielle Chan, Rowland Holmes', 'PG', 'Verity and Peter’s trip to the old family mansion takes a turn when the floor of their room suddenly gives way and they fall into an underground chamber where they are met by a civilization of creatures. The leader tells them that Peter''s arrival was foretold as he’s the one who can use Great Clock of the Citadel to restart time and destroy the Shroud, a malevolent creature who feeds on fear itself...', 'Verity and Peter’s trip to the old family mansion takes a turn when the floor of their room suddenly gives way and they fall into an underground chamber where they are met by a civilization of creatures. The leader tells them that Peter''s arrival was foretold as he’s the one who can use Great Clock of the Citadel to restart time and destroy the Shroud, a malevolent creature who feeds on fear itself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dteXMzVY53GBHUgrR7vigAartsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893345'),
  ('158477968554771338', 'The Secret Life', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'David R. Bowen, Bob Mandera, Ronald Vidor', 'Carl Crew', 'Carl Crew, Christopher ''CJ'' Smith, Donna Stewart Bowen, Jeanne Bascom, Cassidy Phillips, G-Jo Reed, Rowdy Jackson, Andrew Christian English', null, 'Based on the life of notorious serial killer Jeffrey Dahmer, who murdered 17 men and ate many of them before he was caught in 1991.', 'Based on the life of notorious serial killer Jeffrey Dahmer, who murdered 17 men and ate many of them before he was caught in 1991.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NZrBKAtpRqVtWuVZvw5HISajld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47044'),
  ('352160657571565744', 'The Secret Life of Bees', 2008, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood, Rogier Stoffers', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood', 'Dakota Fanning, Queen Latifah, Jennifer Hudson, Alicia Keys, Sophie Okonedo, Paul Bettany, Hilarie Burton, Tristan Mack Wilds', 'PG-13', 'Set in South Carolina in 1964, this is the tale of Lily Owens a 14 year-old girl who is haunted by the memory of her late mother. To escape her lonely life and troubled relationship with her father, Lily flees with Rosaleen, her caregiver and only friend, to a South Carolina town that holds the secret to her mother''s past.', 'Set in South Carolina in 1964, this is the tale of Lily Owens a 14 year-old girl who is haunted by the memory of her late mother. To escape her lonely life and troubled relationship with her father, Lily flees with Rosaleen, her caregiver and only friend, to a South Carolina town that holds the secret to her mother''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1LGEeoYfc6crbfG8WmTKg9SVqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12837'),
