  ('298920307084362660', 'The Secret of an Old Attic', 1984, 'Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Vladimir Tadej, Ivan Frič, Vanja Pinter', 'Jaroslav Petřík, Vladimir Tadej', 'Mario Mirković, Jiří Guryča, Nina Petrović, Rene Bitorajac, Špiro Guberina, Boris Dvornik, Petar Jelaska, Jan Kanyza', null, 'During a summer holiday, two boys discover an anti-gravity cannon in an old attic.', 'During a summer holiday, two boys discover an anti-gravity cannon in an old attic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IrFyQ59vvPgaANkln1rrh58QZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377385'),
  ('596857384027149295', 'The Secret of Anastasia', 1997, 'Adventure, Animation, Crime, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lee Lan', 'Mark Zaslove', 'Lisa DeSimone, Jere Shea, Robert Petkoff, Roger Raines, Earl Hammond, Cynthia Harris, Barbara Jean Kearney, William Meisle', null, 'The Secret of Anastasia is an American 1997 direct-to-video animated musical film, about Anastasia and her quest to find her identity.', 'The Secret of Anastasia is an American 1997 direct-to-video animated musical film, about Anastasia and her quest to find her identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLsaPmZIfh67GIkWp7TQ2ltXYmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123489'),
  ('594644402681138785', 'The Secret of Arkandias', 2014, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Julien Simonet, Alexandre Castagnetti, Yannick Ressigeac', 'Alexandre Castagnetti, Julien Simonet', 'Christian Clavier, Isabelle Nanty, Anémone, Armelle, Ryan Brodie, Timothée Coetsier, Pauline Brisy, Renaud Rutten', null, 'Theo, not the most popular boy at his school, dreams of escaping the dreary everyday life, experiencing adventure and accomplishing great heroic deeds. His dream seems to be fulfilled when, one day, he finds a very old and magical book in the library and fascinates him with a short hand. He forges the plan to forge a ring with his best friend Bonav and the rebellious Laura, who can make him invisible. The charm succeeds, but the three friends conjure up all sorts of dangers of magical, but also secular nature. Only the mysterious red wizard Arkandias can now help you out of trouble.', 'Theo, not the most popular boy at his school, dreams of escaping the dreary everyday life, experiencing adventure and accomplishing great heroic deeds. His dream seems to be fulfilled when, one day, he finds a very old and magical book in the library and fascinates him with a short hand. He forges the plan to forge a ring with his best friend Bonav and the rebellious Laura, who can make him invisible. The charm succeeds, but the three friends conjure up all sorts of dangers of magical, but also secular nature. Only the mysterious red wizard Arkandias can now help you out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9TwXHOlSiMnYBhN0ytBGDMOQ2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289171'),
  ('672719323134544908', 'The Secret of Bacchus', 1984, 'Action, Comedy', 'Geo Saizescu, Aurel Kostrachievici', 'Titus Popovici', 'Emil Hossu, Maia Morgenstern, Ștefan Mihăilescu-Brăila, Dem Rădulescu, Gheorghe Dinică, Sebastian Papaiani, Jean Constantin, Rodica Mureșan', null, 'Victor, an incisive journalist, discovers a series of irregularities in a State farming enterprise. His investigations will unmask the fraud committed by the person in charge of the wine section, called Bachus. Although aided by an impressive number of cronies, Bachus will not be able to hide forever infamous secret.', 'Victor, an incisive journalist, discovers a series of irregularities in a State farming enterprise. His investigations will unmask the fraud committed by the person in charge of the wine section, called Bachus. Although aided by an impressive number of cronies, Bachus will not be able to hide forever infamous secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yot4gP73UKszHfNRfDb6QYvMsao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34132'),
  ('827885303637016649', 'The Secret of Convict Lake', 1951, 'Western', 'Michael Gordon, Leo Tover, Lionel Newman', 'Oscar Saul', 'Glenn Ford, Gene Tierney, Zachary Scott, Ann Dvorak, Ethel Barrymore, Cyril Cusack, Richard Hylton, Barbara Bates', 'NR', 'After a group of convicts escapes from prison, they take refuge in the wilderness. While most of the crew are ruthless sociopaths, Jim Canfield is an innocent man who was jailed under false pretenses. When Canfield and his fellow fugitives reach an isolated farming settlement where the men are all away, it creates tension with the local women. Things get direr when rumors of hidden money arise, and Canfield discovers that the man who framed him is part of the community.', 'After a group of convicts escapes from prison, they take refuge in the wilderness. While most of the crew are ruthless sociopaths, Jim Canfield is an innocent man who was jailed under false pretenses. When Canfield and his fellow fugitives reach an isolated farming settlement where the men are all away, it creates tension with the local women. Things get direr when rumors of hidden money arise, and Canfield discovers that the man who framed him is part of the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l69zTFXKVkefNiLq5AwUknJ2GMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40642'),
  ('634307329506570092', 'The Secret of Dr. Grinberg', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ida Cuéllar, José Luis Bernal', 'Ida Cuéllar, Fernanda Rossi, Juan Muñoz-Tébar', 'Sperry Andrews, Sam Quiñones, Toni Karam, Estusha Grinberg, Jerry Grinberg, Ruth Cerezo, Lizette Arditti, Juan José Sánchez Sosa', null, 'In the early nineties, Dr. Jacobo Grinberg’s career was blooming and he gained lots of international credit as a researcher in the fields of telepathy and neurophysiology at the Universidad Nacional Autonoma de Mexico. When Dr. Grinberg mysteriously disappears in 1994, the police find no trace of him. The only thing that is clear, is that all his research material, including his computers, disappeared along with him.', 'In the early nineties, Dr. Jacobo Grinberg’s career was blooming and he gained lots of international credit as a researcher in the fields of telepathy and neurophysiology at the Universidad Nacional Autonoma de Mexico. When Dr. Grinberg mysteriously disappears in 1994, the police find no trace of him. The only thing that is clear, is that all his research material, including his computers, disappeared along with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keDQeTQtqIku2iK5ijV4J10QL4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640028'),
  ('227145025710872738', 'The Secret of Dr. Kildare', 1939, 'Drama', 'Harold S. Bucquet, Randall Duell, Alfred Gilks', 'Harry Ruskin, Willis Goldbeck', 'Lew Ayres, Lionel Barrymore, Lionel Atwill, Helen Gilbert, Nat Pendleton, Laraine Day, Sara Haden, Samuel S. Hinds', 'NR', 'Intern Kildare heals a millionaire''s daughter and tricks Dr. Gillespie into taking a vacation.', 'Intern Kildare heals a millionaire''s daughter and tricks Dr. Gillespie into taking a vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ybJG53cJKD9hM5zuJWhzJXxM84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153163'),
  ('38739584553093117', 'The Secret of Evil', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dorian Fernández-Moris, Gabriel Di Martino, Rogger Vergara Adrianzén', 'Dorian Fernández-Moris, Paco Bardales, Úrsula Vilca', 'Bruno Espejo, Lupita Mora, Eduardo Ramos, Willy Gutiérrez, Úrsula Kellenberger, Ryu Valverde Oshiro, Rafael Pulgar, Henry Oshiro', null, 'Lima, Peru. An investigation into the mysterious disappearance of a young man in the supposedly haunted Matusita House reveals its darkest secrets to those who dare to open its doors.', 'Lima, Peru. An investigation into the mysterious disappearance of a young man in the supposedly haunted Matusita House reveals its darkest secrets to those who dare to open its doors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hIJYEM2FReIqlavHOujvBx6ixP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415255'),
  ('681355305820754089', 'The Secret of Kells', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Rémi Chayé, Rémi Chayé, Tomm Moore', 'Fabrice Ziolkowski', 'Evan McGuire, Christen Mooney, Brendan Gleeson, Mick Lally, Liam Hourican, Paul Tylak, Michael McGrath, Paul Young', 'NR', 'Adventure awaits 12 year old Brendan who must fight Vikings and a serpent god to find a crystal and complete the legendary Book of Kells. In order to finish Brother Aiden''s book, Brendan must overcome his deepest fears on a secret quest that will take him beyond the abbey walls and into the enchanted forest where dangerous mythical creatures hide. Will Brendan succeed in his quest?', 'Adventure awaits 12 year old Brendan who must fight Vikings and a serpent god to find a crystal and complete the legendary Book of Kells. In order to finish Brother Aiden''s book, Brendan must overcome his deepest fears on a secret quest that will take him beyond the abbey walls and into the enchanted forest where dangerous mythical creatures hide. Will Brendan succeed in his quest?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBymyj7QsXiW4TICD2JC5pAuBHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26963'),
  ('1113125202981884962', 'The Secret of Loch Ness', 2008, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Michael Rowitz, Dietmar Koelzer', 'Daniel Maximilian, Thomas Pauli', 'Lukas Schust, Lisa Martinek, Thomas Fritsch, Hans-Werner Meyer, Karl Merkatz, Serge Falck, Dorkas Kiefer, Eva-Maria Reichert', 'PG', '11-year-old Tim is way ahead of the other boys his age: nothing excites him more than explorers, myths, dinosaurs and legends - and planning his mother''s life! One day, however, Tim''s life is about to change completely: He accidentally discovers a photo of an explorer living in Scotland on the internet and he looks like the spitting image of his dead father! The adventurous boy secretly sets off on a journey to Iverness, the famous Scottish village on the banks of the legendary Loch Ness. And what awaits him there exceeds Tintin''s wildest expectations.', '11-year-old Tim is way ahead of the other boys his age: nothing excites him more than explorers, myths, dinosaurs and legends - and planning his mother''s life! One day, however, Tim''s life is about to change completely: He accidentally discovers a photo of an explorer living in Scotland on the internet and he looks like the spitting image of his dead father! The adventurous boy secretly sets off on a journey to Iverness, the famous Scottish village on the banks of the legendary Loch Ness. And what awaits him there exceeds Tintin''s wildest expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhuSyeGy5L0c1K4vVJjxmDr6xn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7215'),
  ('224079038850166902', 'The Secret of Moonacre', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Gábor Csupó, David Eggby', 'Graham Alborough, Lucy Shuttleworth', 'Dakota Blue Richards, Ioan Gruffudd, Tim Curry, Augustus Prew, Natascha McElhone, Juliet Stevenson, Tamás Tóth, György Szathmári', 'PG', 'When 13 year old Maria Merryweather''s father dies, leaving her orphaned and homeless, she is forced to leave her luxurious London life to go and live with Sir Benjamin, an eccentric uncle she didn''t know she had, at the mysterious Moonacre Manor.', 'When 13 year old Maria Merryweather''s father dies, leaving her orphaned and homeless, she is forced to leave her luxurious London life to go and live with Sir Benjamin, an eccentric uncle she didn''t know she had, at the mysterious Moonacre Manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZdwKhauiCgIxulUme63JjejpTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18032'),
  ('888087544194618562', 'The Secret of My Success', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Herbert Ross, Carlo Di Palma, Louis D''Esposito', 'AJ Carothers', 'Michael J. Fox, Helen Slater, Richard Jordan, Margaret Whitton, John Pankow, Christopher Murney, Gerry Bamman, Fred Gwynne', 'PG-13', 'Brantley Foster, a well-educated kid from Kansas, has always dreamed of making it big in New York, but once in New York, he learns that jobs - and girls - are hard to get. When Brantley visits his uncle, Howard Prescott, who runs a multi-million-dollar company, he is given a job in the company''s mail room.', 'Brantley Foster, a well-educated kid from Kansas, has always dreamed of making it big in New York, but once in New York, he learns that jobs - and girls - are hard to get. When Brantley visits his uncle, Howard Prescott, who runs a multi-million-dollar company, he is given a job in the company''s mail room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UizUgCGt2Vx48m3v2bOUEt51b2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10021'),
  ('885985094974783739', 'The Secret of Nikola Tesla', 1980, 'Drama', 'Krsto Papić, Ivica Rajković', 'John English, Ivo Brešan, Krsto Papić', 'Petar Božović, Orson Welles, Oja Kodar, Strother Martin, Dennis Patrick, Charles Millot, Boris Buzančić, Ana Karić', null, 'Life and times of Nikola Tesla, famous scientist whose inventions were stolen, but whose greatest contribution to mankind remain a mystery to this day.', 'Life and times of Nikola Tesla, famous scientist whose inventions were stolen, but whose greatest contribution to mankind remain a mystery to this day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teuDrqS7xj1mCKrORarJFCxSs43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51444'),
  ('251004601661441645', 'The Secret of NIMH', 1982, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Mystery, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Don Bluth, John Pomeroy, Gary Goldman', 'Gary Goldman, Don Bluth, Will Finn', 'Elizabeth Hartman, Derek Jacobi, Arthur Malet, Dom DeLuise, Hermione Baddeley, Shannen Doherty, Wil Wheaton, Jodi Hicks', 'G', 'A widowed field mouse must move her family -- including an ailing son -- to escape a farmer''s plow. Aided by a crow and a pack of superintelligent, escaped lab rats, the brave mother struggles to transplant her home to firmer ground.', 'A widowed field mouse must move her family -- including an ailing son -- to escape a farmer''s plow. Aided by a crow and a pack of superintelligent, escaped lab rats, the brave mother struggles to transplant her home to firmer ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prNrnOKlkV9wl5Sl3zwHu1f3t2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11704'),
  ('578983750476631018', 'The Secret of NIMH 2: Timmy to the Rescue', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Dick Sebast, Bunis Yang', 'Chris Hubbell, Sam Graham', 'Ralph Macchio, Eric Idle, Hynden Walch, Harvey Korman, Andrea Martin, William H. Macy, Dom DeLuise, Peter MacNicol', 'G', 'The rats and mice, made intellectually superior in the original Secret of N.I.M.H., return to Thorn Valley to groom their destined leader - young Timmy Brisby.', 'The rats and mice, made intellectually superior in the original Secret of N.I.M.H., return to Thorn Valley to groom their destined leader - young Timmy Brisby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8CLj0g6hB2849rCLoWrkUkJpvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20756'),
  ('23634040808010352', 'The Secret of Roan Inish', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Drama', 'John Sayles, Des Hughes, Peter McAleese', 'John Sayles', 'Jeni Courtney, Eileen Colgan, Mick Lally, John Lynch, Pat Slowey, Dave Duffy, Declan Hannigan, Richard Sheridan', 'PG', 'Ten-year-old Fiona is sent to live with her grandparents in a small fishing village in Donegal, Ireland. She soon learns the local legend that an ancestor of hers married a Selkie – a seal who can turn into a human. Years earlier, her baby brother was washed out to sea and never seen again, so when Fiona spies a naked little boy on the abandoned Isle of Roan Inish, she is compelled to investigate.', 'Ten-year-old Fiona is sent to live with her grandparents in a small fishing village in Donegal, Ireland. She soon learns the local legend that an ancestor of hers married a Selkie – a seal who can turn into a human. Years earlier, her baby brother was washed out to sea and never seen again, so when Fiona spies a naked little boy on the abandoned Isle of Roan Inish, she is compelled to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FFcEEMMrnXh3CFz3aON92sLkXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14334'),
  ('538287820149838560', 'The Secret of Santa Vittoria', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Stanley Kramer, Ray Gosnell Jr., Franco Cirino', 'William Rose, Ben Maddow', 'Anthony Quinn, Anna Magnani, Giancarlo Giannini, Virna Lisi, Hardy Krüger, Wolfgang Jansen, Peter Kuiper, Sergio Franchi', 'PG-13', 'During World War II, Italian villagers hide their wine from the German army.', 'During World War II, Italian villagers hide their wine from the German army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX4xHo8GptvEbkch6i7OpWiM1L0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30298'),
  ('948164916178799073', 'The Secret of Sinchanee', 2021, 'Horror', 'Steven Grayhm', 'Steven Grayhm', 'Steven Grayhm, Tamara Austin, Laila Lockhart Kraner, Nate Boyer, Rudy Reyes, Jacob Schick', null, 'An industrial tow truck driver suffering from insomnia returns to his childhood home after the untimely death of his father, to discover that a paranormal presence has been living in the house and haunting the sacred land it was built on.', 'An industrial tow truck driver suffering from insomnia returns to his childhood home after the untimely death of his father, to discover that a paranormal presence has been living in the house and haunting the sacred land it was built on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TcVPNaoIlfQHJchqYQ7mehBcaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874728'),
  ('126840766509831751', 'The Secret of Steel City', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Ludvík Ráža, Věra Pištěková, Jaroslav Hrubeš', 'Ondřej Vogeltanz, Ludvík Ráža', 'Martin Růžek, Josef Vinklář, Petr Kostka, Jan Potměšil, Jaromír Hanzlík, Taťjana Medvecká, Josef Somr, Petr Čepek', null, 'The film is a metaphor for the Cold War. It depicts two neighbouring nations: peace loving Fortuna and the not so peaceful land of the Steel City.', 'The film is a metaphor for the Cold War. It depicts two neighbouring nations: peace loving Fortuna and the not so peaceful land of the Steel City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3qcubNW5YsnEsskeKqc1f0uVvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72491'),
  ('89242583184092573', 'The Secret of the Abby', 2017, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Alfred Lot', null, 'Fabienne Carat, Bernard Yerlès, Antoine Chappey, Marie-Christine Orry, Rio Vega, Sophie Rodrigues, Henri Guybet', null, 'Who would kill a Carthusian monk and why? As the investigators will find out, the key to the mystery lies in the ultra-secret formula of the Chartreuse plant liqueur.', 'Who would kill a Carthusian monk and why? As the investigators will find out, the key to the mystery lies in the ultra-secret formula of the Chartreuse plant liqueur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4H8RVbo7Ei99bqV5J1Z3i1c3Fot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522509'),
  ('80550537399823114', 'The Secret of the Black Widow', 1963, 'Crime', 'Franz Josef Gottlieb, Godofredo Pacheco', 'Alexandra Becker, Franz Josef Gottlieb, Rolf Becker', 'O.W. Fischer, Karin Dor, Doris Kirchner, Werner Peters, Eddi Arent, Klaus Kinski, Claude Farell, Gabriel Llopart', null, 'Someone is killing people related to a South American expedition. The means of murder are poison darts with rubber spiders attached to them. A writer and some police detectives investigate.', 'Someone is killing people related to a South American expedition. The means of murder are poison darts with rubber spiders attached to them. A writer and some police detectives investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQI0JRzr43LveWXybEk6MUuqUjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153439'),
  ('23516125853809575', 'The Secret of the Grain', 2007, 'Drama', 'Abdellatif Kechiche, Lubomir Bakchev, Benoît Baraquin', 'Ghalya Lacroix, Abdellatif Kechiche', 'Habib Boufares, Hafsia Herzi, Farida Benkhetache, Abdelhamid Aktouche, Alice Houri, Bouraouïa Marzouk, Cyril Favre, Leila D''Issernio', null, 'In southern France, a Franco-Arabic shipyard worker along with his partner''s daughter pursues his dream of opening a restaurant.', 'In southern France, a Franco-Arabic shipyard worker along with his partner''s daughter pursues his dream of opening a restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqPwap2uS7d7yLJVGjQYTdG9I1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8280'),
  ('906137428562736689', 'The Secret of the Iron Door', 1970, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Vitali Grishin, Mikhail Yuzovskiy, Iosef Sosland', 'Aleksandr Reyzhevsky', 'Alisa Freyndlikh, Oleg Tabakov, Savely Kramarov, Georgi Svetlani, Evaldas Mikaliūnas, Andrey Kharybin, Vladimir Brezhnev, Michislav Yuzovsky', null, 'Every one of us dreams of finding a magic wand, matches or, at least, an enchanted flower that would make any wish come true. Well, we’re just dreaming, but a boy named Tolya Ryzhkov did find one, though, between us, he didn’t deserve such a good fortune. He was a pretty big liar and rascal, didn’t listen to his mother, hurt those who were weaker, and didn’t obey traffic regulations.On that ill-fated day when his incredible adventures began he behaved badly, as usual. He had even made a policeman mad! While running away from him, Tolya met a magician and forced a box of magic matches from him. To punish the boy, the evil magician (alas, there are such, too) had Tolya transported to his magic island. You will know how it all ended when you watch this humorous, fascinating adventure film.', 'Every one of us dreams of finding a magic wand, matches or, at least, an enchanted flower that would make any wish come true. Well, we’re just dreaming, but a boy named Tolya Ryzhkov did find one, though, between us, he didn’t deserve such a good fortune. He was a pretty big liar and rascal, didn’t listen to his mother, hurt those who were weaker, and didn’t obey traffic regulations.On that ill-fated day when his incredible adventures began he behaved badly, as usual. He had even made a policeman mad! While running away from him, Tolya met a magician and forced a box of magic matches from him. To punish the boy, the evil magician (alas, there are such, too) had Tolya transported to his magic island. You will know how it all ended when you watch this humorous, fascinating adventure film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IOF0x6R6OHsMqnuApv5s6Ab4e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149894'),
  ('326195630613932138', 'The Secret of the Magic Gourd', 2007, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Frankie Chung Chi-Hang, John Chu Ka-Yan', 'John Chu Ka-Yan', 'Chen Peisi, Zhu Qilong, Zheng Jiahao, Guo Kaimin, He Qing, Meng Qian, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Sean Lau Ching-wan', 'G', 'When schoolboy Wang Bao discovers a magical gourd that can instantly grant his every wish, the awkward child suddenly becomes a hero amongst his curious classmates. When the gourd proves more of a burden than a blessing and the boy decides to get rid of it, he quickly discovers that''s easier said than done.', 'When schoolboy Wang Bao discovers a magical gourd that can instantly grant his every wish, the awkward child suddenly becomes a hero amongst his curious classmates. When the gourd proves more of a burden than a blessing and the boy decides to get rid of it, he quickly discovers that''s easier said than done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwJilsNFXDpdI6UNd2IJgL3R2GN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38057'),
