  ('419231401199211670', 'The Sentiment of the Flesh', 2010, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Roberto Garzelli', null, 'Annabelle Hettmann, Thibault Vinçon, Emmanuel Salinger, Pierre Moure, Claudia Tagbo, Pascal N''Zonzi', null, 'During a medical exam, Helena, a student in anatomical drawing, meets Benoit, a young radiologist. Their mutual fascination for the human body incites them to start a passionate romance. Helena''s capability to memorize every detail of Benoit''s body and Benoit''s irresistible curiosity to uncover the ''interior'' secrets of Helena''s body lead them to a dangerous journey with no limits...', 'During a medical exam, Helena, a student in anatomical drawing, meets Benoit, a young radiologist. Their mutual fascination for the human body incites them to start a passionate romance. Helena''s capability to memorize every detail of Benoit''s body and Benoit''s irresistible curiosity to uncover the ''interior'' secrets of Helena''s body lead them to a dangerous journey with no limits...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fN4MQUHpNE0fqE7PEoS6QvUBedC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52321'),
  ('623496520808529213', 'The Sentimental Education of Eugenie', 2005, 'Romance', 'Marco Carosi, Aurelio Grimaldi, Guendalina Zampagni', 'Michele Lo Foco, Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Antonella Salvucci, Valerio Tambone, Sara Sartini, Cristian Stelluti, Salvatore Lizzio, Guia Jelo, Boris Vecchio', null, 'The clever and passionate Madame De Saint-Ange has taken into consideration the education of the young and illiterate Eugenie and at the same time wants to seduce Marquis Dolmance, a famous homosexual philosopher. In two days, with the help of her brother, the Cavalier de Mirvel and the young servant Augustin, Madame will bring the company to completion with more or less mischievous geniuses, put in place through a combination of sensuality, eroticism and feeling.', 'The clever and passionate Madame De Saint-Ange has taken into consideration the education of the young and illiterate Eugenie and at the same time wants to seduce Marquis Dolmance, a famous homosexual philosopher. In two days, with the help of her brother, the Cavalier de Mirvel and the young servant Augustin, Madame will bring the company to completion with more or less mischievous geniuses, put in place through a combination of sensuality, eroticism and feeling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp4tXVguC5n14X6zo5fFNCuVK5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64827'),
