  ('966757484040689583', 'The Sentinel', 1977, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Richard C. Kratina, Michael Winner, Charles Okun', 'Michael Winner', 'Cristina Raines, Chris Sarandon, Martin Balsam, John Carradine, José Ferrer, Ava Gardner, Arthur Kennedy, Burgess Meredith', 'R', 'As a young girl, Alison Parker attempted suicide after being traumatized by her father''s sexual exploits. Now an elite fashion model, she moves to a Brooklyn Heights apartment building where she encounters a number of bizarre, eccentric tenants and attempts to uncover the building''s sinister secret.', 'As a young girl, Alison Parker attempted suicide after being traumatized by her father''s sexual exploits. Now an elite fashion model, she moves to a Brooklyn Heights apartment building where she encounters a number of bizarre, eccentric tenants and attempts to uncover the building''s sinister secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoLuOdAD63prJP0o3Z0zRaAfwXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18196'),
