  ('682542796011388549', 'The Sergeant', 1968, 'Drama, War', 'John Flynn, Louis Pitzele, Henri Persin', 'Dennis Murphy', 'Rod Steiger, John Phillip Law, Ludmila Mikaël, Frank Latimore, Elliott Sullivan, Ronald Rubin, Philip Roye, Jerry Brouer', null, 'Master Sgt. Albert Callan is a war hero and a no-nonsense leader who reforms his previously mismanaged military base. Although Callan seems collected, he struggles as a closeted homosexual. When the sergeant becomes obsessed with his handsome clerk, Tom Swanson, he even disrupts the young man''s relationship with his French girlfriend, Solange. Since Swanson isn''t receptive to Callan''s advances, it creates major tension between the two men.', 'Master Sgt. Albert Callan is a war hero and a no-nonsense leader who reforms his previously mismanaged military base. Although Callan seems collected, he struggles as a closeted homosexual. When the sergeant becomes obsessed with his handsome clerk, Tom Swanson, he even disrupts the young man''s relationship with his French girlfriend, Solange. Since Swanson isn''t receptive to Callan''s advances, it creates major tension between the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwCcfhPDamFTuaqsiJMswyDZH8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118533'),
  ('1123293076038921643', 'The Serpent', 1973, 'Thriller', 'Henri Verneuil, Claude Renoir, Marc Grunebaum', 'Gilles Perrault, Henri Verneuil', 'Yul Brynner, Henry Fonda, Dirk Bogarde, Virna Lisi, Robert Alda, Farley Granger, Philippe Noiret, Michel Bouquet', 'PG', 'Vlassov is a Soviet spy who defects in France. He is whisked to the U.S, where Allan Davies takes over the case. After polygraph tests and cross-examinations, Vlassov names several Western European agents who are also spying for the Soviets. Davies wants to take the listed agents into custody; meanwhile, those on the list start dying under mysterious circumstances.', 'Vlassov is a Soviet spy who defects in France. He is whisked to the U.S, where Allan Davies takes over the case. After polygraph tests and cross-examinations, Vlassov names several Western European agents who are also spying for the Soviets. Davies wants to take the listed agents into custody; meanwhile, those on the list start dying under mysterious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smqx8XlZSJzezGEfcI9ySIetzpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44607'),
  ('841111211713357466', 'The Serpent', 2021, 'Action', 'Gia Skova, Lars Lindstrom, Mattia Ferrante', 'Gia Skova', 'Gia Skova, Travis Aaron Wade, Nigel Vonas, Jason Burrill, Craig Conway, Alexandra Tebano, Lin Gothoni, Jason Scott Jenkins', null, 'Top special agent Lucinda Kavsky works for a secret part of the CIA. She''s given a special assignment but then set up by her own agency.', 'Top special agent Lucinda Kavsky works for a secret part of the CIA. She''s given a special assignment but then set up by her own agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OSfx8jJrjHWO9SU3Wtfd7Rs8PF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504148'),
  ('284238149472184911', 'The Serpent and the Rainbow', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Wes Craven, John Lindley, Robert Engelman', 'Richard Maxwell, Adam Rodman', 'Bill Pullman, Cathy Tyson, Zakes Mokae, Paul Winfield, Brent Jennings, Conrad Roberts, Badja Djola, Theresa Merritt', 'R', 'A Harvard anthropologist is sent to Haiti to retrieve a strange powder that is said to have the power to bring human beings back from the dead. In his quest to find the miracle drug, the cynical scientist enters the rarely seen netherworld of walking zombies, blood rites and ancient curses. Based on the true life experiences of Wade Davis and filmed on location in Haiti, it''s a frightening excursion into black magic and the supernatural.', 'A Harvard anthropologist is sent to Haiti to retrieve a strange powder that is said to have the power to bring human beings back from the dead. In his quest to find the miracle drug, the cynical scientist enters the rarely seen netherworld of walking zombies, blood rites and ancient curses. Based on the true life experiences of Wade Davis and filmed on location in Haiti, it''s a frightening excursion into black magic and the supernatural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezgaj43WaSmyQa24NLG7vPK9hb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11503'),
