  ('135349142203441341', 'The Seven Crystal Balls', 1992, 'Animation, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Robert Réa, Eric Rondeaux', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Michel Ruhl, Marie Vincent, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman', null, 'Tintin and his friends investigate when something ominous haunts seven archaeologists, just after their return from an ethnographic expedition to the Andes, where they have dug up the tomb of Inca Rascar Capac.', 'Tintin and his friends investigate when something ominous haunts seven archaeologists, just after their return from an ethnographic expedition to the Andes, where they have dug up the tomb of Inca Rascar Capac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mtLreAXIX0hLuWtfdCntE0BA5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441294'),
  ('388496250120547227', 'The Seven Cucas', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Felipe Cazals', 'Jorge Patiño', 'Isela Vega, David Reynoso, Patricia Rivera, Isaura Espinoza, Blanca Guerra, Angélica Chain, Merle Uribe, Amparo Muñoz', null, 'A worker''s wife and six pretty daughters are desired by all the men in their little town, so he decides to move his family elsewhere.', 'A worker''s wife and six pretty daughters are desired by all the men in their little town, so he decides to move his family elsewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loTRETCZSSrvrkwMSeKn81qsT9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430549'),
  ('903737322239306998', 'The Seven Deadly Sins', 1952, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yves Allégret, Claude Autant-Lara, Eduardo De Filippo', 'Jean Aurenche, Pierre Bost, Carlo Rim', 'Michèle Morgan, Françoise Rosay, Jean Debucourt, Marcelle Praince, Louis Seigner, Robert Auboyneau, Marguerite Cassan, Frédérique Hébrard', null, 'A compilation of segments covers the seven deadly sins of greed, wrath, envy, pride, lust, sloth, and gluttony.', 'A compilation of segments covers the seven deadly sins of greed, wrath, envy, pride, lust, sloth, and gluttony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRVO6GEwiU9aPPwJUeMyY7RSdQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300503'),
  ('78281475159185772', 'The Seven Deadly Sins', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Roger Vadim, Jean-Luc Godard, Philippe de Broca', 'Claude Mauriac, Jean-Luc Godard, Jacques Demy', 'Danièle Barraud, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Jacques Charrier, Claude Rich, Sacha Briquet, Jean-Claude Brialy, Dany Saval, Claude Brasseur', null, 'Seven directors each dramatize one of the seven deadly sins in a short film. In "Anger," a domestic argument over a fly in the Sunday soup escalates into nuclear war. In "Sloth," a movie star would rather pay someone to tie his shoe than bend over to do it himself, and he can''t be bothered to accept a starlet''s sexual favors. In "Gluttony," a peasant family on its way to the funeral of a relative who died from indigestion stops regularly to eat and drink en route, arriving in time to eat some more. In "Greed," a high-class prostitute refunds the price of a cadet''s lottery ticket. In "Pride," an unfaithful wife finds reason to reform. And so on through lust and envy.', 'Seven directors each dramatize one of the seven deadly sins in a short film. In "Anger," a domestic argument over a fly in the Sunday soup escalates into nuclear war. In "Sloth," a movie star would rather pay someone to tie his shoe than bend over to do it himself, and he can''t be bothered to accept a starlet''s sexual favors. In "Gluttony," a peasant family on its way to the funeral of a relative who died from indigestion stops regularly to eat and drink en route, arriving in time to eat some more. In "Greed," a high-class prostitute refunds the price of a cadet''s lottery ticket. In "Pride," an unfaithful wife finds reason to reform. And so on through lust and envy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhU348zOhyu3FPTqnlli1FaU41B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72898'),
  ('116138189500585107', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 1', 2022, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Bob Shirohata', 'Rintaro Ikeda', 'Ayumu Murase, Sora Amamiya, Yohei Azakami, Jun Fukuyama, Keisuke Hamaoka, Setsuo Ito, Yuki Kaji, Natsumi Kawaida', 'PG-13', 'Tristan, the son of Meliodas and Elizabeth, inherits the power of the Goddess Clan and can heal people’s wounds and injuries, but he often ends up hurting others due to his inability to control his Demon Clan power. To protect his family, Tristan heads to Edinburgh Castle and meets a host of new friends along the way.', 'Tristan, the son of Meliodas and Elizabeth, inherits the power of the Goddess Clan and can heal people’s wounds and injuries, but he often ends up hurting others due to his inability to control his Demon Clan power. To protect his family, Tristan heads to Edinburgh Castle and meets a host of new friends along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1CSJZwI51YPGATc5iiExxfwvyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989937'),
  ('595949463483940814', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 2', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 'Bob Shirohata, Kazuhiro Wakabayashi', 'Rintaro Ikeda', 'Ayumu Murase, Koki Uchiyama, Yuki Kaji, Sora Amamiya, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Aoi Yuuki, Jun Fukuyama, Yuuhei Takagi', 'PG-13', 'Reunited with Lancelot for the first time since their tragic accident, Tristan must learn to conquer his inner demons in order to save his mother''s life.', 'Reunited with Lancelot for the first time since their tragic accident, Tristan must learn to conquer his inner demons in order to save his mother''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/516MFML05KWiPfiQNAsVCGMySc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064835'),
  ('1141177362515346630', 'The Seven Deadly Sins: Prisoners of the Sky', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 'Yuu Karube, Yasuyuki Kai, Takehiro Hamatsu', 'Makoto Uezu', 'Yuki Kaji, Sora Amamiya, Misaki Kuno, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Jun Fukuyama, Aoi Yuuki, Tomokazu Sugita, Maaya Sakamoto', 'PG-13', 'Traveling in search of the rare ingredient, “sky fish” Meliodas and Hawk arrive at a palace that floats above the clouds. The people there are busy preparing a ceremony, meant to protect their home from a ferocious beast that awakens once every 3,000 years. But before the ritual is complete, the Six Knights of Black—a Demon Clan army—removes the seal on the beast, threatening the lives of everyone in the Sky Palace.', 'Traveling in search of the rare ingredient, “sky fish” Meliodas and Hawk arrive at a palace that floats above the clouds. The people there are busy preparing a ceremony, meant to protect their home from a ferocious beast that awakens once every 3,000 years. But before the ritual is complete, the Six Knights of Black—a Demon Clan army—removes the seal on the beast, threatening the lives of everyone in the Sky Palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63NOOAkaZAK8h93Sg7Ucq6XLJGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507569'),
  ('389606796394552390', 'The Seven Five', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Tiller Russell, Igor Martinović', null, 'Michael Dowd', null, 'Meet the dirtiest cop in NYC history. Michael Dowd stole money and dealt drugs while patrolling the streets of ''80s Brooklyn.', 'Meet the dirtiest cop in NYC history. Michael Dowd stole money and dealt drugs while patrolling the streets of ''80s Brooklyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prCuFhowUc6YmcyJvd2AP1E50WA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320882'),
  ('172824865514678138', 'The Seven Kittens', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Paulo Sérgio de Almeida, Bia Castro, Liège Monteiro', 'Gilberto Loureiro', 'Antônio Fagundes, Ana Maria Magalhães, Lima Duarte, Ary Fontoura, Sura Berditchevsky, Sônia Dias, Cláudio Corrêa e Castro, Thelma Reston', null, 'Noronha is a low middle-class civil servant who lives with his frustrated wife Gorda and their four eldest daughters. The youngest one, virginal Silene, is unexpectedly sent back from boarding school after killing a female cat and her seven newborns in a hysterical fit. Many dark family secrets will emerge from that episode leading to tragic events.', 'Noronha is a low middle-class civil servant who lives with his frustrated wife Gorda and their four eldest daughters. The youngest one, virginal Silene, is unexpectedly sent back from boarding school after killing a female cat and her seven newborns in a hysterical fit. Many dark family secrets will emerge from that episode leading to tragic events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDtK3boRVeqZ8llWdANCrpGoMoJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186411'),
  ('59531597866060861', 'The Seven Little Foys', 1955, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Melville Shavelson, James A. Rosenberger, John F. Warren', 'Melville Shavelson, Jack Rose', 'Bob Hope, Milly Vitale, George Tobias, Angela Clarke, Herbert Heyes, Richard Shannon, Billy Gray, Lee Erickson', 'NR', 'Vaudeville entertainer Eddie Foy, who has vowed to forever keep his act a solo, falls in love with and marries Italian ballerina Madeleine. While they continue to tour the circuit, they begin a family and before long have seven little Foys to clutter the wings. After tragedy threatens to stall Eddie''s career, he comes to realize that his little terrors are worth their weight in gold. - Chris Stone', 'Vaudeville entertainer Eddie Foy, who has vowed to forever keep his act a solo, falls in love with and marries Italian ballerina Madeleine. While they continue to tour the circuit, they begin a family and before long have seven little Foys to clutter the wings. After tragedy threatens to stall Eddie''s career, he comes to realize that his little terrors are worth their weight in gold. - Chris Stone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFsRUT27D1Jxi58QCU8D743R71q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25893'),
  ('79119615050821601', 'The Seven Magnificent Gladiators', 1983, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Claudio Fragasso, Bruno Mattei, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Lou Ferrigno, Sybil Danning, Brad Harris, Dan Vadis, Carla Ferrigno, Barbara Pesante, Yehuda Efroni, Mandy Rice-Davies', null, 'A bandit leader endowed with supernatural powers by his sorceress mother makes yearly raids on a peasant village. However, the women of the village come into possession of a magic sword, and go in search of a hero who is able to wield it and save their village from the evil bandit.', 'A bandit leader endowed with supernatural powers by his sorceress mother makes yearly raids on a peasant village. However, the women of the village come into possession of a magic sword, and go in search of a hero who is able to wield it and save their village from the evil bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVsx4QXHlf5ppMc5Ezvlu8H9gp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110261'),
  ('539137846336510979', 'The Seven Minutes', 1971, 'Drama', 'Russ Meyer, Fred Mandl', 'Richard Warren Lewis', 'Wayne Maunder, Marianne McAndrew, Philip Carey, Jay C. Flippen, Edy Williams, Yvonne De Carlo, John Carradine, Harold J. Stone', 'R', 'To help with an upcoming election, a bookstore clerk is indicted for selling obscene material. The defense attorneys need to find the mystery of the original publication of the book.', 'To help with an upcoming election, a bookstore clerk is indicted for selling obscene material. The defense attorneys need to find the mystery of the original publication of the book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHd1zxZPpTQ7CBrUlj4HzV0wJy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5745'),
  ('144630615304602939', 'The Seven Vampires', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ivan Cardoso', 'Rubens Francisco Lucchetti', 'Nicole Puzzi, Nuno Leal Maia, Andréa Beltrão, Susana Matos, John Herbert, Lucélia Santos, Colé Santana, Ariel Coelho', null, 'A clumsy detective and his secretary are hired to solve the mysterious, vampiresque deaths happening at a nightclub show.', 'A clumsy detective and his secretary are hired to solve the mysterious, vampiresque deaths happening at a nightclub show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ly1m7Gk14mXyCTqesNJYIfNYF8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152022'),
  ('724176197713882282', 'The Seven Year Hitch', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Scott K. Harris, Deborah Chung, James W. Wrenn', 'Brian Sawyer, Gregg Rossen', 'Natalie Hall, Darin Brooks, Ryan Doom, John Sloan, George Wendt, Frances Fisher, Katy Stoll, Eric Michael Roy', 'PG', 'Jennifer and Kevin are childhood best friends who have lived together, platonically, as adults for many years. When Jennifer decides to marry her cheating, manipulative boyfriend, Bryce Kevin has to stop the wedding to protect her from making, what he believes is, a terrible mistake. With a little help from his brother and neighbor Kevin discovers that he and Jennifer are already legally married due to common law, having lived together for seven years and, as such, Jennifer can not marry Bryce.', 'Jennifer and Kevin are childhood best friends who have lived together, platonically, as adults for many years. When Jennifer decides to marry her cheating, manipulative boyfriend, Bryce Kevin has to stop the wedding to protect her from making, what he believes is, a terrible mistake. With a little help from his brother and neighbor Kevin discovers that he and Jennifer are already legally married due to common law, having lived together for seven years and, as such, Jennifer can not marry Bryce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wwRnQQ4KLgmc24Y7fr8FqP2IER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173557'),
  ('873414723631539036', 'The Seven Year Itch', 1955, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Milton Krasner, Billy Wilder, Joseph E. Rickards', 'George Axelrod, Billy Wilder', 'Marilyn Monroe, Tom Ewell, Evelyn Keyes, Sonny Tufts, Robert Strauss, Oskar Homolka, Marguerite Chapman, Victor Moore', 'NR', 'When his family goes away for summer vacation, a hitherto faithful publishing executive with an overactive imagination is tempted by an attractive new neighbor.', 'When his family goes away for summer vacation, a hitherto faithful publishing executive with an overactive imagination is tempted by an attractive new neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oLqx0QbjWFzWtkxRmDLGH47CUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10653'),
  ('471026306685884086', 'The Seven-Per-Cent Solution', 1976, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Herbert Ross, Oswald Morris, Scott Wodehouse', 'Nicholas Meyer', 'Alan Arkin, Vanessa Redgrave, Robert Duvall, Nicol Williamson, Laurence Olivier, Joel Grey, Samantha Eggar, Jeremy Kemp', 'PG', 'Concerned about his friend''s cocaine use, Dr. Watson tricks Sherlock Holmes into travelling to Vienna, where Holmes enters the care of Sigmund Freud. Freud attempts to solve the mysteries of Holmes'' subconscious, while Holmes devotes himself to solving a mystery involving the kidnapping of Lola Deveraux.', 'Concerned about his friend''s cocaine use, Dr. Watson tricks Sherlock Holmes into travelling to Vienna, where Holmes enters the care of Sigmund Freud. Freud attempts to solve the mysteries of Holmes'' subconscious, while Holmes devotes himself to solving a mystery involving the kidnapping of Lola Deveraux.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95IzjZIzXVDpojBuMWaeAmJzIDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29578'),
  ('778763184678925540', 'The Seven-Ups', 1973, 'Action, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Philip D''Antoni, Ted Zachary, Irving Bigman', 'Alexander Jacobs, Albert Ruben', 'Roy Scheider, Jerry Leon, Tony Lo Bianco, Victor Arnold, Ken Kercheval, Larry Haines, Richard Lynch, Bill Hickman', 'PG', 'A tough detective who is part of an elite New York City unit is trying to find out who killed his partner, but uncovers a plot to kidnap mobsters for money.', 'A tough detective who is part of an elite New York City unit is trying to find out who killed his partner, but uncovers a plot to kidnap mobsters for money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmpzuTWUEiVPsRz7kKXijNISUNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32080'),
  ('195081330601311633', 'The Seventh Brother', 1995, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Jenö Koltai, József Gémes', 'Tibor Hernádi, Attila Dargay, József Nepp', 'Csongor Szalay, Balázs Simonyi, Álmos Előd, Halasi Dániel, Szvetlov Balázs, Nemes Takách Kata, Mánya Zsófi, Károly Kassai', null, 'After his owners abandon him in the woods, a puppy befriends a family of rabbits.', 'After his owners abandon him in the woods, a puppy befriends a family of rabbits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRaVX9HU0l1Av6dAFTIoAlrl2FQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41097'),
  ('623601905596653399', 'The Seventh Companion', 1967, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksei German, Eduard Rozovsky, Grigoriy Aronov', 'Edgar Dubrovsky, Yuri Klepikov', 'Andrei Popov, Aleksandr Anisimov, Pyotr Chernov, Vladimir Osenev, Valentin Abramov, Sofiya Giatsintova, Vladimir Erenberg, Aleksandr Mikhaylov', null, 'A portrait of the era of "Red Terror" during the civil war that followed the Bolshevik revolution, The Seventh Companion offers a character study in General Adamov (Andrei Popov), a law professor in the tsarist army, who is incarcerated by the Bolshevik secret police along with many other members of the bourgeoisie. Finally released into the new world of the Soviet Union, the resigned officer finds that he has lost everything from his old life except a mantel clock that he carries through the night from place to place, until he ends up back where he started.', 'A portrait of the era of "Red Terror" during the civil war that followed the Bolshevik revolution, The Seventh Companion offers a character study in General Adamov (Andrei Popov), a law professor in the tsarist army, who is incarcerated by the Bolshevik secret police along with many other members of the bourgeoisie. Finally released into the new world of the Soviet Union, the resigned officer finds that he has lost everything from his old life except a mantel clock that he carries through the night from place to place, until he ends up back where he started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzwR6x4yunr0zxED4qgYsdtPbsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164041'),
  ('83113718765607108', 'The Seventh Company Has Been Found', 1975, 'Comedy, War', 'Robert Lamoureux, Marcel Grignon', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Robert Lamoureux', 'Jean Lefebvre, Pierre Mondy, Henri Guybet, Pierre Tornade, Érik Colin, Robert Lamoureux, Bernard Dhéran, Jacques Monod', null, 'The second part of the Seventh Company adventures.', 'The second part of the Seventh Company adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBsGkRLaeZzoJr4qnlyF6wZQst9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401306'),
  ('363632571995516600', 'The Seventh Company Outdoors', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Robert Lamoureux', 'Robert Lamoureux', 'Jean Lefebvre, Pierre Mondy, Henri Guybet, Patricia Karim, Gérard Hérold, Gérard Jugnot, André Pousse, Jean Carmet', null, 'The third part of Seventh Company adventures.', 'The third part of Seventh Company adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNBJf3mEfKmoB2iKAlAY3ux9wMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56589'),
  ('223800673459787999', 'The Seventh Continent', 1989, 'Drama', 'Michael Haneke, Anton Peschke, Hanuš Polak jr.', 'Michael Haneke, Johanna Teicht', 'Birgit Doll, Dieter Berner, Leni Tanzer, Silvia Fenz, Robert Dietl, Georg Friedrich, Udo Samel, Elisabeth Rath', null, 'Chronicles three years of a middle-class family seemingly caught up in their daily routines, troubled only by minor incidents. Behind their apparent calm and repetitive existence, however, they''re planning something much more sinister.', 'Chronicles three years of a middle-class family seemingly caught up in their daily routines, troubled only by minor incidents. Behind their apparent calm and repetitive existence, however, they''re planning something much more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPwtcwwmOnW7Mqr1s170LHxa74A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32761'),
  ('387103308577329090', 'The Seventh Cross', 1944, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Karl Freund, Horace Hough, Fred Zinnemann', 'Helen Deutsch', 'Spencer Tracy, Signe Hasso, Hume Cronyn, Jessica Tandy, Agnes Moorehead, Herbert Rudley, Felix Bressart, Ray Collins', 'NR', 'In Nazi Germany in 1936 seven men escape from a concentration camp. The camp commander puts up seven crosses and, as the Gestapo returns each escapee he is put to death on a cross. The seventh cross is still empty as George Heisler attempts an escape to freedom in Holland.', 'In Nazi Germany in 1936 seven men escape from a concentration camp. The camp commander puts up seven crosses and, as the Gestapo returns each escapee he is put to death on a cross. The seventh cross is still empty as George Heisler attempts an escape to freedom in Holland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sznO6f1h4uG03VDs8OCI1llz9Ur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85574'),
  ('601689447435925351', 'The Seventh Curse', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Lam Nai-Choi, File Ip Kwok-Wing, Lam Wah-Chiu', 'Wong Jing, Yuen Kai-Chi', 'Chin Siu-Ho, Maggie Cheung, Dick Wei, Chui Sau-Lai, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Chow Yun-Fat, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Ni Kuang', null, 'When Dr. Yuen attempts to rescue a girl about to be sacrificed by the Worm Tribe in the middle of a jungle in Thailand, he is damned with seven deadly "blood curses" and must return there to find a permanent cure.', 'When Dr. Yuen attempts to rescue a girl about to be sacrificed by the Worm Tribe in the middle of a jungle in Thailand, he is damned with seven deadly "blood curses" and must return there to find a permanent cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRbK5H0nwALC2CyCPpKBHr4kgwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39900'),
  ('189935166814088072', 'The Seventh Day', 2021, 'Horror', 'Nick Remy Matthews, Anthony Melino, Jeff Weiss', 'Justin P. Lange', 'Guy Pearce, Vadhir Derbez, Stephen Lang, Brady Jenness, Robin Bartlett, Keith David, Chris Galust, Acoryé White', 'R', 'A renowned exorcist teams up with a rookie priest for his first day of training. As they plunge deeper into hell on earth, the lines between good and evil blur, and their own demons emerge.', 'A renowned exorcist teams up with a rookie priest for his first day of training. As they plunge deeper into hell on earth, the lines between good and evil blur, and their own demons emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtt2dfMdmlCcgaJZkPPQsIY5oR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645856'),
  ('237783879429779096', 'The Seventh Day, the Eighth Night', 1990, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Josef Krameš, Milena Kropáčková, Anna Lackovičová', 'Zdeněk Mahler, Evald Schorm', 'Jan Kačer, Bohumil Šmída, Jan Libíček, Květa Fialová, Josef Bek, Bohumil Švarc, Luba Skořepová, Josef Němeček', null, 'An allegory set in an archetypal Czech village, it tells the story of what happens when a series of mysterious events take place, including the disappearance of the station master. While everything has a rational explanation, collective paranoia takes over and everyone''s worst instincts are unleashed. Interrogations, disenfranchisement, and the search for scapegoats ultimately lead to murder. The movie was completed in 1969, but it was banned and not released till 1990, Evald Schorm who died in 1988 never saw it completed.', 'An allegory set in an archetypal Czech village, it tells the story of what happens when a series of mysterious events take place, including the disappearance of the station master. While everything has a rational explanation, collective paranoia takes over and everyone''s worst instincts are unleashed. Interrogations, disenfranchisement, and the search for scapegoats ultimately lead to murder. The movie was completed in 1969, but it was banned and not released till 1990, Evald Schorm who died in 1988 never saw it completed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/920T5tLd5XqhQzCigVNv7n49gde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257719'),
  ('721271876126710134', 'The Seventh Floor', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Fulvio Marcolin, Enzo Serafin', 'Giulio Scarnicci, Ugo Tognazzi, Renzo Tarabusi', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Franca Bettoia, Tina Louise, Olga Villi, Gigi Ballista, Riccardo Garrone, Alessandro Quasimodo, Alicia Brandet', null, 'In this unusual offbeat black comedy directed by Ugo Tognazzi, Giuseppe (Tognazzi) is a middle-aged industrialist obsessed with gadgets. When his nose starts to whistle uncontrollably, he checks into a clinic to resolve the problem. What begins as a minor affliction worsens, and Giuseppe is placed on a different floor as his ailments multiply. The sicker he gets, the higher he goes up in the floors of the clinic, until he is near death''s door.', 'In this unusual offbeat black comedy directed by Ugo Tognazzi, Giuseppe (Tognazzi) is a middle-aged industrialist obsessed with gadgets. When his nose starts to whistle uncontrollably, he checks into a clinic to resolve the problem. What begins as a minor affliction worsens, and Giuseppe is placed on a different floor as his ailments multiply. The sicker he gets, the higher he goes up in the floors of the clinic, until he is near death''s door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzWR2SGGJwJtTReUvBE5FPjnB4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268662'),
  ('256318318028697052', 'The Seventh Grave', 1965, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Garibaldi Serra Caracciolo, Aldo Greci', 'Alessandro Santini, Antonio Casale, Garibaldi Serra Caracciolo', 'Stefania Nelli, Nando Angelini, Armando Guarnieri, Bruna Baini, Antonio Casale, Germana Dominici, Ferruccio Viotti, Calogero Reale', null, 'Ghosts and dead bodies infest a small nineteenth-century village.', 'Ghosts and dead bodies infest a small nineteenth-century village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCVjKj4WyCXpjCurnHl0qowkfJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142030'),
  ('653566525245239491', 'The Seventh Horse of the Sun', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shyam Benegal', null, 'Rajit Kapoor, Rajeshwari Sachdev, Anang Desai, Amrish Puri, Pallavi Joshi, Raghubir Yadav, Himani Shivpuri, Siraj Ahmed', null, 'A man shares some lazy memories about his friend, Manek Mulla, who had a knack for telling stories. On this particular afternoon, Manek narrates a ''unique'' love affair with the help of different stories, various characters'' point of views and the social relevance of these stories. As these stories proceed, reality mixes with fiction.', 'A man shares some lazy memories about his friend, Manek Mulla, who had a knack for telling stories. On this particular afternoon, Manek narrates a ''unique'' love affair with the help of different stories, various characters'' point of views and the social relevance of these stories. As these stories proceed, reality mixes with fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37jJOzuthBxZuJjmnNh4gijovjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79731'),
  ('298561021361641370', 'The Seventh Juror', 1962, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Georges Lautner, Claude Vital, Bertrand Blier', 'Jacques Robert', 'Bernard Blier, Maurice Biraud, Francis Blanche, Danièle Delorme, Jacques Riberolles, Yves Barsacq, Henri Crémieux, Robert Dalban', null, 'In a moment of madness a middle-aged, married and respectable pharmacist kills a young woman who is sun-bathing by a lake. Unable to take in what he has done, he flees from the scene of the crime and behaves as if nothing has happened. Eventually her boyfriend is charged with the crime and, in a strange twist of fate, the killer finds himself serving on the jury.', 'In a moment of madness a middle-aged, married and respectable pharmacist kills a young woman who is sun-bathing by a lake. Unable to take in what he has done, he flees from the scene of the crime and behaves as if nothing has happened. Eventually her boyfriend is charged with the crime and, in a strange twist of fate, the killer finds himself serving on the jury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TCSQejFMvoo2tsVnxP3HBZWTGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21070'),
  ('293427251432871067', 'The Seventh Master of the House', 1966, 'Animation, Family', 'Ivo Caprino', null, 'Harald Heide Steen, Carsten Winger, Rolf Just Nilsen', null, 'Not until four years after The Fox''s Widow was the third fairytale movie, The Seventh Master of the House, released – Caprino''s personal favourite. This is a wonderful fairytale and a sharp satire on everyday bureaucracy. Caprino knew all about that – in fact, you might say that the movie was an indirect stab at the bureaucrats who had considered all his funding applications.', 'Not until four years after The Fox''s Widow was the third fairytale movie, The Seventh Master of the House, released – Caprino''s personal favourite. This is a wonderful fairytale and a sharp satire on everyday bureaucracy. Caprino knew all about that – in fact, you might say that the movie was an indirect stab at the bureaucrats who had considered all his funding applications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3audfAJFlhZx0joWeVrK5TeYYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62839'),
  ('895590278645221122', 'The Seventh Room', 1996, 'Drama, War', 'Márta Mészáros, Piotr Sobociński', 'Roberta Mazzoni, Éva Pataki, Márta Mészáros', 'Maia Morgenstern, Adriana Asti, Jan Nowicki, Elide Melli, Giovanni Capalbo, Czinkóczi Zsuzsa, Anna Polony, Jerzy Radziwiłowicz', null, 'An expressionist biography of Edith Stein, who converted from the Jewish faith to the Catholic one and became a Carmelite sister. She would die in a German concentration camp.', 'An expressionist biography of Edith Stein, who converted from the Jewish faith to the Catholic one and became a Carmelite sister. She would die in a German concentration camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/punu9BzLvvfCtzL0hJCITS9JWFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202140'),
  ('115969778312198815', 'The Seventh Sign', 1988, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Carl Schultz, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Ellen Green', 'Demi Moore, Michael Biehn, Jürgen Prochnow, Peter Friedman, Manny Jacobs, Lee Garlington, Akosua Busia, Arnold Johnson', 'R', 'Abby is a pregnant woman with a curious new boarder in the apartment over her garage. Turns out he''s heaven-sent and is speeding along the Apocalypse by bloodying rivers, egging on plagues and following scripture word for word.', 'Abby is a pregnant woman with a curious new boarder in the apartment over her garage. Turns out he''s heaven-sent and is speeding along the Apocalypse by bloodying rivers, egging on plagues and following scripture word for word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAgVzkPmfe2pcgzkpoz8cZ9i9wm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11082'),
  ('389841016700226901', 'The Seventh Target', 1984, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Claude Pinoteau, Edmond Séchan', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Lino Ventura, Lea Massari, Jean Poiret, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Roger Planchon, Élisabeth Bourgine, Béatrice Agenin, Robert Hoffmann', null, 'Bastien Grimaldy, a man driven to heightened anxiety as the plot against him begins to take effect. Bastien''s personal relationships give him enough cause for anxiety -- between his new lover Laura and a feisty mother, life provides its own insecurities. When he goes to the police with his problems, Bastien is assigned an off-beat inspector to protect him but is still faced with skepticism about his dilemma.', 'Bastien Grimaldy, a man driven to heightened anxiety as the plot against him begins to take effect. Bastien''s personal relationships give him enough cause for anxiety -- between his new lover Laura and a feisty mother, life provides its own insecurities. When he goes to the police with his problems, Bastien is assigned an off-beat inspector to protect him but is still faced with skepticism about his dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BAtrtSCQrXPA9K6Y7jIVQ5mmIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70929'),
  ('844915387261321158', 'The Seventh Veil', 1945, 'Music, Drama', 'Compton Bennett, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Muriel Box, Sydney Box', 'James Mason, Ann Todd, Herbert Lom, Hugh McDermott, Albert Lieven, Yvonne Owen, David Horne, Manning Whiley', 'NR', 'A concert pianist with amnesia fights to regain her memory.', 'A concert pianist with amnesia fights to regain her memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk64loLiFPfYKpqvUIiSMmX8iu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43495'),
