  ('358403902616334449', 'The Severed Arm', 1973, 'Horror', 'Thomas S. Alderman, Scott Fieldsteel, Kelly Estill', 'Tom Alderman, Darrel Presnell', 'Deborah Walley, David G. Cannon, Paul Carr, Marvin Kaplan, John Crawford, Vince Martorano, Ray Dannis', 'R', 'Trapped in a cave, five men cut the arm off of another companion in order to ward off starvation. After they are saved, their victim seeks revenge on them one by one.', 'Trapped in a cave, five men cut the arm off of another companion in order to ward off starvation. After they are saved, their victim seeks revenge on them one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Bp6f2wWQH8gjCSvMhsP4ydrKvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106402'),
