  ('137591545053674453', 'The Sex Life of the Polyp', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Chalmers', 'Robert Benchley', 'Robert Benchley', 'NR', 'Dr. Benchley is addressing the Ladies Club on the subject of the reproductive habits of the polyp, a small aquatic organism. Although he is not able to display his live specimens, he has prepared a series of pictures of his subjects. He explains that the subject is made more complicated by the fact that polyps are able to change their sex from time to time. Then he presents some of the pictures of his specimens and the experiments that he has done with them.', 'Dr. Benchley is addressing the Ladies Club on the subject of the reproductive habits of the polyp, a small aquatic organism. Although he is not able to display his live specimens, he has prepared a series of pictures of his subjects. He explains that the subject is made more complicated by the fact that polyps are able to change their sex from time to time. Then he presents some of the pictures of his specimens and the experiments that he has done with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NO6TlV5x4tTfXL91qx4pMnu2o5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148215'),
  ('624945257694461111', 'The Sex Machine', 1975, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Ottavio Jemma, Pasquale Festa Campanile', 'Gigi Proietti, Agostina Belli, Eleonora Giorgi, Christian De Sica, Mario Scaccia, Adriana Asti, Franco Agostini, Quinto Parmeggiani', null, 'The year is 2037 A.D. Depletion of natural fuels has eliminated electrical power throughout the world. No light… no heat… no T.V., until a team of award-winning scientists succeeds in harnessing energy from the world’s oldest source of reciprocating motion.', 'The year is 2037 A.D. Depletion of natural fuels has eliminated electrical power throughout the world. No light… no heat… no T.V., until a team of award-winning scientists succeeds in harnessing energy from the world’s oldest source of reciprocating motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/673v1jEL28KklPk7scGgo5T2blM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340637'),
  ('659016190822346176', 'The Sex Monster', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Mike Binder', 'Mike Binder', 'Mariel Hemingway, Mike Binder, Renée Humphrey, Taylor Nichols, Missy Crider, Christopher Lawford, Joanna Heimbold, Kevin Pollak', 'R', 'A neurotic L.A. building contractor pushes his reluctant wife into having a threesome. Unfortunately for him, his wife gets more out of it than he does and begins seducing every female she meets, including the contractor''s secretary.', 'A neurotic L.A. building contractor pushes his reluctant wife into having a threesome. Unfortunately for him, his wife gets more out of it than he does and begins seducing every female she meets, including the contractor''s secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3otrY7hETbYjId7gzJnuGEyzSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14383'),
