  ('152612279780809206', 'The Shack', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Stuart Hazeldine, Declan Quinn, Myron Hoffert', 'John Fusco, Destin Daniel Cretton, Andrew Lanham', 'Sam Worthington, Octavia Spencer, Tim McGraw, Aviv Alush, Sumire, Radha Mitchell, Graham Greene, Gage Munroe', 'PG-13', 'A grieving man receives a mysterious, personal invitation to meet with God at a place called ''The Shack''.', 'A grieving man receives a mysterious, personal invitation to meet with God at a place called ''The Shack''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doAzav9kfdtsoSdw1MDFvjKq3J4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345938'),
  ('508230376191149682', 'The Shadow', 1994, 'Fantasy, Action, Crime', 'Russell Mulcahy, Stephen H. Burum, Dick Ziker', 'David Koepp', 'Alec Baldwin, John Lone, Penelope Ann Miller, Peter Boyle, Ian McKellen, Tim Curry, Jonathan Winters, Sab Shimono', 'PG-13', 'Based on the 1930s comic strip, The Shadow is put up against his archenemy Shiwan Khan, who plans to take over the world by holding a city to ransom using an atom bomb. Using his powers of invisibility and "the power to cloud men''s minds", The Shadow comes blazing to the rescue with explosive results.', 'Based on the 1930s comic strip, The Shadow is put up against his archenemy Shiwan Khan, who plans to take over the world by holding a city to ransom using an atom bomb. Using his powers of invisibility and "the power to cloud men''s minds", The Shadow comes blazing to the rescue with explosive results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAbFJH3vQYZvUyzzGAtG4OLy492.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8850'),
  ('913076693221731777', 'The Shadow', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Mihkel Soe, Jaak Kilmi, Kadri Kask', 'Indrek Hargla', 'Pääru Oja, Rain Simmul, Karol Kuntsel, Kersti Heinloo, Peeter Tammearu, Riho Kütsar, Ago Anderson, Andres Mähar', null, 'Juhan Liiv, a struggling poet and an unlikely detective, solves gruesome murder cases in Estonia, the Wild West of the crumbling Russian Empire in the 1890s. Investigations take him to miserable dwellings of the local Estonian peasants, luxurious castles of German nobility that have sworn allegiance to the Czar, and to the depths of ancient forests where witchcraft is still practiced. Juhan is fighting crime and his own inner demons. He is considered mad and pronounced crazy. But by standing for justice and truth, at the end of the day, he is the sanest of them all.', 'Juhan Liiv, a struggling poet and an unlikely detective, solves gruesome murder cases in Estonia, the Wild West of the crumbling Russian Empire in the 1890s. Investigations take him to miserable dwellings of the local Estonian peasants, luxurious castles of German nobility that have sworn allegiance to the Czar, and to the depths of ancient forests where witchcraft is still practiced. Juhan is fighting crime and his own inner demons. He is considered mad and pronounced crazy. But by standing for justice and truth, at the end of the day, he is the sanest of them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MAPtbKtRdndw2HhnoR7fxBhSFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1194388'),
  ('707880337064369123', 'The Shadow Effect', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Amariah Olson, Obin Olson, Star Victoria', 'Evan Law, Chad Law, George Abbott Clark', 'Cam Gigandet, Brit Shaw, Michael Biehn, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Michael Aaron Milligan, Jon Kohler, Andi Matheny, Cullen Moss', null, 'A young man''s life is turned upside down when his violent dreams begin to blend with reality.', 'A young man''s life is turned upside down when his violent dreams begin to blend with reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/in6p8c9ceTs1wDDkaVwXBXIsjQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383538'),
  ('234149159208290781', 'The Shadow in the North', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'John Alexander, Adam Suschitzky, Nige Watson', 'Adrian Hodges', 'Billie Piper, JJ Feild, Julian Rhind-Tutt, John Standing, Lyndsey Marshal, Doña Croll, Matt Smith, Jared Harris', null, 'Sally Lockhart crosses paths with the nefarious industrialist Axel Bellman, the richest and most powerful man in Europe. She''s determined to prove him guilty of corruption and fraud, whilst Bellman will stop at nothing to destroy her case.', 'Sally Lockhart crosses paths with the nefarious industrialist Axel Bellman, the richest and most powerful man in Europe. She''s determined to prove him guilty of corruption and fraud, whilst Bellman will stop at nothing to destroy her case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptDvV42gIkdKbYLtPrhOpUks9os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46513'),
  ('378602969540849295', 'The Shadow Men', 1997, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Timothy Bond', 'Eric Miller, Justin Stanley', 'Eric Roberts, Sherilyn Fenn, Dean Stockwell, Brendon Ryan Barrett, Andrew Prine, Chris McCarty, Tom Poster, Benjamin Brown', 'R', 'Happily married couple Bob and Dez Wilson and their 12-year old son Andy are being attacked by a blinding light when driving home from a daytrip. They awaken a couple of hours later, seemingly unscathed but soon driven mad by recurring nightmares. It soon appears that they have been abducted by aliens as proved by their sons handycam that had suddenly started running right after the incident. This mysterious fact is discovered by even more mysterious Men In Black who start nagging the family up to the point of threatening to kill them. Laughed at by the police the threesome seek refuge at sf-writer Stan Mills'' house and start fighting back.', 'Happily married couple Bob and Dez Wilson and their 12-year old son Andy are being attacked by a blinding light when driving home from a daytrip. They awaken a couple of hours later, seemingly unscathed but soon driven mad by recurring nightmares. It soon appears that they have been abducted by aliens as proved by their sons handycam that had suddenly started running right after the incident. This mysterious fact is discovered by even more mysterious Men In Black who start nagging the family up to the point of threatening to kill them. Laughed at by the police the threesome seek refuge at sf-writer Stan Mills'' house and start fighting back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBaR548OuaCAtglXZWbHu31dVIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60009'),
  ('185405542386192613', 'The Shadow of Chikara', 1977, 'Horror, Western', 'Earl E. Smith', 'Earl E. Smith', 'Joe Don Baker, Sondra Locke, Ted Neeley, Joy N. Houck Jr., Dennis Fimple, John Davis Chandler, Grady Wyatt, Linda Dano', 'PG', 'Two former Confederate captains try to remove diamonds hidden in the Arkansas mountains, but a native spirit guards the sacred site against intruders.', 'Two former Confederate captains try to remove diamonds hidden in the Arkansas mountains, but a native spirit guards the sacred site against intruders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4Rh2WFvlGWg36sVcfqPsEYhm9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65272'),
