  ('493174759900294908', 'The Shadow of the Day', 2022, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Marcella Libonati, Giuseppe Piccioni, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Gualtiero Rosella, Annick Emdin', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Benedetta Porcaroli, Waël Sersoub, Lino Musella, Vincenzo Nemolato, Valeria Bilello, Sandra Ceccarelli, Antonio Salines', null, 'In 1938 Italy, after Jews are banned from public life, fascist-abiding restaurateur Luciano nonetheless believes he can still live by his own rules. Everything changes when Anna, a girl with a dangerous secret, begins working at his business.', 'In 1938 Italy, after Jews are banned from public life, fascist-abiding restaurateur Luciano nonetheless believes he can still live by his own rules. Everything changes when Anna, a girl with a dangerous secret, begins working at his business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a18JFP7aZoV72PlYTOxg5zWH7q1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834141'),
  ('639345644199673539', 'The Shadow of the Eagle', 1932, 'Action', 'Ford Beebe, B. Reeves Eason', 'Wyndham Gittens, Ford Beebe, Colbert Clark', 'John Wayne, Dorothy Gulliver, Walter Miller, Kenneth Harlan, Richard Tucker, Pat O''Malley, Edmund Burns, Yakima Canutt', null, 'The Eagle uses sky writing to make threats against a corporation. Nathan Gregory owns a travelling fairground and is thought to be the Eagle. Craig McCoy is a pilot who goes looking for the Eagle when Gregory turns up missing.', 'The Eagle uses sky writing to make threats against a corporation. Nathan Gregory owns a travelling fairground and is thought to be the Eagle. Craig McCoy is a pilot who goes looking for the Eagle when Gregory turns up missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ELZLwb6ANmB37HJ5r6aWzCp6Gt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40725'),
  ('97514274903765903', 'The Shadow of the Tyrant', 1960, 'History, Drama, Thriller', 'Julio Bracho, Agustín Jiménez, Julio Cahero', 'Julio Bracho, Jesús Cárdenas', 'Tito Junco, Roberto Cañedo, Tito Novaro, Tomás Perrín, Bárbara Gil, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Ignacio López Tarso, Carlos López Moctezuma', null, 'In 1920s Mexico, the candidates being chosen to succeed the current president, El Caudillo, find themselves at his mercy as he will resort to anything to accomplish his will, including kidnapping, betrayal, and murder.', 'In 1920s Mexico, the candidates being chosen to succeed the current president, El Caudillo, find themselves at his mercy as he will resort to anything to accomplish his will, including kidnapping, betrayal, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCyLBzJiulE1ie0SokbDdtrJLHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120298'),
  ('895646380743969912', 'The Shadow on the Window', 1957, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Asher, Frank G. Carson, Irving J. Moore', 'Leo Townsend, David P. Harmon', 'Philip Carey, Betty Garrett, John Drew Barrymore, Corey Allen, Gerald Sarracini, Jerry Mathers, Sam Gilman, Rusty Lane', 'NR', 'Three delinquents murder a prosperous farmer at an isolated farm house. One witness to the crime - the dead man''s secretary - is then taken hostage. The other witness - her young son - is thrown into state of shock. Can he recover soon enough to help the police - and his father - rescue his mother before it''s too late?', 'Three delinquents murder a prosperous farmer at an isolated farm house. One witness to the crime - the dead man''s secretary - is then taken hostage. The other witness - her young son - is thrown into state of shock. Can he recover soon enough to help the police - and his father - rescue his mother before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8O6IxxTxYK8bomCrheF8UFA3VIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44931'),
  ('289974511728108105', 'The Shadow Play', 1992, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Şener Şen, Şevket Altuğ, Larissa Litichevskaya, Metin Çekmez, Füreya Koral, Nazan Kesal, Ülkü Duru, Nergis Çorakçı', null, 'Mahmut and Abidin work as comedians at a night club, Mahmut is honest yet Abidin is sly. A deaf and mute girl named Kumru is brought to work in the night club.', 'Mahmut and Abidin work as comedians at a night club, Mahmut is honest yet Abidin is sly. A deaf and mute girl named Kumru is brought to work in the night club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DspOQzgOzaSKjK5SxQ2GpWPauY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14840'),
  ('27427574765465190', 'The Shadow Play', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lou Ye, Shadow Hung', 'Ma Yingli, Mei Feng', 'Jing Boran, Ma Sichun, Song Jia, Qin Hao, Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Zhang Songwen, Edison Chen, Wang Weishen', null, 'Tang Yijie, the Construction Committee Director, falls off from rooftop and dies in a demolition riot. Yang Jiadong, a young police officer starts his investigation and finds that Tang''s death is tied up with another case several years ago. Soon he is framed and suspended from duty, but he never gives up.', 'Tang Yijie, the Construction Committee Director, falls off from rooftop and dies in a demolition riot. Yang Jiadong, a young police officer starts his investigation and finds that Tang''s death is tied up with another case several years ago. Soon he is framed and suspended from duty, but he never gives up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfm4S5DZCh2FwXXdsI4GdjpgXQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454161'),
  ('79631957243129577', 'The Shadow Returns', 1946, 'Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Phil Rosen, William Beaudine', 'George Callahan', 'Kane Richmond, Barbara Read, Tom Dugan, Joseph Crehan, Pierre Watkin, Robert Emmett Keane, Frank Reicher, Rebel Randall', null, 'The Shadow (Kane Richmond) cracks a case of missing jewels, murder and plastics.', 'The Shadow (Kane Richmond) cracks a case of missing jewels, murder and plastics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPH9tIzOnPJmzC3KXUrx9uIap4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162015'),
  ('560057105433429171', 'The Shadow Riders', 1982, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Jack Whitman, Andrew V. McLaglen', 'Jim Byrnes', 'Tom Selleck, Sam Elliott, Ben Johnson, Geoffrey Lewis, Jeff Osterhage, Gene Evans, Katharine Ross, Dominique Dunne', 'PG', 'After starring in "The Sacketts", Tom Selleck and Sam Elliott team up again but this time as Mac and Dal Traven, in a movie based on a classic Louis L''Amour novel. They are brothers, who meet up at the end of the Civil War fighting on opposite sides. They go home only to find their family in dire need and their sisters and brother kidnapped by ruthless raiders. They set out to rescue their family.', 'After starring in "The Sacketts", Tom Selleck and Sam Elliott team up again but this time as Mac and Dal Traven, in a movie based on a classic Louis L''Amour novel. They are brothers, who meet up at the end of the Civil War fighting on opposite sides. They go home only to find their family in dire need and their sisters and brother kidnapped by ruthless raiders. They set out to rescue their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbILlAZ0YaIs1J1huAFUZwuuFZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22765'),
  ('143520003169949045', 'The Shadow Strikes', 1937, 'Mystery', 'Lynn Shores, Marcel Le Picard, Henry Spitz', 'Al Martin', 'Rod La Rocque, Agnes Anderson, James Blakeley, Walter McGrail, William Kellogg, Cy Kendall, Kenneth Harlan, Norman Ainsley', null, 'Lamont Cranston assumes his secret identity as "The Shadow", to break up an attempted robbery at an attorney''s office. When the police search the scene, Cranston must assume the identity of the attorney. Before he can leave, a phone call summons the attorney to the home of Delthern, a wealthy client, who wants a new will drawn up. As Cranston meets with him, Delthern is suddenly shot, and Cranston is quickly caught up in a new mystery.', 'Lamont Cranston assumes his secret identity as "The Shadow", to break up an attempted robbery at an attorney''s office. When the police search the scene, Cranston must assume the identity of the attorney. Before he can leave, a phone call summons the attorney to the home of Delthern, a wealthy client, who wants a new will drawn up. As Cranston meets with him, Delthern is suddenly shot, and Cranston is quickly caught up in a new mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1xKuLYOsPq2qJPjMAH92qZVPbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105073'),
  ('950272472412787688', 'The Shadow Whip', 1971, 'Action, Drama', 'Lo Wei, Wu Cho-Hua', 'Lo Wei, Ni Kuang', 'Cheng Pei-Pei, Elliot Ngok Wah, Tien Feng, Ku Feng, Li Kun, Wang Hsieh, Lee Sau-Kei, Lo Wei', null, 'This top ten box office hit reunites the star duo from Come Drink With Me in another classic action adventure. Cheng Pei-pei radiates her trademark charm while wielding the deadly title weapon, which is implicated in multiple murders and a major heist. Whether single-handedly fighting sixteen bandits or avenging her father''s brutal death, she demonstrates why she was Hong Kong''s number one swordswoman and no slouch with the whip either!', 'This top ten box office hit reunites the star duo from Come Drink With Me in another classic action adventure. Cheng Pei-pei radiates her trademark charm while wielding the deadly title weapon, which is implicated in multiple murders and a major heist. Whether single-handedly fighting sixteen bandits or avenging her father''s brutal death, she demonstrates why she was Hong Kong''s number one swordswoman and no slouch with the whip either!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFXWqChn1GWEkSx5lsTwmFljYxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64885'),
  ('839984648239352227', 'The Shadow Within', 1970, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yoshitarō Nomura, Takashi Kawamata', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Shima Iwashita, Gō Katō, Mayumi Ogawa, Yūsuke Takita, Kaneko Iwasaki, Shinsuke Ashida, Yoshio Inaba, Yōsuke Kondō', null, 'When a married man begins an affair with a woman from his past, he comes to suspect her young son intends to murder him.', 'When a married man begins an affair with a woman from his past, he comes to suspect her young son intends to murder him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTWkwfmXY4zQWpcecfAPBLKQGY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175086'),
