  ('371412707156171417', 'The Shadowless', 2009, 'Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Ümit Ünal', null, 'Selçuk Yöntem, Hakan Karahan, Taner Birsel, Ertan Saban, Arsen Gürzap, Altan Erkekli, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Ahmet Özarslan', null, 'A barber working in Istanbul longs to be ‘both here and far, far away’. One day, he takes the day off and disappears abruptly without warning anyone. He then settles in a far-flung village. Some mysterious events start happening in the village as people disappear one by one.', 'A barber working in Istanbul longs to be ‘both here and far, far away’. One day, he takes the day off and disappears abruptly without warning anyone. He then settles in a far-flung village. Some mysterious events start happening in the village as people disappear one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpTOxX1tbnRJNNeQ1MYqIbtGkq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52180'),
  ('950158276304550015', 'The Shadowless Tower', 2023, 'Drama', 'Zhang Lu, Piao Songri, 廖炎龙', 'Zhang Lu', 'Xin Baiqing, Huang Yao, Tian Zhuangzhuang, Li Qinqin, Nan Ji, Wang Hongwei, Wang Yiwen, Liu Wanting', null, 'Gu Wentong learns the whereabouts of his father, who lost contact with him more than 40 years ago. Encouraged by new friend, photographer Ouyang Wenhui, Gu Wentong decides to face his father and rebuild the long-lost father-son relationship.', 'Gu Wentong learns the whereabouts of his father, who lost contact with him more than 40 years ago. Encouraged by new friend, photographer Ouyang Wenhui, Gu Wentong decides to face his father and rebuild the long-lost father-son relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5KK3jQzb9iMyZFozFp22PKdfqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075840'),
  ('682657192771942039', 'The Shady Sailor', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Letourneur, Ludivine Renard', 'Sophie Letourneur', 'Sophie Letourneur, Laetitia Goffi, Johan Libéreau', null, 'Laetitia and Sophie go to Quimper, town where Laetitia used to live, to pass the weekend. Sophie is having problems with her husband, while Laetitia tells her about one of her youth''s boyfriends, the "masked sailor" she used to love while she lived in Quimper.', 'Laetitia and Sophie go to Quimper, town where Laetitia used to live, to pass the weekend. Sophie is having problems with her husband, while Laetitia tells her about one of her youth''s boyfriends, the "masked sailor" she used to love while she lived in Quimper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9USs69FGA3Fqzjyt6S0EUSvG5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160373'),
  ('575720622294965888', 'The Shaggy D.A.', 1976, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Robert Stevenson, Christopher N. Seiter, Frank V. Phillips', 'Don Tait', 'Dean Jones, Suzanne Pleshette, Tim Conway, Keenan Wynn, Jo Anne Worley, Dick Van Patten, Shane Sinutko, Vic Tayback', 'G', 'Wilby Daniels, a successful lawyer running for District Attorney, suddenly finds himself being transformed into an English sheepdog. Somehow he has to keep his change a secret and find just what is causing it, all the while eluding the local dog catcher.', 'Wilby Daniels, a successful lawyer running for District Attorney, suddenly finds himself being transformed into an English sheepdog. Somehow he has to keep his change a secret and find just what is causing it, all the while eluding the local dog catcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RdTXlf06wFCQ0gAkeOljtw1dFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15943'),
  ('345778180645164679', 'The Shaggy Dog', 1959, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Charles Barton, Edward Colman, Arthur J. Vitarelli', 'Lillie Hayward, Bill Walsh', 'Fred MacMurray, Jean Hagen, Tommy Kirk, Annette Funicello, Tim Considine, Kevin Corcoran, Cecil Kellaway, Alexander Scourby', 'G', 'Through an ancient spell, a boy changes into a sheepdog and back again. It seems to happen at inopportune times and the spell can only be broken by an act of bravery....', 'Through an ancient spell, a boy changes into a sheepdog and back again. It seems to happen at inopportune times and the spell can only be broken by an act of bravery....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0fTvnnRIZNyTne2BrcS8I5X20e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15944'),
  ('1008735222774400140', 'The Shaggy Dog', 1994, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Dennis Dugan', null, 'Ed Begley Jr., Sharon Lawrence, Jon Polito, James Cromwell, Jeremy Sisto, Jordan Warkol, Sarah Lassez, Natasha Gregson Wagner', null, 'Preteen Moochie Daniels just wants a dog, but his dad, Daniel, is allergic to canines, like Bundles, the shabby sheep dog of neighbor Charlie Mulvihill who secretly trained his pet to help him steal jewels. Mooch''s big brother Wilbert ''Wilby'' is smart, shy and a promising inventor, but hopelessly clumsy when it comes to girls, and is jealous of his slick mate Trey who has no problems. Desperate Wilby resorts to a spell from the ring of Lucrezia Borgia (he accidentally got from dad''s museum of curiosities), which magically turns him into Bundles and back at uncontrollable times. This is how he also knows that the diamond on loan in his father''s museum is Charlie''s next target.', 'Preteen Moochie Daniels just wants a dog, but his dad, Daniel, is allergic to canines, like Bundles, the shabby sheep dog of neighbor Charlie Mulvihill who secretly trained his pet to help him steal jewels. Mooch''s big brother Wilbert ''Wilby'' is smart, shy and a promising inventor, but hopelessly clumsy when it comes to girls, and is jealous of his slick mate Trey who has no problems. Desperate Wilby resorts to a spell from the ring of Lucrezia Borgia (he accidentally got from dad''s museum of curiosities), which magically turns him into Bundles and back at uncontrollable times. This is how he also knows that the diamond on loan in his father''s museum is Charlie''s next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rehY2aWyiCeYQ3S4h2rXqg3hRxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207451'),
  ('38985392048866678', 'The Shaggy Dog', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Brian Robbins, Gabriel Beristain', 'Don Tait, Bill Walsh, Lillie Hayward', 'Tim Allen, Kristin Davis, Zena Grey, Spencer Breslin, Danny Glover, Robert Downey Jr., Joshua Leonard, Shawn Pyfrom', 'PG', 'The tale of a workaholic dad-turned-dog who finds that being man''s best friend shows him the most important job - being a great dad.', 'The tale of a workaholic dad-turned-dog who finds that being man''s best friend shows him the most important job - being a great dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGX3YyPaYMbjiRwR5PjRsJW7GtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10067'),
  ('745248779261092335', 'The Shakedown', 1929, 'Drama', 'William Wyler', 'Albert DeMond, Charles Logue', 'James Murray, Barbara Kent, George Kotsonaros, Wheeler Oakman, Jack Hanlon, Harry Gribbon', null, 'The life of a less-than successful professional boxer changes when he takes in an orphan.', 'The life of a less-than successful professional boxer changes when he takes in an orphan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkUdCtPp4Is91DYElSySf5gG0sO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190107'),
  ('707937585846915550', 'The Shakiest Gun in the West', 1968, 'Comedy, Family, Western', 'Alan Rafkin, Andrew Jackson', 'Everett Greenbaum, Frank Tashlin, Edmund L. Hartmann', 'Don Knotts, Barbara Rhoades, Jackie Coogan, Ruth McDevitt, Frank McGrath, Terry Wilson, Carl Ballantine, Pat Morita', null, 'Jesse W. Haywood (Don Knotts) graduates from dental school in Philadelphia in 1870 and goes west to become a frontier dentist. Penelope "Bad Penny" Cushing (Barbara Rhoades) is offered a pardon if she will track down a ring of gun smugglers. She tricks Haywood into a sham marriage as a disguise. Haywood inadvertently becomes the legendary "Doc the Haywood" after he guns down "Arnold the Kid".', 'Jesse W. Haywood (Don Knotts) graduates from dental school in Philadelphia in 1870 and goes west to become a frontier dentist. Penelope "Bad Penny" Cushing (Barbara Rhoades) is offered a pardon if she will track down a ring of gun smugglers. She tricks Haywood into a sham marriage as a disguise. Haywood inadvertently becomes the legendary "Doc the Haywood" after he guns down "Arnold the Kid".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWOyypjHxqpRXj50zcbbxCGeavg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20238'),
  ('672846498358477254', 'The Shallows', 2016, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Jaume Collet-Serra, Flavio Martínez Labiano, Fiona Donovan', 'Anthony Jaswinski', 'Blake Lively, Óscar Jaenada, Brett Cullen, Janelle Bailey, Sedona Legge, Pablo Calva, Diego Espejel, Ava Dean', 'PG-13', 'While surfing on a secluded beach, Nancy finds herself in the feeding grounds of a great white shark. Though stranded only 200 yards from shore, survival proves to be the ultimate test of wills, requiring all of her ingenuity, resourcefulness, and fortitude.', 'While surfing on a secluded beach, Nancy finds herself in the feeding grounds of a great white shark. Though stranded only 200 yards from shore, survival proves to be the ultimate test of wills, requiring all of her ingenuity, resourcefulness, and fortitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnBV7hZmLuA0Si5Aop481sPF2RY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332567'),
  ('76081042755065350', 'The Shallows', 2025, 'Adventure, Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Xia Banchang, Xue Fei-Wei', 'Xia Banchang, Anthony Jaswinski', 'Chen Xiaoyun, Wang Sen, Ding Wenbo, William Yang, Peng Biyao, Li Sinan', null, 'A scientist passionate about extreme sports, Li Qiang, faces off against a ruthless predator at the top of the ocean''s food chain in a life-and-death game. Beneath the ominous clouds, danger lurks just beneath the surface.', 'A scientist passionate about extreme sports, Li Qiang, faces off against a ruthless predator at the top of the ocean''s food chain in a life-and-death game. Beneath the ominous clouds, danger lurks just beneath the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTEvvi93axTduN31rpAeuCWXm4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1417260'),
