  ('896986573110626725', 'The Shameless', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Oh Seung-uk, Lee Yang-jun, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Oh Seung-uk', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Kim Nam-gil, Park Sung-woong, Kwak Do-won, Kim Min-jae, Park Ji-hwan, Choi Young-do, Ha Ji-eun', null, 'A homicide detective tries to flush out a mob enforcer by befriending the suspect''s beautiful girlfriend, but soon develops romantic feelings for her.', 'A homicide detective tries to flush out a mob enforcer by befriending the suspect''s beautiful girlfriend, but soon develops romantic feelings for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jhKRDWdaVQXeJYQs9GaLbld7ex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336053'),
  ('718634176419477419', 'The Shameless Old Lady', 1965, 'Comedy', 'René Allio', 'René Allio', 'Sylvie, Victor Lanoux, Malka Ribowska, François Maistre, Étienne Bierry, Pascale de Boysson, Jean-Louis Lamande, Lena Delanne', null, 'Madame Bertini, a newly widowed 70-year-old miser, has lived a sheltered life in squalour. She determines to venture into the modern world and have as much fun as possible, and in doing so finds that she loves it. She blows her life savings, much to the disapproval of the young people around her.', 'Madame Bertini, a newly widowed 70-year-old miser, has lived a sheltered life in squalour. She determines to venture into the modern world and have as much fun as possible, and in doing so finds that she loves it. She blows her life savings, much to the disapproval of the young people around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9G4VE2I7nNv4xdQhFzbGsZQNjJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160847'),
  ('1019368842674300959', 'The Shamer''s Daughter', 2015, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Kenneth Kainz, Lasse Frank Johannessen', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Rebecca Emilie Sattrup, Peter Plaugborg, Jakob Oftebro, Maria Bonnevie, Søren Malling, Stina Ekblad, Petra Scott Nielsen, Olaf Johannessen', null, 'The Shamer''s daughter, Dina, has unwillingly inherited her mother''s supernatural ability. She can look straight into the soul of other people. When the sole heir to the throne is wrongfully accused of the horrible murders of his family, it is up to Dina to uncover the truth, but soon she finds herself whirled into a dangerous power struggle with her own life at risk.', 'The Shamer''s daughter, Dina, has unwillingly inherited her mother''s supernatural ability. She can look straight into the soul of other people. When the sole heir to the throne is wrongfully accused of the horrible murders of his family, it is up to Dina to uncover the truth, but soon she finds herself whirled into a dangerous power struggle with her own life at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFRbysvW0m1IcGFWT5FGVzRX3tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305638'),
  ('457958989363248495', 'The Shamer''s Daughter 2: The Serpent Gift', 2019, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ask Hasselbalch', 'Gunnar Järvstad, Astrid Øye, Philip LaZebnik', 'Rebecca Emilie Sattrup, Jakob Oftebro, Dejan Čukić, Nicolas Bro, Petra Scott Nielsen, Allan Hyde, Agnes Kittelsen, Søren Malling', null, 'The Shamer''s Daughter, Dina, with the magical power of compelling people to admit their most secret shame, must save her family with her newly found father. But he is a Blackmaster, with the power to make people see and believe things that aren''t true, so Dina must deal with having inherited this horrible power, while forging a relationship with a father she fears and mistrusts.', 'The Shamer''s Daughter, Dina, with the magical power of compelling people to admit their most secret shame, must save her family with her newly found father. But he is a Blackmaster, with the power to make people see and believe things that aren''t true, so Dina must deal with having inherited this horrible power, while forging a relationship with a father she fears and mistrusts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/172jeGRLZhhsaBXBU1huyb9u2Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547066'),
  ('448972584993293719', 'The Shanghai Cobra', 1945, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Phil Karlson, Vincent J. Farrar', 'George Callahan, George Wallace Sayre', 'Sidney Toler, Benson Fong, Mantan Moreland, James Cardwell, Joan Barclay, Walter Fenner, Roy Gordon, Arthur Loft', 'NR', 'Someone is attempting to steal radium stored in a bank. Death by cobra venom connects a number of murders. Charlie Chan investigates.', 'Someone is attempting to steal radium stored in a bank. Death by cobra venom connects a number of murders. Charlie Chan investigates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCBMMKluSdIzG5pzCjYRRpNU2MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38465'),
  ('1007916467779504500', 'The Shanghai Gesture', 1941, 'Drama', 'Paul Ivano, Josef von Sternberg, John London', 'Josef von Sternberg, Geza Herczeg, Karl Vollmöller', 'Victor Mature, Ona Munson, Gene Tierney, Walter Huston, Phyllis Brooks, Albert Bassermann, Maria Ouspenskaya, Eric Blore', 'NR', 'A gambling queen uses blackmail to stop a British financier from closing her Chinese clip joint.', 'A gambling queen uses blackmail to stop a British financier from closing her Chinese clip joint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHDmFi7Q9M6mpMxRm7VpiXwmTYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42678'),
  ('873890285820734919', 'The Shanghai Spell', 2002, 'Drama', 'Fernando Trueba, José Luis López-Linares', 'Fernando Trueba', 'Fernando Tielve, Aida Folch, Ariadna Gil, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Eduard Fernández, Antonio Resines, Rosa María Sardà, Jorge Sanz', null, 'A fourteen year old lad discovers his first love at the point of his pencil whilst drawing the portrait of a sickly but coquettish fifteen year old girl. In the neighbourhood an old freedom-fighter pits himself against bad types, a pretty cinema-ticket girl takes to the streets at night and a young anarchist dedicates himself to telling tall stories. Far away, in Shanghai, a hero of the Republic meets a beautiful femme fatal with oriental eyes. Reality and fiction become fused in an embrace.', 'A fourteen year old lad discovers his first love at the point of his pencil whilst drawing the portrait of a sickly but coquettish fifteen year old girl. In the neighbourhood an old freedom-fighter pits himself against bad types, a pretty cinema-ticket girl takes to the streets at night and a young anarchist dedicates himself to telling tall stories. Far away, in Shanghai, a hero of the Republic meets a beautiful femme fatal with oriental eyes. Reality and fiction become fused in an embrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRjG6zCkjvbIsL1Yh9I7x0RYoux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97318'),
  ('639189693804232810', 'The Shanty Where Santy Claus Lives', 1933, 'Music, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Rudolf Ising, Hugh Harman', null, 'Rudolf Ising, Johnny Murray', 'G', 'Christmas Eve. A poor orphan boy trudges through the snow, pathetically. He finally arrives at his miserable cabin. While he is crying, Santa arrives and, singing the title song, offers to take the boy to his workshop. They arrive, and the toys go wild. He plays with a few toys. A candle falls off the tree and starts a fire. The toys try in vain to fight the fire; the boy hooks up a hose to a set of bagpipes and takes care of it.', 'Christmas Eve. A poor orphan boy trudges through the snow, pathetically. He finally arrives at his miserable cabin. While he is crying, Santa arrives and, singing the title song, offers to take the boy to his workshop. They arrive, and the toys go wild. He plays with a few toys. A candle falls off the tree and starts a fire. The toys try in vain to fight the fire; the boy hooks up a hose to a set of bagpipes and takes care of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZEL8lyGL0EpXo3vvjSeZJ092WZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81340'),
  ('757120735488075374', 'The Shaolin Avengers', 1976, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Wu Ma, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Alexander Fu Sheng, Chi Kuan-Chun, Bruce Tong Yim-Chaan, Lung Fei, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Shan Mao, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming', null, 'Heroism and romance combine in an action-packed martial arts story. When the Shaolin are betrayed by White-Browed Hermit, hotheaded warrior-hero Fong Sai Yuk vows revenge.', 'Heroism and romance combine in an action-packed martial arts story. When the Shaolin are betrayed by White-Browed Hermit, hotheaded warrior-hero Fong Sai Yuk vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXl2BPZHsmhuUgl8hUic430UsNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109088'),
  ('153632571269603479', 'The Shape of Things', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Neil LaBute, James L. Carter', 'Neil LaBute', 'Paul Rudd, Gretchen Mol, Rachel Weisz, Frederick Weller', 'R', 'Quiet, unassuming Adam is changing in a major way, thanks to his new girlfriend, art student Evelyn. Adam''s friends are a little freaked by the transformation.', 'Quiet, unassuming Adam is changing in a major way, thanks to his new girlfriend, art student Evelyn. Adam''s friends are a little freaked by the transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iETHZRRlr9WCgx3W8hoOp7gvOn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22958'),
  ('973785878316689909', 'The Shape of Things to Come', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'George McCowan, Reginald H. Morris, Fred Geringer', 'Martin Lager', 'Jack Palance, Carol Lynley, Barry Morse, John Ireland, Nicholas Campbell, Anne-Marie Martin, Greg Swanson, Mark Parr', 'PG', 'Planet Earth is a devastated wasteland, and what''s left of humanity has colonized the Moon in domed cities. Humanity''s continued survival depends on an anti-radiation drug only available on planet Delta Three, which has been taken over by Omus, a brilliant but mad mechanic who places no value on human life. Omus wants to come to the Moon to rule and intends to attack it by ramming robot-controlled spaceships into the domes. Dr. John Caball, his son Jason, Jason''s friend, Kim, and a robot named Sparks embark on Caball''s space battlecruiser on an unauthorized mission to Delta Three to stop Omus.', 'Planet Earth is a devastated wasteland, and what''s left of humanity has colonized the Moon in domed cities. Humanity''s continued survival depends on an anti-radiation drug only available on planet Delta Three, which has been taken over by Omus, a brilliant but mad mechanic who places no value on human life. Omus wants to come to the Moon to rule and intends to attack it by ramming robot-controlled spaceships into the domes. Dr. John Caball, his son Jason, Jason''s friend, Kim, and a robot named Sparks embark on Caball''s space battlecruiser on an unauthorized mission to Delta Three to stop Omus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXKgpRHS65NrsEDKa6dXgrcpzpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41415'),
  ('608133814096734635', 'The Shape of Water', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'David G. Fremlin, Samantha Dick, David Best', 'Vanessa Taylor, Guillermo del Toro', 'Sally Hawkins, Michael Shannon, Richard Jenkins, Octavia Spencer, Michael Stuhlbarg, Doug Jones, David Hewlett, Nick Searcy', 'R', 'An other-worldly story, set against the backdrop of Cold War era America circa 1962, where a mute janitor working at a lab falls in love with an amphibious man being held captive there and devises a plan to help him escape.', 'An other-worldly story, set against the backdrop of Cold War era America circa 1962, where a mute janitor working at a lab falls in love with an amphibious man being held captive there and devises a plan to help him escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zfwPffUXpBrEP26yp0q1ckXDcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399055'),
  ('1016363261293337289', 'The Shark Hunter', 1979, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Ramón Bravo', 'Jaime Comas Gil, Jesús R. Folgar, Tito Carpi', 'Franco Nero, Michael Forest, Patricia Rivera, Jorge Luke, Enzo G. Castellari, Rocco Lerro, Mirta Miller, Eduardo Fajardo', null, 'A crusty recluse on a Caribbean island who is dedicated to destroying sharks gets involved in a hunt for buried treasure.', 'A crusty recluse on a Caribbean island who is dedicated to destroying sharks gets involved in a hunt for buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n50N25AfLsSk0BP8UgAfnyv75cU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95103'),
  ('1151399509463295944', 'The Shark Is Still Working', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Erik Hollander', 'James Gelet', 'Roy Scheider, Steven Spielberg, Richard Dreyfuss, Joe Alves, Richard Arbogast, Susan Backlinie, Peter Benchley, David Brown', null, 'After three decades, Jaws continues to intrigue, thrill and frighten viewers. This documentary focuses on the many ways in which Jaws has helped to shape popular culture.', 'After three decades, Jaws continues to intrigue, thrill and frighten viewers. This documentary focuses on the many ways in which Jaws has helped to shape popular culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EPgYjpvdHfOqS105p35HXelcgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106262'),
  ('142509308182360899', 'The Shaukeens', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Abhishek Sharma', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Lisa Haydon, Anupam Kher, Annu Kapoor, Piyush Mishra, Rati Agnihotri', null, 'Three friends in their 60s try to do everything that they couldn''t do in their younger days - before death arrives.', 'Three friends in their 60s try to do everything that they couldn''t do in their younger days - before death arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAAzlXKdYtheXSVrWQKTQ6Dy0oR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297019'),
  ('402063013136535305', 'The Shawshank Redemption', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Roger Deakins, John R. Woodward, Thomas Schellenberg', 'Frank Darabont', 'Tim Robbins, Morgan Freeman, Bob Gunton, William Sadler, Clancy Brown, Gil Bellows, James Whitmore, Mark Rolston', 'R', 'Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.', 'Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278'),
  ('102073642652659372', 'The She Beast', 1966, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Michael Reeves, Gioacchino Gengarelli, Charles B. Griffith', 'Michael Reeves', 'Barbara Steele, John Karlsen, Ian Ogilvy, Mel Welles, Joe ''Flash'' Riley, Richard Watson, Edward B. Randolph, Peter Grippe', 'NR', 'A young woman is driving alongside a lake. She has an accident and the car plunges into the water. Her body is then possessed by the spirit of an 18th-century witch who was killed by local villagers, and is bent on avenging herself on them.', 'A young woman is driving alongside a lake. She has an accident and the car plunges into the water. Her body is then possessed by the spirit of an 18th-century witch who was killed by local villagers, and is bent on avenging herself on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSPryYmCWvVxaiMt6FioVAHdyGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101898'),
