  ('126748664531073197', 'The Shed', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Matthias Schubert, James Thomas, Eldar Erlich', 'Frank Sabatella', 'Jay Jay Warren, Cody Kostro, Sofia Happonen, Frank Whaley, Timothy Bottoms, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Chris Petrovski, Francisco Burgos', 'NR', 'The story of Stan, an orphaned teenager stuck living with his abusive grandfather and tasked with routinely protecting his best friend from high school bullies. When Stan discovers a murderous creature has taken refuge inside the tool shed in his backyard, he tries to secretly battle the demon alone until his bullied friend discovers the creature and has a far more sinister plan in mind.', 'The story of Stan, an orphaned teenager stuck living with his abusive grandfather and tasked with routinely protecting his best friend from high school bullies. When Stan discovers a murderous creature has taken refuge inside the tool shed in his backyard, he tries to secretly battle the demon alone until his bullied friend discovers the creature and has a far more sinister plan in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aV9n5MyLZQsoXNfbZG5OOf16IkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551994'),
  ('610111577402310940', 'The Sheep Detectives', 2026, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy, Family', 'Kyle Balda, George Steel, Caroline Barclay', 'Craig Mazin', 'Hugh Jackman, Emma Thompson, Nicholas Braun, Nicholas Galitzine, Molly Gordon, Hong Chau, Tosin Cole, Kobna Holdbrook-Smith', 'PG', 'George is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can''t possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.', 'George is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can''t possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QtL9rl3Zb4d8qW6EJ4qO5hSSfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301421'),
  ('871846650057848740', 'The Sheep Has Five Legs', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Jean Manse', 'Fernandel, Françoise Arnoul, Andrex, Georges Chamarat, Édouard Delmont, Paulette Dubost, Louis de Funès, René Génin', null, 'A publicity-minded French mayor reunites quintuplets and their earthy father, all six played by Fernandel.', 'A publicity-minded French mayor reunites quintuplets and their earthy father, all six played by Fernandel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1yYZadxajnDlP8eEUn9RuXwp0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74810'),
  ('817303869133566023', 'The Sheep Thief', 1997, 'Drama', 'Asif Kapadia', 'Asif Kapadia', 'Jigar Bikhabha, Soaib Karimbhai, Kokila Mahendra, Abdur Rehman', null, 'A young boy gets caught stealing a sheep and is shaved of all his hair and branded with a mark on his forehead so that everyone will know that he is a thief and not to be trusted. Dumped in the desert, the thief covers his marking with a headscarf and goes to the nearest village where he is taken in by a trusting family in return for his work. However, has be actually changed or is he still the same thief at heart?', 'A young boy gets caught stealing a sheep and is shaved of all his hair and branded with a mark on his forehead so that everyone will know that he is a thief and not to be trusted. Dumped in the desert, the thief covers his marking with a headscarf and goes to the nearest village where he is taken in by a trusting family in return for his work. However, has be actually changed or is he still the same thief at heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WuQBQotkgdu3Nr7vpUa6fvvQJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49454'),
  ('91215627701106183', 'The Sheepman', 1958, 'Western, Comedy', 'Robert J. Bronner, Al Jennings, George Marshall', 'William Bowers, James Edward Grant', 'Glenn Ford, Shirley MacLaine, Leslie Nielsen, Mickey Shaughnessy, Edgar Buchanan, Willis Bouchey, Pernell Roberts, Slim Pickens', 'NR', 'A stranger in a Western cattle-town behaves with remarkable self-assurance, establishing himself as a man to be reckoned with. The reason appears with his stock: a herd of sheep, which he intends to graze on the range. The horrified inhabitants decide to run him out at all costs.', 'A stranger in a Western cattle-town behaves with remarkable self-assurance, establishing himself as a man to be reckoned with. The reason appears with his stock: a herd of sheep, which he intends to graze on the range. The horrified inhabitants decide to run him out at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4TtmJvXPPOSDJmQmqZMjj9F8i2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76568'),
  ('357485791242798762', 'The Sheik', 1921, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'George Melford, William Marshall', 'Monte M. Katterjohn', 'Rudolph Valentino, Agnes Ayres, Ruth Miller, George Waggner, Frank Butler, Charles Brinley, Lucien Littlefield, Adolphe Menjou', 'NR', 'Sheik Ahmed desperately desires feisty British socialite Diana, so he abducts her and carries her off to his luxurious tent-palace in the desert. The free-spirited Diana recoils from his passionate embraces and yearns to be released. Later, allowed to go into the desert, she escapes and makes her way across the sands...', 'Sheik Ahmed desperately desires feisty British socialite Diana, so he abducts her and carries her off to his luxurious tent-palace in the desert. The free-spirited Diana recoils from his passionate embraces and yearns to be released. Later, allowed to go into the desert, she escapes and makes her way across the sands...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cwKEW94PEB1IPQtlJMdP1suXnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36841'),
