  ('780543432127461575', 'The Shepherd', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Peter Hayman, Graeme Mears', 'Nelu Ghiran', 'C. Thomas Howell, Roddy Piper, David Carradine, Heidi von Palleske, Mackenzie Gray, Raymond Serra, Marina Anderson, Fraser Reilly', null, 'In a futuristic wasteland, a mercenary saves a woman and her son from lethal cultists.', 'In a futuristic wasteland, a mercenary saves a woman and her son from lethal cultists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiMFrxYGzK4momux7t84CTtYMag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51854'),
